{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301017.zip::R2-2301017.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2 agreed in the last meeting that an out-of-coverage L2 U2N remote UE upon receiving SIB12 with the field sl-SyncPriority set to gNBeNB, the choice of synchronization source is left to UE implementation. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Agreements:","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Alternative Proposal 1 (modified): Add a NOTE in 5.8.6.2: “When the field sl-SyncPriority in SIB12 t is set to gNBeNB, the choice of synchronisation source for a L2 U2N Remote UE out of coverage is left to UE implementation. “.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2 foresee no RAN1 impact from this decision.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"However, this violates the current priority rule for synchronization as set by RAN1 in Rel-16. ","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Section 5.8.6","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Updated the NOTE 1 to reflect the priority of sidelink synchronization reference based on Rel-16","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c95aec79a390f5790ac213a5a3bcee0e5a39a6de85f21c15269fa2c3ce4005e2","original_member_sha256":"c47fa83a98ea1665699e44d5e600ef2b6eefcb7e592be79b181e0fedb04cb1e8","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","440dd3e56b59f482e5a4c97cb740086be92256b85d99c9ab1253f6338821f8fd","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","0ba51bd5cdbc6e061a483eed92504c9b5f1161718270d5009c60390bd90a7755","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","35a79586a19ee65775f4dff5cf3a4e432ed8af6387d08e3052dca8d1b5d12e12","34212fc6f04370a4e535ce9cc41d8546dd1f377420e476f0306c144fd63998ef","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","3c4c80e1e11044a4d07c2d065ab1badcf74a3b84af6435503a27154aade28f9b","9cce1527cccfaf06414da2452ff9fbfb13a943f1f279cd895084b62905eabc41","e9f57ce1c3e124e0f26ba07722c4c268c349be00805ee0ef64a5456886074ab6","c7cd98854c6adfe9513ebc7e7772f9bbef75d0c729aa1818a510be71ea0293aa","c1c73b56f552d1400a3749026aeabb678ba4be88b32c2cf8ac3c531b6c4929b4","31b5124c3a631cdab79bbceadcf08f24c2e093a157e668b0c4b3b5ffac491a88","8b24573e0133d1c5ee95e1377545628b16380b4d3d980bde5296376e8173041e","7423559940944ed0cc1fe176b76253cf9035dcdbfc0fac2f3e385feb311a2329","288cc60197c635a28716a1c3a9133085106b36b1009fb0a2849670c1b99dfd9f","3e55826dcc9506783bf3e9e2ce7144d9dac94a4d2014edab45d3e675db110d7d","db45945f64ffa498e24e6ef437cac7d3331191f8035f9fb9841063a9becd38fc","959c778bd80ce2e0b342f6e567974beb9183aa55835dc0f0ecb9faef78084e47"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301017.zip::R2-2301017.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301017.zip::R2-2301017.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: Sidelink, NR-SA ","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink Synchronization Reference","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not, there is no inter-operability issue as the changes are related to UE-behaviour.  ","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2. If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, there is no inter-operability issue as the changes only concern UE-behaviour.","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3. If one UE is implemented according to the CR and another UE is not, then it would lead to erroneous sidelink synchronization reference selection and such UEs will not be able to perform SL communication. ","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the CR is not approved, leaving the choice of synchronization source to UE implmentation could lead to incorrect selection of the synchronization reference. In addition, could lead to misalignment among the UEs and network wits respect to synchronization source selection rendering SL communication infeasible. ","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6.2","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c95aec79a390f5790ac213a5a3bcee0e5a39a6de85f21c15269fa2c3ce4005e2","original_member_sha256":"c47fa83a98ea1665699e44d5e600ef2b6eefcb7e592be79b181e0fedb04cb1e8","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3b58796efe33d8c6fc493654488dd20a7f99c72e2ef0b1dfe93bf5cfd0103c9a","751604cde4122641804bc655f0b8152648594ab4bf976207a45a0e38ff0cb565","b2d5a584e6fd521f251adee71b606652cf1a64b8aa8a0a0c193fb794c76e0196","6fd12aa6e3602850403e56d86432f3b40c294d4b55176dbbdde0ce8fa9e30634","507e02107f7a29b009568b57e90168615bcb70af591789f4fd989c278a8d6c6b","8c56f671bbbca5cda30401857d17fe6e9d66a36e391db51085fea1d8c34b3eb3","d56316e388b1a6252b0b8a119e456e388b01e9689d57d3087e4db10cd65921b0","f8efcc18a145ed6f7188d0747d3b1c615c95139ca9554f4a63ab005f3b76d194","0469855c30b0fcf108f77ec4d0d43100ea19878ed409ff79b8839b1349b0a2f7","22b1b1abf921ed47748e86af528cf555bf0da4cc22687517eb63848a7ffdd6b7","a63b5734791883f74d37bdb70e31a285508d61aced607fa6626eb02bbdab90fa","53dcac6273d5c5894aee968ac410fbf65e935aa4190f6b6b4a13ce6b09988b85","60bc62947ce5d89fc03f4c6862e984aa9981a2700a7f32bccae1b80f2d20c8e8","23da18bbbcbc650fad7a07ef8006251a7a06ae59113986d1a2b8d37f6d71a8d1","85f9fe225bf206da5b28016fbb39c62cb1368eb1244f4f20547ea6629