1017.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301017.zip::R2-2301017.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"START OF CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6Sidelink synchronisation reference","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to select a synchronisation reference and used when transmitting NR sidelink communication/discovery. This procedure also applies to NR sidelink discovery.","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.6.2Selection and reselection of synchronisation reference","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12, and sl-SyncPriority is configured for the concerned frequency and set to gnbEnb:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select a cell as the synchronization reference source as defined in 5.8.6.3:","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When sl-SyncPriority in SIB12 is set to gnbEnb, the synchronization source for an out of coverage L2 U2N Remote UE follows the sidelink synchronization source reference of the associated L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12, and sl-SyncPriority for the concerned frequency is not configured or is set to gnss, and GNSS is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select GNSS as the synchronization reference source;","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery is included in SL-PreconfigurationNR, and sl-SyncPriority in SidelinkPreconfigNR is set to gnss and GNSS is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select GNSS as the synchronization reference source;","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform a full search (i.e. covering all subframes and all possible SLSSIDs) to detect candidate SLSS, in accordance with TS 38.133 [14]","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>when evaluating the one or more detected SLSSIDs, apply layer 3 filtering as specified in 5.5.3.2 using the preconfigured sl-filterCoefficient, before using the PSBCH-RSRP measurement results;","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has selected a SyncRef UE:","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the strongest candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the minimum requirement TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and the strongest candidate SyncRef UE belongs to the same priority group as the current SyncRef UE and the PSBCH-RSRP of the strongest candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the PSBCH-RSRP of the current SyncRef UE by syncRefDiffHyst; or","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c95aec79a390f5790ac213a5a3bcee0e5a39a6de85f21c15269fa2c3ce4005e2","original_member_sha256":"c47fa83a98ea1665699e44d5e600ef2b6eefcb7e592be79b181e0fedb04cb1e8","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8a2054446422db10127b53522c244dd671006eed469081cd46119e9103434846","09696b54939497a8ca2ba620420c03c7479c8446d64fb680ae1962b6d211066f","c002616492b1923e46d6fa95a25dac7944411eca88ccdcee2199f265ed726678","d02e8cbd697ae1810074c3012247d88e70339f7889a7482c352e21eca4a8f878","dcfe2bb2be026f64206f96633b2eaa49b0a134a719d3c6657eb778d6d91f60fc","2b244657ef7cf4f83a6cf3724abfe77db845bfd512eb5cbdb596faf7a963e426","b8291ea505aea6b99dd8f71f28e7e9d9a64ea540959850577afbaeb161987ebc","77d0e2005b8aa5b0ade78404d5be580d5449291a0a17149ad0afb167879813c3","a8646132abe7a9b623a021c2c9062dd78896510564dfc7b5dceef8cb7d23b650","d9f5d9e2b81d6880dd49009a277149059b147c1aee0699686ef130a627d7b4f5","23871a81d8826db63c6e9d5ab4cf2ceb5b2323e5174a6f9903e536e22ea24cf1","7d08cf190eea5b350295a8f31036b5c549c9a41578bda9279fa3057b8966199e","641dc83babd087802e19cae9374bbd4e224742a53557e2543a32fdbbbf93313d","ebf8e3abcfb8b6a774b89917024dc346228e7fcb4b568cb002852204f09e3faa","678453c80dfd17f2c6c8c6d7ce0ce5c91240c643405b5ceb6c7446f4d3ae9c1a","06bf3b53131bc64b200b5a071c4e52d22d843df0b39f1335c96c9528aa956e1e","b963daeca1b456fa3204408f96a058161b1fb4426735f949c36f332c3129fe0a","ff3c731335ed650b2fbe5d8020eb9794868152594312e097a4822c42cdcecb20","5eae7c3db07cf70fcef3493a8f8f1f658a16243c336c6f19731e306c99037381","d92cc1eb8f49dfdc1e434c13a57d9b9f27f611987d97676a666df36890ab7b09","69d8993d515a1562a1eee354938c8b0dba99aedfd348d3c7449a57b38cc0031d","73fbace967fba57c846e96ac4c67a57166153ec5bb6be89f3c7470016659c204","707eae1238bd09f93896011126e7f64f09111074676e76211767846fcc5a4b27","efeefc15002ddb29f2a1988db24303b5df8f00efa108f1e3b85b61f26738a2ba"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301017.zip::R2-2301017.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301017.zip::R2-2301017.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the minimum requirement TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and the candidate SyncRef UE belongs to a higher priority group than the current SyncRef UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if GNSS becomes reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14], and GNSS belongs to a higher priority group than the current SyncRef UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if a cell is detected and gNB/eNB (if sl-NbAsSync is set to true) belongs to a higher priority group than the current SyncRef UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the current SyncRef UE is less than the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider no SyncRef UE to be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has selected GNSS as the synchronization reference for NR sidelink communication/discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and the candidate SyncRef UE belongs to a higher priority group than GNSS; or","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if GNSS becomes not reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider GNSS not to be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has selected cell as the synchronization reference for NR sidelink communication/discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PSBCH-RSRP of the candidate SyncRef UE exceeds the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and the candidate SyncRef UE belongs to a higher priority group than gNB/eNB; or","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the selected cell is not detected:","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell not to be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has not selected any synchronization reference:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE detects one or more SLSSIDs for which the PSBCH-RSRP exceeds the minimum requirement defined in TS 38.133 [14] by sl-SyncRefMinHyst and for which the UE received the corresponding MasterInformationBlockSidelink message (candidate SyncRef UEs), or if the UE detects GNSS that is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14], or if the UE detects a cell, select a synchronization reference according to the following priority group order:","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-SyncPriority corresponding to the concerned frequency is set to gnbEnb:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is part of the set defined for in coverage, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 1);","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UE of which SLSSID is part of the set defined for in coverage, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>GNSS that is reliable in accordance with TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.133 [14] (priority group 3);","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 0, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, or of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 4);","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is not transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 5);","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 337 and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 5);","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>Other UEs, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 6);","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-SyncPriority corresponding to the concerned frequency is set to gnss, and sl-NbAsSync is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c95aec79a390f5790ac213a5a3bcee0e5a39a6de85f21c15269fa2c3ce4005e2","original_member_sha256":"c47fa83a98ea1665699e44d5e600ef2b6eefcb7e592be79b181e0fedb04cb1e8","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["622fd8128582d0940ffeff5ef41bbe6897ec3a6cab25a5eade06e9af2701ef22","e999463d720c0dadc312cb3bfd1c7b66275f88a306bd783259927602852fdf79","d2f5eab8962121b6523ea418ea34655d8a23e9051b553be7067511598ff142b8","c80ed2264af45c07bb02add5ce475bf7f20f4b353a3c70d22047ee032bcd3f2f","1239ec5bbd0a27c0cc424f08d824c7a7f29e6c4928bbdc1361539eaae65e353d","9efa7d516a32cd4fceb117d3eb7c2d28337b2430886f055986ed325cd0007504","9fd36d59faa94d2974cbc3a23f4b13f3dbba3c355ec17d378dddb6216c218dc5","d85725b9c055dcc473108153dd96a669f899dd334a4cd650c54b2a607936ffbd","f94a64be6ddcd6efa590e3fdb3ec53fd322fb891f9d9d1b34ca56c868d102eae","0adffb4685728ece472d3ed0c5577c516f8286197627cb75186571cc80ba23f5","84161618e9b996ffccd966462ad14caf815fd55c3523ffe44202875020f03b99","eb2b388db189df9e867e1a594c460784096a63e388523a96ff9429b7aa8e1378","8072ba0ae178de2f40894e3407691eb9937c2c24ee53f6ea2e1f9944514ec104","c503ea0c21b8500d88224eb7b0911380af49b1fca6c3c2da7cd14d7e3723f8ea","fab91f790907581b46eb56c179a0e0d347d371de05301797ee4014682a269594","356c045fe706d39056741723c07b27396d000aa77e1fae0e341f19940743a855","60133d1d8fbf827e8a7d60ef1ec89e2f6d36f26f41fe495433fd3508d3dbeac0","44ec421eb99990dbf0bcb864a81dd4e200bd6a4f7b8dee6d6b6c56083693f1f4","85087448a3463392dda97dcddfe192d8fac8cd3807ed9dafe7c1a8d184ef53d1","0f226e5239b410601b9711b6680a5715524472ebff70e399693bb9322fabd62c","b12cf6c356253fa65533c39fd3a7abfd034038c447f93d8d0194a037bc2738c1","3256f516db80d9936d174fbe2c2f5c264643d39c73879615728c664c1303dbe6","675652648c48a08b193da4b72d67539b2f33a022cb753d1da35e84f85ea84eb3","3cd542e752de21ceb9455443cd4dab1b5bebd10385464ec6d36a45c005c3f62f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301017.zip::R2-2301017.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301017.zip::R2-2301017.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 0, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, or of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 1);","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is not transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCHS-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 337 and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>the cell detected by the UE as defined in 5.8.6.3 (priority group 3);","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is part of the set defined for in coverage, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 4);","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UE of which SLSSID is part of the set defined for in coverage, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 5);","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>Other UEs, starting with the UE with the highest S-RSRP result (priority group 6);","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-SyncPriority corresponding to the concerned frequency is set to gnss, and sl-NbAsSync is set to false:","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 0, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to true, or of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 1);","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 0 and SLSS is not transmitted on slot(s) indicated by sl-SSB-TimeAllocation3, and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCHS-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>UEs of which SLSSID is 337 and inCoverage, included in the MasterInformationBlockSidelink message received from this UE, is set to false, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 2);","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>Other UEs, starting with the UE with the highest PSBCH-RSRP result (priority group 3);","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:How the UE achieves subframe boundary alignment between V2X sidelink communication and NR sidelink communication/discovery (if both are performed by the UE) is as specified in TS 38.213, clause 16.7.","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"END OF CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":182}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c95aec79a390f5790ac213a5a3bcee0e5a39a6de85f21c15269f