7b39a62f8df172","original_member_sha256":"4d9f158efad51e5969f6795f719418e62c14198c6b9e5aa8f29cc107e6120491","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["63dd7851ff23b5be7b761572a8afe0ba5b8f13bad07c9481b7b878c261800525","4328dbc2e9ed59984edad9da9f918a037222a8bc1d4a7f801e449d0bf4e71fd0","1b57abbb250ccf0e7dbcfaad8666dd22e39df29408dc1d6e61b3298df1a31533","dca27312d7a1517d19ed558671871fab25e9b549c607883b97a78f9f3628f08a","6d3fba1314de1001e3753ed4f16b9c74cdf0271805f61b17dcc5b42bd590842f","617785343afc34ff86d7085e070e5171c849cf65b766df069d11ae4921b43535","ac7a2a3bfcc12da674527c269fc0c2998df0db52eb24e9be9ae32b0473eb532b","cb9646e53a961acadd8b9d1cbe9977f71385aded0c0dd84e225defb7e8545ad8","e434e65a10e838afc9f35a37c5efebc215fd9aedc21692d7cc12941674744e85","48f27d1f338f2e6cabf1ff384625f9d1a5e67ab8190bf0af224f5e9fd5a2044d","9f472e42a3679b848a4da2adea1c7e091e4264e683d3137d0eb76acba7d486d3","731cd85286f824ffc8ab15b3e076faaf16231b040ec58d5b982eb0b04411f518","629d24244e77ee20ee7cf1cca29a46947ce59d3d6eeff3f99743f86727d9d856","15446e336e26f8e8542354aaa67cefc1b9b0d8b4af76558f1b7e96594ab3e72b","032e9f858d3d59ab048f1c6847f25e5b233bb6ba0c88c96eee40690f328745ca","1ac810a1cab11c95a1df934fbe11d17d0c7b90f828c877e62a98a07ed58b7dfa","1e553ed4c1104f0872ebe8c81e561657e8b71962d981316d2c2e7b3b58a25f58","b3f8ba76ec829a0eac6003bc8cbccaed17d41a62756dd1214cc8a7fa8c87c76d","ebb18e058d1fac3e0efc9941e530e6c9327f91af82e47a50969e70a111afea2a","035799d13826430e8b6ff6c9a97cb67eef9498d1e3d02e513a9ce1766bf261fb","dcb00a9e6c6c316c0088d2dc5f1b8ad2617b4424352762cd9029642ce44b55be","adf91afec1ef44a2388772bd7103ea6e4f36004e933a3b58dc00af5209fde022","500ae1e95311986e752b9be027e0c22a78d267c2f0de2c686523828721158b14","1cef444d894cdacbe559bb45e53c3b2ef7f77da82c45f0f24d784d4541645307"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[24,47],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301019.zip::R2-2301019.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301019.zip::R2-2301019.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"D","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The current field descriptions for the SL-SRAP-Config do not clearly capture the related UE behaviour. For the sl-EgressRLC-ChannelUu and sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5, the applicability of these egress channels over Uu and PC5 are not detailed i.e., whether a certain channel is applicable to L2 U2N relay UE or L2 U2N remote UE. Furthermore, details on which of the egress channels are applicable for uplink and downlink are not captured. In addition, in sl-MappingToReleaseList, the details of the release as to which bearer mapping is to be released and applicability to the L2 U2N remote UE is not mentioned. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the sl-MappingToReleaseList, details added as to which bearer mappings are to be released and that this is applicable to U2N remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For sl-EgressRLC-ChannelUu, egress channel applicable only to uplink transmissions for L2 U2N relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For sl-EgressRLC-ChannelPC5, details for egress channel applicable to both uplink and downlink. In addition, the corresponding ","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: NR-SA, Sidelink ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"890a1a41550c92f4f4d4fd733244e9f2ca4b99b896082f68e57b39a62f8df172","original_member_sha256":"4d9f158efad51e5969f6795f719418e62c14198c6b9e5aa8f29cc107e6120491","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","984e84bd7aa7d088f87174d59565e739cc2e0cfe56114f044243fad34acfea5f","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","a3eec5f64fd0948b98e837db0274b49dba386dc18b9818b7265660746c77bbe7","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7