{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301019.zip::R2-2301019.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL SRAP Configuration","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not, there is no inter-operability issue","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2. If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, there is no inter-operability issue","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3. If one UE has implemented according to the CR and another UE has not, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Based on the current description, it might be difficult to discern the functionality of the different egress channels (PC5/Uu) and bearer release function which could lead to incorrect implementation. ","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.3.5","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","pa