hs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3ae7382fac5a05fbdfcee0ce7ffa40cab8c9106486f09469eabd3ee9af9676d5","original_member_sha256":"22956335148b7a5c16c2b5dda19d49a29d30d34a1f02b6918ba645f49922cb03","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["179e00fa9628be5f82ee494276877cf4498d0bb0a35ab38d03ece72639682d80","0ac5bbcd1e31b2aba6ff269040acf8aa504bdf7bcfe69697b2c364d5d849f89e","e3a3fb852a51d790a088e771b8a81225cfda129725490603d27e248b881ec9ab","d2b16179f93f6d7484e9a786ad51826c691372d93dba4f130e7d2996b31a86ce","e7ee3ac7e8f0387becdae378873d0436ee41c2aac54fd0eb88a5f3657ff4ab7c","99d862fe0fd93f000c9cd50ac85674c6d098c430b169cc6abedae84eba806c22","549bd08054ed437ff3830d5c495b6ba211412b1bbcf82892fca346434e12230e","38eaf53f71bc8faf196c6c8a5939fb76f5f2249abd4ed6cb4171e7ae285b1124","4d8ddcab91cb26617282b8fc3ef65085784fd75fa96b5bacb2d7d98e267d2091","7409c926556712a7be43c382b2f6729442ec8bc1383f1c67a3632e30df95460a","71c731b31ec9a9ab2978a357fd81e9197c24ff8b5097beb9dd51f42a3640be2a","e5d1e964a4b288102bd60f8305f341b6f5c7bb16bf73f61fd5eb4e7fe9d58733","a7988d7a5ce90b8674351506e5d20b76efc9c42f0d722181e9eed82f4786d618","d8fa72923b33e63e838a739dcbb08af3061f8f0559020196399d2536c6d4fb60","339ffd652006ee93f017d5b19648ff0f645ad29061e73149e2d688740f0a64b6","c3cab02940f906073aeb8737733d4c577fcb25f58d09885082fead6c3bd1ab3c","793b96d5ab69227eab891a054480129e86a1e21962c1842082b1903356795320","908830d6f0fe016286a464be1134597b20d51b5e77901917c8fe311ffdf1ede5","1485acda57476dc5e08bcb09d3de669bbcd170b1fbeb969005e99258976bfe82","262730755cc2bc50986802271dedd747439158ce1efe05650ad3b138024e7c93","0d8a75f837597e918dc57c22635f3fd3a3cf7472ca262f8bf2f74144bf94c64b","d7ac67bccdf6f2c51682df0f07b9d2a0282c144742b3a3f0481034a43bd888f9","6a5a0ad7435622e272da0db444c5a0f0e96bee89d6b76f845dbcd07719a8e2c9","b403050aa6ce9ab26288f5c504a4d2be23f60e4842c63f34490c40a288f04662"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301167.zip::R2-2301167 - CR3872 Correction for receiving PC5 link release during path switching.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301167.zip::R2-2301167 - CR3872 Correction for receiving PC5 link release during path switching.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Start of changes","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7RRC connection re-establishment","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.1General","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.7.1-1: RRC connection re-establishment, successful","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.3.7.1-2: RRC re-establishment, fallback to RRC establishment, successful","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to re-establish the RRC connection. A UE in RRC_CONNECTED, for which AS security has been activated with SRB2 and at least one DRB/multicast MRB setup or, for IAB, SRB2, may initiate the procedure in order to continue the RRC connection. The connection re-establishment succeeds if the network is able to find and verify a valid UE context or, if the UE context cannot be retrieved, and the network responds with an RRCSetup according to clause 5.3.3.4.","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network applies the procedure e.g as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-When AS security has been activated and the network retrieves or verifies the UE context:","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to re-activate AS security without changing algorithms;","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to re-establish and resume the SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-When UE is re-establishing an RRC connection, and the network is not able to retrieve or verify the UE context:","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to discard the stored AS Context and release all RBs and BH RLC channels and Uu Relay RLC channels;","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-to fallback to establish a new RRC connection.","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If AS security has not been activated, the UE shall not initiate the procedure but instead moves to RRC_IDLE directly, with release cause 'other'. If AS security has been activated, but SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB or, for IAB, SRB2, are not setup, the UE does not initiate the procedure but instead moves to RRC_IDLE directly, with release cause 'RRC connection failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE initiates the procedure when one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG and t316 is not configured, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while SCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3ae7382fac5a05fbdfcee0ce7ffa40cab8c9106486f09469eabd3ee9af9676d5","original_member_sha256":"22956335148b7a5c16c2b5dda19d49a29d30d34a1f02b6918ba645f49922cb03","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9477498ab98df9a6fc2982685e23606fe0daf6107f6f6c34836d9510acdc3a6a","57ab18baa0c00a82b7a561003bf8e0e7db6f9271df2add95a6a51974bf59b38b","a82f279b88710c711b2c73835abf13fc7f45fc8253084efb3b2fe092137ba0c2","8da56801de13e1f5628023897c9b97e1a2832cd7b3ee85fc7585c46f97405344","533860d39315623226d85a6f2b5b20bc11f64cf822c1d14ba5ff6760da3a83c2","4b63eb51413f157423d17c91bc9f10bfa8c680e265ed2a3e385a7afd33ec8ed7","ba77aba4b3be316c2ddc11d00b601a5cfeb14533ad1ec476f531ebd0d153c3d3","d3f5f2c54bf569b5597b968488ff240ecaa56564d16535915063e244823f9f1a","0f998352ebcdaba15e47d5dee3f3ce14df569f45193894b630c9c426d0442855","2115f5cb8613d8eb2aa87e3610edf0984943563e5ce2eb99c774cbbb6d005896","0206c009dc82b7fc2fca81dc4e7bbd021357e1f6a24dc5a92316373cfe35134e","69cc670ed2258f868bf4fbae5bc5939f190b336a39a3b92d8c48bb53e8b3f223","4fc4003a8b039f2a331a1cdcb4f8dc530eda71a7e2088398b415ea9b8c946b60","4b8c1c20fd42b6b2da2374f979ca62324d70cba94df8fe1398e6425a7c821be3","dc81abd9f2997b7d7494d0adf1a4e7e14c9a52b99ed151a8a26f49b5ca65fc74","b058a6a299bb68db416e15fad4a79cb9283ab971e68a5985bc535f3486b217a7","4753f29226f65e7344ab1ab06f6b2e88dca40b634a850ce5404b1e8776800c89","77a3f04810d085dafabb89483bd639fe655f87b0064f21cbd812f7177e050eb4","e7bcdab2dfc8e9701ad92c24ecb2a9b480eae06df0b9cc5b78ee289483317ad5","d9de54442c38543e8a4660638d1da49eea0d88997ead8cfb1e0537a59eac0146","2b3e712e87923304f677f0718e2f889f3235dd505faa321fdea86c7eac4dd537","f6701fcb01ad861fb4574c35359877b95ea4dbb4d45f182cc927dfcc0bf59059","cfeba26c79561b51d3622f839f13be2a587d68794b3ab5557f9852ca5616c145","23f035f4b47f4f654b0d7bfb79d9ccc9856cd91824bea461b6f72f2bc1a66c4a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301167.zip::R2-2301167 - CR3872 Correction for receiving PC5 link release during path switching.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301167.zip::R2-2301167 - CR3872 Correction for receiving PC5 link release during path switching.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while PSCell change or PSCell addition is ongoing, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while the SCG is deactivated, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon mobility from NR failure, in accordance with clause 5.4.3.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from lower layers concerning SRB1 or SRB2, except if the integrity check failure is detected on the RRCReestablishment message; or","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon an RRC connection reconfiguration failure, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2; or","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure for the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with clause 5.3.10.3 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.11.3 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reconfiguration with sync failure of the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG change failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.7a; or","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG configuration failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.5 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from SCG lower layers concerning SRB3 while MCG is suspended; or","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T316 expiry, in accordance with clause 5.7.3b.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting sidelink radio link failure by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reception of NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:It is up to UE implementation whether to initiate the procedure while T346g is running.","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The L2 U2N Remote UE may ignore the PC5 unicast link release if it does not release the PC5 unicast link in source side yet during an indirect-to-direct path switch, i.e. T304 is running.","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T310, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T304, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T316, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if UE is not configured with attemptCondReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3ae7382fac5a05fbdfcee0ce7ffa40cab8c9106486f09469eabd3ee9af9676d5","original_member_sha256":"22956335148b7a5c16c2b5dda19d49a29d30d34a1f02b6918ba645f49922cb03","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ba32049831e364d3cd50a52e3623c66bafde8fade675433cf4afc646b5902054","14ea6608fbcfa6561845fbf31e0517bb38bab997d689f52b5a2a37397c52f029","385f3e9ef213bcf913c211f5f943e3296fb17173aab0ba990aaaba3a127ab627","fee574dbc78deb2253f573073c95ec8f67821191a3629950f62ff484b67d8663","9ad25bab08dc5c763e5b43c3dd872a12b6499f68c47f3699951a68f4f6b15894","daa886459a043d87366b4a552d545964921a39cf9988a69eed4669080a2a594d","d5097dfd7c9ae894a9fde2fd5bf7c64ec4a9115026206932f662bf4aac09dd15","beaffb32203520e32d85c6367d5ac9113d0f8aac79a502fb48aa364d1ba99e29","c6c01dfddc9f40893da0730f843bc128191cab23b15f6164e16b4fb88274c58a","2905dda3e2252a4c6aa66f293895326590bd852579ecf6cbc0f7cf874b8929b9","1b2f25d4fb2badd48097e193b31d05ea6901cb399eca8e7a77b61520441c9f3b","a020a8d5b67766fcce2fb082cfe88fae331753ace4fd82054ecc9312aa651fd1","89e8f2708d1bae683a26da99d12eb175e1b9854914307969fa197ca42e0bd945","ade7ba3f57da49db29f82e6149dd5c3988c67d3c7b37995c9a005260c0a433d4","bd9a7c2d91e673e3c4baf5a56a2dc3e60fc4f744dbcf0b334840501080fe4e5f","97214b9401859610b487b49be1a2ac1adbf6c70658cf6be513e4a77a4bc90be5","71af44f716a42e84c744955d88bdaac96b3533629f338e9739271300e62b0388","efc2486c18293924070906aee091650fa9c5c4de21a1c4f53ecf85d198e9c7c5","a6d702a67a0adfaf99b01ad22d00341fb2036c010be5d76dd9573b849870bb00","b47ce4e89ad224e23b6ad511385d4e22553e22917031b70bb71062793519ef6d","ca67acc53d458083fc4a22805bffee3831db85c4484a00a76e3bb171c599980d","c90379998702c1cf866a124c3cfba149c4e86792297837d32b2f0afcf3103aa8","abe61edc18ca33799717d8310bb9ebf88a802d3d8d94a328c48cf84bc7c9650c","288bd1666682af2efc158bd307fe7b38d47fd626801b1bb97d