{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301167.zip::R2-2301167 - CR3872 Correction for receiving PC5 link release during path switching.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release musim-GapAssistanceConfig, if configured and stop timer T346h, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release musim-LeaveAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig, if configured, and stop timer T346i, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release propDelayDiffReportConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release maxBW-PreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successHO-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3ae7382fac5a05fbdfcee0ce7ffa40cab8c9106486f09469eabd3ee9af9676d5","original_member_sha256":"22956335148b7a5c16c2b5dda19d49a29d30d34a1f02b6918ba645f49922cb03","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2c7dc0570e64d48b3508d577ad7c11185628a2686012fbb717c4cd04d1557695","94d9aa1ffe3cd8bab779f544ad84b057ab48ebc685db897caac9c41706dd3376","86873289c18acc8f0db792634d0efb8f58722e112737242396fb652864c7d81d","d7b08fe01f15dbf4c179a002d74dd21924b4deaaeb845b680dfea146d538198c","f48b981232ffcc187ef70aaaea5b3b129a422e1ce6ce72a0dfc2d0e7cf796919","0d2e44ee56029e72453c2d9eba1d08b2494ee6c7afcc6aeeee8defd0f8cc1744","9ea63bb170a707eb6fcc9ce712a2ddc661dd42693cade60b1f0ef0dc7d35e2c0","455be0119cb92e6f0fc9b9ac656a699417564c2153cbfa4eeb533e07038c9fa7","3010ef1ee6430cd17de6bcd5257b0069500f81ba3a972ff65a4848f8e222f6e1","eef8f0ca5945599dc963fa6ab304ddd7a12e07b052026e2659c2bbed825c2cc0","9266a9cef118648b798099763127bb56fb9bafce85c982b41ce4166f8cea97c9","484419aeb8099dff73da6ec5e636a107db3d7b4d12732cadacf50d61e5dbbb5c","d165a45f10d00baa61083481ce8268d8fd442801a0c9836da545295f4afb3b28","ec177788ebba3d14455255ae76ee020b5a014d5113cd87cb637a6bf603635cf6","6bae25383a8f284bee282624508be019ca20eb9af5bb7704e2fabda185a53325","a2d725343c5b2596b98fdaeecc72c31ba3a1023481595d22f207742b5f8d818b","f2edd77f2cccbb3a1823a4de7dd1a70f1c644dcf566e3cdb30ebede4d95d1ead","6dc73bd73d48b36f3d234416937882a57b27da27d44ef8deb457fe90c23d0d82","9ab4ee874498ab1d300454744934360f45b65c1bcab4d65e65ac63bde6bdbaba","95766813e6bd8be8195718875680ccf0d6285767e8339a8dff54aeb3b1ca3ed2","6d24e06d62266f1c5acd1ff5814e397c0b9b3caf45d77d9349e8379d8dadb177","c24123246e5e5fa7dbb10a76a0eb87017791a3daa2bfcd4115bf487098a1279a","1955fe20bdd4b2ac637ab68c05d12531d62ef9fd4f211b6745edbc302f67b737","5b76b7d8138107d9bf985aa3647b67e6f1224b543f7575c4886d43bde35df54e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301167.zip::R2-2301167 - CR3872 Correction for receiving PC5 link release during path switching.docx:p192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301167.zip::R2-2301167 - CR3872 Correction for receiving PC5 link release during path switching.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the connected L2 U2N Relay UE as suitable and perform actions as specified in clause 5.3.7.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to Remote UE implementation whether to release or keep the current PC5 unicast link.","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For L2 U2N Remote UE, if both a suitable cell and a suitable relay are available, the UE can select either one based on its implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of changes","paragraph_zero_based":228}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"3ae7382fac5a05fbdfcee0ce7ffa40cab8c9106486f09469eabd3ee9af9676d5","original_member_sha256":"22956335148b7a5c16c2b5dda19d49a29d30d34a1f02b6918ba645f49922cb03","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9e9d984caad9b8b058a2494b39e5ef369d3be50ee56d3a7b82291051bb3d3479","140ecd913f2fcdd328a7215eb7edda77fa729d79d01abbba31adbd6aa4277307","d0ce7e2b70f51e78ad87ebc1a291934a305281ec3ddda9b0e6b46da4ea5bcc4e","922663d7972e6b28879d53dcfd245b498cd286ba2b142ffcaf95044f3fb8013e","05a224bd3cc2092d5963b698e80063c4ee52a3e783cfa9cf5ef91582d1eb5474","466b940da49bd1d1113915c431d09a1870d09dc4fac5d0a0d31ae6529efb1e67","eff5fe88d9ef8889548f390efb7f9a77398a04bd87ba6d15413c60e509b26161","56d0f48f11b592d19b35976326149dece782e2bc3888ecee94fd7fbb012b894c","2bbdafc0653c9d12089ca545d134abee31eab2a794e1351a4882ca289d54c160","510e1e0aaed3034ac02ef7f664241068f925ea13c578f01883b731584d2fb06d","2f1488e1faeb13aa32d6eaf1a633235b39f5a6264f8f30f4c66e2c35f577414f","1a6ae016df37990b9320d72f5b5316e1a4999bcc16c515690f40564f7377849d","b34ad06fb4cf4cfb75cf422d7b284a1fa4ab23fbfc7618664a6d6083fef2cc39"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,228],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301167.zip::R2-2301167 - CR3872 Correction for receiving PC5 link release during path switching.docx:p216"}
