{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301174.zip::R2-2301174 - CR3873 Correction for Uu message transfer procedure.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-15(Release 15)Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.8.3, ‘perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9’ is missing. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.2.3, the description of ‘inititate the Uu Message transfer in sidelink to that UE as specified in 5.8.9.9’ is not aligned with ‘perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9’. ","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"‘perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9’ is added in 5.8.9.8.3. ","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.2.3, ‘perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9’ is replaced by ‘inititate the Uu Message transfer in sidelink to that UE as specified in 5.8.9.9’.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"69376c1fd5ef3c9aea92699c51af06f4a06428eaee9e91442d75fc66631908ad","original_member_sha256":"c9aa1d0527b4fe5eea731f1043e789b41def2d627cb2e14372615f94d2cfd618","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2bcad8961d97171dd3fbae5ea706cf46bbdd94a04b93c609c900a4af7ede1858","d622c54a868313da351fa86dae16dadcd2073d33090cf3e1e76543fe652f972f","d975aabcd9228ecd798c1433c6a35d2c69d69a27d33efb7f2ac2a54398341915","615a48abec7417733bfe9728932a4941c6fd75d743f8a92237761ba0c08c4048","0f39bf2357c9fd63b9db49a9c1bf526f46081b95d81ed7d8e93497db007e25fc","cba28c4eedaa61bee3f95099a3baee536dfa9d098cb8984cc8461f95c6422237","eea552d38622d7df72780ec5ca2edb58d0a931f9f46a81e9e1fa095f130211d7","2f60689334dfd0b2e31699f78214d55ac8d1ae39dd47d4d2378c023aaa981308","449d6e23d84cb818f3a3363b7e0295df269d8fa48e4b1a5f38a84723798029e5","d7f2d1b827a040d898049aff3c4ef54ec5a34362e3dac607cf0bcfa189957b15","4dda21c21e7337d670c3cbc670e6e8def3752920573c3149ef3508cda3a776be","6904d39dfb3746a48de34d230d053ca9a502717e261bb79abcf160e49f844c8d","7976a2d9a702b5ae676fa24388efe6c5b