{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301174.zip::R2-2301174 - CR3873 Correction for Uu message transfer procedure.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release received SIB request in sl-RequestedSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of first change","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"start of second change","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.2.3Reception of the Paging message by the UE or PagingRecord by the L2 U2N Remote UE","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the Paging message by the UE or receiving PagingRecord from its connected L2 U2N Relay UE by a L2 U2N Remote UE, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE, for each of the PagingRecord, if any, included in the Paging message, or","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE, for each of the PagingRecord, if any, included in the UuMessageTransferSidelink message received from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the ue-Identity included in the PagingRecord matches the UE identity allocated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if upper layers indicate the support of paging cause:","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the ue-Identity, accessType (if present) and paging cause (if determined) to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the ue-Identity and accessType (if present) to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_INACTIVE, for each of the PagingRecord, if any, included in the Paging message, or","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_INACTIVE, for each of the PagingRecord, if any, included in the UuMessageTransferSidelink message received from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the ue-Identity included in the PagingRecord matches the UE's stored fullI-RNTI:","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured by upper layers with Access Identity 1:","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the RRC connection resumption procedure according to 5.3.13 with resumeCause set to mps-PriorityAccess;","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the UE is configured by upper layers with Access Identity 2:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the RRC connection resumption procedure according to 5.3.13 with resumeCause set to mcs-PriorityAccess;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the UE is configured by upper layers with one or more Access Identities equal to 11-15:","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the RRC connection resumption procedure according to 5.3.13 with resumeCause set to highPriorityAccess;","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"69376c1fd5ef3c9aea92699c51af06f4a06428eaee9e91442d75fc66631908ad","original_member_sha256":"c9aa1d0527b4fe5eea731f1043e789b41def2d627cb2e14372615f94d2cfd618","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6fcc59dc2b3c849ee90cd3365439dcb10f7e2142f8d09ec96007ab6bcc9dff6d","22fa716e153b84855f4e114216b452de9fe074828e48b8e