{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301174.zip::R2-2301174 - CR3873 Correction for Uu message transfer procedure.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the RRC connection resumption procedure according to 5.3.13 with resumeCause set to mt-Access;","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:A MUSIM UE may not initiate the RRC connection resumption procedure, e.g. when it decides not to respond to the Paging message due to UE implementation constraints as specified in TS 24.501 [23].","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the ue-Identity included in the PagingRecord matches the UE identity allocated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if upper layers indicate the support of paging cause:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the ue-Identity, accessType (if present) and paging cause (if determined) to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the ue-Identity and accessType (if present) to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'other';","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE, for each TMGI included in pagingGroupList, if any, included in the Paging message:","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has joined an MBS session indicated by the TMGI included in the pagingGroupList:","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the TMGI to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_INACTIVE and the UE has joined one or more MBS session(s) indicated by the TMGI(s) included in the pagingGroupList:","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if none of the ue-Identity included in any of the PagingRecord, if included in the Paging message, matches the UE identity allocated by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the RRC connection resumption procedure according to 5.3.13 with resumeCause set as below:","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured by upper layers with Access Identity 1:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>resumeCause is set to mps-PriorityAccess;","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if the UE is configured by upper layers with Access Identity 2:","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>resumeCause is set to mcs-PriorityAccess;","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if the UE is configured by upper layers with one or more Access Identities equal to 11-15:","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>resumeCause is set to highPriorityAccess;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>resumeCause is set to mt-Access;","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>forward the TMGI(s) to the upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"69376c1fd5ef3c9aea92699c51af06f4a06428eaee9e91442d75fc66631908ad","original_member_sha256":"c9aa1d0527b4fe5eea731f1043e789b41def2d627cb2e14372615f94d2cfd618","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["82c56482ed0c1198d3746480ca21a7476ef5d19f5aec7a6b33353ce2c85b51a9","f5cefb7412befb316936951435892bba1e324d750e40508663947f82fc42