{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301174.zip::R2-2301174 - CR3873 Correction for Uu message transfer procedure.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as a L2 U2N Relay UE, for each of the PagingRecord, if any, included in the Paging message:","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the ue-Identity included in the PagingRecord in the Paging message matches the UE identity in sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE included in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE received in RemoteUEInformationSidelink message from a L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9;","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of second change","paragraph_zero_based":195}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"69376c1fd5ef3c9aea92699c51af06f4a06428eaee9e91442d75fc66631908ad","original_member_sha256":"c9aa1d0527b4fe5eea731f1043e789b41def2d627cb2e14372615f94d2cfd618","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["114a07e1a20aced6a3efbe5747d4236a0f7bd5795519f0a5e41d3a2b89d5c873","8ebdd7455243605ac1b288d92af407581050ae0eb26642973a5327df6fca1eea","e56384a6f0c3d172e754d6e823f19ee1e62fc5752216dce9f59951cf2916c470","27e8df905764bddeea3e236615d50e885bcdcacef1d6ace021d37bbe068877cc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,195],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301174.zip::R2-2301174 - CR3873 Correction for Uu message transfer procedure.docx:p192"}
