"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"53da1889dc35904076dbb4e20cf7868c2a9a535cdb1b6c6c8b3ce10e10ca2a60","original_member_sha256":"1d1c7a562bc0a858dad014746765439744ed1921a2cf95aed6a29e33f202ddc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["177c876ff8a78b326fd85999d15142a5086076cb2a381d19e3be7ccf3f23a01d","4328dbc2e9ed59984edad9da9f918a037222a8bc1d4a7f801e449d0bf4e71fd0","1b57abbb250ccf0e7dbcfaad8666dd22e39df29408dc1d6e61b3298df1a31533","dca27312d7a1517d19ed558671871fab25e9b549c607883b97a78f9f3628f08a","6d3fba1314de1001e3753ed4f16b9c74cdf0271805f61b17dcc5b42bd590842f","617785343afc34ff86d7085e070e5171c849cf65b766df069d11ae4921b43535","2caa595cd7e59285af78dbc891ce778a4a574be0fa8c01888719cceb91e8cf0b","cb9646e53a961acadd8b9d1cbe9977f71385aded0c0dd84e225defb7e8545ad8","e434e65a10e838afc9f35a37c5efebc215fd9aedc21692d7cc12941674744e85","48f27d1f338f2e6cabf1ff384625f9d1a5e67ab8190bf0af224f5e9fd5a2044d","eb2b8d96ad7095fb7da447cec68977f0b423a35f22229cf548c3a8c3e6093bde","731cd85286f824ffc8ab15b3e076faaf16231b040ec58d5b982eb0b04411f518","6ba36f5254d0a3f609cfdca72bbc96ee077e433e0bc80634bf3e176721e3f8af","15446e336e26f8e8542354aaa67cefc1b9b0d8b4af76558f1b7e96594ab3e72b","032e9f858d3d59ab048f1c6847f25e5b233bb6ba0c88c96eee40690f328745ca","1ac810a1cab11c95a1df934fbe11d17d0c7b90f828c877e62a98a07ed58b7dfa","1d8a3640ac8bf4ac751339eedd1b07cebe1a539a6f5a019350cc0a6385712852","b3f8ba76ec829a0eac6003bc8cbccaed17d41a62756dd1214cc8a7fa8c87c76d","ebb18e058d1fac3e0efc9941e530e6c9327f91af82e47a50969e70a111afea2a","191839387f36cc17e2fc7c32976a9924d5300c8f56387fd2d8fd55776aa99ddd","dcb00a9e6c6c316c0088d2dc5f1b8ad2617b4424352762cd9029642ce44b55be","adf91afec1ef44a2388772bd7103ea6e4f36004e933a3b58dc00af5209fde022","500ae1e95311986e752b9be027e0c22a78d267c2f0de2c686523828721158b14","1cef444d894cdacbe559bb45e53c3b2ef7f77da82c45f0f24d784d4541645307"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[24,47],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301175.zip::R2-2301175_38331_CR3874_(Rel-17)_Clarification on dl-P0-PSXCH for OoC Remote UE.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301175.zip::R2-2301175_38331_CR3874_(Rel-17)_Clarification on dl-P0-PSXCH for OoC Remote UE.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-15(Release 15)Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In Rel-16/Rel-17 a UE performs power control for SL transmission as describled in clause 16.2 in TS 38.213, according to which DL pathloss based power control is enabled when: ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For PSBCH, if dl-P0-PSBCH is provided;","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For PSSCH/PSCCH, if dl-P0-PSSCH-PSCCH is provided;","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For PSFCH, if dl-P0-PSFCH is provided.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"During L2 U2N relay operation, a Remote UE that is out of coverage, can receive SIBs from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE, which means it can receive dl-P0-PSBCH/ dl-P0-PSSCH-PSCCH/ dl-P0-PSFCH when they are included in SIB12. However, the Remote UE can not perform the DL pathloss based power control for SL transmission as the DL path loss info is not available to remote UE in this case. ","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Therefore, in this CR, it is clarified that a L2 U2N Remote UE which is out of coverage should disable the DL pathloss based power control even when dl-P0-PSBCH/ dl-P0-PSSCH-PSCCH/ dl-P0-PSFCH are included in SIB12.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 6.3.5, ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Add a sentence in the field description of dl-P0-PSBCH, dl-P0-PSSCH-PSCCH and dl-P0-PSFCH, to clarify that the OoC Remote UE should consider that DL pathloss based power control is disabled for PBSCH/PSCCH/PSSCH/PSFCH even when dl-P0-PSBCH, dl-P0-PSSCH-PSCCH and dl-P0-PSFCH are included in SIB12.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"53da1889dc35904076dbb4e20cf7868c2a9a535cdb1b6c6c8b3ce10e10ca2a60","original_member_sha256":"1d1c7a562bc0a858dad014746765439744ed1921a2cf95aed6a29e33f202ddc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","436df15741b55f08b4bf4008749c5ec82f0a841932bcc6af302c8aedfe04e62b","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","d275988d1cb90e1bd38cb188191eb269c7f51da39d9d09d9caf4415e220f1b0e","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","9179ba236853e4a73f15d3d408619f0f62540850e6daa878c17cdc8a8f26dbb9","a615669d70d88f746182497c27411722540e138f4e197fb87659137d241b7c3e","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","3c4c80e1e11044a4d07c2d065ab1badcf74a3b84af6435503a27154aade28f9b","064f182f5037ef8bdf383667fcf36151e947372f23cf7626004a97f92c0efc32","c29b176b4ec432aab88fce66147e160a9a51c1b613acc4fed578e57edf623098","67d8517217247bdc43e286f79cf6c158860c5783a6ce8aa3705c1155eff82632","92e700d9a4bcb8a9c37d58e23aa0f33a1469e7be7d62eec197c393f4310fc0bb","8dda1146c8ad77f697930c050bab4c4d610906c37080a2d0d969adb0a7241b07","911339b19a26dc9361ad09608b1a1de988e01a1f7f2fc2e7f4a07595f9b01a37","8b24573e0133d1c5ee95e1377545628b16380b4d3d980bde5296376e8173041e","7423559940944ed0cc1fe176b76253cf9035dcdbfc0fac2f3e385feb311a2329","288cc60197c635a28716a1c3a9133085106b36b1009fb0a2849670c1b99dfd9f","cfdf9320374a54147e8f7e4da81c0b55ce371e6a300aeb5863d17b61724d4dfe","0a670547f4ec2c3f1a3b765099729a6c4e5445b539a989729c2117046c24387f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301175.zip::R2-2301175_38331_CR3874_(Rel-17)_Clarification on dl-P0-PSXCH for OoC Remote UE.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301175.zip::R2-2301175_38331_CR3874_(Rel-17)_Clarification on dl-P0-PSXCH for OoC Remote UE.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options:","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR SA ","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Power control for SL transmission when L2 U2N Remote UE is out of coverage","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"There is no inter-operability issue as the change only has impact on L2 U2N Remote UE behavour.","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N  Remote UE behaviour will be unclear for the case when Remote UE is out of coverage, and it is unable to perform power control for SL transmission when DL pathloss based powner control is enabled by the network i.e when dl-P0-PSBCH/dl-P0-PSSCH-PSCCH/dl-P0-PSFCH is included in SIB12.","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.3.5","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"53da1889dc35904076dbb4e20cf7868c2a9a535cdb1b6c6c8b3ce10e10ca2a60","original_member_sha256":"1d1c7a562bc0a858dad014746765439744ed1921a2cf95aed6a29e33f202ddc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["62f3137911015e6315c7d68f99af67fe9539ec3b92bbb03ef456991614058a2a","a32c114f1719f26ab03f7a8b76a839b6819f7fb2bc9c331c7eb63445d5b3f22e","9f2497dacdd40ba291e94eeaa0d634df03b9574fc9d85027f7c25fdd85067511","0b994b9057ff01ccc51bbc3910351d64f7c9821d3f84f768378a3231b7721f9c","19784d9196eaed1ad20d64c374c3301f638ff40d49399a1eda7a5dc3a1b0874e","3f65dcb0553eddaf6d22b7e89d865d4dc697ac12464be532738615ec936c692d","5a3b33dc23c8e3139ff1c0fd6f6c876fc87824ff72f82b25637fd699f985df29","d6e2dfe30dc84e122bea23caa3b3e6598ea78d27e3e15713e70d27c57f82fdcc","a179dd901b845e1406275efebd4601f72aa2eb92d4f093fdf761147edfb8df34","9d327157e61ec0f343dc8a09a47ff32c673d6fe3d600390dcd164897cb2de232","12f53760d5a65e8663d92a288b2691000628259dfd579630d31c28eb1dea761a","23da18bbbcbc650fad7a07ef8006251a7a06ae59113986d1a2b8d37f6d71a8d1","85f9fe225bf206da5b28016fbb39c62cb1368eb1244f4f20547ea6629294dc69","378adf0aa423995360841de5b3ff121413a3320bd55a44c2044b1a4823324310","9ddb0dbe3764a705b50e1b75d987056d16cead4ce55d6e62d26d3f5109eed5df","d3098623b4dfc23a1a4b383cc6c305d01a4c1c56ac54d5853c2f6542bbe0ad3e","d88bc81b05cdcb5373fcefe52e78f5e5b7ea4e37e19c0d9ebb00bb2abbe8ad2d","61cf31ccb32ca743f815831546a63f3d4f37ea5f4ff7e02e623d0e686dc91277","f60d6caa44b5763ed31adce9de07e57c2bc513038416d2b5e966bbd3cac2a407","d3262b1816fab55992cffb02c05a6ffa91b6523e243fbbc95fea56d1d4a60b