{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301175.zip::R2-2301175_38331_CR3874_(Rel-17)_Clarification on dl-P0-PSXCH for OoC Remote UE.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-PSBCH-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-Alpha-PSBCH","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates alpha value for DL pathloss based power control for PSBCH. When the field is not configured the UE applies the value 1.","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-P0-PSBCH","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates P0 value for DL pathloss based power control for PSBCH. If not configured, DL pathloss based power control is disabled for PSBCH. When dl-P0-PSBCH-r17 is configured, the UE ignores dl-P0-PSBCH-r16.","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A Remote UE which is out of coverage, considers downlink pathloss based power control is disabled for PSBCH when dl-P0-PSBCH is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-ResourcePool","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" The IE SL-ResourcePool specifies the configuration information for NR sidelink communication resource pool.","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ResourcePool information element","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-RESOURCEPOOL-START","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-ResourcePool-r16 ::=            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PSCCH-Config-r16                SetupRelease { SL-PSCCH-Config-r16 }                                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PSSCH-Config-r16                SetupRelease { SL-PSSCH-Config-r16 }                                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-PSFCH-Config-r16                SetupRelease { SL-PSFCH-Config-r16 }                                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-SyncAllowed-r16                 SL-SyncAllowed-r16                                                    OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-SubchannelSize-r16              ENUMERATED {n10, n12, n15, n20, n25, n50, n75, n100}                  OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dummy                              INTEGER (10..160)                                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-StartRB-Subchannel-r16          INTEGER (0..265)                                                      OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-NumSubchannel-r16               INTEGER (1..27)                                                       OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"53da1889dc35904076dbb4e20cf7868c2a9a535cdb1b6c6c8b3ce10e10ca2a60","original_member_sha256":"1d1c7a562bc0a858dad014746765439744ed1921a2cf95aed6a29e33f202ddc7","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b5db3165bf47fde81e4022f290cbf3f6c8b7bf83dfbd17fa2ed79ba8c254c665","de639dcc9f5a295acb4652