{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301347.zip::R2-2301347.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-16","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The condition for inclusion of the field sbas-ID in GNSS assistance data from TS 37.355 is not reflected in the posSIB definitions in TS 38.331.  This omission allows the possibility that a network sends GNSS assistance data in a posSIB that indicates applicability to both an SBAS and a (non-SBAS) GNSS, and a UE that receives such a posSIB does not know whether it should apply to the indicated GNSS or SBAS.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Alternatively, a network could indicate gnss-id=sbas, but then fail to include the sbas-id, and the UE would not know which SBAS the assistance data applied to.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The Need R condition on sbas-id in PosSIB-Type is changed to a condition indicating that sbas-id is mandatory present if gnss-id is set to sbas, and absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Network may confuse UEs by sending inconsistent metadata for a posSIB.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e8db888fb982803df73b5b70d0aab8c62937a78cdcaaf45c33eae1b126eff1c9","original_member_sha256":"80851f6ec4179a1dcedf260272906258a89ff70e2fd14ccbbe1e0979b29cdbec","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["004e79f05163313a5ddbd89100439f87d6222f3e6bc399d029f92dc6b1c8f94d","867c3d6f70420e93a6c983a461a7c8b1caa128b5668634b909fbb9cc4f17f68a","42f6f346c4eee5a6ab42d67dfee794edbd1ad5e75afd1d5f20c5a71ca5bad627","0cc02a3fd5466318fe2bddccfbe449f4c0b73223b0a940d3af4c374db6addf8f","891d59112f0d3171c71b04d81f8678e1affca713ddbf47ac01a52d66a8dd3d61","e7b9f9f143110aac73092d314561a0cdc516af83f1c9d168f78e739c43675dac","95b811b53144c2959cafcb20ccfdd6f64b1fa58250555256eaae00a2489ca157","8a162c7b38dd363ce01599b58e4e56d497004649f7df960d5e3bf208e2a477bb","0966ad4491d0dda31c94941647d31c7914bb53da1c3f4a948d6ed927e0ca56f7","354816f4e17c1cb64b19613a461dd43f555e5921b6238e579462526e46cd