{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301432.zip::R2-2301432 Note.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-16","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A note should not reflect a normative text as per the 3GPP TR 21.801 drafting rule. “Informative elements shall not contain normative content”","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A shall behvaiour is associated with normative text. In below field description however the informative note has a shall requirement. ","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-SFN0-Offset","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the time offset of the SFN#0 slot#0 for the given TRP with respect to SFN#0 slot#0 of the assistance data reference TRP and comprises the following subfields:","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-sfn-Offset specifies the SFN offset at the TRP antenna location between the assistance data reference TRP and this neighbour TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The offset corresponds to the number of full radio frames counted from the beginning of a radio frame #0 of the assistance data reference TRP to the beginning of the closest subsequent radio frame #0 of this neighbour TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-integerSubframeOffset specifies the frame boundary offset at the TRP antenna location between the assistance data reference TRP and this neighbour TRP counted in full subframes.","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The offset corresponds to the number of full subframes counted from the beginning of a subframe #0 of the assistance data reference TRP to the beginning of the closest subsequent subframe #0 of this neighbour TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The location server shall set the value in accordance with the defined search window for the target device using nr-DL-PRS-ExpectedRSTD and nr-DL-PRS-ExpectedRSTD-Uncertainty.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d8ea2f71f3934a8587b5f7f325441496184ccd7b68d1aa88459300c9d9e56e2b","original_member_sha256":"ce424fd41c1de8e7fe631d2c48a21f828a13a40e8c26645855bf15096b4f8bc5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b734a644343312905dbfaacd198118abef91d8b821819cd6d4fdf6558919946b","a9684fa345fd4c2658b9c386f1088c87758f388b939ab