{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301433.zip::R2-2301433 Orbit and Tropo.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The tropospheric changes are: ","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional presence of the tropospheric delay corrections of the GNSS-SSR-GriddedCorrection introduced","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clarifying text describing the applicability of the tropospheric delay corrections applicability to all","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis, orbit corrections","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: NR SA, (NG)EN-DC, NE-DC,NR-DC ","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS SSR Clock Corrections","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If NW implements the CR and UE does not","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE may not be able to apply SSR clock corrections for GNSS Type Galileo, which may result in positioning error","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If UE implements the CR and NW does not","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE may apply the clock corrections with reference to I/NAV, while the network may provide clock corrections with reference to F/NAV signal.","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis, tropospheric correction","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: NR SA, (NG)EN-DC, NE-DC,NR-DC ","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS SSR Gridded Corrections","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"fb8ec76fc8fff2631a54eea3056fb58660493df02c08adfc8f87a29b6647ca9c","original_member_sha256":"c372cd2cebbb02ac4d53a8ac60ad70ed83b67917bcef75f23e4950c4d4dce8c5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["355d1e058ea1326e0eaee60a971c4dda5a501000f73299bd7082b29cf93b7cf0","556df4338ec1260fa5eac4d06b33a362138ef041cff2f8ad5aec50ffc23a589e","ba5cd9303a57aff5c908678143528c6c23d3cdc86adac3c48c75050db072e4a4","1b00903cfd49b8780c7154bad08f5255a27ede260266997c7879fe02091c95f3","fff703927cf3e0386e9801c3606e4b13c50d9dc130e0ec10027720431a5fcda1","4b328fda2319984e9c37453fc9ddab7dc15ce5b10c574e17c40eecb544e9b2be","775b90dad286c4cac26840c249725b0053dd80f3e69b42fd1c8cd5f98f1b7777","608706d35568a072be0ceb97d41ae30b7fdc5c9d959c3e029a41a59841e76395","f895a00d4ae879631a85dda02ce96f35cf497c0e0bd6f5b37bf7611260c45811","a9fbc4c207f53bb59b32dc3884a5440ff1ef527c0dc3062f2f08c38d8ec2d7cb","7c872089cd6a0ea81a48bad74b343a8555ca3168077c4fd733d25046a5d4841e","e66d3c089d400e973d6e43063ef316b624fca66a6a392e617597bc9bdfcff145","6ef02564ecbcbc3c9a5d0e812f520185f5d6e4efe08b755735c5710ea9183a34","9d70a25f3896bad43f346801078af8d1c694eab0c02e37f72b4e499802e584dd","fe2e0fb30c394c12322b857093ab0553134be50a2a5c7da2529751dc7e9bc52d","4e918295225ed114d4d93a4a894ba426b70d5d453d18aeac668110f2d9107678","b5bc593007c0341102ede946fe93e15d1cce595b