{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301433.zip::R2-2301433 Orbit and Tropo.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Beginning of Changes","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.5.2.2GNSS Assistance Data Elements","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–GNSS-ReferenceTime","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Skip Unmodified Changes>","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–GNSS-SSR-OrbitCorrections","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE GNSS-SSR-OrbitCorrections is used by the location server to provide radial, along-track and cross-track orbit corrections together with integrity information. The target device may use the SSR-OrbitCorrectionList to compute a satellite position correction to be combined with the satellite position calculated from broadcast ephemeris.","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The parameters provided in IE GNSS-SSR-OrbitCorrections – except for ORBIT-IntegrityParameters and SSR-IntegrityOrbitBounds – are used as specified for SSR Clock Messages (e.g., message type 1057 and 1063) in [30] and apply to all GNSSs.","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-SSR-OrbitCorrections-r15 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"epochTime-r15GNSS-SystemTime,","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssrUpdateInterval-r15INTEGER (0..15),","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"satelliteReferenceDatum-r15ENUMERATED { itrf, regional, ... },","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"iod-ssr-r15INTEGER (0..15),","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssr-OrbitCorrectionList-r15SSR-OrbitCorrectionList-r15,","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...,","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[[","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"orbit-IntegrityParameters-r17ORBIT-IntegrityParameters-r17OPTIONAL -- Need OR","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"]]","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SSR-OrbitCorrectionList-r15 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..64)) OF SSR-OrbitCorrectionSatelliteElement-r15","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SSR-OrbitCorrectionSatelliteElement-r15 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"fb8ec76fc8fff2631a54eea3056fb58660493df02c08adfc8f87a29b6647ca9c","original_member_sha256":"c372cd2cebbb02ac4d53a8ac60ad70ed83b67917bcef75f23e4950c4d4dce8c5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["20e33cc5bdf126e4a81b9f210df64a2ac632883f5f621f522f83c08e2065f893","a66a144e5fd3a1bdad73b9884827a627c77e650040672ebd0c32cb8facefc179","ab5913488f485e22d00a9ce7bd601bdce4e0d9393d805c54da49f7493734e2a7","f448509b4ac0ff94e9407df7ecd948c2fd891fd52f1e4d6d9a3dc8c3a3423965","aeec7ca75639196bd5055b304287520a45e0867fc4a4cca3f1ec3260bee994f8","520e12604298ba80e3a702b1fe976cd6d50730377667c2ac57c6e9293f3d4092","ede817cad252af000a90db983dfba502df0d7a57161bd12b1cfaf2edf6c14595","c590366378d992ec0bc9ec2433b6e48bddac6186be3e7d43bd5d8a5b91c76d82","5daa375a41e3e7a5e71ffac3f9c7333000d8394cca48125189d9af6d152074bb","d65ce906af80c5cb1f5c70cec7a310319af0580284d26271a945974e71cd0c57","88af64c029fae2a92e0467f53e0fc8c5b885050aedd19e9604b3167077ade69e","c9457959a94dfca9c249163861b04e0a35c1f7efb03e175390232fea4080803a","cf24ed163e2e9b4333666769050b1d369a9bab68a4d631dbf954bafebae0beac","0ba1f767fd833857414785e82bc70967b9764cfe714ca4dd5b0665e76f3e2aac","f58b1143ae5d89ff855bf5b95f0944152151261cce6fa755d21ffc5128cc9812","aac1e97f35ea88a3a09f50f2e860cf027ad49970139719ccb2fb7d613b6e54ae","e7102f542306b7fe150728bacaa571cf4d58feb78e50c69e6e91adadc71619c0","22047f9ae451faa85f076f6958a217c810fcc3494e3976a9ad5c922328b178c7","12a2470600c07c95351443c2415d4ec0d6692e5d20d2af52aba676283382da16","55f5457a1239955f1ca72d6b6152a424f4a46a690c9dec78e9e34ad987ce48f8","7a0c849f3effc0a88b706e2957ae53bee55e89302ba001a3549548fd5136b920","13590fca3ad928c815c77074fe24665fdad785c801991ef377fae15e0bda9415","298b933b85f079466cf0f2d5ec20a4ce9b8b6d3a24eb6fdad3c510eabaade96a","824c5caa3a1161da89ee9f6bcd8b54695e0f2a793837273315fa4e856e8e9d36"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2301433.zip::R2-2301433 Orbit and Tropo.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301433.zip::R2-2301433 Orbit and Tropo.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"svID-r15SV-ID,","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"iod-r15BIT STRING (SIZE(11)),","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"delta-radial-r15INTEGER (-2097152..2097151),","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"delta-AlongTrack-r15INTEGER (-524288..524287),","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"delta-CrossTrack-r15INTEGER (-524288..524287),","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dot-delta-radial-r15INTEGER (-1048576..1048575)OPTIONAL, -- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dot-delta-AlongTrack-r15INTEGER (-262144..262143) OPTIONAL, -- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dot-delta-CrossTrack-r15INTEGER (-262144..262143) OPTIONAL, -- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS-SSR-OrbitCorrections field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"epochTime","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the epoch time of the orbit corrections. The gnss-TimeID in GNSS-SystemTime shall be the same as the GNSS-ID in IE GNSS-GenericAssistDataElement. ","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssrUpdateInterval","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the SSR Update Interval. The SSR Update Intervals for all SSR parameters start at time 00:00:00 of the GPS time scale. A change of the SSR Update Interval during the transmission of SSR data should ensure consistent data for a target device. See table Value of ssrUpdateInterval to SSR Update Interval relation below. NOTE 1.","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"satelliteReferenceDatum","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the satellite refence datum for the orbit corrections.","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"iod-ssr","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the Issue of Data number for the SSR data. A change of iod-ssr is used to indicate a change in the SSR generating configuration. ","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"svID","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"fb8ec76fc8fff2631a54eea3056fb58660493df02c08adfc8f87a29b6647ca9c","original_member_sha256":"c372cd2cebbb02ac4d53a8ac60ad70ed83b67917bcef75f23e4950c4d4dce8c5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ad3ae10cd69e003c956c3217dda270eeb32c4a2665e0c73500ea10450d28347d","7bd5d7d2f156be4cdb83c93329397d5f91fa48bd012f35bfff279429c1778fcb","dd70e03b649ef0b20b9058d9e822a01a8926d78a1a3127fdd27bbdc9bdad2018","a76a4d7ab877615539ce8f0d8d9384645b5f4af494cf96659b17499458d123ec","dc03fa7eea1fc4fa350dc0d5ae8511c7854c00a3fe62fc3c42675999bea7ccf4","00096cc46369cc15cfff0dcf9d8803e85a731451fd8e2b9fe5ef982ba356eb82","db1bc8e19e3431f3d6d92e23548c08a72496ce37b2365b7a7a72ada1c36ca077","2b756511b94739d75ecaa4deeda591d8c4cccc51a5eddd060d7c681045b004b0","032216c018f8f100f5f7233adc42b9d668ba2764bd70938f3bd65ad6d6021a24","06b67b2c9a1b0894ea837fd4af21255a39da10ba502b7ba47a9194a3a2d7d04c","9ee1d0d625b60f942ab2becf07cfa223c4b27090e4f0df1fa766d186f6