{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301434.zip::R2-2301434 Note.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE AreaID-CellList provides the NR Cell-IDs of the TRPs belonging to a particular network area where the associated assistance data are valid.","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Skip Unmodified changes>","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceData","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceData is used by the location server to provide DL-PRS assistance data.","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The location server should include at least one TRP for which the SFN can be obtained by the target device, e.g. the serving TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The nr-DL-PRS-ReferenceInfo defines the \"assistance data reference\" TRP whose DL-PRS configuration is included in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList. The nr-DL-PRS-SFN0-Offset's and nr-DL-PRS-expectedRSTD's in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList are provided relative to the \"assistance data reference\" TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The network signals a value of zero for the nr-DL-PRS-SFN0-Offset, nr-DL-PRS-expectedRSTD, and nr-DL-PRS-expectedRSTD-uncertainty of the \"assistance data reference\" TRP in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList.","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:For NR DL-TDOA positioning (see clause 6.5.10) the nr-DL-PRS-ReferenceInfo defines also the requested \"RSTD reference\".","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For DL-PRS processing, the LPP layer may inform lower layers to start performing DL-PRS measurements and provide to lower layers the information about the location of DL-PRS, e.g. DL-PRS-PointA, DL-PRS Positioning occasion information.","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceData-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-ReferenceInfo-r16DL-PRS-ID-Info-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList-r16SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxFreqLayers-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataPerFreq-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-SSB-Config-r16SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxTRPs-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-SSB-Config-r16OPTIONAL,-- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"afd7460cf554024cdd543f9064d790b9aa6edee1b4152e9ba84094d5a97ec947","original_member_sha256":"200d020a4005a2583dd49ea3376815774f4ec73f5686eaea31635f25c702125f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["42e69f5835ec5a2e0d0ad44583150d09f3dad8f10f292124105c9710cc260441","b180b24fe635f2f65ccba80e07b75d884da0647f7164980c2973e3877a246a93","a974c52ab492756dabc3f8100a1950b5d1c8f1eaf1971d0ca1e9bb5467f3b8e0","c59452a114995c896f662d40900b50e72074b3e24e2ea41226c344127dd9eae3","2e0e420fa161f66bb4624dac04a0f3c44959590bc36a56ad7bd2fb1a3dd4ec6d","e27f0b5ed28321c42ffca1e99db1192e801