1_R17_threshold.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301466.zip::R2-2301466_CR38.321_R17_threshold.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The description of how the UE performs filtering on L1 RSRP measurement of the reference signal (SSB or CSI-RS) before comparing with rsrp-ThresholdSSB (for SSB) or rsrp-ThresholdCSI-RS (for CSI-RS) in TS 38.321 is incorrect and does not reflect the filtering as specified in TS38.133.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS38.321: ","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sec 5.1.2:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:When the UE determines if there is an SSB with SS-RSRP above rsrp-ThresholdSSB or a CSI-RS with CSI-RSRP above rsrp-ThresholdCSI-RS, the UE uses the latest unfiltered L1-RSRP measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS38.133:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sec 8.5.5.2 (for SSB):","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" “the UE shall be able to evaluate whether the L1-RSRP measured on the configured SSB resource in set q1 estimated over the last TEvaluate_CBD_SSB ms period becomes better than the threshold Qin_LR”","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7bfc481d94d17903db419976e7fade4d782f0507aad540fef2bde15e9796a1c8","original_member_sha256":"4af3775736bbe3798670044795f5e96edd1d746ce169bf0fb01a7da2f8134b1a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cec1f3846fc3b34f3c7dcac50f79f2ac88a33b319303e6ca142a4a8a07cd6614","01f0b7968e0905c80c4a5bb37dd205a0686493efb29c328c19e0b09bfbc34fc5","73a3338f78356eb8d0d6eff5c99ff6d8013cec82a5d4b3adc47eec2289083ebc","217bef1fbe8523deb895895663a57cbe1c5bca4c5657d7af99b2fe2d47b28973","7c2a4d1b34631ed11d635b9e24e48ea9d3c0bba89136aaccb4759027ff10a86c","7b289afb88b020b0ffd46aa12da89851605907cd1b407880599e269df95c0e66","1226e5726f39d0b9dae14546fc45f47127cab60e5954582aa261e6b541217831","95c987fcc2340a0b24bc2241ead492c94e559d6ae73aabe5c2349bf26f1866e4","c408a20b6f3de380301df2e29a364e61d44c907f67b693436737e4759a2b650d","0235075ab6662ab6f1d7db3fad9fe33122f3fc1f658165ef5efe24085d5708fc","3bc15f040bd707ea0341343d5a64e5ca12880107bc82c651b89ab4894ddb0b3b","19fcf8bd726be0399e4a5116c5e8