{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2301466.zip::R2-2301466_CR38.321_R17_threshold.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(T_Evaluate_CBD_SSB is given in Table 8.5.5.2-2 for FR2)","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sec 8.5.1:","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Qin_LR for SSB is given by rsrp-ThresholdSSB.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sec 8.5.6.2 (for CSI-RS): ","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"“the UE shall be able to evaluate whether the L1-RSRP measured on the configured CSI-RS resource in set q1 estimated over the last TEvaluate_CBD_CSI-RS [ms] period becomes better than the threshold Qin_LR within TEvaluate_CBD_CSI-RS [ms] period” ","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS38.321 specification states that UE should use the latest unfiltered L1-RSRP (which is applicable to the RACH procedure which was NOT triggered as part of beam failure recovery).","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the RACH is triggered as part of the beam failure recovery procedure for the sPCell, UE should follow TS38.133 that states that the filtering over evaluation intervals is to be performed by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS38.321 specification needs correction to correctly point to TS38.133 on the UE requirements for filtering of the L1_RSRP for this procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Correct the NOTE1 to refer to TS38.133 clauses 8.5.5.2 and 8.5.6.2 for the UE filtering of L1_RSRP in case the threshold comparision for the SSB or CSI-RS if the RACH procedure is triggered as part of beam failure recovery procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: ","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SA","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7bfc481d94d17903db419976e7fade4d782f0507aad540fef2bde15e9796a1c8","original_member_sha256":"4af3775736bbe3798670044795f5e96edd1d746ce169bf0fb01a7da2f8134b1a","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dbd4fabfa93a9cd3289da021a5d1b40c872dbb35272967c316fec5926a530619","4f4d7f53d5f329ba5ccadb5c0f239b7f8fe726f591721e8ed63ef1bfbf828d83","4918fc4c378bee73b30cb6c25c9e57481eb32634142db109e375b56ce282f8b5","2e90271c1a138033ddc50a488e9447fe395f5b562ddd0a51df7e0304a9478a8c","109955f936b6bcbde818f57eec0001faba69617ec99890ccb7dbb0acbbbf23eb","34c9bfbd284bf71b373f4f1448b73e57c01907a2656213552de4f1092f0486e0","b1c7f3b8e5ef2c130aab4552956e214cf015028623b8d707cc8f064c956869dd","5df5d2febf42dfae6c5d8e8676df3e4dadd38544cc59114e399b941c75086c29","d16a0b6c3a9c6c1fc2fa87ef0f61a9491e560230b34b487a401de8eb2afd348d","e13cbde16ccd8d9a75270a1f9fb1f679d9dcbe7832749eef964192b2e55a82a1","19082a283ac5b8b895f4c4db4dfe0a63a1fae7e6a8b7eac9b7357fe4a699ede8","6bc82dfbe1152b1b88dbb76defb11e9721d8b0888339