16091139d8dfd70a6aada8ff33d5d22880412c0f43a4e64fb9784a","original_member_sha256":"b99805c18f17075611ced4abf93162c176db59800b7f6420cf1aba416ccc323e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2d46b005853207f15e30f9541482ce5b44b221d429bb1f782ecde64bb7ee5fbb","4328dbc2e9ed59984edad9da9f918a037222a8bc1d4a7f801e449d0bf4e71fd0","1b57abbb250ccf0e7dbcfaad8666dd22e39df29408dc1d6e61b3298df1a31533","dca27312d7a1517d19ed558671871fab25e9b549c607883b97a78f9f3628f08a","6d3fba1314de1001e3753ed4f16b9c74cdf0271805f61b17dcc5b42bd590842f","617785343afc34ff86d7085e070e5171c849cf65b766df069d11ae4921b43535","21afdbda6b05f014ca83e791d6b785cb0340956685d24d87b15e9d96542f9ff8","cb9646e53a961acadd8b9d1cbe9977f71385aded0c0dd84e225defb7e8545ad8","e434e65a10e838afc9f35a37c5efebc215fd9aedc21692d7cc12941674744e85","48f27d1f338f2e6cabf1ff384625f9d1a5e67ab8190bf0af224f5e9fd5a2044d","479c0fc4700398040b94c4560d32885f244816c074ef3ee9e05a6482ccc7b7c1","731cd85286f824ffc8ab15b3e076faaf16231b040ec58d5b982eb0b04411f518","4f3c321c0f59ff8eae8b150057e3dcfbc133c3778215d5599b7a30a645cab58e","15446e336e26f8e8542354aaa67cefc1b9b0d8b4af76558f1b7e96594ab3e72b","032e9f858d3d59ab048f1c6847f25e5b233bb6ba0c88c96eee40690f328745ca","1ac810a1cab11c95a1df934fbe11d17d0c7b90f828c877e62a98a07ed58b7dfa","fac1555bdd891981b7d00527f880547f02141476a101de50a47271a5a72f43f5","b3f8ba76ec829a0eac6003bc8cbccaed17d41a62756dd1214cc8a7fa8c87c76d","ebb18e058d1fac3e0efc9941e530e6c9327f91af82e47a50969e70a111afea2a","3427bbef5f2a45190b6f732cc030321e9081203c6ebe686b9138c7b3768b0624","dcb00a9e6c6c316c0088d2dc5f1b8ad2617b4424352762cd9029642ce44b55be","adf91afec1ef44a2388772bd7103ea6e4f36004e933a3b58dc00af5209fde022","500ae1e95311986e752b9be027e0c22a78d267c2f0de2c686523828721158b14","1cef444d894cdacbe559bb45e53c3b2ef7f77da82c45f0f24d784d4541645307"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[24,47],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2302684.zip::R2-2302684 Corrections on TS 38.300 for SL enhancements.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2302684.zip::R2-2302684 Corrections on TS 38.300 for SL enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to 38.321, the active time of RX UE(s) at TX UE is not only determined by the timers (e.g. SL on-duration timer(s), SL inactivity-timer(s) or SL retransmission timer(s)) maintained in the TX UE, but also includes time determined specifically by certain procedures, e.g. the time between reception of Direct Link Establishment Request message (TS 24.587 [28]) or ProSe Direct Link Establishment Request message (TS 24.554 [29]) and reception of RRCReconfigurationSidelink message including initial DRX configuration or the link establishment procedure being aborted by upper layer, for which no timers are maintained.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Therefore, such limitation that the active time of RX UE(s) is determined by the timers maintained at the TX UE should be deleted.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL DRX for unicast is configured per direction for a connection, such statement should be added to be aligned with other sentences in corresponding clauses. ","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to 38.331, the assistance information for SL DRX contains SL DRX slot offset, which is missing in current 38.300.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1.In clause 16.9.6.1, delete \"determined by the timers maintained at the TX UE\" from the sentence that \"the TX UE selects resources taking into account the active time of the RX UE(s) determined by the timers maintained at the TX UE. \"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2.In clause 16.9.6.2, add \" for each direction\" into the sentence that \"For unicast, SL DRX is configured per pair of source L2 ID and destination L2 ID.\"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3.In clause 16.9.6.2, add \" SL DRX slot offset\" into the sentence that \"RX UE may send assistance information, which includes its desired SL on-duration timer, SL DRX start offset, and SL DRX cycle, to the TX UE and the mode 2 TX UE may use it to determine the SL DRX configuration for the RX UE;\"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"29e58bbe9916091139d8dfd70a6aada8ff33d5d22880412c0f43a4e64fb9784a","original_member_sha256":"b99805c18f17075611ced4abf93162c176db59800b7f6420cf1aba416ccc323e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","4f503ecfb83b883dbb53e41349d00ee49ccb006b6a0ae90fac7c4efed10bb4c0","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","1a9b90a3d4d97cd13a6d7074cccac37fcf46085c87ec4220598ead2208e813a2","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","c7f154badb51090dd578312419bcf46f1ff9111557a952165c0ca920b2e5af4d","d533b0355400f08c76a44c519125120c2f022258d1d067d35c15682c8bc34c13","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","3c4c80e1e11044a4d07c2d065ab1badcf74a3b84af6435503a27154aade28f9b","57a7a48b1f59f295fc4316fe5269e33dd14b0d35ad67955f8e92f58de36ab3f3","161146a771ae3853eddbbab7ff6fa2e221c592b2f5e7b03d80e048962bde399d","0616dbb5358c0d8527ec9223a44edafa43cbc5c794ed5c0619860768895f3770","027c62b0496675f23d00a4dca7e9bcd345ab2dc12761f96b22acc91d7a0da3a9","8b24573e0133d1c5ee95e1377545628b16380b4d3d980bde5296376e8173041e","4c75ac50a57034b2aa04046427dc0c7f4c16649747f6206b522495ccdcb4ec96","288cc60197c635a28716a1c3a9133085106b36b1009fb0a2849670c1b99dfd9f","88acadb694756083fa639d5b91711a70c89ecaf2899e4a8abeeab48591611ea4","6e3f910d1bd2c3694638b98f2d0205bbac547ee3144bfe2e4234a9a662cab252","fa6ba22b98fd5849000fac4f78803774d70f4b301f8d5633e99d698cf9b295e5","f49f8e082f56aa382b97fe8bd2084f8a356bb305cb46ea502dcc5fd72b849cbc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2302684.zip::R2-2302684 Corrections on TS 38.300 for SL enhancements.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2302684.zip::R2-2302684 Corrections on TS 38.300 for SL enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: ","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR SA, NR-DC","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL DRX","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to this CR while the UE is not, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to this CR while the network is not, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If one UE is implemented according to this CR while the other UE is not, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The definition of active time of RX UE(s) is not complete.","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The definition of SL DRX configuration for unicast is not clear.","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The content of assistance information for SL DRX is incomplete.","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"16.9.6.1, 16.9.6.2","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"29e58bbe9916091139d8dfd70a6aada8ff33d5d22880412c0f43a4e64fb9784a","original_member_sha256":"b99805c18f17075611ced4abf93162c176db59800b7f6420cf1aba416ccc323e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5b8888f67716e87f5ff4240d399d8feb8ddc71062c7bed8604b1c5097b28f2d2","24bd9e13b2f23cb6fb3522aa15f28bb4d0d26612491f30812eed51551309d7b5","1970248e39da0aac30e1df988719ef3e7fe1b39eafb2a3c5e7beb3d998b6bd04","f7e342fc5618049c8451dd87510b68657a17fdb14b7dd1527f546db4828a63ca","84807d8d675a08f08ce2ce5c50b59eb713f02fc2cd335bded6d09f65bb32b3b9","ba258885f8d12c380bd9059428cc4f1952753d57439c1103faf64e2eb90d275f","eab5da2777534557042b9a9ce777a3329e16ac1491cba7d234e7b1e4e5df2765","082d97967c771f68c8519d3c886a5ad806ee7c51c6c2fc2cc68883c8d51779e3","1250eaa1cc23bf9d40d5f0defccff02fd8af57728c07739bcda3d19464bb50c9","30f4777645f6e6db775c8986aeece0b66aaf5faedf2b34703514a0d1b780cfe3","0c497e3e8add747d479170b7daf1b49af893e186741c653985a2ab83f3dcf8a1","23da18bbbcbc650fad7a07ef8006251a7a06ae59113986d1a2b8d37f6d71a8d1","85f9fe225bf206da5b28016fbb39c62cb1368eb1244f4f20547ea6629294dc69","378adf0aa423995360841de5b3ff121413a3320bd55a44c2044b1a4823324310","dac11475afa50f507833d68c6434a1637b4f1472122263432e5943a65b4e8fdc","f41be4470b2f4d39a68da393441dd727437e1461afdb5d4d2a1706208048b2c0","987c837856de2140d38f843898725dc59da16ec2da97625974fe5dc2b024afc7","d3098623b4dfc23a1a4b383cc6c305d01a4c1c56ac54d5853c2f6542bbe0ad3e","d88bc81b05cdcb5373fcefe52e78f5e5b7ea4e37e19c0d9ebb00bb2abbe8ad2d","61cf31ccb32