3.zip::R2-2303213 Miscellaneous corrections on TS 38.300 for NR sidelink.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303213.zip::R2-2303213 Miscellaneous corrections on TS 38.300 for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-15(Release 15)Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"     Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For groupcast and broadcast, RX UE may report the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile associated with its interested service that sidelink DRX is applied, which is similar as the report of DRX on/off indication but missing in the current stage 2 specification. ","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In section 16.9.6.3, add the corresponding UE behaviour to report the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile associated with its interested service that sidelink DRX is applied.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: ","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"  NR SA, NR-DC, NE-DC, (NG)EN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"d17fa530376e24676fae95d129835438e7eb57131388867ee1a1a1ccb743fedd","original_member_sha256":"50bc1f2403c6b442ab626fcad35da3527c1a7bd7137ba6fdd4862f43337c6bbe","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6c14188b935b71c193d6e88beab856351147c70ff8d4348a6e87fcd8c73e7fb9","b0a809ef3d489b75d5885f0fd106c2212f09a2f99dc066d4f6f3a4e7a42a5f14","b492eae2f5f89dd7af65044b9c03a7dda795334fd0cebbbbf8e4456e6938838f","b10cc07f5fd694b129fbbc5076893a354db3ef9208ec057f546d2901bf4c71e8","6800356d20b56d6e56cd4bc8f075b32b66392d20291e93fb5b543d9ff25e3528","7ea33120eaa33c256662eda67c055565e1877b94ad96a6c6390c1a6223c7f914","224417853c2536e2e9a02f1beb0ac2155a24bb8e4b9bcb45112811525a765a67","639705040e6190bacfc3a72dc66b5ec316f4e7c57b6dae323c7f42ff6d2263bd","2778d2f78f1b80d9f28ff0a902f4dd45de598fce5e9b0ff8efbf7354afca2937","49193f0680870b23ee68f45f6ebde151d353198122730dc52f031120fcb76ddb","20ece7df4fcc561e6207ff53152a190af027fc33b1abcb0ccb58d347a8e43ee4","b9bc6977f1abedcd15b18b762ea84d40304107eba31a1727be490b4c2b061c04","10dddf03bf6a9eb1ac12a281a941a328b81d01279928a7469aa9d025e7c671c2","d91f7f26bf6342647586c7ce2c38f0895d71be2eef20adddd59f3d5267fa0ecb","211bbc476a85db848bd5b09cdc9572cbf04ee41a2638751bbea4c50b5fbfe9f7","0c050a72c03e8c896afb0566ebf23a69a75f9ea82c9a8cf6ec4991968bcffb9e","4d77ec1a9866eb8f55adce89a3212e7e79d1b8b2ac27b65d68da4b06e9a25c09","2af6227200b7c74405234d0735a87058bdf487ebc370c4f6a040c516ecdc1620","639e42c7b2acfa0917288c00a2ba1eb1796f909e790e210420d8dad71e2d891f","1b43373d331ddd6a04598df2c94b98a75ecfd707e35d55b7e75e2e18dc415a8a","5dc4a25513b8c3ee36dedd9bea5275be8af58ce45b84950f7541bbb9a66668c7","a84774b8a435d796a1c015a54b54d29f48cc7ba89e1cc4d77caba0a073508074","b38eecfe58bcee2cce7bc898016c814166283b7daf930f09fa514b48d60315f5","55f79e90c6e923a31e3020d0736291f1466a02d9b8f41ae6556535a0789ee374"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303213.zip::R2-2303213 Miscellaneous corrections on TS 38.300 for NR sidelink.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303213.zip::R2-2303213 Miscellaneous corrections on TS 38.300 for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR Sidelink DRX","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to this CR while the UE is not, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to this CR while the network is not, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If one UE is implemented according to this CR while the other UE is not, there is no inter-operability issue.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RX UE reporting the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile associated with its interested services that sidelink DRX is applied to the serving gNB is missing. ","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"16.9.6.3","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_