{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"START OF CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.22.1.1SL Grant reception and SCI transmission","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink grant is received dynamically on the PDCCH, configured semi-persistently by RRC or autonomously selected by the MAC entity. The MAC entity shall have a sidelink grant on an active SL BWP to determine a set of PSCCH duration(s) in which transmission of SCI occurs and a set of PSSCH duration(s) in which transmission of SL-SCH associated with the SCI occurs. A sidelink grant addressed to SLCS-RNTI with NDI = 1 is considered as a dynamic sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the MAC entity has been configured with Sidelink resource allocation mode 1 as indicated in TS 38.331 [5], the MAC entity shall for each PDCCH occasion and for each grant received for this PDCCH occasion:","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a sidelink grant has been received on the PDCCH for the MAC entity's SL-RNTI:","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the NDI received on the PDCCH has not been toggled compared to the value in the previously received HARQ information for the HARQ Process ID:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the received sidelink grant to determine PSCCH duration(s) and PSSCH duration(s) for one or more retransmissions of a single MAC PDU for the corresponding Sidelink process according to clause 8.1.2 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the received sidelink grant to determine PSCCH duration(s) and PSSCH duration(s) for initial transmission and, if available, retransmission(s) of a single MAC PDU according to clause 8.1.2 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if a sidelink grant has been received on the PDCCH for the MAC entity's SLCS-RNTI:","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if PDCCH contents indicate retransmission(s) for the identified HARQ process ID that has been set for an activated configured sidelink grant identified by sl-ConfigIndexCG:","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the received sidelink grant to determine PSCCH duration(s) and PSSCH duration(s) for one or more retransmissions of a single MAC PDU according to clause 8.1.2 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if PDCCH contents indicate configured grant Type 2 deactivation for a configured sidelink grant:","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger configured sidelink grant confirmation for the configured sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ccf3e542702790e906a6e62672ded541e15cf1844698454a407440a6d9bd3bf9","15c688de34899defee20bf40d5bf07ec6e66c5369a7f00a115b509170ca43ab4","e127f5f36047df71a523d9fc7438651c56df8ee54afb27eb5796b70c202318b0","73e61e81b73c1707d43cde5a184477ca2042f4c4701ef35e50c63924c61e4f29","49069048e641b79dbced68ded3190a3fb952b6c2769342d89bbcfc02dc29b02c","e5a540b784baac4e7e88e4749d98f4312b0928d04870520da544cce2e21619f3","21ea53af5e30e1a51c6a7fe6e9dd847a61d9bcf9c59f9904a4279e085aa137a3","d11228f01d099ef8a23678e33ee8d6112c3b487062935fbef0a8f2520ceba344","408d42fb52d6847a90ce6eaf454357ce6d0a5e4a2e16ff35598e3a848601dbb6","624a8ffe8c34a78ad400e3d3f36639a710f524d4fa450dfab6b8b247bc5da3e1","310d3b6aea17958c9e57c4aa5c018f5c1e73c177acc38149ae98b25f882dbd3e","e6f261b2f0e3649b74bc06ec64f051e16215471b9a3437f93db71def16b42c7e","9b39fbe33033479f5e4fbe7b9f220a2b519700f6f04e9e0181e91844b5fd3afd","bb0bb4f6138f9c90b4728c672b1e4805c164930f32c2c045725418743ce1ec1f","206630e16d01ef409d112bb5a29ddc2c544ed10c54912d0a3c3016111953c856","8a3bf9f31259774ce6c27328ccddb9c9cb20fe219a7dbe0d10f2625696da54c0","b03f1408615cc9224c5083635ac1f8a785f4a48dc2ffb737339bd8b14a7cc752","240775a514ab57ca5231b78de581a900ea34c0cf42dafb613b9244226dc6a5b8","59cd59a9d8b0edd7fa540d4bda394264f9ded1b144e226647acc41f12200de97","08981d1d82549ed206a47f2709914b709a78d25b7a84e3aebb96f866bb8685d5","8e054985049e3a3701523fd5c94991c476fa7c029246e620b8b5344272122164","86c9ede79177ab7c7eb38a7f6bd2a4455b4eebecb923a4f37200aa6a0aead1d1","ce0b97d9fd2a8fa8c1b98dc80b00315c7c61fdba133e9b0f45f69c09c3c5820b","91e84c20fefbd54a16d37feaba43cb5a38c5af5dc5cd2ad1155299aed1663b6b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if PDCCH contents indicate configured grant Type 2 activation for a configured sidelink grant:","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger configured sidelink grant confirmation for the configured sidelink grant;","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the configured sidelink grant;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initialise or re-initialise the configured sidelink grant to determine the set of PSCCH durations and the set of PSSCH durations for transmissions of multiple MAC PDUs according to clause 8.1.2 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a dynamic sidelink grant is available for retransmission(s) of a MAC PDU which has been positively acknowledged as specified in clause 5.22.1.3.1a:","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear the PSCCH duration(s) and PSSCH duration(s) corresponding to retransmission(s) of the MAC PDU from the sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the MAC entity has been configured with Sidelink resource allocation mode 2 to transmit using pool(s) of resources in a carrier as indicated in TS 38.331 [5] or TS 36.331 [21] based on full sensing, or partial sensing, or random selection or any combination(s), the MAC entity shall for each Sidelink process:","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:If the MAC entity is configured with Sidelink resource allocation mode 2 to transmit using a pool of resources in a carrier as indicated in TS 38.331 [5] or TS 36.331 [21], the MAC entity can create a selected sidelink grant on the pool of resources based on random selection, or partial sensing, or full sensing only after releasing configured sidelink grant(s), if any.","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The MAC entity expects that PSFCH is always configured by RRC for at least one pool of resources in sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal and for the resource pool in sl-TxPoolExceptional in case that at least a logical channel configured with sl-HARQ-FeedbackEnabled is set to enabled.","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2A:For the transmission of Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Request MAC CE, the MAC entity selects the TX pool of resource where the IUC resource set is required. For the transmission of Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Information MAC CE, the MAC entity selects the TX pool of resource where the IUC resource set is located.","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the MAC entity has selected to create a selected sidelink grant corresponding to transmissions of multiple MAC PDUs, and SL data is available in a logical channel:","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the MAC entity has not selected a pool of resources allowed for the logical channel:","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SL data is available in the logical channel for NR sidelink discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon is configured according to TS 38.331 [5]:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the sl-DiscTxPoolSelected configured in sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon for the transmission of NR sidelink discovery message.","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select any pool of resources among the configured pools of resources.","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if sl-HARQ-FeedbackEnabled is set to enabled for the logical channel:","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select any pool of resources configured with PSFCH resources among the pools of resources except the pool(s) in sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon, if configured.","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select any pool of resources among the pools of resources except the pool(s) in sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon, if configured.","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the TX resource (re-)selection check on the selected pool of resources as specified in clause 5.22.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The MAC entity continuously performs the TX resource (re-)selection check until the corresponding pool of resources is released by RRC or the MAC entity decides to cancel creating a selected sidelink grant corresponding to transmissions of multiple MAC PDUs.","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the TX resource (re-)selection is triggered as the result of the TX resource (re-)selection check:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["16c8b906358bbb3b005e4b85cb59742bc6b18cdd4ecd420279773a4f68cafe40","4333e506e88716672897f255cc5da0be7c634b035aa480cce83f2444e541ecb1","5e8903e92ab06220a9d5527d88229c9cb54602488bc7efe5adff19e2934a7a46","8c4748cd6f23fba8991ca5ca5e050f865683ee5a0aba8aecc1bb507e3a515bda","26a3c9954cfe320b89aeea4210f1dc2323c3355c3c94f5875111a6a65c6cfc86","6fb50bac46d8a77c6fe6b754f1e5a1df586d19fd192b4be55482e31b43312062","836afcffeb0d3dee1c887b1cd313a2867e823edcb3083e53df93fd5c5d88f72e","fc465872eccf190ef4dfe3d5bec474b8baa79e4bd3ccc2abb186e695cd42f10b","7a5d88bc1a958b58a4dd55f184c3be24889a36512e01be0355248c9e11185aa5","3dc91ebe19ed70d72edd1888315e516d53635dee0bff67ed72c24f4be2325db5","350dfee643d22e663392a63b2eb1c9ab6fa9b7afb9858431f46d169838bd77df","d5b0358ba4021a30870ac5ec1af6ab5ceedd8e0d9c7e1e8b161609fffa6f2c36","431cdc3d88eee3fdca5165ffa5c6377ec6c92bd9ed9ab20b78d5e8ec4d315605","1d578f125acbde44e8ea96f5ccb0ff3f2255fbba933bbf2f5e38c50183ce74b1","c5ff58406cb86b045d2aecccce3ab86ce4c5417c21fdbe83eaa8a1c13da44fed","906721d47341a0761f3da23a8e839b3ade93ff777978904e7922e296cbb51290","ff62a9ee299e0484691bb902b6d9f338da89067609660149facb713aed1df4dd","6cf8adad1d9db54ff185d6e64f70eaacaff156cf302eddc1700fe2f7d7d04042","86f7dc06f53c288abab7bb7c2edaad3872fe51645a3e001c4a0e0480a5df5573","9c4d149e287bee6e5e3ed67c605ee492020cc09f80e2f1a62179d854d41ebfb6","174ba82c75a4143e8a8c3fa1f03815c5d5a0780e56121901e351d7644e0122f2","a5e60b0cad066f8bf79b00e7941767e4b2f1782fa08c8de6ffa7dddd6672ee5b","610ce0e3bbb5f69b754b7a3628eafd3a43b3ed1e07ea8fd79332c59f20c8bd60","89780c26f1189b854f97578546da9cbf468e931d0520e45ab99b5a324f53312c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if one or multiple SL DRX(s) is configured in the destination UE(s) receiving SL-SCH data:","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to the physical layer SL DRX Active time in the destination UE(s) receiving SL-SCH data, as specified in clause 5.28.2.","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select one of the allowed values configured by RRC in sl-ResourceReservePeriodList and set the resource reservation interval, Prsvp_TX, with the selected value;","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3A:The MAC entity selects a value for the resource reservation interval which is larger than the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>randomly select, with equal probability, an integer value in the interval [5, 15] for the resource reservation interval higher than or equal to 100ms or in the interval 5×100max20, Prsvp_TX,15×100max20, Prsvp_TX  for the resource reservation interval lower than 100ms and set SL_RESOURCE_RESELECTION_COUNTER to the selected value;","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the number of HARQ retransmissions from the allowed numbers, if configured by RRC, in sl-MaxTxTransNumPSSCH included in sl-PSSCH-TxConfigList and, if configured by RRC, overlapped in sl-MaxTxTransNumPSSCH indicated in sl-CBR-PriorityTxConfigList for the highest priority of the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier and the CBR measured by lower layers according to clause 5.1.27 of TS 38.215 [24] if CBR measurement results are available or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if CBR measurement results are not available when the sl-TxPoolExceptional is used, or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if full sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-PartialSensing configured by RRC if partial sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available, or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-RandomSelection configured by RRC if random selection is selected and CBR measurement results are not available;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select an amount of frequency resources within the range, if configured by RRC, between sl-MinSubChannelNumPSSCH and sl-MaxSubchannelNumPSSCH included in sl-PSSCH-TxConfigList and, if configured by RRC, overlapped between sl-MinSubChannelNumPSSCH and sl-MaxSubchannelNumPSSCH indicated in sl-CBR-PriorityTxConfigList for the highest priority of the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier and the CBR measured by lower layers according to clause 5.1.27 of TS 38.215 [24] if CBR measurement results are available or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if CBR measurement results are not available when the sl-TxPoolExceptional is used, or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if full sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-PartialSensing configured by RRC if partial sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available, or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-RandomSelection configured by RRC if random selection is selected and CBR measurement results are not available;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is not configured by RRC:","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if transmission based on random selection is configured by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resource pool which occur within the SL DRX Active time if configured as specified in clause 5.28.2 of the destination UE selected for indicating to the physical layer the SL DRX Active time above, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] which occur within the SL DRX Active time if configured as specified in clause 5.28.2 of the destination UE selected for indicating to the physical layer the SL DRX Active time above, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and preferred resource set is not received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if transmission based on random selection is configured by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources pool, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] , according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE does not have its own sensing result as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] and if a preferred resource set is received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources belonging to the received preferred resource set for SL-SCH data to be transmitted to the UE providing the preferred resource set, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE has its own sensing result as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] and if a preferred resource set is received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity within the intersection of the received preferred resource set and the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] for an SL-SCH data to be transmitted to the UE providing the preferred resource set, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if there are no resources within the intersection that can be selected as the time and frequency resources for the one transmission opportunity according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the randomly selected resource to select a set of periodic resources spaced by the resource reservation interval for transmissions of PSCCH and PSSCH corresponding to the number of transmission opportunities of MAC PDUs determined in TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7c29eb3c8e2efa979856c5927494ea2279a4dd1db797cdc8a235b785a3474bde","2028bcbee61c38d3c95c5685af46750c5adab04e41d4b2206499b0f5897e2d34","0acbb4648f2f87c3badd36ce58df2cc10528dfa54533ca147ac338d605a6c99c","c64a21e3003ffa7325d791ea08199478ed89246ac67363acb902fc6fbdf55dcc","0a29ccb159bf7b167f5ebf6764f6032059066c8151a9f080af4c96d53960ef35","2d9e02b40bebbaedf5baffd523cd53f06de62ff25533809917ba3788def0c3a4","009093b4802ff80e92c41823696a78a816ea148c32ce47585c6f643e58146ceb","fbd3b0694b68e59fdeaa4f9ff6168ccddd518b2f6cab2b89d3eb54a1ff2faa24","c1304748cdb691f1b388a2824e28c7de9bc1c81cbb8381946103a1b314db2a11","c5400836896b18880dcce6fecd095473823301dd49f97a1d5f854b2134fb840e","50b2d381ddd923e36601c6907cf34bb65320f4d2f7a1e2609829203d205dccc4","43397d32bb1837ca703fac0d76ad29439b25fa91d7ff1db66f7eaa0eb0de2271","4b0e3a29c773b585a43a93ad1ba377b68b29ce4bc64cde5eee340b93fcf998e8","b2b8a0fe6001317b4ee1ae3a1d3c2c4513a5d2a7ce05f597e3f5d1d58c2dc23f","863feaf7acec44eb2ad1da745287f44b3004fe739c79c80b552959f6d8be9ae8","07b987787169660a39e04887e8a318cb48c628c0bc2884c8517344e052123772","9ca25ec71343ec1c05360c2a83f58a95ab506ada0743bc058e20fe34c7394ecd","f9c419b0265b7e9405bba61af0c16307960644183b99720111bab83ef061406a","734b64f07ac4c938692330aaaca8529057b4b3848c6480594d9b73af5a5f4e9b","9272d0c9ac3a64cd8ec1e138fd5812e3b94ad571fc12d24e0cf93cb9ffad63a7","67cdf5c59049f949a39bc6864c533582cf9cdef3a4e7c85ac78ce00c4b4d6dce","d1a7d61371a9d89c3a567e56455f47f39db7baa8dff523bb9870922da8e0458b","3a25d467a2ba1e73b3a2651c1afc7e44822eb932d15204148ec92d99b9dcac4d","0aeaa31655c385942398a86d2aa95f1756f37d927f5150f5f96328f0639e8dca"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,191],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p168"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if one or more HARQ retransmissions are selected:","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is not configured by RRC:","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if transmission based on full sensing or partial sensing is configured by upper layers and there are available resources left in the resources indicated by the physical layer according to clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] for more transmission opportunities; or","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if transmission based on random selection is configured by upper layers and there are available resources left in the resource pool for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources which occur within the SL DRX Active time if configured as specified in clause 5.28.2 of the destination UE selected for indicating to the physical layer the SL DRX Active time above, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and preferred resource set is not received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if transmission based on full sensing or partial sensing is configured by upper layers and there are available resources left in the resources indicated by the physical layer according to clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] for more transmission opportunities; or","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if transmission based on random selection is configured by upper layers and there are available resources left in the resource pool for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE has own sensing result as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] and if a preferred resource set is received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if there are available resources left in the intersection of the received preferred resource set and the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources within the intersection for SL-SCH data to be transmitted to the UE providing the preferred resource set, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the number of time and frequency resources that has been maximally selected for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources within the intersection is smaller than the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and there are available resources left in the resources indicated by the physical layer for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>randomly select the time and frequency resources for the remaining transmission opportunities except for the selected resources within the intersection from the available resources outside the intersection but left in the resources indicated by the physical layer according to clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE does not have own sensing result as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] and if a preferred resource set is received from a UE; and","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if there are available resources left in the received preferred resource set for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources belonging to the received preferred resource set for SL-SCH data to be transmitted to the UE providing the preferred resource set, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>use the randomly selected resource to select a set of periodic resources spaced by the resource reservation interval for transmissions of PSCCH and PSSCH corresponding to the number of retransmission opportunities of the MAC PDUs determined in TS 38.214 [7];","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the first set of transmission opportunities as the initial transmission opportunities and the other set(s) of transmission opportunities as the retransmission opportunities;","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the sets of initial transmission opportunities and retransmission opportunities as the selected sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the set as the selected sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the selected sidelink grant to determine the set of PSCCH durations and the set of PSSCH durations according to TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if SL_RESOURCE_RESELECTION_COUNTER = 0 and when SL_RESOURCE_RESELECTION_COUNTER was equal to 1 the MAC entity randomly selected, with equal probability, a value in the interval [0, 1] which is less than or equal to the probability configured by RRC in sl-ProbResourceKeep:","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a3d589c87004bed0b14941e96017144521755fddb13c8b9ae2a7d20ffacd3007","99480632477c04625718c6f92e0f959870b4550753631d35e55c77be58a6c2e5","8b3380e5e7e3eaff530466d937a6e5a26fbfad119e6f1b96e9d464cdd0e709dc","62e83816b87d1f9f5ff4ef5f8bf52df6e83bd85df74832049dc15bba43127621","d1078cf156ba33ba1bca54920589dc27c02a96dba80e38a312d528f9d6dda18d","fc8b9fc573dc24f7a604961435ed5ae78ea2275adf3b5db93faa909242620801","a377b6b655b42db39529735cd9395fc502f2a4678b9eb9f38a3eed83d7f7aaec","7f424a155f51dbc6e82e10e603406eac8d7f44ac748005965fb102d00da34fa1","91ad5937a456922f9c1fc12b96b0136a8ed1bd39829ecd0d2fd2f8c2666d5155","cde2ae93c992d167384ab2add80472035f334d1ff48574de78a83b9282812625","b11c8a26c64091540c3a3e8b225c6e3a745eda7fb145e1d00976fea98d9d751f","585a6b32bbeb642403e1048fb8822d7ddb255cf3aa39ea3797c46cecf16c007b","38a00a62800085abcefd80dfe0b3b28051399b778a0317e854c4968e2031aabd","2cda5b0df4e48885bd0775f2870fac8a7926a782697e3b6d829bea167a23e3d1","f6be96e0d1f9524ca1ee5e6f6363097f50e2e15573e344620476011149e6e917","079ce05d387578f3ede40fd56cfdf8ec2c85dd84df0f0b12df749942898ad46c","229747255818bb4e0d7d1d1a5cb96df91c344ea1b3c8623a161f95e8d8d28b1a","d7419f3d99711f36a5a0f05363a8d47ff5461abfcce7556df247d8f497a4f3d3","6f68e285b5a66a2e0172b4db05ecfa0b2dfe2024771afa8192dc0ff780fda826","2893fcf269f7a25dc190a498f4ced27524e1e21d94f14aba9af7986788d486a5","ff5198141c5aa46eec99f9a51f580afe1066081b854a4a835abb2419011deaf9","065f659d35aabd60a939f0014f5d6af5b3691513a6c418aafdcc985a6b31e846","00aec782464962bc4b0024050faa645ba165fc19d21c16e3a41a72a0b31f0918","a7eb193a68bc781d35f24aff3aa5e5927cabeb63535eb8bb2a12f2035bf02eec"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear the selected sidelink grant, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>randomly select, with equal probability, an integer value in the interval [5, 15] for the resource reservation interval higher than or equal to 100ms or in the interval 5×100max20, Prsvp_TX,15×100max20, Prsvp_TX  for the resource reservation interval lower than 100ms and set SL_RESOURCE_RESELECTION_COUNTER to the selected value;","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reuse the previously selected sidelink grant for the number of transmissions of the MAC PDUs determined in TS 38.214 [7] with the resource reservation interval to determine the set of PSCCH durations and the set of PSSCH durations according to TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the MAC entity has selected to create a selected sidelink grant corresponding to transmission(s) of a single MAC PDU, and if SL data is available in a logical channel, or an SL-CSI reporting is triggered, or a Sidelink DRX Command indication is triggered or a Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Information reporting is triggered, or a Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Request is triggered:","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SL data is available in the logical channel for NR sidelink discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon is configured according to TS 38.331 [5]:","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select the sl-DiscTxPoolSelected configured in sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon for the transmission of NR sidelink discovery message.","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select any pool of resources among the configured pools of resources.","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if SL data for NR sidelink communication is available in the logical channel:","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-HARQ-FeedbackEnabled is set to enabled for the logical channel:","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select any pool of resources configured with PSFCH resources among the pools of resources except the pool(s) in sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon, if configured.","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select any pool of resources among the pools of resources except the pool(s) in sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon, if configured.","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if an SL-CSI reporting or a Sidelink DRX Command or a Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Request or a Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Information is triggered:","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select any pool of resources among the pools of resources except the pool(s) in sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfig or sl-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon, if configured.","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the TX resource (re-)selection check on the selected pool of resources as specified in clause 5.22.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the TX resource (re-)selection is triggered as the result of the TX resource (re-)selection check:","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if one or multiple SL DRX(s) is configured in the destination UE(s) receiving SL-SCH data:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to the physical layer SL DRX Active time in the destination UE(s) receiving SL-SCH data, as specified in clause 5.28.2.","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select the number of HARQ retransmissions from the allowed numbers, if configured by RRC, in sl-MaxTxTransNumPSSCH included in sl-PSSCH-TxConfigList and, if configured by RRC, overlapped in sl-MaxTxTransNumPSSCH indicated in sl-CBR-PriorityTxConfigList for the highest priority of the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier and the CBR measured by lower layers according to clause 5.1.27 of TS 38.215 [24] if CBR measurement results are available or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if CBR measurement results are not available when the sl-TxPoolExceptional is used, or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if full sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-PartialSensing configured by RRC if partial sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available, or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-RandomSelection configured by RRC if random selection is selected and CBR measurement results are not available;","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select an amount of frequency resources within the range, if configured by RRC, between sl-MinSubChannelNumPSSCH and sl-MaxSubChannelNumPSSCH included in sl-PSSCH-TxConfigList and, if configured by RRC, overlapped between sl-MinSubChannelNumPSSCH and sl-MaxSubChannelNumPSSCH indicated in sl-CBR-PriorityTxConfigList for the highest priority of the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier and the CBR measured by lower layers according to clause 5.1.27 of TS 38.215 [24] if CBR measurement results are available or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if CBR measurement results are not available when the sl-TxPoolExceptional is used, or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if full sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-PartialSensing configured by RRC if partial sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available, or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-RandomSelection configured by RRC if random selection is selected and CBR measurement results are not available;","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is not configured by RRC:","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if transmission based on random selection is configured by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["30c81020921a3754890002664edbd513cc996cd7908f32382895523200ec166d","241916583c53e16e85c1df609490d9e9cc5fd0f7314d051fc701c9c94f12d989","d838dded9345df8abc4a0083cf992c74ad2e543a303040881d1b2c11fccfc555","aedeb3b6c05fe4759cda304bf7ab5575706e1c737a6f85d22b134cc776246749","05008f90242cd6cdfa430ea8af2096b8dad9aaafe706b570bfa90c7158725c97","b7d14dbfa980f10bcf8c2c3364c60026dd119d77c344cd471fc8abdad8538cc8","b585c9752586fe8411bcc233b238a1bc54bbf4ea9aa3827da17dfbebbaf8a07b","d9494ebe5ac8b80fbc841509072f4fc0f4bb98a30d39959597ee47bd867a05ff","60923eb2954de733ab0808ff31df768f93658d4e58519f4e8ea03561f1d0486a","f85dae369fc39ffc0e7f4abe4a56626ac589698aa0455ca5368ba6055fd9bd37","049e07a2e763cef5eccf2fc36e056f59c252fbae8df0bfe337443fedb1c00adf","fb8d35ffcc20580855f4346205ba5067c21f3abd4f2cfa659722410fa73bad28","c553b884c7e6af1df204bd22bb094817d1845c4de1b57c1aa8086ca8292e0e48","24fbb53fdf164e17ff41993ad5b8ce3c9164cc4cf57d6dd97b56337c2b043cb9","47e1e1a873708ee3b07ca7e2a009ac1b7d805395895e38a6eb890abb49d8ded5","c6388c7a124afad8b838782ef50754da24d49a84c534f4a525e5021343d94a96","9311fe90919647e9e303bed55e6dbf3743ee5bbc39ca86bd1100a3db3a0cd635","b249ee320c75294a6725ee5c2ce76928247d9669148d182be77b68783b1c5977","ce7e6adb71b11bc61b923b0d2fc8a6f6d6ca39d7247bc2068fc4ee27e0f873f5","ada45f4b13c2d43cbd3779d5c6394d95ee676bc4d8ff82fdf47238a09d898571","45e3c311406b64415d52d4fe4ac9b7904d9ba7ab6cffefdfd251fe68b1f70a02","6c0745d2869e4d6eb7c097443b8cab5a99786cfda9c240802206c2c24c43ccfe","55c64fd9709b630b611075cae43d348c24b0dea1d974473e357917c7a94c8452","4bd5966ee9c7b380cc8366895726ad1b304b66d359cc44bcdfc288f91339b84e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p216"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources pool which occur within the SL DRX Active time if configured as specified in clause 5.28.2 of the destination UE selected for indicating to the physical layer the SL DRX Active time above, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and the latency requirement of the triggered SL CSI reporting.","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] which occur within the SL DRX Active if configured time as specified in clause 5.28.2 of the destination UE selected for indicating to the physical layer the SL DRX Active time above, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL-CSI reporting.","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and preferred resource set is not received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if transmission based on random selection is configured by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources pool, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL CSI reporting.","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL CSI reporting.","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE does not have own sensing result as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] and if a preferred resource set is received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources belonging to the received preferred resource set for a MAC PDU to be transmitted to the UE providing the preferred resource set, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL CSI reporting.","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE has own sensing result as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] and if a preferred resource set is received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity within the intersection of the received preferred resource set and the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] for a MAC PDU to be transmitted to the UE providing the preferred resource set, according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL CSI reporting;","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if there are no resources within the intersection that can be selected as the time and frequency resources for the one transmission opportunity according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], according to the amount of selected frequency resources and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL CSI reporting.","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE determines the resources for Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Information transmission upon explicit request from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL-CSI and the latency requirement of the Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Information transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if one or more HARQ retransmissions are selected:","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is not configured by RRC:","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if transmission based on full sensing or partial sensing is configured by upper layers and there are available resources left in the resources indicated by the physical layer according to clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] for more transmission opportunities; or","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if transmission based on random selection is configured by upper layers and there are available resources left in the resources pool for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources which occur within the SL DRX Active time if configured as specified in clause 5.28.2 of the destination UE selected for indicating to the physical layer the SL DRX Active time above, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL-CSI by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources, and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9];","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and preferred resource set is not received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if transmission based on sensing is configured by upper layers and there are available resources left in the resources indicated by the physical layer according to clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] for more transmission opportunities; or","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if transmission based on random selection is configured by upper layers and there are available resources left in the resource pool for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4788b28c7de565f16ac5749dcaba628e60e010ea5c85f06e8108ff15c9ea2c93","2c3d9ca728344618e7a0716f7f0444e5580782ef079374c8abeb5c8d0a8a8a35","b0520713a7b1d0d11507634bab03b9bbf55efb1e4444841ab7b348401c7a3e03","207bab35253647884e129fb9ba508be4e55d18aa4846e010b6628afc1608f301","8e85cfa2fdc96c20308efbb710ff9053457568903581ae97032d7c65e947576e","188e7d94412b48153881b986fd8460dc3e8c8fbae70a55efd1a25a1437659cb3","94b8bc425ecea627f7d817b3aa876402017124f62847b1c52c6baa48ccf3410c","2268c719955f8dd42e8124d9f8f0bc2dac4d2b81cdb2d6ce901c4ec7f01d9ba8","0ed90b8b9efd76d3f3f885ab02c9e53c53614096dde063e18b41d308472ad536","dbdc4b3dedad7e8de76233f167f2b5b9f3e6640657f7e1031bea3fd221103998","f4f071bbf6893beb2164c649d4ccdedcc5c98708a0fc9fb18fc24459a81b1291","25ebcd67bffdae5a48333b56dd2e21f7a39694d1ebbb96fcb9383ec2690d77a2","1c51e34cf6b189961c9815cf7ba2a694f65b278c5bb17d5e982170c54ed4384f","c047d1f3c38957e264a560c280e6a3889e5fb3c79b08c697e414e44f5186c6ee","851fea8a870529a0124e108910cab45fbb1ece26dbcefd98806a5cdcf2a2ba8f","ca4496887ecdf1b05c6ba952a5976140a0d13ff0695bd21e3a10e57009e8a1ec","26fb4708a772a1f9d553bf14012e6c8d5aac397325c95b658898b9a93fdd5dc5","50eefdbcdf2229b9e5862e2d03db46f24147e7db5f9bbdece234a5e087263899","e11f15cca7367f22b0ecdb37654c0e2e8668f95cd6781490ad9cda387f28f554","59afdd6e8a0409d611de51ea2c48d7d594fda074cdbf0f815008fe754ce92cca","a25a4f909eb1d09275bfe938984581dda61d83767a53ffce24e41fad07b874d8","22eabb2ef63e9e78abdc561b170b23c5eaecd1aa64df42708e6e69309a4d922d","dac106b466f048caf4e3fda8382fcacc6238c6a5375b5d6604e66258346a9219","f0c03cf540cd6720bd5b3ba2f7c6864ed2b3e217b405315c33434747e11844df"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[240,263],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p240"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL-CSI by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE has own sensing result as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] and if a preferred resource set is received from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if there are available resources left in the intersection of the received preferred resource set and the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources within the intersection for a MAC PDU to be transmitted to the UE providing the preferred resource set, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL-CSI by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the number of time and frequency resources that has been maximally selected for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources within the intersection is smaller than the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and there are available resources left in the resources indicated by the physical layer for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>randomly select the time and frequency resources for the remaining transmission opportunities except for the selected resources within the intersection from the available resources outside the intersection but left in the resources indicated by the physical layer according to clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL-CSI by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE does not have own sensing result as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] and if a preferred resource set is received from a UE; and","paragraph_zero_based":270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if there are available resources left in the received preferred resource set for more transmission opportunities:","paragraph_zero_based":271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources belonging to the received preferred resource set for a MAC PDU to be transmitted to the UE providing the preferred resource set, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL-CSI by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources and that a retransmission resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and when the UE determines the resources for Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Information transmission upon explicit request from a UE:","paragraph_zero_based":273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>randomly select the time and frequency resources for one transmission opportunity from the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the remaining PDB of SL data available in the logical channel(s) allowed on the carrier, and/or the latency requirement of the triggered SL-CSI and the latency requirement of the Sidelink Inter-UE Coordination Information transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider a transmission opportunity which comes first in time as the initial transmission opportunity and other transmission opportunities as the retransmission opportunities;","paragraph_zero_based":275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider all the transmission opportunities as the selected sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the set as the selected sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the selected sidelink grant to determine PSCCH duration(s) and PSSCH duration(s) according to TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3A1:If sl-InterUE-CoordinationScheme1 enabling reception/transmission of preferred resource set and non-preferred resource set is configured by RRC and if multiple preferred resource sets are received from the same UE, it is up to UE implementation to use one or multiple of them in its resource (re)selection.","paragraph_zero_based":280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3B1:If retransmission resource(s) cannot be selected by ensuring that the resource(s) can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI, how to select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources is left for UE implementation by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected ‎resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of ‎resources.","paragraph_zero_based":281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3B2:When the UE receives both a single preferred resource set and a single non-preferred resource set from the same peer UE or different peer UEs, when the UE has own sensing results, it is up to the UE implementation to use the preferred resource set in its resource (re)selection for transmissions to the peer UE providing the preferred resource set.","paragraph_zero_based":282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3B3:The UE is not required to use any resource from the preferred resource set in its resource (re-)selection if that resource is earlier than (Tproc,0SL+Tproc,1SL+Tproc,2SL) after the resource of Inter-UE Coordination Information transmission, where Tproc,2SL is equal to (Tproc,0SL+Tproc,1SL) when only MAC CE is used for inter-UE Coordination Information transmission, or Tproc,2SL is equal to Tproc,0SL when MAC CE and SCI format 2-C are both used for Inter-UE Coordination Information transmission. The case when Tproc,2SL is equal to Tproc,0SL is assuming that SCI format 2-C is received.  Tproc,0SL and Tproc,1SL are specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3B4:For Inter-UE Coordination Information triggered by an explicit Inter-UE Coordination Request in Scheme 1, whether or not to transmit the Inter-UE Coordination Information upon the Inter-UE Coordination Request reception is determined by UE-A's implementation subject to Release-16 procedure of UL/SL prioritization, LTE SL/NR SL prioritization, and congestion control.","paragraph_zero_based":284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3B5:If configured by RRC, sl-IUC-Explicit set to enabled and an SL-IUC request is received for the Source Layer-2 ID and Destination Layer-2 ID pair of a unicast, MAC layer indicates to physical layer the resource selection window, resource set type (i.e., preferred resource set), L1 priority, the number of sub-channels to be used for the PSSCH/PSCCH transmission and the resource reservation period for preferred resource set. If configured by RRC, sl-IUC-Explicit set to enabled and an SL-IUC request is received for the Source Layer-2 ID and Destination Layer-2 ID pair of a unicast, MAC layer indicates to physical layer resource set type (i.e., non-preferred resource set) and the resource selection window for non-preferred resource set.","paragraph_zero_based":285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3B6:If either sl-IUC-Explicit or sl-IUC-Condition is configured as enabled, UE considers the reception of preferred and non-preferred resource is enabled.","paragraph_zero_based":286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3B7:When sl-TriggerConditionCoordInfo is set to value 0, for groupcast or broadcast of Inter-UE Coordination Information triggered by a condition in Scheme 1, which Destination Layer-2 ID (and the corresponding cast-type) a UE selects among Destination Layer-2 IDs that are already used or interested in NR sidelink transmission is up to the UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ab224389f3d3b231f315bb36c2f75a038360d21a7f9977d747e94313d7f3dbf6","75e3285568c66820daf06d33db814e7802b193145b1a8450467c3fe4c0907453","9ed11ed9f05a4ffd4826e3acce8d5815e00291e448c396a75e102066c6e59d51","b8dfad101bb1d9c97ebbd2d9b89c711bf6a69d84d5936c8349878b90d3dbecbb","242643e0ba69a730347408e7c5efc0bdc4a5d17f90cf55ccb879fb7c01b1e41a","e6dbf132878086594b416912a064e0cb201927ff80bf85c190635be9972b38d1","22097e09bded3cc5385f49e349cfb5d45c1949832f83c74317ddca1fb069106f","a46b1210d016b67301abcb04ff2ffd61804653275212e50f32525a64c90c7f1b","bb3695b62fa69168b9d331b81c2df5c7aaf07945616a93c5b61995a053b7b3d8","a7e3d07eebaa591ae22683833dcbc8d24b23195d2d42e00df590f9bfb38c2e8f","9f7f6b1161259bc1ee139c339eeb3e3486af9e97dd00d90456136f1fb91ae4f1","62128cf5310055517ae649bc49475c77eb360dd476838a25c49b4ce38142e022","ee918db51ad32358bfc7e81c78d70faf321fe581990bd7cf67e7154ac5a56b7a","cb404a4fd83ffe0f707aae5991bf3db51b5d36cda5e2f65544a235a064d1cc02","024e8cc80a381d7e1dd4f4f82fa12a2aa62ab814da408844572ec318d777da06","d4926c5a8ed64dc2eed98f80d694a9b33397604fef8caa363864563340809635","1d33e6d8edfcc2710ed0932e8f53daacab81283630d8c5e1bb56004ba91b51e8","991563880ee6f8b4b7555247ae80afe7ada77628f8fda668be17701ec52cc9ba","81b65928273fb7bde70ebc072c57ef06ac255ac670b09f2d621dd4c3fff34926","36ea7778e3a88d64517432b642c5485a9ab06ff1c9eab2b26d72ad077ec159c0","20960e6657f6b96d95747a8f1a9631b89dc6165847b25e88ff7ab0ecc664daab","4f4d26dea2dd8b54a16fcacd6951a9bb1a4a045cf3c4ae49861fa53b1a00fbd5","c0c1f2919439cceea6227206f147eef348ed0642b5da36e5f724a7fbac750eb0","f539ac694ac9c51a05016bb557c0c6ccedfbbf766f65df7ff94fed63cdcdcd64"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[264,287],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p264"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a selected sidelink grant is available for retransmission(s) of a MAC PDU which has been positively acknowledged as specified in clause 5.22.1.3.3:","paragraph_zero_based":288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear the PSCCH duration(s) and PSSCH duration(s) corresponding to retransmission(s) of the MAC PDU from the selected sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3C:How the MAC entity determines the remaining PDB of SL data is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For a selected sidelink grant, the minimum time gap between any two selected resources comprises:","paragraph_zero_based":291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-a time gap between the end of the last symbol of a PSSCH transmission of the first resource and the start of the first symbol of the corresponding PSFCH reception determined by sl-MinTimeGapPSFCH and sl-PSFCH-Period for the pool of resources; and","paragraph_zero_based":292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-a time required for PSFCH reception and processing plus sidelink retransmission preparation including multiplexing of necessary physical channels and any TX-RX/RX-TX switching time.","paragraph_zero_based":293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:How to determine the time required for PSFCH reception and processing plus sidelink retransmission preparation is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity shall for each PSSCH duration:","paragraph_zero_based":295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sidelink grant occurring in this PSSCH duration:","paragraph_zero_based":296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select a MCS table allowed in the pool of resource which is associated with the sidelink grant;","paragraph_zero_based":297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4a:MCS table selection is up to UE implementation if more than one MCS table is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the MAC entity has been configured with Sidelink resource allocation mode 1:","paragraph_zero_based":299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select a MCS which is, if configured, within the range that is configured by RRC between sl-MinMCS-PSSCH and sl-MaxMCS-PSSCH associated with the selected MCS table included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR;","paragraph_zero_based":300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the resource reservation interval to 0ms.","paragraph_zero_based":301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>select a MCS which is, if configured, within the range, if configured by RRC, between sl-MinMCS-PSSCH and sl-MaxMCS-PSSCH associated with the selected MCS table included in sl-PSSCH-TxConfigList and, if configured by RRC, overlapped between sl-MinMCS-PSSCH and sl-MaxMCS-PSSCH associated with the selected MCS table indicated in sl-CBR-PriorityTxConfigList for the highest priority of the sidelink logical channel(s) in the MAC PDU and the CBR measured by lower layers according to clause 5.1.27 of TS 38.215 [24] if CBR measurement results are available or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if CBR measurement results are not available when the sl-TxPoolExceptional is used, or the corresponding sl-defaultTxConfigIndex configured by RRC if full sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-PartialSensing configured by RRC if partial sensing is selected and CBR measurement results are not available, or the corresponding sl-DefaultCBR-RandomSelection configured by RRC if random selection is selected and CBR measurement results are not available;","paragraph_zero_based":303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the MAC entity decides not to use the selected sidelink grant for the next PSSCH duration corresponding to an initial transmission opportunity:","paragraph_zero_based":304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the resource reservation interval to 0ms.","paragraph_zero_based":305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the resource reservation interval to the selected value.","paragraph_zero_based":307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 5:MCS selection is up to UE implementation if the MCS or the corresponding range is not configured by RRC.","paragraph_zero_based":308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configured sidelink grant has been activated and this PSSCH duration corresponds to the first PSSCH transmission opportunity within this sl-PeriodCG of the configured sidelink grant:","paragraph_zero_based":309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the HARQ Process ID to the HARQ Process ID associated with this PSSCH duration and, if available, all subsequent PSSCH duration(s) occuring in this sl-PeriodCG for the configured sidelink grant;","paragraph_zero_based":310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>determine that this PSSCH duration is used for initial transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["13b55f400668f7b7d291abaebb6b0fb72b4ae0ffa74f5c58808cda432c433475","b62fa93c746910b4fb5b81308c8dce1e02c0e35e2ed748cb09c5efdb89133f00","4a402f85397cfa5c0a0ce14f62c835e0074d2fcc2e13f6eb5b05d87960d6f808","44dab6ba3b5d84bc81650480c6303741741b75c78e567bcfe8345531d1e52458","36445d169b09ced71641d5914c8547f746e7e95a90aba849d4e4e84669b2c38a","e917645bfc7668acce538c5b5c298d650c8e8e3212b772d577aacdddc021540e","de697d4cc7e049277909d1824584f4ad384bd8faa6876cff7a8d86a5654e6116","c43e37e2b343edd3abca07cf9a1adde13b9db13ecfb80d339626956b80212cc7","2ffcb0f8ac18bfbb80bba59937269afe7fc9c71d341dbfdb3bab15180ce7deaa","b41ea4d67aa7990e81c1f932d6ebfed2a2f10381a0909ad515ce6c309626a2f6","1bd861acca1ab96bbfc49634bf85549c286ae254d0dd4acbf13da58caeb33e3f","275a6604dc182a28f582addc4b771c2231d1d7250b792402f3c9386230e26b33","3ca60521f58d6507b17664fd79e2c20728240ede03105d7f4c56cae1c5fde953","7538b2ec04cbed9726bdb9c5b2d157787460611dd6b690c1c1af7069701e181c","444d2973abea495a58d02880a0143286285ff6a1a970fe88d416bcef646bf6bf","df0f57308afe75d0deec101a27913f55bd09005c937ea22a58fb28e54656e192","8a558a235cfc72554dd83ad5a16993da73a69060705d4bc8453e8746b6ac5bfe","4164a3edffb87517e33e0fed13b50831fc70bbbd2505fd759e8864aedc428166","6151c6541249eefd92b5d89acd35d1a5d442bc99bfc6ce2a72d665f9c0229ce3","c9fc6c6cb787e81343b875132cb37da0947b65478e50a414f23022ef4f37c5b1","ec39aebaaff2f07fff7cc32afa2c76a5a8bc8634c60aae104fcc55a2e3e87715","2a11540408d953ba30d5c35cd37fb303afa589bbef872e68cef4d4bdfa1c639d","41f92ff5c92fffd31c0ca7172d0719a82e4ffc6b557a83240c9f5a7341293d60","4884595ac271a84d6828c1bf4334bb5b0adfcbf374ebaf12867c4aebb87ea33a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[288,311],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p288"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>flush the HARQ buffer of Sidelink process associated with the HARQ Process ID.","paragraph_zero_based":312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>deliver the sidelink grant, the selected MCS, and the associated HARQ information to the Sidelink HARQ Entity for this PSSCH duration.","paragraph_zero_based":313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For configured sidelink grants, the HARQ Process ID associated with the first slot of an SL transmission is derived from the following equation:","paragraph_zero_based":314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HARQ Process ID = [floor(CURRENT_slot / PeriodicitySL)] modulo sl-NrOfHARQ-Processes+ sl-HARQ-ProcID-offset","paragraph_zero_based":315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"where CURRENT_slot refers to current logical slot in the associated resource pool, and PeriodicitySL is defined in clause 5.8.3.","paragraph_zero_based":316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":317}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"7415921573891a3b422a70566bf834f34997fbf688c6bbe9a6822a18366f7dc6","original_member_sha256":"fb9a2ae736bd47dbee922f41b02070f91d504cf37a31fe0a2639ea321127534f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9b172ffa9f0761ab73eef24facbfecb22fd1d5a17a814707aeaf86f0d9f5be29","b78ea93e11726e0ba83fbbb97431db34743a8d8744ef39a36eb05900c387ebde","3f0b1c4cb341314ec00621ddaf2ba4843993b9e6cb05e55696a86893d86eb0f9","d563e8786c1f1cb74d5459491361b90f9d4a4d6a64e6019a97c51cc2b49af0e0","efeae02c960e519b636645fe1df889fef57adff706bdfe390b8cd8857f7499b0","62810730d5684a2adf660723b02f04c7b9b94ffac86899fa701b46c41c5e3e78"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[312,317],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303215.zip::R2-2303215 Correction on the usage of default CBR values for NR sidelink.docx:p312"}
