:R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. Since IUC procedure of RAN1 agreement (i.e., IUC scheme 1’s agreements) below is missing in section 5.22.1.2a (Re-evaluation and Pre-emption) and Section 5.22.1.2b (Re-selection for using a received resource conflict indication), the related texts should be specified in the section 5.22.1.2a and 5.22.1.2b.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Agreement made in RAN1#106-e meeting:","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In scheme 1, at least following UE-B’s behavior in its resource (re-)selection is supported when it receives inter-UE coordination information from UE-A:","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For preferred resource set, the following two options are supported:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Option A): UE-B’s resource(s) to be used for its transmission resource (re-)selection is based on both UE-B’s sensing result (if available) and the received coordination information","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE-B uses in its resource (re-)selection, resource(s) belonging to the preferred resource set in combination with its own sensing result","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE-B uses in its resource (re-)selection, resource(s) not belonging to the preferred resource set when condition(s) are met","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Details of condition(s)","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This option is supported when UE-B performs sensing/resource exclusion","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Other details (if any) ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Option B): UE-B’s resource(s) to be used for its transmission resource (re-)selection is based only on the received coordination information","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cc31593bb5d5d4391b2feff2bd0790b51c81b8e7994d08c06672777eb65fca23","original_member_sha256":"4579b065171040f3b7129b625b1bb7fec17c0dd544e3c3b2ded19bc9d1fc6d35","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9b99422c25bfe4b00a42f0c9ddd7acc6438bf40f67a38b77f84e8e37dbf722c4","cad5c99f5372b481599d62aaefb5ebf68093b73c7b3410b59e3aec4d20b4de33","787e7eba30461bd86064345500fbf1f5dd8bd33a7dd1f974725d2105b49734f4","b02ec7ed4b4264ce9f3878446fb02872be81afd100c2bfa26c84ef2bd0ee0aec","8c24bb48840868adb6df8734642d073f50459847e608b94ca57eea005f576af2","ee42ede3672e6f287796a3025cc7af48bd4d6fc5aae143e44b90d94652be2fee","f39a6ed77ecaabf42c0ea14c093cb112d7ac87a584f831414cc5f16be7507299","bb993a368481cc9b1e15a92a8e74e2380b250579b194aed995f829bf24702c5e","66cd6bcf97676a551e87cc8faf0c136479ded1e27a5b0a4754d3af7dcb2b5cbd","42fb903497de481a829171abe6273a1ecab3b3d226bcfb184eaee3440e182b6f","388a1c01ac6916aced71d1b749d5e9ac75a351727aa6096f9877ffbe21aeac53","99ba7538add4375c7321381dc8ec7dcc9f1550fae4971cfafc6aac717101b4c1","0f709226d9af15c8fb54d7ea4864ab8d0e342746325111d6aa61a0da69d72d93","e337dc1bb79fac5ff8b002dd4b3c6b2a13775e981b2966fdd15186a4dbb4da8f","9bd456616241d611877ab3f0952da56a3b01f541c0a0ae053bbdd119743a98df","0dd1461c90b5dd5724a96c556968d101f5d920b5c84c979e9fbf830d0894bf9a","1eaa60a1b5d6120c3864f10ae529140ef98d3c03db807201f01f566ff71547be","1f9a851570a6b4ae3e3e4501d9cc5dfffedc51f7673cd290f205f69583aa2a5a","b90395a033ad7fed42d7950c97a8bb20ff83691c9c4a5047a307c6c1cb18fc50","5d42ffee19adae85071701a321c4114ab070a07c0fcf78819a167d62ed1ea87e","1c36965d38d76f6c684656ccde1a00374901c854d8cdc4ca2cea3d41fda4f471","f9144f81dee0a2af96c92944a56e94f6526ea254afb0e35b4b4d384f863a1bad","8213d6ee72a4185710c7f27dd1e6970401617d8c97df76ef30bc74fe54918ab0","10bae0aabd74ea095d0de9eb4a3161ee3bec924ecf048d9626c803c0b4284e73"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE-B uses in its resource (re-)selection, resource(s) belonging to the preferred resource set","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This option is supported at least when UE-B does not support sensing/resource exclusion","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Whether the support is conditional or UE capability","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Other details (if any)","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Other option(s), and other details (if any)","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For non-preferred resource set, ","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE-B’s resource(s) to be used for its transmission resource (re-)selection is based on both UE-B’s sensing result (if available) and the received coordination information ","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE-B excludes in its resource (re-)selection, resource(s) overlapping with the non-preferred resource set","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Details including","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Whether/how UE-B can use in its resource (re-)selection, resource(s) overlapping with the non-preferred resource set, definition of the overlap, and other details (if any)","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When UE-B excludes in its resource (re-)selection, resource(s) overlapping with the non-preferred resource set","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: UE-B reselects in its resource (re-)selection, resource(s) to be used for its transmission when the resource(s) are fully/partially overlapping with the non-preferred resource set","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FFS: Other option(s), and other details (if any)","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. Add a normative text for IUC procedure (i.e., “IUC scheme 1’s agreements) in section 5.22.1.2a (Re-evaluation and Pre-emption) and Section 5.22.1.2b (Re-selection for using a received resource conflict indication).","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options:","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR SA, NR-DC, NE-DC, (NG)EN-DC","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink ","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. For change 1, if one UE implements the changes but not the other UE, there is no inter-operability issue since they are just corrections/clarifications. ","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cc31593bb5d5d4391b2feff2bd0790b51c81b8e7994d08c06672777eb65fca23","original_member_sha256":"4579b065171040f3b7129b625b1bb7fec17c0dd544e3c3b2ded19bc9d1fc6d35","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bea3fc706d31f04f7beacca92306285261fccbf04bb1b208fb0d7f52f368b9f8","c279811ed8cfe9f729a23f631658608bf014df242372c29cf9959a45b32378b2","ee64cf080be2bc7c480c3a9859db69600c602d32121e77d87f300b392cdc8c4f","8835ee081fdc3871bb2ad41c69deac690357f402fe375398a248a71865a272d8","637fe7a19b