ng tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS/TR ... CR ... ","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(show related CRs)","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"X","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" O&M Specifications","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS/TR ... CR ... ","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other comments:","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"START OF CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.22.1.2aRe-evaluation and Pre-emption","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A resource(s) of the selected sidelink grant for a MAC PDU to transmit from multiplexing and assembly entity is re-evaluated by physical layer at T3 before the slot where the SCI indicating the resource(s) is signalled at first time as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A resource(s) of the selected sidelink grant which has been indicated by a prior SCI for a MAC PDU to transmit from multiplexing and assembly entity could be checked for pre-emption by physical layer at T3 before the slot where the resource(s) is located as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7].","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to UE implementation to re-evaluate or pre-empt before 'm – T3' or after 'm – T3' but before 'm'. For re-evaluation, m is the slot where the SCI indicating the resource(s) is signalled at first time as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214. For pre-emption, m is the slot where the resource(s) is located as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214.","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the MAC entity has been configured with Sidelink resource allocation mode 2 to transmit using pool(s) of resources in a carrier as indicated in TS 38.331 [5] or TS 36.331 [21] based on sensing or random selection the MAC entity shall for each Sidelink process:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if a resource(s) of the selected sidelink grant which has not been identified by a prior SCI is indicated for re-evaluation by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7];","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the resource(s) from the selected sidelink grant associated to the Sidelink process;","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cc31593bb5d5d4391b2feff2bd0790b51c81b8e7994d08c06672777eb65fca23","original_member_sha256":"4579b065171040f3b7129b625b1bb7fec17c0dd544e3c3b2ded19bc9d1fc6d35","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ef653a720d1a51698e6a60cbd9ffa5726f39942a1c287b457035e849fd20bdf1","6e2a568f9d31f096aea18520cb32fae96e401b55acc7dbd285ed50b1f8eb65ff","0da83bdc9c5f2b4299ab4ae59a2d38d1993cb3f926e0a2a470109bee93a499ed","3632399cdf808e12dc4352020b61b3d7a183e93453784f7d1a08876217e7a77a","f4a60567d422d77ef321943aded97a043a7f1c2184d8ccc4fd24076ec17e934c","c77d4d3f99fbf8296fb7c5657659913ead0574d900c00e405d9fa1d42bd9d695","b6080532049d89d522c808c55b4f97ac0f9bbfcee1d3a54a49b879e9cb8b2f13","cbc77f0259d989148618236dfc3d3cac103558e93c16a2d136cfa50a405486e3","9de26b00db9a4d2f2fd0a36758efa18e7172ffcd6c3e7523b05568a5c43f5799","52e79ae65c9ed43c5b9b0e1c52a0ca0901968ea70099e6a4503e360719d543cc","15ddd9e081c846e9174c50bf394e84780315b74ebb93e1f852a9485a641b0eac","39a58850a01fa4aea25093c1c40bb18c8f7e639f2b2ab27b9d8db90a8e803ccc","269dadaa92514e3e5fac071a974bdd577d775d4c329d83e759830876cd86bef2","d6aefab42e92cdffb5b21f0fc66703694a93210cddc5a9a5053a3661b019581c","8ab861e9d0b36edf2d4040a5308e132dc37b67b0edd7d40733fac79f57507f56","ba65dc6de65e466ee6340b70d1cfdf811a8b2c9de84fccd1a269dccb7086291a","ebd6d0a9e9bcfaff7ce0659f6b563907501ed4b36415675294cfbbfb71ddb64a","db66297cfe322035b891e4acc0ebeba1cc1387a6da3d4d198d276ae0df717498","f36331014e990866b7f74ddeee5250fab9cdcc09943f206b1e2134cb3c27d490","6e8b3776a2911ce8dd92b038d8a6ef8783908506400623c4522270ee5f7d23a6","21fddc9ba9964e128fe811ba1646b0c7ab7b2cb5a76d725a588f884788b479ee","c63e9c2c41c0e49471106fe153e96ce75cc9df91ef964a51f6b98b44349f15e2","9d91ad5919a0916e3a681950ad58d07e1658559fca6aef1c55b8c825fa37a367","8e7ed10a60f94c18656f3f6f3c5ca18b02f4869abafc284e69af575360a551cc"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>randomly select the time and frequency resource from either the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], or from available resources after a received preferred resource set is taken into account according to 5.22.1.1, for either the removed resource or the dropped resource, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of either SL data available in the logical channel(s) by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources of the selected sidelink grant in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources, and that a resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of an SCI for a retransmission according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9];","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>replace the removed or dropped resource(s) by the selected resource(s) for the selected sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any resource(s) of the selected sidelink grant which has been indicated by a prior SCI is indicated for pre-emption by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7]:","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the resource(s) from the selected sidelink grant associated to the Sidelink process;","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if one or multiple SL DRX is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>randomly select the time and frequency resource from the resources later than the resources for either the removed resource or the dropped resource indicated by a prior SCI, from the resource indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7] which occur within the SL DRX active time as specified in clause 5.28.3 of the destination UE selected for indicating to the physical layer the SL DRX active time above, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of either SL data available in the logical channel(s) by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources of the selected sidelink grant in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources, and that a resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of an SCI for a retransmission according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>randomly select the time and frequency resource from either the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], or from available resources after a received preferred resource set is taken into account according to 5.22.1.1, for either the removed resource or the dropped resource, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of either SL data available in the logical channel(s) by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources of the selected sidelink grant in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources, and that a resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of an SCI for a retransmission according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9].","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If retransmission resource(s) cannot be selected by ensuring that the resource(s) can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI, how to select the time and frequency resources for one or more transmission opportunities from the available resources is left for UE implementation by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected ‎resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of ‎resources.","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>replace the removed or dropped resource(s) by the selected resource(s) for the selected sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:It is left for UE implementation to reselect any pre-selected but not reserved resource(s) other than the resource(s) indicated for pre-emption or re-evaluation by the physical layer during reselection triggered by re-evaluation or pre-emption indicated by the physical layer.","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:It is up to UE implementation whether to set the resource reservation interval in the re-selected resource to replace pre-empted resource.","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 5:It is up to UE implementation whether to trigger resource reselection due to de-prioritization as specified in clause 16.2.4 of TS 38.213 [6], clause 5.14.1.2.2 of TS 36.321 [22] and clause 5.22.1.3.1a.","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 6:For the selected sidelink grant corresponds to transmissions of multiple MAC PDU, it is up to UE implementation whether to apply re-evaluation check to the resources in non-initial reservation period that have been signalled neither in the immediate last nor in the current period. ","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.22.1.2bRe-selection for using a received resource conflict indication","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the MAC entity has been configured with Sidelink resource allocation mode 2 to transmit using pool(s) of resources in a carrier as indicated in TS 38.331 [5] based on full sensing, or partial sensing or random selection or any combination(s), the MAC entity shall for each Sidelink process:","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-interUECoordinationScheme2 enabling reception/transmission of a resource conflict indication is configured by RRC; and","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the next resource of the selected sidelink grant which has been indicated by a prior SCI is overlapped with conflict resource(s) indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 16.3.1 of TS 38.213 [6]:","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the resource from the selected sidelink grant associated to the Sidelink process;","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>randomly select the time and frequency resource from either the resources indicated by the physical layer as specified in clause 8.1.4 of TS 38.214 [7], or from available resources after a received preferred resource set is taken into account according to 5.22.1.1, excluding the conflict resource(s) for the removed resource, according to the amount of selected frequency resources, the selected number of HARQ retransmissions and the remaining PDB of either SL data available in the logical channel(s) by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected resources of the selected sidelink grant in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of resources, and that a resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of an SCI for a retransmission according to clause 8.3.1.1 of TS 38.212 [9];","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:If retransmission resource cannot be selected by ensuring that the resource can be indicated by the time resource assignment of a prior SCI, how to select the time and frequency resource for more transmission opportunities from the available resources is left for UE implementation by ensuring the minimum time gap between any two selected ‎resources in case that PSFCH is configured for this pool of ‎resources.","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>replace the removed resource by the selected resource for the selected sidelink grant.","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:It is left for UE implementation to reselect any pre-selected but not reserved resource(s) other than the resource overlapping with the conflict resource(s) indicated by the physical layer during reselection triggered by the conflict resource(s) indicated by the physical layer.","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cc31593bb5d5d4391b2feff2bd0790b51c81b8e7994d08c06672777eb65fca23","original_member_sha256":"4579b065171040f3b7129b625b1bb7fec17c0dd544e3c3b2ded19bc9d1fc6d35","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9f56e306dbcc6ef16c455c405aca7c8038d1cd136f555db0dabbb58ce7e6a795","c19050a7d9333e0960c4dce1fb442273a8743f7a80b10e002ebd1770b23fbb74","53f84e911c611663e1d9e9d54dacc9517b32c06ebd06ffe43606da0a69a25df1","c3dbe1211604e124f5a16299494a9f4c35eb75ae3ef9bc7aab1428701302763f","d40df2594789cc790f3d5db3f1ea3950d78ee55e5022a678945155a92fa0e50e","19d360371743ce404fa9ef2ba88e2eb67c417bcbbc1c793b29881a31b7e74846","e7a19a28557d04ade894f4c693a8878d941e5645434b0e64c8066dc6d810d774","e5ff35f7e5fe59288f1543045430d51faef9adbd005e1d62c8de5776c9c42b06","ec5ec2421f3ab7675c108b0a8f0454a5dbba54f4855e0f7c865ff05ebebf4c24","080991dbed7261b9fa42f761a8d7876724e5c3866c426232874224eb87016d9c","0f217986c1e46910329162941b50712ca364f6f71e8689a0d4e3376972bb5b79","03747a3fe363ebe3ff5413b0fd7768f5c87f897ff70831b69e0bdb4a93297c2e","1e5f395a1763a8cf42a908a6ab40ebe2dc453ac97e5decf3a8ada85e6559b848","e63c8307deaa2283e7ed3c6edc7ea027f8d5f97b9fe76f118766dcc0bc6e6734","5c1a51ef706f742532aeae1b8b164d3da79fb5ada10711cedcfe2ac8dfa7b9e8","48063d52856621362aa041781eb07b30fc0482c5652922a60cdfe682ed87f0ee","bf9a989854165fdbf80900e2a938bdc7addd9977fdd6fbaa0f44f4c64412b7be","a42321ae8e372652791f01d17bd78de0da0dbdd097875cf474f4cbd6b3029ca2","4d51665c3b1ca52e5d287143303de85ddb344cebc0d6a6d0d73fc7473d849573","6daa1daf95c285bf5ce9c9975d169d9acf8b2fe274dbcefb3c464510bd351dae","4c17eb43ad32ab8d10c1acb44158b4205cb8c1cb85917f5af22df66dbc0acbba","58be6f3720685829cd1a87585e2cdc6f4cad4d13184cf45c7dbceb75b9f5f80f","2664e2ec945eface462bf40e8e33aa20426a57ece11ecf824cd564fa89eb93b4","878a0a3c2795821ddffb496052c7e2d9221c6de11fe0baf9b0556761121c652b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:It is up to UE implementation whether and how to set the resource reservation interval in the re-selected resource to replace the resource overlapping with the conflict resource(s) indicated by the physical layer.","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"END OF CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":169}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cc31593bb5d5d4391b2feff2bd0790b51c81b8e7994d08c06672777eb65fca23","original_member_sha256":"4579b065171040f3b7129b625b1bb7fec17c0dd544e3c3b2ded19bc9d1fc6d35","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["66b0cf4c0c35a39a95db706109d33ce43317212a28b82a24a119e91af4baf063","f1c060a7d48acf1a783970e9721c83c157fbb53d637dc5851b2f032a01668c8c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,169],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303745.zip::R2-2303745 CR#1595 User plane corrections on NR Sidelink enhancements.docx:p168"}
