{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303915.zip::R2-2303915 Corrections on MAC reset regarding configured sidelink grant.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-16","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In the current specification, when a MAC entity performs MAC reset requested by RRC, the MAC entity considers the timeAlignmentTimer to be expired and performs the actions in clause 5.2, where the MAC entity clears any configured DL assignments and configured UL grants: ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.12MAC Reset","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If a reset of the MAC entity is requested by upper layers, the MAC entity shall:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider all timeAlignmentTimers as expired and perform the corresponding actions in clause 5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"…","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2Maintenance of Uplink Time Alignment","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"…","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>when a timeAlignmentTimer expires:","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear any configured downlink assignments and configured uplink grants;","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bde1953134afc7232c3b85bbe56f17a18335b0467ee90fb1e9fe1e0ffc4a998f","original_member_sha256":"5226f282075a722b4cebe17bdc4641f967c0f2298a5db15c2df09f33f91ba38f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eff196609043449dd77bd5bac1290dcd7fdc267cae13419a6cadaec04b6d3632","7612e809f1943fb30a1c98edd7d811f49ddeade8b5fcdd56cd5af46756db8f28","bd03e4c1ed01429e9812507a458ecb0d038d0f746305e6180198cfbf25f2a6c5","b8def0e5eeb1eaed9c5a8fe16addd0e69ddbc366019f8c923c02c3ea92f11660","3e500b8ae317c32f33bc03859746a0d532d5018fce54a328d609be6727a167ae","4301f6d8262385904eb846525f71779d1a612ae0a61426b8d4e757fbe47da8b5","f0ad421b1793f5cf9df01a566be1f706b7c72308c7231ef92a42a6fde0c65171","25133badc448e2dc8e700bed18de802c55b084cbdcd4cbe70d46b959f3ebb854","7fe420f9545afe47d3944873f53bace6b6a9f468b692bcde9cbff96f11e07274","2ad61b707982e47c74c022aacb0823013439aa893f2f0b1e38c64bcc07e024a7","c063ae0c4b4fa3272d858348e46961d3f97c21db53f32e4b60537e0522d3c936","f98a046013ede106a2a42dbbdfd2507f05655fd74f3344fb3697d55f0dd5d67d","d57a11c8ffa7c11ec0cd782bafd2ba214f5cba1d9c6d5cd0d17830c1960f5fba","124e83c039462ffc7080376e8600746c49c4d3fbc00ced689790cd1a8818f83b","a2fa580fe1e5c7828a8e78beb5733cb7887471d9ad5cbda0e24d026f2c158961","f70a4c4edffcf00ef777a3808bc460ed611642768d1650b7de5d61a0aa88b894","f8588a4220b1268e92c94871ed58397a56400a4e1b55ab43777445d83b6fbf09","49319d34b002182ac5e1eb5fd27d4cf144397feab2047cac39c9e03d055299fd","2b9a4dfba62c76a4ee361ad1b03a3daee7db6f405562cb0328a6020386332fc4","d33df14ee1bd14872877c1da62abfa2773cb4cba983210e20991378a504925c3","eb508dce8f6256c4d91e546046c82751d8140f5f75801381f0d532c94aa44374","93252e2a3bff4ba163504a67a78a140b35c53b9cac7fdeb394a8e6ca320bd5b2","c60218925dfc477cef7bf97ae50009cfb2606f65e849770abfc7f15a0a81156a","37a2c062510cf49f1485e187d4a663f338a757cc919d780425c87d0e6fa02e8d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303915.zip::R2-2303915 Corrections on MAC reset regarding configured sidelink grant.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303915.zip::R2-2303915 Corrections on MAC reset regarding configured sidelink grant.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MAC entity should not keep using SL CG in scenarios requiring MAC reset, e.g. the serving cell changes due to handover/RRC re-establishment. To align with the handling of Uu CG, the MAC entity should also clear SL CG when performing MAC reset.","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Added that the MAC entity clears configured sidelink grant when performing MAC reset.","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: ","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MAC reset","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to this CR but the network is not, the network could still reserve the configured sidelink resources for the UE after resetting MAC.","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to this CR but the UE is not, the UE could still occupy configured sidelink resources after resetting MAC.","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE could still occupy configured sidelink resources after resetting MAC and may result in collisions of SL transmissions. ","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"bde1953134afc7232c3b85bbe56f17a18335b0467ee90fb1e9fe1e0ffc4a998f","original_member_sha256":"5226f282075a722b4cebe17bdc4641f967c0f2298a5db15c2df09f33f91ba38f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bc95b0effbc1b1382ce8623bb8916cc6be99348a6a415ea4057856427fbce288","39bf6b4b26658d6f3e9900cb97c41e2b76b938ab9fe7b31d76710625c78fa4d8","8a85c14cec8ba28234d248b1e448b3be643174f5f0d1bd20c14c2004cbfaa6be","fc7f1d7ade99761ccd1694517a2fc68a0774e8d547041ba5e94e9a1b155c8830","23bec12679cb821b4c3ecaed15ba6e2a78c22b90c3425f7872d54f6b60d54b02","8e5bbfb521b4e520545d177b6f426031b1660ab17f4968e8587e9ab7dfbfe74d","8735fac5a356e316ea144d93e5c81358e4b64b9b311800c269dbafbecbb652f4","7e75f9d764ee94221da2c9b2583d6c4b9f9318504e293e43b4c4ad4232bac67e","7480860edc51f60aa95efe4695632af4ce124d40aa3e23ac67fa398b6761903d","0cc268f79b556599598f828a2f5444a52222f40ee4fa52166cbfd30d9c54d725","360b9dbd9a22a7e7234e3fda60205e2387abd6ee9c4b5e4599a8d1cb5e6afeef","dbd54e808ea12062eb12b771c3129f7c244d7f272b8bd3f77eae189e880d140b","d91560be4a950552bdf638110ca782c711f1f797e83d8a8b164dde42ef84395a","2580f19d96f6e8817b3aac21e0f17a5660ebf44478e112b6a6650fe8c1823054","b669d75c0978a04890c94391548cea51b8881ed4f05d8bd142162481ae0385da","ea5d7ee3a5c690dad01087cb3da075b0e705c6c87f4a90b4aaa493141e59