{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303928.zip::R2-2303928 Corrections on MAC reset regarding configured sidelink grant.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" O&M Specifications","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS/TR ... CR ... ","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other comments:","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Start of change","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.12MAC Reset","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If a reset of the MAC entity is requested by upper layers or the reset of the MAC entity is triggered due to SCG deactivation as defined in clause 5.29, the MAC entity shall:","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the MAC reset is not due to SCG deactivation:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initialize Bj for each logical channel to zero;","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initialize SBj for each logical channel to zero if Sidelink resource allocation mode 1 is configured by RRC;","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if upper layers indicate SCG deactivation and bfd-and-RLM with value true is configured for the deactivated SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop (if running) all timers except beamFailureDetectionTimer associated with PSCell and timeAlignmentTimers.","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop (if running) all timers, except MBS broadcast DRX timers;","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider all timeAlignmentTimers, inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer, and cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if configured, as expired and perform the corresponding actions in clause 5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the NDIs for all uplink HARQ processes to the value 0;","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"de491b233e8414866db886ef6744be3d315fc24aa135eb3a6d90276a2cbaf07b","original_member_sha256":"995706d22787828e57dd2e5c655ede09df69b7e77d6bf90f0dd97b9bbe977b40","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4be865076d9a636a68189733f0abaf076f7482b2501a43ec0106b8be692d58df","8f2297822a9631a2b1e1758afc2386cc7f4af5455bee95da74d00e489d47491d","63ef285bda977c4c925d85123428af076c32cba8858b5fc8bd4bcc0caa2a0aae","fa95302cb50acca2a6b2c65c464eb2aa47abc3aaf4166c85c5a39b5ae6f6ea1a","457acd554b3d1ce009db4f216c93fa9c15621c0c297ff5931a417bd427661753","91f488fe4ea750367681bc0b09e7a3be7770ffec32dff883077b7c6c890c0e86","e738e92b5478fc661007b2993b34e20e07e0117b5085b9287b07aec58f90b20b","30dd9aa0667809673ff088592ef3e43e842efdf5d9efb7fbf2c14173a65bfd1a","315c49290bb449a0227880324de27e60a71341ff3317446daaff185e308cf1d9","05c8666e410a0bdb95b5e0ce7847ea3c2e5a474a0a66820482112aafe018e0fa","6c6e8e80671895077c5f675c07dda8034e825ebb8855158ba204d846f6381594","2e2eb35077e07115901c68783ba45e9a29b8898f97b704590987d9a118de09c8","f4a3d4c9dd790e912f593bceb25771ce7dbbaad1a9923b9150513bdcde2873f0","78d21c2f2a851e124ea9db16dbde0000cb70554d78957c3e370fae4627e513e2","f53db35a450733d51bbed301aa11b408b5dfb81aba5af3cd6c3d75e655bab91a","3677783c3cd611c5c813bf949bda8080dc8c1123af45b9af6ace158fc9d34d6a","f5b6cea9b8ddcae513dd6956a6a1c6bb2e9f20ab5936b837293ada3c847d2da2","4225d0071076c143c2765d432c4947b9bf5116105313d19d420d5d500adc615e","45c8738648b79f79da93cfe34540d8c124331eb256445812321d283a49db9658","ab66fdf54c8e3fb6aa0d21723170e2c6d0fa65e6c719da206228128a9df34a40","c1443157dc7a3d178a04a5818fcc00c99c87f8382f402e4747d7f49f345aaebe","7473e4959432c7cd88797f8a2929d1d01974dc66f3f03a0a5107661cc9792b59","d7ec708d3172ce87ed41b76c2b59b7997ec05ed7b1e9a978328cef7b624cdbfd","9c3698bfcbcbe2293c4512165e872e2087ddcf313cdb54698e346f8c62bca3f4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2303928.zip::R2-2303928 Corrections on MAC reset regarding configured sidelink grant.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303928.zip::R2-2303928 Corrections on MAC reset regarding configured sidelink grant.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>sets the NDIs for all HARQ process IDs to the value 0 for monitoring PDCCH in Sidelink resource allocation mode 1;","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop, if any, ongoing Random Access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>discard explicitly signalled contention-free Random Access Resources for 4-step RA type and 2-step RA type, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>flush Msg3 buffer;","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>flush MSGA buffer;","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Scheduling Request procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Buffer Status Reporting procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Power Headroom Reporting procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered consistent LBT failure;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered BFR;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Sidelink Buffer Status Reporting procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Pre-emptive Buffer Status Reporting procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Timing Advance Reporting procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Recommended bit rate query procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Configured uplink grant confirmation;","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered configured sidelink grant confirmation;","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>clear, if any, configured sidelink grants;","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Desired Guard Symbol query;","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Positioning Measurement Gap Activation/Deactivation Request procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered SDT procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>flush the soft buffers for all DL HARQ processes, except for the DL HARQ process being used for MBS broadcast;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each DL HARQ process, except for the DL HARQ process being used for MBS broadcast, consider the next received transmission for a TB as the very first transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release, if any, Temporary C-RNTI;","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if upper layers indicate SCG deactivation and bfd-and-RLM with value true is not configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"de491b233e8414866db886ef6744be3d315fc24aa135eb3a6d90276a2cbaf07b","original_member_sha256":"995706d22787828e57dd2e5c655ede09df69b7e77d6bf90f0dd97b9bbe977b40","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9cc9f4cbbd54a20e643c61db0f8f1feb152740b3c4e9d40837a57c91e3189cf1","7b6cffd288c2d48ceb01f5275f4f673dde7b6ac46654bee2e2bce28486822189","2a5b07fc64bd10c64cc82ea55d48adecfd5d928f727f08b65e0dbd9b7c10d8d7","d8883f76eca55e5a31fae5cda80a8dff6034442a29e8039f0f48a9bfb90b9bf4","264c7c221ebf9e