{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2303928.zip::R2-2303928 Corrections on MAC reset regarding configured sidelink grant.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the MAC reset is not due to SCG deactivation:","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset all BFI_COUNTERs;","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset all LBT_COUNTERs.","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If a Sidelink specific reset of the MAC entity is requested for a PC5-RRC connection by upper layers, the MAC entity shall:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>flush the soft buffers for all Sidelink processes for all TB(s) associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider all Sidelink processes for all TB(s) associated to the PC5-RRC connection as unoccupied;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Scheduling Request procedure only associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Sidelink Buffer Status Reporting procedure only associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Sidelink CSI Reporting procedure associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Sidelink DRX Command MAC CE associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Sidelink IUC-Request transmission procedure associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>cancel, if any, triggered Sidelink IUC-Information Reporting procedure associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop (if running) all timers associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset the numConsecutiveDTX associated to the PC5-RRC connection;","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initialize SBj for each logical channel associated to the PC5-RRC connection to zero.","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of change","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":185}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"de491b233e8414866db886ef6744be3d315fc24aa135eb3a6d90276a2cbaf07b","original_member_sha256":"995706d22787828e57dd2e5c655ede09df69b7e77d6bf90f0dd97b9bbe977b40","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["47492e73287e3b89800680a7b3c6c39755d857df057a143c723e64ca712097cc","b384f1028aa2512645e0844d64525d519529b8d257b1f637f0eeb62c8dc6e2a6","b78002cb30540671e880b977f7fd4df11005a4dcc83eac4a7fdb8b585a832400","0947f1922deefa8e9baf0fdc1932e4fd1b170b29b3ec4c192343445de161586e","33ccc67225d55088d11082ae7c2137b601551fb33ce6b8473a9c625a32904836","49185d87f9f21909dc1c804120941aa721bacdeda6cfb413b786dfa29283a0ef","dcafbd71b0aa6adf58f6750c8d4f61b5dda563344aaf22c2d109668677b137a4","ad3952e18e1b6005f8c9c522a7ca2cce791091e01b63cba39224992e8cf6ceb9","1b942a45c8d9674067a3e52053bb27439d945cae9471a02a5a9202d7a35cb8dc","65c587c6d042126c96234efcad67c3f80f92c6f356c29deb24d38664b8aad919","410e9d3aa62ef893f74df25f91a67b7896ccebc2666cbf8beb951b32ab5edf63","02787453971b75e719d820a4797aa51a5b7cf21a3d55aa90d04a419f96e44639","9b040678afca7a18fc95778f9017efa13b8570d44b0bd0edb9b0ad15be585e6b","b0da60d15a68cb3c6972237625f18e8cf372228906e2ad5e8475f958e6dca4ad","35db235f5c8042af4dfe6fbdfad69d4518e854e19dbcfddafab02576fe2d9a50","7aad89023dc4f93df