{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 1: “non-relay’ discovery RX is wrongly specified as “relay discovery” in one of the SUI triggering procedures.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Issue 2: The logic opposite of “A or B” is “neither A nor B”. Thus, it is wrong to use  “else” of “if A or B”  condition to mean “not A” or “not B”. Hence, for SUI initiation procedure in 5.8.3.2,  when the if branch is specified as “if configured by upper layer for L3 U2N relay or if configured by upper layers for L2 U2N relay”, the “else” condition will only be satisfied if the upper layer disables both L3 U2N relay and L2 U2N relay operation simultaneously.  However, the real intention of this “else” branch refers to the opposite of either one of the two cases (either L3 U2N relay or L2 U2N relay, not necessarily both. ","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"So, according to the current procedure, there are several “else” branches will not be properly triggered if UE has ever been acting in both L3 U2N relay and L2 U2N relay operation, but only one type of the relay operation is now disabled by upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Correted the “non-relay discovery RX” case for SUI initiaiton in 5.8.3.2 ","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Replaced the “else” with an explicit list of two “if” consitons when UE is no longer configured by upper layers for L3 U2N or L2 U2N operation in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RX L3 U2N or L2 U2N relay discovery message","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"79f5984c19f5201732d06222469fdfac7a3d95c6570ca5484c683601561d09f7","original_member_sha256":"5566407ba7f157afa39e1e7995716386e1fc82a6f5c951a64bb939bdb8f753d5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","285a8c8799db0481a805d2aec7ce7fc209db7244f09ed6018ec158f8b79d2b31","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","062ab817e3a0ceb9c24fb32e82a4a4427541cd05a1cec04900557d158c3df865","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","c7f154badb51090dd578312419bcf46f1ff9111557a952165c0ca920b2e5af4d","1257bef6de0d6fbcb35da4ad9e5d1d2efb40539d216438a199be822d1e60e855","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","6318240db9ef9ff789b2c42279fc4a12aa709d231c796ced014c8a9651101984","dcc5d2c3b08a34eec5a55068e769d16084586d8e4d9de2c7259adefba50b5b3b","494c2fdeb7720fd919a1db57efb88bd2a86f9d8a983758cfcb74e2ed4c816102","b8a33b8ff51b7e736e6ff823b330475b4d01c0f4014e1236147812aa3e0ba26c","c5b1c39a69899f97f34afbb7e831e54c69345451a001b90070fb102e2b4d86be","2e7ad5e5152c8504ca6703eca0ec00824a34f16960b5e133fa18c977eb3c790b","8b24573e0133d1c5ee95e1377545628b16380b4d3d980bde5296376e8173041e","7423559940944ed0cc1fe176b76253cf9035dcdbfc0fac2f3e385feb311a2329","288cc60197c635a28716a1c3a9133085106b36b1009fb0a2849670c1b99dfd9f","14a0300d41f7a52e58bbd410744ea26a96bce8c5306293775db597bfe78a91e0","f33ce871a4224e0be00534e0e6c83c2f2a1404abac739855abac3c1ea161652a","f63de680636c9b7693090b041a6793a0f1f168847f4b905345fe75e12cb90379"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TX L3 U2N or L2 U2N relay discovery message","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TX L3 U2N or L2 U2N relay communication","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: ","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Actions related to SUI initaiton for SL relay.","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If Sidelink UE implement this change, there is no inter-operability issue between UE and gNB.","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If Sidelink TX UE implement this change, but the Sidelink RX UE is not implemented this change, there is no inter-operability issue .","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE supporting both L3 U2N relay and L2 U2N relay will not be able to revoke its SUI TX or RX interests if only one type of the relay operation is disabled by upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.3.2","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"79f5984c19f5201732d06222469fdfac7a3d95c6570ca5484c683601561d09f7","original_member_sha256":"5566407ba7f157afa39e1e7995716386e1fc82a6f5c951a64bb939bdb8f753d5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b575776ff1e3cb8082044897eed52291d29dda832b74817218ee2c4469f66273","ecd77a777a1126a3080a5b87d8583e91c4fd7fb3340f2e17bbce39790d1dc5c6","2db883f410fd8718623c328ad9a7352da796769aca4b9c53f577529ca913edb3","73d8691bf4e7719e612d80d3fb7527700c457decbea19b8ac6537f9845da1c76","ac8fa8b5b772145e3d22a46625d1fe6c2dc79806ac39bb5bd592fccc48665aff","0089356d83a0014c066dbdc985d3324871c3efdf132581ac1796c6c0d94005b7","d1367aa1096f07c6e5ffdfae7792b136dcbbb782f9473d2e20dbcdfd933ee2a5","73183cc7f922333f68ddebd142394b1f95cf2e0fdd52ccd81a941b0e04cf79c4","feffe1ef0796d0811775892bab54719864d10fa08a4f560155189dc7a0f2ed4b","0b8656b111477b2d0151873e3ef789da6fffeae50d76b9f54abdb04d84445cf0","674a78c7f36a86b80b6ed414f613757d614b2c276ebb2a2f8275ae33af9121b0","97eb7b87818967a58ccdd2dacc2a9288dfb0faa76e3c5b4269e281782b3bf790","23da18bbbcbc650fad7a07ef8006251a7a06ae59113986d1a2b8d37f6d71a8d1","85f9fe225bf206da5b28016fbb39c62cb1368eb1244f4f20547ea6629294dc69","378adf0aa423995360841de5b3ff121413a3320bd55a44c2044b1a4823324310","36de608cea3aee171368fbd4466754d033ea30db95e21f5283b143c4a518b71d","d3098623b4dfc23a1a4b383cc6c305d01a4c1c56ac54d5853c2f6542bbe0ad3e","d88bc81b05cdcb5373fcefe52e78f5e5b7ea4e37e19c0d9ebb00bb2abbe8ad2d","61cf31ccb32ca743f815831546a63f3d4f37ea5f4ff7e02e623d0e686dc91277","77193b86a1636eceffd8406750d481cd2830954cd8f996d35396a87fa69ba1fe","d3262b1