{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-NonRelayDiscovery; or","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqListDisc; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqListDisc has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay; or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case L2 U2N relay operation or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqListDisc; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqListDisc has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met; or","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink relay discovery messages resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers not to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery message; or","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers not to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery message:","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink relay discovery messages resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case L2 U2N relay operation or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message; or if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met; or","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"79f5984c19f5201732d06222469fdfac7a3d95c6570ca5484c683601561d09f7","original_member_sha256":"5566407ba7f157afa39e1e7995716386e1fc82a6f5c951a64bb939bdb8f753d5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1875b5f8a05fabfb0dda43ab8978089aa55b570f1437e0fb38f2fdc62ecba8b7","e2f264d534497f56d702fb600f76f021576ae73ee209e83ab80ece3b04b6fb07","d3f8f3410eb8387e533d709be6215b0d93c1e676e3d2e81724d07d41f9232afa","5361874cbc0c0d2d0c6331e2301d185358bb13db145c6e1afbb15886123376c4","14b0c538676025651438b97d3d990d5ab269a74a53b46f423632b19d816655e2","5d72f1174fbeae407fef6db3dc02a889e3a780c181312b7200e174c9475a99f4","0e6440e2a89d5555678c53fa3a2776468fa5e47b94ad3e412ab97729a4646c98","6bd38113ddc208b292817e21237f6f070a71da8a2aba8f7b55824b83d12e60de","80cd64c66cf0c6c5657b88e93df7f0730a91db03e30de32af1fb81467ba2ef66","d897135b9babe4fbfa5f781b822bbe04365a7e438dedd78f591e7284d69ff6c2","3a382d9888d767422404023768381e0b7728301acae685275c6b3ed29afb5ba7","5c69ad5908b76bcdc56c813281f28330a3472bdabbfd95d68478e9645f4c75e8","4518cd8eefc5fcf9254bc82af0ee0b1131f6a1b8fe6ab351c36113cf2b81733e","afb7da4da65607b603c362b45830fb1e2aba684648d40c66d78c91c3b12f69d8","124ac16d927e0c7622548bcd6eff437210cddf9a821040d9376bfd5fc030bb58","4526adebfdd67d2c5530ce0a67ede640148a9b74a603eb3b0fae9aa7fd1fba0d","34d14f56facd5845dd3f7c1689d5dc9f3b06b81a08eaa17e1195d675defa8c74","e8581a4468b9f7c5d1669e54917c4789fa36f9d8d6b21aaf11a561a088be0eb2","0fa36e00ea28bea156f87fe7da39f0568af68b9084f0ed69a3b4d03f83ea81ee","a0f2173e878bb9553f29b23b422f086f7656644f66668e2506451c0a6863938d","980db06d6c3d9a2c4b5a06837f7fa472ee9204a8d79979ecd3234f2d31930ca4","3f2a8e6ce3f871aedf2e701f89d6b83568be9d13a49c995236a09e905ce35471","eac17d05745b6a4ed0f58f9fd87f9fe73ab3778404037da9040d3098ca8d3d82","52076e79dd798cc70442a852fc4a72a4077a3000dacdd296a1aab001312cc056"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,191],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx:p168"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink relay communication transmission resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers not to transmit NR sidelnk L2 U2N relay communication and if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay; or","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers not to transmit NR sidelnk L3 U2N relay communication and if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay:","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink relay communication transmission resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink reception on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell and if sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC is included in SIB12-IEs:","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE received a sidelink DRX configuration in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message for NR sidelink unicast reception from the associated peer UE and the UE accepted the sidelink DRX configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxDRX-ReportList; or if the information carried by sl-RxDRX-ReportList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the sidelink DRX configuration in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxDRX-ReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the sidelink DRX configuration is no longer used in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception and is interested in a service that sidelink DRX is applied:","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList; or if the information carried by sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile(s) associated with the service(s) in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList:","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it is no longer interested in the service that sidelink DRX is applied in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink transmission on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell and if sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC is included in SIB12-IEs and if the UE is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE received a sidelink DRX assistance information or a sidelink DRX configuration reject information from the associated peer UE for NR sidelink unicast transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"79f5984c19f5201732d06222469fdfac7a3d95c6570ca5484c683601561d09f7","original_member_sha256":"5566407ba7f157afa39e1e7995716386e1fc82a6f5c951a64bb939bdb8f753d5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f75b3afaecd4e96d8c19be6b537569c84f93ecdd001e6d4c944d9f6dc2ae9116","ce162818a4b8f9ed1b032661133741ee7ec83e509b6666cfc8da832befd313ae","29c277380082a8b7c6059463130c2cb2517c843977b1bbae2047e94af5d79ad1","5f8a134817cb8d2426ff8865b1ad8b4faac5f74aa6219e57c2e63e6316fb730a","d4082865b2bd1dddd6892699cac80b2f3e98a046c4682a8f5ad8d0e6dc955452","5331fa47ccf45e15f315068e92c81dc5d503c76d380cf019b0eadfc16f5f0aa9","0c8e1af08d174de4ec9e3248bce1a86fcd527edf8e60668da0843c65c573a869","42af92fc6c86a1cce47c12bcff112f0d9c4349022b706156e53c2d3ae5167fad","11a225f82c9ca5f3f8744a2286e605216e51db2ececffe69a759df7735d82628","e9d7a1bc7197a0143b30177ed079c77ef9ecdb9ad60cefe3db62c03cb5022507","e958d3924cc8306436b31419e5f1aee64c9c61abc4f2b11fa4b46d2a3d2f3296","4da42a3fee8b881605200ae1f0328e07e3a6ef9f8c26d1f0740538ec9cae096d","a13ea454e10c6cf0efdf428643cd823db33a58c08b45067e2073ac960af542d2","9003d7cd2a15ead9fb21d6d61449dfa4f5d05f4393719786bbeaf90aecde48f0","dae60a9730ac65e887c5c348ba22a65cfa06053f37af0a1d0b0c14b58dba0f8b","9ba73811f6d447558fc290c7f816f1b8b10ebcfc38639b17b8489bc9dd926415","65fe3dd7a6dd0c815389bab476d3340fb2d47433c7d84ac32128768d16a12399","3d9ee3237479dc9ce16576d4eb6a7edd37cf6e4fddd29029b6ada4e2d43283d9","774979a14d1ebbc51bd219251e4cc8d026c77e3c6b8e42063061c8270efedf99","f907a21f0ec59a27f8034ff98576fd67e2db5901b5e39ef14ed0098bdef4516e","dc7d948203ce7f7d0ed17875ddee31cf28ff9b0a4e423afb5d787567abba2814","dcae6eae9a810a025a09e4e70293ec1e766813f0f2b304810fc87ccd99b98dec","b50fff0e2d0bdd5a661ed10bb1d0f4a5f7bce63f57a2db3863c2c1c572b32910","52a725cd27295f26291e1a2d044587428ab78fd518b3808e9751f327d776ee00"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx:p192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-DRX-InfoFromRxList or sl-FailureList; or if the information carried by sl-DRX-InfoFromRxList or sl-FailureList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the sidelink DRX assistance information or the sidelink DRX configuration reject information in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink groupcast transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-DRX-Indication; or if the information carried by sl-DRX-Indication has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report sidelink DRX on/off indication for the corresponding destination in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"END OF THE CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":226}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"79f5984c19f5201732d06222469fdfac7a3d95c6570ca5484c683601561d09f7","original_member_sha256":"5566407ba7f157afa39e1e7995716386e1fc82a6f5c951a64bb939bdb8f753d5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ee4fe36384faad3334079f1436be611492d26b02351246f2e0f5208d719678a8","f3703b29c7bbc96a362b80cefa222b19b1ac46cc14dc7802a326bd5769f2a04b","27103cfe330066d5cc60f0d13e2da5352667ad0fbaeb293b385194ec1a5d7015","5c7541c2c2e9c48b0fa0704709b4253bbe273da9b02d3e4ef3ddbd94d15720b3","5e6a5c02e1085af520836c0277d733d63edbb43382930eea1cecdfb052a76eb8","e805282d16568e8e347f782a5826ab89ba30aeed25f3a203576e5b1bb8d240c3","6caff97eac0d96e4d2687c81f50ed60bf60b97091fd068f3993b6f4fa75069cb","83d908e43ab7c2eb42666951aad579777a5b80530270b9fb8c3c906a940d6b50","65c1855c5b65597133a668a9d39f02bb17c21cb023d4e8c73c472016abea7641","adaebccf423c26a59f5418cbd273a5b98162d024e8be7375907ad79586ac9c55","bb15ea6933920e5bd3fa789d46c65848d55b8c28e4181c346ee408bc180c5550"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,226],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2305060.zip::R2-2305060 38331_Correction_SUI_relay.docx:p216"}
