2-2305849.zip::R2-2305849- CR4118 Correction for release message with re-establishment v1.0.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305849.zip::R2-2305849- CR4118 Correction for release message with re-establishment v1.0.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-15(Release 15)Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to Rel-17 L2 U2N relay, relay UE can decide to transmit NotificationMessageSidelink or PC5 unicast link release due to Uu RLF or HO of relay UE. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Based on 5.8.9.10.4, the L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED shall initiate the RRC connection re-establishment procedure upon receiving the NotificationMessageSidelink if T301 is not running. Based on 5.3.7.7 of TS38.331, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE upon receiption of NotificationMessageSidelink indicating relayUE-HO or relayUE-CellReselection if T301 is running.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Regarding the reception of PC5 unicast link release, UE shall initiate the re-establishment procedure upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED in current specification. Therefore, the condition of T301 is missing for the case of the reception of PC5 unicast link release from relay UE. Upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED, UE shall initiate the re-establishment procedure if T301 is not running. L2 U2N Remote UE shall enter RRC_IDLE upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer if T301 is running.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.7.2, the condition of ‘T301 is not running’ is added to ‘upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED. ","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.7.7, the condition of ‘upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE’ is added.","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"579202af481741cb7bb8161336b86b02431d52d588c77dded6efecb764b57769","original_member_sha256":"b0505b7e6667faeeee211b1942b347757320657484dec9587529cf442d0bad19","paragraph_ElementTree_utf