{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305849.zip::R2-2305849- CR4118 Correction for release message with re-establishment v1.0.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release referenceTimePreferenceReporting, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release sl-AssistanceConfigNR, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release obtainCommonLocation, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release musim-GapAssistanceConfig, if configured and stop timer T346h, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release musim-LeaveAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig, if configured, and stop timer T346i, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release propDelayDiffReportConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release maxBW-PreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successHO-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"579202af481741cb7bb8161336b86b02431d52d588c77dded6efecb764b57769","original_member_sha256":"b0505b7e6667faeeee211b1942b347757320657484dec9587529cf442d0bad19","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5b937d94d7924e8478643382183a76e30dbf527c25e57ceb181a99c1ddcfca36","f4507fa6b14970fce5f0743997c8244167df316e8414b69a43d792ec6f896be9","1ad76965f1e6ebbe0b0334b6b5eb8ab8b26376c007a02e30f65c966c4ca3b715","453af258b2f5469f6e37c3b5af01f483b825304707c8e4c2e651321f55a542fa","0354d5dd3a449bcd05d7ab38cbd8b1eed97182dc16ca4483d01109f9d7ca0cd9","0dfaa6f99b79cae9c8b8a1d1860cacfae63f836078949fa74