{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305849.zip::R2-2305849- CR4118 Correction for release message with re-establishment v1.0.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the connected L2 U2N Relay UE as suitable and perform actions as specified in clause 5.3.7.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to Remote UE implementation whether to release or keep the current PC5 unicast link.","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For L2 U2N Remote UE, if both a suitable cell and a suitable relay are available, the UE can select either one based on its implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of first changes","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Start of second change","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.7T301 expiry or selected cell/L2 U2N Relay UE no longer suitable","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T301 expires; or","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected cell becomes no longer suitable according to the cell selection criteria as specified in TS 38.304 [20]; or","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the (re)selected L2 U2N Relay UE becomes unsuitable; or","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"579202af481741cb7bb8161336b86b02431d52d588c77dded6efecb764b57769","original_member_sha256":"b0505b7e6667faeeee211b1942b347757320657484dec9587529cf442d0bad19","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["14eb94849251404cd94181f1e649991727b9a78bcaf68c11cebb9028aee7a53c","0ea9e86143228788581c10a4dcd08224dfbeff028900671409f8ce223c1dd4fd","665fcdca71de15d61515fbba7317da135b4bbbf22730bb13ec25b0350c775228","c0ea666fa2ca2e090919e203762a842c2b0d74ddc8d420f3fdc78b41119f8048","7bd94750e9088f4e0d8ea1ff3f6af31c664ed000a78f9beada50b59c6884c04d","2e96dd927049447964daac80e574b0d5cf590ba8141a2059494c5386dbc03037","9bdb4c6cd2f5c52b81e6a67c83517203d579fc94987f63e8dc4673712a0d25