{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AccessTypes field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"accessTypes","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the cellular access type(s). This is represented by a bit string, with a onevalue at the bit position means the particular access type is addressed; a zerovalue means not addressed.","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ARFCN-ValueEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IEs ARFCN-ValueEUTRA and ARFCN-ValueEUTRA-v9a0 are used to indicate the ARFCN of the E-UTRA carrier frequency, as defined in TS 36.331 [12].","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ARFCN-ValueEUTRA ::= INTEGER (0..maxEARFCN)","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ARFCN-ValueEUTRA-v9a0 ::=INTEGER (maxEARFCN-Plus1..maxEARFCN2)","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ARFCN-ValueEUTRA-r14 ::=INTEGER (0..maxEARFCN2)","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:For fields using the original value range, as defined by IE ARFCN-ValueEUTRA i.e. without suffix, value maxEARFCN indicates that the E-UTRA carrier frequency is indicated by means of an extension.","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ARFCN-ValueNR","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ARFCN-ValueNR is used to indicate the ARFCN applicable for a downlink, uplink or bi-directional (TDD) NR global frequency raster, as defined in TS 38.101-2 [34] and TS 38.101-1 [37].","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ad5861da0dccef1291129531d32d787af0fd13713ef27f554120fd6d7dfa3c8b","original_member_sha256":"85e43ed4cce9951e9169dd51891e9ea74001bd66e886c9b8fd4a0c481e900934","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c267d5e515a007034307d58d6ea2e265a476191f4886a75d367e23c2a1579e82","0589931fc594bc29223ff60a89b2d26710434900ec9fd174d0acab098700e091","dd64ad6b3240ef0c33e0a9391372bc00b443e902d7b3aad2c8586a81cb21120b","9394e614ad89188e73343b00d7033c5ccdd7ba82aeb09790815ba8ad122d0728","7d91afe7a1a6ab497bbb5d7788c76f0e98da766be30471652ca22f27b2696a1a","e18f54822d13c1fe10d4d46f1d12781008ab29b6b54aede09e7d766aa80f980e","89487a189ab971ad299decbd252a2c80027c6a6f4a7b4e053ac0a1fe0d1eca42","feb70e5dd96f4462b8b85bc55094d6162d56270549feac103c41de95acef22c3","a53b1417a22e24bd511f0f112daf56dc76d08b794c18a0d886cd591291dbe847","0d92a96cd04f27e41626af26532b4a3881a408fef8cdbc23a1b8b149e22b50b3","202d4384412c2c79a220c3542f7982448e29f3d1dab11181e57d21d616995fca","82541b7edcba16cbfce451e46085712da126813c0bc0d376c086556a6665dd0d","701a19616f2036e2fae7c95763df60cc09916e3094d1474c2fe88d319a1a165a","62987bbf0eb769b745211f3fc8619f92161d56abb6add8707c9f0d2f579940a8","4463dd2f5