{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scale factor 1 degree; range 0 to 359 degrees.","paragraph_zero_based":1368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gamma-fine","paragraph_zero_based":1369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides finer granularity for the gamma.","paragraph_zero_based":1370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The total slant angle γ is given by gamma + gamma-fine.","paragraph_zero_based":1371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scale factor 0.1 degrees; range 0 to 0.9 degrees.","paragraph_zero_based":1372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–LOS-NLOS-Indicator","paragraph_zero_based":1374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE LOS-NLOS-Indicator provides information on the likelihood of a Line-of-Sight (LOS) propagation path from the source to the receiver.","paragraph_zero_based":1375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":1376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LOS-NLOS-Indicator-r17 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":1378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"indicator-r17CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":1379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"soft-r17INTEGER (0..10),","paragraph_zero_based":1380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"hard-r17BOOLEAN","paragraph_zero_based":1381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"},","paragraph_zero_based":1382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...","paragraph_zero_based":1383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":1384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":1386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"LOS-NLOS-Indicator field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":1388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"indicator","paragraph_zero_based":1389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides information on the likelihood of a Line-of-Sight propagation path from the source to the receiver and has the following choices:","paragraph_zero_based":1390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-soft: This field specifies the likelihood of a LOS propagation path in the range between 0 and 1 with 0.1 steps resolution. Value '0' indicates NLOS and values '1' through '10' provide an estimate of the propability for a LOS propagation path between source and receiver.Scale factor 0.1; range 0 to 1.","paragraph_zero_based":1391}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ad5861da0dccef1291129531d32d787af0fd13713ef27f554120fd6d7dfa3c8b","original_member_sha256":"85e43ed4cce9951e9169dd51891e9ea74001bd66e886c9b8fd4a0c481e900934","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["13b4bf90e1791eb119a1f4ad828726473d223fd63e6d429fe2dc01cbe28e45be","f8cfcd2da3f67e4e000df45d4f5ba1887a276380f95b4e78fac7d7fbd6604846","0affd46dcc7bf80637367afc4409d9e53cb673b4a71f949876b1b9e99ead758a","60a1358c95c052e1d538456bef9468b5595113ff3bf116db22bd87ee0a07b24f","4e203c8a4ab0ac54805680faa36ab4a7711ea57e3bde1d0af722b7d3b12f12b6","db470d7bf494a3e256404f9b6cbdc181d87004a0278955680970cb7aac5c316d","881a7b07fb537ca9049fe22020531299c80d55142460ecf02297d90428e67f5b","93c91b36691110b77f83772856efe5798a4b287e2ce26bcf592bb7c2286fd98f","21c5ef3e031200c9f5e46ffa06c6d9d337f7ff60126036edb6e5a233cfea63b3","e8de69931a659e0a14e99543935552c5cb012533c2974440bf152915b977eac8","917c2e64237e43bdcc2accc0560d3e79197f58487154512a7fb192b72dc26e87","4f72dbd800bf041b541086967e1197db079ddd4b4e523564ef5b6c27ce2158df","5dfac2fbb195b7dae673df31949cf414f545de9a4358709e548c1b3b74a40c83","ae9d250ee6daecc884576a58a5f09818598477689515d8f0d10f542661f76c77"