{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The nr-DL-PRS-ReferenceInfo defines the \"assistance data reference\" TRP whose DL-PRS configuration is included in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList. The nr-DL-PRS-SFN0-Offset's and nr-DL-PRS-expectedRSTD's in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList are provided relative to the \"assistance data reference\" TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":1464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The network signals a value of zero for the nr-DL-PRS-SFN0-Offset, nr-DL-PRS-expectedRSTD, and nr-DL-PRS-expectedRSTD-uncertainty of the \"assistance data reference\" TRP in nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList.","paragraph_zero_based":1465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:For NR DL-TDOA positioning (see clause 6.5.10) the nr-DL-PRS-ReferenceInfo defines also the requested \"RSTD reference\".","paragraph_zero_based":1466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For DL-PRS processing, the LPP layer may inform lower layers to start performing DL-PRS measurements and provide to lower layers the information about the location of DL-PRS, e.g. DL-PRS-PointA, DL-PRS Positioning occasion information.","paragraph_zero_based":1467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":1468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceData-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":1470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-ReferenceInfo-r16 DL-PRS-ID-Info-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":1471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataList-r16SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxFreqLayers-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":1472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataPerFreq-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":1473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-SSB-Config-r16SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxTRPs-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":1474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-SSB-Config-r16OPTIONAL,-- Need ON","paragraph_zero_based":1475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...","paragraph_zero_based":1476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":1477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataPerFreq-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":1479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-PositioningFrequencyLayer-r16","paragraph_zero_based":1480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-PositioningFrequencyLayer-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":1481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataPerFreq-r16 SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxTRPsPerFreq-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":1482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataPerTRP-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":1483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...","paragraph_zero_based":1484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":1485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceDataPerTRP-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":1487}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ad5861da0dccef1291129531d32d787af0fd13713ef27f554120fd6d7dfa3c8b","original_member_sha256":"85e43ed4cce9951e9169dd51891e9ea74001bd66e886c9b8fd4a0c481e900934","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2f8b1b58638d0e282ab73184110552fa41f87b810abaf6c110aae8c016f370a6","eda6b5fda61ae5cd034dfc6465472aaf1e784958fbee023a8b1a28d6b79d9818","96ab15fdc2c3c2d59c1050da599b2c7dfedc66fa5db20bb1882d2b222bdabc02","25b8d9d3184f53dc6dc7793bb67f2b9e09cb98a7267df33e77a5ee4644a86e95","4bca41c5537e070d050de1cd0b0d3eba6e758f69b47a1794cd5498185e0b7caf","6f487757b2e2e9568c12dd9ddd5ed4b9267453beb91b5a2bf0133c4455f8c5c2","ed8a0bcc2fab04d3d762c495cdb147dd870e7d3733688