{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of DL-PRS resources per positioning frequency layer. Value 6 is only applicable to FR1 bands. ","paragraph_zero_based":2256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNrOfDL-PRS-ResourcesAcrossAllFL-TRP-ResourceSet","paragraph_zero_based":2257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the maximum number of DL-PRS Resources supported by UE across all frequency layers, TRPs and DL-PRS Resource Sets.","paragraph_zero_based":2258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fr1-Only: This is applicable for FR1 only band combinations;","paragraph_zero_based":2259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fr2-Only: This is applicable for FR2 only band combinations;","paragraph_zero_based":2260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"fr1-FR2Mix: This is applicable for band combinations containing FR1 and FR2 bands. fr1 means for FR1 in FR1/FR2 mixed operation, and fr2 means for FR2 in FR1/FR2 mixed operation. ","paragraph_zero_based":2261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-DL-PRS-ResourceSetID","paragraph_zero_based":2263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-DL-PRS-ResourceSetID defines the identity of a DL-PRS Resource Set of a TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":2264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":2265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-ResourceSetID-r16 ::= INTEGER (0..nrMaxNumDL-PRS-ResourceSetsPerTRP-1-r16)","paragraph_zero_based":2267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":2269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-DL-PRS-TRP-TEG-Info","paragraph_zero_based":2271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-DL-PRS-TRP-TEG-Info is used by the location server to provide the association information of DL-PRS Resources with TRP Tx TEGs.","paragraph_zero_based":2272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":2273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-TRP-TEG-Info-r17 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxFreqLayers-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":2275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-TRP-TEG-InfoPerFreqLayer-r17","paragraph_zero_based":2276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-TRP-TEG-InfoPerFreqLayer-r17 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxTRPsPerFreq-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":2278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-TRP-TEG-InfoPerTRP-r17","paragraph_zero_based":2279}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ad5861da0dccef1291129531d32d787af0fd13713ef27f554120fd6d7dfa3c8b","original_member_sha256":"85e43ed4cce9951e9169dd51891e9ea74001bd66e886c9b8fd4a0c481e900934","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b0f33676a4370d0cf8d0fd2e7453e45535f190ae1edcdbd5b0ce3e239c8ff004","1585db0f3bca115de943aa3b515559f01b14bed6ce8ad72359af23da95458e95","9cf491f0b2ee6af063ec7ad3d05626da2df3b9ef15cc1995b0bb742be457f116","fcb51cc6b371dd1cf4cd8e6581aa3233cb485029fe2a4ebccb86461cfb25b895","30e78a8ec3c5283084a1c4b933742302816b39344f83317608327ef2c57458f7","7ae45ddc6e19485642315b0cfdcc206b9b833f3c0c362a66954f82f2488c37a4","16d5eb7902a57569cf4e979c6d0a550301fe3685a1e7a376b98221346a36b4f8","e773d8014c492cec270453534c2d0e76cfff8c1d61eb39c38fa385d17ec3899c","6a9c78bc1bf5d95b2df833d1ab095b7ef22282bd0693584700ea32eb3d0805c5","f601c99cd2a5417bc79b70672706400cbb8ad7ad48a17b4e690050e7ffc0447f","6d4b5d033add82e04afbd9d9fcf8e2f76844dbde1cc