{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-RTD-Info field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":2569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"referenceTRP-RTD-Info","paragraph_zero_based":2570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field defines the reference TRP for the RTD and comprises the following sub-fields:","paragraph_zero_based":2571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-dl-PRS-ID-Ref: This field is used along with a DL-PRS Resource Set ID and a DL-PRS Resources ID to uniquely identify a DL-PRS Resource, and is associated to the reference TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":2572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nr-PhysCellId-Ref: This field specifies the physical cell identity of the reference TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":2573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nr-CellGlobalId-Ref: This field specifies the NCGI, the globally unique identity of a cell in NR, of the reference TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":2574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nr-ARFCN-Ref: This field specifies the NR-ARFCN of the TRP's CD-SSB (as defined in TS 38.300 [47]) corresponding to nr-PhysCellID.","paragraph_zero_based":2575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-refTime: This field specifies the reference time at which the rtd-InfoList is valid. The systemFrameNumber choice refers to the SFN of the reference TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":2576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-rtd-RefQuality: This field specifies the quality of the timing of reference TRP, used to determine the RTD values provided in rtd-InfoList.","paragraph_zero_based":2577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dl-PRS-ID","paragraph_zero_based":2578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used along with a DL-PRS Resource Set ID and a DL-PRS Resources ID to uniquely identify a DL-PRS Resource. This ID can be associated with multiple DL-PRS Resource Sets associated with a single TRP for which the RTD-InfoElement is applicable.","paragraph_zero_based":2579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-PhysCellID","paragraph_zero_based":2580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the physical cell identity of the associated TRP for which the RTD-InfoElement is applicable, as defined in TS 38.331 [35].","paragraph_zero_based":2581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-CellGlobalID","paragraph_zero_based":2582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the NCGI, the globally unique identity of a cell in NR, of the associated TRP for which the RTD-InfoElement is applicable, as defined in TS 38.331 [35]. The server should include this field if it considers that it is needed to resolve ambiguity in the TRP indicated by nr-PhysCellID.","paragraph_zero_based":2583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-ARFCN","paragraph_zero_based":2584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the NR-ARFCN of the TRP's CD-SSB (as defined in TS 38.300 [47]) corresponding to nr-PhysCellID for which the RTD-InfoElement is applicable.","paragraph_zero_based":2585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subframeOffset","paragraph_zero_based":2586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the subframe boundary offset at the TRP antenna location between the reference TRP and this neighbour TRP in time units  where Δfmax=480∙103 Hz and  (TS 38.211 [41]).","paragraph_zero_based":2587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The offset is counted from the beginning of a subframe #0 of the reference TRP to the beginning of the closest subsequent subframe of this neighbour TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":2588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scale factor 1 Tc.","paragraph_zero_based":2589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rtd-Quality","paragraph_zero_based":2590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the quality of the RTD.","paragraph_zero_based":2591}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ad5861da0dccef1291129531d32d787af0fd13713ef27f554120fd6d7dfa3c8b","original_member_sha256":"85e43ed4cce9951e9169dd51891e9ea74001bd66e886c9b8fd4a0c481e900934","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["738810c3ea50db97b315bedf3fd99dcbf35de7d97fc8d4bd6d1d8eebf8edcebe","444a4e62d4e25c0c044db80eece8203aee93201d5f28f0e186f515d763b20fb1","f0fedb530864f073117106a2aea9a41e7a725ad0135c6b2202ed49a55e34a73d","ed43535543e53b25c6610eb3e3c671054c19bbf927cfcf657bea4d8af67c939d","191b080835dfe54ba462f139c8195ba5bc9f340744007fd166c0556b6ecd7b8a","98c92a5ae74397e8c58b2bd73368424ee609af769bdb9a3ea2eb3b529cbe3db5","c40c340a623b81b121079b8c0834f676822c9ee0c2e24ecc7805004e1442d7f6","09c9c719c8793e02985c2a685c9193675187c81252adb6a9754afb8a64032d45","f7c499e5eebdc997b5b2ec48ca6f5279b0d8190ea500fb78e6f76cd26492717e","5fd5997b59cc10a7cbaa325b639ab12ad511e221dd06f790457d5e6668f62049","02b308aeda30638ce6daead67da55f71d48232b86c0679e5e83c733276e8752d","c7571793904523ba83ce0a8260c7ed6567a01cfeb03f1eec1eb079baa9d91ae8","d47938b4ab028c96fcf167a37ea7e121e6d7eaad14ea159a6a03fe15fafac970","93280808d27df7c3f4edab3f045c94712f75ebe5bab8b903a51b449d793e75d0","bc671e1401dca295e202d2053cffba7b7b12ef1daadb633d6c9ca39e6f7daa71","2c8ed8626c83c6ebf636126a82a1ef8653f061f70cb416e486a3f6af98ea683f","b7725e04f4a1fe7cf511e467e5f88863f02ac5bf676f73a32c6ad94ea24f2ba0","81a8755dbee9e5ffabd7998d353777d2ebfb9b78dd686f501a432a2b3a8d5b36","9eeff2a4d9e508be25572b3351b449aa272c12077a443ad9ad0357b124fa09ea","4393114a5c2dd6a554b417eda408901211d73d614078443b439453ea1170fd3a","58e87bf225e5a9d20b9a833154fd966839ef1e671d9d739565b87d5b949b863b","31b0bb080a89349055bf85fddea6a1f194af44a709e705f4753fe29c8bc63202","7c046abe44533d200ed460ee5888a4d28054d19accec6b49a7cf394cfe846cb4","5c2eb3156dc3decc65eb922ed0f5bb5b8d4e1939a05dfaba127ba9dd9475feb3"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2568,25