{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cartesianCoordinatesUnits ","paragraph_zero_based":3192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the units and scale factor for the x-value, y-value and z-value fields. Enumerated values mm, cm, dm, and m, correspond to 10-3 metre, 10-2 metre, 10-1 metre and 1 metres, respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":3193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"x-value ","paragraph_zero_based":3194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the x-value of the desired location in a Cartesian coordinate system and comprises the following sub-fields:","paragraph_zero_based":3195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-delta-x specifies the delta value on the x-axis of a Cartesian coordinate system in the unit provided in cartesian-coordinates-units field.","paragraph_zero_based":3196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-coarse-delta-x specifies the delta value on the x-axis of a Cartesian coordinate system in 1024 times the size of the unit provided in cartesian-coordinates-units field and with the same sign as in the delta-x field. If this field is absent, the value for coarse-delta-x is zero.","paragraph_zero_based":3197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"I.e., the full x-value is given by:","paragraph_zero_based":3198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(delta-x × cartesian-coordinates-units) ± (coarse-delta-x × 1024 × cartesian-coordinates-units) [m].","paragraph_zero_based":3199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"y-value ","paragraph_zero_based":3200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the y-value of the desired location in a Cartesian coordinate system and comprises the following sub-fields:","paragraph_zero_based":3201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-delta-y specifies the delta value on the y-axis of a Cartesian coordinate system in the unit provided in cartesian-coordinates-units field.","paragraph_zero_based":3202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-coarse-delta-y specifies the delta value on the y-axis of a Cartesian coordinate system in 1024 times the size of the unit provided in cartesian-coordinates-units field and with the same sign as in the delta-y field. If this field is absent, the value for coarse-delta-y is zero.","paragraph_zero_based":3203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"I.e., the full y-value is given by:","paragraph_zero_based":3204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(delta-y × cartesian-coordinates-units) ± (coarse-delta-y × 1024 × cartesian-coordinates-units) [m].","paragraph_zero_based":3205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"z-value ","paragraph_zero_based":3206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the z-value of the desired location in a Cartesian coordinate system and comprises the following sub-fields:","paragraph_zero_based":3207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-delta-z specifies the delta value on the z-axis of a Cartesian coordinate system in the unit provided in cartesian-coordinates-units field.","paragraph_zero_based":3208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-coarse-delta-z specifies the delta value on the z-axis of a Cartesian coordinate system in 1024 times the size of the unit provided in cartesian-coordinates-units field and with the same sign as in the delta-z field. If this field is absent, the value for coarse-delta-z is zero.","paragraph_zero_based":3209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"I.e., the full z-value is given by:","paragraph_zero_based":3210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(delta-z × cartesian-coordinates-units) ± (coarse-delta-z × 1024 × cartesian-coordinates-units) [m].","paragraph_zero_based":3211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"locationUNC","paragraph_zero_based":3212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the uncertainty of the location coordinates (see IE RelativeLocation).","paragraph_zero_based":3213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If this field is absent, the uncertainty is the same as for the associated reference point location.","paragraph_zero_based":3214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ad5861da0dccef1291129531d32d787af0fd13713ef27f554120fd6d7dfa3c8b","original_member_sha256":"85e43ed4cce9951e9169dd51891e9ea74001bd66e886c9b8fd4a0c481e900934","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a89ad8f929ff6fa94b13549d1cc381ff6f14e949a23d7fac5b5abcd408ce7f3e","1f40c3121186dc4ba608b997ed7ca3a6e24f1818ba78fde53f177b77d20c9115","741f690b515aa366bcf8c6c74de1343a3781a466fc4246f2bdbdd80c39d65436","211cdafdf7c23608908a843961002a6e94129bcdafbea6de3ebee87901bb5559","cc89830dcbf5a4cedb4616f8094bbd7c513695cf1e9e058b2b804bb7ad18c54a","4e0ff0e0b050539d15d330e80761fe331a2a252b38ce3f81bdaa985f895bc440","eef3140a79e455e827b1970193fa487d3ed0b126871422f54da289d2182217e7","50c91570382a423ae381297a6cbbb18a17bd0e066aff7be7a8c1e4bc5ac67383","0537e272529d0b3ee23413dd705ede9c63faa83a190271aa2eaa6d7d05d74dec","4c0595f82e40eea0450e18ed3d7a76fc957e47274951bdbc376da91409996692","a6ab6d40d2a81d829ee764e70885729b0750a1aa80a18ef968a81e25618a43f8","9082c7ecf0c1c6ea91fade2ddb3b11f78b1f20c6c95be62a68c5563e0b919829","25f70d7fc904d5c3e8849b38cd9b9126a6595f7e7f51cc6ffbecf1df07b268ef","3fde127a0dd6947f59cd3246b95f9f9ec24cb59c6a717112d89e3b5e6c5a2552","12407e669f5a99047d9dce58b96ce3541a4eae3ae7027a2ed548df207f8372bc","a200c1f7c1a7d59b3882060e47cc12470de3b9dbf12e368892099f938a6f50c8","d19b4858c95e58a5c454c99fc28865349f5ecb04a0d247a37407aa32af5abeeb","2f1f7420470f351538809b5cfe50138024538e0706eeddc7155be8e5717e61e7","af23c6021c637754b9a98348ca801ca570a104da475c8584f2254bfe89ccc821","c9ad0ff24c71217e096b6122a086347c85a354779fe17595c8da7e8dea537dcd","7dcd006bf7f1eef841c20cd4e1b5021febaee7f9735056a89ee2804f2dbedddb","4f2732f4e6b58