videCapabilities field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":3355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-TDOA-Mode","paragraph_zero_based":3356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the NR DL-TDOA mode(s) supported by the target device.","paragraph_zero_based":3357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicalReporting","paragraph_zero_based":3358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, specifies the positioning modes for which the target device supports periodicalReporting. This is represented by a bit string, with a onevalue at the bit position means periodicalReporting for the positioning mode is supported; a zerovalue means not supported. If this field is absent, the target device does not support periodicalReporting in CommonIEsRequestLocationInformation.","paragraph_zero_based":3359}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ad5861da0dccef1291129531d32d787af0fd13713ef27f554120fd6d7dfa3c8b","original_member_sha256":"85e43ed4cce9951e9169dd51891e9ea74001bd66e886c9b8fd4a0c481e900934","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b74653be3ad8388803958cf91787ec7cc9a70398bc3f4c6eda61734cacf28fdd","da8319c342b9118d0505c0767b1ca39c0212b5fb59df67f251d008cda09c31c4","190309e3de8384e1e3735bacb61cf1ac4a5661fd296a148061e9379198dfd92c","c4150820564e0ca90ba48815a29f682367ddcc2d7be66a7ec5b51f49b8a18687","6eecd8448a651b6a2990c290dbaa774da591864e123428533fd5585c0d6530f9","8952b0a94186c67b885c22aacdaca3857f774791b35b3b04f7432418e7762cb2","9bc6e6decfd86c96734d4b266f04b994f3602fda2e2e9eed7a88c281ed27db87","295129be51798b9271d39b0438957d694c03a3a20ade6add97b42cfd0875c255","83bc4f402708fe96125e32d8632a53759ca1b20f9e5df468e569dfa9d8dad35e","cf2ecee61fe2c2462dfc116bad5b003a500d95baceb2a80b88f18ab0031708b8","f3911e6f9792b3abd9c2fed98ebe57d3d03b76c32d0a76f3c60a748cffdd202d","09d1c7c1aa57004386e1a981f12ba8e5650a65586338fa986af871a6037dff82","e76cd60db5bdfab9b4463ff8a5d75f7b4aa45bad3f9ffb674347e290e639c7e0","ce8f26acba86e22d26f353417b41187b070261324d5efab2bd88a24596afe1d0","e0f7f05aa03fcc7c0863de5e413e8fb2137170bae34a985a96729d8ab727cbe9","001e29789c0c8fd5d8f5c9c4238f6872c96513a9b4ff168040b9594d449f83a4","3d51586e8fe2907842abcc71f4ebcc215cf9798d4e44fc0a4fee62c7b4d488df","669ac17bb53f7419cf27c2f77f6feb284bef6caea04cc53c085700ebc3506f41","68947cf717d17513b3060e99c4e922f4b58c81c2d26af122684347ec0c0f54ad","c97c7748ed5b79febfb0eb25a9bf0ddd0a45bbe74d76d3b5c9771695839016f4","6528f97b16313fe5ed2516b3ee1dbdabf504232823b21b7cccf9c44c90b5df14","7f66decfab5a59f12373d863bdcea73cfe55b8cccc6b7679e25d2a15fe9b8255","32d5cb9d8c5d953db9889dbb4966d6c16cd4477053460e37631b78d3fa0dd188","ecdb5a285672e81e44562f127ca0dd306d13dfb2511b70811c0225265dc3f291"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3336,3359],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx:p3336"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ten-ms-unit-ResponseTime","paragraph_zero_based":3360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, specifies the positioning modes for which the target device supports the enumerated value 'ten-milli-seconds' in the IE ResponseTime in IE CommonIEsRequestLocationInformation. This is represented by a bit string, with a onevalue at the bit position means 'ten-milli-seconds' response time unit for the positioning mode is supported; a zerovalue means not supported. If this field is absent, the target device does not support 'ten-milli-seconds' response time unit in CommonIEsRequestLocationInformation.","paragraph_zero_based":3361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-PosCalcAssistanceSupport","paragraph_zero_based":3362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the Position Calculation Assistance Data supported by the target device for UE-based DL-TDOA. This is represented by a bit string, with a onevalue at the bit position means the particular assistance data is supported; a zerovalue means not supported.","paragraph_zero_based":3363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-bit 0 indicates whether the field nr-TRP-LocationInfo in IE NR-PositionCalculationAssistance is supported or not;","paragraph_zero_based":3364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-bit 1 indicates whether the field nr-DL-PRS-BeamInfo in IE NR-PositionCalculationAssistance is supported or not;","paragraph_zero_based":3365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-bit 2 indicates whether the field nr-RTD-Info in IE NR-PositionCalculationAssistance is supported or not;","paragraph_zero_based":3366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-bit 3 indicates whether the field nr-DL-PRS-TRP-TEG-Info in IE NR-PositionCalculationAssistance is supported or not. The UE can indicate this bit only if the UE supports prs-ProcessingCapabilityBandList and any of maxNrOfDL-PRS-ResourceSetPerTrpPerFrequencyLayer, maxNrOfTRP-AcrossFreqs, maxNrOfPosLayer, maxNrOfDL-PRS-ResourcesPerResourceSet and maxNrOfDL-PRS-ResourcesPerPositioningFrequencylayer. Otherwise, the UE does not include this field.","paragraph_zero_based":3367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-los-nlos-AssistanceDataSupport","paragraph_zero_based":3368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device supports the NR-DL-PRS-ExpectedLOS-NLOS-Assistance in IE NR-PositionCalculationAssistance:","paragraph_zero_based":3369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-type indicates whether the target device supports 'hard' value or 'hard' and 'soft' value in LOS-NLOS-Indicator in IE NR-DL-PRS-ExpectedLOS-NLOS-Assistance.","paragraph_zero_based":3370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-granularity indicates whether the target device supports nr-los-nlos-indicator in IE NR-DL-PRS-ExpectedLOS-NLOS-Assistance 'per-trp', 'per-resource', or both.","paragraph_zero_based":3371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE can include this field only if the UE supports one of maxDL-PRS-RSRP-MeasurementFR1, maxDL-PRS-RSRP-MeasurementFR2, dl-RSTD-MeasurementPerPairOfTRP-FR1, dl-RSTD-MeasurementPerPairOfTRP-FR2, maxNrOfRx-TX-MeasFR1, maxNrOfRx-TX-MeasFR2, supportOfRSRP-MeasFR1 and supportOfRSRP-MeasFR2. Otherwise, the UE does not include this field.","paragraph_zero_based":3372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:A single value is reported when both Multi-RTT and DL-TDOA are supported.","paragraph_zero_based":3373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-ExpectedAoD-or-AoA-Sup","paragraph_zero_based":3374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device supports the NR-DL-PRS-ExpectedAoD-or-AoA in NR-DL-PRS-AssistanceData.","paragraph_zero_based":3375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-TDOA-On-Demand-DL-PRS-Support","paragraph_zero_based":3376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device supports on-demand DL-PRS requests. ","paragraph_zero_based":3377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-los-nlos-IndicatorSupport","paragraph_zero_based":3378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device supports nr-los-nlos-Indicator reporting in IE NR-DL-TDOA-SignalMeasurementInformation.","paragraph_zero_based":3379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-type indicates whether the target device supports 'hard' value or 'hard' and 'soft' value in IE LOS-NLOS-Indicator.","paragraph_zero_based":3380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-granularity indicates whether the target device supports LOS-NLOS-Indicator reporting per TRP, per DL-PRS Resource, or both.","paragraph_zero_based":3381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"additionalPathsExtSupport","paragraph_zero_based":3382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device supports the nr-AdditionalPathListExt reporting in IE NR-DL-TDOA-SignalMeasurementInformation. The enumerated value indicates the number of additional paths supported by the target device.","paragraph_zero_based":3383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ad5861da0dccef1291129531d32d787af0fd13713ef27f554120fd6d7dfa3c8b","original_member_sha256":"85e43ed4cce9951e9169dd51891e9ea74001bd66e886c9b8fd4a0c481e900934","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["de9234a7bc590b6ada7b807350f225471253b98a7a59ebaa6a159256a7912127","b5cbe34f9956474081d2928a4251521d6c25497dda580289dbe652ae4d549382","9adf09008956877d92fb44100c8c13725160ae559d2041fd464798650be861ab","b4e3cb8ab1755d50b2256e78433bc2db11f777feaf035c722d6dd76248c3d3ec","0574c4a7378aa5d4c992beecee92507067af7f968e8f87b434bdbc736dab3d3c","254d8e273ab14f0cc7dd863c853a15000c933f16759d7130d54bc4d3150019f4","5e3ef3df7abd1fa684b662229983dbcf0d78a88632c846c188da800154275794","68a0dbb1fbcaeb400deffb16ea50111ee528ae45aaaaeedac61cb0f067388966","dbd3d799c11a2ebce59abdaf18c4757281f8dbed571d0b1a5c67f488dfe842f7","e5527d5f3318095f7600710eca8a3f0d83a4e4bc436210e3789a75061ebff488","ec14e7d3c59a0f52baa68aee8068d2b8ee29df799893bc8020017fe75ea129ec","fcedd69b22e9de9de001f0dbb68743ed40ce8c3c9808e39e3aa4e0dec4e6eed1","191842e46938db772b9751042343998997a754b5e1388608fbf1669b796bb8e7","cdb19be77f6c308d8e2d94eea66210af3cd2d429682936daa5c9f43ed25aab5b","bd39853a57b9d8a1ea2543f12b44b19836a2ba40e89b8d2e44ab047a33b1da98","b9958ec3132b49dee6db363ad9a63f98caff22af54ccb409859bd32251eff71f","33dcde0fe1cd54a5756ba8a3dd3799123f4142ed3393e254856698dbc2f18f34","f521db4f0a42d9d040685f4a5f0b4483332a4018381bd7c310391390d1b61ed5","6398bab052aabd2263f4f3e841addf2b68c48396da55648b3bdc5d9d642f9b37","25d13b13633f33470ba855c01bbe62857b04e4c99f8f3567be0135e85e5e40b8","2c1f01396fb4d66d861a876fe58afce3609f7d908c8cf0a147d1f133bea12141","9a967a7ecbac4c8e0546bcdf3b676dc39b5b71ea7e0a4cea4b939c92fb500594","b5669d8b04fffa6d22d9faffa972714f221917881a591bee02f89a1c4dc82015","eac73c0dcdb8540095b248aad8ddbb268126215b8fbc9dc05908351f533a5a1e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3360,3383],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx:p3360"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2305891.zip::R2-2305891_(LPP CR on local coordinates)_v01.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The supportOfDL-PRS-FirstPathRSRP in IE NR-DL-TDOA-MeasurementCapability also applies to the additional paths.","paragraph_zero_based":3385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scheduledLocationRequestSupported","paragraph_zero_based":3386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, specifies the positioning modes for which the target device supports scheduled location requests – i.e., supports the IE ScheduledLocationTime in IE CommonIEsRequestLocationInformation – and the time base(s) supported for the scheduled location time for each positioning mode. If this field is absent, the target device does not support scheduled location requests.","paragraph_zero_based":3387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-dl-prs-AssistanceDataValidity","paragraph_zero_based":3388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device supports validity conditions for pre-configured assistance data and comprises the following subfields:","paragraph_zero_based":3389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-area-validity indicates that the target device supports pre-configured assistance data with area validity. The integer number indicates the maximum number of areas the target device supports.","paragraph_zero_based":3390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"multiMeasInSameMeasReport","paragraph_zero_based":3391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device supports multiple measurement instances in a single measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":3392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mg-ActivationRequest","paragraph_zero_based":3393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, if present, indicates that the target device supports low latency measurement gap activation request for DL-PRS measurements. The UE can include this field only if the UE supports mg-ActivationRequestPRS-Meas and mg-ActivationCommPRS-Meas defined in TS 38.331 [35].","paragraph_zero_based":3394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"locationCoordinateTypes","paragraph_zero_based":3395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the geographical location coordinate types that a target device supports for UE-based DL-TDOA. TRUE indicates that a location coordinate type is supported and FALSE that it is not.","paragraph_zero_based":3396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.5.11.6NR DL-AoD Capability Information","paragraph_zero_based":3398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-DL-AoD-ProvideCapabilities","paragraph_zero_based":3399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-DL-AoD-ProvideCapabilities is used by the target device to indicate its capability to support NR DL-AoD and to provide its NR DL-AoD positioning capabilities to the location server.","paragraph_zero_based":3400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":3401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-AoD-ProvideCapabilities-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":3403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-AoD-Mode-r16PositioningModes,","paragraph_zero_based":3404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-AoD-PRS-Capability-r16NR-DL-PRS-ResourcesCapability-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":3405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-AoD-MeasurementCapability-r16NR-DL-AoD-MeasurementCapability-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":3406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-QCL-ProcessingCapability-r16NR-DL-PRS-QCL-ProcessingCapability-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":3407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordi