cx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306025.zip::R2-2306025 LPPmisc.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The defintion of area for preconfigured assistance data is not clear. If NW configures the same cell in different area, then a UE camped in that cell would have ambiguity as which AD is valid in that area. Hence, clarification is needed that a cell is included in only one area.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Currently, there is no field description for the nr-DL-PRS-PrioResourceSetID and nr-DL-PRS-PrioResourceID. Instead, the field description for dl-PRS-ResourcePrioritySubset is provided but dl-PRS-ResourcePrioritySubset is not defined as field. It is difficult to search for the field description defintion and does not reflect the ASN.1","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Further the field description of nr-DL-PRS-ResourceID is missing.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"868ffca525350b8cd9caaa00570962f5727a78ecfae70a062dbe5b906554f4e0","original_member_sha256":"8bf312286b6c91504c27741e192315ccdaf2e929a04539394e9021924ef2f9c2","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["18a6a564b777716054d9af696eaf39fc17c8b59995c047767d7560af4c1f43aa","b3d61a6b054f522eab59c3f9c27438b8a5f713ab98d4d83d3d1b986c80484244","9c31067b906f6707d0242637e940f657509be056f4df897fdca7c81d3f30b8a4","717d59cd3d57237f06580fcaf1844edbabd7ca4103712d7d4ea219dfdcb075c7","5fe00cbfd9d5128f22f9f01fb7382fec8650dd40ef724824491798186003a81a","1126b85574f90d6d073b96725ce7a6ef4101e2182cef4fe5380ac6c9af085743","191dd336d2e58cd16868a5ef0389bf91cbc2556a354fa90cdb54ea16a0aa8fd4","4942c52a3f959bf3082c17bdf8cbddec8ffafc2331cebab29ab7df0bf44bb0b0","8716091f6d492e4399d019c9a982f4f6a9ba491362773162f2cf92e62ed574ae","9bff720ffe9f4b6dcd3dfecd202a0912e3aa918d002024b6194dd7b879e51ee1","da3be81f0e3296ac6247cd11fae8073204121d2c02420ee9607bf75ebc2164ba","9194fe123617dcb49d8176c7dfbaa9e87057cbb7adb6f9ea9552f1630958ffc4","f6d6c6e3