"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)...Rel-15(Release 15)Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sub-clause 5.3.7.2 had following statements: ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"There two terms are used:","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The difference between the above two terms is that the UE in case (1) still has a PC5-RRC connection with a L2 U2N Relay UE, while the UE in case (2) has no PC5-RRC connection with the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sub-clause 5.8.9.3 specifies sidelink radio link failure related actions as below: ","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c1ed42b119e148cbb57fcea39491d4da5b78930bc8a6166f3f3e3aba27e25a2c","original_member_sha256":"f3afebf4757d0143b195626e6dcb6201bb479e0a62fc2aa634fb9db81c094386","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["748e0c4270ffd4b9f7174cc66c4e926f6d2c74554f86d41416ed4b833cfcbdd6","b247c4f6fc8a5366d31066a531949c9528a6a6673d3558c0b63492603afb4212","c08f2f13497b7bbbc5c71cde4fcb60f0f8befe62fefa62952ee4798f881a0506","2c6f78ffa7a89367b1f32e55d701ab36962636531e0a1ce22b4f18982c6a99e4","bcd1338599625ff399e929ee8ab90512f6ba58bc6c8d01485cec8f49f4ff0952","7081bfa4b06294c01bdfe48f8abdefe2e226acc593fd1764a8194897652f0eea","a90a2c8d67fe66c88c706d5287d65951a17a14146427ee9c01ced3824a316250","addea5542b1f91343e87529a7cf2af8680d411c70b6ea9c7cd03459a8a01a0c6","4095a5b5daa6e1f97b02f8f006b3cb8c65fe3480f873ab5f0d9a4c864aacfffe","6bb9170db45e10d2b6d05d5b2a1e4f5d337e517aaf775712106f77d022980c6f","b2b1bbad640efb8ff9864b350d582fc49d847de96f33a7142239bf2b9bc93ec9","8e4e41fa2629afd12fb3bec85f4f40ecccd6a1432e42519655a50154976ac833","088d4523c68b3d814e992725736afc376f56e9acff649263ec5f4cd8185c3c42","5ec2d0ba8f4a04db1c12bd7c6296d74aa6e03bd437c43fb04b9f32eb91785e4d","a1edfc84073fbe7700fb7a9f2f7510fd9c64894d25afd117a8087593ea34aff4","a316c33fff6b08a83feaae7c055f15b42a6cb87d5ab0faeef5ee854d8fb28166","4c41bb1481a22b23abd02b33057761affc4857794a31e0e5a0cad55148e41139","359c9d0ccd50881d8704bb8e4500423b14daa072620b8960b2138c8166da6cd4","4469b64984a5666878fe2014bb246e2d26c0ed89766306a579a8672728df127b","bf93eeee25317dded86e0de4620eb6224e9c76669d9fbf792bf19ab041c47c8b","c956dfee76a4d7c75541a4fbef667e50b95811a60a34b57e47910e57df2b8e50","a93bf8bbf1a7d48a25442778e0f81ecee015f540bb46fc1831cfa92323a9973d","0a94e1f3affd64a57910faac88a78d76ede0b49cf0435a6131c68d66650f5d69","1e21b51936d9e4749861db086fac37b31344f2545875a8f2dc0c94009b7c5f8a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the PC5-RRC connection is released for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE for the destination:","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<omitted>","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"After the sidelink radio link failure has been detected for this destination, the UE shall consider the PC5-RRC connection is released for the destination. However, the first term is still used after the PC5-RRC connection is released for the destination. R2-2303922 in RAN2#121b was raised for addressing this issue, but the Rapporteur suggested to change “if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE for the destination” to “if the UE was acting as L2 U2N Remote UE for the destination” and come to it in this meeting.","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"On the other hand, some editorial corrections in clause 5.8.3.2 and clause 5.8.6.1 are proposed.","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In sub-clause 5.8.9.3, the term “the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE” is modified as “the UE was acting as L2 U2N Remote UE”.","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In sub-clause 5.8.3.2, the term “in case L2 U2N relay operation” is modified as “in case of L2 U2N relay operation”.","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In sub-clause 5.8.6.1, the statement “The purpose of this procedure is to select a synchronisation reference and used when transmitting NR sidelink communication/discovery” is modified as “The purpose of this procedure is to select a synchronisation reference and the procedure is used when transmitting NR sidelink communication/discovery”.","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality(ies): ","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink radio link failure related actions","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink UE information for NR sidelink communication/discovery","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink synchronisation reference","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: ","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to this CR but the peer UE is not, there is no inter-operability issue foreseen.","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c1ed42b119e148cbb57fcea39491d4da5b78930bc8a6166f3f3e3aba27e25a2c","original_member_sha256":"f3afebf4757d0143b195626e6dcb6201bb479e0a62fc2aa634fb9db81c094386","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3b6f6804041d9d0e87edf7a2c42b1257df13154801abee8ac21567ab4b1fe6d1","130525c0d40aa023b85e9c8bac69beed6347b5bfda5e171b10fa2ffe57733d93","cffa0c95db45359c5a778922a79d7f85f105a26a0226a40d7ca2f9ce3f695245","dc277c7a166a62881f3892403f11317f0aea5dba85ac2d40744a36b72499cef2","fe835cdadf