{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"* * * Start of 1st Change * * * *","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.3Sidelink radio link failure related actions","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon indication from sidelink RLC entity that the maximum number of retransmissions for a specific destination has been reached; or","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T400 expiry for a specific destination; or","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon indication from MAC entity that the maximum number of consecutive HARQ DTX for a specific destination has been reached; or","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from sidelink PDCP entity concerning SL-SRB2 or SL-SRB3 for a specific destination:","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider sidelink radio link failure to be detected for this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the DRBs of this destination, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SRBs of this destination, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PC5 Relay RLC channels of this destination if configured, in according to clause 5.8.9.7.1;","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the NR sidelink communication related configuration of this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the sidelink specific MAC of this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the PC5-RRC connection is released for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate the release of the PC5-RRC connection to the upper layers for this destination (i.e. PC5 is unavailable);","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE was acting as L2 U2N Remote UE for the destination:","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the RRC connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7.","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the sidelink UE information for NR sidelink communication procedure, as specified in 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:It is up to UE implementation on whether and how to indicate to upper layers to maintain the keep-alive procedure [55].","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"* * * Start of 2nd Change * * * *","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.3.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c1ed42b119e148cbb57fcea39491d4da5b78930bc8a6166f3f3e3aba27e25a2c","original_member_sha256":"f3afebf4757d0143b195626e6dcb6201bb479e0a62fc2aa634fb9db81c094386","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["98f0ee3fbac2d3004f7180a429ed4025f684d06ebcb98400798c140599585086","9d36b67ef842d69acbce26c3a01dfdecad997ca57bd80ed678e2599feb81759b","8d2a27f50b266efce8fcebda1a95b657cfac4577510958a63e0a5ce9ea8cba3c","babd85036598c8fb5175b900f3d2eed7dedcec361cb7bc3d11ddb7ddda703e25","bf6e3196852fcbac8bfc0c61cdda73278ef43cc8fe6b048a118c185702417b86","dff1321f4b0d0cb95a73c92457c480c81fdc2aaa60beb61c92d62ba52286c3ed","89b6aad0737388951c59858abb318c8b3bb11781331af7b538e4d0244a8a9d73","b49d85366db020639c05077476bb7bd74d35c9c12c6503b9f759ba4334c5c23d","a66b15916fb1804cd26b84e2c3766984ebab79ceb440e8b8f5e5a9cd45625073","d1bdcbb50590a6ea3338dced827ed549d86d173234cb0382eeb5fae870eb7e6e","55610c48d416d3fe9dc112bb1e568ace503d866b661d8c15b92176fc756ca7f1","3c74d8cdcfa7a813e01e9d4df48b301793f73c7c43cf3b019e63d0e03df238d2","15a348970b261b1ad94e138414eb105c1588d9f9e24c58868c37a52f2aee23a0","712102d035f2d5f50b016a0fe59e4898de65579d3b585bebce80599cebd6c01c","2889fc558e54a51a62b4a32fc5c44b101f623d10c04f2e45ecb7fb79841d76c3","27285632d7023034fa069a478d8cd0551d93dea6712889ba6e28bdc55dcf9ce6","3a705442d6f9705c8f8c3cec4ced2bcc21bb4a2fd1e076ebf1e0720ee18b4be6","88ec40e0ac8017e7a3d6a520e6b961eff519dedc18d9d71c52deb93945532438","054c476f21a0a7562d9a408ed727e8fc5b533af7020e36fb54ba9d9c6d5cc833","75bd1abca1775f3a32081a8607024e093c14b4f2a5e389efb178cd81c4e3fc25","cda5fe6b5ae15d6cc2e879b172175240918ccf6b54eef77b8926b5cab0bdf2f3","3412718bde295cf0a839e62cd7792f144a73e4c5b210a710cd5d00a605e590ea","e11030dbd2750ee2dbdcbd886be45c45958449b3a8688b531d92df1eb640657b","49d61f3f61824ecfbddc020fc588b711751436c97f55157f9ea527142ab9b03a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink communication or NR sidelink discovery or NR sidelink U2N relay operation that is in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure to indicate it is (interested in) receiving or transmitting NR sidelink communication or NR sidelink discovery or NR sidelink U2N relay operation in several cases including upon successful connection establishment or resuming, upon change of interest, upon changing QoS profile(s), upon receiving UECapabilityInformationSidelink from the associated peer UE, upon RLC mode information updated from the associated peer UE or upon change to a PCell providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR. A UE capable of NR sidelink communication may initiate the procedure to request assignment of dedicated sidelink DRB configuration and transmission resources for NR sidelink communication transmission. A UE capable of NR sidelink communication may initiate the procedure to report to the network that a sidelink radio link failure or sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure has been declared. A UE capable of NR sidelink discovery may initiate the procedure to request assignment of dedicated resources for NR sidelink discovery transmission or NR sidelink discovery reception. A UE capable of U2N relay operation may initiate the procedure to report/update parameters for acting as U2N Relay UE or U2N Remote UE (including L2 Remote UE's source L2 ID).","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink operation that is in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure to report the sidelink DRX configuration received from the associated peer UE for NR sidelink unicast reception, upon accepting the sidelink DRX configuration from the associated peer UE. A UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig and is performing sidelink unicast transmission may initiate the procedure to report the sidelink DRX assistance information or the sidelink DRX configuration reject information received from the associated peer UE, upon receiving either of them from the associated peer UE. A UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig and is performing sidelink groupcast transmission may initiate the procedure to report the sidelink DRX on/off indication for the associated Destination Layer-2 ID.","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink operation that is in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure to report the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile(s) associated with its interested service(s) that sidelink DRX is applied, for NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception.","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating this procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR is provided by the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ensure having a valid version of SIB12 for the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxInterestedFreqList; or if the frequency configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink communication on has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink communication reception frequency of interest in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxInterestedFreqList:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it is no longer interested in NR sidelink communication reception in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to transmit non-relay NR sidelink communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqList; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink communication transmission resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqList:","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink communication transmission resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3.","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to receive NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-NonRelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c1ed42b119e148cbb57fcea39491d4da5b78930bc8a6166f3f3e3aba27e25a2c","original_member_sha256":"f3afebf4757d0143b195626e6dcb6201bb479e0a62fc2aa634fb9db81c094386","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d4b675db94067b46c3985e880f3380e8f79f301d6067fc7b4e7e5a9f8401794f","65e219f91ffacccc5b3af5095b6a510e1c480cf7eba9239c1140ab53aa127d5b","57c4fe789771dd089f169536f12dce244a4ede98b993a52845a799ece9f9bdca","a34e89e5287d8f9ca2d43d62472953c7901021393286d26e198f13009a993247","43a1d3c321ecff1b24d49dcbf4aff831ce16d2529d7ab06f6a05c55d2a7b72af","9180f19ad22cd580a4f191f68402e675705484c7aa7bb1fa3188480a75eaade7","703cd56a2de4da80ac43951d0f10cc9d07242606bfdd0babb56c1e8e8c285aeb","6bfef7cb96f4ca6b13bf3358895f8c505c731d6ae6e03a8715ab243733d28b22","2cbe4b354f34b2df07213dd73a92f1285a8343f44496ea1cd525ea03732cc130","4b872fd4e90d8b624b78fd995a3f61af18599ef9974f7a2f5a0a6c268c534ff3","e72b15aa3db9f31fcb8bc17384ca03b577a8e94418cf96c91480504edf28b89d","c45394343ad