{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay; or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case of L2 U2N relay operation or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqListDisc; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqListDisc has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met; or","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink relay discovery messages resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink relay discovery messages resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case of L2 U2N relay operation or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message; or if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met; or","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink relay communication transmission resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay or sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink relay communication transmission resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink reception on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell and if sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC is included in SIB12-IEs:","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE received a sidelink DRX configuration in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message for NR sidelink unicast reception from the associated peer UE and the UE accepted the sidelink DRX configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c1ed42b119e148cbb57fcea39491d4da5b78930bc8a6166f3f3e3aba27e25a2c","original_member_sha256":"f3afebf4757d0143b195626e6dcb6201bb479e0a62fc2aa634fb9db81c094386","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["00236ff391a8f0150336dd023f6ca9a018137fee666a6a4c162612e7d567564d","83a5227568e91dd85db44fd08d8db128ac5b72562abfe6ad7bec90a010ef909b","ea6f3ee85e98fe9c338d7aa1a05f8c7c952234181d8268f3452531e741635f2b","fe7d3a829a30299bbc5f2f0eb879f9f00cb6b5cd0f34fc7b5753026ea034d028","a8b348be1946a18da75a759c652b86ba6985542366e1fec5fcaabbac9cd3f0ed","4f8fdb3dc358cf48458e22b0e3329b51c4d2b02e7cb3b96a08e604ea802fbc72","4a60c19de5d0b5d453dfbd9c9667cd4d731cf8aa1f9d765a2af63e7f58b43ba1","6da35c353412f69b317633f83cd71031b4e0758843438e9aa0d4a53c06cfb56f","67081794a377445f7eb3ab874ada68c03d4102c9abb55f2a56b55dfe15e7f02b","6c1f0937e807570881f35b4cbb10eefaaa1c2a8f1b6bbe69e9e02042104a9696","258339ee370a4da0d8099753c1f84d522f19b05181d92bc22883ef81cac00613","5cf407ac9fce5e7c7a02c4551318b778f770ad18043bd9de284d934cfedd34da","9a94cb981649cce7b08b56c2aba9d56e5c7c19ecbc7425198829bac630b70c6e","4291974e5ac726f30ff748cc9730624c8b295f521e43ceb6ca0b405caeca9b6e","807bb62202140f5cce44a8433130f993b53e3884aa211cfe3b30b2ee06d28aa4","9f7668bd6ff268990786f69a6ee608ec80fea2a3bbd66c4074c5b8e9220ec9db","fa9a8cdc0a675bfe3d3a5df9b8167e376d5282935aeff86cffe74c5a41024ee0","87c8d0695c4e84d4a3d37dacc1631a1d9cc0ba7d3f01ddc4242ea34ff5cdae92","cff6a2026234136efa3e7ccda521eb7d0516b9e7f4e4fc47103947f87ca4b9d6","c5c392061bf3d6ce639b3c80c56585f23a30824c82821eb24100051b5a118961","33db38e104a68bf9d694460f3e974fa8ea7e9f25bd0fe438498f1b43ce00f255","ce6b40141cd68e00f37d7e64423a627ee07d6f08e7ddfdf4db28ac131b535a58","85002340ed1d21ce8fd6a23c0ee2fcd1308b4dc2d37c5a7588e3ecfa7a8aa061","6328e7519e7803365b9465432bcbf91146fe55f1ca442305049a0e5039ef70b6"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx:p216"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306115.zip::R2-2306115_Corrections on L2 U2N Relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxDRX-ReportList; or if the information carried by sl-RxDRX-ReportList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the sidelink DRX configuration in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxDRX-ReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the sidelink DRX configuration is no longer used in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception and is interested in a service that sidelink DRX is applied:","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList; or if the information carried by sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile(s) associated with the service(s) in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList:","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it is no longer interested in the service that sidelink DRX is applied in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink transmission on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell and if sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC is included in SIB12-IEs and if the UE is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE received a sidelink DRX assistance information or a sidelink DRX configuration reject information from the associated peer UE for NR sidelink unicast transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-DRX-InfoFromRxList or sl-FailureList; or if the information carried by sl-DRX-InfoFromRxList or sl-FailureList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the sidelink DRX assistance information or the sidelink DRX configuration reject information in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink groupcast transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-DRX-Indication; or if the information carried by sl-DRX-Indication has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report sidelink DRX on/off indication for the corresponding destination in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c1ed42b119e148cbb57fcea39491d4da5b78930bc8a6166f3f3e3aba27e25a2c","original_member_sha256":"f3afebf4757d0143b195626e6dcb6201bb479e0a62fc2aa634fb9db81c094386","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["22f5b33b8fa6089693ce3b0976cbb58d52ecc4692b9e1bcc4663f62eae2358de","8d626e18baae06adb2a97d1260a399fa437b25263e9c1b7da2252d1c6384a290","d9e05ee5e32e2d23be5203244727dee0f2a577c073c485c7993eb7a727ef6bf3","b8a712d670a84c4b29e109f9c5b10ad70ac941b46c028b6f06893d6f4218c306","7f256da98a8d843e4d6958ff1d391b29f9f58dd50156955133a8ae85e6257e88","724