 Alert Limit Definition for Integrity.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306258.zip::R2-2306258 CR to 38305 Alert Limit Definition for Integrity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The definition for Protection Level (PL) references AL but there is no definition of AL in any normative specifications.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Added a definition for Alert Limit in the Definitions clause.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: GNSS positioning integrity.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability: There are no inter-operability issues.","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"1b05c911136b3c8d8480db604b20572b254e1cd462a718300af683b56281cf24","original_member_sha256":"49bf1fdb2205a3670f69a065b7b9d243a8e043ce398252e5172e4e767e77c325","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","5d4c05c81833ffb872e377faf7e4a37fcdc3d54154792e132e0e37c35c6e9830","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","fa19d08f9b4d76b7b861e79998284d1ea2db1cc28cd744430e999802fb33cc01","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","268845fe64eda25ae12900e812394ae0818f7226ca3defd680db15e2b6b810d5","aeb7dbfe4f652fa68f641332bcd8175ba022780894ddf7905379f7d1842433d8","1257bef6de0d6fbcb35da4ad9e5d1d2efb40539d216438a199be822d1e60e855","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","3c4c80e1e11044a4d07c2d065ab1badcf74a3b84af6435503a27154aade28f9b","d51a66ceb749ab78a7b57ae41dc0c7a3be8adc4e01a093ff6ebd16a1c0a49f49","8b24573e0133d1c5ee95e1377545628b16380b4d3d980bde5296376e8173041e","7423559940944ed0cc1fe176b76253cf9035dcdbfc0fac2f3e385feb311a2329","288cc60197c635a28716a1c3a9133085106b36b1009f