{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306536.zip::R2-2306536.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"B","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The determination of the accuracy is one of the major tasks of GNSS receiver and the increased accuracy is very important especially in the multi-path environment like urban canyon for many use cases. In order to achieve it, the assistance information of Line of Sight (LOS) / Non Line of Sight (NLOS) of satellites of a particular satellite in a given location is required to assist GNSS receiver. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The support of assistance information about LOS/NLOS GNSS satellites, and the information to request LOS/NLOS GNSS satellites assistance data are introduced as two new posSIBs","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Broadcast of GNSS LoS/NLoS is not possible in NR","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"c849e270186aa65c5d82c5188107c7939724bc15f01fe686c74692e07cad1882","original_member_sha256":"a0a916dc7e263edeb89902af3aff2e56f23422120901bfe09e4aba3b7beafbc6","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4b9ce41d566f95ba6e130773bb79a077b86c3d9ef9196e611f79c67b6cdf7554","af6f8af3cf40723edae48b8623465a5a7c6c8cba682408cd8d2ba31496b8f33c","84c863bee2adfe1ddc4334783364d72e7907469cdc5f6489b6a4bccf42213ee5","f7568e98fa07ef1030ebf8e7b83190bfe29ab82752590507224d6e3678b839d5","74407f6031b8041814d11ca12cb478fdb83d89483d77d7e20530891a7e2360f9","b31faaefde5b131f34ad081e3761f6b4a9afa6c9191c5d4a67dc7e091293ed3b","b2e622502302c18fff946d740f1b03387e48139cb7db2765e9e32311ef96bde9","cde07d305ed9e6233d0b24fdf3f402cc8d8215f6d5c56a62813e698811828608","536a4f2e93c23d59d5f249f0f8065b12e66b58fe2427ab6f121e3b4119e6258e","8d331d5c91d986f19a6e8957cfadde288e95353e0a624124cf5e92a43caf1514","95d4ead4c780a517d3e47a169807fc7c7f9913a70d3e172d57112e003195244f","49a478b0e3506d8e311baa92a516140e571325948a65f3ac7a3d56d0596ed616","aaa08d200cfc093cc8a2a55e1c87758b560f0fd5992