{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"F","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(1)","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field descriptions for nr-DL-TDOA-AdditionalMeasurements and nr-Multi-RTT-AdditionalMeasurements are currently missing.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(2)","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"As a general drafting rule in RAN2, requirements are specified for the UE, whereas the expected behaviour for the network node (location server) is specified without any explicit \"shall\" requirement. However, in the LPP specification, a few \"shall\" requirements for the location server are defined.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(3)","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Minor editorial mistakes.","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(4)","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The defintion of area for preconfigured assistance data is not clear. If NW configures the same cell in different area, then a UE camped in that cell would have ambiguity as which assistance data instance is valid in that area.","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e4e44ee677ed4051201972f11f51bb54396e91b31bb2136139e5ab06d90870d5","original_member_sha256":"7e17bac3b5b722159fad6bbbdc973ced135f72f2a32bb2bedf6473afad53255e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["517e833a934ea17fb42fae50ed7b6cff26a4690554d711c7d70e591511b3ccfe","27dff9c4dc3a8e0d225ca9aef54811fc30d0c85f315145c5c0b0cfcfc0cd2cdd","54d9a63b4d78d15f54306ea28817b238d2e168e4c492cc85359b1febae083a79","0e9086c7dbe3c1784e82b1460dd039d271a3f0687d08bdb393f5cb7ecf2f08e9","18fb5586e554a43d55b47e1a53c35178cb87378036f39a4f16560b813022d266","390c7408ab609d50fd26ebbd9d810238506406053f68d8168534cc9d78a77439","d8eb1da4bf605bd19f4b7b8a78a26829f6467a7890060ddd6e07eef3202931cc","4e85a0e4566545566511b1029e141ee020105e9f937c40148ca1b024d3af16f3","81a05043f823650475e863dbf20eb33d1a3ffbd76826fc340072fc10e1309fd5","cbbca58896eeb1d3dda3c21699cfdbf015ea3cc1796f8022b1dc0384cec982c5","1e86bc86b0effbec9247697e13be1078f3d78a9b54e0768b9956ed2c58eee58f","8e0bf64e0629e39cde6804ff236fd1a4647e6bbb246e4a25108dc812915cc073","7f2480133a3dee8c27099413a0911259ae7fe391a4f2ea60fc5bb4e6360239d4","98eca9ee9f24bd9bee361568be344b71ad8290a1e42f08de1b4aa5087bc1efb1","952765ceda9530deaa0d5fe0d28cc01ba8e03c6a3327f7371113f9bbd6eff24a","d5b0d96877cedfa113e2c3918db068fd86cf799a534351fa21333451c1d83629","187e8b70856f76f0f56a47e31f40a4283f92cf3f424a978b4db4bd3388b488fb","4af8e74d1a76fc5dc80147bbfa19543c5fc369cb1e1716173f9e2521765cc20f","3a6c7c320a7e37a5a41b811beb7253fa38480b9b60a812e6e3c3a8726e4c5d3d","cbc17dc1ea8f1fe55425801ec06a5e64d693e4f9b859b8ab1563870f23e70428","443f09096af8b07fd92382aab0bba849742392120a08d83cd190e6c42edd91f7","ebea477cb8deba2aeb893cc46f0e65bef84dfaf5b963eb4c8198f548b2c4fb8e","d5f1d036dec385d5056fd5808b6002d59b0a997090f2b8a3429a6364c6d090c2","b479ce0e09623d48528a3a4a43d9571f12735026b7dce6f65cef542624774c1a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(5)","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field description of nr-TRP-LocationInfo in NR-PositionCalculationAssistance provides not only the ARP location but also the TRP location. Also, the ARP is associated with Resource Sets and Resources of the TRP and this detail is missing.","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(6)","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-TRP-LocationInfo is a list and NR-TRP-LocationInfoPerFreqLayer is an entry in the list but the field description for referencePoint and the explanation for conditional presence tag ‘NotSameAsPrev’ refers to NR-TRP-LocationInfoPerFreqLayer as the list.","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(7)","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The meaning of the ENUMERATED values in fields maxSRSposBandwidthForEachSCS-withinCC-FR1 and maxSRSposBandwidthForEachSCS-withinCC-FR2 in IE NR-UL-SRS-Capability is ambiguous.","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(1)","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field descriptions for nr-DL-TDOA-AdditionalMeasurements and nr-Multi-RTT-AdditionalMeasurements are added according to TS 38.214.","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(2)","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Changed the location server \"shall\" requirement to an expected behaviour.","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(3)","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Various minor editorial corrections.","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(4)","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Area definition has been updated that each cell is included in only one area.","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e4e44ee677ed4051201972f11f51bb54396e91b31bb2136139e5ab06d90870d5","original_member_sha256":"7e17bac3b5b722159fad6bbbdc973ced135f72f2a32bb2bedf6473afad53255e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dff10f96d0f48c5e3ca13f7749786fbe97fe1315b6f7023a90226a4b3c4d883d","8909ba02cc8c577270a87591eb047d38d5099a469baeddb996008e74555ccfa1","c1f1159592e8c227e9184c7b204dc5221441a7f64c2d8d2b0d3a148e2adb90cf","cbdda78fb4371aed65c52fcf87adb9f7ad43bd27c9aee046c9d3245052b52a93","338492b0e345ef069a7211ba8042b6eaf6887f9024a87fcbaabf48c6767084d6","76153f02b4accbe4f654725aca472d4e748a7ca7ea35e7e4e8f2c1dc773b7bbb","0625c1ec0b71ddc468c929de3ce612e50c7242916937b890e792fbd6a7a20bc8","2e00865e9a8fcd61b8c2f8a46c48a495f9fb033568bdb72d5a1159d02f772473","d52d8934579a47b8b0615ed7b2d3faf4bef6fac76944f3f8eaf85585e1c862a8","9305e868242ab3cf76ac8bbbca20b010bc0da3828dc0550b94e049e09ae48532","8dffc9105e3b3ef48d68fce7faa679f4ce8d8a6d244626f18869adf4b2e62717","58ef52b864942e677ba8ba0c24ca8a688d8fc7f7359252d81bfef0f50edd8a23","cd0d1e5e0451605060cd5c122939aaba80929ca5f27a26875c1da58fe313de65","c935efc34348d17c4cedeb86941cb4cd48526e3914340b7fb2cfbd0f52f28935","aa188ea7a052068d84094693b82efa542d365cb8476dbb45530959769cff9058","662af84e4dd32c832801c7f1184ef4dc7ae61f633d0ad61697eb95fcb6b2d25f","093ba71d830ed203f44c86b4a65cd69dde4d76943e4b7547e1050278f640f3bd","8a1493ce8e2e379b60aa88e232467553a49c303f6d0f9a179597647229585893","72498bcefcaaa8612e35a1e5b22b1c7fc964cc834fdbea3b3050cf5e6c9e2cdf","f92576fb070de42a92b8d040ce4ab4cdaf249728034e17b14536478074f6ba3b","80fca194e89d4383c582ca16d47b0c1e2b044b5f706593eb4c4b7784b4c9b132","332ae0d5a514807b542d6d0857453f44cea996ae642adeb31b39192cea15e3cd","b432672d11c655c0aa55788647cb32f6e1182549fedb62645864f5d7b2d22258","83e52009977cb19f284663274b50cfb6dad393a6032be0e224778ebd0ae58984"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[72,95],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx:p72"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(5)","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clarified that TRP location in addition to ARP location is provided by nr-TRP-LocationInfo and ARP is associatd with DL-PRS Resource Set(s) and DL-PRS Resources of the TRPs.","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(6)","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Corrected the field description for referencePoint and the explanation for conditional presence tag ‘NotSameAsPrev’ to refer to NR-TRP-LocationInfo as the list IE.","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(7)","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clarified that the ENUMERATED values in fields maxSRSposBandwidthForEachSCS-withinCC-FR1 and maxSRSposBandwidthForEachSCS-withinCC-FR2 in IE NR-UL-SRS-Capability indicate the bandwidth in MHz.","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(1)","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field descriptions for nr-DL-TDOA-AdditionalMeasurements and nr-Multi-RTT-AdditionalMeasurements remain absent.","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL-TDOA/Multi-RTT Signal Measurement Information ","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, there are no inter-operability issues.","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not, the network may receive the measurement report with both fields, additional measurements and extended additional measurements present, which an LMF may not be able to comprehend correctly.","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(2)","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Misalignment with RAN2 drafting rules remain.","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e4e44ee677ed4051201972f11f51bb54396e91b31bb2136139e5ab06d90870d5","original_member_sha256":"7e17bac3b5b722159fad6bbbdc973ced135f72f2a32bb2bedf6473afad53255e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e1df8e6a2b3b86bc9bbf31171be8a1990083cdca13abd8575db0c1684317e68f","335a3e31762e5808684fa56eb945c120002da972ff328475b86b2ac5c64ffb67","3d73cf14c901215a7b5b663ba9fb9b14fda08264904ce6d07d5b8b5465430c6f","4a882bf72a35e774de31cc91a74097613e3cc55d55afe3017f381dc63d3a38cb","9c5a615016ea82117627d2a6da4feb1140d76167603455d2758c62392a0db201","c29702c8c643282223137cf05070bb51ecf97f0c947084c4a019b281c566a911","a7fe3bb35396f80c32fc2ace4bae06fbdf3f500483b9c73042b83537eceb8635","e08838b88645641bcd38c8c15d8d3bb650a7fa3f3feea30631d194ba013adc5f","be0a2b07ef90101bd707a3f951b22343dd7465ec87a36f24aefdcbc651d881f1","c4b47e33a98e306bbcd86cfed19b222526566dd71a9ce70c4ecb10e98d88cfc0","b8bba669bc8ea481274ab1e98ecfbedb6830b838567049bee9a7ab61b5decf02","83cdfe31e5299cf2a850031153597c0a084d562f54c521e4804db64c99568001","b72ae8daa532d58e22c9262cbe7ae2a6c352041b58937ccb3479eac03b3fd83e","7ac598d77cd502677743edbf4c6057849b98249f50a417f55e6b8c2c8c86169c","c84837daec00b01772751383442a14f21702cba6a8b6532c9cae3d32b5fb4a85","f2ffa0edc498a001f7c7d46a41f403cf195c28228c48d56aceac733bee500f8c","ce9e29a1f21af9d1f90302e5e17f8792b2697d463ff4bddb988ab8078ff62b01","c565d96efb682ce85f269004d8f7225462416713abf6d0112832e2901aaf1e50","4d5775250fa04dcad964c509cc55a06fcad05b92f813453284fe37943c1889fc","4538627bfb0c697c347bdeed803e26fae0245b0b9e3fddf134a3ee8d13d18143","f28e3473a63a3cc7687a77f468be8d402b21455e46abd1aec36ae03df7741820","47ad8c06edc89424595bff2a54405c85ef5083251d69894b6544ab14c38b21da","19837b64c744c914f6208d45cd4211cade7b613efbc00ae96af2f25eed275a41","3a4d9e8da3d913986be8152330fb23e6fc81d9be85a6f6a5cf02ab5bd3cc1678"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Location Server behaviour ","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, there are no inter-operability issues.","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not, there are no inter-operability issues.","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(3)","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editorial errors remain in the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(4)","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ambiguity in the applicable assistence data instance remains.","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Preconfigured Assistance data with validity area","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, there can be ambiguity on the UE as which assistance data to select.","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not there are no inter-operability issues.","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(5), (6)","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field description of nr-TRP-LocationInfo will be incomplete and will lack details of what the ARP is associated with in a TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Field description for referencePoint will remain incorrect, referencing the wrong IE.","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e4e44ee677ed4051201972f11f51bb54396e91b31bb2136139e5ab06d90870d5","original_member_sha256":"7e17bac3b5b722159fad6bbbdc973ced135f72f2a32bb2bedf6473afad53255e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ae9bf94b898a3850003473fe021e89b6a4d1bfa1fb484c1a80b15204995f821b","98c1b82eef543410c3b2d83e3aeaeaac17be2900dd4aa73f78994a86e05ae361","568abee1a3b12967024e5bb95f5fa3205d0d0f57d5ffa9ccafe25b7cf2f230eb","e774a8c6e5211fd95989bde111f5cf696946fbe45b14a5d78c2d233fd0ceb6b2","70a49f4c08bcbf8e46332d7e5eab9db691ae2cccead93204e57ba62026b3a10f","e83036badaaa64577679d5043f6628308084a1bd193d05c98db4e9d0f159ccdd","805b0b4f1cbcd8f4ba8e7e70bbc90fb2bff094f3dfb2f2cad438abb467ba4877","fdc7b080e7a925b4b8e937705a4e49ebbf82045633e3819f12d91aa7fca52e6c","2b40ac599b8a131310506bc5be72e0b74ab8db81301baaa99a48ab10be2cc45f","4917187c8f60d169348f897b387309ff6c1b72986e820b0d817d387c3541e572","cbde93376f7f4d7c1501600b1636e585b9194e8bad0f617e35d182dd2b6130bf","f73a1a9dea3fec236e5d3f7c6de146631e1db5f7f11959e0c72e6083b3234d6e","a3b6a757190b95161f70c53f4dfe31fa484e9f1f08a825881b5a6b44e1fed144","8ed84347aaafa8b888f2262717079d2511b410b908f11ef140abccdad2b4d44e","afb72b279605a7873870110c69eaf41253e198d72a9d51a811af