{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the spatial directions of DL-PRS Resources for TRPs.","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-RTD-Info","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the time synchronization information between the reference TRP and neighbour TRPs. ","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-TRP-BeamAntennaInfo","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the relative DL-PRS Resource power between PRS resources per angle per TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-ExpectedLOS-NLOS-Assistance","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the expected likelihood of a LOS propagation path from a TRP to the target device. The information is provided per TRP or per DL-PRS Resource.","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nr-DL-PRS-TRP-TEG-Info","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the TRP Tx TEG ID associated with the transmission of each DL-PRS Resource of the TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[…]","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-TRP-LocationInfo","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-TRP-LocationInfo is used by the location server to provide the coordinates of TRPs and coordinates of the antenna reference points for a set of TRPs. For each TRP, the ARP location can be provided for each associated PRS Resource ID per PRS Resource Set.","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-TRP-LocationInfo-r16 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxFreqLayers-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-TRP-LocationInfoPerFreqLayer-r16","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-TRP-LocationInfoPerFreqLayer-r16 ::= SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"referencePoint-r16ReferencePoint-r16OPTIONAL,-- Cond NotSameAsPrev","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trp-LocationInfoList-r16SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..nrMaxTRPsPerFreq-r16)) OF","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TRP-LocationInfoElement-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"...","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e4e44ee677ed4051201972f11f51bb54396e91b31bb2136139e5ab06d90870d5","original_member_sha256":"7e17bac3b5b722159fad6bbbdc973ced135f72f2a32bb2bedf6473afad53255e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a8cc1b48535b21aeb9fa0a4e8e00ecb401ac9d406782e4d44419a2f440b7638d","f69117577d73e26db8f03c1114e0bc1100d33584e8ac98381ff708b1aebd13cb","121c1f2373a3514aeda85c8838feb5776c07ac6a0da57b05e1c2aa6442783dd6","9afed1843069d72f9fba9274e4df564803a32e2d25ac35897c2f2abf3d4872cf","76fe7a6b3b3fb4ed955ab4d4903da89615c4982568d6dcfe24690f4365d2e511","39ca596704018d9e352107a5997454a41286941e7f1d3de2dc35b70f13ea7079","ae9e785e85d668a73699eba636ce2bfc2d0a39cd64728dc358118a14a076250a","b711dc05bc90b837aa60c8de13405f91503a3ed3360c4f9a0fddd8fbb96bcf24","a5f84caa675fcc57993afd3bb86a5340fcac86cc4e10f15dac0384bc65d8192e","63c5ba1cb5ff07fcf1f420f6e0d540fbc67a187036331b020c89b2679a0caac8","1cf31ec181b44d21cc72b603161f45f1b1f0d8a2df9