{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional presence","paragraph_zero_based":291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NotSameAsPrev","paragraph_zero_based":293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in the first entry of the NR-TRP-LocationInfoPerFreqLayer in the NR-TRP-LocationInfo list; otherwise it is optionally present, need OP.","paragraph_zero_based":294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-TRP-LocationInfo field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"referencePoint","paragraph_zero_based":297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field specifies the reference point used to define the location of TRPs provided in the trp-LocationInfoList. If this field is absent, the reference point is the same as in the previous entry of the NR-TRP-LocationInfoPerFreqLayer in the NR-TRP-LocationInfo list.","paragraph_zero_based":298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trp-LocationInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field provides the antenna reference point locations of the DL-PRS Resources for the TRPs and comprises the following sub-fields:","paragraph_zero_based":300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-dl-PRS-ID: This field is used along with a DL-PRS Resource Set ID and a DL-PRS Resource ID to uniquely identify a DL-PRS Resource, and is associated to a single TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nr-PhysCellID: This field specifies the physical cell identity of the associated TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nr-CellGlobalID: This field specifies the NCGI, the globally unique identity of a cell in NR, of the associated TRP.","paragraph_zero_based":303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-nr-ARFCN: This field specifies the NR-ARFCN of the TRP's CD-SSB (as defined in TS 38.300 [47]) corresponding to nr-PhysCellID.","paragraph_zero_based":304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-associated-DL-PRS-ID: This field, if present, specifies the dl-PRS-ID of the associated TRP from which the trp-location information is adopted. If the field is present, the field trp-Location shall be absent.","paragraph_zero_based":305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-trp-Location: This field provides the location of the TRP relative to the referencePoint location. If this field is absent the TRP location coincides with the referencePoint location, unless the field associated-dl-PRS-ID is present, in which case the trp-Location is adopted from the associated TRP indicated by associated-dl-PRS-ID.","paragraph_zero_based":306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-trp-DL-PRS-ResourceSets: This field provides the antenna reference point location(s) of the DL-PRS Resource Set(s) associated with this TRP. If this field is absent, the antenna reference point location(s) of the DL-PRS Resource Set(s) coincides with the trp-Location location. This field comprises the following sub-fields:","paragraph_zero_based":307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-dl-PRS-ResourceSetARP: This field provides the antenna reference point location of the DL-PRS Resource Set relative to the trp-Location location. If this field is absent, the antenna reference point location of this DL-PRS Resource Set coincides with the trp-Location location.","paragraph_zero_based":308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-dl-PRS-Resource-ARP-List: This field provides the antenna reference point location(s) of the DL-PRS Resource(s) associated with this Resource Set of the TRP. If this field is absent, the antenna reference point location(s) of the DL-PRS Resources coincides with the dl-PRS-ResourceSetARP location. This field comprises the following sub-fields:","paragraph_zero_based":309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-dl-PRS-Resource-ARP-location: This field provides the antenna reference point location of the DL-PRS Resource associated with the DL-PRS Resource Set of the TRP relative to the dl-PRS-ResourceSetARP location. If this field is absent, the antenna reference point location of this DL-PRS Resource coincides with the dl-PRS-ResourceSetARP location.","paragraph_zero_based":310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":311}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e4e44ee677ed4051201972f11f51bb54396e91b31bb2136139e5ab06d90870d5","original_member_sha256":"7e17bac3b5b722159fad6bbbdc973ced135f72f2a32bb2bedf6473afad53255e","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1fdd755c70f5ce058a2cceeeb020d2859950b6bea5b131ad3a2c5ac9896e0e43","8c1dc127512ecf46eff98a82780f788242f571d738ab29373e4f2984f2aba102","a62bb05d3b8db30d3178ae858f89461e2cafd72761df0d3b800fa499d22e4df1","e3e71849da617ad20767801441f15bdca4188bac76ce1e43e204919f9b80b8e4","54cce3144a01d6e6831e1ce21640a62391cbfddcca469529bc1d436e0ac547a2","488dd521c65fe0955bdecd29211b3e070aaa20c2de69bc01790c1e4c08c7964b","44a95894e14384a516f33152b7e1cbc60ba38cd54c333bc606d503df630f82af","264ee84051690c9f0db67c59ec3a70d7029e62b7cfede3fc1c4363cd3a040f27","b745e6415f763c576927011f6bf636e47e01f154f27e63fb68eea548271af93b","4b16f69a5753b7a06393bc72a4a4c840681283b68ed7a3e40b76047bf5ad5428","06ef123168f75fca95763bbfaa1b5ccf14fb2a5b7cb40c7326b49de63defcce8","bcb9403d7e7dbadb200755f7a2087d4b0147d49d8e1807ac7fc19073a9587bb3","4d871edfb149ca41dee3e5f87ebeadabf5782bc362444e83c286bd396bd678d6","e94fb4d2c509a6262f3703a9a362e3542219108054607b9bc0ad05ae44709c28