{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(reserved)","paragraph_zero_based":936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"'0'","paragraph_zero_based":937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(reserved)","paragraph_zero_based":938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note 1:If GNSSID indicates 'gps', and GNSS Orbit Model-2 is included, this interpretation of svHealth applies.","paragraph_zero_based":939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note 2:If GNSSID indicates 'gps', and GNSS Orbit Model-3 is included, this interpretation of svHealth applies.If a certain signal is not supported on the satellite indicated by SVID, the corresponding health bit shall be set to '1' (i.e., signal can not be used).","paragraph_zero_based":940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note 3:svHealth, in the case that GNSSID indicates 'sbas', includes the 5 LSBs of the Health included in GEO Almanac Message Parameters (Type 17) [10].","paragraph_zero_based":941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note 4:If GNSSID indicates 'qzss', and GNSS Orbit Model-2 is included, this interpretation of svHealth applies.","paragraph_zero_based":942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note 5:If GNSSID indicates 'qzss', and GNSS Orbit Model-3 is included, this interpretation of svHealth applies.","paragraph_zero_based":943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note 6:If GNSSID indicates 'bds', and GNSS Orbit Model-6 is included, this interpretation of svHealth applies.","paragraph_zero_based":944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note 7:If GNSSID indicates 'bds', and GNSS Orbit Model-7 is included, this interpretation of svHealth applies.","paragraph_zero_based":945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS to iod Bit String(11) relation","paragraph_zero_based":947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"GNSS","paragraph_