{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306676.zip::R2-2306676_(Misc LPP corrections).docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AlmanacKeplerianSet field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":1272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"svID","paragraph_zero_based":1273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field identifies the satellite for which the GNSS Almanac Model is given.","paragraph_zero_based":1274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"kepAlmanacE","paragraph_zero_based":1275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter e, eccentricity, dimensionless [8].","paragraph_zero_based":1276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scale factor 2-16.","paragraph_zero_based":1277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"kepAlmanacDeltaI","paragraph_zero_based":1278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter i, inclination at reference time relative to i0=56°; semi-circles [8].","paragraph_zero_based":1279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scale factor 2-14 semi-circles.","paragraph_zero_based":1280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"kepAlmanacOmegaDot","paragraph_zero_based":1281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter , rate of change of right ascension (semi-circles/sec) [8].","paragraph_zero_based":1282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scale factor 2-33 semi-circles/seconds.","paragraph_zero_based":1283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"kepSV-StatusINAV","paragraph_zero_based":1284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field contains the I/NAV signal health status [8], clause 5.1.10 , E5bHS and E1-BHS, where E5bHS occupies the 2 MSBs in kepSV-StatusINAV, and E1-BHS the two LSBs. ","paragraph_zero_based":1285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"kepSV-StatusFNAV","paragraph_zero_based":1286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field contains the F/NAV signal health status [8], clause 5.1.10 ,E5aHS. If the target device is supporting multiple Galileo signals, the location server includes this field. ","paragra