{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS/TR ... CR ... ","paragraph_zero_based":96},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"(show related CRs)","paragraph_zero_based":97},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":98},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"X","paragraph_zero_based":99},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" O&M Specifications","paragraph_zero_based":100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TS/TR ... CR ... ","paragraph_zero_based":101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other comments:","paragraph_zero_based":104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR's revision history:","paragraph_zero_based":108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"START OF CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.1General","paragraph_zero_based":111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.1.1-1: Sidelink RRC reconfiguration, successful","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.1.1-2: Sidelink RRC reconfiguration, failure","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to modify a PC5-RRC connection, e.g. to establish/modify/release sidelink DRBs or PC5 Relay RLC channels, to (re-)configure NR sidelink measurement and reporting, to (re-)configure sidelink CSI reference signal resources, to (re)configure CSI reporting latency bound, to (re)configure sidelink DRX, to (re-)configure the latency bound of SL Inter-UE coordination report, and to indicate the SFN-DFN offset.","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may initiate the sidelink RRC reconfiguration procedure and perform the operation in clause 5.8.9.1.2 on the corresponding PC5-RRC connection in following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the release of sidelink DRBs associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.1;","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dec1e4511df8447a3ea458a0ce278295c0151fd5172112dce961ebbde193783e","original_member_sha256":"d20a68ac0bd13aa84db23fe0b3c3cbdd952a7f22a689b8f8c07eda17c3796b74","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3e09c91bb45cf858b0f63e0088880c6ea30150890c31f00d7d9ecca33357b70d","8154c3aed40e8eddc33722d8805b1b158556090f816777307b029ce5ad4f2865","eb73062537cec0a0f7e023d3cefccf573ae63da669f5ce6ddeb78ebe2fda3f7a","df7ac76460f210a08cc8acbba0580d82be9e7ea0d323458bc7e60064c5f2cf48","6ef2a9f53d6b82406ccdb2ef5c16dd936a35b63301da98c0ebc3c0425a97d677","9bb0124a2cc32dbf584816513434d7f18b0c3d6bc3084bb19c4d0557bd08a656","3ad18f3e8e0127d069dcf8966761a5286683cc5522726174836ac6db236abae0","7cb5cd70bcb929ce080e7e9fca658e572950f20a162fbf6e98df8dd6b0a78415","e659bc2fb3da149327128275a480c9e51610d0514e68ef56494c9af16e1cfba9","62a08a59a216e949624e8eb13f56c26941e64dc200544970cf90e2b61d188c6b","0e160c8dc28f5650230ec774d09bf41edb0b9c12252cccb4e4e1f6b8e2fe2e59","2f04a097a2dd6cf9bc41d5433c33857d50ddc980575bfaaf9087220ec763ce32","ae8166fd7dbf550f682fbbb877814faa1525d4f9b9d60042fd999c04da48a3f2","761bcff223f1343b9d6b8e1287040dbe0b6deb01e515bb32b1359b48da0a5993","2116d392735addb2c53f3c80f269fe478e0f86584e51088b22dbcb4cfbb930b8","9dc5aec6da2d28561976bd2d34b8728e77c78796c480843d8c7401d09c672b40","df06aacb888fc2320c55aaad28114474b88ab4c95a210aaf1ab47c7e62641365","f65d4bc4a95fda77ccbc548b32f06825070876f51d4e6185b0b6227e0ef3c3b3","df9fa2ac491249536379f4e35cd726c18f5f2e6fcca65bcd1c08c4c88328091b","1f9f5afbdc560f7f69fd7e3ac3a762870e1c9167d2c7e2d8b7232cd8a255e998","d93efd1fe81821d9767347ee0fc5f1767dee8087a03bafe7a00b9e6ac7cf621f","239fdcf6d9fd8a5f4a1a55ad99ef208f29e1a70f7d5340d5b826f13ef0f03d33","5b037e13ee663cc8fdf2da9f272c9730c92ed6a434d39cfac187d4d990c79941","99e24ca47fd584521e1d0d81a770139bce07cf30c1a21fc9b3afb958b964ad78"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of sidelink DRBs associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.2;","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the modification for the parameters included in SLRB-Config of sidelink DRBs associated with the peer UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.1a.2;","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the release of PC5 Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE and Remote UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.7.1;","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the establishment of PC5 Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE and Remote UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the modification for the parameters included in SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 of PC5 Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE and Remote UE, as specified in clause 5.8.9.7.2;","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the peer UE to perform NR sidelink measurement and report.","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the sidelink CSI reference signal resources and CSI reporting latency bound;","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the peer UE to perform sidelink DRX;","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the (re-)configuration of the latency bound of SL Inter-UE coordination report;","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the request in a RemoteUEInformationSidelink message for the SFN-DFN offset from the L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the change in the value of the SFN-DFN offset at the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE: It is up to L2 U2N Relay UE implementation to determine when the SFN-DFN offset has changed in value to a degree requiring an update to be sent to the L2 U2N Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In RRC_CONNECTED, the UE applies the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in RRCReconfiguration (if any). In RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, the UE applies the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in system information (if any). For other cases, UEs apply the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in SidelinkPreconfigNR (if any). When UE performs state transition between above three cases, the UE applies the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in the new state, after acquisition of the new configurations. Before acquisition of the new configurations, UE continues applying the NR sidelink communications parameters provided in the old state.","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.1.2Actions related to transmission of RRCReconfigurationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCReconfigurationSidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sidelink DRB that is to be released, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.1.1, due to configuration by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12, SidelinkPreconfigNR or by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the entry included in the slrb-ConfigToReleaseList corresponding to the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sidelink DRB that is to be established or modified, according to clause 5.8.9.1a.2.1, due to receiving sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, SIB12 or SidelinkPreconfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a sidelink DRB is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the sidelink DRB and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SLRB-Config to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SLRB-Config included in the slrb-ConfigToAddModList, according to the received sl-RadioBearerConfig and sl-RLC-BearerConfig corresponding to the sidelink DRB;","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-MeasConfig as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>If the frequency used for NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dec1e4511df8447a3ea458a0ce278295c0151fd5172112dce961ebbde193783e","original_member_sha256":"d20a68ac0bd13aa84db23fe0b3c3cbdd952a7f22a689b8f8c07eda17c3796b74","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cd86ca389816b93ae9554969fcac31fd7af7877cb608335339462009bfb1d25d","c31f9953e37d47f759764047e19e505a7047e3001a03e5f3919581e9346912fc","644a1af1a75a0f803c1d4365f30022f47eb4ce637b11b276004ccae1bbc93f91","dc9ba1bd46bfb02bd5432e4c8fc4aa3fafb04325e82cacd7eebd8f7e3c3ec10d","8cdec4201c7a0c974d8e5333763f977e19b9cfd95e083ac14715cc1d4bd9103d","5bc6a458a9af6346e3f06684b59e25d5e47b822964124beee922bcbdf9b58c09","158cb409a3cc23ddedf91d22661279815759afe4e98cd5cfe5210c1f4ef34e7a","16dc2221a44aa665ecfe7e8703fd735f2eb7b7e18a5c63ffd2b0b4ab8dd638ec","372c6103a962bbbeb4314c73ae219be1943a7e4f2f10e806de965675190499e9","0281d10a1606f9ba0bf4b053ec4adbdb7f21ccfc08a341964efa568b245debb0","780653788dfaae378ec1646dae40aa7e3c8c00187b386eb5e541e509c4c4f06a","f9a7f3d4f394187865bee5479786f406f31d1aaada84bd3fe45741022083bc87","c145ed39781591672f657aeb18afb74e8009f7b2bcb2a1770fdaa2c4b09429f9","33b689f4b47dc0efed02299de5730ead0b83167227be012d712ba53c2a7db269","8b847a8554309104ad481af74907fa44a21c03a74deaa93104c625237ffb2a46","2e9b5743af4915146d87ff2e022ac3f7ab502adca1cc43acfa2fe753b7430bb9","c920c4ca8adc7f4dab8c949562a3b6650dbe86531670e2d0af2e51ab015b9895","e049d91c9701dc3182efbd85ff9f1f46ea8a02e9391c75aa47a429859eb9cc30","c12f43f2f8e3ba597fc4e3805d5941d73a8cda7c3b8b3a9e072f66d060948553","a9b5b88c3a1e3abd802b260ea3d7c6e666ceaf1de052051cda50d5f4ec179930","ad5513abffa5a7f812e8dccd8fa332e74ac26271808aafde4aa8ff10abfc3c47","0a4dbb2870f5d0f25449fbaa65d185c0f9ecb0dcab41dc8709b9eba260462da6","8d083f3ae402fbe39797ff7840b145750b1f01a24941cbcf9b05c6b128e45635","3a7cda88f9a368a7db698136eb1c008c83dfb341ba989125a8a0f0c97998f4ad"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-MeasConfig according to stored NR sidelink measurement configuration information for this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-MeasConfig according to stored NR sidelink measurement configuration received from SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the sl-MeasConfig according to the sl-MeasPreconfig in SidelinkPreconfigNR;","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T400 for the destination;","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-CSI-RS-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-ResetConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Whether/how to set the parameters included in sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report, sl-CSI-RS-Config, sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report and sl-ResetConfig is up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>If the frequency used for NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message or included in sl-ConfigCommonNR within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and if sl-ScheduledConfig is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5 according to stored NR sidelink DRX configuration information for this destination.","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or out of coverage, or in RRC_CONNECTED and sl-UE-SelectedConfig is included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration, it is up to UE implementation to set the sl-DRX-ConfigUC-PC5.","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each PC5 Relay RLC channel that is to be released due to configuration by sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-ChannelID corresponding to the PC5 Relay RLC channel in the sl-RLC-ChannelToReleaseListPC5;","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each PC5 Relay RLC channel that is to be established or modified due to receiving sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a PC5 Relay RLC channel is to be established:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>assign a new logical channel identity for the logical channel to be associated with the PC5 Relay RLC channel and set sl-MAC-LogicalChannelConfigPC5 in the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 to include the new logical channel identity;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the SL-RLC-ChannelConfigPC5 included in the sl-RLC-ChannelToAddModListPC5 according to the received SL-RLC-ChannelConfig corresponding to the PC5 Relay RLC channel, including setting sl-RLC-ChannelID-PC5 to the same value of sl-RLC-ChannelID received in SL-RLC-ChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is operating as a L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the destination UE requested the SFN-DFN offset in a previous RemoteUEInformationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dec1e4511df8447a3ea458a0ce278295c0151fd5172112dce961ebbde193783e","original_member_sha256":"d20a68ac0bd13aa84db23fe0b3c3cbdd952a7f22a689b8f8c07eda17c3796b74","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["aa740433dc34887ce3f57a7f30ec2fe314b8bfa3c5fa40ea8becac6e0f889f4b","a876f232f8f6490cafc41a55b9436613dc05a56de02bad4550fb57cb84dd25e0","a915c54f464b717afcb723403923fba06b88b6bca1e88d48f50e2ba1cff95bec","477ec927c34f243967baf9d527898c0b602991d1e9f85842df1da628e6f95a65","c5a61f8df2f9d6a7f1f542df65ad83a91c268e963844aa2ef1dbcf5441472408","478631d1424ec0f2a1090f35ede2b0809257187810e6cae7f0cc126691072f27","29563f472d20d4f70cde52adf0c8a726207290c6c95a332b0af5cede752db679","3878f9dab711fe77529d3fae0cb1354c8614117c1392457a8ec5fcbcfbcc4d18","0270ef491a6ef1e0400f7834476e61103f200872d962eb70c38a205366b31435","3adcbce1dbdf887f9274fb04836292ee21c4c6ba7c881ceea17d212595c27d1d","8fc02cee7f7965bb0a443766255b18f8ce2c41d01255fcdb7e0d924c9caa14c9","badad82684587a9f6362d05a5311992ac032623e22b5cffb86cbf8f63343a897","e9fc1b527dac735a57b482167fd4bc0126beac8d6c9e1d4942a221077c70f63b","c7d9e3c31038a77b6309753f75b2eabf4f7a4d1778f3d2df55dfa540df7463d9","03b7cbea7ce58e972d298e2efe9a1cad657ff007bcd47b527142d58fdc9a6aaf","906f449b794baa2fd2865b77ec785c64c78910bf997838af3e96ab74d6a01978","d822ae11e65fbf9fd3ea0d8a3cdfc8b88c4c638c47cb08f5448e44f4cd5cd8d4","33a29b115067606ec4ced4572c60ebd1f924e9467bfd988154b27ab06b9a48b3","1f5a03c0b649b299b4ebb327bdf97e8001840423a37f0fbce84f9a86786fe1fe","9f54c1707c284636fa732b0ee3dde009346b51b640f9179d9d5f5491eecf6616","5c8c8c3699f6fe6a9b5594f3753ae5c69c6ab2b887464eefc80d3f740f8bbd48","f97a4d59de9ee73ec42b89c88697c6e3083c3bb20607378198c26a90890ae1f8","c0b74ae1ed84a1c08147d5a1ed775f9d91ea1ba32e172615f65b4f3e629bbc26","0c7d6d8af6bfc6d217c3f7fc4a52600fd4da05df2c12642e80d6e9bfc6084b2e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the SFN-DFN offset has changed since a previous transmission of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message, or no previous transmission of the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message has occurred since the reception of the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message:","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-SFN-DFN-Offset according to the relation between the SFN timeline of the PCell and the DFN timeline;","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[…]","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.1General","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.9.8.1-1: Remote UE information","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This procedure is used by the L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTIVE to inform about the required SIB(s)/posSIB(s), provide Paging related information to the connected L2 U2N Relay UE, and request the SFN-DFN offset from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:MIB is not required by a L2 U2N Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.2Actions related to transmission of RemoteUEInformationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When entering RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or upon change in any of the information in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink while in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1 and the requested SIB has not been indicated in RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include sl-RequestedSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has not stored a valid version, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several posSIB(s) that the UE requires for a positioning operation, and the requested posSIB has not been indicated in RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before, and the connected L2 U2N relay UE set posSIB-ForwardingSupported to true:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include sl-RequestedPosSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink to indicate the requested posSIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has not sent sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before, set sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the L2 U2N Remote UE is in RRC_IDLE:","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include ng-5G-S-TMSI in the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE specific DRX cycle is configured by upper layer, set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the value of UE specific Uu DRX cycle configured by upper layer;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the L2 U2N Remote UE is in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include ng-5G-S-TMSI and fullI-RNTI in the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE specific DRX cycle is configured by upper layer,","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the minimum value of UE specific Uu DRX cycles (configured by upper layer and configured by RRC);","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dec1e4511df8447a3ea458a0ce278295c0151fd5172112dce961ebbde193783e","original_member_sha256":"d20a68ac0bd13aa84db23fe0b3c3cbdd952a7f22a689b8f8c07eda17c3796b74","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["37980b64bf61b6ab20fd6d768c1015b0ec0747c66ac4ffcfd56c437e0e5c2dc8","ee848f58e1b8b5e4bc094b750053a2b1a563a6227da00ecab5b3c62e9307a2b5","c178fff5247e56a81414684ba5028df52c3f88b08e3451309eaa52d184ab5f5c","47bba1f2140e1a14586abecf68ba36a06b07fd5df1176eb8ca6acf2c4b6d6e02","dbf0f7da2c41e8028fba977a7fee6f6d95c482dc88acc7b60731295e89202e62","518ccecf02fb2d5d2a779fddb0f16d52df04f21f689570c6e9b8036621e09667","b26b7d7fd895264bcd2c1016e49e55448ef3fea5ba8a52e1ffe4de8d836cc4fc","8d3d4e67f8864d46a234be36d8f6f11edae9dc0f7698e91b1bb6f7d2c679744e","d7585f783a2858b2a34aaa07c5cc7d0cebbf2b7968fef880a7cc1a6abfcf0b5d","018e53553ffa1894d1ecd7389108e513b0779ad62e036890c6c0b448a77f1158","51f48b54a3ba5fb8c00710860a515773919360fa63a9be869cb4a333017e4264","b92c1ebaeb65c112ab49690cbb0c10ba54b5cba38cfdfb601b2f81e7e6c19b24","bc5d2cd1d5a4bf75ea895f7a8babd78e97a3f897ad518fce3c9fa8e412438c50","10f6b1d53d208499af8b936afef354ab3d3c8624c24f06637c119a3648480ed7","709ad20407fd7102841a820f087926b0837c91568228675b8afab191675872dc","ef6a9dce3b625617978af3f4e97f499614ab6ba823603437fd2c9551027fd356","150726038c7c6e33e219312e2d393c443e56108e73b1777f7693212aab55f4c8","28ffee538d1387d5c27dd914572547407eb45b7ca05382f9f431fb7bd71208c3","014b3748b2b76ef69df790f0130f9c309e4259d5d8a6c9f15aa02fc8b26ab0db","6063b11ef65b9fcf72fe1a5a9536196ae53ab2564882a42f27ef9ad33c19fa59","4d855258ea36c0e58efeca98aaf31251db569327d057bc5aa88a666d6077189d","c94e53f398016e942a12b58f596ede3e0146065aadc9d5f5dde27ed996f812ff","ff3a14b53c69c19d5251702bc4faee6cfe68857b28d74c275a624790d2bd40a8","829464f847e83dac8c51320814bb29f462c8956c61195832dd450f49812d7e33"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[168,191],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx:p168"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the value of UE specific DRX cycle configured by RRC;","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When entering RRC_CONNECTED, if L2 U2N remote UE had sent sl-RequestedSIB-List, sl-RequestedPosSIB-List, and/or sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-RequestedSIB-List to the value release if requested before;","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List to the value release if requested before;","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE to the value release if sent before;","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.3Reception of RemoteUEInformationSidelink message by the L2 U2N Relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE:","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED on an active BWP with common search space configured including pagingSearchSpace; or","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>monitor the Paging message at the L2 U2N Remote UE's paging occasion calculated according to sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE and sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE included in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop monitoring the Paging message at the L2 U2N Remote UE's paging occasion;","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the received paging information in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED on an active BWP without pagingSearchSpace configured):","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the received sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE in SidelinkUEInformationNR message and perform Sidelink UE information transmission in accordance with 5.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to release the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE in SidelinkUEInformationNR message in accordance with 5.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the received paging information in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dec1e4511df8447a3ea458a0ce278295c0151fd5172112dce961ebbde193783e","original_member_sha256":"d20a68ac0bd13aa84db23fe0b3c3cbdd952a7f22a689b8f8c07eda17c3796b74","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f40617842374e710dcdcf3de1e9b007e7072c381bd0b86bde2e8eb44862ba763","dcbb1947cc5cdb5656a8efebe487684a904b60a0c73ae86d4117381bb754ecfb","79c379b81039d04d1f612dd84e5b93c00848e497603dfbd7fd64e3d59e8892b2","49213ce9cfaed513e249c871240a015b98e44cdb0b2c75394d330e7a67a2da93","64cf0948b65ab2fb3afe5e4b9b0ebd36a729a597572ed02cc72c69860d5804f1","8b857098743ce03d0810c2c9aae9c2ba0cffb7766b09d0c2c2e18bce03a13d95","744bc8e594510c22400d4853921c6ba3a681c092cf08c7c872d651407b83a023","8c3e67e0a718974b537770fb7008566a7000fc8eaecae96503a2f31fba931509","402832a4b5dba594ce7092a72a1ca86266948301767cda9bf3b83c1348038f7b","a215ed71f9c0409788068330fe73bb8c6fad24587ec8cbcbcc153ef4d78dd49e","251cb29f8e4ff1723e0585e264c5ef000514d2d3cad17d7f58d5b3cf9c073517","b4095135f4e4c6b824829275469f8baa2a15fb098486ac7aed40d34aa6fdf354","68ae37a747bf0795f821f0fc99c722f9ed99c9f5db6514973d992fc49bbc5104","bda469eda2e6f3658800f34c407ed9db116472d15273163a83cb4131491b36b9","c89f3fc69736df6ad3c47b4d10b51d238f86228cde9400e2ebfd1bff391f201c","691eed1cb88a0f3be759440fac092796a16a8d92a5b006cc8bcbd4a1a06246f0","73289b35016b977be2ec3953f1cc3705a2e45bc58e7776af638c7d3025ab3da3","5979b5b0261f7a71b0032ec80bd2c6127f720a0de67a6e023fa4ff0f1c5db259","677beba829f653eedfc552c36d1b849f1a6cf7bc38dc6315592a0590c6cc5fa2","657f4ab2bcc271c9c3e0949768f31d5ff19ba02a62432785d2e4aaa354cfa0e3","405c7af1f214100262dca193e033fe8f3f7707a90a8ee62847f046624bea0ef8","4cad768bffc56861fa3af344869e51d458f5a163d71b0c26dd1924485d9af767","39f3bfcd91c5cc5e6ac8f8fa1ab409f8f0709651bd151273eac8a8ee048ce217","f494dc8049b4b669f121268a5a378f75d88a415e6a47bc6b1ff865b03cd7addd"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx:p192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-RequestedSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedSIB-List is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the L2 U2N Relay UE has not stored a valid version of SIB(s) indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform acquisition of the system information indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List in accordance with 5.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9;","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedSIB-List is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release received SIB request in sl-RequestedSIB-List;","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the L2 U2N Relay UE has not stored a valid version of posSIB(s) indicated in sl-RequestedPosSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform acquisition of the positioning system information indicated in sl-RequestedPosSIB-List in accordance with 5.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9;","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release received posSIB request in sl-RequestedPosSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[…]","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.9.2Actions related to transmission of UuMessageTransferSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE initiates the Uu message transfer procedure when at least one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon receiving Paging message related to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE from network (including Paging message within RRCReconfiguration message);","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon acquisition of the SIB(s) requested by the connected L2 U2N Remote UE (as indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink) or upon receiving the updated SIB(s) from network which has been requested by the connected L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon acquisition of the posSIB(s) requested by the connected L2 U2N Remote UE (as indicated in sl-RequestedPosSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink) or upon receiving the updated posSIB(s) from network which has been requested by the connected L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon unsolicited SIB1 forwarding to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE or upon receiving the updated SIB1 from network;","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each associated L2 U2N Remote UE, the L2 U2N Relay UE shall set the contents of UuMessageTransferSidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dec1e4511df8447a3ea458a0ce278295c0151fd5172112dce961ebbde193783e","original_member_sha256":"d20a68ac0bd13aa84db23fe0b3c3cbdd952a7f22a689b8f8c07eda17c3796b74","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1752842dc1e4e64a1c2d93ea28705f8575cae664fa707a8cbe56e644bb0e0b6b","20d1233ff061f2709d4287e82b0f786f8f14885b9623fbcf7d7afb30b037c6ee","dbfaac0bfe298c4ffc1f8745399d4262ba3d41f89d3b3da2571d3b5c49e952df","76d3d357dc2d60fc7a8e7dd4d425da4d2d158f92a5d7907746f3c43a92e295aa","408ff4780283fc584446441da0566cd6eae9f22a3cd6206eca7faa60fdcb3b8e","0f2e143fa87797725eeecfc792303c7533e7735063089180003f170ed13a1b18","cbf2f23106301e258d90506af6c289d460f609ebd45c97f4ec459d808862bbed","ebfa01044107212abc59d497835b36a332cf5b9e3deedb34be2a3f0e7f868eae","c49bbf97d88ba3c89a573db506f72c153e764193c375c6a15e3cd2c978483d32","27a038f2c7a3fffe121f60778a3cc4afd4cca976ce619f8be8fb479aae9ccf25","ae3f3bee9f1acd66be8114c7ca3595486e44767b6f7fd36c1a2a8d227f1e4111","b39616e42ae881c411b0b7138785ef3c239abcb2e0a99bebac7bbd1eac1b729c","ccf71cc0c21416864ae9c76186bbf0001606d25f800c4288684d268d6c7a45e3","d1205641d07c8cd21c6387bac6fb4adae19f076b74a5925069737832a3c30831","5dcb9818d7258cb00b8b59083d07d0f1dee0dd99b2bbea97bc1388fcc7882911","d4da43ed83f712bd38911df2fc545ad09503ac87b4eccb119ab8b9d3ae0f2d99","3bc8de2a80fadcb590776ed1067bafd95a39b83622042ae0ad6e503021ff67f2","acb0b1add5d17462899bd4f1e931b3b7b5567f6ab0d80935b7d01a94bddce219","b6bff18afdc5e20bcb792def007e6b61287343da7ef85fc1ab6b10bd64e12a97","ea39c7b60311535442a93a6c27bc40acb57ce640b240d18430e15795c9894955","5456a22f1b04e537357771a0cb78b678ee2bfff279deb7e6336d288c398f1e37","d44fd28c4e1b884aedd95d6e486cb6cbd968e4184ef1bfd0e27f9c978187e9c9","1cdae5f2120208b4c2db1a40fa9857d06fcfe05c3c6ea9e73855cc591be5ceea","5eb1e0eb8cc070d774a76245383943d6abd6cd5e0a13cc082513d8e1986d1b98"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[216,239],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-