{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306827.zip::R2-2306827.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of requested SIBs.","paragraph_zero_based":312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE","paragraph_zero_based":313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the paging information used by L2 U2N Relay UE to perform the connected L2 U2N Remote UE's paging monitoring.","paragraph_zero_based":314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE","paragraph_zero_based":315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the L2 U2N Remote UE's paging UE ID.","paragraph_zero_based":316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE","paragraph_zero_based":317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the L2 U2N Remote UE's UE specific DRX cycle as the minimum value of the one provided by upper layers (if configured) and the one provided by RRC layer (if configured). Value rf32 corresponds to 32 radio frames, value rf64 corresponds to 64 radio frames and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SFN-DFN-OffsetRequested","paragraph_zero_based":319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, this field indicates that the L2 U2N Remote UE requests the L2 U2N Relay UE to provide the SFN-DFN offset in a subsequent RRCReconfigurationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–RRCReconfigurationSidelink","paragraph_zero_based":322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The RRCReconfigurationSidelink message is the command to AS configuration of the PC5 RRC connection. It is only applied to unicast of NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SL-SRB3","paragraph_zero_based":324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: AM","paragraph_zero_based":325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: SCCH","paragraph_zero_based":326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: UE to UE","paragraph_zero_based":327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRCReconfigurationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RRCRECONFIGURATIONSIDELINK-START","paragraph_zero_based":330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRCReconfigurationSidelink ::=          SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    rrc-TransactionIdentifier-r16           RRC-TransactionIdentifier,","paragraph_zero_based":333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    criticalExtensions                      CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        rrcReconfigurationSidelink-r16          RRCReconfigurationSidelink-r16-IEs,","paragraph_zero_based":335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"dec1e4511df8447a3ea458a0ce278295c0151fd5172112dce961ebbde193783e","original_member_sha256":"d20a68ac0bd13aa84db23fe0b3c3cbdd952a7f22a689b8f8c07eda17c3796b74","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a3242090390f910e78ce33201fc8e71791d91373401f8c2dd48a18f1a1c9f30f","2a7caecc8f17a9f3160a2822bdbb2e45b614efeafe6bc359802d7d1195630cfd","25197ce748220c1cb788c6bca75cb67996bcbb7fc67834c7ce7adb348b3ac690","aaf17e43f3bc9b4ecb1feef55483cf5a044e0effabf301ae2d1d733e4472aa35","ebe6259289fa7516cb38464c764c8a74f08f4f20f7471e273cd3fedf732a4d0a","7cb19678b6b756077c45aaba493f6080110cd31d380f907426ea797dded57e92","1f1453da7006955b2629445c56aeb27ebe4ea73070834c01312ad7e4485a8828","0cc35a4759c13b904899f26114f6baee1225b1de4a7ec5239b3ada827f3a126f","482e593a7ca0db3dc405f6787839c6e6855af3ed2faf425553cf521e349afc2f","0889771dbd0458ff8c5cb65e284d1800807f2