{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306828.zip::R2-2306828.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"C","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE when operating as an NR L2 UE-to-network relay UE needs to indicate its capability to the network.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Adding a UE capability to indicate whether the UE, when operating as an NR L2 sidelink relay UE, supports forwarding of posSIBs or not.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Adding a UE capability to indicate whether the UE, when operating as an NR L2 sidelink relay UE, supports indication of the offset between SFN and DFN timelines or not.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE can’t signal the capability, meaning the network don’t know the UE capability when the UE operating as an NR L2 sidelink relay UE ","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"31d8e7d824d1ff57e6334e184dd23611ae20cafe6b061c860b99b00d2f132bca","original_member_sha256":"44738b49795fdef44ed28168bff588cafd0c70387bdf666ffb6903fe688787e5","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b734a644343312905dbfaacd198118abef91d8b821819cd6d4fdf6558919946b","a9684fa345fd4c2658b9c386f1088c87758f388b939abdb7fbcbafd971788a00","64195dd093aaffe7faea92f198455362d710aa62051d83991865f6b33cc7f269","f355b20b944493508a58b0ef5c9a4d826d50e3d3500e6052e39b1e782910a451","640e93ebb516ef82b9f3e42e5c67f165e49bd9495f39b96bbfaf9552a41a5123","563944ec8761cae22fad7b7b3485c02c69223c783dd7702a6176d00fde748078","1e4ebd22d9b29d168e0a65b731c2bc6fe6f55736bdc553cf981c18f8fa3b3fe5","3ff45975aca06d8b509667c141a2c97e810153331e0fcf52f44d506df98be8a0","0ad04535a4ed115bf1ea25483be00f2ca046620d1b0df30b19e06606731617d6","2b1e8cf332c1de242bdf1df222160d5116696284978fccdfb7b0a1d432b79479","2641fbe90e700ab22e239a741100c7941f6d4e72bdf342c65fe2a330fd0c518c","1293ecaf0d690b5bcbc8a8e96524a57262ec200f15e51dc9aecdd33cee736b99","6c852ba39b8c2f6e1805193f315df1dd894fb5a2009256234bab99d6bd82dd46","542922748a6964968b1facc37ba28453eb7045591bb78b0b219c0afce