{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306839.zip::R2-2306839.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"C","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-15(Release 15)Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Downlink positioning methods require knowledge of the system time by the target UE.  However, a L2 U2N remote UE may be unable to obtain the system time because of lacking a direct Uu link and potentially being out of Uu coverage.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A L2 U2N remote UE cannot request posSIBs from the relay UE, which reduces the benefits of posSIBs by forcing remote UEs to use unicast LPP to request assistance data.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An SFN-DFN offset is added to the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message sent from the L2 U2N relay UE, allowing the remote UE to infer the SFN timeline from the DFN timeline.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A requested posSIB list is added to the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An indication of support for the SFN-DFN offset by the remote UE is added to the UECapabilityInformationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An indication of support for forwarding the posSIB by the remote UE is added to the UECapabilityInformationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"13260ee9bba0a047cbddf8eb9f8f20d481d5022dfd7922f87b55d5afa5abf372","original_member_sha256":"8312534bc8869558e6089447be92e0f2ad7945068fda4ebfe19e0ca2e1cfbea0","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["11308d29405785c46b78089ab861ad15139f07c5210895a886050fa1c8a0abfb","c321c90dda42064663313ec4739dd2fe122869be00ec9100bd677ff649fb8487","7879352302225ce3090a71f6756dd97ba1594643a5f08d18ddf4dccc783b35d0","cff3e89cc7a8ef4f3cc088ac3088665ee7d1b0d0e6e5be52bd5145ff1332a986","90e28c9b45107b3693790d06f4404db5c003f1887b84c38505215f2e9cb7c9bf","1b4a6aedbe78c75749f01d1a3399a9f9b35243be4b4601da2a982d4c2472dab1","7fefebc2bbe33df760371c1364f9d0cf9aa3c8c4f6fc055eb63716d38f09d097","574afc84cef46ea105e9aea2d8b36a156a5936efb809f1bcd3849bcfcbd89ee4","39a4490d7739edcb5f9b28738b752269abce3a15a6e85cd52bcac80