{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2306839.zip::R2-2306839.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-RequestedSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedSIB-List is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the L2 U2N Relay UE has not stored a valid version of SIB(s) indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform acquisition of the system information indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List in accordance with 5.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9;","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedSIB-List is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release received SIB request in sl-RequestedSIB-List;","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the L2 U2N Relay UE has not stored a valid version of posSIB(s) indicated in sl-RequestedPosSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform acquisition of the positioning system information indicated in sl-RequestedPosSIB-List in accordance with 5.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9;","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedPosSIB-List is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release received posSIB request in sl-RequestedPosSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[…]","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.9.2Actions related to transmission of UuMessageTransferSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE initiates the Uu message transfer procedure when at least one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon receiving Paging message related to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE from network (including Paging message within RRCReconfiguration message);","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon acquisition of the SIB(s) requested by the connected L2 U2N Remote UE (as indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink) or upon receiving the updated SIB(s) from network which has been requested by the connected L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon acquisition of the posSIB(s) requested by the connected L2 U2N Remote UE (as indicated in sl-RequestedPosSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink) or upon receiving the updated posSIB(s) from network which have been requested by the connected L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon unsolicited SIB1 forwarding to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE or upon receiving the updated SIB1 from network;","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each associated L2 U2N Remote UE, the L2 U2N Relay UE shall set the contents of UuMessageTransferSidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"13260ee9bba0a0