{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2310816.zip::R2-2310816_38331_CR4352_(Rel-17)_RRC corrections for measurement reporting event Y2.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"D","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-17","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Aligning the parameter name ’y2-Threshold-Relay’ of measurement reporting event Y2 for the candidate L2 U2N Relay UE mentioned in TS 38.331.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.5.4.20, correct the “Thresh2” to” Thresh”.","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 5.5.5.3, correct “yN-Threshold2-Relay” to “y1-Threshold2-Relay (for eventY1-Relay) or y2-Threshold-Relay (for eventY2-Relay)”.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In clause 6.3.2 ReportConfigInterRAT, correct the “yN-Threshold2-Relay” to “y1-Threshold2-Relay”, correct the “event number N” to “event Y1”, and add the field description of ‘y2-Threshold-Relay’.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact analysis","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality: ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink relay","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f7a8d1d5e6569d018d76561bd746dfbbfd1aa32ad1bc9a6ef9d998095fcfb244","original_member_sha256":"8127484b2ec4002f72f8fe74eba5fd00ab2c47c38649dab50650fa4cf232781d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4ea5591218aa96d0cd407936b651eb165fb4c75e229dab64ec9de6be991cb96","2d00e3b1a82065155328ddd802c3d4a8ebff11f4a0d6da9ecf9b1e34dc8ebfc8","d44fc58904791abdae4a4743eb330f0c37acfc015d7c049a7af909954db8f604","761fa4d36b282591b5f5bb5ee554c6086f6eb9d5925f257d405f142f9e3a17e1","9ee3a8ef1b4d8b5d23ae68c79878f83d9a7ffdf02ec93cff53f7b1de6029f4d6","838e6ca766bc131dd607bf47b1764fe99f052310753b3692dfdffbc1b18e920f","b08252b53f111fda758564f01d6aeb287a86ceee9730eba0ca5fcf7c7dadb00e","5397ebe3cc2afa3393b897343a62f60e5b485315d8236802a715ec930f5cc336","f439ea8fefde97178c1c6b158c1ff05161a2262418d39e7b133465990e176835","1257bef6de0d6fbcb35da4ad9e5d1d2efb40539d216438a199be822d1e60e855","16c8d70f7d429c511b56c375317337c5d5c75b5a185ec91bf088b77069963fb7","acd6206245de4b9556a4853ff1b8b41875944834aa76df6c7d72af763f365262","3c4c80e1e11044a4d07c2d065ab1badcf74a3b84af