satisfied when condition Y2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f7a8d1d5e6569d018d76561bd746dfbbfd1aa32ad1bc9a6ef9d998095fcfb244","original_member_sha256":"8127484b2ec4002f72f8fe74eba5fd00ab2c47c38649dab50650fa4cf232781d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5b9d3e94b2e2469a162f36c651ac6802b31fcc4b4fed4f8769f27295b66f32e3","0e47661d68410752894205dee6a9bbbad763c4fb8f938472f606caa30fd5b3b2","84b64e4763ddd69c6783f0e7bf7162f190de4cd7e865c2c7064bf865d158c456","046072d789da32203b2dbdc5bf6faf7ce0947321bf61b1475c3867e7f07b4f28","ad7c58beb1d9e90fb0849bcd216a0fa195ed528b17181f725cf2b49a179cb8f1","826ddaefbd35bf5941dd0ba7402603c67afa4054d718e9bc0124542ef7dca6de","f93659204248bf7212a2a073874fa6ef6bab855e1f334d94d95f69bdfcb0d978","529374cab076196c1937a0e60f76aa3b6144dc80c94a186385d4558f9334aa9a","84cfffd8b170c458e9fd1f937758338e77952052a138c7c60120dc1e8ee9c412","f7b3a7bb9ad97a828da3323273c2deac8004729d61d7f2c7a25185dd92d4eb66","623edfeb67c2d41b2b9e147012100dce2f709456a108863b11db12637e74c692","972c89243ea25b912af8179a8be8c77ab6d50347dd064fa94fff2d9d947bbd4b","022031e640f79d734e0c0078695b4546709c7cc0e2d4b09f740c852d83464850","90739a9b5718a75a6036a95b91a37f44f1e9aef38922942dfe97f431acb1a425","6c4b79aee2df9417fdcf7ff053d8ed2a9ea25e31efedf31e6292500ff9c4b627","8a2054446422db10127b53522c244dd671006eed469081cd46119e9103434846","09696b54939497a8ca2ba620420c03c7479c8446d64fb680ae1962b6d211066f","c002616492b1923e46d6fa95a25dac7944411eca88ccdcee2199f265ed726678","d02e8cbd697ae1810074c3012247d88e70339f7889a7482c352e21eca4a8f878","bac486af70b51ab47627745058f12802ce6a65d9bdcb514bf3fcb43ccaf747f5","d23ba03f94e0e3c21a133033272d6ce3875191896120aeda8ee8e63ef47143d6","375335c81ae4da1ae878b355912dbcac20f24998e3e43e8b8bc9ad49b5d96d3f","a11af2158cc52281ce49227067b24be39c9cb5df83575ff471087aeb36319647","119a49c381fa315efde255fdbce46407dca1ead620b4acd5ac20ad93d9d45dec"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[96,119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2310816.zip::R2-2310816_38331_CR4352_(Rel-17)_RRC corrections for measurement reporting event Y2.docx:p96"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2310816.zip::R2-2310816_38331_CR4352_(Rel-17)_RRC corrections for measurement reporting event Y2.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition Y2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Y2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr– Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Y2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is the measurement result of the candidate L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. y2-Threshold-Relay as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is expressed in dBm or dB, depending on the measurement quantity of candidate L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.5.3Sorting of cell measurement results","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall determine the sorting quantity according to parameters of the reportConfig associated with the measId that triggered the reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for an NR cell, consider the quantity used in the aN-Threshold (for eventA1, eventA2 and eventA4) or in the a5-Threshold2 (for eventA5) or in the aN-Offset (for eventA3 and eventA6) or in the x1-Threshold2 (for eventX1) as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for an E-UTRA cell, consider the quantity used in the bN-ThresholdEUTRA as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for an UTRA-FDD cell, consider the quantity used in the bN-ThresholdUTRA-FDD as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for a candidate L2 U2N Relay UE, consider the y1-Threshold2-Relay (for eventY1-Relay) or y2-Threshold-Relay (for eventY2-Relay) as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the reportType is set to periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>determine the sorting quantity according to reportQuantityCell for an NR cell, and according to reportQuantity for an E-UTRA cell, as below:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if a single quantity is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider this quantity as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f7a8d1d5e6569d018d76561bd746dfbbfd1aa32ad1bc9a6ef9d998095fcfb244","original_member_sha256":"8127484b2ec4002f72f8fe74eba5fd00ab2c47c38649dab50650fa4cf232781d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["27bd99e1f108bde7