{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2310816.zip::R2-2310816_38331_CR4352_(Rel-17)_RRC corrections for measurement reporting event Y2.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if rsrp is set to true;","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider RSRP as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider RSRQ as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>determine the sorting quantity according to reportQuantityUTRA-FDD for UTRA-FDD cell, as below:","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if a single quantity is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider this quantity as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider RSCP as the sorting quantity.","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for a candidate L2 U2N Relay UE, consider the reportQuantityRelay as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.3.2Radio resource control information elements","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigInterRAT","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigInterRAT specifies criteria for triggering of an inter-RAT measurement reporting event, or an L2 U2N relay measurement reporting event. The inter-RAT measurement reporting events for E-UTRA and UTRA-FDD are labelled BN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on. The measurement reporting events for L2 U2N relay UE are labelled YN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event B1:Neighbour becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event B2:PCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event Y1: PCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event Y2: Candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigInterRAT information element","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-REPORTCONFIGINTERRAT-START","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"f7a8d1d5e6569d018d76561bd746dfbbfd1aa32ad1bc9a6ef9d998095fcfb244","original_member_sha256":"8127484b2ec4002f72f8fe74eba5fd00ab2c47c38649dab50650fa4cf232781d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0188eb36a4fcf74b6588c895ca8777d75c21cf5b4a9ce3d99b71fd3ca62662d6","1473b4df8edcc328706d3e3dcf31d6acedc97b3acf6c235db0c5c232bfa64a5c","d755b88632da6efdfc71ea853c1809c8331f2eef5cf1a14b8840e4a0da428886","579ec88ea961992143b31c14c9256bfe10a7f5d4f10c645bc2e1267ee1bc19ec","368331e9ee04bae8910f15bdf146e5f136786f9cec3bd9c69d704fe503457dd4","959af431bdee77264d97c202752b17b82abba3f5c66ebdc20485839d8486e77e","f7bef34e5bcad7f0d74855e733a356b5c7c1b7b6dcc075a886b8f9d600f0ca69","11533c2ce9e445bc7ce5edce5670154e915dc30e431b7ddd10c133829a709707","644e3662378bc758e30f