.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"B","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In Rel-18, new functionalities were agreed for NR to provide enhanced support of XR services, which require RLC protocol modifications.","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2 has agreed to report DSR including the burrfer status associated with the remaining time. Thus, ","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Delay critical RLC SDU should be added.","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The abbreviation for DSR should be added. ","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The data volume calculation for DSR should be added. ","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This is a draft of the running RLC CR for XR. To be updated based on the progress on XR in the following meetings. ","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 3.1, add the definition for delay-critical RLC SDU","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"1fd9f16534b26eee15baab3a47739160032c703a8d4ddc120014677d06b86450","original_member_sha256":"1880f869758b87c97e5d0e04077adac82a215fb7673353b85103b6107247d198","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a837fd3ae0eaa92ff670fdd31cbcf63297932aa7ce5325089952ca8b4891a6a9","fc1a5dd62cb621032eaa05d0d799fd867ad2d4fe893d7c6e90aec39b1bf4e3b8","9430c789fc838f10a6cf3895ee3414bdf61b2fa3511e29c78cc6dd3998e2133c","1c2e34cbf39db3e5ef4b51df5f82f84699f23e0f54035efc98ab88e34caa8ef5","9bda8d826e4b24d566e40c475b5f4c2af1c5e6a9a67563e9cf2f591756d772bf","6edafd6d8f8c1eda9f147776630442224888558f1284233a7ef386f07e41b545","ec00b57a3174473a74c4190fb3a8179e837c029e7915819ba7d0cfd5499e7e91","adf12cd83aa5ca45a08e373ef7f4a9687be5a80306c25c56e16b55e046734785","852dc26cbcb01b02b0861a906a9e5546a821f4d3261b16fb40c632805f128e36","0b821563c10dbb5476cbbc9ca7a672ae9d41ed600c7a66e4808d8e4f1bae40cf","2b5a17378899547d512cf96a59b6b36c2968dde1dc316df9655ebaa197f3d306","747c0cf43876246f2cf184c07fcccf14ad81b12dfd8028a304e9f5dc83a9174f","c28255a1d9f6e06d87506d3a96cdf7f6edb477d87b287f37d55e42eeef97f081","498427f3dd5747a2f3045e7afdf84f9e387237a529924502e86dbdf7f