{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2References","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following documents contain provisions which, through reference in this text, constitute provisions of the present document.","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-References are either specific (identified by date of publication, edition number, version number, etc.) or nonspecific.","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For a specific reference, subsequent revisions do not apply.","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For a non-specific reference, the latest version applies. In the case of a reference to a 3GPP document (including a GSM document), a non-specific reference implicitly refers to the latest version of that document in the same Release as the present document.","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[1]3GPP TR 21.905: \"Vocabulary for 3GPP Specifications\".","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[2]3GPP TS 38.300: \"NR Overall Description; Stage 2\".","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[3]3GPP TS 38.321: \"NR MAC protocol specification\".","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[4]3GPP TS 38.323: \"NR PDCP specification\".","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[5]3GPP TS 38.331: \"NR RRC Protocol specification\".","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[6]3GPP TS 23.287: \"Architecture enhancements for 5G System (5GS) to support Vehicle-to-Everything (V2X) services\".","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[7]3GPP TS 38.340: \"NR; Backhaul Adaptation Protocol (BAP) specification\".","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[8]3GPP TS 23.304: \"Proximity based Services (ProSe) in the 5G System (5GS)\".","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"[9]3GPP TS 38.351: \"NR; Sidelink Relay Adaptation Protocol (SRAP) Specification\".","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Next change","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3Definitions, symbols and abbreviations","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3.1Definitions","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the purposes of the present document, the terms and definitions given in TR 21.905 [1] and the following apply. A term defined in the present document takes precedence over the definition of the same term, if any, in TR 21.905 [1].","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Data field element: An RLC SDU or an RLC SDU segment that is mapped to the Data field.","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Delay-critical RLC SDU: the RLC SDU [indicated from upper layer (e.g. PDCP) whose remaining discardTimer value is less than a [threshold]]","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"1fd9f16534b26eee15baab3a47739160032c703a8d4ddc120014677d06b86450","original_member_sha256":"1880f869758b87c97e5d0e04077adac82a215fb7673353b85103b6107247d198","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["921db26a47fa7ddf7eaa2d52b42108eeefdd6de297e56d0204239c4ca8e3a9bf","0a14cafbefb6ef618c6cb134820bb44b8178e27bbd7238ed9e8ddf4bc6052080","7aaf9780a57b2f934d8c71cced2d60b9ea0d89c4b3213228f8864179ae8573b2","0c521936643f9ea3f56532d7e49dcc7381d1eaa638359ab731af0f062ab7876b","d9740dee13ff7b5fa1c11d6bf84de9632d5fcacea506ef9a316249d00ce04873","01ac9f991e93ad76ae85ec3bedc3853409ba522f87613f126f80d0e01af4e5cd","aad80b2eed1d48054914029df54a07548b28191edaf34aa212ee83d5a606427c","b41ad687bd98747844b52870f76c64f9b2c582a789d46079b2ca03503aec94f2","ef9e1b54e2e4e7824018c3fe9e14196ad8b49cdde975cd28c7ec291eb2f41ce0","d3e8dab3bcdd70fcdc156c5108f8aa1ad922ec9cd4ce30953beed39ddeffebf3","e6d1c95508c2ccd0c606e042f11c5e2832da3be404275a79039fa703e97f7da8","8dead7fc93372f1d569e5fc8070b8c5ad4753713675857e64667cdbcd5132bff","89a99c4c604f72337e2aa8c527b897395429f85ae1bb50649e4d1c1fe00b2922","7c6b2cd907b07adff703fa85c4caa25728f62993445a661d49a5cbaf1dc0538b","086f509c71752dd8cd4f4abdba87675674b99d5a4f28f8941f1b497182356318","dd476f25177cda0f6308bc4508ce650b260d1c323c2573a0a96f56eac6cf791a","87c9909d0f0a0a6cf51a233fbe8eaf084045b63eefce8515df1bc61451708159","7141bbda472996186e2e15e1ffa6e4123c24547fdd96fac7253b930903bac739","63f5f7b56853d54c12c51e5976b066880c0ff0d43a9f0eb7af7a204a6402f3c4","bcf0a2e5b495a46c6b8488c493bcd40902f71d346a3c5ae196c4d1aac9566f45","55fd1baa5004a64a2c6017f3376b8055d4d7ee5fea12d02da5ae9deb66a63433","36d7c118c2e8019f917d780663b6b6c1ae3b8af239d37f564d40c572b988c7a9","018a370a9e5a27d4d74902f55fc42125600bda26543d9f5e4b97ac7d6f38803b","edefabe4c791d8569dbf2163901b51064b3fee5d40a395803c81ae5345519964"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR sidelink communication: AS functionality enabling at least V2X Communication as defined in TS 23.287 [6] and ProSe communication (including ProSe non-Relay and UE-to-Network Relay communication) as defined in TS 23.304 [8], between two or more nearby UEs, using NR technology but not traversing any network node.","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR sidelink discovery: AS functionality enabling ProSe non-Relay Discovery and ProSe UE-to-Network Relay discovery for Proximity based Services as defined in TS 23.304 [8] between two or more nearby UEs, using NR technology but not traversing any network node.","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC data volume: The amount of data available for transmission in an RLC entity.","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC SDU segment: A segment of an RLC SDU.","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3.2Abbreviations","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the purposes of the present document, the abbreviations given in TR 21.905 [1] and the following apply. An abbreviation defined in the present document takes precedence over the definition of the same abbreviation, if any, in TR 21.905 [1].","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AMAcknowledged Mode","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AMDAM Data","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ARQAutomatic Repeat request","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DSRDelay Status Report","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gNBNR Node B","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBSMulticast/Broadcast Services","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MCCHMBS Control Channel","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MTCHMBS Traffic Channel","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDUProtocol Data Unit","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLCRadio Link Control","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SBCCHSidelink Broadcast Control Channel","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCCHSidelink Control Channel","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SDUService Data Unit","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SNSequence Number","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"STCHSidelink Traffic Channel","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TBTransport Block","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TMTransparent Mode","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"TMDTM Data","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"1fd9f16534b26eee15baab3a47739160032c703a8d4ddc120014677d06b86450","original_member_sha256":"1880f869758b87c97e5d0e04077adac82a215fb7673353b85103b6107247d198","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["973f2ea7b16942fa0da4410364bf4ba5343b07481703c1658ea9a94bbffc5d70","9414cced936fdbcedf2114c682fa69df2c55b6a840347bbbad7ea8b503986cf2","13f6ef3612dd786788c8b03e46ff08e39e39e2f04e4a9267c346c27dd6fea894","7c8843a1041e0a06d249f45c8d8bdc8ceb8bfd41c9cde317888e7ad5b726c6e4","875ced7a53b4ae4b648f8013ce7a34e18a524756c150f95d234475b06f7c33b4","7bad08f34e9f6ee283c0f520d253fb80db024c1c8b4050588d9be71e9aba74ae","744ef34d2221af7fc232ddc9a7b68b76f147505dd2b40221025f7f882a890a3a","5bdcbb4ea4738a21e465e689114ba906b37ad62aea42c65c5790ccc69d9c24fe","288164ceef9df63aa822481133ddd6a40c95a6f95ff6bf52b44691ac0b225981","de996df93c3f901984d6fb6e0153eb6530009e78575838c5e2f5ff4546c7cf84","4a52effa06581884f0163f589a5fca367e2e24e46864db84f69602ac1ac53e59","b3d1bbffad1b99bd8afe6171e730783b2460f78eaacb0f6380b8def3ad264c06","cc8256e4f5f61631916fd36027cdfb8dea75b91b22434341a4c01010f10ef792","1db49edbb4b3de48cfdd2548810acaf28f350d326cc5662fff2b47d984f3b3a6","7c51ec0d28562206b37ea7bfe958e79365ee8ceffa75d0cf62ec30a106af9c43","6f40fd8889a90ab4890d387589a6624db4724f7dbc991cd0394a7afd204930b3","8e88b08fea480ff30464638770ec46b755cb8b209b863605ae6f19c5817c0cf6","d4fd44187eb8ad5a49d73025f27d3173f71b3d5de5560d7ea460f8193a563543","7ecb7c31d92f107ece64196604bb36541d634ee63abc02117ddd1c40dd4fb0ec","ecf92bc7a0267d93429946cdde79461a85ac7034e56ecb477946fc02dd1f0c14","3f27b22e8a96641a1ddf9d8f9e7185698b0654f8acc160f229ec79a4c1e2f423","521cfe66feb4211063e2643907ef7052afdd1015871ed4fa703a584e0549dab5","025a281807ccdbdce172719287e2c9e026647302cd5114327057cc2ec0577265","3a80b5f703e2e9bfad3441db89eb6b133ff1353eec3551743d46727de41d8b48"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UEUser Equipment","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UMUnacknowledged Mode","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UMDUM Data","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor’s NOTE:The abbreviation of DSR will be aligned with other specifications (e.g. 38.321).","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Next change","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5Data volume calculation","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the purpose of MAC buffer status reporting, the UE shall consider the following as RLC data volume:","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-RLC SDUs and RLC SDU segments that have not yet been included in an RLC data PDU;","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-RLC data PDUs that are pending for initial transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-RLC data PDUs that are pending for retransmission (RLC AM).","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the purpose of MAC delay status reporting, the UE shall consider the following as delay-critical RLC data volume:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-delay-critical RLC SDUs and delay-critical RLC SDU segments that have not yet been included in an RLC data PDU;","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-RLC data PDUs that contain the delay-critical RLC SDUs and are pending for initial transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Notes: it is a placeholder for new mechanism for DSR. FFS how to calculate the buffer status associated with the remaining time. Depending on further progress, the exact procedure and location of this text may need to be changed.","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Notes: FFS how to determine the remaining discardTimer value is less than a [threshold] in RLC, e.g. based on an indication from PDCP similar as legacy. ","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Notes: FFS whether the data with discardTimer expired indicated by PDCP is also included in the above case that discardTimer value is less than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor's Notes: it is FFS whether the RLC Data PDUs to be retransmitted for RLC AM are considered for delay-critical RLC data volume.","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In addition, if a STATUS PDU has been triggered and t-StatusProhibit is not running or has expired, the UE shall estimate the size of the STATUS PDU that will be transmitted in the next transmission opportunity, and consider this as part of RLC data volume.","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"End of change","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"1fd9f16534b26eee15baab3a47739160032c703a8d4ddc120014677d06b86450","original_member_sha256":"1880f869758b87c97e5d0e04077adac82a215fb7673353b85103b6107247d198","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f23d588a4f1cce3f138fafe4e6e8d46df2e474a70cdf1f0496bb4081cd693899","48e9197d63a7daabe5db29854898601f1d0ba731bb02319d1f13eb252957ba6b","8ab28921798cfe59ef19533c6fa3e556c733535235108d9