{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Annex A– RAN2 agreements related to RLC","paragraph_zero_based":192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2 agreements","paragraph_zero_based":193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted specification","paragraph_zero_based":194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Comments, if any","paragraph_zero_based":195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2#121","paragraph_zero_based":196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5. Introduce UL PDU Set Importance. How UE derives this will be handled in UE implementation. ","paragraph_zero_based":197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Can indicate that in RAN2 considers PDU set concept applicable to both UL and DL in LS to SA2.","paragraph_zero_based":198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No impact","paragraph_zero_based":199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2#121bis-e","paragraph_zero_based":204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N/A","paragraph_zero_based":205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2#122","paragraph_zero_based":211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1: UE calculates the remaining time based on the PDCP discard timer value. FFS if UE reports one or multiple values. FFS how this is modelled in PDCP specification. FFS which UEs support this.","paragraph_zero_based":212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When/if UE reports remaining time, the reference time for the remaining time is determined from the point of the first transmission of the information. FFS if intra-UE prioritization can impact this.","paragraph_zero_based":213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Partially captured in 5.5","paragraph_zero_based":214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"1fd9f16534b26eee15baab3a47739160032c703a8d4ddc120014677d06b86450","original_member_sha256":"1880f869758b87c97e5d0e04077adac82a215fb7673353b85103b6107247d198","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8b22f0e8003dcfa67c3a55fcd15775c8efddfabcb2262eb3a38aa0d64d14e936","bb3fa5b745825e4a4820669ccb8b01252c46f8dc278046e23edcd6e6a6c896bb","7e464e483699962c7909efd7efe3349768cf4529ce456583a59d829b6be1e578","ddcbdcda5981de2dd151ceb2a733e026c4c318b2cb7c6287785491db318ba489","c8426519ae2d62984849d9ce2c2cefb1b7ef99a5e14682b86c54062373535371","64e0f8e843fcab1468f6ccec742e2537291ce587d3e44246d1c65a1158f51e24","601c6184922301327560093387a3f0ca2ae3b101e01468030a6b94d710019eaf","688e133c2f1a577e1806c4084049b8647a431801b3a02744be587c1d6aadc03a","3461078fcfef2b0cd2bf9936898dea6950f7ed8eed7dbf6d6224f4d4d5b6fd7d","c7993e127f2f04b700e8e57b368aa59aaf6e57d937a7a385efffcd047b762929","2144535ce4e7ab7b5c380867e58b3d8759006a41139a2c0e7df9af0593692019","137b214e47a5c6fca7d8addaada290f52371b8a7468c3b996216299e611cc4cc","ee48a70e7d01f84bd08aa05781560dce9ff0feca317b2ff66953641123b881e3","96058bb1a7e518433c9843e3453af95f2248f23907574a7c94b6304cfbab6ca9","19bf7857c118b5e97488d51e2af35a960c64cdc228272b6e889ace2747e91c5e","945b59f97fae04da9e1105240a4a381234ec1971076d35ffc629e8dcaeb928ec","3015c8a05e83ea7654b372368980010d41ffe5c08d62ca19006f6fad5dd98db9","9f87656f317cecfcbe669bac13956e65d7d2f6a1e3bbd4884efff9fb403612eb","bd29cee5f8a05fb012b0bf3c7c96e9f8d732c63677cc4122a01d152e701e93d9","d02b6a63d2cc7f382b621964751602b788ae978718c2223666d5bc4757fae9ff","459d0b9e796601a2a5cc7ea4260285d13d0872b3b52197cbe7dc1747f444e033","7714ac6e5ec8b7aa77c63996e8e7a6a836e4904c1d45298979403e16eadaee48","b3491fb7aa8b2bdd04689cd1a4009696066c42c454db95255741c391bf47d67e","9465e509e7ed095a4d7315c2ff953e24f32ca3caee7dda09221cd6bb8dd871a0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[192,215],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx:p192"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311903.zip::R2-2311903_Introduction of XR Enhancements.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2#123","paragraph_zero_based":219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Network can configure the UE whether to trigger delay status reporting. FFS if we have some thresholds per LCG.","paragraph_zero_based":220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No impact","paragraph_zero_based":221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When UE triggers reporting delay information for a LCG, and UE also reports the buffer status associated with the remaining time.","paragraph_zero_based":223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Captured in 5.5 in brackets.","paragraph_zero_based":224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Working assumption: Define a new separate MAC CE for DSR (remaining delay and associated data volume) reporting, e.g. DSR reporting is not coupled with BSR reporting. Detailed Definition of associated data volume is FFS. ","paragraph_zero_based":226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Support threshold based DSR reporting, e.g. DSR reporting is triggered when remaining delay of a PDU/PDU set is below a NW configured threshold. The threshold is configured per LCG. FFS whether configuring multiple thresholds for a LCG is supported. Definition of remaining time is FFS.","paragraph_zero_based":227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Captured in 5.5 in brackets.","paragraph_zero_based":228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN2#123bis","paragraph_zero_based":230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1.For triggering DSR, the shortest remaining-time left for the buffered data in UL is smaller than a configured threshold is used, if there is no pending DSR associated for that LCG.  ","paragraph_zero_based":231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Captured in 5.5 ","paragraph_zero_based":232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2.One threshold per LCG for triggering purposes is enough for delay status report","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No impact","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3.The data volume calculation to be reported in the DSR will consider the at size of the full remaining PDUs in the PDU set (if any PDU within the PDU set is with remaining time below the threshold), if the PDU set discard is configured.  FFS what to report for the case of not PDU set discard configured","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Captured in 5.5 ","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"1fd9f16534b26eee15baab3a47739160032c703a8d4ddc120014677d06b86450","original_member_sha256":"1880f869758b87c97e5d0e04077adac82a215fb7673353b85103b6107247d198","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d9bfe58aa1737032b55a24b5eb769d592d497a63dfc4a222728f7b1a46523d4f","20c65f0b692577560202c5831928c73e9fc06b60ddf4fba15131e07b9fea45af","9b773940a5331537c40c3de2c609ee6f9ea525b41c7f4f3f07e81bbba34a3ead","f0ed8c32707ba91679b1c6fe96e94fde730e76bb7b3c9cfadb61c9419fd79416","02f1f989ecb6f9746876207b7101f3fd8af5d5f78a23b435cf4810b2037c97ef","6e8e5580cf30256c2583466c65466bd66fab48d043a01a2cec0fe469ec385c17","6b6fb80b2748c5eef258c4e9b0cd7126f354b2de55dd56e2edf698f98938b3e3","5da011f4f30fc64ac96bbda3b51a89148f7c66c13d65d