{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311924.zip::R2-2311924_Introduction of BWP_Wor in TS38.300.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"B","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In RAN#100 meeting, a work item for BWP_Wor was revised in RP-231486. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The specification need to support for BWP operation without restriction including Option B-1-1, Option B-1-2, and Option C as agreed in work item RP-231486.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NCD-SSB should be defined in stage-2 specification. ","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In the WID, it is agreed NCD-SSB configured in the active BWP could be used for L3 intra-frequency measurement/RLM/BFD/BM. Thus, the corresonding description should be added accordingly. ","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to the WID, NCD-SSB could be used for beam level mobilty. ","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to the WID, NCD-SSB could be used for L3 measurement. ","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to the WID, NCD-SSB could be used for RLM. ","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"According to the WID, NCD-SSB could be used for BFD. ","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The current description for NCD-SSB for RedCap UE need to be merged with the description for non-RedCap UE. ","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"5beccf2c4f7bc5ba3600d747955377cdba92a80fa413985f5bae4049b3acb775","original_member_sha256":"d98a639b7aa49723a0879cdea4b6917ea304cb84ec0d9c26e2a2bc33ee4c3d9f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a5b2c7404317ec2b2a3e9f5d93dedfe4af3227f0674dbe949702c20b9a3b08c8","d361df68864d8bfc8a5bea3c8462dfc7605845b9d5ab7d1c3bca1d6ae353713c","87a497aa4a5b00557ef777948e65bde4aa306f7029c3a2649e409b0d618fb640","719cb717b1ba22af68809ce5254bec50d0fc050a971e83050ae3c56697c03b04","e89b1b0279ea95105956adffa57d51565ee90438d9048f7e1bcc868cd31b2dc9","3b47ac1718a980221177955d12e8fca4a39ef83feec7a0ce066bef186d6c400b","70ac89ef39c5de4bb4078ff75316210702155c25626d476c26597f0d28f48f27","0cf1aafe3e6a0c645874daecc0e24f9c3221bb2ef33262e66fbc77df2e7f759d","09b37fe2f1e3de300e1c82d3326e543ddea9831a44c36f5a25bc9d8b3fbbdaf1","8fcc1e2244764b7a6029e873e6e8487eba852c2b4559b9b50e8c10761a777e0d","ea48dd176c5978235a23ee1572e92ae3d910e1ddb6d7e9e3a1c892288660aa0c","4bdec475f57424e1df471fd3dc6e674acd67e51a5a4b1927bbe724c2199910ee","3adc2368f2916775fe7155cefb88893b290317b823c3d4aa7d3c8b4368ff677c","e11e2465e0651c231531c01a49499e344b091d5a094fc3398d6c14c7d32e213e","3f88615a374f2585c15e07f2bbcbb60a6026c59493954ecdf26b0734daf25b01","a105e237a88f4189c77d56ecb400c63a4c811376f0a1f3d5b6ee30d63caf0177","d3935b157608c50ecdc0b960199e932cc8eef61c70ce43bc3072c7946ab139f4","9a3e28f1f19b894d899ae962b6d933c419fca9e43d2ea56526fe674a82c2cb18","6cf415850a01a90d121c6a56b3e10ef08ad433b647f553fc7e43af725ba278ec","db95a4bbb2183535de0a070de8595de798fac6337b69b265aa235603c9b3696f","7ec54837f18ceacb456f7c27101bbc39afaa4735aa7b061934c13cce132971d9","7bf1bda560e73bcaaca07f693c92394a5c347e41e33998f923019f42baf97e36","2bbe83c446690436ca153d9dd3a7d31cecc430cbe879909485e3cc1aa7e32df8","f24d6a2484e8f48eedcf2279eb3ced512717a381b3c3d8b5d1f27aa5904f70f5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311924.zip::R2-2311924_Introduction of BWP_Wor in TS38.300.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311924.zip::R2-2311924_Introduction of BWP_Wor in TS38.300.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 3.2, add the definition for NCD-SSB.","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.2.4, add the description that NCD-SSB configured in the active BWP could be used for L3 intra-frequency measurement/RLM/BFD/BM.","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 9.2.3, clarify that NCD-SSB could be used for beam level mobilty.","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 9.2.4, clarify that NCD-SSB could be used for L3 measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 9.2.7, clarify that NCD-SSB could be used for RLM.","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 9.2.8, clarify that NCD-SSB could be used for BDF.","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 16.13.5, move the description for NCD-SSB for RedCap UE to 5.2.4 to merge the corresponding description for non-RedCap UE. ","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Specification does not support BWP operation without restriction for Option C, i.e. NCD-SSB based solution. ","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3.2, 5.2.4, 9.2.3.1, 9.2.4, 9.2.7, 9.2.8, 16.13.5","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other specs","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"5beccf2c4f7bc5ba3600d747955377cdba92a80fa413985f5bae4049b3acb775","original_member_sha256":"d98a639b7aa49723a0879cdea4b6917ea304cb84ec0d9c26e2a2bc33ee4c3d9f","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7501545662adaffb31da2c18f39357dfbca27e9c3715815fb20ab059b2fe1d8e","5b5de83dcce9ffe25d71800d28b95e95a9a6f6cc7214edffde33f95d2cd7e111","70347a375cf9159674a41905cd2817090ed59850efd417a7b8bd583b099268bf","cbe00265f06a0896743e462168ca533508df18b84ea3d8e3746bd8fb3779b472","542b6ee19ebb6076d0acb2f449421d26bd0aa51b3f622d0f56a9faac480bc746","f3fd1c9287f4cf5b24598752cc417aadc6ac3637a37382360df46d9ce3cd335d","28b35cf43dea2b5a3e43c1bc619f3b53b65872e0417dc5e0ad025509b63f50af","cc2394a68c3a169e33d75507c83ef02ff0598041f37fde5e7359da84e52dcd83","49675d7bc2bb1352389d40fad8d7dacd968b1099d3f98a6998f022687e91266b","34831615491529f6fb9ecaa78a1843748e77e161fd2444b34cfbf19ca6c5bce9","f656456a4f6815c88c1a1680746296c6c59dee66709da9927bd883de2fc6c0e9","4a41dc9aaf2e20869bfd3c40d22a4d055e9e8b47046c6f5324527fc8d698bd69","a83ae89dc805c139537a5748fc5d8af1e3a645ae9c727ddfc0b5a9e242bc1346","da48adfeaf727627355f798bac4611ce720fecfbdd2a4f29e0b651fd5353c94a","77049e4ed12794f2f411c20849f2ad5ab3c0b508b5ea08d15f440fb1de28399f","f2fd496cfadcd106e7dd10e9d5c8c1d2603a9e82c7b22acc6915c476675f12ba","6ed4e31f459f9b87effca8141fa2f46e11eac855d66470bd6a818fd3ec4574b1","4fa04ba648be1a27a6f1cb586ca2a73049395a65edc585f7843d950c8c5d7d0a","