ay.docx:p648"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay; or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case of L2 U2N relay operation; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqListDisc; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqListDisc has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met; or","paragraph_zero_based":678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink relay discovery messages resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink relay discovery messages resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay; or if configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case of L2 U2N relay operation; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message; or if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message; or","paragraph_zero_based":687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured by upper layers not to transmit either NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication or NR sidelink L3 U2N relay communication, and if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message includes both sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay and sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay:","paragraph_zero_based":688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met; or","paragraph_zero_based":689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon, and if the U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met:","paragraph_zero_based":690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink relay communication transmission resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay or sl-TxResourceReqL3U2N-Relay:","paragraph_zero_based":693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink relay communication transmission resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink reception on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell and if sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC is included in SIB12-IEs:","paragraph_zero_based":695}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1aa2e40f1e7533d1410b8c98fe0de6ce5872f5541f68f175018a74cb0253482e","420c949a884003f36e776eba2e510a53813fed4f1e07102b7699324f5408deda","04d5a349ad92a2d1a1484ab27c5dc6abc582ae0589e5add053dcdac9bd35f04d","096ebb90d7b4a4bd98009b121c10c5d0f2b5d6f84415d84e04e5159f42cf9d4d","6ea5987f9351a5fb6a6630f7adcba683730e1bd006c0ffc207780dec13222c95","36c38d075ef534ce58b16d48d336ae027bd10fbf1562b440151f676cab547a9e","5f4bfdcf89f502acc3cb3cce8469135b940bdba510d6b432a5944cbd32e24011","3749ccbbece0d67aad704ae314bd0cc46ad993c4ab3d26880d1e61dc2e2652d2","3c337154f920b4cdf14d87219ece6fd344c37a07a5db0b249fb575597e741102","a56cd877f306b7bc4d15244ec579e86f9f245cb69ec5cb0b5df0a6711f9a829e","8715b03747fb47d93eaf6af4afa77ecb5e11c564a0b70d81953cc48d2352bd9d","d76bc3800f9d7fb194e5b48052fed2d052dd16fb83ca60732770bb76f3c61c3f","45bad00b867628b8cd57c6165501f569dd111086392d6c3ad4d04ac60a99df0b","e72d8488b1facc07187fc9768d90ae81f2f8c10cacd46eeb504d403f4130ad00","4907b50360a332e68eb8d635068f631d7b3de025978261dd6700a27b1aa82ed1","e827ff3d2c8ffeee0217bb41c171c845178eb114d0b5cbef3b36e75327e45672","b18631ed32f42a7be801247497d815fce5fc7db0dde76c00050f444234e1fb3e","7a46b2e47a1f947a4a556e4b304835dfc0d154e8315033defb15dd38a8bfc036","8cd190cba57912ca06beb8b36928bbc8b0c72f85c78c18cf5c06386694ccb2db","fbd868d77a3d270d8bc590b736fe2d4b577bd7771f8fbda89af695b46844da8f","102f7be13756e338bbb258fd24a32340d0d939820dcf23a3db29dfa8622af9b7","1ee0a81b6440d3b09ac4093194cbf473722a3bef070feeafac1668b956d12d93","a29f064c784d142d80f48206c0d93cc38fd3c20a2cc7ff48ac03963e5626870f","3a0dd94a0a4bde375ce78ccb4b3b009c23ccfb593e39570de0479d36af8554e4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[672,695],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p672"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE received a sidelink DRX configuration in the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message for NR sidelink unicast reception from the associated peer UE and the UE accepted the sidelink DRX configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxDRX-ReportList; or if the information carried by sl-RxDRX-ReportList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the sidelink DRX configuration in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxDRX-ReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the sidelink DRX configuration is no longer used in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception and is interested in a service that sidelink DRX is applied:","paragraph_zero_based":704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList; or if the information carried by sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile(s) associated with the service(s) in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxInterestedGC-BC-DestList:","paragraph_zero_based":710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it is no longer interested in the service that sidelink DRX is applied in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to perform NR sidelink transmission on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell and if sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC is included in SIB12-IEs and if the UE is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE received a sidelink DRX assistance information or a sidelink DRX configuration reject information from the associated peer UE for NR sidelink unicast transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-DRX-InfoFromRxList or sl-FailureList; or if the information carried by sl-DRX-InfoFromRxList or sl-FailureList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report the sidelink DRX assistance information or the sidelink DRX configuration reject information in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink groupcast transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["73317b855793dc20d266731e0b68f2e883f4edf63ff4f066bac56caab5d55ec8","f1de66b5f537798caf5fade35c167bd733bc972c48ed3addc36d366c5022b911","817556b92ae2282a9b39941fa04859b6f2b1bd093123f81898c523a17a8b1723","cc435858bcee6479be7d64ab16d102b3bd7e4b38529cc921cb363f29861ed857","7cb740755e80e9940392d0f1df7ec920cc675cb035daf85970655bf7ba5354d1","83526bc4da41d703fa58c55afe663dd4b17cc1f37eae2a6d608a8a3169f2844c","2c8327abb91e61cb987c80c4e1ddeac8e3b05f21e66d6d9daf8a874131800fc0","877a7e2f80dadf28fac12293bac4601875bcd188e4d30b0c374496076a6fe0a2","6aae43204bedf95b72c00e9da00fbaba08c3d16f8e09eb2825173c58a9adbf16","f2212456f6b02be2e200eae29e1baf31567f4354ae208245e00012868a3e8466","13b387c683bbd09ee9f25f90a0f229d27a9ca2daf3651863a6eca0d58088e049","94dac0297b54952b0e19d73eb8346eb2213213382d03948bc445f0be54b8aa63","39ac642f0a5beb82e9e5c2325cef764918c14d2990b6c0c848331628069f4d77","c9e3b74d0d960d93b363a96355f2cfba7b4468621d506dbfea33b740ae299043","020fe3df932ce947eebca8ceeee5917ee7cad34de1092b2b1b3201a7039adf5a","3966b7bc9574b26f7790a9d29ecccd1afd43dfee5a5ab0e969a8a0c21f59c3ac","a669e6f3c416754d6d45048187e19f43729b381dca2ef583d23fe5f17ba9c60f","7a641f89dd5f33a7b0e2e89765675331da97ba28a9d8501853fce4f5846306c7","ae9293c700a2317dd65f4ec525adb93faa485f2dd33a7043bf80d9d5c799e207","4d8a1a6e8e96acb9212ab286e8e13e369c6e8ebcaaad4c89025c5fcbfc21658a","c5e0c775474e224be8b8d996ebdb47b45542111ba6489518b1689921d0fa0603","fb91cc420c15b162c8df6a668a161334bb68c7999453b2c150f093184d656a97","b6980467128279b90942125ae2b2545ae5394c1b87659ebca1ba32c3652a8ef8","f3ba31441b1b6d30b15edd74c46d40e1847e3b64be87a0de7fe2dfc909e497dd"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[696,719],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p696"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-DRX-ConfigCommonGC-BC; or","paragraph_zero_based":720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-DRX-Indication; or if the information carried by sl-DRX-Indication has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to report sidelink DRX on/off indication for the corresponding destination in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.3.3Actions related to transmission of SidelinkUEInformationNR message","paragraph_zero_based":723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to indicate it is (no more) interested to receive NR sidelink communication; or","paragraph_zero_based":725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to request (configuration/ release) of NR sidelink communication transmission resources or to report to the network that a sidelink radio link failure or sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure has been declared; or","paragraph_zero_based":726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to report to the network the sidelink DRX configuration for NR sidelink unicast reception; or","paragraph_zero_based":727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to report to the network the sidelink DRX assistance information or the sidelink DRX configuration reject information for NR sidelink unicast transmission; or","paragraph_zero_based":728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to report to the network the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile(s) associated with its interested service(s) that sidelink DRX is applied for NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception; or","paragraph_zero_based":729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to report to the network the Destination Layer-2 ID and the sidelink DRX on/off indication for the corresponding destination for NR sidelink groupcast transmission; or","paragraph_zero_based":730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to indicate it is (no more) interested to receive NR sidelink discovery messages; or","paragraph_zero_based":731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to request (configuration/ release) of NR sidelink discovery messages transmission resources; or","paragraph_zero_based":732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates the procedure to request (configuration/ release) of NR sidelink U2N relay communication transmission resources (i.e. UE includes all concerned information, irrespective of what triggered the procedure):","paragraph_zero_based":733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR is provided by the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-RxInterestedFreqList and set it to the frequency for NR sidelink communication reception;","paragraph_zero_based":736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured by upper layers to transmit non-relay NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-TxResourceReqList and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it requests network to assign NR sidelink communication resource:","paragraph_zero_based":738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DestinationIdentity to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CastType to the cast type of the associated destination identity configured by the upper layer for the NR sidelink communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-RLC-ModeIndication to include the RLC mode(s) and optionally QoS profile(s) of the sidelink QoS flow(s) of the associated RLC mode(s), if the associated bi-directional sidelink DRB has been established due to the configuration by RRCReconfigurationSidelink;","paragraph_zero_based":741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-QoS-InfoList to include QoS profile(s) of the sidelink QoS flow(s) of the associated destination configured by the upper layer for the NR sidelink communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-InterestedFreqList to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for NR sidelink communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5ec22817b7e8195dee44a1bec7b6b1b036653348d6aac7c13f92c4bc9d68864b","84adf1706dbd63050841c978fa660a66ebfde19aac86730f5b678da9664219cb","3fd71210f9ba0335b018e38d1ba6afc8091d4d6dc3ef0a4724ba55d81a471957","9f83556018c74823d15a4cd1603e63ebdd2ba2fa7eaa8fdd84f4fe5038c0d440","01397a9bfe9ee79eb10f8c12907c1c4acf1e5f0a9eb6c816dc11920e0fc5818b","8bff859d45c391d461d43ae94d89d9a7c8bb5979dab09cf48c0758f2c7c61e32","0ebdeacb8d453e5866726ac6fad3cb4c825879a3645129f75726b9599b9a1da0","1bce13c4006f6239b2ca077a26c42fb0a9db449a2d47a36c56b87a782a2d10a3","3ed439635974160493de514bcf95de60a4ea581e4012bd541eb2913804208a25","b68b1d48378e206f46b61e5d629b027ec1f54c9d1e85c44c8fd5686b727ece03","fb9e08266278a52ad5690f6f25a46dd4212acede9eae3928314429bebc84d01d","77907e44baeba2117f32945e8ad4c092dccfbae2835e2b91c16ca0494bafbf28","019bfe61dc9caba44b59bd8bcbaf3c0f8175c03b1be11164c2b3cb71a1d4cac2","6c9be07837598f2eb8b06ddf66041163455664b17512993714b14b25197a7e03","7ce3e900b2cca10146d3e9c7fea58ad9eaa4edc1b18b1d057445769d7ca43885","8542797653b1713a2e3a158c97df9658cfa55ed727685ba72bebcd39e85ae2b4","b74b7cefa496d4640b884d6c5546b510ab127e4e281969cdbbb6b13c77dff1cf","d2e84be10d2b48e112d3dcea2d19c1512cfdcfad37e0ca1c0303f51e630c9211","45ceae50fc06b6fbca56f4eb41763003ea63fb7380a39e52026d19c372ce1989","d0809610fb80c4b583a100b3ef4ad97486aca96aa988681bb4215fbeccb516f2","1d3fab0ed27b07bce1b5315a8f0c107964024c493031cc06027a91f0e6a16de5","98626a74626cf78f8a6ab9ac6f58aabf75b5316b0dda30eb62d876aa8b04addd","2b77f2a4e53d40a0365a985a1b6d260e9f292c0c10600b3838f412ae074bcf99","389e2f16ef6858830233c2d4ab346e29c097d1543d6814a6901d419aa9618889"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[720,743],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p720"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncList to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-InterestedFreqList for NR sidelink communication transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CapabilityInformationSidelink to include UECapabilityInformationSidelink message, if any, received from the associated peer UE.","paragraph_zero_based":745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if a sidelink radio link failure or a sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure has been declared, according to clauses 5.8.9.3 and 5.8.9.1.8, respectively;","paragraph_zero_based":746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include sl-FailureList and set its fields as follows for each destination for which it reports the NR sidelink communication failure:","paragraph_zero_based":747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-DestinationIdentity to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the sidelink RLF is detected as specified in clause 5.8.9.3:","paragraph_zero_based":749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>set sl-Failure as rlf for the associated destination for the NR sidelink communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else if RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink is received:","paragraph_zero_based":751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>set sl-Failure as configFailure for the associated destination for the NR sidelink communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 including sl-NonRelayDiscovery and if configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages, or if SIB12 including sl-L2U2N-Relay and if configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages, or if SIB12 including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery and if configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages:","paragraph_zero_based":753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-RxInterestedFreqListDisc and set it to the frequency for NR sidelink discovery messages reception;","paragraph_zero_based":754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include sl-SourceIdentityRemoteUE and set it to the source identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 including sl-NonRelayDiscovery and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages, or if SIB12 including sl-L2U2N-Relay and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages, or if SIB12 including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages:","paragraph_zero_based":757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-TxResourceReqListDisc and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it requests network to assign NR sidelink discovery messages resource:","paragraph_zero_based":758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DestinationIdentityDisc to the destination identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink discoverymessages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sl-SourceIdentityRelayUE to the source identity configured by upper layer for NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-CastTypeDisc to the cast type of the associated destination identity for the NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TxInterestedFreqListDisc to indicate the frequency of the associated destination for NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-TypeTxSyncListDisc to the current synchronization reference type used on the associated sl-InterestedFreqList for NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sl-DiscoveryType to the current discovery type of the associated destination identity configured by the upper layer for NR sidelink discovery messages transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 including sl-L2U2N-Relay and if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication and the UE is acting as L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include sl-TxResourceReqL2U2N-Relay in sl-TxResourceReqListCommRelay and set its fields (if needed) as follows for each destination for which it requests network to assign NR sidelink L2 U2N relay communication resource:","paragraph_zero_based":767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3f9cfeb1df00642b095f1bfe0f61c13a30acb8c0f36bffb170bb3d8bec295f58","4134314be9a46d5f588c489ab05d03173c5d230e155a77b984f89dd3a2c20759","552b15c7af3e69add1a674f005b4a9fffa3c49fd7b5ca71e5f6a745a36e951bc","761f18abb04e108188ff7b0b085bd7f7df6f208c5ed99841095498b6d75ecfc2","b2b4fc07ef454abe0349af4c0b9df8d3f281b7b53081145601511669ae05832c"