{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId from the VarMeasReportListSL, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":1536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop the periodical reporting timer and reset the associated information (e.g. sl-TimeToTrigger) for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.2.4Sidelink measurement object removal","paragraph_zero_based":1538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-MeasObjectId included in the received sl-MeasObjectToRemoveList that is part of sl-MeasObjectList in VarMeasConfigSL:","paragraph_zero_based":1540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the entry with the matching sl-MeasObjectId from the sl-MeasObjectList within the VarMeasConfigSL;","paragraph_zero_based":1541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all sl-MeasId associated with this sl-MeasObjectId from the sl-MeasIdList within the VarMeasConfigSL, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a sl-MeasId is removed from the sl-MeasIdList:","paragraph_zero_based":1543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId from the VarMeasReportListSL, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":1544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the periodical reporting timer and reset the associated information (e.g. sl-TimeToTrigger) for this sl-MeasId.","paragraph_zero_based":1545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE does not consider the message as erroneous if the sl-MeasObjectToRemoveList includes any sl-MeasObjectId value that is not part of the current UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":1546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.2.5Sidelink measurement object addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":1547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-MeasObjectId included in the received sl-MeasObjectToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":1549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an entry with the matching sl-MeasObjectId exists in the sl-MeasObjectList within the VarMeasConfigSL, for this entry:","paragraph_zero_based":1550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each sl-MeasId associated with this sl-MeasObjectId included in the sl-MeasIdList within the VarMeasConfigSL, if any:","paragraph_zero_based":1551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId from the VarMeasReportListSL, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":1552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop the periodical reporting timer and reset the associated information (e.g. sl-TimeToTrigger) for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the entry with the value received for this sl-MeasObject;","paragraph_zero_based":1554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add a new entry for the received sl-MeasObject to the sl-MeasObjectList within VarMeasConfigSL.","paragraph_zero_based":1556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.2.6Sidelink reporting configuration removal","paragraph_zero_based":1557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-ReportConfigId included in the received sl-ReportConfigToRemoveList that is part of the current UE configuration in VarMeasConfigSL:","paragraph_zero_based":1559}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62f