{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the entry with the matching sl-ReportConfigId from the sl-ReportConfigList within the VarMeasConfigSL;","paragraph_zero_based":1560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all sl-MeasId associated with the sl-ReportConfigId from the sl-MeasIdList within the VarMeasConfigSL, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a sl-MeasId is removed from the sl-MeasIdList:","paragraph_zero_based":1562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId from the VarMeasReportListSL, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":1563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the periodical reporting timer and reset the associated information (e.g. sl-TimeToTrigger) for this sl-MeasId.","paragraph_zero_based":1564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE does not consider the message as erroneous if the sl-ReportConfigToRemoveList includes any sl-ReportConfigId value that is not part of the current UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":1565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.2.7Sidelink reporting configuration addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":1566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-ReportConfigId included in the received sl-ReportConfigToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":1568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an entry with the matching sl-ReportConfigId exists in the sl-ReportConfigList within the VarMeasConfigSL, for this entry:","paragraph_zero_based":1569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the entry with the value received for this sl-ReportConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each sl-MeasId associated with this sl-ReportConfigId included in the sl-MeasIdList within the VarMeasConfigSL, if any:","paragraph_zero_based":1571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId from the VarMeasReportListSL, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":1572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop the periodical reporting timer and reset the associated information (e.g. sl-TimeToTrigger) for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>add a new entry for the received sl-ReportConfig to the sl-ReportConfigList within the VarMeasConfigSL.","paragraph_zero_based":1575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.2.8Sidelink quantity configuration","paragraph_zero_based":1576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each received sl-QuantityConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the corresponding parameter(s) in sl-QuantityConfig within VarMeasConfigSL to the value of the received sl-QuantityConfig parameter(s);","paragraph_zero_based":1579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-MeasId included in the sl-MeasIdList within VarMeasConfigSL:","paragraph_zero_based":1580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove the measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId from the VarMeasReportListSL, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":1581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop the periodical reporting timer and reset the associated information (e.g. sl-TimeToTrigger) for this sl-MeasId.","paragraph_zero_based":1582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.3Performing NR sidelink measurements","paragraph_zero_based":1583}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a515470b14f1eb9c36e5d3e1e350ff3f1c7582850b9a0e0340c61b8d8343e1cd","2f1610f8b66519d351b3e18123084873aa8adf72c5a6a739aa015a7accf7673b","4207b8f1426f53915f6d68c730312087e3bcaf066678e55264c036bd768cbc06","1423677f0a983e88c9ac4d4cb08c815309a9c498cea63083f62896a846151fc4","db4e410d9add9264af820e73c4b95d43c144aff5c1a6e08c9dc50db8332b4a1c","9373a428820658010a1ef7d64cdc138f6f49b018d513eb03d01912e2ea5d1614","8f19dc14f20b6343aee33c0a88f194fdeb8e1f493716e841ead7db781e9e27d7","3651b177e291f33016af7c1f8b3fcdd648d9f463a0cb51599aeb55c0217a4bb5","384cc23f54bafc2430322045343e7485f7974f084e6ff844216c92b5e1e5a7ba","f8be9216f9705eb5b174ed9e7d6446297a04084e0cd8874869fc5ef707a93b69","dbcd801f73f1f54b09940996d58eba59bd4fe84a0c3b2bc36299a14fad769a6d","c3aa2bf6edd6c1e6c86d77dcb1cdde9a00458e12a3b0fdb400c50113cf511cc3","5536164b414fe9dbd58eb5b37efbb04e56da898196a56bbbed549259043d1543","b468c878d724903b718ef2c0c10da840f66a2f64404b72d08f7d6d0a6466f521","bdc7230c6bca05ea94dffec872bbf96c92dc0e74551cf2a39dc6f1c913c4f0b8","bbb0d30a2ced182de49e42c0db7449aaf4b33005104aca071394b0e59d04af89","f9104f2721f4e5be9c666544ab0cfe708c755814bd1a4475cbce75605123cd4a","9df6a0baa0bac40a1820935a964863bc045884d67262162dfed80193a755a554","b71d1da2e6bc7efb26e7b9321ed8a0edac1a2035ff4c0b0cf007c631fdd8afcc","a9f8b57691561de9d4382ab187cbd50f5b4d998c78a8bcf11138e4256461dbbf","7bd1f5027f2e2f44ab59a19e4ba8865d05f5feb43c4842b51e40bc2201ea9714","602e7a9c8801418ed6491cd9bfada1e042ff1201a4124fc47b3dbc64259a29fa","faf30599db64ac035ff4e00107741575a20771cc2a220082e4803427493dac10","60a8d252243694a5ad2e9987f04a9afe05ca2a1eaad9701d897e226642332b67"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1560,1583],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1560"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.3.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE shall derive NR sidelink measurement results by measuring one or multiple DMRS associated per PC5-RRC connection as configured by the peer UE associated, as described in 5.8.10.3.2. For all NR sidelink measurement results the UE applies the layer 3 filtering as specified in clause 5.5.3.2, before using the measured results for evaluation of reporting criteria and measurement reporting. In this release, only NR sidelink RSRP can be configured as trigger quantity and reporting quantity.","paragraph_zero_based":1585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-MeasId included in the sl-MeasIdList within VarMeasConfigSL:","paragraph_zero_based":1587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-MeasObject is associated to NR sidelink and the sl-RS-Type is set to dmrs:","paragraph_zero_based":1588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>derive the layer 3 filtered NR sidelink measurement result based on DMRS for the trigger quantity and each measurement quantity indicated in sl-ReportQuantity using parameters from the associated sl-MeasObject, as described in 5.8.10.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":1589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the evaluation of reporting criteria as specified in 5.8.10.4.","paragraph_zero_based":1590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.3.2Derivation of NR sidelink measurement results","paragraph_zero_based":1591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may be configured by the peer UE associated to derive NR sidelink RSRP measurement results per PC5-RRC connection associated to the NR sidelink measurement objects based on parameters configured in the sl-MeasObject and in the sl-ReportConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":1592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each NR sidelink measurement quantity to be derived based on NR sidelink DMRS:","paragraph_zero_based":1594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive the corresponding measurement of NR sidelink frequency indicated quantity based on DMRS as described in TS 38.215 [9] in the concerned sl-MeasObject;","paragraph_zero_based":1595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply layer 3 filtering as described in 5.5.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.4Sidelink measurement report triggering","paragraph_zero_based":1597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.4.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1599},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sl-MeasId included in the sl-MeasIdList within VarMeasConfigSL:","paragraph_zero_based":1600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-ReportType is set to sl-EventTriggered and if the entry condition applicable for this event, i.e. the event corresponding with the sl-EventId of the corresponding sl-ReportConfig within VarMeasConfigSL, is fulfilled for NR sidelink frequency for all NR sidelink measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during sl-TimeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarMeasConfigSL, while the VarMeasReportListSL does not include a NR sidelink measurement reporting entry for this sl-MeasId (a first NR sidelink frequency triggers the event):","paragraph_zero_based":1601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a NR sidelink measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the sl-NumberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":1603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the concerned NR sidelink frequency in the sl-FrequencyTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the NR sidelink measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.8.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the sl-ReportType is set to sl-EventTriggered and if the entry condition applicable for this event, i.e. the event corresponding with the sl-EventId of the corresponding sl-ReportConfig within VarMeasConfigSL, is fulfilled for NR sidelink frequency not included in the sl-FrequencyTriggeredList for all NR sidelink measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during sl-TimeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarMeasConfigSL (a subsequent NR sidelink frequency triggers the event):","paragraph_zero_based":1606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the sl-NumberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":1607}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0c3301316fc850f8af87193581f7477b046179538b1907fa215dfec5144226ce","57d4920051ef27c3cacb672954d7b02cab534ebd27379387dccfff047e39c03b","233454e65c9b738e01d9f2c8ea18f1582f3cfe787fd8dd7232a8879567da9d6a","ad244ed099ff15789e78f80531a6461afc2b11b4d517e892910bfbfe6e319ab5","1d2ed60d4191ea604109876bd941d1edbe2f94c4f8b4cd5b6c5a57d0d586277c","29ff9d377ea63dae78ba8fd02b3d22d73397f5576ef805ee51bbbb19283e5d23","2682b9e1f54971638d8ed5cf1fc7c069669dae19e0c9fc7ebd31e3a89b4ba81c","3b758d4220da268e47f5d2d20c56ad88ca7339e9b07e37f417bbd991fa6db534","1b01464791c032cf034b643d0ad7506abf2d52cb9f5068e4ee298b0e7a102d4f","eb5a5dea7401f9d4a5b8b3cdf0e5842d0694ad122b96f611687fff2a6c70e585","c92e7c43a1e3b018932d6e2caf9ceac58cb6c557d4731a4af95a89f4e6cd84e4","f3be260b28c70705a9a1ef1a93c3bcc8325438f165bdcb26236d1e6c66b191e1","6990cc2afaad8a6b5f358aa1b73ea7d5c049722ddb81ac9d01430a84d0b0c375","ca9d4769a10eb4566c399b8f7a7820de4c3a28bb8bd714bbeb6bad5dcc61aeed","d4a3c0abbe4f639214c8fc4951cc78f35cb6401a679862ecec994e67b9ef7029","016b09ca23ca79d3c82782b461b3dc38559b3957b4e88fad02e4a768d5747fb5","1211f7d7cd44bafba3ac5bd701087e2394b36707aa2dfbc8a0a63b59d62dd844","4cd641f7c61651319baac46fd0d5d3091fe7c7ebceb232d17c3f082862cc6cce","b6df7c6ae512ef2fc99110ee4c5fd2bd983a85c4738509fb4cbbac42dc6eaeae","9ff169cd18743f199fa7e7f11e887b305e933ecf59a7769d455bf5db5ad1e083","eaa108c997562f8a07ef918c3de12e8c9ae78c0e867324a636addc97b15fa586","6e4f2e7477c00cc2ad05af6f0c5822114f4a4c9edcc4b82983e4288f8fc7067f","adefacb393283e26d6e8ecd787415163aa0ee1a2438f5e984f55900e89623cca","fc73ffc8924cc2d7c6d4ff42786006c3a579ae3c1f1f644304fa84620eda2fed"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1584,1607],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1584"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the concerned NR sidelink frequency in the sl-FrequencyTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the NR sidelink measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.8.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the sl-ReportType is set to sl-EventTriggered and if the leaving condition applicable for this event is fulfilled for NR sidelink frequency included in the sl-FrequencyTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId for all NR sidelink measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during sl-TimeToTrigger defined within the VarMeasConfigSL for this event:","paragraph_zero_based":1610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the concerned NR sidelink frequency in the sl-FrequencyTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-ReportOnLeave is set to true for the corresponding reporting configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":1612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the NR sidelink measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.8.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-FrequencyTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId is empty:","paragraph_zero_based":1614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the NR sidelink measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop the periodical reporting timer for this sl-MeasId, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-ReportType is set to sl-Periodical and if a (first) NR sidelink measurement result is available:","paragraph_zero_based":1617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a NR sidelink measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the sl-NumberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":1619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the NR sidelink measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.8.10.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the NR sidelink frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":1620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon expiry of the periodical reporting timer for this sl-MeasId:","paragraph_zero_based":1621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the NR sidelink measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.8.10.5.","paragraph_zero_based":1622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.4.2Event S1 (Serving becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":1623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition S1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":1625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition S1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":1626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this NR sidelink measurement, consider the NR sidelink frequency corresponding to the associated sl-MeasObject associated with this event.","paragraph_zero_based":1627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality S1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":1628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":1629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality S1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":1630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":1631}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["93e210b7abcb52e315a8b1f4a7d1d00f657ac795dc67327ded6cfceea41c528b","09da72ba379b84f3f70f1a4e1f45a11fabd0e8193c8a3f2f3a949d34cf5d6926","7dec2363e830199e9cadbceb8d6e4b75b9c137f02e1e220b48ccbf2a09e4867e","a71b9a0e488d25a5bfc939cc08c5ece76e7aef4ae0808cd1f8d69d6b913f117b","3b4f1797340881b549a0c5a43b11f9fa8743e6377c527dd8e9c04faaa18832c5","6a6c65b04ad7d2eeba032860517b85688b7a53dfe23784f0c90158fb7f0fe4f6","84f84499ba1ad32b83fdf63f40f35b380c92e3a2304d0c2d31f32ddbc596486c","72c9e9e0b7b0672fcc4113980108bfd9a9e8c9bc613165a47bd045e9c0848495","f43150317c51b792e1b4f0e03afbd170abcc066c4a3cdeb847b5648c1e1f5412","f362b53c5e38eeda48d37faba802b723a9f6c1b680ca8c2212f1684078b65615","5c2f52b436c709fb5b8ef08c2f5276b9439a95a9e6621162c6a87a3519a27ce5","323d5bca8e21854be918a0a3be125cd4f0107d665d0e4a362952c4c0cbe042c9","993f51886c153b128af6fbd78581a73119797953cb027416bd072145b6ff51fc","f1e3f7f642027cb0bc357465af981f358cae50bd0c2dacfafc4fc0a76dfc74fc","16e0e1b5f6f7da05994a5be74768f3bd6275b6c03a7de0254ee626c957118903","f35433652e07d158ea9309d2869522fd2dc86b644f15266089d3de555cbe5d11","ee2b603ef4f070cfc4574569c0f6f7566a85a62ad98ab5e486b890580bd6f431","3cb3424d2e1a0f94ba0ddcea4e90db2c468943ecd395b8987f6c8c3c82955092","94dc13deaeef77ad0d4cfdcf58b4ca7a31c7043e860d37e351471ab88f9fe16f","2acdb293966113bcb4dc1455b473c19a83d0d481b7a97b33cf74e885343a0017","b552c622e95e1196e7420f1e4473b6250e8aaa2ab85881d8664a191c18037dce","29eac0a225b6bf4309cac6c05838d1396a96966c681c7ee831f0c3a1f170269a","234f224613e9e45399edfa2d8933c33de11d66b9e255ec07f618a68b5c47e5b0","feff08e8f36c065dbf0068b782fd4939aae32503bd8e7be15d17cfb1dfca59b7"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1608,1631],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1608"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the NR sidelink measurement result of the NR sidelink frequency, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":1633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. sl-Hysteresis as defined within sl-ReportConfig for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":1634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. s1-Threshold as defined within sl-ReportConfig for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":1635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP.","paragraph_zero_based":1636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":1637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":1638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.4.3Event S2 (Serving becomes worse than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":1639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition S2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":1641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition S2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":1642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this NR sidelink measurement, consider the NR sidelink frequency indicated by the sl-MeasObject associated to this event.","paragraph_zero_based":1643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality S2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":1644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":1645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality S2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":1646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":1647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the NR sidelink measurement result of the NR sidelink frequency, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":1649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. sl-Hysteresis as defined within sl-ReportConfig for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":1650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. s2-Threshold as defined within sl-ReportConfig for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":1651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP.","paragraph_zero_based":1652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":1653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":1654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.5Sidelink measurement reporting","paragraph_zero_based":1655}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["537d448a4cb6a9d8f8b8171c8f2eb0df03a1e46c1a49d7aed17d7ac2d25094f4","79a93c19b5d7794cc8668a5c54c782ccf826ceac70eafb4b5cf033f98521a643","5071844a796079d94f60aafb085f42896be912e80813156e6a77ede8933288c7","1d16a54ca89461dcbb25267e3526f8ad717eb0bed6ff086ae41df14477c2e1a7","834725e416762495bb48bf89a993e7362f7a17f0002bb3bb0a794b9bb234f290","0f0b2d4af774eb859ccd14f1492075d0bdd0946d0b1b85f0d527775e7dd5f8f5","e6eb71220ebb21c7b4ca766d6234216057ac1eb8a7dac9d98124e0e2f6088b10","8eb75a32d6d3bd44cfc29021d8fca0fc350724cf6220b706341b46230cbdc8f6","fda6bac551db21e1a4563181a6f15153bb999667c0c00000c6125407de25a170","20f340ba4ed69b3ab8da0a12e078fe13be09d3be7366105df8be904014521519","182c196e028fb9095e37f6583c5b6f414624e71fc7e3bff8780ce274cef685af","3109ef5900d0eb7bc00bb69566c2fd63ce133b8579022eefc0dab949268e4dd0","4615d040b832a7cb9f3489d6b72101f4f97da0fda8784b3e8426265706e8a710","a1a7f80cbab876cac19b90ce73afe9590a4b9460f8f47c2b34cfb0f23a89c87c","396a5f882e479692db3a102569d9ee76b4a5f3fddff1fe0558f98cb181a24cb1","7d6514682f83da9033a9cc65ed73518d15c0763c4793734b77ffe157d9d98cd0","bb25b06f88d04801e2ef6aa7397cb18b796b07a5f95b457eae67bfb4d72ef75a","1a1d134ee347fad31b4e7527a3d0eed09f62bbb9897a5a3ae7363e5b4ec062d7","f94d570c6913326b9e73bbcd347c04aee8ee0bae857421b9a9be433e1a11a22b","5ca32db98d1c97d2c0178a180d47856c93de2adc96bdee75f0ad0ea2765fce96","c900fbf883b396d5c8d7084132b492b9d7dca73c3a33a7dd51d77c73eed1e7b0","7f6757432dc586188c1af06d5d477aa03c221ab1f5d4e11becb88d9e1c7d4c9c","66851644175eb7a046882ef66c1cb8953252aaa114ca51bb73c72fe86fe40cff","57f6c3258bfbafc773a71810f73453a37145034c9e3c1c256b0a48bcd423669b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1632,1655],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1632"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.10.5.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.10.5.1-1: NR sidelink measurement reporting","paragraph_zero_based":1658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to transfer measurement results from the UE to the peer UE associated.","paragraph_zero_based":1659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For the sl-MeasId for which the NR sidelink measurement reporting procedure was triggered, the UE shall set the sl-MeasResults within the MeasurementReportSidelink message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-MeasId to the measurement identity that triggered the NR sidelink measurement reporting;","paragraph_zero_based":1661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sl-ReportConfig associated with the sl-MeasId that triggered the NR sidelink measurement reporting is set to sl-EventTriggered or sl-Periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":1662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set sl-ResultDMRS within sl-MeasResult to include the NR sidelink DMRS based quantity indicated in the sl-ReportQuantity within the concerned sl-ReportConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>increment the sl-NumberOfReportsSent as defined within the VarMeasReportListSSL for this sl-MeasId by 1;","paragraph_zero_based":1664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the periodical reporting timer, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the sl-NumberOfReportsSent as defined within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId is less than the sl-ReportAmount as defined within the corresponding sl-ReportConfig for this sl-MeasId:","paragraph_zero_based":1666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start the periodical reporting timer with the value of sl-ReportInterval as defined within the corresponding sl-ReportConfig for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-ReportType is set to sl-Periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":1669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry within the VarMeasReportListSL for this sl-MeasId;","paragraph_zero_based":1670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove this sl-MeasId from the sl-MeasIdList within VarMeasConfigSL;","paragraph_zero_based":1671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the MeasurementReportSidelink message to lower layers for transmission, upon which the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":1672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.11Zone identity calculation","paragraph_zero_based":1673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall determine an identity of the zone (i.e. Zone_id) in which it is located using the following formulae, if sl-ZoneConfig is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"x1= Floor (x / L) Mod 64;","paragraph_zero_based":1675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"y1= Floor (y / L) Mod 64;","paragraph_zero_based":1676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Zone_id = y1 * 64 + x1.","paragraph_zero_based":1677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The parameters in the formulae are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L is the value of sl-ZoneLength included in sl-ZoneConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1679}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["01e8b27eaeadfa235c7000155d287330ddc04f76c7ce10767206af4467d3d290","280c498f3f9ce3035c23542c9b98761a40ce65d19585eed7e1d460ec5bdb44b0","9912510f4c1c80c05772322b4c86c4037db439b260f15ca9014bea6cd24576b9","127ceb4ae603f43337acc4900855ce04ed02a6a0a9d87be268d2ff4210e68a1f","1d7f9e0de83eb0e6890afd67c6cd4cc5998f553f5a9ad6cb5d13f227dd66ac96","4811774bcc969d931bebfcefdd8e6fe96e14478974fec99711479dcbe675d24c","dd872b5ca40b5d2695bc1c3d20d7099bf2718a1fc7cbe183bdb643eef62a2ec2","51f57d057074bc0098118476087a8fac899a7af579d3d3c2058083a857c4eee3","b1cbb88bb0c6dcd91f14ab9ca788462f69ce87b0f4044bc680695303ddb3f082","8f6d0ce87a06f27872a8f0ed1d0fcb7a4205e254ed3fc91e1e9bc787c42e8c87","449fd25e13a30090dd2440f5c77a8b84bec7a8e1a57de5223600314c25312d64","622e7fd9f53fe3cae8288e4a79e39e3aff497209a3e845a077809dc4caf351f7","b74ec4eb00fabde46347c19b213cd481fd3c830a7a24d3c714df0f102abda4e0","cc97504c9b81eb12fdd7101bfab85b0d8c8953d8b75da869a2eb56b883635b0e","f5c5a736fb969c8f1b2ae202501f4830dec196a2b00354475d60f9dd3ac1a8b3","f4d11fa2cdaac727291485d6286f705842bc2a2cf2279a226f01a638eaab4e90","629098d251f0e9d211962139b19839e5ac73135f5c09b4100f1a6b9f404e516e","16605b14b7e80ba9dee35de5b03cb03a0972834a0a9cad0edbe4907610f73b9a","d2844e45b391e9c87a4c88d3a4be3acf0f466b7a7688fad8c2d3b6ddb1f39004","c34b7b8af0528e28fdd90a1c15f45dd439b23e6778755af1d56b156e626ebc96","efeec4eff98fd5b64f5312417a83f2ff909eb49dfee20be0568c661f4e1278e4","69ce733c2102ae16925da69f15ff26f67174005dea038bf962d0fbce05939a6a","278c651bdd135860d64c476e5b15bded8ebfd9f18a750d23951079e260fa669e","4af8b4fda51c6d4314ed2cb1f4e9e3c9eb36d515802c6b10bc7b0ad6d6a76ff4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1656,1679],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1656"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"x is the geodesic distance in longitude between UE's current location and geographical coordinates (0, 0) according to WGS84 model [58] and it is expressed in meters;","paragraph_zero_based":1680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"y is the geodesic distance in latitude between UE's current location and geographical coordinates (0, 0) according to WGS84 model [58] and it is expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":1681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:How the calculated zone_id is used is specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":1682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.12DFN derivation from GNSS","paragraph_zero_based":1683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When the UE selects GNSS as the synchronization reference source, the DFN, the subframe number within a frame and slot number within a frame used for NR sidelink communication/discovery are derived from the current UTC time, by the following formulae:","paragraph_zero_based":1684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DFN= Floor (0.1*(Tcurrent –Tref–OffsetDFN)) mod 1024","paragraph_zero_based":1685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SubframeNumber= Floor (Tcurrent –Tref–OffsetDFN) mod 10","paragraph_zero_based":1686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SlotNumber= Floor ((Tcurrent –Tref–OffsetDFN)*2μ) mod (10*2μ)","paragraph_zero_based":1687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Where:","paragraph_zero_based":1688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Tcurrent is the current UTC time obtained from GNSS. This value is expressed in milliseconds;","paragraph_zero_based":1689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Tref is the reference UTC time 00:00:00 on Gregorian calendar date 1 January, 1900 (midnight between Thursday, December 31, 1899 and Friday, January 1, 1900). This value is expressed in milliseconds;","paragraph_zero_based":1690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OffsetDFN is the value sl-OffsetDFN if configured, otherwise it is zero. This value is expressed in milliseconds.","paragraph_zero_based":1691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"μ=0/1/2/3 corresponding to the 15/30/60/120 kHz of SCS for SL, respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":1692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:In case of leap second change event, how UE obtains the scheduled time of leap second change to adjust Tcurrent correspondingly is left to UE implementation. How UE handles to avoid the sudden discontinuity of DFN is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":1694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.13NR sidelink discovery","paragraph_zero_based":1695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.13.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to perform NR sidelink discovery as specified in TS 23.304 [65].","paragraph_zero_based":1697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.13.2NR sidelink discovery monitoring","paragraph_zero_based":1698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink discovery that is configured by upper layers to monitor NR sidelink discovery messages shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the frequency used for NR sidelink discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList in RRCReconfiguration message and sl-DiscConfig is included in RRCReconfiguration; or if the frequency used for NR sidelink discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoList included in SIB12 and sl-DiscConfigCommon is included in SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured with sl-DiscRxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception included in RRCReconfiguration message with reconfigurationWithSync (i.e. handover):","paragraph_zero_based":1701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the resource pool indicated by sl-DiscRxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception in RRCReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":1702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is configured with sl-RxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception included in RRCReconfiguration message with reconfigurationWithSync (i.e. handover):","paragraph_zero_based":1703}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fc0389fa879ccfda17145f7b6a1695d9211acd88b074912f9d7fe91fbec69c3a","8e603ced86a852d549ec87caff8bfa316acf859b4c9a42d8bec0c271fa25e181","35c82b05cced7f0276f24cbbe1170977c5bf7a69fb162868105624eb900ae076","72bd2793f319788cf0f29179478e72305cb5faa0b8ac381ce5f7437413cd2221","09fd752765cffdc3ab8f6cf34e5192b88b7c20398e9ff63059911966a9498c4a","22446bd0f52732b33a288d3f23e0e1b9f59c5114e08f6533825affd18e54a24f","893c007ab67b07c06101880fcd08c5b4dabac1ad0b58fbafe3302b892637edaa","abd0e714ded6b005df779d4f8a82d465d82b02662bd725f933d909ee3f624d90","24f7a5fd16d1a257b085f34fbc9a5c60e54c5a0fc7499d0a46745f23b258d39a","6fa3b6915a21936b370783f4f76921a1488171b060c25f01ad3ed031d07c6920","b3d64541b45718fd230e2d1337ddd49521dc8feca7db08e7da4087f8581d3e1e","8cb33610c99ba0180c7def8c7e7d6d8cd229be0b3c8ede3c4d7ae2d3ce875ced","00ccf13b98af6a9a7aecfcfd170d5d77a8892bcac1e15ad559c241a0a6ae54a1","d227c988359d69d8ab45e33205a5c14f8f3ba42002998cf2e94ae5c574db5bb6","8524f3f9790e57e8706c1e7f64e6928bdf700970bcd2291204f7c92dc9b6a2e7","da8cb65f5115a90538a1c32d658d9e2140261748a1f0902e818477e6dc2a0483","6679f5284994f66601541df9052d33c2b5945bd470f22994f9ca39ebfdda0dc0","d357675df0ef4f4a64963017c6a8e42dfd141aca1972208e15a2884cb6d65703","0f865cf086bdb1bf61f9ce165f669b3a5060bc880b44bcd7d761909d8da6280f","de8a01b0e1bfaef74bd18e638b1c0df0d24e9a751ca614b32cccf7801142b0bc","f88612db5712e5421fcbe3159e82ee650eed8e6530bebed771f1bab131b2a99a","e4504d0b7e4dab59c8bff8454fdf140fd9066f4b8abe4f7e971fda59b9cd4a5e","cbb242c55d059d8ed06cb2ede6c2e23d4128bdf646daf7a0fe572e356dd05fed","6e38eaa49aa697e9ee5412ebcd7362dbd0042f0cba15fe3bef67542301fc3b37"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1680,1703],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1680"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the resource pool indicated by sl-RxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception in RRCReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":1704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the cell chosen for NR sidelink discovery reception provides SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-DiscRxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception is included in SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the resource pool indicated by sl-DiscRxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception in SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":1707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if sl-RxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception is included in SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the resource pool indicated by sl-RxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception in SIB12;","paragraph_zero_based":1709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if out of coverage on the concerned frequency for NR sidelink discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":1711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sl-DiscRxPool was preconfigured:","paragraph_zero_based":1712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the resource pool that was preconfigured by sl-DiscRxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception in SL-PreconfigurationNR, as defined in clause 9.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure lower layers to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the resource pool that was preconfigured by sl-RxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception in SL-PreconfigurationNR, as defined in clause 9.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:If sl-DiscRxPool and sl-RxPool are both included in SIB12 or preconfigured, it is up to UE implementation whether to monitor sidelink control information and the corresponding data using the resource pool indicated by sl-RxPool for NR sidelink discovery reception.","paragraph_zero_based":1716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.13.3NR sidelink discovery transmission","paragraph_zero_based":1717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink discovery that is configured by upper layer to transmit NR sidelink discovery message shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the frequency used for NR sidelink discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoToAddModList in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message; or if the frequency used for NR sidelink discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoList within SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and uses the frequency included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":1720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is acting as NR sidelink U2N Relay UE and sl-DiscConfig is included in RRCReconfiguration, and if the NR sidelink U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met based on sl-RelayUE-Config; or","paragraph_zero_based":1721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is selecting NR sidelink U2N Relay UE / has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE/ configured with measurement object associated to L2 U2N Relay UEs and sl-DiscConfig is included in RRCReconfiguration, and if the NR sidelink U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-Config; or","paragraph_zero_based":1722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is selecting NR sidelink U2U Relay UE / has a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE and sl-DiscConfig is included in RRCReconfiguration, and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions associated with the peer NR Sidelink U2U Remote UE as specified in 5.8.X2.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U; or","paragraph_zero_based":1723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the UE acting as Target Remote UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model B and sl-DiscConfig is included in RRCReconfiguration, and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions associated with the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE as specified in 5.8.X2.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U; or ","paragraph_zero_based":1724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model A or Model B response message as specified in TS 23.304[65]; or","paragraph_zero_based":1725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model B as specified in TS 23.304[65] and sl-DiscConfig is included in RRCReconfiguration, and if the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.X1.2 are met based on sl-RelayUE-ConfigU2U; or","paragraph_zero_based":1726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE X: For U2U Relay UE and Target Remote UE, it can be up to UE implementation on cross-layer interaction for the AS layer condition check for discovery message forwarding.","paragraph_zero_based":1727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["eab537cac8479bdaa938147971118bcf779805959d9e97d17d36f263c37b0f06","7ed46cc397b564330a764e34c3be694d69a886c8ee850c3f0cbdd58e77d6b8e4","9129095a9aa39b1ed4956b97bddbd6a41ce748377b4fb9525ab48421ca5cce13","a9bda294f76c9ca558534ab0ba21f72ba16bed93340637ee47ab8098602ffe64","a3ec0789d51575a25cf16565ddf1e364b0f6acd900abc13393fdf96569111d29","1b9eae4c36cf21c38aa3f893ebfff4b0d84c97171a14b8c9a9ff023913de984a","9618c69c58deb28d1e3832e043befb07d97fd130c7fd649e63845fbc0c185ecc","196f2441e933260cd2a0bb741058fb4026fcffbc59a7e3a9bd29078f091c6423","14f6c6c65110a64cf780120b330046b9f9dd4be09a80896e92891db54787d0cd","87e4a4274fd3735893715f900f1ee1c7e14c3178df21ae2c93a26de19c826ba9","4dcffba2b6b38edf8dab40e9e769ee68f8065ca16e5a9875110ef1e7f61526c0","7e839c669f04614e0eca2e8f7bc3fa6e1c4e75bca54be7c31cb6b68cc8ff8453","1719b84674f65058502e1dda9013de739ff898caca6bf637052a42f78e297e9d","428151f0dbe0d9286fef884f2330d4b3f555db726dd5cd37e95a8e58b2f282e9","7ec86ba58cfa99c6da0ef7ae47a851263e0cadd95d33629900601bb12e5954a3","614fc863a3a8c92176d04f63e7bbd9b72d6fb65e878f6d4ccccc507d17e672f8","24f3579ea2ad4477f5acbec2bd1bacd167dc45ab76e90c6fa83a0e784b8bbb12","231e80bdc89e0ab5074ca7b02e329071902d002a77312c3357170586bfa8e7be","cffbacb28846ca3bf26a1def6afbaf18d75f668cc596dd63ab094112439e658d","9f27a9a50e89e4facb9eec954a1fca2388d0a82b23ba399f975ad04f0dc9c655","b71e8c550c22ff67521dfe4a6bedf31e0c5f15e1c209bd405d7b19966e60f894","9e6cbfc3767b13e3996fb4866b6a2b2758c17bdeccf42f1c2827ad47fe916cc0","f3fbcf0f4a4528382d9f3d43698d9894e2e084ab2f7076f62a09355814fb8327","ad04610af5e92a53402cfab06f540a79f629d70a548b827f8820729e014da7f0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1704,1727],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1704"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink non-relay discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":1728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if T310 for MCG or T311 is running; and if sl-TxPoolExceptional is included in sl-FreqInfoList for the concerned frequency in SIB12 or included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR in RRCReconfiguration; or","paragraph_zero_based":1730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if T301 is running and the cell on which the UE initiated RRC connection re-establishment provides SIB12 including sl-TxPoolExceptional for the concerned frequency; or","paragraph_zero_based":1731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if T304 for MCG is running and the UE is configured with sl-TxPoolExceptional included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR for the concerned frequency in RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on random selection using the resource pool indicated by sl-TxPoolExceptional as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 1 using the resource pool indicated by sl-DiscTxPoolScheduling or sl-TxPoolScheduling for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency in RRCReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":1735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if T311 is running, configure the lower layers to release the resources indicated by rrc-ConfiguredSidelinkGrant (if any);","paragraph_zero_based":1736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is configured with sl-UE-SelectedConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency is included in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration, and if a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration is not available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19]; or","paragraph_zero_based":1738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency is not included in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration, and a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency included in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration is not available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19];","paragraph_zero_based":1739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if sl-TxPoolExceptional for the concerned frequency is included in RRCReconfiguration; or","paragraph_zero_based":1740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the PCell provides SIB12 including sl-TxPoolExceptional in sl-FreqInfoList for the concerned frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":1741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on random selection using the resource pool indicated by sl-TxPoolExceptional as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else, if the sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency is included in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1743},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig (as defined in TS 38.321 [3] and TS 38.214 [19]) using the pools of resources indicated by sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency in RRCReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":1744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else, if the sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency is included in the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig (as defined in TS 38.321 [3] and TS 38.214 [19]) using the pools of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency in RRCReconfiguration;","paragraph_zero_based":1746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the cell chosen for NR sidelink discovery transmission provides SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is acting as NR sidelink U2N Relay UE and sl-DiscConfigCommon is included in SIB12, and if the NR sidelink U2N Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.14.2 are met based on sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is selecting NR sidelink U2N Relay UE / has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE and sl-DiscConfigCommon is included in SIB12, and if the NR sidelink U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is selecting NR sidelink U2U Relay UE / has a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE and sl-DiscConfigCommon is included in SIB12, and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions associated with the peer NR Sidelink U2U Remote UE as specified in 5.8.X2.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommonU2U in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE acting as Target Remote UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model B and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions associated with the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE as specified in 5.8.X2.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommonU2U in SIB12; or ","paragraph_zero_based":1751}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bc7f071b9445a6d77272ca23e0c7d4b365ad366474a1e140ba9b4a935fd5fb2d","8309c7a329efac434385a436bca438e59f9eb3861db5e484ba4c8efb828a0c77","d5f058a0dcc73650e1355fc3a865957c98afc535223074cbabd818f607f65766","96b349e5a40e650657df1dc6b9ffd6df7e09eee8cd9f46e2c461036963eb8eae","e08fdabfb0ab1d0ef34e482e4bb612d1d50202c7ee88e8c8e39ba3e58fdc90f2","49e1ba8fa833ca5fb519eb4a97bf7bc8c0c6c2b90f3d6cf54e9749954492c564","3844dd37d09cf06abf2c32c3c0f81739ad1f703babfa8ca5f60df4aced5280f6","5a5d9ec507b9b459f384c0dcc040714cdd9ad3f34f4bf0903615caee271cc212","1a9bdd24d648d3c1dbb58d2911e736b7b015b58f80c998a45f95d37d9736f1a4","f8b8fd2bada3549398738550d8571a9bfad853a4f09de7e54fcf59242463f39d","fe602cdcb486003a8aed659c1a06877d636de24866759eb99307d1da6af4bfb3","f1b0897f39d81e6c156bff97fab65e585cb6cd1505c7b8df14c4438dad9dde7b","ae674e05a0a8b55d3d4e2561e3bac9014ad1efff29002b3fb1b74018f77f9532","085bf83e69b2c4ba9f1a7d25b99a8f26847585e9afb803a55182167bada8e8cb","5698ba7ca79a3a0efed803757fbeddc06a8595d6f6a0c89ea14fc402ffdf3a8a","58dce4c3d0456e35ea1378fbcb2ed269bce6d80152b819bbdafeb62358aac743","0ce47efdb35bff7b52df0c0abdf996eb73350a7b44821a68b25fd2b34d47d5b0","054da776da858a5105ad31e21fb7942f8bfbcb044b5989d748ccbe329ee06655","19314f5d3a5ca0e9f95b8321abe5b64f9eeed46f5a9652b2a2b61a400f75919a","c8b230dc5e8886181c20345aa3cd784931fb423abc2b7181fe03e4c29d9286ac","12f457bbb731010d76ac44895f60a09b2786a27b108007ec89c85917ebefcdb0","cced16e19d203b6c968b45e40ea269b34a6507524d89578715742e747de9cd89","739737109ff7a8264f090067a4e2e7c82123b2af4f935694f968a616592b2203","c0a43298c8da5b04d2d7602badba1f5a33bf27a25734f83f6e10eeeeeb628a26"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1728,1751],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1728"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model A or Model B response message as specified in TS 23.304[65]; or","paragraph_zero_based":1752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model B as specified in TS 23.304[65] and if the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.X1.2 are met based on sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommonU2U in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor Note: FFS whether reuse the U2N relay (re)selection parameters to U2U relay (re)selection.","paragraph_zero_based":1754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is performing NR sidelink non-relay discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":1755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if SIB12 includes sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency, and a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in the sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission is available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19] or random selection, if allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, is selected:","paragraph_zero_based":1756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig using the pools of resources indicated by sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency in SIB12 as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if SIB12 includes sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency, and a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in the sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission is available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19] or random selection, if allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, is selected:","paragraph_zero_based":1758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig using the pools of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency in SIB12 as defined in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":1759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if SIB12 includes sl-TxPoolExceptional for the concerned frequency:","paragraph_zero_based":1760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>from the moment the UE initiates RRC connection establishment or RRC connection resume, until receiving an RRCReconfiguration including sl-ConfigDedicatedNR, or receiving an RRCRelease or an RRCReject; or","paragraph_zero_based":1761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency in SIB12 is not available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19]; or","paragraph_zero_based":1762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if sl-DiscTxPoolSelected for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency is not included in SIB12 and if a result of full/partial sensing, if selected and is allowed by sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig, on the resources configured in sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency in SIB12 is not available in accordance with TS 38.214 [19]:","paragraph_zero_based":1763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on random selection (as defined in TS 38.321 [3]) using one of the pools of resources indicated by sl-TxPoolExceptional for the concerned frequency;","paragraph_zero_based":1764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if out of coverage on the concerned frequency for NR sidelink discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":1765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L3 U2N Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":1766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is selecting NR sidelink U2N Relay UE / has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE and if the NR sidelink U2N Remote UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.15.2 are met based on sl-PreconfigDiscConfig in SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":1767},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is selecting NR sidelink U2U Relay UE / has a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions associated with the peer NR sidelink U2U Remote UE as specified in 5.8.X2.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-PreconfigU2U in SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":1768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE acting as Target Remote UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model B and if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions associated with the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE as specified in 5.8.X2.2 are met based on sl-RemoteUE-PreconfigU2U in SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":1769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model A or Model B response message as specified in TS 23.304[65]; or","paragraph_zero_based":1770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE acting as U2U Relay UE is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model B as specified in TS 23.304[65] and if the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE threshold conditions as specified in 5.8.X1.2 are met based on sl-RelayUE-PreconfigU2U in SidelinkPreconfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":1771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is performing NR sidelink non-relay discovery:","paragraph_zero_based":1772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to perform the sidelink resource allocation mode 2 based on resource selection operation according to sl-AllowedResourceSelectionConfig (as defined in TS 38.321 [3] and TS 38.213 [13]) using the pools of resources indicated in sl-DiscTxPoolSelected or sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for NR sidelink discovery transmission on the concerned frequency in SidelinkPreconfigNR.","paragraph_zero_based":1773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:It is up to UE implementation to determine, in accordance with TS 38.321[3], which resource pool to use if multiple resource pools are configured, and which resource allocation scheme is used in the AS based on UE capability (for a UE in RRC_IDLE/RRC_INACTIVE) and the allowed resource schemes sl-allowedResourceSelectionConfig in the resource pool configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":1774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.14NR sidelink U2N Relay UE operation","paragraph_zero_based":1775}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cf4fab04ef89753ecd8c708e7d3153d888d72cbb2e9b971d97b6ad4bf051142a","59ac2e9c6d6134bc22fab58c699e01e634c96f45068d8b38420aef51fb2ffa01","a922d00dc1846c7781c51845dcf516b19d1e8ac34e3c4faba42ce94791e4c8fe","452640d46d44e4a1b958972a9dbb4e0da1db2bf66f1b558bc51e6568fe62dbbd","4bc591d0b18bd23ace502b647d6cbaae9c9a0fc3c9706bbeda66d2fbf1c41f6a","fbfbc516624102d1f7a7cb4f27108bbdcf5a30f1c3dae56146cec8d0578002d1","08fe148b1f1aa026b7f86d1b2a80666a2d808ff15a3530de2cecec7efca1d40c","7dde5378b90f155471103d0bd222b8be5544e73d120ed2b8ed8d9b54169812ec","eeeef69bb1995b334eb0a45c52695bb1e806464e30742619abb642309dccb769","5462b58733af4aa0a39308229d94e496b2356b4ca419f875129e0bb985650f52","13d7fcf2fcd5e68b383faf5b79c6acefc46a0901ebe931cb2024a6197bcdba00","15838364e59670c623ecb36b7a191195de891ca10a165af1c7a287220520a97c","a60d035fa09e6fe63d47d4c731114ba8d1a32da49d6589b5fa08c2f0cee43603","f3253b02859af08c0ba02f83467b37deb9d817941a2bb26b9b4d29126a5157a3","6aceb54add45dd10b052371427ed0974cc111eb4aff66931d78bdd75784f7fa3","a8eb804bedcdfc2f87c8d43c2f527c3a079821836373bba76f809baac033cf8d","448f5ec6e8dfb209514efb56eeb9edbe48768ba3a2c4eb7765a64b2ec244ea52","0b125fce973be3874228b3fa8e1d9125208b4b6701c504b833a7ee9484efeddd","11f1e23fcdab73a7adcad0687b86aeaeb9266dc3e0218bb799c9f4237aabf69f","e0f635c01492ff34964b71fa6b8cf860d81c0839926fb99129e9e2ab1c7b8b46","cdfa6570b0695e28e9b3c5c1951d7d8b445ecf6a4a6f59338ad9328da6e2b035","361b2985e0bcb889b43d8dfd1f48a55b3f520c985ace9e4a3dc3543c6cf64728","dcfaa190f3e5f4a4c9af5fc69ea424f47350740514d06748147176b83c50e6ae","727c290530425520ec71dc83d90969973dbbe5d83972ce8215dd7e0c899d4d2c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1752,1775],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1752"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.14.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This procedure is used by a UE supporting NR sidelink U2N Relay UE operation configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink discovery messages to evaluate AS layer conditions.","paragraph_zero_based":1777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.14.2NR sidelink U2N Relay UE threshold conditions","paragraph_zero_based":1778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2N Relay UE operation shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the threshold conditions specified in this clause were previously not met:","paragraph_zero_based":1780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if threshHighRelay is not configured; or the RSRP measurement of the PCell, or the cell on which the UE camps, is below threshHighRelay by hystMaxRelay if configured; and","paragraph_zero_based":1781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if threshLowRelay is not configured; or the RSRP measurement of the PCell, or the cell on which the UE camps, is above threshLowRelay by hystMinRelay if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions to be met (entry);","paragraph_zero_based":1783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RSRP measurement of the PCell, or the cell on which the UE camps, is above threshHighRelay if configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":1785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RSRP measurement of the PCell, or the cell on which the UE camps, is below threshLowRelay if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions not to be met (leave);","paragraph_zero_based":1787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.15NR sidelink U2N Remote UE operation","paragraph_zero_based":1788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.15.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This procedure is used by a UE supporting NR sidelink U2N Remote UE operation configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink discovery message to evaluate AS layer conditions. The procedure is also used to perform selection and reselection of NR sidelink U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":1790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.15.2NR Sidelink U2N Remote UE threshold conditions","paragraph_zero_based":1791},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2N Remote UE operation shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the threshold conditions specified in this clause were previously not met:","paragraph_zero_based":1793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if threshHighRemote is not configured; or the RSRP measurement of the PCell, or the cell on which the UE camps, is below threshHighRemote by hystMaxRemote if configured, or","paragraph_zero_based":1794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if the UE has no serving cell:","paragraph_zero_based":1795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions to be met (entry);","paragraph_zero_based":1796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RSRP measurement of the PCell, or the cell on which the UE camps, is above threshHighRemote if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions not to be met (leave);","paragraph_zero_based":1799}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c9c3570564e3c43afcb2e148face1263b6cdd26b7b0dea3ee704be95947a263a","891251c9200a6b753b84c65b39db52baa91d16ca6dcae423e4a2ce397bf30e3d","d4dec57e8ee5b41d2f74aa9639cb2311e76c3fb9d644da2aeb3bf3b7decf390e","0fbf1b836979267cba870f7423de6f17e392d41ccb5ff77024dece6b7e2b0e88","1b58b9765bd9c98b261a7cbfec5f856833295c398ebd0aabb757e558dd39a96e","49cc9e14d1e89835357606a1c74db7c304cddfece3a97a2db08725455cd5f0a5","6fbee17ed032598525d53b6d56d893a30004fa1be5b6bb5fbf7cd3dd327bb604","41802fc56ac9dd43abb7546e3ffe58779d9b37c34213592ebd77741e89c6799a","56cc2c82fafc962a7a9f56c34141ed01bd8ed653beecfa2a0b5091eb6e10f40c","6962ae78b5df66ffe8fb921ae3cf548ee4b3d1d31147321b153e9f1bc8279cda","41a9aff58eb7d1a155750323cd66cd413d20b28460a734321b45d4eb9b73c81d","f4b60e61f4dfbe1b5d81eec47a3dd86f2912655b2ee0d5194335e818b8ece9b2","3e3c597f84cf1506f8604d1a437936a3ade81076b927d6f46a685197ce445c30","9dab6a611804b8f18d5fa36e6ba500d61027f96c7f73348eafb2ff6cf11c269c","5fd22bed5464a979680859e86ee3a833a7a2f21183d48cecac237033f3f7be7c","ddea18c513d3c050c6a9ceee7b8db602622146a58d0e39a9912c54231c27f2b0","186e70a1e51ed729285379c07f782e2d4c451acc297146ac0f3ef7fa5e9de319","d84fafc789381e856639607969ed337f55ff5d4bd41d5c527505b32c30a4d95a","70f8cbb954a355f1db70643d1700196ef6a0aa860ea2ba9adbf9309f1be8310a","87b0a92f6f26b8efdc53d0d2a2251618df7ea4395ba12be2b02e802999278f17","93db27d6e347133f953dbf039e1ae3ccd64e45ec9eb51ec80ed4ea2eb90451e5","e199acbf17dc066642b790b52596d77ae5b86a7ad8cdbb785b167acff172833c","6d473c18c03e14e64dedf715d2550baeafa01986642ddde529e01cc93de878e9","acaede68526029f9f7dc7339959d7afa4c5ff4073c77c222779eda25f3c1bbe1"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1776,1799],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1776"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE considers the cell indicated by sl-ServingCellInfo in the SL-AccessInfo-L2U2N-r17 received from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE as the camping cell.","paragraph_zero_based":1800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.15.3Selection and reselection of NR sidelink U2N Relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":1801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2N Remote UE operation that is configured by upper layers to search for a NR sidelink U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has no serving cell; or","paragraph_zero_based":1803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RSRP measurement of the cell on which the UE camps (for L2 and L3 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE)/ the PCell (for L3 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED) is below threshHighRemote within sl-RemoteUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE does not have a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":1805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and SL-RSRP of the currently selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE is available and is below sl-RSRP-Thresh; or","paragraph_zero_based":1806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and SL-RSRP of the currently selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE is not available, and SD-RSRP of the currently selected U2N Relay UE is below sl-RSRP-Thresh; or","paragraph_zero_based":1807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:U2N Remote UE uses SL-RSRP measurements for relay reselection trigger evaluation when there is data transmission from U2N Relay UE to U2N Remote UE, and it is left to UE implementation whether to use SL-RSRP or SD-RSRP for relay reselection trigger evaluation in case of no data transmission from U2N Relay UE to U2N Remote UE. If SD-RSRP is used, the discovery procedure will be performed between the U2N Remote UE and the selected U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":1808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and upper layers indicate not to use the currently selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":1809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and upper layers request the release of the PC5-RRC connection; or","paragraph_zero_based":1810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2N Relay UE, and sidelink radio link failure is detected on the PC5-RRC connection with the current U2N Relay UE as specified in clause 5.8.9.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform NR sidelink discovery procedure as specified in clause 5.8.13 in order to search for candidate NR sidelink U2N Relay UEs;","paragraph_zero_based":1812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>when evaluating the one or more detected NR sidelink U2N Relay UEs, apply layer 3 filtering as specified in 5.5.3.2 across measurements that concern the same U2N Relay UE ID and using the sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP in SIB12 (if in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE), the sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR (if in RRC_CONNECTED) or the preconfigured sl-FilterCoefficientRSRP as defined in 9.3 (out of coverage), before using the SD-RSRP measurement results;","paragraph_zero_based":1813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider a candidate NR sidelink U2N Relay UE for which SD-RSRP exceeds sl-RSRP-Thresh by sl-HystMin has met the AS criteria;","paragraph_zero_based":1814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE detects any suitable NR sidelink U2N Relay UE(s):","paragraph_zero_based":1815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider one of the available suitable NR sidelink U2N relay UE(s) can be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":1816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:A candidate NR sidelink U2N Relay UE which meets all AS layer criteria defined in 5.8.15.3 and higher layer criteria defined in TS 23.304 [65] can be regarded as suitable NR sidelink U2N Relay UE by the NR sidelink U2N Remote UE. If multiple suitable NR sidelink U2N Relay UEs are available, it is up to Remote UE implementation to choose one NR sidelink U2N Relay UE. The details of the interaction with upper layers are up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:For L2 U2N Remote UEs in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE and L3 U2N Remote UEs, the cell (re)selection procedure and relay (re)selection procedure run independently. If both suitable cells and suitable NR sidelink U2N Relay UEs are available, it is up to NR sidelink U2N Remote UE implementation to select either a cell or a NR sidelink U2N Relay UE. Furthermore, L3 U2N Remote UE's selection on both cell and NR sidelink U2N Relay UE is also based on UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider no NR sidelink U2N Relay UE to be selected.","paragraph_zero_based":1820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X1NR sidelink U2U Relay UE operation","paragraph_zero_based":1821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X1.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This procedure is used by a UE supporting NR sidelink U2U Relay UE operation configured by upper layers to forward NR sidelink integrated discovery messages or Model B Discovery messages to evaluate AS layer conditions. The procedure is also used to determine whether a NR sidelink UE is in proximity to NR sidelink U2U Relay UE in Model A Discovery messages.","paragraph_zero_based":1823}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fa1d8d72b00f9b4c4b508dc0d9f870569aaf9034eb4415715c4fd171b6d0ecd2","679be7f05455abdd4fe0e2a045664036c0576f90528e14611b206ac690739dc3","f56e89fe4b64a3cab1c8f46a78dee480a002a8e7a36768ccf8bc8836347250ca","3ed2d50c28e82313fcb2829df8e94ca595a7b0657273f39a69aa5ad3738c5c2b","0bc8224cc8e6cec07a80a5e3ab293198d675410910028f046a45a65a680f9b7c","ef538d474132ae543e63eeda829f06b287750f51c07421c93f65af471c518ff6","679eb079141651252ee73e25efc34bbfa7711cf2c270eaa94a86cdee4fd0fcdf","fd556bc23b5c4a7dd559fc389849870ca59dc47a8c49fe65523a88c6a3eda971","e387da4708473991f8dd9b53345064c8ad0e387e7dd49938375e2621bf0052fb","08201e92c747a56b2583a0808e457b277b442e5bd5e8ca44277ae77b9d16844a","814bc4b08f2c2710ef2cb4c8d69b0e484cb9893736e74ae7ac7225b0264d178a","86ac3f0fa740a407412c94514de92aa013bf76fabccb27d3005fdb69956957ef","a5d70e01623551688029eb3bba234833c5cf4ae529f6b34e79cea0c5929468ed","174e700c8b2ec11b09a72cf11414dc9f95053f5f5c5cb9316b5d6f4420301b79","22f460754b86d4975a94d7829bb75c8cf97ec778165d00802592b2961053e428","497b64d19625946d5e823f6a80becddbe44514c84697adae56805cfaf650e54c","b81abbfe065f5c24ac48c0a8c218df9edbdc0841a9b23e3770a0089e2d534d71","4aa56ff0832970d54f00cf53bda120f2eb99bad038bf7bdb208286633506cc45","d0286e2da29a11356e9b66da9cacb8f6f9f6cb9d78a3a1ba7be1ef1205dc89c7","ebe4e9894fbaa2da384d8a39855106adda7ecd50b75bded63272f9b7198297e1","51372d7da947f8c14d37fa7768d731a98d661c189a8b894f8d5fcbf11e494017","e2b0c1cca7fa8f2810847d3d7725711cce42c309aa394c442263130ecdece9ca","0da45e954d0015fcc10935134f5c0044e0fcdb0b22be62fa361a68bb76acea22","17f85eca69eb61f9e687c6fd33bcc420dcebcf865f4334a69c1d7224d4725b7d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1800,1823],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1800"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X1.2NR sidelink U2U Relay UE threshold conditions","paragraph_zero_based":1824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2U Relay UE operation shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the threshold conditions for integrated Discovery specified in this clause were previously not met:","paragraph_zero_based":1826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sd-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig is not configured, or if the SL-RSRP of the Direct Communication Request message with integrated Discovery received from the Source NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is available and is above sd-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig if configured: ","paragraph_zero_based":1827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions to be met (entry);","paragraph_zero_based":1828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"else:","paragraph_zero_based":1829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SL-RSRP of the Direct Communication Request message with integrated Discovery received from the Source NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is available and is below sd-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig by sd-hystMaxRelay if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions not to be met (leave);","paragraph_zero_based":1831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the threshold conditions for Model B Discovery specified in this clause were previously not met:","paragraph_zero_based":1832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sd-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig is not configured, or if the SD-RSRP of the Model B Discovery message received from the Source NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is available and is above sd-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions to be met (entry);","paragraph_zero_based":1834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SD-RSRP of the Model B Discovery message received from the Source NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is available and is below sd-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig by sd-hystMaxRelay if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions not to be met (leave);","paragraph_zero_based":1837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X1.3Neighbor UE(s) in proximity conditions","paragraph_zero_based":1838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2U Relay UE operation and is performing U2U Relay Discovery with Model A as specified in TS 23.304[65] shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1839},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each of the neighbor UE(s) configured by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":1840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SL-RSRP of the neighbor UE configured by upper layers is available and is above sl-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig if configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":1841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if the SD-RSRP of the neighbor UE configured by upper layers is available and is above sd-RSRP-Thresh-DiscConfig if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate that the neighbor UE is in proximity to upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":1843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X2 NR sidelink U2U Remote UE operation","paragraph_zero_based":1844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X2.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This procedure is used by a UE supporting NR sidelink U2U Remote UE operation configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink discovery messages to evaluate AS layer conditions. The procedure is also used to perform selection and reselection of NR sidelink U2U Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":1846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X2.2NR Sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions","paragraph_zero_based":1847}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f887900b83adb27c506c8a3fac03aafa6bae7d6841b7ee2895a5c0a1d1eb63ee","67d28211c5a2e47515368d537a6f4f27902423b127505349c57eb3f785ea9c05","c9f5b704a7db8bcbf72a554926d05b3bf7859bf12b2120efab24d606ff848f73","5be05e46aac14a7325299e3aa75d5d39f4dfc56dd0d93952f64a30bc9fde39ae","18d6a8fe56782c71201ace1d0254885c4ce41df75aad1a22244c6fe4160e56c2","f9782062ea88ce0eaf241091e47cbcf5ec6f4fd3f6aa13f1ea7fcc20e5f51088","bb5983175effc8c70d85aba416ea892cf191d9f99ab27cd9c8467db794e009cc","fddc04ccf599bb8cd2e5be51bec2bffd36711d0c05cccdeb26023aafa2435d25","b7252b7518dce3907fc82f7f8c247aa27965b0bcef5a6f94faf44f2d3ee1de09","c155ea286f60e6fb2b38cc80f16c053c4a66a1895f047130517f519d8b3c7b3c","f5509924a174e45b1893ab36a2171f09abe0813ab73686f439bda816f9060010","dfc58f1d737acd70fb1f31eb90394c9c56808d43b1555496954939fe9ac344a9","d1d656a52becf0f22bdd48732882c1b32d0012437e63cfff87c8fe0e4f56f298","b4a362433e6ddee6c13c38ad4186770b01954c6d89672967a25f224e5284d0fc","0b28c4bb77a1ecfaa5bcdfdeab2f74e42d549d12cc5a95577bd260f9b8849130","71389ad28a207fdc3d0e31dc7908c403f893c2da40e877391ea93bbd48f734a4","a5a6993c2b22d17e32e36c471bbf9982971f110ec50ee2a09aa9475d5bc92a30","0fde8f9a36c15c7f1c3f23f12b4c46a39f1cf096516ab5a8eff804dac87a07b0","c3cf512f365301124fe57015adcb3730a014076520aaec6a7e33ea204c191eee","de66966010d93fe51cf5fe58532e096644cdd057bf849175bb8a33904f967697","633027c30a51b6a96cbc0e37dad2346a4b8d2accbe53e68027f0de497bf16f2d","43d318bbf1cb467937f3344358d283e204110249e85f5a446011d160eb9c486e","56dc34ae9923ce43dd7728542b66c3560e1b8a4f613cb4f6de02285290012d2c","565a1cc253b7c8f0af84afe74608406e4972b0d555b1628c16d4e4e4ad24dcda"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1824,1847],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1824"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2U Remote UE operation shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the threshold conditions for direct PC5 link specified in this clause were previously not met:","paragraph_zero_based":1849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-RSRP-ThreshU2U is not configured, or if the SL-RSRP measurement of the peer NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is available and is below sl-RSRP-ThreshU2U by sl-HystMinU2U if configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":1850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sd-RSRP-ThreshU2U is not configured, or if the SD-RSRP measurement of the peer NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is available and is below sd-RSRP-ThreshU2U by sd-HystMinU2U if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions to be met (entry);","paragraph_zero_based":1852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SL-RSRP measurement of the peer NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is available and is above sl-RSRP-ThreshU2U if configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":1854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SD-RSRP measurement of the peer NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is available and is above sd-RSRP-ThreshU2U if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions not to be met (leave);","paragraph_zero_based":1856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the threshold conditions for U2U relay discovery with Model B specified in this clause were previously not met:","paragraph_zero_based":1857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sd-RSRP-ThreshU2U is not configured, or if the SD-RSRP of the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE is available and is above sd-RSRP-ThreshU2U if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions to be met (entry);","paragraph_zero_based":1859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SD-RSRP of the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE is available and is below sl-RSRP-ThreshU2U by sd-HystMinU2U if configured: ","paragraph_zero_based":1861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the threshold conditions not to be met (leave);","paragraph_zero_based":1862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor Note: FFS whether/how to capture if the SL-RSRP/SD-RSRP measurement of the peer NR sidelink U2U Remote UE is not available.","paragraph_zero_based":1863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X2.3Conditions for Selection and reselection of NR sidelink U2U Relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":1864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2U Remote UE operation shall initiate NR sidelink U2U Relay (re)slection procedure as specified in 5.8.X2.4 when one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":1865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured by upper layers to search for or select a NR sidelink U2U Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":1866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE threshold conditions for direct PC5 link with the peer NR sidelink U2U Remote UE as specified in 5.8.X2.2 are met within sl-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U if configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE does not have a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":1868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE, and SL-RSRP of the currently selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE is available and is below sl-RSRP-ThreshU2U by sl-HystMinU2U within sl-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U if configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":1869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE, and SD-RSRP of the currently selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE is available, and is below sd-RSRP-ThreshU2U by sd-HystMinU2U within sl-RemoteUE-ConfigU2U if configured; or","paragraph_zero_based":1870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For relay selection, U2U Remote UE uses SL-RSRP measurements for relay selection trigger evaluation when there is data transmission from peer U2U Remote UE to U2U Remote UE. For relay reselection, U2U Remote UE uses SL-RSRP measurements for relay reselection trigger evaluation when there is data transmission from U2U Relay UE to U2U Remote UE. And in both cases, it is left to UE implementation whether to use SL-RSRP or SD-RSRP for relay (re)selection trigger evaluation in case of no data transmission. ","paragraph_zero_based":1871}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0c45e26e1ec664a55345dc6d743c55044eba70d3c364d95e508b34d7ef526329","d761619b8002f8509e550ec888c88c7b0ef354964e0b0a598e07fab86d89d4e1","4b688160546eb46ed92a719eb3a5b2a5db32ae5eb15e06d533c4ea58f2926ae5","67cf2b69723307c8b77f28ba48d46012fca95f2b462e4d899b8b49eada2c07c2","9c5f4797ab0505bd72f711f7ab08136714fb468601bd0233751af02e1dffa664","6c859d9723b57b27182fb26ae99ab11f37192e71bce94315d988b6a10c368776","2dbb1921b1394030ca971aa08a0b7019f0ec17db2cd68d9ff45a030d67261c3e","e15613f59e97a049e0c4446869181aaff9951a35e183c4b7ff26d0450de52ef9","e9d6f0959143fa1878da471194ce61393ff938f613a96334d7ba847d44ce6ec1","a81b30d63eb200329abbab5128da7ce9cc895900ea6b0273e8326f2401deeba6","a9c430133a77aecb7b109b94e1b4c3498fce0bf7ed29db4e6b4ba0b06cd55de4","0d3000c04a24bb7f187f5f0934e51722218cfc103dd64ba9cd7a55c18966313d","7f3c2af89e09e14238631a9721b3eb77dc35a245589fc3990cad2ec5ccd2c929","7cf57f6a0f9f2b769c0e349919f61493737fe4e01e984ee60f1f03340f990961","638eab62393ec1f8c0d4c6257ea7b08ea17cf7f331b25476c62835f705cb6a66","febf2c88fa1e40068177bc650c461d75e5108dee13daacbbd5dd23423d77ae2c","653873f8dcf7340f38530c4b2288a5306e98a5e0afdaf745972a9768973da6e3","605c08dcd8691809553fcc91d9f2694fe89845eebaa0f3a62f832edf6624544e","a7c25d738707a0c1a4beeaf89900b84cd3957112f02c7c799018fa38ce6a8b74","cf4a1063b85e3a8528bbf90b6b53292316a6f8d784a17440516208f36a07edc1","f1b28192a103d055057f834d2e13bd772d60d3aaec949280bc63e123d6b323b8","ec8f9e2a85e5ae9817aa0ca6a569719289200a73ebe117f3e66c2c7d14ea734c","5eba66436840fac47855176ca968f0220c650d0b8f350f0d92566e8eb1b3008d","ce562a2489ac5ffee6aaafb3c866002e614e70765f1f6217db77ead7a51c94c2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1848,1871],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx:p1848"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE, and upper layers indicate not to use the currently selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":1872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE, and upper layers request the release of the PC5-RRC connection with the current NR sidelink U2U Relay UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":1873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a selected NR sidelink U2U Relay UE, and sidelink radio link failure is detected on the PC5-RRC connection with the current NR sidelink U2U Relay UE as specified in clause 5.8.9.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.X2.4Actions related to selection and reselection of NR sidelink U2U Relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":1875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink U2U Remote UE operation shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> perform NR sidelink discovery procedure as specified in clause 5.8.13 in order to search for candidate NR sidelink U2U Relay UEs;","paragraph_zero_based":1877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>when evaluating the one or more detected NR sidelink U2U Relay UEs, apply layer 3 filtering as specified in 5.5.3.2 across measurements that concern the same U2U Relay UE ID and using the sd-FilterCoefficientU2U in SIB12 (if in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE), the sd-FilterCoefficientU2U in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR (if in RRC_CONNECTED) or the preconfigured sd-FilterCoefficientU2U as defined in 9.3 (out of coverage), before using the SD-RSRP measurement results;","paragraph_zero_based":1878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider a candidate NR sidelink U2U Relay UE for which SD-RSRP exceeds sd-RSRP-ThreshU2U has met the AS criteria;","paragraph_zero_based":1879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE detects any suitable NR sidelink U2U Relay UE(s):","paragraph_zero_based":1880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider one of the available suitable NR sidelink U2U Relay UE(s) can be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":1881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider no NR sidelink U2U Relay UE to be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":1883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is performing U2U Relay Communication with integrated Discovery as specified in TS 23.304 [65] and has received Direct Communication Request message(s) from one or multiple NR sidelink U2U Relay UEs:","paragraph_zero_based":1884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>when evaluating the NR sidelink U2U Relay UE(s), apply layer 3 filtering as specified in 5.5.3.2 across measurements that concern the same U2U Relay UE ID and using the sd-FilterCoefficientU2U in SIB12 (if in RRC_IDLE/INACTIVE), the sd-FilterCoefficientU2U in sl-ConfigDedicatedNR (if in RRC_CONNECTED) or the preconfigured sd-FilterCoefficientU2U as defined in 9.3 (out of coverage), before using the SD-RSRP measurement results;","paragraph_zero_based":1885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider a candidate NR sidelink U2U Relay UE for which SL-RSRP exceeds sd-RSRP-ThreshU2U has met the AS criteria;","paragraph_zero_based":1886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE detects any suitable NR sidelink U2U Relay UE(s):","paragraph_zero_based":1887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider one of the available suitable NR sidelink U2U Relay UE(s) can be selected;","paragraph_zero_based":1888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider no NR sidelink U2U Relay UE to be selected.","paragraph_zero_based":1890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:A candidate NR sidelink U2U Relay UE which meets all AS layer criteria defined in 5.8.X2.4 and higher layer criteria defined in TS 23.304 [65] can be regarded as suitable NR sidelink U2U Relay UE by the NR sidelink U2U Remote UE. If multiple suitable NR sidelink U2U Relay UEs are available, it is up to Remote UE implementation to choose one NR sidelink U2U Relay UE. The details of the interaction with upper layers are up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<<Skip Unchanged>>","paragraph_zero_based":1892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.2.2Message definitions","paragraph_zero_based":1895}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9560775d55ee35d6a11f8580ec7d3706b92d5c16c7192d323577295654e8f1bf","ad8ab5058223db42564f125daa28e73e98c5da7d5b546c326c3afb0381556b73","cd4fe55da8c2056faefd6643671e86ad979b7014465af4f0efbf643fc36fc40f","e493cf1d2106573000198ea99a261272998c207fb45917d60287d46d991dc720","9188515a18038e4f5e330e549397d38ddf9c99753f6947ccd485a3ab544e47d1","a7725bdc633a4c3d5d2d1ce385d3fdec38ffcbd032791153571756bb4139ef97","a111a4ee4052c944500ff0c45326aeccf2fbca2de7a4f3f5851b494073107c0f","d323ee17293c9903f3d67043614c81a7d494a2095adca4797c8a6ef86e9dbaf9","beb9aba4a240c96eb7f2d228739692ea352991bba6404d402b9346f45a2369cb","76fb7f3206fb89a6ef163ef3b17bb20699279d37c9e9b7fc5f985640fb6cbcf1","b94840e1585afe039f2b4b2e9f124b96d70fe47a8183e1ae8f97eaa68fbde2b4","78c5625941c03d3769fd57b2b685739e11f447b83ea6f485c6ed3cc544ca8aa9","2b6a12bf9d1eb56adb98075f7ca2ebd4dee8ff728aa35138d6855565915e3b69","36d501fa3731a56361b002a0b6f047689bfa257e066089618ad