{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the latency bound of SL CSI report from the associated SL CSI triggering in terms of number of slots.","paragraph_zero_based":2880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report","paragraph_zero_based":2881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the latency bound of SL Inter-UE coordination report from the associated SL Inter-UE coordination explicit request triggering in terms of number of slots.","paragraph_zero_based":2882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LogicalChannelIdentity","paragraph_zero_based":2883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the identity of the sidelink logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList","paragraph_zero_based":2885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the QoS flows to be mapped to the configured sidelink DRB. Each entry is indicated by the SL-PQFI, which is used between UEs, as defined in TS 23.287 [55].","paragraph_zero_based":2886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":2887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate the QoS flows to be released from the configured sidelink DRB. Each entry is indicated by the SL-PQFI, which is used between UEs, as defined in TS 23.287 [55].","paragraph_zero_based":2888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MeasConfig","paragraph_zero_based":2889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the sidelink measurement configuration for the unicast destination.","paragraph_zero_based":2890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-OutOfOrderDelivery","paragraph_zero_based":2891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether or not outOfOrderDelivery specified in TS 38.323 [5] is configured. This field should be either always present or always absent, after the sidelink radio bearer is established.","paragraph_zero_based":2892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PDCP-SN-Size","paragraph_zero_based":2893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the PDCP SN size of the configured sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":2894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-Resetconfig","paragraph_zero_based":2895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the full configuration should be applicable for the RRCReconfigurationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":2896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SDAP-Header","paragraph_zero_based":2897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether or not a SDAP header is present on this sidelink DRB.","paragraph_zero_based":2898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slrb-PC5-ConfigIndex","paragraph_zero_based":2899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the identity of the configured sidelink DRB. In case of L2 U2U relay, value 1, 2 and 3 cannot be used for the sidelink DRB identity between L2 U2U Remote UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":2900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-QoS-InfoListPC5","paragraph_zero_based":2901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the end-to-end QoS Info between L2 U2U Remote UEs.","paragraph_zero_based":2902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SplitQoS-InfoListPC5","paragraph_zero_based":2903}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"ffe6aa9e169eee2e55d5910307b90f1a0088b587d5b1b62ff44829994c9db517","original_member_sha256":"470fa87ca234afd3cdd6813f454487933839ab990f95bcfa5c1735fcd90b61bf","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1d88d15dc2ccd2571a36413ae4e860ad56954b2ef44b4fe27e561f85a9951e65","6d421acbc17749d5303ffca6e8b623727ba23444b31fb8213b472a931f695574","23a0eb25805ab1875695e445c17181dbba5c2dbd4edcf0b811dab9a936e375cd","3895dd1c3d76cbe1e27c5407938da920ccf4a158eec9c107931c6a5961bb6fd5","4b8cc2429c28e0a4c61