{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311934.zip::R2-2311934_Introduction of NR sidelink U2U relay.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the splitting QoS Info on the second PC5 hop between L2 U2U Relay UE and the Target L2 U2U Remote UE.","paragraph_zero_based":2904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor NOTE: WA: AS signalling is used to indicate the end-to-end QoS and QoS split for L2 U2U relay. FFS AS singnalling content design, including whether the split QoS needs to be sent to the target remote UE for QoS split.","paragraph_zero_based":2906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink","paragraph_zero_based":2907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message is used to confirm the successful completion of a PC5 RRC AS reconfiguration. It is only applied to unicast of NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":2908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SL-SRB3","paragraph_zero_based":2909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: AM","paragraph_zero_based":2910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: SCCH","paragraph_zero_based":2911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: UE to UE","paragraph_zero_based":2912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":2913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":2914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RRCRECONFIGURATIONCOMPLETESIDELINK-START","paragraph_zero_based":2915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":2916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink ::=         SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":2917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    rrc-TransactionIdentifier-r16                  RRC-TransactionIdentifier,","paragraph_z