{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.5.5.12, N3C relay UE is added.","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.5.5.13, N3C relay UE is added.","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.5.xx (new), the description for MP configuration is added for MP via PC5 unicast link and MP via N3C link.","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.7.2, the tirggers for RRC reestablishment introduced in MP are added. In addition, how to handle the MP configuration upon RRC reestablishment is added.","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.8.3, how to handle the MP configuration upon RRC release is added.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.3.13.1a, the condition of remote UE bringing inactive relay UE to connected state by PC5-RRC message is added.","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.7.3b.2, MP case is added.","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.7.3c (new), the new procedure for Indirect path failure information is added.","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.7.4.1, the case of reporting available N3C relay info in UAI is added.","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.7.4.2 and 5.7.4.3, the descrption of reporting available N3C relay info in UAI is added.","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.8.2, the case that connected remote includes indication to bring idle/inactive relay UE into connected state is adde. ","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.8.3, the MP remote UE behaviour upon receiving notification message is added. ","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 5.8.9.10.4, the MP remote UE behaviour upon receiving notification message is added.","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 6.2.1, indirectPathFailureInformation-r18 is added as a new UL-DCCH-Message. ","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 6.2.2, ","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The description and asn.1 are added for IndirectPathFailureInformation.","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In RRCReconfiguration, new fields sl-IndirectPathAddChange-r18, n3c-IndirectPathAddChange-r18, n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay-r18,     otherConfig-v18xx are added.","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In UEAssistanceInformation, new field n3c-RelayUE-InfoList-r18 is added.","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 6.3.2, ","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In PDCP-Config, new field primaryPathOnIndirectPath-r18 is added.","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MP related case is added to Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelConfig, RadioBearerConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Three new IEs N3C-IndirectPathConfigRelay, N3C-IndirectPathAddChange, SL-IndirectPathAddChange, are added.","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 6.3.4, new field n3c-RelayUE-InfoReportConfig is added in IE OtherConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In 6.6.2, RemoteUEInformationSidelink-v18xy is added into RemoteUEInformationSidelink message.","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["91ce2b5e4581647be06506c5cd430964735d969e26965