{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N Remote UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedPagingDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the Paging message reception procedure as specified in 5.3.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedEUTRA-Info:","paragraph_zero_based":532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform related procedures for V2X sidelink communication in accordance with TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.10 and clause 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ul-GapFR2-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the FR2 UL gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13c;","paragraph_zero_based":535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the musim-GapConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the MUSIM gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.9a;","paragraph_zero_based":537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the appLayerMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the application layer measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13d;","paragraph_zero_based":539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the UE positioning assistance information procedure as specified in 5.7.14;","paragraph_zero_based":542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the configuration of UE positioning assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-IndirectPathAddChange:","paragraph_zero_based":545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the SL indirect path specific configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.xx.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the n3c-IndirectPathAddChange:","paragraph_zero_based":547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform configuration procedure for the remote UE part of N3C indirect path as specified in 5.3.5.xx.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay:","paragraph_zero_based":549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the configuration procedure for the relay UE part of N3C indirect path as specified in 5.3.5.xx.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of the RRCReconfigurationComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b4edd02cca10157fbe45b7ddd48d0a99de2beb43398504ddaa9d0168badd03de","f6db80077cb3585b8b7de95568e8af5be24329fa530e0