{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each MCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each MCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the masterCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":559},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each SCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each SCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the secondaryCellGroup containing the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured intra-band uplink carrier aggregation in the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0b:The UE does not expect that the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier is received in both masterCellGroup and in secondaryCellGroup. Network only configures at most one of reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent, reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier in one RRC message.","paragraph_zero_based":566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig with mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the eutra-SCG-Response the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig with mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the nr-SCG-Response the SCG RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to conditional reconfiguration execution and the RRCReconfiguration message does not include the reconfigurationWithSync in the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include in the selectedCondRRCReconfig the condReconfigId for the selected cell of conditional reconfiguration execution;","paragraph_zero_based":572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarLogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":575}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["074a85fbfa8cf66b527ae09e6e64326bd90d11ccc174b00dc87f81d40646c4d6","d93fe7fdd449215fc23418735602a1b28e9c9d13856f1fcffef0427a4547db2e","3050dcd272d240e460d4e5826ebc76e6fc0cf15dec38866a60a1060112df53c7","a6cf20c2235f0a3fb71e0702af2e937a0f074862c06bc9964cb7c38b14632c61","48940d2efcb66951145f49bcdec88a1e2bb37dc696d083c0df99bd11e68dce77","c72c7eeaee5e67bf0ecfe0752b3d83eb467ea8dc2a3f11fea47419991a901ee3","3298841713dcbfa9defb642db8b2d1b156a80d9f0495af6958e4beef55cae2c2","6037159ee49e2480ba37d340a9f4d93d71dd1bb02ed0ebb1b3d586ceaadbe77c","fadc0de51e9966138caacbca1e9371a26b54c7157e5672f21c5aa8464da27b3c","e94fbe9378ee5101543dd601061a24e6d7aea518d32198b4a21ce1cb4ef932e4","69409241df59d425ecbc6aa2992a852855c12e4ff359821ea0ae41df6f532914","25efede37381913edbe4055a05510a9af46fdfe9ba14eef27f43c4aaa9cd43ee","65767a12f88c99eed8198e4b8376239b6b86c19a84fdea328c0bd89018d86afb","857c7e2e20581c8f2757d5e0e74b5cd63ca668d919b4ca8cfbb29d22b0fd6034","86258d04edd7f9f0aa5fe658e996fa5d5afb3395178e60ee88f446f0d36bcdf1","8308bfa92a2a5696ca2ae7a6c09f495e10f75106dcc0481b58e63fef0a1afdec","f2b986e505c45e3d7f15ee2e171e32bbf2eee47c59a94f11d1590f02399a992f","eeb8bc05c500994273e872707892abfebe9c1964c3dbe9de757313266bba7b3e","9b0a6f4c5047a4e428fb86f2d0a891ffdb54b6bab37d20f0a3dd50c3e9bc6ad1","5b9fa915fbc97e12e25d5b3448a0c1d733d6eccc045854823c75999903bd68a5","eb2ad1b2a53787795a448eb04cedae99628988311b396ec44912ebb2f5e4d412","7fbaf2a2180861cbe3e51e18cf032d58d619a1514957237cb24166ff4a207c47","42153c500939c19dc8dba1a291f6d39d406f2c3fd4ef5fae5ff67adc2baefa9b","ea3b8d448620a1d9cd52d4c56c5e1a664b0c69fb373273432df2f2fe499a66f8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[552,575],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p552"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if Bluetooth measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableBT in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if WLAN measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableWLAN in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport is included:","paragraph_zero_based":580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T330 timer is running and the logged measurements configuration is for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to true in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to false in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include connEstFailInfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] and if the UE is capable of cross-RAT RLF reporting and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include rlf-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE was configured with successHO-Config when connected to the source PCell; and","paragraph_zero_based":591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the applied RRCReconfiguration is not due to a conditional reconfiguration execution upon cell selection performed while timer T311 was running, as defined in 5.3.7.3:","paragraph_zero_based":592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions for the successful handover report determination as specified in clause 5.7.10.6, upon successfully completing the Random Access procedure triggered for the reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include successHO-InfoAvailable in the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB1, but not within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup or E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration or E-UTRA RRCConnectionResume:","paragraph_zero_based":596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapsConfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the NeedForGapsInfoNR information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":599}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["71b3e725d01f2c86a5e2505d641f407464e46188115825cc85bd09ee2d8efb4a","ad7fab6f278c9f37a2c0d017897ef24fde37e91e7186e9d4486dfab94a1d3e00","0d0ea0b8c1155d245b14e7f7c443a71f839f2603720ce4d7d06299f39bfbfc3c","f6eace6f9aebc85716ba48bd019486912973f0ee499edb3d98e453b72332caa3","f72f34739a04008165388b578ad76e6098843293ec7821462152ee40a68a8316","d210dc88ff25edbf55d6eeb3a63154642739627877187b3ea637f2788e081fae","b2bcb1c526cf798633040767ffde65b84944b98826d074a3c7afc764c41d5929","026dc4ff76b6d64fceec2846f595575de1c1ec6071a47af893e0b7fe31a30988","bcca9e098f8e2e3a1df7458eaf0076044124331c5b2996413be34e13c1fb3b96","523459e5de2b03fcafd26fa6d555f7f750e58399935ac45a1c79d42d619478bb","b57a9f0de1ef2fc8d748ab7dec0610e6e618e9aeea5919c72b91389f9dafeab6","0519a3dd3550b694dbfb42d20c7d967a777362e2e31cc227f96dae292c3250a8","87a7c5378a59078753bcaaf5a1af29fcd0399175999f75d415f2722c0931ba74","2897a1864083beef03cffcf3d574e7b9ec86d844fbbf10f06534378c015c0dce","35c15c765c6ec00b7a475a4153f76a0e64a8a69e03d92152f0b6b8248a3d8b42","c8119981c0848caf3fc49b67c5f171896bb4b9aa5f2eeddda426afdd3d70129a","238d3c34b21c08fef6ca51f8a685e0205a4f9fa0ac29a130c2ed230ce33c252b","87b4474d445257ac5e8bb65d7ef2e421d1c23fa695a66c8630b7c1b15a71492a","4238eeee52a29c843d1bb21490659942917699fc6491919ad07799b7e34f9a1c","df99497877484398be47804c90e94b91240271a331d7c0b178c37f86811eaa34","4e89f8267f8466652733b94ab067f43d6bdb36d2b61f71db101b555bfc023ac9","ea76f69302e195e99ce4857621325dab519a4ef0d49e95e4b78c2f3f3f2e7bff","85b2c49be783239ffbf1d4dedfc7e697fd841edfc18e2d0b260dcd42e91d629a","590b58208a37f9938b8e8d020c97bd904b065640351738626e0c0cc8699f26ad"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[576,599],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p576"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapsInfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include intraFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>for each supported NR band that is also included in requestedTargetBandFilterNR, include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the corresponding gap requirement information for each supported NR band;","paragraph_zero_based":605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":607},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the needForGapNCSG-InfoNR information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include intraFreq-needForNCSG and set the gap and NCSG requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>for each supported NR band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR, include an entry in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the NCSG requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include an entry for each supported NR band in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA; or","paragraph_zero_based":616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the needForGapNCSG-InfoEUTRA information is changed compared to last time the UE reported this information:","paragraph_zero_based":617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoEUTRA and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA is configured, for each supported E-UTRA band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA, include an entry in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the NCSG requirement information for that band; otherwise, include an entry for each supported E-UTRA band in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured with E-UTRA nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig (UE in (NG)EN-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via E-UTRA SRB1 as specified in TS 36.331 [10]; or","paragraph_zero_based":621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfiguration within MobilityFromNRCommand (handover from NR standalone to (NG)EN-DC);","paragraph_zero_based":622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution for CPC which is configured via conditionalReconfiguration contained in nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig specified in TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":623}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e16cd719ec8dc3c78088d4a096e8f7b368c0d80e04e4166b0dc0e62fb37f12cb","e7af0eda3c1f1408a8ad4bdeab01d5431decf2ec3b121cc497ade194813a7be4","b8d6d43f3603348eb07549a3328dfdd9c2ee1c644fe893a3bd95fbec4f75fd1f","e1eb6bfdec1691e7eb3b707a4c9d068a26ae6f2ce89f5ee190d4cae69dff9403","a84c9a7cd9fd5f5710686f8b7bd85b1b19bac0cd5754d09ba7d4c40fda8df2a2","1e0d8ebdc691ce63404c437c089bd4a9a454120b79b9c0e00481d0b81f036b09","0c9a9cf35c62e26abd5c0339f20a6ced5970b0048d75156ef7fd7b58c69f858d","e6c73c04fc20eb707be173d3b09fa7b8e15a35fe5c2fbd30c24f851218cfe51d","1541b9c2e0d579cfd3fa2912bf96a28e0b9bac89a7f28511fa004f53306cea8c","fb46c2d0822063e3446a1d32c6a1dd8932f123a94d644f0e767f57ff1eb06437","fb2327c844205b3a2d497dfc4f28baf84229d4303ffc30a774606fac730c2af8","3af638d64955034dd17353807a3ad2a3e8ebccfaa929276661c27b7215f77ffb","ac7c9b7ab1276f7084dbcdff7c89952f17930f06cb86b1911db1363cba49e1b7","a84c9a7cd9fd5f5710686f8b7bd85b1b19bac0cd5754d09ba7d4c40fda8df2a2","54dc442d6fcd1b0826476cadbf3f3da13e45ccc1caa499755c217af137f4f4ce","0893b32a730a697f5d145a71025b14ba527d53ff43ae87f6b47f5460d68a38c0","0735820954b91cf1fc60968be2964102d91c33f40037fee5825101f2f2e445ef","50c6552563e57382933d7a66c633a424f53efe0fd15f1e2a3844dc0d9bc83668","2b271e53d0edeef69bc1310197f526ba089c01dde08117ec8bdc99ab6dc737b3","33c327824f5beee8705f2db0d3ec97c8f25af6939a680001d170f833eb36833e","b14d5eeaeb61a9ba35e4cda91d89c76c60ddce81eae7a7958501f6c432354687","3cf88a3fa993d8b282f4313d8c780a6c08489854e3d4e5df4f5da7d3f404c934","3339e812280a2c2993eac56652c44524a36a1afa53bd316da6da3fc33b4bfb92","91f91b095c0200d50e38a7179c760107f4dc4c5a68f53cb5300e028b089d9bec"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[600,623],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p600"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via the E-UTRA MCG embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.6.2a.","paragraph_zero_based":624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was included in E-UTRA RRCConnectionResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionResumeComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.3.4a;","paragraph_zero_based":626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3/5.3.5.4/5.4.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the scg-State is not included in the E-UTRA message (RRCConnectionReconfiguration or RRCConnectionResume) containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG activation as specified in 5.3.5.13a;","paragraph_zero_based":630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":631},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":632},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if the SCG was deactivated before the reception of the E-UTRA RRC message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":633},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if bfd-and-RLM was not configured to true before the reception of the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration or RRCConnectionResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message or if lower layers indicate that a Random Access procedure is needed for SCG activation:","paragraph_zero_based":634},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate the Random Access procedure on the SpCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":635},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":636},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":637},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":638},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":639},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within nr-SecondaryCellGroupConfig in RRCConnectionReconfiguration message received via SRB3 within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3/5.3.5.4;","paragraph_zero_based":642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCConnectionReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the SpCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":647}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["88ad6b578c8c5dfce6b640b6e9ad92a58cb31271df5062fd70574e3072e1fda9","a893260dd492e00a53a2643c8b79dc103b7fb92db2f3639c34e86b734bdbbff9","ce06cb2743e22bdc16fb7cdb515ea6e6646bb7b8f21b251d23de960d58dde1a7","df2e48cb1d7bad8c98113be800d8e7d0a9e11bf88c88ead70f8c69985819119c","621fa54c2b6836e5bd161232aba5e2408d6dd12c3a2e117d6ea6f6a79c8da27e","43fa5effffd97ca984153a67cbe44142f78ea26d3fa6caff2022207bb1727cd9","5e6dda61e14e65576155d03667e97f64e41881f490f8ce42001cc4da7ab1567f","1529827509eb2dc59513e424ab269f19b4d29f2dcfdb459b5d5e28555acc2b72","a258cd23337c784fc59694bcc6dde2d8c5765b17e220cda4ef2abe03ca552867","b4ec3547733485dc39212789485a645f3dc94fdea1b8c4b5c4532b49e2e71149","855dfdb804e98cdf011fb619124aeda611191e3a4e6a08a9747ac8310cce9753","3bb5b8be641e3350de1e3cba2e7a2ee445272002766f876f81d28a06541a82a9","89576694c88d0e4cebf05f585aa33462941339df7bb076a45ea3edece54f5048","646c07918bdffc31047a60c8a83ca8905b85b32ceb3ba2547c87d386f91a8721","f717beca3b493877806d74d6b43b1a17550838dc6d9bb41192ed0279e830f679","760ce7645797b82696854cd128d3440c9d2058ba95fc5c156ff5a101eb1fec31","06dc2ed85ec6f2f2d24cd602aeed72443f542ff8331fa5b314a05e196d370e47","f0b25dd24d0fd235d5560c94b430f00b293be392bf4bba5c6580773fdeb43ceb","8c26f589b068ea78ebca5850fdd4cc84979ea6cab9becca0ba55b5c4c608ca56","fac27dfa22e09ccd806cc46841e3ad653156bf2fc0730c57bdce3670dc7f9767","1529827509eb2dc59513e424ab269f19b4d29f2dcfdb459b5d5e28555acc2b72","e8ed9549c9baeff7e356b8d79ec230ac175ecb7fe206480c0b6b733001b87ef9","94c2c8e977ed45144a1b85bcd693da3de8577df99d6be82d7405788d39fe0bb7","ab04d01ba493425dbf4319eb2fc5ecd183c2b42377c7ef5b4c66e1a6763558f4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[624,647],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p624"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The order the UE sends the RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message and performs the Random Access procedure towards the SCG is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (RRCReconfiguration was received via SRB3) but not within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In (NG)EN-DC and NR-DC, in the case RRCReconfiguration is received via SRB1 or within DLInformationTransferMRDC via SRB3, the random access is triggered by RRC layer itself as there is not necessarily other UL transmission. In the case RRCReconfiguration is received via SRB3 but not within DLInformationTransferMRDC, the random access is triggered by the MAC layer due to arrival of RRCReconfigurationComplete.","paragraph_zero_based":653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB1 within the nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup (UE in NR-DC, mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup was received in RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume via SRB1):","paragraph_zero_based":654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution for CPC which is configured via conditionalReconfiguration contained in nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via the NR MCG embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in clause 5.7.2a.3.","paragraph_zero_based":656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform SCG activation as specified in 5.3.5.13a;","paragraph_zero_based":658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig in nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the SCG was deactivated before the reception of the NR RRC message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if bfd-and-RLM was not configured to true before the reception of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message containing the RRCReconfiguration message; or","paragraph_zero_based":662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if lower layers indicate that a Random Access procedure is needed for SCG activation:","paragraph_zero_based":663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else","paragraph_zero_based":667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2a:The order in which the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message and performs the Random Access procedure towards the SCG is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the RRCReconfiguration message was received via SRB3 (UE in NR-DC):","paragraph_zero_based":671}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["760ce7645797b82696854cd128d3440c9d2058ba95fc5c156ff5a101eb1fec31","06dc2ed85ec6f2f2d24cd602aeed72443f542ff8331fa5b314a05e196d370e47","b424edf0460c0f1bfbd66ee72b8ebd387823081e4fdd24ab08fbdf0e154304cc","f27461598d9884ba6722445e5895ddf183d9656599d86298ad4935ea807b72d2","e27c70a9de193c2d7b92cb1c893ffaef330299d9b346a9b91c6d8deefb7c3787","f39287d63cf3e562fb19b74327d5ab73b57dbf7ab849dc5f46f9586e11bec932","5e4d62cba583fb7ede84ac1d1c87a53a3a42b53fcbc1db74bbe3cc05798b6f57","4422429f491c51278421c9d9d27a4d97926f9d63a6a195659d4124078d484314","08e6cbf2900b1400f5f1cfcdebe6daaabb5da6c6bd9a4aaaf5d2c7c0dc33782d","1bd3845713cec9e1fc756a9c75cd2416c5461353dc10208951c396b93db4f704","bacfcc90f11e67617807a22304ee406ac9ceab8981bc85ba7bc820b91542ac4f","a47c6ee2b5c5b2b1d22f386b9bff05e8a4881060e6953f659151d9aef4a86325","f579410f7f250b93e77403be29f3b44ec9a2540e44647701ac51ed5a3eb4a967","6767a06f8f59b0806ff3d5452cfbebd68b6c8a7c48ed5f56811a46fc0ad55519","6417ca064900411866a862c6645270dd4402b6dba95c696f8183d2ba9e11d6d3","96141e24ee589695dfccb527152f2a18a0f86ec3bbe47011fa2a3590fe8758ee","a258cd23337c784fc59694bcc6dde2d8c5765b17e220cda4ef2abe03ca552867","7727771899b2b76fb60551c6fd5efc4ff4600a0632a54929871c3ccc250cc38e","d638b4ec9c7d351290c7adf30fe889cf3f4a4bb89d6c4357130d562326b853ee","03f5c750fe3373dffc1822e019a088f77d565aba74bce90729ecb7f3e365bdfa","c4df4d3e181ab3d4c42e36ad0159fb02d9603a167a8ae51b705c9398d9bf2400","bf73040915fffd3182456c1eabb3a86ec67b75406759f7df4990bea3ca53dd35","2a25cc82619fdfa6c29ec1c81237bdb348d075d789244d085618910ccf16f058","7cf5c42e46e404c7a81afe8dc6f8fb9b65f2bf74bf2d4646409087577cba7502"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[648,671],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p648"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within DLInformationTransferMRDC:","paragraph_zero_based":672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message was received within the nr-SCG within mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup (NR SCG RRC Reconfiguration):","paragraph_zero_based":673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the scg-State is not included in the RRCReconfiguration message containing the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig in nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate the Random Access procedure on the PSCell, as specified in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":679},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the RRCReconfiguration does not include the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the scg-State:","paragraph_zero_based":684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (RRCReconfiguration was received via SRB1):","paragraph_zero_based":689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in NR-DC and;","paragraph_zero_based":690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCReconfiguration does not include the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroupConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration includes the scg-State:","paragraph_zero_based":692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG deactivation as specified in 5.3.5.13b;","paragraph_zero_based":693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform SCG activation without SN message as specified in 5.3.5.13b1;","paragraph_zero_based":695}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0f47af27b2cec2a69a4cb951414e292450b3b80a635a602e19eaf3951fed580e","66b1a1c94c34a4bdf88b2d8486ea51e674b6fe4947d995f1627e3ffae5cc718e","62c0718f61223ffdc4ac5bd09f0154e01ad162fe6d855cc07a144cace90b5974","b0389d8dd2f5e8575d5d1851a79833c8231a92127b40f29a0430b23076d8195b","b75d21171578223ea80a32ef576972d5ff5ae21fe508d3245602071db7a88c0c","7513ac1543ea21a8d8e248960ea2c9b0633c0f2340537d948f8b7974cd32711d","465f86fa6c912fed2db1a1787d40079f85bb77199aa140815d68b55df8e5fd16","43a7f99c0547a4c257bf58bd339b44e3dc478214ac66d8aabe4a96b610873ae3","7e20886b7817cd06f814b859f427c5e0a3052e4986f99ffcc1bbb9c5f9ffb46c","da431097e2c4fa3a0aeab57c60ad33a0b22b8b3884346c11a76a7c3341cdd5a4","ab04d01ba493425dbf4319eb2fc5ecd183c2b42377c7ef5b4c66e1a6763558f4","b91d464879520ad715288597551736e7a3abcd67289a4eca653eb86263b7cc0d","cc523b46581450d436db38e80cd75bb229e3b03e6255a1ddd59d4f7f3966a153","5894176f6c715e4b07c360a9f4934158d66809f52de282165c0c0c78ac2a1b4a","e40848ded51253379af092e5c88705bc5b6be97249a6ee4158385e5df4869a9a","8540545bc3d77de01f2d800c9883526d7de41da0d4c6b63067ff8651014ed8b8","e27c70a9de193c2d7b92cb1c893ffaef330299d9b346a9b91c6d8deefb7c3787","ddb4d93b94756152b552c2e626037a6f4eabb2e461012ee5e40051373fc213dc","3b37e90f5d6b331cf191efdedb899cc686801f70b57241335b0969b6b0ac0c2f","0b5a24c0a28684b30f4a6a0227ea8bbee00a3da0c0075593d9bb4f220c0ac7d2","7a20935b2e68db74ea65e2ecf1c6a12ba4248db821af4707b838a9f4542b9bea","760ce7645797b82696854cd128d3440c9d2058ba95fc5c156ff5a101eb1fec31","ab04d01ba493425dbf4319eb2fc5ecd183c2b42377c7ef5b4c66e1a6763558f4","ed10b534be656bda11545bb57debb6ca171e3f53c4568d0a52c415fe6b31ded6"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[672,695],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p672"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if ta-Report is configured with value enabled and the UE supports TA reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate TA report initiation to lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission using the new configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if this is the first RRCReconfiguration message after successful completion of the RRC re-establishment procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>resume SRB2, SRB4, DRBs, multicast MRB, and BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, and Uu Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE, that are suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-IndirectPathAddChange was included in RRCReconfiguration message and if SRB1 is configured as split SRB and pdcp-Duplication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>when successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message via SL indirect path (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T4xx;","paragraph_zero_based":704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG or SCG and when MAC of an NR cell group successfully completes a Random Access procedure triggered above; or,","paragraph_zero_based":705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync included in spCellConfig of an MCG, and when successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE):","paragraph_zero_based":706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T304 for that cell group if running;","paragraph_zero_based":707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if sl-PathSwitchConfig was included in reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T420;","paragraph_zero_based":709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release all radio resources, including release of the RLC entities and the MAC configuration at the source side;","paragraph_zero_based":710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset MAC used in the source cell;","paragraph_zero_based":711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2b:PDCP and SDAP configured by the source prior to the path switch that are reconfigured and re-used by target when delta signalling is used, are not released as part of this procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T310 for source SpCell if running;","paragraph_zero_based":713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the parts of the CSI reporting configuration, the scheduling request configuration and the sounding RS configuration that do not require the UE to know the SFN of the respective target SpCell, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the parts of the measurement and the radio resource configuration that require the UE to know the SFN of the respective target SpCell (e.g. measurement gaps, periodic CQI reporting, scheduling request configuration, sounding RS configuration), if any, upon acquiring the SFN of that target SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DRB configured as DAPS bearer, request uplink data switching to the PDCP entity, as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a814f2c9ec8fd243104c71c0e63d3a5486c9fea01571c48b4e66213a9219cce5","098b69ed802db00c92cc7760e0a09e0736c2fa78e335fa27396741ff80a07fa5","ac19ad697c45f962b63f1e5f045d4e2972db05f94bfe9cdf4af5121cc8c37d5b","807fc26aeb6028b9b13b109185f1d16a1107c2c97d73b39e62f72d80136311cd","f1b4d2db7f8671680d38e9f9da00c251fa54d987ffeb4d6846a04aad12551a4e","42745d282e1e5acb5299507839ba941bf846d9b3051a0a2484c66532305b7585","5d9a61ec7c9cbe374fd843c5681a7d908055b34172d5eaac5d2e656961aa65a2","2c41f8dcd83c9b68cb34feef2cfedba4c8f4c008009629dc6221c5ca9a4ae92d","e4670ce1a9b06ce0051370e5e19762febaa034978210eb6d44be3a006f266a9c","202fc76d7cd805471add7335cd6524765bfd9bf83ddcafdb6ef471c854a47ae3","e425813565f7f9a77c74d41cbb560661d287d493153977f5704b77e1e03cc886","4b9c98794e33cfa72258da7d884386799f3c49c0b5283a3b09c416a2d01e4ccf","7927ae7277a2d764ea2317a87fa8d3037064e93eec1a1b07a3aaf761271f2bc8","c8944bf19d3a4be73ddaea589e7c1715ea3d0e7872ed52268c4ae8a0200e2fed","7e6a383ebfe819dd957bfcfc5877eeba30124b505a759964ad504fd10cacad52","796d0240ea371ccc07fe13765684f8d662d3f3b63fffe2c5725cc0bcd2c5ee71","0242b1614724e75304eddc119af8ee32e9419d48d86fbe6f4ee999ee15801451","60e528b67a60765961d272b320d7a320f4bd3893c1594eb190a0d5df975d6e9d","037f870a4cc697a36d93893476b85ce6632752bdaed22e130804e8ab8020cfc1","b549b1365a7941d6cff2e8fa3b9889214bab3eee60a6e96f0493866d421ff758","3268bef5ac6afb60e33e9e7ce5819c0295fec0e8315868b6f895d606b0902d0a","1ce64914fe53494efb88e840abfc2324f90ac758298aed9fead3fc517d41300b","2d104ad68fd9294b9c1b54cae1a47b7972e54ad7102e58f849c1b8b7ba444bdd","97b4bfe6c9fbf9dd181ee6130e2d647cc63473c1d3da96e0801b295d98165c58"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[696,719],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p696"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T350 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T350;","paragraph_zero_based":722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if RRCReconfiguration does not include dedicatedSIB1-Delivery and","paragraph_zero_based":723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the active downlink BWP, which is indicated by the firstActiveDownlinkBWP-Id for the target SpCell of the MCG, has a common search space configured by searchSpaceSIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the SIB1, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13], of the target SpCell of the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>upon acquiring SIB1, perform the actions specified in clause 5.2.2.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reconfigurationWithSync was included in spCellConfig of an SCG and the CPA or CPC was configured:","paragraph_zero_based":728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove all the entries within VarConditionalReconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.9.6, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each measId of the MCG measConfig, if configured, and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup or secondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE initiated transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group during the last 1 second, and the UE is still configured to provide the concerned UE assistance information for the corresponding cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution, and the UE is configured to provide UE assistance information for the corresponding cell group, and the UE has initiated transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group since it was configured to do so in accordance with 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of a UEAssistanceInformation message for the corresponding cell group in accordance with clause 5.7.4.3 to provide the concerned UE assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start or restart the prohibit timer (if exists) or the leave without response timer for the MUSIM associated with the concerned UE assistance information with the timer value set to the value in corresponding configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB12 is provided by the target PCell, and the UE initiated transmission of a SidelinkUEInformationNR message indicating a change of NR sidelink communication/discovery related parameters relevant in target PCell (i.e. change of sl-RxInterestedFreqList or sl-TxResourceReqList) during the last 1 second preceding reception of the RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of an MCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution and the UE is capable of NR sidelink communication/discovery and SIB12 is provided by the target PCell, and the UE has initiated transmission of a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since it was configured to do so in accordance with 5.8.3.2:","paragraph_zero_based":743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a2422636160ccabf888e1ba31c8b753cddffb02472666d3b0e3a8a2f9f6041dd","9ee80f72010864f8c2877a5cc170053a860fb09f7e865323776253ca3d795ee4","e817877f649f44bca6383920932f77d2a7cebb2fcc7f9d7b8ed3d8c437ca105e","68bf1ed1c7a1482761e166a4f8f7c876364706e71c51c68142d29181c0c1043b","3cfd684a4ddd95d3d7f441845a4d8ff9b7723f907190c07f4d1815efe9b43881","5e4d17d2ab3adab5e7cda57b35ddaa3cd4854c6e4e3dcb3e6847ab9aad49c65d","b2b7f94d83f2a28d960e37094ff8b52496d71d31ea8616fd93a9ab439c27bbd4","0e534abd5603e178d5d4b31786075f14fa057cbba29ac88c0fb54ad09c9b3a0f","d9c28b4f9bd6f68ec2c7a4375271b430d39158daf70d374954ce28416878f148","46d1117a2fd6c99074aac5d1d913931d69db883727451918fc77d3f342e64f71","c7e98626bd48362d2e166faed1ea0fc7f8f8488b60b7896bb12334e964e8ef47","b8ef38b73c8eb5dee2091a3af9a95b1a3d19b9fe92f9d3c57b2c2f1cbc418536","9043712e5beb7720fe891f42a7c65e4188bce8c583676da24abfc8c8ed24f94c","c592ebc241b4a8f80f3e35482db275f22e8e2977d6bdb005ad5c3bfbf9eb1128","2fc5f3b93cb2ce5390e5f1b42e3a46018d51feca3e4c0cf2b526cc7c38e8bccf","9db93239404a4aa5d77b1e9edf4261e4d945dbf348dbb27955effe1d9b384abf","c7d2724f04ba96bb00be9db4ccc0696a587f511bc7eec28106d1463d1f82d90f","5d2f84df17dfb6def275ec78a248c125e413eb9324fa85b52021eaf5d76bb0ab","3ce002bb234fb586088ec830a890e9100b21e283e6883ff658c32e62a33c35cf","3b058a334dac0866029de6aaa7e49dda15a781aa346c38df9ea57660aced9d8a","dea6695b1135ca34c3a2f674bc6bac28ff3285b81f99d949a142584605328362","b800d6d6cc20a88a64be36240fca0a95985c3be9059ecf0aeea06200bd0738ba","55438a263293a7204b6c26064adac4a8ccd3e1155d1b3c740466fda22f50b5cd","54cb9239fc3e057941da107b7ffc3eff7cab2f150ee06a50649b01c920b27d17"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[720,743],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p720"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if configured with application layer measurements and if application layer measurement report container has been received from upper layers for which the successful transmission of the message or at least one segment of the message has not been confirmed by lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-submit the MeasurementReportAppLayer message or all segments of the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to lower layers for transmission via SRB4;","paragraph_zero_based":747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reconfigurationWithSync was included in masterCellGroup and the target cell provides SIB21:","paragraph_zero_based":748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE initiated transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message during the last 1 second preceding reception of this RRCReconfiguration message; or","paragraph_zero_based":749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the RRCReconfiguration message is applied due to a conditional reconfiguration execution, and the UE has initiated transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message after having received this RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of an MBSInterestIndication message in accordance with clause 5.9.4;","paragraph_zero_based":751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE is only required to acquire broadcasted SIB1 if the UE can acquire it without disrupting unicast or MBS multicast data reception, i.e. the broadcast and unicast/MBS multicast beams are quasi co-located.","paragraph_zero_based":753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4: The UE sets the content of UEAssistanceInformation according to latest configuration (i.e. the configuration after applying the RRCReconfiguration message) and latest UE preference. The UE may include more than the concerned UE assistance information within the UEAssistanceInformation according to 5.7.4.2. Therefore, the content of UEAssistanceInformation message might not be the same as the content of the previous UEAssistanceInformation message.","paragraph_zero_based":754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.12Uu Relay RLC channel release","paragraph_zero_based":757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE or N3C relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelID value included in the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToReleaseList that is part of the current configuration within the same cell group (LCH release):","paragraph_zero_based":759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.13Uu Relay RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelConfig received in the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToAddModList the L2 U2N Relay UE or N3C relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the current configuration contains a Uu Relay RLC channel with the same uu-RelayRLC-ChannelID within the same cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2210a5496e94dee956f6c465d84bddc0ca5fa4efb7b1b5e0d97f3f62b39d6976","a11cc1106f8b25a13ec6537e6e5a2a68be0a466481784df7b10e73006aa2db6d","1245f4795d84b08c72c6481ecb2aa43d504d93236915dd83de2a9847d7cbb526","1947fdcf8a2b1c5acc3daa61634cb0893ec135da7a04f3e9ca69199ec3e9efc4","8eb8ae6145eab24d87854df28817103af6391d203ecd503441329e1a9b860be5","a5de845eddd6550115e7fee355126aefefcf51b5f0b45130edf3518ac1b9b645","071b5b8a4142d38a699d455bdab35217484a894ad228afa65d41786136669201","7dd581850c5b20afb4c019c7ba4813df73822eec9b7f90566c0037cbb152efda","736ada5e6193a53dc7d8a4abcaf9f130450952ad59ce6b807bcbfa6a916b4454","b01abed77286e2c563556f24c92c3ab2d98ea2fa6eae195b3336a7973e2ea508","a4b860b6b7e6e84f50e8abff33fc5a55f96b34b22b836e4776f14aa6248688b2","57395431330bb9ad29571b4184428f6ee42c11d11611a0b1a2374120f22590b7","040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","d7b64ee378ea84ae59e2125105d532efd6bccdd3fd579aca0656398f22a1cf0f","5ed2b80677a1f6342cd67c263d231a6e865c47b4422c4833ddc25b459eca6d3e","b0f1acf3ab228b219b7270f9e7a02a184b4e3566f4737168d0f7dc323c871da4","17fa5afb29f4707077106e045dd4c9597826c32bf7bbc7f789ddd61b0dd80b98","baaea442a2a64e5c117802d1f1fec5b02604db924ca07c9429fbac4eb26cb28d","4967a59889337fe86c5a7c6fe3c65d09bfd317c1cb6cc441595df133eae59807","0085fb36e9d2da26740bec1e007e252f6c49d317074a72be10467eb1564d2d35","45e6ed4e2d0174dab4528cc65c40085f9b267d939e97587cad4b90733d96a29b","9203f68b54607757ef62b6acfe0a6fdf22aaf29a5c724717689e6888de3a7106","5751bef66a5ee17960cbf160ba9007cad4e967fd5ab865aebc049509b8af8bdf","89330b33d0f1f93cddbaaf109911afd8a22e55b62846f04236f1619f1ac97c8a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[744,767],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p744"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reestablishRLC is received:","paragraph_zero_based":768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the logical channel in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (a logical channel with the given uu-RelayRLC-ChannelID was not configured before within the same cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xxMP configuration","paragraph_zero_based":777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.0Introduction ","paragraph_zero_based":778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MP, a MP remote UE is configured with one direct path (i.e. MCG) and one indirect path. The MP remote UE connects to network on the direct path using NR Uu, and connects to network on the indirect path via a MP relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"On indirect path, for the hop between the MP remote UE and the MP relay UE, when the MP remote UE connects to a L2 U2N Relay UE, i.e. the MP remote UE is acting as a L2 U2N Remote UE the network provides the configuration of SL indirect path to the MP remote UE and the L2 U2N Relay UE as specified in 5.3.5.xx.1; when the MP remote UE connects to a N3C relay UE using non-3GPP connection, the network provides the configuration of N3C indirect path to the MP remote UE and the N3C relay UE as specified in 5.3.5.xx.2. ","paragraph_zero_based":780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.1Configuration of SL indirect path ","paragraph_zero_based":781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.1.1 General","paragraph_zero_based":782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For SL indirect path:","paragraph_zero_based":783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the L2 U2N Remote UE is provided with sidelink dedicated configuration as specified in 5.3.5.14, L2 U2N Remote UE configuration as specified in 5.3.5.16, and SL indirect path specific configuration as specified in 5.3.5.xx.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the L2 U2N Relay UE is provided with sidelink dedicated configuration as specified in 5.3.5.14, L2 U2N Relay UE configuration as specified in 5.3.5.15, as well as Uu Relay RLC channel as specified in 5.3.5.5.12 and 5.3.5.5.13.","paragraph_zero_based":785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.1.2 SL indirect path specific configuration","paragraph_zero_based":786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sl-IndirectPathAddChange is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the UE indicated by the sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity to be the (target) L2 U2N Relay UE and indicate to upper layer to trigger the PC5 unicast link establishment with the L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer [T4xx] for the corresponding L2 U2N Relay UE with the timer value set to [T4xx];","paragraph_zero_based":790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to upper layer (to trigger the PC5 unicast link release) with the source L2 U2N Relay UE in case of SL indirect path change (i.e. a new L2 U2N Relay UE is indicated via sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity);","paragraph_zero_based":791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b2fd649fb663f8e3bd1d1abce20804c58309babd5594b092e524a3afa2338236","977da062724d61a47df3d456ff23ce90d019a3b37fbf549bb3dd114722dc1ce9","2d986c10b80f8d036aa8ae542df3a2068ff7033adfcf053c98a961628f8fd94a","b11fde6c5f5acbc2a93bcca2370c0739b945b775bc8b3d8e53b7a43228f83386","0a45eb82dccd841d3e9eaa8d4a00529265dc5cb9b9510fc57d6b66d20a42898d","d039810b6035bf67e83a1b7ead20d1d7df5f21acf533c1b3ae740d2318b77a4c","594a6422f0ac475cc13b3972ae798dd5902502ee41730066009608146f48dc75","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","e703ed8765b4ee510c54520bd9f6b16beedcc0982dd09146f861d84c4e8398ed","0c3b8863e5d2bb4aca80442082a78c528a51c611f9c13b51905c092298b2cc96","dd954bbfc33d8684ec4177b718493234d19970f0c3ed552310ddb8a257c7ff91","8b81f53f6ee7c10e75edcb0e2ec8c359b0a8c1235d0c7d09b03dd06d03e5b5d1","21abc798d668e75e47f14f861e2ca73c2f762952f3aaf530704b8151bc1b6095","db6eed989d94ec2e51f5e1961bf4d50f038f9fa9d0a128c51f800fb62cb5dd1c","52f60b7375f933166a3a25834bc4e759fdadfb4134e9c942a932c19b70c34453","9760267a4183738b099bef69d862cb8989ba70ca2adf8ba167c0c8685c19b954","4998f708caa1208df46bc27ab691c3f69208707f2b93c736247f62abfa9e7071","83a6f403f41d5d4bd49521fbb58a1ceb54deb8199e7a97fb230a9a3e5f0a751e","6304e2f75f7c7b7097ae0854a6a531f130aa15944074b307805e260dfa9a924e","b726f1b81a5d0a8350bec4f8be63fa1869b7aff3235c94ce5f4786d04709767b","2b6fc31dc4f2acfb2770398690e6d44f6b81ac5e2b62c68a0aa5703bddaef9d6","ee398b325335528f57375c58f9482ae7d972817bca366a61229c58dc124b0861","75676e44308b3b7d5fc6d141e5c54d0420946f969a938c58809fe14fe9967cf4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[768,791],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p768"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if sl-IndirectPathAddChange is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the SL indirect path is released and release the corresponding configurations;","paragraph_zero_based":793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to upper layer (to trigger the PC5 unicast link release) with the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.1.3T4xx expiry (Indirect path addition/change failure)","paragraph_zero_based":795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if T4xx expires; or","paragraph_zero_based":797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if the target L2 U2N Relay UE (i.e., the UE indicated by sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) changes its serving PCell to a different cell from the target cell ( i.e. the cell indicated by sl-IndirectPathCellIdentity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) before path addition or change:","paragraph_zero_based":798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if MCG transmission is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the indirect path failure information procedure as specified in clause 5.7.3c to report indirect path addition/change failure;","paragraph_zero_based":800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in clause 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.2Configuration of N3C indirect path","paragraph_zero_based":804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.2.1 General","paragraph_zero_based":805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For N3C indirect path, ","paragraph_zero_based":806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the N3C remote UE is provided with non-3GPP indirect path configuration including relay UE identification as specified in 5.3.5.xx.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the N3C relay UE is provided with non-3GPP indirect path configuration including bearer mapping configurations as specified in 5.3. 5.xx.2.3, as well as Uu Relay RLC channel as specified in 5.3.5.5.12 and 5.3.5.5.13.","paragraph_zero_based":808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE: The data transmission/reception between the N3C remote UE and the N3C relay UE via the non-3GPP connection is outside the scope of 3GPP.","paragraph_zero_based":809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.2.2 N3C remote UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if n3c-IndirectPathAddChange is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the non-3GPP connection with the relay UE indicated by the n3c-RelayIdentification to be used for the N3C indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the source non-3GPP connection is not to be used in case of N3C indirect path change (i.e. a new relay UE is indicated by the n3c-RelayIdentification);","paragraph_zero_based":814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if n3c-IndirectPathAddChange is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d55c348a0b1eec403d79a27b06e273a2a0e0e40433520b2e329e06e8ed35b928","857fb64239b23f387ac69a3c2d00bce163d605773ecab87b919dab023ccb6866","ad849c7f8f4c1f233f48bc4aea64f689fc7141fef20a6bba856f046a287d160e","d6776c8f5a343a2ccfa908d1229803769000a7747bdb813f6a78cf8f2670a2ba","15910f3359234ec4fe85e1e44bbcb7c3f0ef0b83e8b0e23b9eeb7c67af513c0f","fc51ad9ae5602b16b48232f869220b97e18df160acd906405419359ab465356b","30a61e6e64657c1e55f2794c624be42eef0acaaa3d9d660799a5534fd4d8b9a0","c78a7412cb3ea8a6c44adb010a8dbd71e3a52ad0f801940be795b7fa0276de8a","dbfc5886b6a9f32b681f9a81e191dad692cb47347b62bfc74c7188fee032f1e6","d5de1d89b130a2df06bdc0074eb9a082cf2c6899154900b99b1b61f23ed00732","db89afb3438377dae05b047b970e4d92eeb175aac242a71e872c96555fa15553","b32dbdf730432688c4c05ac3cd02b384263e1936bf5c50960dc20ec75ff760df","4bec0405d1b3d6c176328c8a59f1291ed040ad79d1c33ab83f0bbbf551b21c92","fbe62363f1b08185aa039ab422f47a196bfa66875e5d31198901092380db42f9","2c8334605334cccea89f0eb4c07a7999f15f03c25024469f24716032c0f48176","fbcc7e0284529ea922e5e90416acc5aa1ff894cc151b789886debfdf859d4fa2","4085f859927889670c1d7a7f79cd431474968a20543a853dcfa67e1635ac9485","f091d09956d086db9c1ef1a349308b0bbad9536cf386f9bb3a6f5520f72ccddb","e484fb583fc338fe7793cb041aef3ba38f7e466314214bc2f036c8ba920d777e","b60fde79d56e13b4a9d3f3b1f106568cfd9721dd91868437c287293b5528b371","bec3d664ecc3306fb68314007275dfc8b919ede2a9edf7d682abd628477716e1","15db84854c5a3453ee122bc0f0e4d167d406115c5ec42a67cd56f77fae78f35a","7b464be3cad869e09480a9de6eceb47755bce573f2811fa9791848d96730f6af","999f823f65b1b8522b2c77e6cf2c3b38c82ad17db7ce8ec75d5f57ddfbb86036"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[792,815],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p792"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the indirect path is not to be used and release the corresponding configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor Note: whether T4xx is applicable to scenario 2.","paragraph_zero_based":817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.2.3 N3C relay UE configuration","paragraph_zero_based":818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if n3c-MappingToReleaseList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform N3C bearer mapping release as specified in 5.3.5.xx.2.4.1;","paragraph_zero_based":822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if n3c-MappingToAddModList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform N3C bearer mapping addition/modification as specified in 5.3.5.xx.2.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the indirect path with the remote UE is released and release the corresponding configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.2.4 Bearer mapping management on N3C indirect path","paragraph_zero_based":827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.2.4.1 Bearer mapping release","paragraph_zero_based":828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for all configured SL-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value:","paragraph_zero_based":831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-RLC-ChannelUu and n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the release is triggered by reception of the n3c-MappingToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SL-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in n3c-MappingToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the corresponding n3c-RLC-ChannelUu and n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity;","paragraph_zero_based":835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.xx.2.4.2 Bearer mapping addition and modification","paragraph_zero_based":836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in the n3c-MappingToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>associate the remote UE’s RB indicated in n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity to the Uu RLC channel indicated in n3c-RLC-ChannelUu;","paragraph_zero_based":839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["656abe3b6a47acfdb8027c19e8912596d4f0e006b191100f7030f109378d5721","6e9fa8a7310995dec43357d90706c7058e7469d2fb5663172c73ed078d4a3739","c07a2088ecfce293ba012d51a55be08ca8b43d8a37226ce7c613a5d04da450b4","2375422bb2fff577e2fbab71c6ce2ab692277f74210b6a901a5a3afe48ae15af","87f28d4b442956865e2afefca457e6451527565ef29f349167511b108aa07648","37ab55a765144eeb9d0f1367fa10b3a76ffd9a6527a131f6e85930ad93c0bd07","edf2f52de1bbadd877f6c8952a38c0981570595c10937f4bc216e182a8ad933f","fdb07626addf305f72cbdfa5f235f6b32fe4cae7e66d0e9abd386e679b98424b","2f6dde75b7e119863b3c66973a0ce7cfc731f212aa064e91e6f34e0fee8d487d","3bf33f634f5975bb03303b0cfd5cf0fec460ca6e7c86d8f282483229db830c01","892ccec33b89414e46c9cb934ccdf1cc33db09be59baaf0af3635fb9f1c7aae1","b8004b41a81ea5dc9f6bf089ee28c9465876bed4712139e7cbf4a41b1609286c","8c9fbebc6844531f72643cfe4eac331a81938a53f0892e9be10f08a95e659c88","e5e1c49246383df501d8d4e0911f8af4f04533c190c306f7a813e023c2da6edd","cb30b8c053bfe595a72ec06f7940a31034e5ac704aaa8895c61ac8a857da1458","c0d889a0186dfefb17d196a21f91e714f1d6442cbbbe794376f993ad704e72cd","5d7aa1b5fb7046b5fdad9f2effb636930afca4750558b75a1df0296434267b59","ab76e90b937c6afb3298b7324f36a36f061b3f896dbcc631bd5d942799e18919","b427eb4731305a315e9d100c6f9c4d5ba6b631419de01f26b8ebe50f94560fa6","85210b64812dff8ab90acfc0ba0bc3fd52731b4ab59d81d7ff98938d3f5153f4","c9471df9d67364a0472423f972f49acf9aa9b9012b6b3f33ba4a311ab52e982e","9ee87d97bd5c42110dbb98a8f6a43db658dcd7b764caad8f36efb69cf30e706d","a4d3ff8e924728de836635ac815a5a1f4a1c787bb3a7974c480db513fc1a7613","2b6c6aa3c7e33b7dcdfb1f1a0e6d2a6795460da07fc9bd9f06132e96f05f33e8"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[816,839],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p816"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for the n3c-RemoteUE-RB-Identity value included in the n3c-MappingToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>update the associated Uu RLC channel to the one indicated in n3c-RLC-ChannelUu.","paragraph_zero_based":841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE initiates the procedure when one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG and t316 is not configured, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while SCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while PSCell change or PSCell addition is ongoing, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG while the SCG is deactivated, in accordance with 5.3.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon mobility from NR failure, in accordance with clause 5.4.3.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from lower layers concerning SRB1 or SRB2, except if the integrity check failure is detected on the RRCReestablishment message; or","paragraph_zero_based":852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon an RRC connection reconfiguration failure, in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2; or","paragraph_zero_based":853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure for the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended, in accordance with clause 5.3.10.3 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.11.3 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reconfiguration with sync failure of the SCG while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG change failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.7a; or","paragraph_zero_based":856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon SCG configuration failure while MCG transmission is suspended in accordance with clause 5.3.5.8.2 in NR-DC or in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.5 in NE-DC; or","paragraph_zero_based":857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon integrity check failure indication from SCG lower layers concerning SRB3 while MCG is suspended; or","paragraph_zero_based":858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon T316 expiry, in accordance with clause 5.7.3b.5; or","paragraph_zero_based":859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting sidelink radio link failure by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon reception of NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType by L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10; or","paragraph_zero_based":861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED which is not configured with MP while T301 is not running;","paragraph_zero_based":862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG (i.e. direct path) in accordance with clause 5.3.10 while the transmission of indirect path is suspended as specified in 5.xyy; or","paragraph_zero_based":863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["b79a34633efcc3a3e4cfc23ade9f6f3eb6e8533544ebae433559c2db3dd9be74","8e3703f99c4893747798ceb352f7f7b0e3f1b2007153782915f097309afdd8d3","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","44771258f288b9c28bff1faab7057d006a326428a0e6392f9cefed55e03890bd","707acd86abe85d23f1ae0799e36f274f72a086589241387b73b3698bd14908f4","e9270212a2e59688bf3acc5fce395908f7d4b66390611f60515299a065ecd252","4760c4f3a0f816d14c36e59d37de32fcbda74b88b4a81d37140d8e9e28c71f5b","ae18984f2dce2038c218d906a858cd6cf0159fa60b0897f0f87b2060628ea12a","fb7c141982429cef5e67fda7e7771cb0c98f16bd05987b7440bdcfdf523fe841","b1f29031cc11acbc3d412ea77c0193c6590cbae2ee19a224840d1b51baae55bb","c19875c33a857152ed28b72464bcb0c94fc52cbf0640e21eac642beefa3cced5","23c2f0747456ad0f9168ac147285f0ceb61c4b814dc6e4b3d27f96a971cc0c31","27495de5c7d9cf0f32208cd56a2bd17f4d0b8fd6c5bc60501104e18d6438eca4","5dfb35196f77f31c5f804b6016532f1e2f1ada4a00708b4eebd1aaf96d613687","b7b54cca4b10e4f394b5d8f2491df586b60d62f3b9e50b3d23a61078e3d38f3a","b3a6b64f3acdd4031a9a620c000ee32dedd5c1bf9191d35d06b5103f4f2abb89","06e509036a61698e8a2a1ecd09b2125e359fd70f91231182606949c483e533b2","ddc055a8c42346d15d988f4d3e548f673274d6d1464ffce300db8f96c41aebee","bf134f5e73fb13b526dda23a6fff17e1b5fdff21859f2f4aa7e6ed7368921eb2","4d7f4199fa1b68fa59cc310a49f9cee4d080dc0ba65156553186a7ede7a1d11f","2d469fd11880446ffb01331d9be1b7804e40486134801e5a25060b05c4983aa5","dbadfb2b1265a0b91fa1bb28bdf27c677e7bbdccc92705ee7560ba754447cab7","80f9b1b7ba6ea4803ac641b392bc7a5d2634ed82e2689953d77b08ad77e54719","44aa9c26772f65a544fce93544a105cecdc469230f74582a5f0b74c7c7936489"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[840,863],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p840"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting sidelink radio link failure of SL indirect path by L2 U2N Remote UE, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon reception of NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon PC5 unicast link release indicated by upper layer at L2 U2N Remote UE, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended as specified in clause 5.7.3b; or","paragraph_zero_based":866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor’s Note: FFS how to handle relayUE-HO.","paragraph_zero_based":867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if MP is configured, upon detecting the failure of N3C indirect path by N3C remote UE in accordance with clause 5.7.3c, while MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is suspended.","paragraph_zero_based":868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0:It is up to UE implementation whether to initiate the procedure while T346g is running.","paragraph_zero_based":869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T310, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T304, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T316, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if UE is not configured with attemptCondReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release spCellConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>suspend all RBs, and BH RLC channels for IAB-MT, and Uu Relay RLC channels for L2 U2N Relay UE, except SRB0 and broadcast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the MCG SCell(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if MR-DC is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform MR-DC release, as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release delayBudgetReportingConfig, if configured and stop timer T342, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release overheatingAssistanceConfig, if configured and stop timer T345, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release idc-AssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release btNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release wlanNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":887}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9a54bbaf3f396a620473d7c238dce08ac58792daf8721ace389c600d737c3fca","9b760041def799c9d55d63de3515bb121f0c36da2bccb360a186dd41122e6873","01db468febf99220306bb74572a1b736fd79e8eb