{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SL indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release sl-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release of the SL indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if N3C indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release n3c-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as a N3C relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE and MP via L2 U2N Relay UE is not configured:","paragraph_zero_based":933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8d11c6103bbf975182ce76fa484af314e39fcb1eb53841fc4c058667d58211d4","515e7100bc61bdcbebaa24a2e26de58b2f415338a558a0b4dbc75e312ee84492","92dfaae3d41d5b3f8ca48251e4d2442b487469a923aa8085d5f7a657cdd1b01b","ac0ab020dfed385b8e684fa0f878790ed79676077e5d2449aa710263f42ff95b","bf7c53b4d5d73dd9bb67c68ef8604e539f438c523eb8fb39626f0efc4bb3b2c6","b432d90f0b168d2f7a9e44ad97ef24e03930ee8b57ebb7a0f100681ce48aa52c","2eb4d4351e140f2c49a7eabfd53bc9bc9a2d8f8af0f1cd796b9480112d44e6c9","dc1d27361f225c9c6c5379b64dab552492bff46ba9171d876c857e574de0f7d7","fa1d154b8ba679f4882068936e416e703fa609a70e5db9fc23f24615c0fcf3f4","35a934c0282cb32caeb19621e60b24a228ad81af70f237a38e274e1a6bf8ee52","9eb389ee25120bcd8afc348e3f10f05f1813e18b4788f2674b7ce2274012ac3d","31ce83161fe02c0d19cddda7bee10e051515f045a625ec5940c2d885632381fa","a83722ad5b508437f71c013ae9107a3e86400c984e4bcad457721314e3aec242","7fce68c67120c5c225c845c66d7a84888c2c506786d1c162da304d067df8474b","c7bc5b4fad47e41cea308112e71cdcfdb21516bd4a092d9cb2f1fa838dc12788","26614680d6609d3b8b05914430bfa6a5db9b742219951fdc4b5b8afcec70b192","9457edfda4dd75c9f223dd3c5d145af637acf0e4402b8629e82b43d0c1e97e91","d37377caafc646c36070265aca0690f26f5cb60f452e2b4e7c7f83dfb51b8429","0fd9a5e990f0b11c36b849304e15977b34d8140a10ba0814d8c29c539cdddeba","6ec834d92e9a778be5da3baf58026d6059f2785e3395f0a666b836893af334eb","304c061ec2d9ac34f129c1459b7643d2be46d0d30ea4e2b9213667ae3460bb1c","92a66b5afd1aafbef5d7f9f14a23cabb185a9f76bc063522d5f3e5403e702b83","e850a39d2ac5b4fabf06881811b26b0c9fe1f35cfe2d78b17eea4265414f5d3f","a9646a113f4c2f46f06c8c8d3ae11df4526434fa987e7b350b879360798aae2e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[912,935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the connected L2 U2N Relay UE as suitable and perform actions as specified in clause 5.3.7.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to Remote UE implementation whether to release or keep the current PC5 unicast link.","paragraph_zero_based":939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else (e.g. acting as L2 U2N Remote UE configured with MP):","paragraph_zero_based":940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For L2 U2N Remote UE, if both a suitable cell and a suitable relay are available, the UE can select either one based on its implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.8.3Reception of the RRCRelease by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>delay the following actions defined in this clause 60 ms from the moment the RRCRelease message was received or optionally when lower layers indicate that the receipt of the RRCRelease message has been successfully acknowledged, whichever is earlier;","paragraph_zero_based":951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T380, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T320, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T316 is running;","paragraph_zero_based":954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear the information included in VarRLF-Report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T346g, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the AS security is not activated:","paragraph_zero_based":959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f89715a1cfc8465edd51520438206599b5bf77ac8a9eb9ff911199121ba490dd","ca5231f98d36bcec0feb703d4d684b6734160eeceadc4e9ef27496b8ace9f0ea","994e10e4e13c6864f7b19810cb57c037bfde505fba416c6926a4bfb6c7948ece","ebbf1d2905bc85270506066e028200a74b4bfbca750cfd8c17db10c13a9071d7","085e760fb845d0f018c3174e13b76f8f5a3e44ba04652a496937041f5f18a243","5a1c6bc30546e224b2518a21b5b026b7252d3c34c375094e5860671ea81fc653","333991d673509de35203814d35dc24f9843b1bf4744d583a1deab755e6538808","8540545bc3d77de01f2d800c9883526d7de41da0d4c6b63067ff8651014ed8b8","132961245701e60c12edb44edd0d7fd5fdc357e785ba20ae151818a0fb8067f0","40fc3213646f936cfe28d4ef538b7f89ea69e90e19472fafe227aa039583d74d","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","400612d36e5cb8f04c689fc5820fb6368dc87e7cbf7cc50bc584a6b752fb9eed","dce72dc23be9ea21d08ba03c38bcf3acb9f96ad09dc5b3203dd3d27d456c9074","ece70edfe350aef45b0d8d8d17c36f6ca3f60c87b06a15bee1c29f0d3d3ff87b","203f05cce24ecf9efebb3b616d686b694d4ef8b9c2862c60782d154aa4ed0590","c21d27355e1a7c029f0f4e489938360cf1c8a7a10900692257d4c792ecf164d8","89d325515a185057459a1d5f926f822732998b9d3fcf5c4b81fd83f492284e79","e38204c5419fbf4b549e4e0756b47e3c814527f1287a3b9ea7eccee2016e4ec2","6f4461f1a34a8b4246457ed1150d9ca73cfc93c31adadd5485791ff714e8b6ca","9691bf4fc30a892233304eae71a39c26fd2806b042ac69243c2bc8ede44564d5","de35ba0ff85100a76b0e7efcb705066e4bb29fc406b685fa68c741ad33e9c168","3a24ef53765a18be7cbfe90cc25b336e8fb08813a9cc3d6dfa594cf7a806408b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[936,959],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p936"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ignore any field included in RRCRelease message except waitTime;","paragraph_zero_based":960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with the release cause 'other' upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease message includes redirectedCarrierInfo indicating redirection to eutra:","paragraph_zero_based":962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if cnType is included:","paragraph_zero_based":963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>after the cell selection, indicate the available CN Type(s) and the received cnType to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Handling the case if the E-UTRA cell selected after the redirection does not support the core network type specified by the cnType, is up to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if voiceFallbackIndication is included:","paragraph_zero_based":966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the RRC connection release was for EPS fallback for IMS voice (see TS 23.502 [43]);","paragraph_zero_based":967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease message includes the cellReselectionPriorities:","paragraph_zero_based":968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the cell reselection priority information provided by the cellReselectionPriorities;","paragraph_zero_based":969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the t320 is included:","paragraph_zero_based":970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T320, with the timer value set according to the value of t320;","paragraph_zero_based":971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the cell reselection priority information broadcast in the system information;","paragraph_zero_based":973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if deprioritisationReq is included and the UE supports RRC connection release with deprioritisation:","paragraph_zero_based":974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start or restart timer T325 with the timer value set to the deprioritisationTimer signalled;","paragraph_zero_based":975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the deprioritisationReq until T325 expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1a:The UE stores the deprioritisation request irrespective of any cell reselection absolute priority assignments (by dedicated or common signalling) and regardless of RRC connections in NR or other RATs unless specified otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease includes the measIdleConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> stop timer T331;","paragraph_zero_based":980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the measIdleConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received measIdleDuration in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["caeba4feb6ed7e5707ba39a48ffdebfcce0de23a96306b1b34d3d08888c73fd2","b0e5939b02d393b479a02fb20783edddcc30c56ecc33291e7570236db7b15bf9","dfb71f5375712d5ebc68afb05e8857266b1d09