{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T331 with the value set to measIdleDuration;","paragraph_zero_based":984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListNR in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListEUTRA in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains validityAreaList:","paragraph_zero_based":989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received validityAreaList in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease includes suspendConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC and release the default MAC Cell Group configuration, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the received suspendConfig except the received nextHopChainingCount;","paragraph_zero_based":993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sdt-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the DRB in the sdt-DRB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the DRB to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-SRB2-Indication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the SRB2 to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each RLC bearer (except those associated with broadcast MRBs) that is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":1000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for SRB2 (if it is resumed) and for SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":1001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":1002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the PCell with the configured grant resources for SDT and instruct the MAC entity to start the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the configuration and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1b:The Network should provide full configuration to UE for SRS for Positioning in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":1007}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7d2cfb741ec7bf0c315009c9c48a520b2a96ef83fab7b2dc0a6041aa0c5fb5d7","26cc0ceeb0a172b8084177b016326e7d5552cda11f95692da94ec2b0b82f2298","4f9fd5384e51c89f497f291e5291cb0c48ee8253a9526ff67c0918031f46460b","025f837e2d6239160af3dfea56523e508ebbf2ed98cf07f394451345fced90c0","acbba2460917e165e79c538b7dbdb05d4b900db5fb0f3faea9acfba6a0e2321f","1e989ae70bace4b8ad30445f0d9545ba9207f64fedc2770f172e4a75818b6725","d687a3d0923e843cb353c9e4eecc7e41daaf833751adca6fe6b5fe9b3cfaa84d","cb5fdb0adc52d9b097af654911b3ee73b0cd7a1d621f95d8ee792af248655d1f","232c2f936bc236709957158a55196b8fa0208941a1999ad08c8cbe7a68e5cfdd","3d3d30c0649bbf9ef45e0feb59abc07c89ebffd8921d5e56abeae3bc84a2a8e9","4d55ecde843302de1c4f48521f0f87d7981b5b92885b84f91dfc85e046b09d55","17992af715581e29381f2cbc77e8e1b486de72b70b932e8749a26512f9fda23c","8984035f832a3a20cde8607b912c2e0158a689c83376d77f0dd3f1fc4a2b6c0c","13dfaf56db9f5200d1fb9ca4daf46e646c5b1860bc421142dd11e43e263428ee","5bcb122a9b8c4041e03398fcb6e3ab3a82f3beeeb11f22dc621da701f08e59e5","8166f89810d4a6b0d77a9bf1c63576ce5b838a0389040a463e964b2c84c81b0c","0b4f5d6972954f9e8d9e18ffcd060c32eaf7865c8bd0a3a171c9f468832e933f","8c955364830ad9a47d4abf2f7bac2c0253c4a71066985b6fc38a749e1715195a","c90557c77a69145f9b14e7df04183a08d0eafd02923f0eda441ac05aca6f1152","c7e5e725569e2332da8c7c5e3a7d19e3be4497316d733627c804c32f8b0a3a30","5762b2659c5488c85056c353bad6519b9a8b18b33f5ee6ba8a93714d32bdd42a","12e4d6365186d8dd2c55b81e0abd6a611ea08413a284c61de1ae1c26ee2daa19","5d88fb9e596166efc5459b9b64ecfdc6dc02781a9e7a03a9d30223136ec63faf","8d2fb70dee18f03d5c9f1e04a6a537ee0eeb1ed3693564a2bf7fdf7850f14d51"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[984,1007],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p984"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":1008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId of the MCG measConfig and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":1010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":1014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE and is not configured with MP:","paragraph_zero_based":1015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":1016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":1017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":1018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish or re-establish (e.g. via release and add) SL RLC entity for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":1019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish RLC entities for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":1021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCRelease message with suspendConfig was received in response to an RRCResumeRequest or an RRCResumeRequest1:","paragraph_zero_based":1022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T319 if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>in the stored UE Inactive AS context:","paragraph_zero_based":1024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the KgNB and KRRCint keys with the current KgNB and KRRCint keys;","paragraph_zero_based":1025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the nextHopChainingCount with the value of nextHopChainingCount received in the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":1026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the cellIdentity with the cellIdentity of the cell the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":1027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the suspendConfig contains the sl-UEIdentityRemote (i.e. the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE):","paragraph_zero_based":1028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the C-RNTI with the value of the sl-UEIdentityRemote;","paragraph_zero_based":1029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the physical cell identity with the value of the sl-PhysCellId in sl-ServingCellInfo contained in the discovery message received from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":1030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> else:","paragraph_zero_based":1031}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6fc0844b0444bfc72429f5ffe63d8021fc8ca5606dd414294f70046b68944ed1","f670f06ed4ad7bf8fbef4cb356c12b694148354d7dc1cd9b20d60f769ad206b6","e4a9b4971f588b3c9b8d30425a4ca5467fd66d71e5962bb4e406e1acd3714d57","8616d5bd05dac1857ac3185d8234695e32afd2bfafdbc29853218d30acf89200","424406b9b4d463d3d8545849e4c8b141a8bb402c64569d685437803d907743a5","cc2e1da16e742d4a52f301914245a2b0956878c716173b5db9e9d680e2a64c2f","6abb1e850a8fe9596b41e4fd8e4b20dd52bb1ece64ecc180f8abbd46ae28f210","24597d0aa9120f65a7e62c55c081665da777daab5da76a8d784f061e2397a776","c0fd1819f56f99d79ddc228027d74ce847f25ca6cad8db2223f7afe470c42448","fb0a2f24cf06399d25d8c924afd90f89bf923ee56dba83c200355436b4c1b5bc","2091706c17f13c81b24ac50332eebb824caf4d41da0812b982ff856b95499e1a","4b3617d3df8dd26fcd6c2c440f0c36cb473c974949494e6d6f341f2d75a16792","04815229ead2cd23a95b78570e5e27ba19dc778cfa17d99b3a074accae140f4e","feefe814f2df958a9a21c0b574697bc633560293873ea647dad2e209658d2889","55a4de33d0716645e2809ae9261f01519ba0bf61b6ff9da103ce757aac4a146d","6f6733c3fb9d2496d18a81379bd504dc586f3ba86d95cb9907dc83679ed8e049","7831bd7c2294745d260df34e8dfb2fcdcf1056a3edf53b018edc71ae7e8b874e","6b38c2cdfcb25d0aa4501d934ba74b31b9f17b69d4c055f29bd937c5589ea041","ab01d2d98b984f115b0f45269e96768660186a9bd55b629b9c9dc6df1e810817","3a225abbf94e6b21180b97095b62397a9d642a8a12b9f31ee13e7919708cfef7","93ace101d1d546f2f50cd570760fab459c47d51e19a4450c73aebb4e607bd4d7","f64a79b13489e7563aad6340e00074b530e4adde0e7bc6bfb1e17498ee4d2659","0a4bcca6c782c70507d4ce0a3dac78d4787110e04e784141f2baf6483ebe959b","21c59d4be6d4082b64cff520ad47cfccea4971e9ef71a51ed01a8613d5c109ac"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1008,1031],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1008"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the C-RNTI with the C-RNTI used in the cell (see TS 38.321 [3]) the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":1032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the physical cell identity with the physical cell identity of the cell the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":1033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the nextHopChainingCount with the value associated with the current KgNB;","paragraph_zero_based":1034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T319a if running and consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":1035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store in the UE Inactive AS Context the nextHopChainingCount received in the RRCRelease message, the current KgNB and KRRCint keys, the ROHC state, the EHC context(s), the UDC state, the stored QoS flow to DRB mapping rules, the application layer measurement configuration, the C-RNTI used in the source PCell, the cellIdentity and the physical cell identity of the source PCell, the spCellConfigCommon within ReconfigurationWithSync of the NR PSCell (if configured) and all other parameters configured except for:","paragraph_zero_based":1037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within ReconfigurationWithSync of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":1038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within ReconfigurationWithSync of the NR PSCell, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within MobilityControlInfoSCG of the E-UTRA PSCell, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-servingCellConfigCommonSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":1041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1c:suspendConfig is not stored as part of UE Inactive AS Context, except for the fields explicitly specified.","paragraph_zero_based":1044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store any previously or subsequently received application layer measurement report containers for which no segment, or full message, has been submitted to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:NR sidelink communication/discovery related configurations and logged measurement configuration are not stored as UE Inactive AS Context, when UE enters RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":1046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>suspend all SRB(s) and DRB(s) and multicast MRB(s), except SRB0 and broadcast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":1047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate PDCP suspend to lower layers of all DRBs and multicast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":1048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release Uu Relay RLC channel(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release PC5 Relay RLC channel(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2a:A L2 U2N Relay UE may re-establish the SL-RLC0, SL-RLC1 and SRAP entity after release.","paragraph_zero_based":1052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SL indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release sl-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":1054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release of the SL indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":1055}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["812ebafc10bfb0f4d53b2c876e88a8015fdc836abb7803cb3438cd5b9276c615","f4273847b3648d640717f52b8e85c18a31e09d4abf18846df557efb519e7b1f4","495745419d2b2e61a7fddda7b98d361dd21e73d27ff3d953b009f2cc808b47ef","a8ed126ec26a0fc95ac6b3b09f26e8dc4a9f4c7c64e0c41a3f0a86995008d796","1a0f1d18d227e572691220ab9f3d4e8081f43a165521e7908da7b8350222eed0","b30d47953d279b398a83d8ce57dcb97312c70d7d8154262c558712986e1090a4","763c89db1910b275b17d045342ba7ca25e3efc2ab13faff8488024a13786594f","5d7908741412840f5bbbed73bc306a63a4f979975c8c33038b51bb235dbb34fe","963dc2ad71330c41c6b0bcc4cb0f387a99b0827290863c21bb1f9df65eb929ad","91ebb635e9a459aa2e18a675861171a0106c8deb3b2c909a656809bf802b4eca","f2ec4061905592e02551306d5cba3613e9134b5636307362e58decce426c767f","5308681a1003547b930f64b1ddade3b5b346857982e13d95e09e76172ede4ef0","ea2318cbe66ffe9bdd37d343f9529d68cb817c6fa8b29a3f2db2148d19848724","1287bd1522bfad8ebe237311f5ef02dffcfafd7a31d8f2ea1af423159dfabd4f","608200c66d6b4dbeb5c503de73e779b83fed92631cb65102dc42b2eeee72d029","8e6d20394a7ea09e1279cdece99d0b2dd34b07d09d64acfe5576ea6aa7a82bf6","40c8da52a322443752dffddc847b9bf15d5e3e2379bd2278c670f9ed4809564d","3b39d65ed4e70b22d368d58c8b08f70835cf39e97b9890429f31fd95eacae512","c0d3ea65b1103a3385cc08ede67b9bb02d269469deea98f82e17f4aa89b84f6a","d262f4e8dfc8455c1755905f26fb1416249b7665ef75b292ddc5c0fed53e250b","a9a737cd1e7a58b5264870f94837df611030d3f39167b87245293ef464736769","19479709b386086228690787cded2354d188f350f272170a7cc9cff1ec76bf58","3ab8216555ab39d8cac45f3d633ce45f08b93bdc6ac3ac9059791fcf2aa71335","5d9283854c1490a805897c65d2d2008b064e0d044bf01f90e4e62dae344993f9"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1032,1055],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1032"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if N3C indirect path is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":1056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-IndirectPathAddChange;","paragraph_zero_based":1057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":1058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as a N3C relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":1059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release n3c-IndirectPathConfigRelay;","paragraph_zero_based":1060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> consider the non-3GPP connection is not used;","paragraph_zero_based":1061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the t380 is included:","paragraph_zero_based":1062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T380, with the timer value set to t380;","paragraph_zero_based":1063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCRelease message is including the waitTime:","paragraph_zero_based":1064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T302 with the value set to the waitTime;","paragraph_zero_based":1065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>inform upper layers that access barring is applicable for all access categories except categories '0' and '2';","paragraph_zero_based":1066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":1067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":1068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate the suspension of the RRC connection to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":1070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":1071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>enter RRC_INACTIVE, and perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":1072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>enter RRC_INACTIVE and perform cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":1074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with the release cause 'other'.","paragraph_zero_based":1076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Whether to release the PC5 unicast link is left to L2 U2N Remote UE's implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:It is left to UE implementation whether to stop T430, if running, when going to RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":1078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1079}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a85496e172139e8605d9bbe57cd8a12ffb510ade1f4208559b68d900ce14ef55","58ff08cf8bcecfe9ec5c4478bf4c2a362cc6085d40c6a620e30e5d9b78c522ed","745e881a0c6f91ec16500f04c5fb870e34d23b4b3cda0ff7ccbe69b4e96d9929","81b8e36ed80bff1c68f81c4cee06c83ebcb8d1784af10475ce7e98979a322275","055931ef354b734faf6aaa15237ab01dd3fe191774acdb642e19b72fc27fa537","301cedd05d77b6b391dc2081ae8945542e8dd265edfce9f720ab9d90418c23d8","a0e5efe62a470e0c005c37805ee6b73e61a3ad2c83ebfb36028c5946e07822e2","1ae4c9fd13f4ac246e408184caeca80ad927da6b26b5970ef707ec8ed003d7ba","73b9434a778b270ad91c894c9b6752f376218c3d47ba8ff23b4d28cad178dd6b","a3706bb342aaafca281395cd5d31bee28066735453c54cc4be64de57cd2f7519","a5c3ca7a1b5e3908aa2d7ffaa77f170617dde41955f4053b9d40c039ff5dbd67","f500f8009cd11ad5ff099fbd58fd2da71e0bf41ba6eb3e1e6e9611b07de60fb3","fb2ea0f252766d668199ad2d1b4e2795cfc15e59e407a758cda1794e72c24bba","3145884471f6d60faa731a5abaca37c4121477a116bb735a33c6d0ccf3f30c7a","952c9051e88b93efaeb6f48f11db40ba5cefdf7fd7e1f7710e43b0b322fa2340","e55bca7cc0311e6f51a95014fb4315c0d72ccc2edfcd8f588b8907b9f0fa08ea","b76a85a570d0ad8b4b373ac70a631fa04669d053b294de7b610a339daca365fc","1a0f1d18d227e572691220ab9f3d4e8081f43a165521e7908da7b8350222eed0","286840a404988b9753e749b99a0fe343d57888076fba650307d514b8bff342e9","160cf39b595c5b6077c3d67250ef32468f39ca7d26fc85e71cab38b14f7e8936","9b8412cadd2ffa59e4557de74e5558c6073c7aeafcba5a8de0b4a23f7b4281fb","8f4db3a2b920cc236e49f8c41643ac69fdf143fe75c840fd81812594983c7990","ae9f16af0972299bb4c9dfbb1ead32f5f742eab181925ba9fc5e383b548ade08","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1056,1079],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1056"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.1aConditions for resuming RRC Connection for NR sidelink communication/discovery/V2X sidelink communication","paragraph_zero_based":1082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For NR sidelink communication/discovery an RRC connection is resumed only in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":1083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink communication and related data is available for transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":1084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the frequency on which the UE is configured to transmit NR sidelink communication is included in sl-FreqInfoList within SIB12 provided by the cell on which the UE camps; and if the valid version of SIB12 does not include sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for the concerned frequency;","paragraph_zero_based":1085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink discovery and related data is available for transmission:","paragraph_zero_based":1086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages and sl-L2U2N-Relay is included in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages and sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery is included in SIB12; or","paragraph_zero_based":1088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured by upper layers to transmit NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages and sl-NonRelayDiscovery is included in SIB12:","paragraph_zero_based":1089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the frequency on which the UE is configured to transmit NR sidelink discovery is included in sl-FreqInfoList within SIB12 provided by the cell on which the UE camps; and if the valid version of SIB12 does not include sl-DiscTxPoolSelected or sl-TxPoolSelectedNormal for the concerned frequency;","paragraph_zero_based":1090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For L2 U2N Relay UE in RRC_INACTIVE, an RRC connection establishment is resumed in the following cases:","paragraph_zero_based":1091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any message is received from the L2 U2N Remote UE via SL-RLC0 as specified in 9.1.1.4 or SL-RLC1 as specified in 9.2.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if RemoteUEInformationSidelink containing the connectionForMP is received from a L2 U2N Remote UE as specified in 5.8.9.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For V2X sidelink communication an RRC connection resume is initiated only when the conditions specified for V2X sidelink communication in clause 5.3.3.1a of TS 36.331 [10] are met.","paragraph_zero_based":1094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:Upper layers initiate an RRC connection resume (except if the RRC connection resume is initiated at the L2 U2N Relay UE upon reception of a message from a L2 U2N Remote UE via SL-RLC0 or SL-RLC1). The interaction with NAS is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":1097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MR-DC, a UE configured with split SRB1 or SRB3 initiates the procedure to report MCG failures when neither MCG nor SCG transmission is suspended, the SCG is not deactivated, t316 is configured, and when the following condition is met; or ","paragraph_zero_based":1098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MP, a MP remote UE configured with split SRB1 initiates the procedure to report direct path failures when neither MCG (i.e. direct path) nor indirect path transmission is suspended, t316 is configured, and when the following condition is met:","paragraph_zero_based":1099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG, in accordance with 5.3.10.3, while T316 is not running.","paragraph_zero_based":1100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T310 for the PCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312 for the PCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1103}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","6682470087c9159349f22f297fa20e999416ac4f11e3291cf7202ef70f069656","2d2707c0bb8f862c39d6b1c9687d220a8b83b3288edd96a0dbad90a0bd7282df","802df1017076810e32df529a960de70b89e831846e4e384f02f5e4ffc0a1e81c","c2ddcaa8b70160166047afdd59080edea04bb939052f8c037e83fbc38a6237b9","389c81c41007961bccc35284e34d0643269f03e8d35256bc438c3d5896404959","f156c98f53cca556fc2ed789518e5faff135466f311043072833e2f12c10a87f","41af37a93af5ea1c9f3eba12cc8176b157c0c7e1f6c60f5c9e26e20a86b8b7ad","e1d7a463bbf0a4b84502d5597db6949b8513dd1946a267f464caaf42959817ff","944e8a8ddb49f68a3e457a97513fbb59555e6c8f711708ce9ba916a63952bcab","456adbc42a5454a5ca50096369378b51f1b06f53e239f87d34c9b7e27434db5c","4a61efefd4a170d908098f4296d1330d3dff73b9fc45ecb7a9ac7bccb20a6938","4781e96b39fd6563bae41743a087bbc3174d3f30065212402c81e461f874c103","0184858f5fe41703d652c710297a591a676a1fc91eb0f38f21938956510f9ae4","f552b88d1532be266e7b99f0d65577d748e2d0fa12ab026551f63b24d5992811","040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","d441268655cf9781b545d03fe981169a1d04a22b2fa9bd9f12344096e43ac53a","60b90022ee6d7f9842fc243cac62b5c39c27784707e95cbe16e360212d48d6dc","9fea19ccdaf14942215f07946425270d886acff3fcc16c751961701f2f43ca9a","20a126a4caafe8308dce35e443ceb5bdadae19aa722c1129d817b768fbc4c529","3a75319a426dc91cfb18eeed95a93c926381a314b365e75b73bae167f4545459","159220f8ea6f073e6689c177a92d00acc10c4a47542c157716885db13f6b4f3f","c23a5eab3d1213d34ef585515fb598089fbe86b34f6c051d33a4b91126497621"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1080,1103],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1080"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>suspend MCG transmission for all SRBs, DRBs, multicast MRBs, except SRB0, and, if any, BH RLC channels;","paragraph_zero_based":1104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset MCG MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":1105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop conditional reconfiguration evaluation for CHO, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop conditional reconfiguration evaluation for CPC, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message in accordance with 5.7.3b.4.","paragraph_zero_based":1108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The handling of any outstanding UL RRC messages during the initiation of the fast MCG link recovery is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":1109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3cIndirect path failure information","paragraph_zero_based":1113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3c.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.3.1c-1: Indirect path failure information","paragraph_zero_based":1116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to inform NR RAN about an indirect path failure the MP remote UE has experienced.","paragraph_zero_based":1117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3c.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":1118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case of MP, a MP remote UE initiates the procedure to report indirect path failures when neither MCG nor indirect path transmission is suspended and when one of the following conditions is met:","paragraph_zero_based":1119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting a SL indirect path failure, including sidelink radio link failure on the PC5 unicast link or Uu failure of the L2 U2N Relay UE, or indirect path addition/change failure in accordance with 5.3.5.xx.1.3; or","paragraph_zero_based":1120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting a N3C indirect path failure, including N3C connection failure or Uu failure of the relay UE with N3C indirect path;","paragraph_zero_based":1121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure was initiated to report SL indirect path failure:","paragraph_zero_based":1123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the sidelink specific MAC of this destination;","paragraph_zero_based":1124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop T4xx if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>suspend indirect path transmission for all SRBs and DRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":1126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message in accordance with 5.7.3c.4;","paragraph_zero_based":1127}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["28f577cebeb014920617568d41e70d53d6a773e3b5e8d7b83436afa31b3d1d91","85d38bb8263955d5eefd0f85eb75a812aa6601b4a1de4fd0ea7a8f6a38b7be78","3ae73045303ddcc48994de8aff7028cb3c028955fac6a2c69ec3309342c8ca42","51bf4e0971749b11efd1ed8274b3a39f841d64b99abbfb7dbc0d08bc5287aa71","771b98f4f7db8164ea498aba1189fd967a6d5572736fca6de2d6fdb7ae706bf9","f599ebc84cc729f8b4b2d90efcd824a625a86c16d718e5078cb6be8d3749aa8b","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","32ca0e5afb0a5993cf4e8302e2a5843ed9a25cf590563e7cb63ba235592be575","5c992f87feed51822d02400b5c7eb937b4e72313538fd3c3a6ba5bb4fc01afb2","52fcf6273a60664edf4e900621b5e4b922c54f9e30f4cde31d19968b1a7471ac","e1bd7bce08229085395b9a74e824473998c01efcae8aa350a07aa23318c6148a","7890ee3f381bd1fbab4d47e0457de933992a633277a4f75232f20f2d83dd90a4","2a7f85933b5dd712898ad013bcccf6c1aaf39a107128bc88457ce5f9556df455","33be443b1705d03f2088048ecea871633b53ec025a1726af9a0cea9fc2f5b16e","fb4bec0f3a1c41a8836e619b06827e87a75673c1f97398de6a504cf8f7ef91ab","bbe6b72e62259000e81bf49dc9c394c628989d98729bd64b58804fb0bba8f160","cd5f13fb4817c3955e6b127a00816958c39bf340cbbea310609e9239f6eae0b6","4d72db936416e78b9e658a0eef871fe6176d4cfc2b759b759b62238019791fa6","5cee7421cff086dc61bcf1627f5138df90cb1211055d9dc9b212418ba7272f1c","027afb1ff39287f8da4eeb0be813ef827fc0f9787fa0e1877dcd51f5157d3f6d","ab3a0d31637a4ac427ea86f568e63daca5d27bb399f5724f371266e842627d93","24383ca79fc91046ee5194101b5579ec440fc0c350310fc655e85df1e1b87ae5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1104,1127],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1104"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3c.3Failure type determination","paragraph_zero_based":1128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE configured with SL indirect path shall set the indirect path failure type as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to T4xx expiry in accordance with clause 5.3.5.xx.1.3 :","paragraph_zero_based":1130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as t4xx-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":1131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to reception of the NotificationMessageSidelink including indicationType, in accordance with clause 5.8.9.10.4:","paragraph_zero_based":1132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as the value in indicationType received from NotificationMessageSidelink;","paragraph_zero_based":1133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to sidelink radio link failure in accordance with clause 5.8.9.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as sl-Failure;","paragraph_zero_based":1135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> if the target L2 U2N Relay UE (i.e., the UE indicated by sl-IndirectPathRelayUE-Identity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) changes its serving PCell to a different cell from the target cell (i.e. the cell indicated by sl-IndirectPathCellIdentity in the received sl-IndirectPathAddChange) before path addition or change:","paragraph_zero_based":1136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as indirectPathAddChangeFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":1137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The N3C remote UE shall set the indirect path failure type as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to N3C connection failure:","paragraph_zero_based":1139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as n3c-Failure;","paragraph_zero_based":1140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the IndirectPathFailureInformation message due to Uu radio link failure on N3C connection:","paragraph_zero_based":1141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureTypeIndirectPath as relayUE-Uu-RLF;","paragraph_zero_based":1142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE: it is out of 3GPP scope how the remote UE detects N3C connection failure, or how the relay UE indicates Uu RLF to the remote UE on the N3C connection.","paragraph_zero_based":1143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3c.4Actions related to transmission of IndirectPathFailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":1144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the IndiretPathFailureInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the failureTypeIndirectPath in accordance with 5.7.3c.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the IndirectPathFailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":1147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.1General","paragraph_zero_based":1151}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9ce8c0e70ff8a4d287a4693df17b3527445e44baed01307f1302b6530128fdeb","2182e2d5cafff72ddab40c04402396f8010555083ca7026a2fde330b4b830c3f","369160072edd31afe6c3f8d04bf0e1e0ee4cdfcf50b5578ae03bc711a04d8b1f","40467bd673a668c20733200399f155f17d10dfd1f601f17f5b888e4be92e955e","9402c31f6ad01f6605310c087c82b481c46c3465b0b62fe62c1bf518a5e4ec67","bef33aa1abc1d5d14d218da2c84fd484d8ea9bfc41e65678eb95596f621473da","11ed4e94cfccd598768d2b707e6f4bebea55c0234b889aa6cb812f9d59101410","be7d44cd1b4253cc89b2e213a61d7ffdc94bfae8e3242e6b1eb507874f3e38b2","011f9512921656c69ff38dc0276086c75b21ef2c394868dd79f7b159a9e73b8b","e0a4712038f58cd765ac6b20ff7e813498a866861aa174c67af761d930a8adc7","07bf9837e4060ba9819ac5ddc19212dcf11a7cad8e7817022b0e3cdc16d27426","34185f49d69f869c54fa8f127556d24005611a20c90685baf8053c1a6e7e76c3","5f14b0b984d178ba83cf90d6bcd035ecf643aba44d06cb223af2b167b77799b1","2496d0474507ac6cba85e115f5995e87f8e29104d14fa53e43c9a7197152ee3f","a7d6ac3e15defccb32ef138c660d491c054653843c238f06a64143f9964186da","b839d373050c650c328fb4a32eec3848a1405dcb68b1270ba444bc0c6ae634d7","eae66cbd20bd0c6d9d449a7d347496a33131cf951daaa263388b351fc8dde579","2705160e6b6dfd3450a19d6f27a5afcffd9ffbd81713a32d8c1ec574ca2ff1a4","a14a90b9fb74d1a728b4c89e71338ee0a0907aee6ac600bf3a35db621ed14ba9","b359f2f402a562774ad726d4dbba125702dbb8582ce6f02f4810163f480ccc4d","17f5835fd99df7975846fdd78f72899a19f95c63c1f6e40d8a0d7fc922d97021","040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","9b14f8f88de2c60588f400bcc7c8405fffed88f3adf6bd6c2a8c4030f3a9af5b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1128,1151],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1128"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.4.1-1: UE Assistance Information","paragraph_zero_based":1153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is for the UE to inform the network of:","paragraph_zero_based":1154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its delay budget report carrying desired increment/decrement in the connected mode DRX cycle length, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its overheating assistance information, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its IDC assistance information, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on DRX parameters for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the RRC state, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference in being provisioned with reference time information, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference for FR2 UL gap, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state for MUSIM operation, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the MUSIM gaps, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its relaxation state for RLM measurements, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its relaxation state for BFD measurements, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-availability of data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers which are not configured for SDT, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference for the SCG to be deactivated, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-availability of uplink data to transmit for a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer while the SCG is deactivated, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-change of its fulfilment status for RRM measurement relaxation criterion, or;","paragraph_zero_based":1174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-service link (specified in TS 38.300 [2]) propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s), or;","paragraph_zero_based":1175}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d7dfa49c546f33c8201abe99657f38146d4b7f8d8a9739239e3ea246208bb078","b1ac5d69206595d6c4ff79512fb46793878049a38437643e97418506375bd4b6","f5ea33b62a135066639adf7d449d92448302f3e40e7f69a09f8f2a242ca4ff87","04a1e5ddcb896372cb33d5a091ec524fe3da8f9d57e70006042b0f1132a0cc3e","ec660fceac8d8151689c55c7324a5dad0e236cf90532415a7775d31b3ef1400c","826603ebfb04cd18f77d0b05bd9163bc6c3282fd162391854208f31f2864bc62","8840c5ebcc9b783e4b40079345a22ceae94a748b5148aab7ee0e43a6314c9c18","26088a2ded1d26b342e4b4e740e0e7bbead79f5330353be2ad73d8c063a2e728","0a50f25ceff09277946f2c0e2d1e7fcfbfc58ba09553ea4e23c253ab09fa3269","ef016fda46dd55d88e06d78f01f5fd39e27d34cf59edada340da4c5d34ab4022","893ebac74e0e00e9d415fbd54e3b4ed1b753b954ec460f497219d12371d4beec","d99b96d14b8aa2d2e12733b0527cf0c982da4e74d2798ccada310e995d048169","45cf551ca5d5568c6d7b45af2d2853d40461cf428201e0c203a76bc636aa51cf","23002b6a7c24ee0790e0acdaa2964f9ac59826f2cf47624f921909d0d94eeb3d","b2f77b5283f05b56516233e7b106ce6aed483b7ebd50da0d1891a22cb4168c34","6da45125488d36e94930f52a449e4086a60c9917aa6394fbe26684bb80de0743","ad5f0ddc0d6ab280c1596e09c82180745f9f17e7cd3667229127abb3c63236dd","28cba5f1b08c905c979b2e3f5152723b01696dcce74837e23d284d8c8e5dc055","6c217b9cd1f1acbb13432697c0f2073e9f388e7da791af4edf09778dd0bec0a5","51fa7b937092905735f2366caa8191e0ae786d235fda60746446d0281788ba65","862b0f228452e51a745bc284ceda828d57ee5a0f72ec0a7f6d2033fe22e87a66","9b3b9d9ff4490740f67af67ab95502c2c57cf969f178aac7a28e02bfad762398","e19dd69a61309ef766f3676334a0032d6c2be852e4da7289b1b05b1533a6186a","b4ae7868b94a3ad7117120881c1e0e71fbf053a54a926cd533b136027fbebc67"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1152,1175],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1152"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-the information of the relay UE(s) with which it connects via a non-3GPP connection for MP.","paragraph_zero_based":1176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":1180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing delay budget report in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, including upon being configured to provide delay budget report and upon change of delay budget preference.","paragraph_zero_based":1181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing overheating assistance information in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting internal overheating, or upon detecting that it is no longer experiencing an overheating condition.","paragraph_zero_based":1182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing IDC assistance information in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting IDC problem if the UE did not transmit an IDC assistance information since it was configured to provide IDC indications, or upon change of IDC problem information.","paragraph_zero_based":1183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on DRX parameters of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a preference on DRX parameters and upon change of its preference on DRX parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":1184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum aggregated bandwidth preference and upon change of its maximum aggregated bandwidth preference.","paragraph_zero_based":1185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum number of secondary component carriers preference and upon change of its maximum number of secondary component carriers preference.","paragraph_zero_based":1186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum number of MIMO layers preference and upon change of its maximum number of MIMO layers preference.","paragraph_zero_based":1187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a minimum scheduling offset preference and upon change of its minimum scheduling offset preference.","paragraph_zero_based":1188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing assistance information to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining that it prefers to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state, or upon change of its preferred RRC state.","paragraph_zero_based":1189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, including upon being configured to provide traffic pattern information and upon change of traffic patterns.","paragraph_zero_based":1190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of its preference in being provisioned with reference time information may initiate the procedure upon being configured to provide this indication, or if it was configured to provide this indication and upon change of its preference.","paragraph_zero_based":1191},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of its preference in FR2 UL gap may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting the need of FR2 UL gap activation/deactivation.","paragraph_zero_based":1192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing MUSIM assistance information for gap preference may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining it needs the gaps, or upon change of the gap preference information.","paragraph_zero_based":1193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing MUSIM assistance information for leave indication may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so upon determining that it needs to leave RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":1194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of relaxing its RLM measurements of a cell group in RRC_CONNECTED state shall initiate the procedure for providing an indication of its relaxation state for RLM measurements upon being configured to do so, and upon change of its relaxation state for RLM measurements in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":1195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of relaxing its BFD measurements in serving cells of a cell group in RRC_CONNECTED shall initiate the procedure for providing an indication of its relaxation state for BFD measurements upon being configured to do so, and upon change of its relaxation state for BFD measurements in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":1196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of SDT initiates this procedure when data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers that are not configured for SDT becomes available during SDT (i.e. while SDT procedure is ongoing).","paragraph_zero_based":1197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference for SCG deactivation may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining that it prefers or does no more prefer the SCG to be deactivated.","paragraph_zero_based":1198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE that has uplink data to transmit for a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer while the SCG is deactivated shall initiate the procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":1199}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["848b2683996bab8a3e04bf54943526a503fb6ce8e8e37633c2d0976cba5405c4","f065132b1cd17c097ae6e03b31566fcf31173e6fb587f3a9148f7f156be27fe8","44771258f288b9c28bff1faab7057d006a326428a0e6392f9cefed55e03890bd","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","62331cd6158b74dcb17fc23d2b74876383f27010be1c1ddaf26d8603d4b1339b","474cbfd890b771d977a9fe54e86f4f13f9a6e27245d9d2e3c9d24a4932f88e96","12b27418a83692d97b09395451e21356109c2a62594a2b89c762dd6ade6d5731","387b300527da0fa5171315298db8b3388db8231529424c37434931f8170b2f5b","d217fb27f1e4165835459a795b59eeaa6172ef7fb9dfd334747f10fcff6ef99d","c598d43653005ec89df92586729adb7e4866c82fa604ebdecf3e9dcb14df7d8d","8ccc274a57e03ac87e4e6772e393c8366e02123e808659f953af43f877ddb74f","e15b1542869eb0f3fd5b74bfa0e6b614dade8d73f8cb3364b54ef23d3e147b0d","d07a97de42a2ae71d9bfc9dd19b072459b6628de61ed1ee98a1d73574f47026a","6504e50076ffa64dcb30682046a460000f7493ad4cbf0301bc80f789013008b9","c95d3197fa046fc5be579927f7b6a40953e005c148436cfdfc5474fcce26cf8d","9fe858d0e0100c9006666fc9c190adb9093fa9efa6502678a86630105b5c79cd","d16a434b2b4ffced15901c8725762959b3b8da8804e92e63d9b0ed71f718f82f","a91760a55582e8975542ca77a8f4b1e7e4491d8e1e3815ea93bc382b0cfbe242","d024b7a46b100ef07f0281423738e8a7c7992d0b6936a4a7c8fd59013da9c18e","206d2bb07fe7f3ee5b7bb7668f4712dc0b45b29c0a2ab816d4d64df067ddd3d0","578164226f1bc072d1af3932ee1dfee9edd4abc9375af0e7f80727008f4e65aa","10ca5d8cd0156ab87f16bbaa326e3af1d3e26a39caccdcca1897057a6093534a","95ed829dcbc2193cc864ba4d2a5d4d39cead39debfe5f5d775abecf82278ac20","5c34d75e022a257777bc13e05f03399d379e565e43224bc91842ac2a6e0125a9"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1176,1199],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1176"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of fulfilment of the RRM measurement relaxation criterion in connected mode may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon change of its fulfilment status for RRM measurement relaxation criterion for connected mode.","paragraph_zero_based":1200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) shall initiate the procedure upon being configured to do so, and upon determining that service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and a neighbour cell has changed more than threshPropDelayDiff compared with the last reported value.","paragraph_zero_based":1201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of N3C remote UE initiates the procedure upon being configured to report relay UE information on the available non-3GPP connection(s), and upon change of its available non-3GPP connection(s).","paragraph_zero_based":1202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide delay budget report:","paragraph_zero_based":1204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with delayBudgetReport since it was configured to provide delay budget report; or","paragraph_zero_based":1205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current delay budget is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including delayBudgetReport and timer T342 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart timer T342 with the timer value set to the delayBudgetReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide a delay budget report;","paragraph_zero_based":1208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide overheating assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":1209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the overheating condition has been detected and T345 is not running; or","paragraph_zero_based":1210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current overheating assistance information is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including overheatingAssistance and timer T345 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T345 with the timer value set to the overheatingIndicationProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide overheating assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":1213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide IDC assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":1214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with idc-Assistance since it was configured to provide IDC assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":1215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more frequencies included in candidateServingFreqListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself; or","paragraph_zero_based":1216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more supported UL CA combination comprising of carrier frequencies included in candidateServingFreqListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself:","paragraph_zero_based":1217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":1218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the current IDC assistance information is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":1219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":1220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The term \"IDC problems\" refers to interference issues applicable across several subframes/slots where not necessarily all the subframes/slots are affected.","paragraph_zero_based":1221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For the frequencies on which a serving cell or serving cells is configured that is activated, IDC problems consist of interference issues that the UE cannot solve by itself, during either active data exchange or upcoming data activity which is expected in up to a few hundred milliseconds.For frequencies on which a SCell or SCells is configured that is deactivated, reporting IDC problems indicates an anticipation that the activation of the SCell or SCells would result in interference issues that the UE would not be able to solve by itself.For a non-serving frequency, reporting IDC problems indicates an anticipation that if the non-serving frequency or frequencies became a serving frequency or serving frequencies then this would result in interference issues that the UE would not be able to solve by itself.","paragraph_zero_based":1222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":1223}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3fb3a0835bf9fc6d0cc0acdda91b26035523cfb738bd5581706f9aad17fee521","cdf54eebba13b04e5b4c6ade2063d7573690d54858bd3e7ad660cb9a1688a81d","fd4a97c6e762d52ff4ad321d3f65e4b10a942f0ed32ea4a0e4cae545b6a6e473","98ff0f3eb57977fbdca2b19802959578895d2c924e9f1fb3d76b4cf853f785fc","f6f3be85434f0145f6aabe4abbe0faa96b2eaae2fcf2461571c00ee1b44bad38","3d599f5a71d32e3196368415930a8756ae0c4443263111e75d51a8a49281c253","ae7b22f20e45f953f123d8a38fe20fb2f1a4e12fd029182fe90eaf0fd56fdd6e","6ee397c9c53f2fbe01795451fb489a1c2ea6457881a4a6d1512426449a370a01","066010adaced7d00f572423afa8032e245720f1466d2d0a03cd43aea90a45bf7","339d6c0a3bade427067a2a7701529139c20d1527819a9747f2c3cdf4b68c56d6","a6566119427b2668d2bb1974aabddc4c4c991d29e20ca1239298336ac67c1714","531eb7985af1868c96dd45cc5692b43636224b432b4dbf76c0fc96ff170ce0cb","260e0e03159c47dbabdd81e343d0b2735a03222e164b482791fe0492d0ef3d35","9463cf78a268e2e2e7867a232501f744d3782259d56da7cf063fea51f2ae1678","ca46fcc8a9a7b45699c423dc010a9ecf29a2c4aba4850957dbd968d984a65b7b","56448fb905eb295f6b66b6ad82be60cad40167027f6e82fbfc0d59de102d29f7","1044ead43fd450ac2fd6b3a8dea8bfcabdbcfe68bc34e5049c02738e38f775d6","29ef3b355a2c5053fd2bea91ae7bbffeeb92afea69d7e9e9b285f087d4884846","23f5d434fe2c7fced5684c33e2ac9cbf03d721ecb5802e4cb35243e9f1cdbbf7","96cafc8f6ca96deef5852fe330892d2c6dda7b578dab9235c0cad7ed0d523443","bff61806cbd6e506ebf04dd97fcdbc7dded2109b557c09a9691ed479af588dec","8f91ea7e0fae580348a9bdae5f3c48aa3948d5d110355f6851959227e53e89fc","802ed53415abbe2dde1b9cf7f788822f7d3cbdf3ab5a4b83a22ff143b831d82c","ec6bb21b7bdcf6870a5d7141a1dc08ee976917311261b55451f89ffe58091e9f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1200,1223],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1200"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on DRX parameters of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with drx-Preference for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":1224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current drx-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including drx-Preference for the cell group and timer T346a associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346a with the timer value set to the drx-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current drx-Preference;","paragraph_zero_based":1227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":1228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":1229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxBW-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2for the cell group and timer T346b associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346b with the timer value set to the maxBW-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2;","paragraph_zero_based":1232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":1233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxCC-Preference for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":1234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxCC-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxCC-Preference for the cell group and timer T346c associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346c with the timer value set to the maxCC-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxCC-Preference;","paragraph_zero_based":1237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":1238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":1239},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxMIMO-LayerPreference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group and timer T346d associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346d with the timer value set to the maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2;","paragraph_zero_based":1242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":1243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":1244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt for the cell group and timer T346e associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346e with the timer value set to the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt;","paragraph_zero_based":1247}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4d081786cc8acdfff8aa3782e64eca1f3e7ae896dc0bad72badb9745a6b2fa2","5a2a3626229fe96a20d86b064a73cd16b0455b7729cc4b7148c65d584e2445c1","63ad51760594f4b91b6e33777b656251a23d9107165527ade606f2f7c11ca0be","281c62a99c28535a9e625ff8a3ec276f1e6279a4526072769b52059c43538d0e","6b43f416e6d4ed98cc7d1f7b54ba1b766b376e6c73a9a521180573055fece1c3","3b3268661f503b6dca200f320bab322e3bb982e3930300d8a61b3af4db092620","c41f28d6a81ef41e8e4930280e6c583ea8e1636c3c9fea3f1beccb5bb56b8108","152e2c1d7fb8ff59b6698b193800c0cf2e870bb3c0e6e618a11c4f12ac0b453b","b281807b9b9b9d6eab2db633eb2dfbc1aa4d847d3a26d777ac9da390f611422f","7a790781fa06c47f3ab9cc2fb0d0b14a32c5329a4dc331eb7ce610116a033c82","78cf06efee8d5cc2d5e6d120a17f1adeda61d0721e6cc0b15cbb0b776771c69a","75a4d5682a9ee1c1ca804cb85caac61d8dbe78e3f7a729feadbe66bd049aaf3d","270a5c3068414aa56863d5aa49ed57cf06d4bba47dec418b1a063c606c60130a","e916925aa0bb080bddb25eb700c65ae0fad92e6687e12830746a47be174d7420","c22c04b4f8c60468c25276bc031506903839b87a6870f5f52e11e1e9075bcbe6","09213fdeff79016e49a43a0368549be981a65068d675b7587ca3fc70c4a9f3b5","9e0672ebaf1364721bb03f9fcf3e6acec4ac8fba311b996762d3384bba1d809b","dfe234eed7bf1d62fd0ac5c493ab5cf64729b6fe9d87c013fd1ca32ca312bf1e","2ad60448c1618d2a1261fc3ca14dc9c292c904b94a2dee0f508259a4008738df","d9dd089ee22b0348406103210dfe6d29ed1010073e5b3696093530c56a470d2a","304d80c719980c0a06fbdb3c3c3935935bdd00f0b0dceb737b3bb7c26d9f6574","dab3891d1373f37b8d4b654c7531d3e74e7fdaaee6c952416d154980f23e6ba3","0f523a22b5af5ab78b2fafcb8713f31555807fadb09556f8fec94022e7dadf54","1ee426a5375e9b22728948d85c984595e485ab2822fa1cf6651fead05c4424b2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1224,1247],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1224"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its release preference and timer T346f is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE determines that it would prefer to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":1249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured with connectedReporting and the UE determines that it would prefer to revert an earlier indication to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state:","paragraph_zero_based":1250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346f with the timer value set to the releasePreferenceProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the release preference;","paragraph_zero_based":1252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":1253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication;","paragraph_zero_based":1254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide preference in being provisioned with reference time information:","paragraph_zero_based":1255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with referenceTimeInfoPreference since it was configured to provide preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":1256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE's preference changed from the last time UE initiated transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including referenceTimeInfoPreference:","paragraph_zero_based":1257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide preference in being provisioned with reference time information.","paragraph_zero_based":1258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on FR2 UL gap:","paragraph_zero_based":1259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with ul-GapFR2-Preference since it was configured to provide its preference on FR2 UL gap information:","paragraph_zero_based":1260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference on FR2 UL gap activation/deactivation:","paragraph_zero_based":1261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide FR2 UL gap preference;","paragraph_zero_based":1262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the current FR2 UL gap preference is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":1263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide FR2 UL gap preference.","paragraph_zero_based":1264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for leaving RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":1265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE needs to leave RRC_CONNECTED state and the timer T346g is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide MUSIM assistance information for leaving RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":1267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346g with the timer value set to the musim-LeaveWithoutResponseTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap preference:","paragraph_zero_based":1269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the MUSIM gap(s) and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-GapPreferenceList since it was configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":1270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current musim-GapPreferenceList is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-GapPreferenceList and the timer T346h is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1271}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7b2382f2edd759541fb8aaa04ee50936814862257f5ade608d7ce3918f7e8def","e5e9dcf2b0f9679d923554fa3b8ea0c83ad295a4f4036d9986b52743ea435552","3b92daa2f9f87a44a044c7bad72d5b4a67627ffa3d4d24b2de5bf8bd61f9867e","c60a42254d7fcf8a64a2e48eab0c9ed04d83f4f47d1721599a398a9f1142a5dd","878f213e4bb1efe761d4a268e8a47ae451048cec1b86a47e63cea95e885d6244","3906054c2a76e20c080e82f494b024256319418f308a5699e5347a532395317b","781d440f57aa2ca180c53d9dc91f5652455f7b74f4e1f73f0c4d6d432a420921","35994f57fd6e5f1794dbe50202ec7fda33775fb6569f83aae86dfc7230560d95","07cfb3f06ade0a114e2c2ea6cacfc69827584a77d92be4e1dfbee74613930ccc","6748ead83fcdcb365ff69a74547147bd7f79f705c81911e507ab134ab8b2b137","78ac0aeadc352b7e90b18fa0182c5a53e5a92029c5baa5d6018d87755715ea28","866401651918ce01c2f05c138488fc5dccae83b75a0959b18baa537c2aac8b97","863a59994a3ade1a3fd7cf8d402c655fae5cfbffb917b9458e7b4be6a29766e7","5c7d8b4a401df8b66c941f5d225dc1cab368864a75af9df251b34ca94fd14a70","1487a3a5cf89d58da687d6377bf4d5dbd19d08b91007863dfd374fe2e80d81a4","2512164df6ea41bfcf3e6fafd6bf77718ee457681acaec8e77eb6ffe8f21cafd","baabca6a54b6c80f47d7bfe664850b59606395fd7282b351af5b913cd013367f","f21fe7d52ccb08e8bb4109969407a62fa986fe9f4043ac791b0b550eb844d534","e77652c8595954401f1d2e42e369c4e1b58bcce9d7b22bc1025b340bc53ac78d","257ebe03248a840e44f8d7bdd7a23660636540e6bd21d5baa7fbc6356a0e4fa4","1a7435e9dfa7074efdc162f6b634a7dca7c61ee9b5ddce8faacb4858eb80de68","c5c24aead8377a132076daaf378156a7139d10b397151d2e9ec41f153c6f0277","0440881c7c7739ff06140918f7ba574f37cc96d62a4533b2055647ea88ffd2ad","91f58ea97538adf717c0a65c6d0f08a51d37d502aadb6c3f90e27efba54f9c35"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1248,1271],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1248"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current musim-GapPreferenceList;","paragraph_zero_based":1272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart the timer T346h with the timer value set to the musim-GapProhibitTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":1273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE does not need to initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message if the difference between the current musim-GapPreferenceList and the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-GapPreferenceList is only due to removal of an ended aperiodic gap.","paragraph_zero_based":1274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements of a cell group and RLM measurement of the cell group is not stopped:","paragraph_zero_based":1275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with rlm-MeasRelaxationState since it was configured to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements for the cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":1276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the relaxation state of RLM measurements for the cell group is currently different from the relaxation state reported in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including rlm-MeasRelaxationState of the cell group and timer T346j associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346j with the timer value set to the rlm-RelaxtionReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements of serving cells of a cell group and BFD measurement of the cell group is not stopped:","paragraph_zero_based":1280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with bfd-MeasRelaxationState since it was configured to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements for the cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":1281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the relaxation state of BFD measurements in any serving cell of the cell group is currently different from the relaxation state reported in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including bfd-MeasRelaxationState of the cell group and timer T346k associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":1282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346k with the timer value set to the bfd-RelaxtionReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements of serving cells of the cell group.","paragraph_zero_based":1284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers not configured for SDT becomes available during SDT (i.e. while SDT procedure is ongoing):","paragraph_zero_based":1285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with nonSDT-DataIndication since the initiation of the current resume procedure for SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":1286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide nonSDT-DataIndication.","paragraph_zero_based":1287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference for SCG deactivation and timer T346i is not running;","paragraph_zero_based":1288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE prefers the SCG to be deactivated and did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with scg-DeactivationPreference since it was configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":1289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE preference for SCG deactivation is different from the last indicated scg-DeactivationPreference:","paragraph_zero_based":1290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346i with the timer value set to the scg-DeactivationPreferenceProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":1291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the UE preference for SCG deactivation;","paragraph_zero_based":1292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SCG is deactivated, and,","paragraph_zero_based":1293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>the UE has uplink data to send for an SCG RLC entity while the UE previously did not have any uplink data to send for any SCG RLC entity:","paragraph_zero_based":1294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the UE has uplink data to send for a DRB whose DRB-Identity is not included in any RLC-BearerConfig in the CellGroupConfig associated with the MCG.","paragraph_zero_based":1295}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3b692a30bea031fc87f1fe021d6a332dc30f9d20182407e5d56d2f92cb3f7d81","0ca3fa14405fd4dabca8cdacffcddf1b45858529ff42dc6f9