{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to send indications of RRM measurement relaxation criterion fulfilment:","paragraph_zero_based":1296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the criterion in 5.7.4.4 is met for a period of TSearchDeltaP-StationaryConnected:","paragraph_zero_based":1297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as true since it was configured to provide indications of RRM measurement relaxation criterion fulfilment; or","paragraph_zero_based":1298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the last UEAssistanceInformation message indicated the criterion in 5.7.4.4 is not fulfilled with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as false:","paragraph_zero_based":1299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the criterion for RRM measurement relaxation for connected mode is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":1300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last UEAssistanceInformation message indicated fulfilment of the criterion in 5.7.4.4 with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as true:","paragraph_zero_based":1302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the criterion for RRM measurement relaxation for connected mode is not fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":1303},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s);","paragraph_zero_based":1304},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with propagationDelayDifference since it was configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s); or","paragraph_zero_based":1305},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for any neighbour cell in neighCellInfoList, if the service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and the neighbour cell has changed more than threshPropDelayDiff since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including propagationDelayDifference:","paragraph_zero_based":1306},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and each neighbour cell included in the neighCellInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":1307},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to report relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s);","paragraph_zero_based":1308},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with n3c-relayUE-InfoList since it was configured to report available relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s); or","paragraph_zero_based":1309},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has new available non-3GPP conection(s); or","paragraph_zero_based":1310},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the non-3GPP connection(s) with the reported relay UE(s) is not available: ","paragraph_zero_based":1311},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to report relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s) included in the n3c-relayUE-InfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":1312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.3Actions related to transmission of UEAssistanceInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":1316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the UEAssistanceInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide a delay budget report according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set delayBudgetReport to type1 according to a desired value;","paragraph_zero_based":1319}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fa311321df36445b819ad022489dd14df7d4596dfff24e1eed3eca8fca01db77","3a23f8836701b102bfcb3590552b5d0d39f58620f069f3a051772e036bfca31f","4d2049fe899a17668c32031e98861d62f2f39090483c0848d003d09c82e485a5","3dcfbc3d9009d5bb89c0eda9d1c37858efe764634ad466d67918b0fa97dca5c2","77288a30bf117ee96499b2362115268525f10bcc4951358c6a49428866518bdc","cf99c60b9ff2423a8098afb866aae81c11cb8bdc58df99dae38b0b7577d74849","9aaa0af36450ab1aab534162a0b4e723cacf5f490459bfbd5d027044a25690d8","38baeafcc2df2c2af692946e53a497496e75ef782eaf1aedd928dfece459cd03","a664dd8f2f2b1590af152a507af6b0b3cc733782657dd3cd1297896f9644e0bd","696141d9b8fed9ad4527ae8588289d2bfea76c4ad090589b19fcac6b80b2b2fc","5c52e27628c6db0784568451f8e25a3c37bc11699abd1f3dc6664f09a1fd7c93","9d3170bf67bbfe003d551b69bcb1c3b94329e5cfd6aaa1fbc96610be4349bcd9","31dd27edb34215d7a1284ed125d051192a2c735b96793b70ecad465f31e025d6","20732001cec323ee1d569d89e6b7df3e034b53c6a36b193ca92958e72e875cc2","1b5851c7a1f9266a1bf0e8cb7d6d51fffb6163e6e9c36fa50aa6256a3dce0dcd","9ed356a44fa8bb44571235a7866ed2560182a2e679b953df8480060fc6e51413","564c54e28bce272f1d180cc903896821db59ca3e221