{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the maximum aggregated bandwidth of FR2-2:","paragraph_zero_based":1392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxBW-FR2-2 in the MaxBW-PreferenceFR2-2 IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedBW-FR2-2-DL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE desires to have configured across all downlink carriers of FR2-2 in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedBW-FR2-2-UL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE desires to have configured across all uplink carriers of FR2-2 in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":1396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include reducedMaxBW-FR2-2 in the MaxBW-PreferenceFR2-2 IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide maxCC-Preference of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include maxCC-Preference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers for the cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":1400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include reducedMaxCCs in the MaxCC-Preference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set reducedCCsDL to the number of maximum SCells the UE desires to have configured in downlink in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set reducedCCsUL to the number of maximum SCells the UE desires to have configured in uplink in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":1404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include reducedMaxCCs in the MaxCC-Preference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE can implicitly indicate a preference for NR SCG release by reporting the maximum aggregated bandwidth preference for power saving of the cell group, if configured, as zero for both FR1 and FR2, and by reporting the maximum number of secondary component carriers for power saving of the cell group, if configured, as zero for both uplink and downlink.","paragraph_zero_based":1406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide maxMIMO-LayerPreference of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include maxMIMO-LayerPreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":1409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR1:","paragraph_zero_based":1410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR1 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR1-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR1-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-1:","paragraph_zero_based":1414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1415}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["933fa397554bbc1d3d9a65e33454770a200607aa5e291221e976ed131a3254b3","ad2ea8dde4f74744a8b6c10a5952bab3eeee3f8ad778389ec7b5e010a214d83c","34f6957c23f6b04d735090437dcfd0e3b051ae9f671dcade4acd1a0209827de7","44ae6ce40a15093b1a8ed2deb740389eec7def8d1412366078526431afc47767","4d71690cace34596d17bbd7e5fac746a0e46f2c7946b833d79a455f93a899d3c","994b60b37f00fad13bc1ab993b4caec2a8d5cc7a7793358f2862011856cdb155","5055c1cb050ec1b6cc02f1b9ffccea55a73477523cc0d83a26c2fa6d6b584a2f","7e073ee5c08eb03c987a7a3686b8ab7091102189a71672f87f5715dec0bc7f20","84970884ef00eaf266e27ab0276c82683e3caf5b8747860f27ea55b275e39126","a04ec43292f55bf52dececc282ee84d416f5e0f3779ff7401a7fbf01bc65ba89","ec6ec737b148912f25b76cfaf5a7f5ce0f05d3fb922ffa0c9c751df5be2c6469","0a308f1444be2afd38b0e8993d94c3f4b0522cb1e6e12917235e94dae86c1868","b070e01026cfb59425ec74032a37c817385c1280574b4e87dc764142efe8a8f5","6ed92d618932aad52f77a8d0869ed6874ec878d65194488c5ff25bf8b20338ae","f5ab71a7aa1bb8ec624be2a67ef86219a4dd6f12f7a7c2990f377a5072491018","6885e7d0e46a6722e54a07101798c24840e8ae38921b83735dfcc14838425404","68e4ce39adc46c62d6b0655f7a0057487448eb76ac7f753128cb5b4eb752f8e9","67be14331b6aba1c8213212ee5fe5d8705a7a301738ffa9201f69cc4b3f7f9aa","31b7e7d00d98c6ff3f5e458ba8ec09119c7e770dda1396cffcd8ee7c22ba5379","55f8f448d780ae449eca248cd6f054396281f83ec2c684e9b216cc9f24976551","a42f1b72ee02b663696cb47db3d57439833c9eb2ca92015b9c043e3c83a343e3","2f6b285bf0c46933c8c70a69e0f5bbf01e107551788be554e16e22757f038fd1","5708e9efde40707ea216a02b4fb288583e5e16fcf9e572744d0f284a22e10306","8bead6b8e70dd4c02e34a6819cca83284c12fd723a1b356577d90af2941056a0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1392,1415],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1392"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR2-1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR2-1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":1418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR1 and reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide maxMIMO LayerPreferenceFR2 2 of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group for FR2-2:","paragraph_zero_based":1422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2 2:","paragraph_zero_based":1423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2-2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2 2 IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-2-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR2-2 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-2-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR2-2 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":1426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":1427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2-2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide minSchedulingOffsetPreference of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include minSchedulingOffsetPreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for the cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":1431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 (TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.1) for cross-slot scheduling with 15 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-15kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":1433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 for cross-slot scheduling with 30 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-30kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":1435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 for cross-slot scheduling with 60 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-60kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":1437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 for cross-slot scheduling with 120 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-120kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":1439}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6064fc68621b09208f18c5c9d610f5d3be599e0927d7e92de842c05e32622b1e","a7854c2c2d5797c44ac4b86b99762e88d7001d465197c297e9be9a4d5ec280e4","6dab3f6a2929a8a4381001b80c9c71dcdf96f6bd147250ee0746eda0465d146e","e025b7afb0e250bff3900c1eca592a6c5283e73a0cf3aec1739033c318a35eda","07a958456bfe15dd3c42dbf221a4af895bf3ae24be0f719235f51afe74c58712","36d332ed50d37f9eddf0178941e7323c73f7ae70708d430497d498813aaa03da","defdbd6e267c8acb48118570a1e82e97fa4958789c4efa053e684444010dd20e","8c8605ed44a26c922dd57d987305425f2bc27517451415338db837e90dfb6c1e","84a1c89d5ae65d6df9fad3e5fec91a2d86ece4f00768e042046ac3dae4e689fa","b44b2e60f995f979407d411103be56817edc23b8c63b9b6a124f8c9b6dab8c83","b88ff31adfd3de9ceb7c3f6eb03a0bb6c3f08d8920d248d77fd3280126dcea39","2d2083434a85488f147a9b1102f9160342a8b3577f21f70427c0fd94210b9ee5","fe05b0f3c269d442d2cddc0908a9db3461a10aed6b8a47baddd2dc856ad8cb16","ee76ff4af5b7f1533ad2ff7e0cbb4cdb4957a8e0e026e76dc87530d48767e0a6","b17b4b63645b3545f6b86c306de8ce96254312c5070372faa4c7dcc089733203","7436befabc6dc5bbd32fcf78eb677ca94e7b57f5435c20e92ee10d21b141d183","d3dea19b2466fbab646ff20a7fd5f15be90fcc0728077e5dc685f1538b514c6b","deea74b53885517a035a7db56c38599954ba086cddb5920092e4a4027799b3d2","6f130dfc0bd71cd7b41c0727610a4ec3c98364bef0b1023090672b4528054ae2","21de494957595d894cdfc2510f0a4b129b7bb654268064d94b0d1ec293d1e30c","24617beff1e731d785966bcd917dd375b40d27040363ff5d546159f199179dda","44918f6cf4222aafc37ea8ee55cc791a7472cd1bf7110bab0ab5bf79ff0cd55a","2eb0f413ebac6f982fbe7d063892cb48b9eebc96c8991dfe45f3f94c067acdeb","f377508596c04e2e209a615cd68fbaa1f8f2cbab976df8459c746a7d10bb0e33"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1416,1439],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1416"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K2 (TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1.2.1) for cross-slot scheduling with 15 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK2-SCS-15kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K2;","paragraph_zero_based":1441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K2 for cross-slot scheduling with 30 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK2-SCS-30kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K2;","paragraph_zero_based":1443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K2 for cross-slot scheduling with 60 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK2-SCS-60kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K2;","paragraph_zero_based":1445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K2 for cross-slot scheduling with 120 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK2-SCS-120kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K2;","paragraph_zero_based":1447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":1448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include preferredK0 and preferredK2 in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for the cell group for FR2-2:","paragraph_zero_based":1452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 (TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.1) for cross-slot scheduling with 480 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include preferredK0-SCS-480kHz in the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":1455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 for cross-slot scheduling with 960 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include preferredK0-SCS-960kHz in the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":1457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a preference for the value of K2 for cross-slot scheduling with 480 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include preferredK2-SCS-480kHz in the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt IE and set it to the desired value of K2;","paragraph_zero_based":1459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a preference for the value of K2 for cross-slot scheduling with 960 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":1460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include preferredK2-SCS-960kHz in the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt IE and set it to the desired value of K2;","paragraph_zero_based":1461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (if the UE has no preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":1462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>do not include preferredK0 and preferredK2 in the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1463}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["667b3a27585d8812b0c42a38ee769be8b110bc78da37e13fe41a8220824179e9","0f3878874a490d939ce19b2a21756a21848f715b4d295188a1f80429593f6229","27d8d125dfeb2c7b029067881feabb9b332266f1136df08b3ba2c3d9ab9b9493","12da885509ea9a2f1bcecc1e49e374c1462e878059b166845d74f2f47aa7195b","e0a83a16e55ba92222c7aa0191afebfc503c31857f533f83c1fa6e28a176d782","2e1e31c5a8f1788b6f9cce6c3c36c73310ec086785d997c271b82940df3b15d1","bf6b5837b0ef06744a079bf36ac6216e9b3c140f3d5085b7fa489af535998806","5aba783afb4a086192fdbb8e9cc63e0767ea22cceaedd151578b09563f1e5705","fffb5aded6756b6e51728c91fde7277f0a0426d0402a2cc657fbab7fb5f0fc2b","c5f1d634cec744f3c103434402bb02d5c225446176094b1a17e46d208d48a230","afbfcbd120d1b397a8994d01524025f18ee21ff85763393e9b74745bec27c866","27fa9c77f422ffe74ab1bdf3f8385dc11093718ab96a1cda992933e147c60031","79ffeb781d5b794a47b6fdeafd7f317c6432ea75eb4dbf6bdd8d82906846a63d","3405f7450a4757220c21895276c4b57faec86130dab493baafc7cc8e66907075","7d3daeebb089026505aa81290560732a9c3b751121f5e03ff945c52694adfdf0","d72ce461149453d6a238fb0400a25c1cd605adde9eccee2fdc29221864afbaf1","af571c69b921955fd8efeb8265f843657f6398b733ec291ab519949c8136a114","f1b8d061d2ef2ac8b8d6dbd895b7f22a2e02c290774e40efaf5dfa7852a2f099","3a1def822fb5c81de8bbef4d93c680b4b9ef91aeb6d67bcdfafe1d1a4db117f9","d96ced328d08e82994548f279947286a9576a4dd36e7e479074fa91ff5babf31","9bb7f97eedb549e3292e63f6a50667307780a7ef465c81f167f6706b6896dca1","87c9609eaf096dffb3e128dca580505d2544c3e0f24f524a0850a751896c921a","e459fe33b8b1da15198e3934825df265602e9d72d5cf06d1c6766e23942ded48","59a10780901ddc0a7588d24a9953513f38bfc53ad811604e95aceb787ecf3842"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1440,1463],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1440"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide a release preference according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include releasePreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set preferredRRC-State to the desired RRC state on transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide an indication of preference in being provisioned with reference time information according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference in being provisioned with reference time information:","paragraph_zero_based":1468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set referenceTimeInfoPreference to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set referenceTimeInfoPreference to false.","paragraph_zero_based":1471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide preference on FR2 UL gap according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference for FR2 UL gap configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":1473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set ul-GapFR2-PatternPreference to the preferred FR2 UL gap pattern;","paragraph_zero_based":1474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference for the FR2 UL gap configuration):","paragraph_zero_based":1475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include ul-GapFR2-PatternPreference in the UL-GapFR2-Preference IE.","paragraph_zero_based":1476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide MUSIM assistance information according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":1477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference for MUSIM periodic gap(s):","paragraph_zero_based":1478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include musim-GapPreferenceList with an entry for each periodic gap the UE prefers to be configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set musim-GapLength and musim-GapRepetitionAndOffset in the musim-GapInfo IE to the values of the length and the repetition/offset of the gap(s), respectively, the UE prefers to be configured with;","paragraph_zero_based":1480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference for MUSIM aperiodic gap:","paragraph_zero_based":1481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the field musim-GapPreferenceList, with one entry for the aperiodic gap the UE prefers to be configured;","paragraph_zero_based":1482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include musim-GapLength in the musim-GapInfo IE and set it to the values of the length of the gap the UE prefers to be configured with;","paragraph_zero_based":1483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>optionally include musim-Starting-SFN-AndSubframe in the musim-GapInfo IE and set it to the starting SFN/subframe of the gap the UE prefers to be configured with;","paragraph_zero_based":1484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has no longer preference for the periodic/aperiodic gaps:","paragraph_zero_based":1485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include musim-GapPreferenceList in the musim-Assistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":1486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE has a preference to leave RRC_CONNECTED state:","paragraph_zero_based":1487}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["76d2d98c5847a226af5e7cdeab81f106797d206650f767b512b9d60b97de5d8b","588032e586f26d0a08f8455e83c1f2dba3ae15ae3e7472895f7762bc1fb0a46d","d66ba2af01fe207e06e5046625b0c10fe1719e34dc02b507a57e39984143c7d2","59872b38fe0ed5d2df9e3b28b3f081111dc582810d2e55e7cd3992eedcc704a9","c717684eec3a077df1f269e2b2cf773ea7fa28ce9cc34bc8dc04835f07e416e5","360f9072eb1e14e2bc890ef243db509eaeb746b58c588cea8f30a012a2bf4f84","cf99c60b9ff2423a8098afb866aae81c11cb8bdc58df99dae38b0b7577d74849","f8e8fc45a3b460907c80a25afdb5ee3a367175d43b1b2894981f188bdc625a05","4320df05dd42efe57407831ec50d9cc89df108acf7e065cc63b57dbf8262540c","a56fc3870c92c5e6e0499483d4e84146cee1502669eb0e2c28213c42bff57ffe","cf3a8ff352d4ba1303c2c741b1ebaf686c81f0b5a92e5ab8582767e1c5544786","641106c23dcb9087227da1212602c401296eaf91a9cc44ee5da09190ac6b44db","38419b22c5492717e5a02e1c4d9be6c21d1197124b83aed1d4c026b75a0de1b9","dbb026abe0f5fab2d93d0f90f7bf555186b9a1bba8389631b8474ad62d7e2877","ef9240e777b76aef07a19940e90b6c34e645c2d3ecf39e8609a0b3b1ac53c73c","cfacc3059cdd2e17ef566bd229f6ccbb30c7ab325adf9b315910ade3812f40fd","27ced9d97b25fabae4dc2989a54787328be6388383d090ab69ed65427e73c9fa","27a56512f08dfd6974cc7180a87d3f285c82d029e5466f67a8db9be74e3a3475","0978cd0d9987afad38bc06ae4c4f561547510f09136e8104623830fe0c77ecf9","5cf6d3ab1dc7ed03286f44a8fca8d1720017ec16b46fa00f7d3c080e0635d8e8","0b81abb0b1df08a568af93f8ef9929e98bb46eaa4e4667f73e6b6efb00231c7e","e6c7b806c7403c6c6ba97743ac20f66a26531443916c604ba523228187ed5e77","28d6d342383ca03a5850247c15bae2eb3d62f2874f86a72e3003a951e82c72a2","d8bd4db551a6dd471c3d1d5856483b477e9576f0463aa44450cb18d25baa8366"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1464,1487],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1464"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set musim-PreferredRRC-State to the preferred RRC state.","paragraph_zero_based":1488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements of a cell group according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE performs RLM measurement relaxation on the cell group according to TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":1490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rlm-MeasRelaxationState to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rlm-MeasRelaxationState to false;","paragraph_zero_based":1493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements of a cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":1494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each serving cell of the cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":1495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE performs BFD measurement relaxation on this serving cell according to TS 38.133 [14]:","paragraph_zero_based":1496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the n-th bit of bfd-MeasRelaxationState to '1', where n is equal to the servCellIndex value + 1 of the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":1497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the n-th bit of bfd-MeasRelaxationState to '0', where n is equal to the servCellIndex value + 1 of the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":1499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to indicate availability of data mapped to radio bearers not configured for SDT according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the nonSDT-DataIndication in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include and set the resumeCause according to the information received from the upper layers, if provided.","paragraph_zero_based":1502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide an indication of preference for SCG deactivation according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1503},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include scg-DeactivationPreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the scg-DeactivationPreference to scgDeactivationPreferred if the UE prefers the SCG to be deactivated, otherwise set it to noPreference;","paragraph_zero_based":1505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide an indication that the UE has uplink data related to a deactivated SCG according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include uplinkData in the UEAssistanceInformation message.","paragraph_zero_based":1507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide an indication about whether the criterion for RRM relaxation for connected mode is fulfilled or not fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":1508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the criterion for RRM measurement relaxation for connected mode is fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":1509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment to true;","paragraph_zero_based":1510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1511}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["955c5dfafe69f0579a48353f3e780f0bcf5aa827eaf7916964081ab684e91edb","4c16c6a3c99c28335206e11aab56d426fb64ee766a80abc09bdfa4bc7c929cca","e9804d76ffde9fff420274dcd302fe4f50f9becff734ec5d7c68a8d30913554f","ca0cb21829cf5f9813f64f83eb20c6d599b28fe6167acec54fe795bf7416e78c","242420ea68aa39a35e938e15a1614079d45529e7d550ad95f3e287786f0d2f94","9294ef710a219190f1f0614b0f4d4766082fd8f9614b9616c020b5dd75c74e4a","19aaf5525656e5d1966263b34807420d0800a089974c3131ace0ae357f0eba05","58e2d2deda2c155f901e128d592c0960587e866c7262355af0c033635bda92f0","2ed7a3f98dbd22a3d81c4b133ac988c90cedba32bc2c8fd863a822fd2ba42871","c266a5b6ef88b8f86569d460d6db69b671ee3671d481f50c9fd025a5eda8f648","a566961ba04bf2d27ede7a1a0c995e3406737b0ca0f64d3d4a3bed4958ebdb81","7c612b8e651c059d7f6e521e92337b6143367125224b6052e264ab8dea064d10","03a233a03d2efe0bd3015ce0571b35ec6dc80378c2fe129a884fb166fe69e34d","e36d92f8ccdf83eb22e38455906473806d18ef8ad9344013d119571f3b5e07d1","4a105641989de031d512907bf03dee045f8fd6b2b5359f972484632a73e2d86e","3d5c818df969d35ca85e9aebda045196d88862fd3847b40bef2869fe9688f6da","794f8935cb1bb304263e483c785fc0cbee04823b71d1675849302bd4184e70a8","6f3e82de2c50114cbf0cc0e0ad41c18d72d14cb914646df384b8e9631f6dfa24","23c2d095a5ab378b1b97bb560b9fcdc51ee975608e7c56082d73b5653759f70f","b73a8c168dbb76df12907fad4f7bdc4ac8e0901a7a9d1cb560382220b2a12b5f","251455be3c4e368ff44c59a795f9882edb2fc834c1544d3ac52435ef92cd1a9c","c77ed86c13f3afbc047cff3c06510bd0e0c985ccd905ca837728c64fcf3f46fa","28b9261dbfe86a286d8df0df69a37ab8461c95438d438be6889688cb013bfc63","242420ea68aa39a35e938e15a1614079d45529e7d550ad95f3e287786f0d2f94"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1488,1511],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1488"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment to false.","paragraph_zero_based":1512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide the service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) according to 5.7.4.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the propagationDelayDifference for each neighbour cell in the neighCellInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":1514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to report relay UE information with non-3GPP connection(s) according to 5.7.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":1515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include n3c-relayUE-InfoList in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":1516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the UEAssistanceInformation message for configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":1517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":1518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the sl-UE-AssistanceInformationNR;","paragraph_zero_based":1519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:It is up to UE implementation when and how to trigger configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":1520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure was triggered to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication by an NR RRCReconfiguration message that was embedded within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEAssistanceInformation to lower layers via SRB1, embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferIRAT as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.6.28;","paragraph_zero_based":1523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the procedure was triggered to provide UE preference for SCG deactivation or to indicate that the UE with a deactivate SCG has uplink data to send on a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":1524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEAssistanceInformation via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in (NG)EN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":1526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB3 is configured and the SCG is not deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":1527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via the E-UTRA MCG embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":1530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":1531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE assistance configuration that triggered this UE assistance information is associated with the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":1532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SRB3 is configured and the SCG is not deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":1533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1535}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["27cc932f41ce58714d358c009637f1baa433c94a376eef2a810ba89db7e3d521","c872309dee9f490c9e8dc645aaf051c99868a5817a86692c051168aa929654a8","239b26f85dde4e62d0b0e9b889f2f44f0a62788e97cabd0fd626d0c22bba1a19","1d0ea3693e68ca6451deefcefbd0dace77e88cb1d4779713f3e43e6e66c181de","b6eb19425867c2992bc950d92d2b061d0374d6f165ae8bc2035101bd1ca5063b","fd120722ff71d0ae9b892ef6107400462572f86b72c3ca27c99d7138be6da229","515eadefe1187f3392f6638e5856ae1f070aa6fd4842ac96a460c8671b4c645b","7f92fe92d26b89ca7b6e7820e61bf669183b77487a89e2e76ad0eda24b6dc23c","ed031a8e0bd5595cd1a1f42dc245e11ad2a5d614bfd2dc62a6e5f796f1444b19","c8ee6f862c9ec1ed98ec0e6897c2275b5d57a70db06d2284b18a50084af84930","24c8049e4f2964c32abe26fb7868abae6a21e578514fd86be4f98478e9d3e286","4b02d23c84720f0a7d3f16c771789b82190a96f5ce30aa21ed96fbc0dd237ecc","d25ace94178cfa53d629144b2c7997cfe57eccff847eb085c7880b730eec81eb","0f5b725f3451481614cfc96c8d94d24acdf32b6b6dce2b4c6304898cf2b7d29d","dc29be5bd76c0b32bc1ff90bc618ca8bb448d5131d48898286967529b0584192","7c9a1968229509939990e3d5adda97d01fb9619432a7d416f04f174b15c1a6ca","f7dec8ee8cb276aa97d18ffd637a6cf92656cae6f821b813200dbe464d1b5eec","242420ea68aa39a35e938e15a1614079d45529e7d550ad95f3e287786f0d2f94","a38cfea0ac91cbd8321ae7db0563f99b751766ebd8ebf6f25b6c9bcdfc14d05d","fe0c9ca4fe5f9f91e7055ecde3c01121153e14bbe188fff6012ce52493f08724","781ed601f33a64e993023432145d60f4d921b78bb40b349d679ef9db756f654f","f446bfec16ea7aff43f15a5e04ea777669c0e288bbcad7c8533788aeb146ee2a","ef9408dee219d29b868f547e2a770aa50b7ab5907d8f548a3621a024c546e256","a566961ba04bf2d27ede7a1a0c995e3406737b0ca0f64d3d4a3bed4958ebdb81"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1512,1535],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1512"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via the NR MCG embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in 5.7.2a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message via SRB1 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEAssistanceInformation message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":1540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.2Actions related to transmission of RemoteUEInformationSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":1543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When entering RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, or upon change in any of the information in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink while in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has SIB request information to provide (e.g. the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1 and the requested SIB has not been indicated in RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before):","paragraph_zero_based":1545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include sl-RequestedSIB-List in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":1546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has paging related information to provide (e.g. the UE has not sent sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE in the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to the L2 U2N Relay UE before), set sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":1547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the L2 U2N Remote UE is in RRC_IDLE:","paragraph_zero_based":1548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include ng-5G-S-TMSI in the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":1549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE specific DRX cycle is configured by upper layer, set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the value of UE specific Uu DRX cycle configured by upper layer;","paragraph_zero_based":1550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the L2 U2N Remote UE is in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":1551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include ng-5G-S-TMSI and fullI-RNTI in the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":1552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE specific DRX cycle is configured by upper layer,","paragraph_zero_based":1553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the minimum value of UE specific Uu DRX cycles (configured by upper layer and configured by RRC);","paragraph_zero_based":1554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE to the value of UE specific DRX cycle configured by RRC;","paragraph_zero_based":1556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When entering RRC_CONNECTED, if L2 U2N remote UE had sent sl-RequestedSIB-List and/or sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE, the L2 U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-RequestedSIB-List to the value release if requested before;","paragraph_zero_based":1559}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4dcf9ab2191f5e2fabdcde0f5774d9083d5a4f8a767421f2af010d8af18a34b","816f9e90d43f5a707dea46b613073f997326d6c6022f8f5cfa25008c972ad872","753150011f3529ef7272cbe82df211a39bc76b9209b08a34a1489d27d2f57f63","8e3c609ea258833fe910e311911e0f9ebea64caa61f231d4bed08040957af885","8ac90979dd068f4209139b3a683c44330f6c7cb5185f47decf8f8fac211f7047","c7456771d40d2c468e41b7f1608ef099b391740a9c89e8cf300525e0179d2f6a","040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","c48731fdd6c290fbc2ef827466f717abaa06c7e1c7c1bb3ecbfe2decce349542","5763e150de35ca4a293d0ba12d6e0888cd6ef28ab5c3d28499221feb54b23e70","80a2054a9ab09fd822041a0e68d821490a152daa13437a30534d87f3cf7b0797","0c866de2d1371af926008b9d1cbc4159affbc80e5f2a718ae1fc944d7e6be9a8","3a1d23e89dbd37296f4505daa1fad2394785669f7f93a1b0ec27b49cd9242c72","ebfa9435bb8868fa3030837c9c7bdfdc6656f0ae80aded1748e345f288082d2d","224dcd742db778784ae0c942186702472017ca10433ed61082613f407aa3acbd","e03b3f75fe375726c02c7f7c0b5b05264c27aec8c4522746f99cd3a03fc0ce0f","96bcd28482720d63f4dadf2e9da6fec9ed583fa5856d143621796005c4c04fdd","e868ddb03000e245f27127d369c96c4a8811369c45527e1d0a1a777d338f3b69","c175f9c1f57b591089c1a17fcb2289e85f9539411f36ee177aea698712ed2a3b","e063b6604c45037f6d13120b1fcfd5acd2cb1655b2af844670401b787d247c4b","350e9592229b65e9dd34efcce917064b0034d68bb51c15e1daf698d90fb05de9","a7ab3472b20d989ab17379398f909b3c5af23300af01376737ef06c8c0f65d05","25e88ca0be118d39f98c0e4bd09af10e94c96d2b6bc60c963ae20c2d69fb2a81","bdcd4a9af17a692f518f45933c05e64b6f54a63e593f31a4d3eb8365eee58ab6","be6c53134407ba0f48c3c66de5117b7e3cddf24ed5cddacfcfb9da72e69b1179"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[1536,1559],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p1536"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE to the value release if sent before;","paragraph_zero_based":1560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RemoteUEInformationSidelink message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":1561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is configured with sl-IndirectPathAddChange set to setup, and not configured with split SRB1 with duplication:","paragraph_zero_based":1563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include connectionForMP;","paragraph_zero_based":1564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor’s Note: FFS whether there is other conditions to include the new indication, e.g. explicit NW indication, or RRC state of the L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":1565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.8.3Reception of RemoteUEInformationSidelink message by the L2 U2N Relay UE","paragraph_zero_based":1569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE:","paragraph_zero_based":1571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED on an active BWP with common search space configured including pagingSearchSpace; or","paragraph_zero_based":1572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":1573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>monitor the Paging message at the L2 U2N Remote UE's paging occasion calculated according to sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE and sl-PagingCycleRemoteUE included in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":1575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":1576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop monitoring the Paging message at the L2 U2N Remote UE's paging occasion;","paragraph_zero_based":1577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the received paging information in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":1578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED on an active BWP without pagingSearchSpace configured):","paragraph_zero_based":1579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the received sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE in SidelinkUEInformationNR message and perform Sidelink UE information transmission in accordance with 5.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (the sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE is set to release):","paragraph_zero_based":1582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to release the sl-PagingIdentityRemoteUE in SidelinkUEInformationNR message in accordance with 5.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1583}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0dbb41fdbf90e7cf3ef261e4c983632c33d96a63b75eb35cbe3a128141279dfa","63374b61216d98a2bba98b5af8b038df77cc6a8aa69b76069b449b10352c70e9","576538e8