{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the received paging information in sl-PagingInfo-RemoteUE;","paragraph_zero_based":1584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the sl-RequestedSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":1585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedSIB-List is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the L2 U2N Relay UE has not stored a valid version of SIB(s) indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":1587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform acquisition of the system information indicated in sl-RequestedSIB-List in accordance with 5.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the Uu message transfer procedure in accordance with 5.8.9.9;","paragraph_zero_based":1589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sl-RequestedSIB-List is set to release:","paragraph_zero_based":1590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release received SIB request in sl-RequestedSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":1591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RemoteUEInformationSidelink includes the connectionForMP:","paragraph_zero_based":1592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the L2 U2N Relay UE is in RRC_IDLE:","paragraph_zero_based":1593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate an RRC connection establishment as specified in 5.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the L2 U2N Relay UE is in RRC_INACTIVE:","paragraph_zero_based":1595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate an RRC connection resume as specified in 5.3.13;","paragraph_zero_based":1596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1599},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.9.10.4Actions related to reception of NotificationMessageSidelink message","paragraph_zero_based":1600},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the NotificationMessageSidelink, the U2N Remote UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1601},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the indicationType is included:","paragraph_zero_based":1602},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":1603},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if MP is configured and MCG transmission (i.e. direct path) is not suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":1604},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> initiate the indirect path failure information procedure as specified in 5. 7. 3c to report indirect path failure;","paragraph_zero_based":1605},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if T301 is not running: ","paragraph_zero_based":1606},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> initiate the RRC connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":1607}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d7744f81ae5b79b9466e0e29863f55ee527a85b179047f5149c615196234bdad","252961ab5bf17134802ed037a7879a6e84417e45e17596eee162d472178a548f","09bb5f5d39218c295a57b0097e611cc0e05d4e00aea6b9dba65e274d0ed3dff1","6728bd7d669c033df0244e074d5e3156788a8430b7c907f522e40726fe025a45","b0c3d86a0848dc99c24b507e06a9868ddf18ab9feb516b238083b91b1e4add20","dba7a7f661336f69901337b60d083994c37a319be5a610e551b29b774e9b5251","713c4e835d129611d058dd71f32a83a051c623c9275a9210cde8a515d40371f6","71d10ae8179b73cc2cc1e1a00a376caaeea91704c742d86c60f0cd1ae1641