{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (the UE is L3 U2N Remote UE, or L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE):","paragraph_zero_based":1608},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":1609},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":1610},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":1611},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is L2 U2N Remote UE and the indicationType is relayUE-HO or relayUE-CellReselection:","paragraph_zero_based":1612},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider cell re-selection occurs;","paragraph_zero_based":1613},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For L3 U2N Remote UE, or L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE, it is up to Remote UE implementation whether to release or keep the PC5 unicast link.","paragraph_zero_based":1614},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The L2 U2N Remote UE may ignore the NotificationMessageSidelink if it does not release the PC5 unicast link in source side yet during an indirect-to-direct path switch, i.e. T304 is running.","paragraph_zero_based":1615},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1616},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1617},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1618},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1619},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1620},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1621},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1622},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1623},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":1624},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6.2.1General message structure","paragraph_zero_based":1625},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"<Omit unrelated part>","paragraph_zero_based":1626},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":1627},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–UL-DCCH-Message","paragraph_zero_based":1628},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UL-DCCH-Message class is the set of RRC messages that may be sent from the UE to the network on the uplink DCCH logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":1629},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":1630},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-UL-DCCH-MESSAGE-START","paragraph_zero_based":1631}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3803e464121c62b24e87c93fe8b7c15e0c1a5946153208433153b904dc92f4e5","12f65d730bbcb36d39528f954132c09c0900033130763f28df7e73a4276cee03","a4dfd9cd2395f0627b0ea11d0d1a7958782a28aea2bf4fc690e443514f074c21","c576c6368fe23f3ab9cbe280ecfbba0b3e7cfd08e620a354504041efa93c3938","d62b0854cd16db1e721a84ceba54cd8a8bbc1b2008a0d7adc68aeccdcbf9949d","8e8c817118dffb14b8b54e6cfc308b1414421ba6598fb82d1c334e8bc58b0fb5","6e04585cd1943becb13d8d2f8434cbde15e65133b4ccd0ef268c0a5ebf0e02a3","01a8b37285b5d952ce017fa1f23a06096c3bf4910d38aaef1e188b5fe9b4257f","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","040b9cbd34aa85f040c03f4531c5b0d43c454fb60b9c92d44e6dd8dba1f93142","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b175657ff418bc552d71bcba67378a39a42d","94676ff3ad221721391c2caafe42b17565