leasing scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig during RRC connection re-establishment/resume or upon receiving scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig set to release.","paragraph_zero_based":3111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":3112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346j (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":3113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":3114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":3115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":3116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346k (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":3117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":3118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":3119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9dc0cf0c6b90a8ef000d343493adf1a234dcc0e576a7f062c66cfdd85535c357","e0e1fffaf69198e9d8bce6e9b0be753a7feffbbc9b8191c776f7502b3663c0b9","367d1fb86bf0b5e8b3d17fa3d648c8e1e1a793ba9ef7bd228da84076b27ab685","c7f455b9e211e4d99a60cdd47ccf3521a