{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":3120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T350","paragraph_zero_based":3121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting DedicatedSIBRequest message with requestedSIB-List and/or  requestedPosSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":3122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the requested SIB(s) or posSIB(s), upon releasing onDemandSIB-Request during the connection re-establishment procedures, upon receiving onDemandSIB-Request set to release, upon reception of RRCRelease or upon successful change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":3123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action","paragraph_zero_based":3124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T380","paragraph_zero_based":3125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of t380 in RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":3126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCResume, RRCSetup or RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":3127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.13.","paragraph_zero_based":3128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T390","paragraph_zero_based":3129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When access attempt is barred at access barring check for an Access Category. The UE maintains one instance of this timer per Access Category.","paragraph_zero_based":3130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon cell (re)selection, upon relay (re)selection, upon entering RRC_CONNECTED, upon reception of RRCReconfiguration including reconfigurationWithSync, upon change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED, upon reception of MobilityFromNRCommand, or upon reception of RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":3131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":3132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T400","paragraph_zero_based":3133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of RRCReconfigurationSidelink","paragraph_zero_based":3134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink or RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink","paragraph_zero_based":3135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the Sidelink radio link failure related actions as specified in 5.8.9.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T420","paragraph_zero_based":3137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of the RRCReconfiguration message including sl-PathSwitchConfig","paragraph_zero_based":3138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE)","paragraph_zero_based":3139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the RRC re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7.","paragraph_zero_based":3140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T430","paragraph_zero_based":3141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Start or restart from the subframe indicated by epochTime upon reception of SIB19, or upon reception of RRCReconfiguration message for the target cell including reconfigurationWithSync, or upon conditional reconfiguration execution i.e. when applying a stored RRCReconfiguration message for the target cell including reconfigurationWithSync.","paragraph_zero_based":3142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Stop T430, if it is running, for the source cell upon reception of RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync, or upon conditional reconfiguration execution i.e. when applying a stored RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync.","paragraph_zero_based":3143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9dc0cf0c6b90a8ef000d343493adf1a234dcc0e576a7f062c66cfdd85535c357","019ebc35eff40a3998de5711e810bcfdb86bf527a81c79279661d99ba91b3f20","77639cd08914e343d86df9a2317521226cb775b6a39e5c240f9bb102b6980f3b","301cb989288bfb7594711d255559925a5cfd26499a28c3fe34c55944355f4fd9","f8687630b39816c9aeae4456ed64447e8d7cc42153cfc189c9b93c5d99489859","1c5a4d2c71dbbcdcdb7fe8003e44cc192482db63ba53c01a8f7397eea4022eb1","99e0bbf1ac8deae1fa3dd0f5e7b21de67e288a772613ee6c3457912c9bd61459","9cd8a328ff4f01d480a9e0aa61b06f98312789cfd714e545be8214ae4820ce14","82325cb4a0cb1701311c047d08546d66b7bea39cebacee94c9cce3fc328d479c","764d36058b2ffb23c7870866a67ff4b120d47111437561b7cead36e362bdb137","0f2fa2ac5783a00dc78f968e489eb7e9d416ff6f6b5679be77611c382243baee","c51dd15ffa899fcc951abe247376f2ee533794cb3b1a2474e9fbaa2b5cd8b0db","d23adea1c82c99c5fd73307cbcc45a068a9a20af3e2a0a216928f116a23ccf82","13510c1c61f614123c9fffcb99c3f7d9f538fb8944c507e0835fa7e46019049f","2e247cb8e0ad818695718606a865612e2a9785f0745e5f95d2191b384f9c7953","f73ccd118e3e006b49bd29859a0a75097a33095e7e6637c8593755723618e70d","87a41cbc0ecb258f95ce8ac6898bfc78891e35a6676d7005ae64258ebf82b38e","fcd304a799c415f1c580586cbbaf7b53b64007dbff09da89d67625f8800aeb07","f9dc8832efa063d0c78e2155b9fac823f44e6b9bc95dfa620e29802aec2be6c2","c9d7dd4cfe1f1d3ea350968fd0fdbc8f860be4f70ca49c24244b51ded4d7bee2","e9e4a631c9b523c834f4d018f83b78b7c12b3d27777223e7112b9ad91fe8937a","3897c73b5cef5de287e97231ed817bc119867ca8745ce75e3332b83741034c15","69828ba34dc0b226890162aa6f71323e8cc2246e68d59adbcd4746c7a1fda2d0","033250470d42799afa30381962d1709c789243509407ed53885762fbd85e5b2c"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3120,3143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx:p3120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2311970.zip::R2-2311970 Introduction of Rel-18 Multi-path.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.2.2.6.","paragraph_zero_based":3144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T4xx","paragraph_zero_based":3145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of the RRCReconfiguration message including sl-PathAddChange","paragraph_zero_based":3146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon successfully sending RRCReconfigurationComplete message (i.e., PC5 RLC acknowledgement is received from target L2 U2N Relay UE) if split SRB1 with duplication is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor’s Note:FFS the stop condition for other cases, i.e. PC5-RRC trigger, CONNECTED relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the Failure Information Reporting as specified in xxx.","paragraph_zero_based":3149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor’s Note: FFS which message for indirect path failure.","paragraph_zero_based":3150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":3152}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"cfd1aef054dea290a9770e5c2de1b12f4cc7358b773882ae43663cec7a0c7249","original_member_sha256":"eb486990e07cad7e16d78b726e76051d7652abe5c7bb2e34c237c431cbcb3180","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dbf7eba41eaa8248fc30d2d075fe019c9d383fd84e405795cea0c9540d1c169f","15fbead7660fca8339d6b59df691bcbeaceb8c6deb3c27bbce23d96c8f660048","a77bcf1544eb1d8538c7a8882d65cb9dfa66affbfdbf1b6fad12b63ea4f13941","d4bcb4122728386402d0ff0c2aef54ff3cb11dcff47888dbfacd00614b9e56e4","c821186ed763fb4ff377b32a1aa3fe2babdf001557cf29eec636d4ae4a3e3f23","8945eccee2e323ea4d0d4e7620aaaba7269b9