{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED with an active BWP configured with common search space with the field searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested SIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested posSIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:UE may include on demand request for SIB and/or posSIB(s) in the same DedicatedSIBRequest message.","paragraph_zero_based":785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.6Actions related to transmission of DedicatedSIBRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of DedicatedSIBRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required SIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required posSIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedPosSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested posSIB(s).","paragraph_zero_based":791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["81fee572f1bde39f818928f636aa36dd940e7299e585535dc0f71c88fffc3abd","adcef6de0935fcc1f17496bab4328a5af3a51fc3e0f5bc1c0d35b68e2cfd4c93","6f1f7543ad295111bd7b1c479b4e70bbba6de7dc9c2a3dcc16f9a64c318cfd9c","458a2b48ea8b4aa65e819fc31d73621f59d89fd3e03f2c98adad526339c54b88","df4ff3658197d4b29120c68500b5c6eb759754517e9d0e325ab1a911709b4761","e7b2783e09c5375fe854243f3b9e7dd2d7ec8dd67b30c75ffda1f965cb05292c","4b9ea122b9272939eead309d95f578bf42f4f02724b3556bdca017747f65863f","390cb797f72181e684271dc469044f81568b5e329c579f168a91a51ebfe8900f","0576082e44bdc9d41330ad7fb0933c3ba0c1a6e813d24882bc8a13b9c3ec49df","8fb94da5e9d43cf6448a934767825daa8e23f70392023380d77e368628cea1c0","0d33920a43643ffcae5cf0d209104c98ef63ca028ba7754e16de017a515d9335","05098ae56e9a9bbacd681039961b116938105d0f4bea6da6f3148548f1dbedc2","e13a6ee82dbbc3eb3ec88d0eaed1fa30860e6926b84f72aa7339f34b01d14bb8","2b9fc14a2d800d2d3f9cb586ade316c26a9c63575e56b3a81ef676e2de072fb5","abdf338f4d0ac7dfdf3900b5885ec39ec922cfe170e238324db95c02ac57db2b","55ea70c090df86d02b7cac2507aab46c9497437c46914704e8101f5215a369c9","45b9a5d66cee92c5b1facf73d24b19a9212754051ec720df194a554ae17bf123","478dd332d78382e8b63e051ec153cab67f8db5afcd9c297472f3429d2df0b47c","ed2c5a543e6accc1b0fc5aebf0c37725e24e089d7f06515cd8684db37b83c5fc","c763184d5cacfa39fae7d4089db29fbfe0988fd74b7436dfc1586fe234cd9c16","ef6f0c80c306d49dbccaef51041936459d75dbcc75f6ac5308fef31cd3a26356","595f84fc1a7463a14db91aa567cefdbec3bcc9555062c8803c2bdb2502e1d9a7","8e404f13b5103d0f9cf9292c9ec0d4c0377f68455f0b0ec322f53d11c897df95","24635385795d7808b8068d1320909050a808ae5131f1afb0fb01f8be51ae3c1b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[768,791],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p768"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the DedicatedSIBRequest message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4Actions upon receipt of System Information","paragraph_zero_based":793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.1Actions upon reception of the MIB","paragraph_zero_based":794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the MIB the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the acquired MIB;","paragraph_zero_based":796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the access is not for NTN or the UE is not capable of NTN; and","paragraph_zero_based":798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cellBarred in the acquired MIB is set to barred:","paragraph_zero_based":799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a RedCap UE and ssb-SubcarrierOffset indicates SIB1 is transmitted in the cell (TS 38.213 [13]):","paragraph_zero_based":800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the SIB1, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the received systemFrameNumber, pdcch-ConfigSIB1, subCarrierSpacingCommon, ssb-SubcarrierOffset and dmrs-TypeA-Position.","paragraph_zero_based":805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:A UE capable of NTN access should acquire SIB1 to determine whether the cell is an NTN cell.","paragraph_zero_based":806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.2Actions upon reception of the SIB1","paragraph_zero_based":807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the SIB1 the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the acquired SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the access is for NTN, and the cellBarredNTN in the acquired SIB1 is set to barred or the cellBarredNTN is not included in the acquired SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is a RedCap UE and it is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the RedCap UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if intraFreqReselectionRedCap is not present in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["62e7d7ec023f0cd7bbb6f232a58770de3a4633b0cca5a5c79027d5846c8f9c7f","b93eb916faa8bc4123bff5023cca969d89021d364d2416b9be0db078a2ef0f53","0f0d7f09f1c3c5ca401a99a793e50fa803cba53ee52f77fd134a8e73b57702c6","728261c57303ce756665af9429c3a38700ee89b814eff416a70b8c8bc131b13f","39ef1d81d477db70168062306c02837230bd2cd1f3dd1f22e17b4eeee49e4634","dc8bba2bfde0dc056bd96c02943288d7c1723fde9612893e8697d8c2f1cfacc6","9680e6e94fb31388ffd63b75aab61e69d91b1dd919a23352729d202985b80ec1","8910df760bb755d672eed50fb4a77ed9b0271ac45ac059f6041d2923fd7bb64e","802fcf60357c28919142bd1999f87f397a75fa3cff451ec8b3e4fb6cbfd5225c","3f80e9abd5e04792faaed9142ec39febf26c53d195a5df18d73bb7bd7c675358","cb34227e9c63e75351e29aca5153302e3f4114ffc4e419f5596e56a88a8dc65f","c10a07c1c7aee8f2e43760583ba8b06efb7bb7548dc331023261b2d5211b1764","712e518a954889e1c6c8df63c6c4d5f62e812a4b3f63e3dfbbff2d475adf2334","d5e42d6541e9460790caa0f654cab70ee602cca5b1ce58ed9bc589c948005012","7ad71f3edf75b32f828d879ffc3ffeda43063df7303ba0245b4955021ffbf39a","6d31c4f5365d5e6af0c016f5aaa32bb3c9b1bbc87ee71e13ec77b6f939ceca65","6e0c09c47dbdd21c982ade727c9946803f38d7434ffc155f3f386d548843357d","e206f6f7782362d63acbbaee6dcab8ddbd664387f3ca12d547f7da2b33bea766","e9a6c377098eef1ef3e0f72d47cb6cfd1bc08dcb07c9704fa13eebe3c700e876","9baf7f38284abf1f5cc2b47e1e0a7e9c990f0c7aaf1e3e6712ed698ad801cd8f","d134b9e17bd3c9907ddc0ec9751f03f1768adfc954952d353bb3ae17df32d3fd","d357bc476aa426ad6ad2720df3e74dcbca921c05a8c8374815d17728236dc6d7","4135c2c12195eb1c629b27acc9969e3d96d909593aceaf0dada4ced4b6639d15","1292593b427c04c8d7cd291ef06c7d062bcf108c16992e1bfc541328d73e95eb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[792,815],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p792"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform barring as if intraFreqReselectionRedCap is set to allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else:","paragraph_zero_based":817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarredRedCap1Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE is equipped with 1 Rx branch; or","paragraph_zero_based":818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarredRedCap2Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE is equipped with 2 Rx branches; or","paragraph_zero_based":819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is not present in the acquired SIB1 and the UE supports only half-duplex FDD operation:","paragraph_zero_based":820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform barring based on intraFreqReselectionRedCap as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the cellAccessRelatedInfo contains an entry of a selected SNPN or PLMN and in case of PLMN the UE is either allowed or instructed to access the PLMN via a cell for which at least one CAG ID is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>in the remainder of the procedures use npn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, and cellIdentity for the cell as received in the corresponding entry of npn-IdentityInfoList containing the selected PLMN or SNPN;","paragraph_zero_based":824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the cellAccessRelatedInfo contains an entry with the PLMN-Identity of the selected PLMN:","paragraph_zero_based":825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>in the remainder of the procedures use plmn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, trackingAreaList, and cellIdentity for the cell as received in the corresponding PLMN-IdentityInfo containing the selected PLMN;","paragraph_zero_based":826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE in RRC_INACTIVE is configured for feature(s) that it does not support in current serving cell:","paragraph_zero_based":827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the corresponding configuration is not used in current serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>disregard the frequencyBandList, if received, while in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the cellIdentity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the trackingAreaCode to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the trackingAreaList to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the received posSIB-MappingInfo to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a stored valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, that the UE requires to operate within the cell in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the stored version of the required SIB or posSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the required SIB or posSIB requested by upper layer as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1bcf35f6e4dbc5a2ac0be0dc4bc92df50aac0586d4986bb5bc8df2b4459eb78b","fc8813e3a7933f2259bce803c92f49b936daaecba91eb07b06e6c15e2644f5c6","bec9f60285d5b670ca9d4986bc56c362a415bca6deffa95c2927aa9bd760cef1","2c40920fa4287c0f04ac93e5229506298e694684e43bc32f2a2e672f847a9d25","f5d16be7d41570df795e2eb2635d225bb7f4f52638ef0acd27f3f7dd0c61b11b","f77bf8df7cff8538e26d40537d73557d57141e378f12faea6fdc765ff5c02d9b","47f5907065475d099421a817db55ce35733586ae14fa084cef2e1dbbd3795035","73c6aba89eac8ab95943c398b55822f66809e451d22579c0506270a0e13a5abe","48768d7e58e0d1475a31efaac816c30bbb6c7bee45b967229ac72bdb0374230f","08e398824cac389144278f771e8a72cd3910417f23d15d91315b795f6acc3818","cc86ed59593b6306d69a1c4fafe21ccd37204c5f525fd5c6451e6741b68910c0","f5502c7b17a6e65e5751c70926c959b0d0b35508e343a646ce56f91ec5db4f04","74907761ce6f45b46a6c48ed0bc38b90d1bca5e66e3d26bd26046a60dc723050","5356aff8ac1cf9d69c8b4e3872b62bbaf7b05169bd99b7b1aa678b4d39a79fce","00a5b7dc11487ea1c6654114704484ef9d609040936b0ddf9fe2321792850bd0","5adb7892babde26d98c935a6a4a4b7ecff6105790b5ad731b8231c088b353f38","23da3abdd94e0a3abc208e1dfc014b52a755f3eba66b8aa0ad01accd5366c799","ef792a1007e7a76d523c05810157151caf44ed502467f8e40d1a3836c5ca8c96","e3bfc53e5b6e53ef37b4e0e7cffdd06771aa65471aad6ffeded3d0c96a88e45a","77113672e795dc21b35e3fe389981858d90718001fc3fde72ab90f7728df579f","467f94316b4f9fd648d7f1335b13e6fcb19006ca8372e4e803fd0b930ab7f116","1af4fef8bc6fdca296d537f1c8cb83cae4c64b6544f4228af913a9635badecac","51869f83a4e8e55e5e508d3245b5f0f8aa3fa376573813a84be380fabf25340c","70f40a9b967adf781a716ad9350e5796a3f7bc39f2ea659e2b724dcc2e771c13"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[816,839],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p816"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList or frequencyBandListAerial for downlink for TDD, or one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList or frequencyBandListAerial for uplink for FDD, and they are not downlink only bands, and","paragraph_zero_based":842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is IAB-MT or supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList or nr-NS-PmaxListAerial for a supported band in the downlink for TDD, or a supported band in uplink for FDD, and","paragraph_zero_based":843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports an uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15], TS 38.101-2 [39], and TS 38.101-5 [75]) which","paragraph_zero_based":844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in uplinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP or, for RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured), and which","paragraph_zero_based":845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial uplink BWP or, for RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured, and","paragraph_zero_based":846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports a downlink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15], TS 38.101-2 [39], and TS 38.101-5 [75]) which","paragraph_zero_based":847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in downlinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial downlink BWP or, for RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured), and which","paragraph_zero_based":848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial downlink BWP or, for RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured, and","paragraph_zero_based":849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if frequencyShift7p5khz is present and the UE supports corresponding 7.5kHz frequency shift on this band; or frequencyShift7p5khz is not present:","paragraph_zero_based":850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if neither trackingAreaCode nor trackingAreaList is provided for the selected PLMN nor the registered PLMN nor PLMN of the equivalent PLMN list:","paragraph_zero_based":851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if UE is IAB-MT and if iab-Support is not provided for the selected PLMN nor the registered PLMN nor PLMN of the equivalent PLMN list nor the selected SNPN nor the registered SNPN:","paragraph_zero_based":854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply a supported uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is contained within the carrierBandwidth indicated in uplinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP or, for RedCap UEs, RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP, if configured, and which","paragraph_zero_based":858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP for the uplink or, for a RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply a supported downlink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- is contained within the carrierBandwidth indicated in downlinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial downlink BWP or, for RedCap UEs, RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP, if configured, and which","paragraph_zero_based":861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP for the downlink or, for a RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is aerial UE and it supports at least one frequency band in the frequencyBandListAerial, for FDD from frequencyBandListAerial for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandListAerial for downlink, for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial, if present:","paragraph_zero_based":863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0fe8da53319fd6e4fdddddf32006ff1bf5bc5a47f56d740bad5fa96566c020ef","5b2d0188f54e2521fab7c6ff270dbcf43fa76c4d66bd6a1308c9dcecd4c220be","fa26032b4414ba6c0f9ea24e2465d3e11ed09186e5871d48e9dd31da3b949207","19ede1d42aeb4d9e2ebb755421491b3b20d0466ee903017a7ae1ade37f3328f9","3f73c68a2112ee8b0b51b542aa6ebe452c42e6a0ef0a5a6326df9b4ec57c6801","72d56b2e3da88383f81aa177fc617ba1742f0c9ab82b41d5932753bcba3ef9e6","9214a6f96acc0a78ae75503399e5f7a2d9619a9527ad