{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandListAerial, for FDD from frequencyBandListAerial for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandListAerial for downlink, which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial;","paragraph_zero_based":864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList, for FDD from frequencyBandList for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandList for downlink, which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxList, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the cellIdentity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the trackingAreaCode to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the trackingAreaList to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the received posSIB-MappingInfo to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the PLMN identity or SNPN identity or PNI-NPN identity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if in RRC_INACTIVE and the forwarded information does not trigger message transmission by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the serving cell does not belong to the configured ran-NotificationAreaInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate an RNA update as specified in 5.3.13.8;","paragraph_zero_based":874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the ims-EmergencySupport to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the eCallOverIMS-Support to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the UAC-AccessCategory1-SelectionAssistanceInfo or UAC-AC1-SelectAssistInfo for the selected PLMN/SNPN to upper layers, if present and set to a, b or c;","paragraph_zero_based":877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is in SNPN access mode:","paragraph_zero_based":878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>forward the imsEmergencySupportForSNPN indicators with the corresponding SNPN identities to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the specified PCCH configuration defined in 9.1.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a stored valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, that the UE requires to operate within the cell in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the stored version of the required SIB;","paragraph_zero_based":883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s), in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":887}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ca36b6df47229d1993021073e21e810edf7e20eb9d330022cd48b80f0078c505","53716e5dd1438614cb4ad8b10e180601565271bad79d9dca7fa7b6634ced5738","6818ca6e483f3a23f65da4fb3a6cb567fd662e87b5cac8b6e41129b58ddca0e9","2645297fdbf422cf2c8defb8d20892ac3f763ed39baedc33a1279a20c5dcdc70","ca34f5d633cf8d0641d18d23ed35aee9f959e5fa329265c97adb5fdd4617cd17","bc54e20e24a086e734ba37e95241a68e532887546a32e6109c94023014092ec5","f1c8a00007e7e2725ded89ea7cb9437c18952c7627bf457e97ebb2c97b28675e","7293b96d5b1aaa9fbf13c4428edea0fd3717f6cd3cc99dc37580072224fdeb04","074bd0e0b1124d694b42dcd4f1c9386646a78f3ec1c1ae7306cc3ec3f50e7c26","cc0075ff42cd203d1495b70324082686d8dcd8a6d8c7ebe9fcadbf3062870fd1","4f37b919da23b084e97b4e94b339efc9f2c94f9bd022445a5d3ba40436d44a40","aeaa19e69bf614e1219f8a04ee9eda4ff7ae5f4d75439a25d24d6a41b232227f","a57f1febe7f4cae529f35256dd4caf22837e444ec03d55481eb219714b0ddf47","751410dc9cd2180055da5eaf14460e6c7e7ba567637f480166b6be8b7cacf58b","f40ecc1a20fd8f8d611a0549eb7292b0148066f199c0e7eddfb682f1825d5af6","30a6a2df4c40ad9f3806fdba4bcd95702b02fa2c77457ad4e5bc53eec68fa3ea","c71821738de514ef03dc36fe7000b560fe5653ac56690082cf6b7c1ef1922051","8b57ef7deb8a90af2a824232132332607a5c154d5e0008a1eab55f6248b6bdcd","409a992a8cd30cae0942a329054805aa817114b9b6a7f56912cb6704620f876f","b188054a25db64f565bb1a4e4759f2f30076f2ff69ca176f197fa9c56c81ed9a","2728acfc34638f75393b3d009e2ff842d7ef0308e52a0b85ae9bc17f596f0f30","04704abc806c55c7ee360b96893c5f7cc58f1569ce9bc20787c9811ec2ff6124","c3a7cfa0edb2dbed761b04993d8d872d06e58a