{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>trigger a request to acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a stored valid version of a posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required posSIB(s), in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the stored version of the required posSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> if the UE has not stored a valid version of a posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one requested posSIB for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>trigger a request to acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is aerial UE and it supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within frequencyBandListAerial in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD:","paragraph_zero_based":896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within frequencyBandListAerial in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD;","paragraph_zero_based":897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD;","paragraph_zero_based":899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList or nr-NS-PmaxListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the additionalPmax for UL;","paragraph_zero_based":901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the p-Max in uplinkConfigCommon for UL;","paragraph_zero_based":903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if supplementaryUplink is present in servingCellConfigCommon; and","paragraph_zero_based":904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink; and","paragraph_zero_based":905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList for a supported supplementary uplink band; and","paragraph_zero_based":906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports an uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.101-2 [39]) which","paragraph_zero_based":907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in supplementaryUplink for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP), and which","paragraph_zero_based":908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial uplink BWP of the SUL:","paragraph_zero_based":909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider supplementary uplink as configured in the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxList, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2e026c3db259372e5d67467d909b589551151e9f7edaff12920d86cd940441ad","6592b386dffabd1973c4f1cbd77558c1f84f7f935950a711997c318b820b4e50","34389ca687b6ddafb8cd513b46c6e2ab7ca2bb2d6951f5810f40fd0613935e17","43e3169e308b23590e255daa6f129452363e2f1279badc87cad01b1d61abcfd4","e4fee7f5bdf323aec3a00c796d0cf023d7ed7e5a29081455eda9e5025ba7305d","b2efebe48f98280adc2b49b69f39545b412a0793720bab8a29db8ee8ffadfbac","67316bbf5bd784b0c806e57cbd1bcc142c0368f3087f7f758b578ae12788593e","3d5ac7580404f08f5e8a5c476b8e359540a4ca849363f1de004fc981d43c5309","28fc7314028ffd9794887d7675e891e4a9597da0f185241f8d527f8ec62f3e77","885eb4a7ce4033d19f4344ba295b34b3bf8c86f557b6a07fdb7d3cd6316a8c00","1a3e5180f4fdeeafe717d4ed79d5cb1573a518e86d8019f409356848d08f432b","7edddf0e5f570c439617c4ccd7f43d47db96b85debb7af9d59a8e385beeb6ca5","f7f271150f6f1e4afecd79ee614660863546302c55425ad97ce15d2ee381ffb5","0a8ba0ded6d52e79ced56b1a3aa53e41d2ac847922bd561e07b3b0207cc1a11f","78237d9ba86468f559e94ce9abf7319c58278c73cde4ad48115d4af81f9f2196","50234296ad629bec7815d2cab36f3a011856cffd2a5a25cd1b0864212f4d8844","04eaf03e09fce730c94287014634495b87f912fefd8193d14911efd83c61cc7f","27595da39b5d98bed21c51669fea0b8517c55b6f75c94777804f5ea1608b28b9","bf2a471780a2c471aad39ad771f0c8f336c6227a36a2856700622e0bf0d41638","c9c52b7d341df7959fba01daea332101d205468fb093bc50d6a1600f075b03a7","8237aa05f8ffb442b9865846f75cc3b32ebe9fa16e7d6b78a102cc77e6c6c692","e5627608ced96007d0de4224484036bcd461c804f511e998cb314a003a166e3e","43bd98135b70e2e3ec9d24903e0770cfe2af44eebe281d73177425df54d5b771","45764c60b5d390b0139aeda6d43797a2738922475c0b016bb00327e4f10a1d10"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[888,911],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p888"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply a supported supplementary uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is contained within the carrierBandwidth (indicated in supplementaryUplink for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP), and which","paragraph_zero_based":913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP of the SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink;","paragraph_zero_based":915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList for the supplementaryUplink:","paragraph_zero_based":916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the additionalPmax in supplementaryUplink for SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max in supplementaryUplink for SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For an out of coverage L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE receiving SIB1 from its connected L2 U2N Relay UE, it is up to Remote UE implementation whether to consider and apply the following parameters: frequencyBandList, carrierBandwidth, frequencyShift7p5khz, frequency band, channel bandwidth, the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon, the specified PCCH configuration, additionalSpectrumEmission, additionalPmax, and p-Max.","paragraph_zero_based":920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20]; and","paragraph_zero_based":922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform barring as if intraFreqReselection, or intraFreqReselectionRedCap for RedCap UEs, is set to notAllowed;","paragraph_zero_based":923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.3Actions upon reception of SIB2","paragraph_zero_based":924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB2, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for the entry in frequencyBandList with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandList; or","paragraph_zero_based":927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for the entry in frequencyBandListAerial with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the nr-Ns-PmaxListAerial within the frequencyBandListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is aerial UE and it supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within the frequencyBandListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in nr-NS-PmaxListAerial within frequencyBandListAerial;","paragraph_zero_based":930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList;","paragraph_zero_based":932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList or nr-NS-PmaxListAerial:","paragraph_zero_based":933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cfec3fe8471d133bb2ba798845661f77a4ba6ebbb3e7e5681a6a53b7b98ed9ab","1dfbd5cc9523f3323e99cce73efd94a7f594ae38798dd61603dfba3eeb30009d","16cd1df6457c993a40aa53732414e1b1e0a78947284d5d3af66030b04dccab76","133b834686f00182f2236492773aa32065a292516e80869551a5f87c8eb41705","3a9c9b99c91249f11f2cefd756ba557ff9c817e537e55f1534d7df0b3fb903ea","a15a0701f8bdcdcefcd75cbdd589f2dd08132438a717cd26a4487e69819b83d7","c5bca96ce6043ee2c6d6b3bcb531e83defd1279687c9929687a9cffec923980a","120fe26e0b76a1031e57c74dcd37a9ce516cfccc18ddb6846c5facee2c8287db","1716bffc5207fea3902cf3c276266397c3e46f734d1992b9dd77fedfc3a12749","a4fab44556d92b6116fd51ee29d6276786fc4c59a05985cb46e63ecfa1c89789","23fbbc283f79db11b6f36f5e675fb060dc88fce340f5ae81fbaf1d1f5ee45599","f66d86a84a77218724ff00bdb9ee27346f6b6f1fb88485543066c4a8bb176d8f","16beece5b0a5a7b6026450499a2be6bccef83b04e1d7ba2a7dfb3d722dec1458","37f2da0f22317566947b3a2aa1f647d0b61346be81070ad879f529452ccdaf2c","2647b35a4c1d07b7db86cc2183464a4701d348b6078401143c5fd20304babf53","dbe87dc1bb3011ae235232ed6abdb5b891cc247d6c039c2d3655cc8a3b0dc658","fd523c4ec3836a32d132da5edb8567a486faacc67de9e37b761e898882088ff2","ada3589bf017399fc0ab6d0e5c91040c97aa9f8aa0f42bb69647c404ecef9daa","863a2720d285a3949b50d2b7641fbf344a85681a26ef91c3a0a74421a8892cef","ab260625b2beff516c593e70dc6e10be168cdc0008127d0bf122bd75bcb1fd4b","1c31b932e2f9