{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE selects a frequency band (from the procedure in clause 5.2.2.4.2) for the supplementary uplink:","paragraph_zero_based":937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if, for the entry in frequencyBandListSUL with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandListSUL:","paragraph_zero_based":938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandListSUL;","paragraph_zero_based":939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList:","paragraph_zero_based":940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the p-Max.","paragraph_zero_based":945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.4Actions upon reception of SIB3","paragraph_zero_based":948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No UE requirements related to the contents of this SIB3 apply other than those specified elsewhere e.g. within procedures using the concerned system information, and/ or within the corresponding field descriptions.","paragraph_zero_based":949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.5Actions upon reception of SIB4","paragraph_zero_based":950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB4 the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE, or in RRC_INACTIVE or in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry in the interFreqCarrierFreqList:","paragraph_zero_based":953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is not a RedCap UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a RedCap UE and the interFreqCarrierFreqList-v1700 is absent; or","paragraph_zero_based":955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a RedCap UE and redCapAccessAllowed is present in interFreqCarrierFreqList-v1700:","paragraph_zero_based":956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList (or for aerial UE frequencyBandListAerial), and frequencyBandListSUL, if present, which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in NR-NS-PmaxList (or for aerial UE nr-NS-PmaxListAerial), if present:","paragraph_zero_based":957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if, the frequency band selected by the UE in frequencyBandList or frequencyBandListAerial to represent a non-serving NR carrier frequency is not a downlink only band:","paragraph_zero_based":958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if, for the selected frequency band, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandList; or","paragraph_zero_based":959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a828