{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (SCell addition):","paragraph_zero_based":2017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>add the SCell, corresponding to the sCellIndex, in accordance with the sCellConfigCommon and sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SCells are not applicable for the associated measurement; and","paragraph_zero_based":2024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the concerned SCell is included in cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":2025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the concerned SCell from cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":2026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (SCell modification):","paragraph_zero_based":2029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the SCell configuration in accordance with the sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state.","paragraph_zero_based":2034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.10BH RLC channel release","paragraph_zero_based":2037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each BH-RLC-ChannelID value included in the bh-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList that is part of the current IAB-node configuration within the same cell group (LCH release); or","paragraph_zero_based":2039}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["328a1ca6da15b96c9461f0ae581343049eaa0c0ced6ad0eb3ed693a4d2f63e93","718cd93442d8c82fb50dbc6ae5e86a07f2adf7107d191908a3b6d41d9ed9ac28","423e206c3aed42a697b045fd0b7f8109826d69699ea6de03460c298212bc67d9","93d7632ee8153c5e0c8b7fa0e04050f3d4ea1a9cca9c8c5ecaad45fc8b87856c","dd712c9498fe9dab3fcac746ab2b325af0993fd739b4f740f9fd254da73ecbec","643591047b880a61c37d15efcdf15ba6f9035bd0e257c1d4d973cb9603a34196","2509886777fe6220e49d63939dce40a3f062df68cb32dc6c860ecc9330e71940","9b2aaacfd514c62750c83cd35be9b0d318e075878d119a6c56598fa55ae6756e","b178659a8d289c2b0a3fb631277b890a540b39b0ce1e5c8b04986618cc51457d","faa7331e2bf845384c53af32c09185c3058a02fe4a5e6c2b43f8a6d1b404b240","cb8e7676474b6fd9472fb5759c03ffc935f0e04afba3035086cc0414bf8a890f","62bbc8ad6bc0ba7d5df0b28c53266d8e72fa8de17988be0ddd4edce139920ac9","bd7e7ac5b338804ee844d582a4e987e419543e8f80ec760de15e0a96bdb4ddee","c33db7659a3207ad8418690dc72efd210808a9b74f81d06fb3fe4b3a2589f13e","c7a3bc3cf47b8268aa20f37880007ee06941db6303f23d9ae6292a793a07fbbe","4810d2db4104b9d1b156f8b813f74a4a89560767836a7873185cb95a4774ef4b","84d2ab2f8b52022b2ff11ac6c3b538f3f7f950008bc6ff864eb537ba39b17d01","1000b14fce9e225251652fc144e22c01991bce7f933cc04d1df99adba95cc41a","480db372d5896fabec42f169c7d0eef1928823502517007502d87a9edd5fbd38","1a2fba23615d6e0ef77dc44a497c3b460b5226d4e9a851081883e96353e73950","67865a64e6a77bdef46b9dd216af65a4fc79422a6adab8317032c5b35bf40938","efc13c7f2e63bcf71197c5fde18aea435198a1135d1b51f0c37f730fd07740dc","415c750608d34ea24e741c7225100be194901b1cf9895f218939158b08d40d10","6bbd7768ab806f5d2cf0bf46cb5f086923361d3f6d7225a3ac0c22b4f0470b35"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[2016,2039],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p2016"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each BH-RLC-ChannelID value that is to be released as the result of an SCG release according to 5.3.5.4:","paragraph_zero_based":2040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.11BH RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each BH-RLC-ChannelConfig received in the bh-RLC-ChannelToAddModList IE the IAB-node shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the current configuration contains a BH RLC Channel with the received bh-RLC-ChannelID within the same cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reestablishRLC is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":2047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the RLC entity or entities in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the logical channel in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (a backhaul logical channel with the given BH-RLC-ChannelID was not configured before within the same cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":2050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":2052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.12Uu Relay RLC channel release","paragraph_zero_based":2053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelID value included in the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToReleaseList that is part of the current configuration within the same cell group (LCH release):","paragraph_zero_based":2055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the corresponding logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":2057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.13Uu Relay RLC channel addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":2058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each Uu-RelayRLC-ChannelConfig received in the uu-RelayRLC-ChannelToAddModList the L2 U2N Relay UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the current configuration contains a Uu Relay RLC channel with the same uu-RelayRLC-ChannelID within the same cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":2060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reestablishRLC is received:","paragraph_zero_based":2061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":2062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dc79dd1b10aaac65e288a57f787de2faaacdc90f9a3ee8eae0d73ebdf935bc95","fe7a6676b