{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reconfigure the logical channel in accordance with the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":2064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (a logical channel with the given uu-RelayRLC-ChannelID was not configured before within the same cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":2065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>establish an RLC entity in accordance with the received rlc-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":2066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure this MAC entity with a logical channel in accordance to the received mac-LogicalChannelConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":2067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6Radio Bearer configuration","paragraph_zero_based":2068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.1General","paragraph_zero_based":2069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform the following actions based on a received RadioBearerConfig IE:","paragraph_zero_based":2070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the srb3-ToRelease or srb4-ToRelease:","paragraph_zero_based":2071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the SRB release as specified in 5.3.5.6.2;","paragraph_zero_based":2072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the srb-ToAddModList or if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the SRB addition or reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.6.3;","paragraph_zero_based":2074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the drb-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform DRB release as specified in 5.3.5.6.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the drb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform DRB addition or reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.6.5;","paragraph_zero_based":2078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the mrb-ToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":2079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform multicast MRB release as specified in 5.3.5.6.6;","paragraph_zero_based":2080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RadioBearerConfig includes the mrb-ToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":2081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform multicast MRB addition or reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.6.7;","paragraph_zero_based":2082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release all SDAP entities established for the PDU sessions, if any, that have no associated DRB as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.2, and indicate the release of the user plane resources for PDU Sessions associated with the released SDAP entities to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":2083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release all SDAP entities established for the MBS multicast sessions, if any, that have no associated multicast MRB as specified in TS 37.324 [24] clause 5.1.2, and indicate the release of user plane resources for these MBS multicast sessions to upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":2084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.6.2SRB release","paragraph_zero_based":2085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":2086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srb3-ToRelease is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2087}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a9e01867111002d9d4f1c1a14695ad19bcc5b64ba79357a