{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346k associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release releasePreferenceConfig, if configured stop timer T346f, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release onDemandSIB-Request if configured, and stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release referenceTimePreferenceReporting, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release sl-AssistanceConfigNR, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release obtainCommonLocation, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release musim-GapAssistanceConfig, if configured and stop timer T346h, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release musim-LeaveAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig, if configured, and stop timer T346i, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release propDelayDiffReportConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release maxBW-PreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release uav-FlightPathAvailabilityConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successHO-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":2995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2999}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c0f1e2eb79592f09dab68c95fa572443157684b219c724ed36d375b97f1b35dd","12a2c35e470cbf60ce0271212f06d919a9537a5eac8f7bf9e261a5435ed151f8","71e3e525b0bdaa3b82c6bd16fc4c23e18434708604f2ddabe8d0a0661e4f1ef1","fa93dcf7ef540f91446076244526ed4ff2ec4d2711bdd6dece414c3c26027f72","004444248447607313dd4a2c5c0613da1f88f6637e9b1eb1fc49bdda4ccc9bf1","bb0aea0fe6762651f2cfd1ec5671295fbe2f392c9e4d5e880819b605178529c4","85d5296e0f2fbe7aa654ef7a308449ee6