{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":3006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":3007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":3008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":3009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":3010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the connected L2 U2N Relay UE as suitable and perform actions as specified in clause 5.3.7.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":3011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to Remote UE implementation whether to release or keep the current PC5 unicast link.","paragraph_zero_based":3012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":3013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":3014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":3015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":3017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For L2 U2N Remote UE, if both a suitable cell and a suitable relay are available, the UE can select either one based on its implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":3018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.3Actions following cell selection while T311 is running","paragraph_zero_based":3019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon selecting a suitable NR cell, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>ensure having valid and up to date essential system information as specified in clause 5.2.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":3022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1b4d4607e4234dd34d98898a6d5df5e210c55f072986ea2f0b3d490d47d9cea0","5c34018bbae7e463fb075a12fbec44685d08395d3423722e12bfd3fecf752625","acb886a652f5ff4e965f00f01238e1803337300d88276e1dee8cf73786