{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":3024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the relay (re)selection procedure, if ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":3026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the cell selection is triggered by detecting radio link failure of the MCG or re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG or mobility from NR failure, and","paragraph_zero_based":3027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if attemptCondReconfig is configured; and","paragraph_zero_based":3028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected cell is not configured with CondEventT1, or the selected cell is configured with CondEventT1 and leaving condition has not been fulfilled; and","paragraph_zero_based":3029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected cell is one of the candidate cells for which the reconfigurationWithSync is included in the masterCellGroup in the MCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports RLF-Report for conditional handover, set the choCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the selected cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the stored condRRCReconfig associated to the selected cell and perform actions as specified in 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is left to network implementation to how to avoid keystream reuse in case of CHO based recovery after a failed handover without key change.","paragraph_zero_based":3033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE is configured with attemptCondReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":3036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release spCellConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MCG SCell(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release delayBudgetReportingConfig, if configured and stop timer T342, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release overheatingAssistanceConfig , if configured and stop timer T345, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if MR-DC is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform MR-DC release, as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":3042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release idc-AssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release btNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release wlanNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release sensorNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release drx-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346a associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3047}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["205c6cae08d74994668b93f6c87554514a1e16b135950042656a92cd0e86e163","e246115ca99167138a83a0e7e32e9c33ca185aecdb