{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxBW-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346b associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxCC-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346c associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346d associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346e associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346j associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346k associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release releasePreferenceConfig, if configured and stop timer T346f, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release onDemandSIB-Request if configured, and stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release referenceTimePreferenceReporting, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release sl-AssistanceConfigNR, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release obtainCommonLocation, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig, if configured, and stop timer T346i, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release musim-GapAssistanceConfig, if configured and stop timer T346h, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release musim-LeaveAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release propDelayDiffReportConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxBW-PreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release uav-FlightPathAvailabilityConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>suspend all RBs, and BH RLC channels for the IAB-MT, except SRB0 and broadcast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":3069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3071}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a56148c7c1d2