{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the specified configuration of SL-RLC0 used for the delivery of RRC message over SRB0 as specified in 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the SDAP configuration and PDCP configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2 for SRB0;","paragraph_zero_based":3697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is different to the PCell in which the UE received the stored sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":3702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the stored sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":3704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is different to the PCell in which the UE received the stored ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":3706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the stored ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":3707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if conditions for initiating SDT in accordance with 5.3.13.1b are fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":3708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the resume procedure is initiated for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":3709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T319a when the lower layers first transmit the CCCH message;","paragraph_zero_based":3710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider SDT procedure is ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":3711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":3712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T319;","paragraph_zero_based":3713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":3714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ta-Report is configured with value enabled and the UE supports TA reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":3715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate TA report initiation to lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":3716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the variable pendingRNA-Update to false;","paragraph_zero_based":3717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successHO-Config from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":3718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the RRCResumeRequest message or RRCResumeRequest1 in accordance with 5.3.13.3.","paragraph_zero_based":3719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1886d8105f5ccf9638b4f6ff6ef3cc56b1ddda414a4c387d7bf219588a4a8b6f","759287fe60f5b15062b4d79095d0da36ba0d083e6da819c601cc137837f19468","6bb308c6f6fa2bf45efbea7eaca31a3e36a8ce8d377190d92480a863cfa01fdc","24bedd5cba49eba835a7c650c568b516a2bb154302727790b8b7c6d83745599f","9f30e1e44dfb4d6001ae4fe8fb6e713d0a43fb74d11cff317e4c60a3ad04812d","930078744c34f00f3cc5811ae7047a4fdd1b7c78f8b9e4f617b0dbf49494026a","bd133c9ea9f6582dbe59d6d059b23992eb27e800deca5b02fa87356ac9b3bf18","e4f3a0f74f000e92bd7a6e595b0c5dd2b4bf817acf54a466cb07995a4f1bd32c","8be9995bad0e174ab0e198b59982fdead734b7d0776869b98dd8f7b822e8e062","8f9dd838ea8faea89f2573c973fc0f2d2848e50e208954375e2958ab37c48d66","fb59cfab0da92d995739ae7f1967471e540841e0d5b03582c2a20230fcc85f7e","0e44449e71211e629ca8b0b3b517635f0d6b1099909396f2b63cf75bb827b0be","30b8327ca71cdea3ed828c00649eb8216ded866ee72216c217e051b74ebf42d7","a51e81ff680b7f5fbb7b91cde8954a28de98b05349ef8dea65a1bd350ea0c832","fb1420124f1b2590e2c915c488af8f9cb1ee2aaa86a3282e8767ef7aeec73e16","d7b9d128f0524100b2b3d287fdfada5bde1ce184011e0bcf7be47c6f221c38e8","7bbb15f15818598ac06531e920d568a0f0041283694adc2355e87e9e69d05651","179bc2487aaba131743dcfa158a8f92c4f6218c76743e718e6c921b4eb672aad","aa3318e92139b7fe885f4078bb80325b3e3ac8c67d64fb3b7037f6ff4f28e45b","0d3643b4d874c380d2fad89b05dcb03942eec1ff1deb85b6384b463694130847","46880f09e54a6f3cb5dd96d722190522d0a7d0d641e20c70580bf8011c723ae7","c25e52e0930fc3d20382a08158667fcf54acd52e856821ef261902d7d16442ec","79f60293ff6c3aa0579465a98ef6fe568f7f127a81e54fb34840d330be744040","56c13e57d7a65c9baec3403d7275a751c12f428a972d5986063edff85e90197a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3696,3719],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3696"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.3Actions related to transmission of RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 message","paragraph_zero_based":3720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if field useFullResumeID is signalled in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":3722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select RRCResumeRequest1 as the message to use;","paragraph_zero_based":3723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the resumeIdentity to the stored fullI-RNTI value;","paragraph_zero_based":3724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>select RRCResumeRequest as the message to use;","paragraph_zero_based":3726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the resumeIdentity to the stored shortI-RNTI value;","paragraph_zero_based":3727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>restore the RRC configuration, RoHC state, the EHC context(s), the UDC state, the stored QoS flow to DRB mapping rules and the KgNB and KRRCint keys from the stored UE Inactive AS context except for the following:","paragraph_zero_based":3728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-masterCellGroup;","paragraph_zero_based":3729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup, if stored; and","paragraph_zero_based":3730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-pdcp-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":3731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the resumeMAC-I to the 16 least significant bits of the MAC-I calculated:","paragraph_zero_based":3732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>over the ASN.1 encoded as per clause 8 (i.e., a multiple of 8 bits) VarResumeMAC-Input;","paragraph_zero_based":3733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>with the KRRCint key in the UE Inactive AS Context and the previously configured integrity protection algorithm; and","paragraph_zero_based":3734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>with all input bits for COUNT, BEARER and DIRECTION set to binary ones;","paragraph_zero_based":3735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>derive the KgNB key based on the current KgNB key or the NH, using the nextHopChainingCount value received in the previous RRCRelease message and stored in the UE Inactive AS Context, as specified in TS 33.501 [11];","paragraph_zero_based":3736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>derive the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key;","paragraph_zero_based":3737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>configure lower layers to apply integrity protection for all radio bearers except SRB0 and MRBs using the configured algorithm and the KRRCint key and KUPint key derived in this clause immediately, i.e., integrity protection shall be applied to all subsequent messages received and sent by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Only DRBs with previously configured UP integrity protection shall resume integrity protection.","paragraph_zero_based":3739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>configure lower layers to apply ciphering for all radio bearers except SRB0 and MRBs and to apply the configured ciphering algorithm, the KRRCenc key and the KUPenc key derived in this clause, i.e. the ciphering configuration shall be applied to all subsequent messages received and sent by the UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>re-establish PDCP entities for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>resume SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the resume procedure is initiated for SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":3743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f213993f7eef1f4e594b05c7b225116def2983253bd0ea593e843769a9334634","33d9ca4dbd514af3e067d22b6680feb3a653af9e1a1158c04239d51a2987fc75","47516167afd4e8412c80374a14d815eebc3659eb512ff42c9840c3fd7a122970","1bf408e70739ed1f013b48d15055a0a1d6d0e2ebb1c83860d121d3fa36585e48","19a08aa9f6e299c9a0f76cb9e087eb825dd4fc80c6fc89d1e15948c3e3c9b086","de95e2681e08d44542e65336ff5193fd797b9071460281f1790eba922dfad247","120de8117987e465ef253f86341958e98af7da49898851d4aa1b98e1fb414544","8a84c9239925e0a356c368bae6dd0bb1cbc384b0faeb224afec37e17c40b4120","fe52d433885b2d4fa41c6728b71617006080c9228747ac27079bafd535a3a612","5fa8e62afe5f0a37f337463ba2959e86f79ef23590dae88b6d32afd9471ef522","7251f1ce5b8c931ad325d4c0977f72ede2ab8b4178c32cadb32170fe01297511","e6e8b38be5fa468fdd29e503f8d305bbefc1aceb910aa31263aa32dc40de0f9e","9f3a1cc0fc3ea8451141af8321c381b5a79388f2508877424b9ab6f3d3885025","7a1800a0568eab539063d7e3a9befd5d2c7f75cd196ed8865d94af8a3fafca56","e761de3a3153f029a6070187346df92581c7d1271d88a4160b6580dad691fe94","4c0e9270a8b1e1d1c72d14a38878b06d013e1e053d9b3be81096beb40afb3d05","6867bbf4d8157dfdda34266e7cd5c862422d70a77d28091d4b06c1741349d03d","86711dca3abcaca1d439f1c7cb91108d45f1281cb941dc8f1aa9293f4acede60","e5b2262bcdc1e7bc38eb45355ae94ee069e7c9394fd216822b763ee24a8c9475","7318e821f3042a3c82e69cb6ca5a03c6c5c19ec98186503267295a9484e12f4f","ec9b404f0002fa9d217fe86145b703359d19138dfd5b795cf2207d8e36f0a377","0ffa5fefd696f5a78a5735d129e9d1e2a5ddbf256518f25d852a20281e8bdf45","7495d6b2230c43a836a5aace5438ba484497e70765afe0cf8b5a02f2a0ec6942","42e95d4e2246285270177e2ff90e5904ff9378f01a511413b94513374942d1ef"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3720,3743],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3720"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each radio bearer that is configured for SDT and for SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":3744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>restore the RLC-BearerConfig associated with the RLC bearers of masterCellGroup and pdcp-Config from the UE Inactive AS context;","paragraph_zero_based":3745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the radio bearer is a DRB configured with Ethernet Header Compression:","paragraph_zero_based":3746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that ethernetHeaderCompression is not configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the radio bearer is a DRB configured with UDC:","paragraph_zero_based":3748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate to lower layer that uplinkDataCompression is not configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the radio bearer is a DRB configured with ROHC function:","paragraph_zero_based":3750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sdt-DRB-ContinueROHC is set to cell and the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is the same as the PCell in which the UE received the previous RRCRelease message; or","paragraph_zero_based":3751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if sdt-DRB-ContinueROHC is set to rna and the resume procedure is initiated in a cell belonging to the same RNA as the PCell in which the UE received the previous RRCRelease message:","paragraph_zero_based":3752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>indicate to lower layer that drb-continueROHC is configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>indicate to lower layer that drb-continueROHC is not configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish PDCP entity for the radio bearer that is configured for SDT without triggering PDCP status report;","paragraph_zero_based":3756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>resume all the radio bearers that are configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":3757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the selected message RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 for transmission to lower layers.","paragraph_zero_based":3758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Only DRBs with previously configured UP ciphering shall resume ciphering.","paragraph_zero_based":3759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If lower layers indicate an integrity check failure while T319 is running or SDT procedure is ongoing, perform actions specified in 5.3.13.5.","paragraph_zero_based":3760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE is a RedCap UE and the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP is not associated with CD-SSB, the UE may continue cell re-selection related measurements as well as cell re-selection evaluation, otherwise the UE shall continue cell re-selection related measurements as well as cell re-selection evaluation. If the conditions for cell re-selection are fulfilled, the UE shall perform cell re-selection as specified in 5.3.13.6.","paragraph_zero_based":3761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:For L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_INACTIVE, the cell (re)selection procedure as specified in TS 38.304 [20] and relay (re)selection procedure as specified in 5.8.15.3 are performed independently and it is up to UE implementation to select either a cell or a L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":3762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.4Reception of the RRCResume by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":3763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T319, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T319a, if running and consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":3766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T380, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e2decbbd375ac89eaa8df50256266ecd30e92689fbfad49117e8c8d929f5b823","e69ac01afc7e5540d0753c3ec4b43731ab649ae0b05c47b1c7686bbb1b344f88","2577cd7ca9985f7152c03b437b951026d759c388cc4cfa92fd9c9c5879d8ec62","df28e2734f3a3a52a10343b4fee0337c9f0dd266f9d64924b83bd70d72452aa3","63b2000d3fb0cca566e77441d8ede2eed1ac05a05f3e886582c3da27cbd24ab1","6d98a9158a4a3f9d21850000cf056486415ecc5e60fd5a30210a4e594832db5f","84f87ad28abb6b213e02e08c8bdaea103b9d3f6c9231b328d44709e29afc2704","629fe8af8b746b0cf971cb22dd4ba5ea1b6708feaf82a0fe3241230a68fb2fe8","c3cbbe022991bda81006969ae83a339f55e051efca158c1fb12f02a54d1d5051","4759bf73a7281a656cc71114cd196a82f2b9cf30e8b4619f8f212c0db2e0dffe","e7aa2a5f60b4c795ad50affc732b03803e6ebd9bd5941fe3d183337cc8cc75bc","a49f887f6fb52aacf9df363e2398b93d3f7b32087cbdd96aa527fa464edf5aaa","b9ab3437ef3b81fc0eb39c0422b76b163831fcdd9d1a06f48c26ef3b2fed84cb","4f930d0bfc2edc39e509ce5e23f5884b49df0a09298611a78de96652998b7f76","f46987e197df37cdb96272bd7c123a830749fe195e8d6f5e7a41941bcc75f368","b93c3bb62d818238b193d6658f63dd091b5b58c4c211bf48f5d10382644adcef","98a3941b3309c2a81e19513b297e2eb4b6ee3d06e63fcc157f35e065d5428d3c","fafdad314b37d4775083bb13e9243679304d64569eaebc74d6404176287ae28c","644c6673c0b0ff2ee69554204093338fdf85c24819ae60c285739b8fe5af60d1","65335e01cfcd65d7ca39e01914e2bc358a38a5068fb26801eada4dada2a722ff","e820b4ac0f4ed67513b837bc2028f89949b37cff43b86c5e0b16ed2e0ec8a21f","fec71bed260fd68a7aeebd2dca468435eeacad6ad4b96528ff706fbb1327a903","ea7913a9a067d5810a0f74e03a8c56ce65407eddcff0e9b6c71f7646d33acbe3","a2af78b305bb4a95e7525b1dc8cfa27f37ddccc468d7cbec3a43ba9ad4175cea"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3744,3767],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3744"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T331;","paragraph_zero_based":3769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the fullConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the full configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.11;","paragraph_zero_based":3772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume does not include the restoreMCG-SCells:","paragraph_zero_based":3774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MCG SCell(s) from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":3775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume does not include the restoreSCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MR-DC related configurations (i.e., as specified in 5.3.5.10) from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":3777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>restore the masterCellGroup, mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup, if stored, and pdcp-Config from the UE Inactive AS context;","paragraph_zero_based":3778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>configure lower layers to consider the restored MCG and SCG SCell(s) (if any) to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":3779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>discard the UE Inactive AS context;","paragraph_zero_based":3780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the used nextHopChainingCount value associated to the current KgNB;","paragraph_zero_based":3781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":3783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to start the timeAlignmentTimer associated with the PTAG, if it is not running;","paragraph_zero_based":3784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if srs-PosRRC-InactiveConfig is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":3786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the suspendConfig except the ran-NotificationAreaInfo;","paragraph_zero_based":3787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":3788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the cell group configuration for the received masterCellGroup according to 5.3.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":3790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["30758cb65a3ab15ffd10274ad1c91a09e4eee2cc6c43cfe4643be85afef20e61","6fc91444595bf2a84b0f87fe94d82a4ef49c764d3b0d12718890ba072a68cb67","dfd9c264c3d8949d819c7ac7819ade6d92e54094044a2650dd323ed453f53b88","e2421edccdecce52f917ba99b336d72bda567e5c5e7195e2d17f2e23830dc3b4","a813cc9952bffa6f6162b2127213a86ddfc949e05e152f70e4ee17fe090843b2","0feb4ddf29f9dab949bfd6c270a6c196f3d8929f90f98ebb02e567825d2e23a4","2806b7081c91f4a65483b543ab447209ae9025254993bb55b1b72f0193362a0d","3137ba1bf16a195dc3da9fbb24df97bf4ddd599e488131fe8fdab45b4ff332d9","3ea7659858daa5e63e64a7a2b518271c80c3821410cfbbe7643113ce45fc2a6c","94f3461ccdc6b24577a8765b46a44b36d0b0c477dfda1a890b77485002b3f313","bddda7590cf27921508d6422fa4d7fd56283e30e9118229665f04fec06d0b981","4d0b593a2e8f254d605ade7c28a6b774a44b7d42f0b9929ef378811166976ef1","a94dd3fc0624dff20950e731ccfe139b6139e2045b0f9308348455a9580ad0f8","fdd22459f0db481bee1be0b58fc3309c743a764fdcdcdcce4133a26b8cd9bfc7","ee8041cbedf536da195402249fa9a91c514ce3583c8a231e816cc5439aeba953","0fbc819db97ab5ccb4a47b027e006a89dc9ba6bb41b503a783943c4c1b620132","b968fb60bfd5df41ec455babff28e43d8e8ac9bd571522c53b1ee2d9bc6230c8","3af9d81bdb4446f570d10603cccdf193d082e697c2bfaadf4bd8ffc489571d00","f6355668c161f60750378d1c47aae64fc8c58602bc8e105fa678f27c6cc23221","c58e1b7a7e7c3eee2af5c67b89d422828764c5e7c338fb2a399c4dc1d8d51dc4","cbeac273b9872a873b45ec9f0e622d545e1396f115d809c00c21eb908ce12d94","916c63c6f824873a10cafcb691b084bfb4351af8d9a828c73705a1d103b9b61a","f7c85bdf58bbc44e6fe9503144bff0f838a0aca108b12dfe0c327d8b879ff634","1815eab851e49d04847e3ea2b051f40bc6b53057bb4141e6b99b1b93809031ad"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3768,3791],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3768"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the RRC reconfiguration according to 5.3.5.3 for the RRCReconfiguration message included in nr-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the received mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup is set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the RRC connection reconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.5.3 for the RRCConnectionReconfiguration message included in eutra-SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume includes the radioBearerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":3796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sk-Counter:","paragraph_zero_based":3797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform security key update procedure as specified in 5.3.5.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the radioBearerConfig2:","paragraph_zero_based":3799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the radio bearer configuration according to 5.3.5.6;","paragraph_zero_based":3800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapsConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":3801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapsConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":3806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":3811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":3815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["22bf390601d02b9a08b0d5048805c92e0e08c396daa8f78062dcbf86f4dfa62f","71d3f0614c143c9ac4291eb9464a219a96cbab6711539be76d8a726a469d2497","54d5a8f6df353cf51a9cc7081834acc00585cdd2c107cacb2f55c6a2c7467a79","677b487accfc8b22f6b825bcea1ca37677cf82fd47b7c4a465ae2db58c6e9f0d","caa3ef4893b61d7be90ccee5956aed9c493aba151c9ced0cd7d128f4610a2e5a","236e262b75dffc65ec4ca5c474a4bd56a6e43f8da60af64c7f23d0c0ce6fe71e","4f6bb07c1367ecbd24bb8eee7f319de4a7295df83c8af88b69480605f849b9c2","d0f0a8f15ef819366a64451284dc2bfefc037b4c2e03bf2bb3601e6fce903ad0","4c89d4e204aba4094a52a901127a2a326b1be80d04a9a2b5313a7478dd3d6357","9a40d3a484d7bc6c1118e4c53ae73ec5afeccf7da832b34e964ce51f89d15880","5ef4ec2e238fbf4ea520ad325154a311c01be528ee63fd522036338b967257b8","7e492c30976385ca8e5984dd43df4fe15264105dd6dbb36fc1b612352fb605f1","1f23641fc8e832a14e5b3ba9c95ef39b008bf0196959d133520281bd9ccacda0","d44d317ac226b5f105a97e6202cb53efa10d247853403d9f475f427a484c9f32","dd1d6a98e1dfbaea139261ad849359fd1fb0db5f57ea32fc49a9a678e74a98c5","9c2461ca3b1dc1e1ee6ebd176db470c26ac111dbc8cbce3e9ef8ed716c16fac2","22c5d93f125836e6262d07ee00b40cff5f5f32ca8d9934a63955443210640a7a","969222faf46a84bbad025ca3735f3012231746250f901382906c7c601c6521ee","0d69ada62c3162b40b49b8aa87c56c42596d797e724094ac3263713d6ee1e79e","466c981dd7eb5ebd5f39822c76a98f081b94b9f94fa4cd87f428cd9bca21e6a3","70138d1b7814992227b46b860b3d28fd8976beca41f66c62123fd3cd9e9950da","5b6c12f1a1635c540160063b906c64c6d35d2ce8c3356a3b37cd0b2bf8365b79","226e7a87a5c9b973b2dcc6ca17477382435265551d5ae0b6f58108a6a01e4714","266c4ef1ca7941bb7f3639860229bb7f5a0b0851da29553387916afca57d0636"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3792,3815],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3792"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the appLayerMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the application layer measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13d;","paragraph_zero_based":3817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config (i.e. the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE):","paragraph_zero_based":3818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N Remote UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":3819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":3820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink dedicated configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":3821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>resume SRB2 (if suspended), SRB3 (if configured), SRB4 (if configured), all DRBs (that are suspended) and multicast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":3822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:If the SCG is deactivated, resuming SRB3 and all DRBs does not imply that PDCP or RRC PDUs can be transmitted or received on SCG RLC bearers.","paragraph_zero_based":3823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if stored, discard the cell reselection priority information provided by the cellReselectionPriorities or inherited from another RAT;","paragraph_zero_based":3824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T320, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCResume message includes the measConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the measurement configuration procedure as specified in 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>resume measurements if suspended;","paragraph_zero_based":3828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":3830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T302;","paragraph_zero_based":3833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>enter RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":3835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>indicate to upper layers that the suspended RRC connection has been resumed;","paragraph_zero_based":3836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the cell re-selection procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":3837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop relay reselection procedure if any for L2 U2N Remote UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the current cell to be the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["743e243d92d2ed41ba29bdcae28e36091f47c0ce57d792478ea15f8c4b386578","63c16c496f0eadc63bc239ec6521448cb807442178c9fdbfcaebd0a8af472821","aeb3dda2121a5dd623f371064f46c55816e584da5eb5e7512a1085d23d9b829a","88a34d3e54102fa532797148158e8f96a3942c27cc42f85f604010c9c558a54e","08298fbf4bc447ea568e854a0317c7fe6a0502b80ae8bd486c0eb3bb4d8d1548","cc0a2fa4b20dec35dcbae356babc557d2fa7fe0d69b5b90e8c3bca4e9c8bd41c","65960ea72545a863edda37871928db83a7eb704cb08bb18b1772208451068e5c","d4ab7356e1cebfeeaf67b33a54e8651584ed98f46b7b3a92a9b89f64b96e4392","18c74d8607a3ddf78c4a82634944249b4b75df83fc6fab62e18311cddc90be6a","56e080483a16a116ac9d99ed68aec10c8293aec47609f30430657b1eeb79f9f0","e67a76c2faf64160506cb77e960c7d9935e215ae2d219e8ed1cb30448c715de1","f87f619bc550a0e429ac723ad01a9374094692ea81cf45f24be8d87ec35c4767","674ef17761b7917754d9f26540b99902ecf111992524f678e9e36a8891152337","260609b3d0a59d09e21d850b5ed263cd47512b4d437e7f07799acf22b341fd7b","0b02261a9d85d79ec30bbb1aafd94cac3d0f70cab9132d49c073ff54d421b1ff","fe14e0bf4ab69ccb0990758027ec818aeffaa95f4793678579feb308d96ddc00","79e8fa7dcff91332e718ea305cbf6a9fd61d88b8a4507b2871b4f467f61bae74","9d1e4c316cd100e039ab7106e12058539a622c2ae57b775b4efc06ae388b8fc2","b51c16e16707a994084957e2bc6811cb9f609c082fa41555d0d95fe8dda97335","c2d27aab31cd6d63eef12514b0eb3a5055ff2a2a2acebe35dbc5fa3489f5b37b","1b67901a391924f429f82e029444cfe3d1f5cd811ea113ececf147e41100dde5","cf5fc744b474fa49c893e1e444125bcffa3ac3f8b064e3c5f9f95cb276b407bc","3afbef82d0f0a8f991b0918e4c2aceb42bceedf7a08537dd931cca80268d5c52","8059ef376c4d674d21c08173ffac420296aefcf5b0ef00b984668f77f1be7a38"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3816,3839],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3816"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the content of the of RRCResumeComplete message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the upper layer provides NAS PDU, set the dedicatedNAS-Message to include the information received from upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":3841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers provides a PLMN:","paragraph_zero_based":3842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is either allowed or instructed to access the PLMN via a cell for which at least one CAG ID is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":3843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the selectedPLMN-Identity from the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":3844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the selectedPLMN-Identity to the PLMN selected by upper layers from the plmn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":3846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent:","paragraph_zero_based":3847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList for each MCG serving cell with UL;","paragraph_zero_based":3848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include uplinkDirectCurrentBWP-SUL for each MCG serving cell configured with SUL carrier, if any, within the uplinkTxDirectCurrentList;","paragraph_zero_based":3849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":3850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the masterCellGroup contains the reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier:","paragraph_zero_based":3852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the uplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrierList the list of uplink Tx DC locations for the configured uplink carrier aggregation in the MCG;","paragraph_zero_based":3853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has idle/inactive measurement information concerning cells other than the PCell available in VarMeasIdleReport:","paragraph_zero_based":3854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the idleModeMeasurementReq is included in the RRCResume message:","paragraph_zero_based":3855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the measResultIdleEUTRA in the RRCResumeComplete message to the value of measReportIdleEUTRA in the VarMeasIdleReport, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":3856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the measResultIdleNR in the RRCResumeComplete message to the value of measReportIdleNR in the VarMeasIdleReport, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":3857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>discard the VarMeasIdleReport upon successful delivery of the RRCResumeComplete message is confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":3858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the SIB1 contains idleModeMeasurementsNR and the UE has NR idle/inactive measurement information concerning cells other than the PCell available in VarMeasIdleReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":3860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the SIB1 contains idleModeMeasurementsEUTRA and the UE has E-UTRA idle/inactive measurement information available in VarMeasIdleReport:","paragraph_zero_based":3861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the idleMeasAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":3862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume message includes mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to eutra-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bd302669a056f7c84424de6a44d21f517b8009acf11f89bb29990d4ae47350bf","8b9107861342a3e38e1a935bf4446ab6703ac928dfdcd595376a4e8aca055c28","16eef831d75159d3010b716b03f9a2ee7eb5e0c26d2f518a322e447ff63edb13","6c48a2b667cc4352a11ef27f38b4d9235800f66e271c78b82c2d4b1cd51c77c6","00d1c67afb9447dc22801cde59ba511de2d3f30fee86de44dabfc936fa06bba5","3ad66279d6f54042496acb7c9acfcd5da355b17dbf12e61ecb76023e96b58138","c44e3ce0398a0b794bd55b0085495a8950b425e4bbb040024ac8c909797698f9","71bd8a069270fd9d84481ce2764bc6eee06d177d54943beafb5badba677b3d6e","9773715bd0575c00ddfec99e9ff69ca59d411e8d8d65ac1b3b64a0ef1a71377c","1e59bc2ef6b883e8b7e4f0187368b1e54faf24f32d7483805732e5ec512a1fdc","271375abe838424204984d0e6f1effc5f1c186aa76bd9bd7bd339eec821ae70c","da9d7fb31f98d7f8185c77e30dd2d30943447df1aea3022fbe8d0c3c302cfb5a","acd7770855451816a68be4868d7cc15fecd574d404a3fd00ca1845c40a91fdca","cc1fe6d75611258df208c749e7bac5ab044ce3cd2add9badb477dc61355f8adf","1080724a9c8e8f56bab54aecf883e0ad10e07271908ca04056bb3a49da7defd3","75f5cc0a8a64d24edf4112d44f153d218b639f95c79bb3ed31cb01d200edf6ad","5645e5e8c4ab9ef3eee7b091f72810d32169d47d8e814bb1b7f9f7ff071e8c57","91068abb24d9bd0998d67a9f2ded844eafb6b4cf926e9912c22cc16819cadad1","3dcf9f44c7694faeb5d84ec9dded98814c6e84a8383c851f02735def8354c015","32f0810379b011a2a96a5e706da7ea2876768f2371fa4e0938a180b99487e804","60765ed64f743f9830307208fc78ac8e14739491059345da8887a869136fc073","6366ad9951738b3b3b9036f910952ee6346bec2b11923a330fc1a5e353aa027c","e97a028e8183ca5b82f4f7d9ab8fbf0e7b5e1dc678dc2d9eede244fb59657b31","bdcf64d0b9507615d2ebd2a26ad057de1fe499a7f70195da9606b8fa0f2b8543"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3840,3863],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3840"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the eutra-SCG-Response the E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfigurationComplete message in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCResume message includes mrdc-SecondaryCellGroup set to nr-SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":3865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include in the nr-SCG-Response the SCG RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarLogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":3867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the logMeasAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if Bluetooth measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":3869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailableBT in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if WLAN measurement results are included in the logged measurements the UE has available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":3871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailableWLAN in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sigLoggedMeasType in VarLogMeasReport is included:","paragraph_zero_based":3873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if T330 timer is running and the logged measurements configuration is for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":3874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to true in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has logged measurements available for NR:","paragraph_zero_based":3877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set sigLogMeasConfigAvailable to false in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":3879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include connEstFailInfoAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report; or","paragraph_zero_based":3881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] and if the UE is capable of cross-RAT RLF reporting and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":3882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include rlf-InfoAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has successful handover information available in VarSuccessHO-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarSuccessHO-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":3884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include successHO-InfoAvailable in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports storage of mobility history information and the UE has mobility history information available in VarMobilityHistoryReport:","paragraph_zero_based":3886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the mobilityHistoryAvail in the RRCResumeComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":3887}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f845660031682e127a0c7b5b8e962b1840be737a059cc231349020e34643b4e0","b440192b6b1c668cc86e31a0e7cf834bd12064831a934c817d96071c035ed1e5","5e0114d331c5fad54af89e34b26d6b4ee376f17cdde6b63e34b30a7608d1eb56","f5282220e2b5d45224d6b02d9289712a2ac360f4fbcb9b0f955b77f449b12d23","a405682f26bff1aa436cf834d338ffd3f138f0cf54c7438efe08b1b791884c29","293b8e7f03159693ffae72591d8c64af3bd7ee167d493a99b5cfbc8e45518973","90576d35d155a0659eb997037e0960ff311106a95b8d8176def1853919abdbd2","55c54d8b0a3109c1bbcd83b75e36122651cadcc2113f4c0f38abf648da150310","b744d5e36a2f45240c37d4e435c2f05bdf3c43a731236ead7aed167404e8741a","e681fe3ced609eee0cb83edf6d29a8b0f2f3d78de811382af1f769dcb06ae1af","2499d3be03a5199fdc155091b3e192922ac3efcbab818d0d1294a7f86f96f20c","7994d2d78bd49b44be9b66e2e4510e1ba22730ae5394f572517b017c55a93ad0","23e2b68f079521811d014f5909ebeaea3a2aabf93ff77326ea795345b447d776","f57d168986c0181143f915bea8f654380fc3b5bc0d6b2918fe342e9823e3d68e","bb44e683dad4d1b89224874cd8f81535f7d3aede5b2944821e68769c7392f808","e4156fb425e6e2638bd779ae3540374827294ac8ebea31a25d97e5690e57a4f0","3031691deeac1cbea612eb3689a40e561924d91c407b179b3c9e0db22cdbd2bb","f4638d88bc981ed4bf36c8fdb43f29bfeecce538cffe46d6e4bfb27d77e8b2aa","3db23202f716e1253e2c48c0d19e4a17bf626458b9950fdf7341221642eb42b4","7764c01ca8b26d52ee6dff4c9a09cd826b984faf84a7488c28402128e98d0fdc","d3de53ac0db6af9c7c578504349937db0406aa6bc007cc410c701a80b525fc05","45aefa809deaa5c5ef7db82efcd14df367c200c9ee11897cfa5957cff1db7f8a","b2772902f91cf6dfc20b37fc2e6f852f568fe8c18ba9ba74e3684359ad921579","fc25b5993161d9a5d7f6f8a2a29273b86e398dd792836c563e1289df366ae9be"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3864,3887],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3864"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if speedStateReselectionPars is configured in the SIB2:","paragraph_zero_based":3888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the mobilityState in the RRCResumeComplete message and set it to the mobility state (as specified in TS 38.304 [20]) of the UE just prior to entering RRC_CONNECTED state;","paragraph_zero_based":3889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":3890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the NeedForGapsInfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> include intraFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if requestedTargetBandFilterNR is configured, for each supported NR band that is also included in requestedTargetBandFilterNR, include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the gap requirement information for that band; otherwise, include an entry in interFreq-needForGap and set the corresponding gap requirement information for each supported NR band;","paragraph_zero_based":3893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":3894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoNR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> include intraFreq-needForNCSG and set the gap and NCSG requirement information of intra-frequency measurement for each NR serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each supported NR band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-NR, include an entry in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the NCSG requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":3898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include an entry for each supported NR band in interFreq-needForNCSG and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":3900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands:","paragraph_zero_based":3901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the NeedForGapNCSG-InfoEUTRA and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each supported E-UTRA band included in requestedTargetBandFilterNCSG-EUTRA, include an entry in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the NCSG requirement information for that band;","paragraph_zero_based":3904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include an entry for each supported E-UTRA band in needForNCSG-EUTRA and set the corresponding NCSG requirement information;","paragraph_zero_based":3906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has flight path information available:","paragraph_zero_based":3907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include flightPathInfoAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":3908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>submit the RRCResumeComplete message to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":3909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":3910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Network only configures at most one of reportUplinkTxDirectCurrent, reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentTwoCarrier or reportUplinkTxDirectCurrentMoreCarrier in one RRC message.","paragraph_zero_based":3911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6865ad8f042a9cdb696713f1904013aafb1879157fa4832dd2bfc2646847d30b","8f3075fa7e977f8fbf0222fd37dfb68be7ae5cc40c1baa56a92dc15269ab0dde","d2bd959af11fc12e6539e13f0b3dc6aac163485efe46d88bb31d27438e6728c8","e32c0dab6f8ecd7bf82b4e52c95b6493d4d835e8f9ec569a8f4ddbe67d2ab125","c40c5d0cfa99b8d5158f9989ad5ffc6cc796bdf62f4b4e5bc88fbf5e31afc54a","5685bdda1cd4002116da1dc034e040b16ca75108d293502e9bdf4ae6e542b5bf","e4703656f420abf5e40da44400219f3338704c72f4e038953b6d8e1de1a3f48f","7d1c0299c0c7d6191e1208f1f85348aeef52f161381c4efeb552af0777633ad5","d3c941321b813cdcb10dd81ee20f348ad89136c42c492c22861390de1147e83d","1db5120e354d36302e6c0bf71699f2474b619eba50bfd39749cf56b3f96ba0ae","6619836a5a5f0be140d1b942a184e71b919a17696a0808005ad29304bea00b2d","afba881f0b059b3666327b23bdfdd4c4339e4c2e2de3e50ffeb98fbee349a23b","6a93c55f56ee083e8e6127ecae351659ec83c5d9ece283faebde16b0dd72fd12","072d09e981356a07abd2b8acb2824a5e7e27e23dd2a44c53737f04db57ef4975","64d55601e52dea35d804403e9a77e2869b7d5d0b858268c01ec985d8cc8ddf48","45b60780312d7b06c5abbee16a9a427bd00b9e78aa8ffd4738b9c8ea41fd9f52","e6d33613f677ec03bbcd52a8da521906a59d8b368a0a5c9c76ad0f710ecfe344","ed5bb01fb2c2b370db16498a10ebc21d1ee2261e4717523c80fcd1239140135d","c5c932d9a6d09adaef5cf19dd8f4424aa60bae673ad0647cad263cd77680e3f8","852f468d35d4eec300cd6bca3761f9bc21060729b503815527b938d0d7ed76c2","6157ef027c4c82245879a0b3f3a780d4dcf16f56b2ca24b329dec39431557881","8e409c880b156bbe2c6e782bc43ca52fb3c6a871bc72dc43b0b67ab1517f364e","ed464a19eb9d15f2608f0de7cb69c15e57277eff570b16282391bd832c7e206e","2886e6c71409c7b7d14892b9180134ef114d332aceff0832456010f352f1c893"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3888,3911],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3888"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.5Handling of failure to resume RRC Connection","paragraph_zero_based":3912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T319 expires:","paragraph_zero_based":3914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports multiple CEF report:","paragraph_zero_based":3915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport; and","paragraph_zero_based":3916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cell identity of current cell is not equal to the cell identity stored in measResultFailedCell in VarConnEstFailReport and if the maxCEFReport-r17 has not been reached:","paragraph_zero_based":3917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>append the VarConnEstFailReport as a new entry in the VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":3918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReport and if the RPLMN is not equal to plmn-identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport; or","paragraph_zero_based":3919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cell identity of current cell is not equal to the cell identity stored in measResultFailedCell in VarConnEstFailReport:","paragraph_zero_based":3920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset the numberOfConnFail to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":3921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has connection establishment failure information or connection resume failure information available in VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is not equal to plmn-identity stored in any entry of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":3922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear the content included in VarConnEstFailReportList;","paragraph_zero_based":3923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> clear the content included in VarConnEstFailReport except for the numberOfConnFail, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the following connection resume failure information in the VarConnEstFailReport by setting its fields as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":3925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the plmn-Identity to the PLMN selected by upper layers (see TS 24.501 [23]) from the PLMN(s) included in the plmn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultFailedCell to include the global cell identity, tracking area code, the cell level and SS/PBCH block level RSRP, and RSRQ, and SS/PBCH block indexes, of the failed cell based on the available SSB measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected connection resume failure;","paragraph_zero_based":3927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the measResultNeighCells, in order of decreasing ranking-criterion as used for cell re-selection, to include neighbouring cell measurements for at most the following number of neighbouring cells: 6 intra-frequency and 3 inter-frequency neighbours per frequency as well as 3 inter-RAT neighbours, per frequency/ set of frequencies per RAT and according to the following:","paragraph_zero_based":3928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":3929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE includes the latest results of the available measurements as used for cell reselection evaluation, which are performed in accordance with the performance requirements as specified in TS 38.133 [14].","paragraph_zero_based":3930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":3931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set perRAInfoList to indicate the performed random access procedure related information as specified in 5.7.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":3932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if numberOfConnFail is smaller than 8:","paragraph_zero_based":3933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>increment the numberOfConnFail by 1;","paragraph_zero_based":3934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC Resume failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":3935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5220519f945bd8ec3f6f55b390385f935e1523492a8a1e9873ecaefd725b2a53","806cbe0b6d48c04668ef6a03da857cba9bcd3cb034f397f08ac1e476f2dcf42e","1ccbacc5b13b4ab235f0749f02b785cc60bebeb9021edfeca8d25d8e91a1a1a3","81875d918f5dc82e69c3851841761af5c36b85b504d929fc518dcf2492b1edf3","7a25058d97a61eafecdfa106f2c62f5cc0d1673075dfaa2b365922715011ca47","794e632df70b7be43f066eb4aec71742deba2eb886ea2da4efc07df137ca45aa","5c645455819fbeca754c1af9083eb018d0ed25112e9b9259c033a1f4c0015836","1ea2e0c30ae39197f44a84bf56e98f2362872cff0a4e347a76b75d05191d1118","bfcad2c93b06ea0411104e9d5d8b03e35fc22a91db37f1356367e238ba78bfab","bbdd656f0b8548a860961a32477a5eed9d3d833ad1febf526fa29fdb8af1a243","44036ec7c434f037f384258290b5e45ce1371db9ea799acfade7aa09fa2fba45","67b42ff8411f985a7cb37d5906af35418f13f061120c24feee6a19084ec78736","c98e98c83dd8151f9e1db21902eadb07331a2409ef2e89d696a64782b49894f1","b0a78c0e622624a15b0e6bb9b8a102b7afce7994d95c3fa8279a5563d9d32622","a368b88d8b724744cef7fde3243fe58076c2df29f89df0a6269cf5324cca00c3","388bc74a083a63840832ef85206a92509cd98b7018d78496ca4e6ef830b71216","af55d8982b460ce21ba99e56a3aef14d4d9c1cd8aa2bd362e240e5e68e7236f0","de4990d558266fb09d1a690018f28feecd91ecf10a01f6e5bd8449fa45856b74","139d3fa2018f967cda595d91e0298359e3457be9447cd3cf51a3e8280be0fe2a","5c668f7676376f593625d8dd24e8a2805e885642a6e2fe2c2d9f11121391e2b7","edd5881a92992bece303754b9083446af5331ccbd49410c69b8a002311ec4d53","613a869b24ee76eecdf8de884bc78a6c95465ece8c7a26c0dfaaa4324fb1b70f","68ca4e11e9e2dbd80fafd30ffa486d4a8f13ca682f0e191718bb067583e7ca84","a419838d3171de77acc1fb68fafd5e8c55006904afe7bc23bdeb0260975a5c34"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3912,3935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if upon receiving integrity check failure indication from lower layers while T319 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC Resume failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":3937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if indication from the MCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached is received while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":3938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if random access problem indication is received from MCG MAC while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":3939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the lower layers indicate that cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer or the configuredGrantTimer expired before receiving network response for the UL CG-SDT transmission with CCCH message while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":3940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if integrity check failure indication is received from lower layers while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":3941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T319a expires:","paragraph_zero_based":3942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":3943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC Resume failure'.","paragraph_zero_based":3944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may discard the connection resume failure or connection establishment failure information, i.e. release the UE variable VarConnEstFailReport and the UE variable VarConnEstFailReportList, 48 hours after the last connection resume failure is detected.","paragraph_zero_based":3945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The L2 U2N Relay UE either indicates to upper layers (to trigger PC5 unicast link release) or sends NotificationMessageSidelink message to the connected L2 U2N Remote UE(s) in accordance with 5.8.9.10.","paragraph_zero_based":3946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.6Cell re-selection or cell selection or L2 U2N relay (re)selection while T390, T319 or T302 is running or SDT procedure is ongoing (UE in RRC_INACTIVE) or SRS transmission in RRC_INACTIVE is configured","paragraph_zero_based":3947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while T319 or T302 is running or while SDT procedure is ongoing; or","paragraph_zero_based":3949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if relay reselection occurs while T319 is running; or","paragraph_zero_based":3950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell changes due to relay reselection while T302 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'RRC Resume failure';","paragraph_zero_based":3952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if cell selection or reselection occurs while T390 is running, or cell change due to relay selection or reselection occurs while T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":3954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":3955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if cell reselection occurs when srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>indicate to the lower layer to stop inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":3957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the srs-PosRRC-Inactive.","paragraph_zero_based":3958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.7Reception of the RRCSetup by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":3959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e95b1c0c936e2ac0f4ee289b731e750cea1c125f96af412dd1caafb0fe85baf4","fd2fb829e0c0474064dc268467fbab57291e1f35c3d69907d271086e7450c01d","58f978526d0c613fcda67fdbfc746f0468c79a9610f985d04b8f47215cd94707","9a3c8a7a457e6e3304aa080f15ea2309c70f53aeb9e61497aec2ffb7da2e7a94","88614946a3518df4a6007e16da035dbc2bdb4538c8847d402ea3a2c2793d8b5c","362cf7e048eba46ddedd3182733fc5d3ac4dccf7e5ad4fd3f2ab038676d642ec","e5ba8f3a149cd8098f2e2d0bcfe421ba85270c659c8f49b6f53ffee2a0bdc713","80286e73a0f7c2ee1872f4e704b3921131bf277b94b751abcfbda173ae5577fa","8183a141b038c33a890288493c04a93f9da3baa1290841cb300623428be0ef85","cc1a5eb7dd99004e4c8bc224146288d207fb9b1ea968c85d5f24736757fdf3fd","6dbb30d7fe06a791fd51e203b8eb26e0f6dd233ee822ea1b38b6dfd204f6a6bb","bb53e30d1da4cd049ede4c6fe33638357b3f95f0bfc082193c40785bc7a2dbcc","e131bdc07778f06f8379810b671230a3b5cb9f64f4c18e8dcb2e4d7ff29d8cd2","3aaf9570293811908d22d5acc3da5e3596c839a3733999849403631decc1d10b","22097f31ec9ed14d3e08d319acb0701f5dc7c212ae6c43c4ff522670abf23f1b","688463df28be2a8c45cc78a9e40249b9d63aeca993fec4055f94bd65b32a06cb","c09cc321d6f5a01b9241637fe2f8ea3e5a1ac3f597196ced7f26008bcce78262","d9eae877a9472dfe1080666ede4b3239393ce5e48b6c75a45f7846cbccb56629","52c6ab35ddfc5926bfe680307e14f8d6f07dc9c78f23d2bcc2734e5eee72ae85","34a026af604cc231b65d92f8944c9e16676af0bd945019f097891bfd33f036e5","2051a1b7b68f1f46365d59727ceac7147ecca232e650383f3e97472aa70b6224","a8a0001e73d9b014e7ab6bf580725bddcd3ccfaa100fe71e3b4af322480642d2","d087cd1bf504dfd6fe79f3ecb0fa5db7a831e80853a0601f167ae7c8896427be","24b5b668d6b0ce08786a29c9f777ec3695f2039ffa07b997f12c4bdac8437539"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3936,3959],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3936"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the RRC connection setup procedure as specified in 5.3.3.4.","paragraph_zero_based":3961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.8RNA update","paragraph_zero_based":3962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In RRC_INACTIVE state, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T380 expires; or","paragraph_zero_based":3964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if RNA Update is triggered at reception of SIB1, as specified in 5.2.2.4.2:","paragraph_zero_based":3965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T319 is not running and SDT procedure is not ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":3966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate RRC connection resume procedure in 5.3.13.2 with resumeCause set to rna-Update;","paragraph_zero_based":3967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if barring is alleviated for Access Category '8' or Access Category '2', as specified in 5.3.14.4:","paragraph_zero_based":3968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if upper layers do not request RRC the resumption of an RRC connection, and","paragraph_zero_based":3969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the variable pendingRNA-Update is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":3970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate RRC connection resume procedure in 5.3.13.2 with resumeCause value set to rna-Update.","paragraph_zero_based":3971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the UE in RRC_INACTIVE state fails to find a suitable cell and camps on the acceptable cell to obtain limited service as defined in TS 38.304 [20], the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause 'other'.","paragraph_zero_based":3973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:It is left to UE implementation how to behave when T380 expires while the UE is camped neither on a suitable nor on an acceptable cell.","paragraph_zero_based":3974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.9Reception of the RRCRelease by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":3975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.8.","paragraph_zero_based":3977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.10Reception of the RRCReject by the UE","paragraph_zero_based":3978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.15.","paragraph_zero_based":3980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.11Inability to comply with RRCResume","paragraph_zero_based":3981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is unable to comply with (part of) the configuration included in the RRCResume message;","paragraph_zero_based":3983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["78d6ebfd14b709054de5b232be65c47f5e05d745720169191bb2415b7a153cf9","7eee6f8cde4f52e69da915db34e97fb56f74fb3dad4832dc9d9d61476c61b2bd","ed21ce7688719db0c540e6f45391e9263bc5eb1c816ea75251bbb8c84569a6de","32f0106168ab5034a6a26a398b1221fb157b0ef9b3bb1dc9fc232dc97f8058b4","49872d88a873eb784ae4bb26c84f8a0b0535185f26a22418aa025227a201ba2d","ac9e7f2bf0141ffbfebbbbf23f155928907a45c7bb5a7c4ed551b9f677df892c","52b5a50f4b6c5341c315a98516810072a52a9bac6a57f4714f0b5d320030f0ff","2f35c8f3384723ceb6e68e38e50b8ffb92ca53f0636c3afe4da8a336441e7e1d","383f3fa167cd8a4b6664c4d0e3b2e46a3808c39f41c4586ae7ac34bd639f4951","293ddb4db36104ce44cbe66446bc8200319167c393961899e07915aa1fd4b7df","6ae1d8d805d88190dcd74ee207a33e7beeaa04026effffc8397e4423b9da3e27","e2907fa329cb2970163ed5cae935654eaef32df30e3fd0a755a83d42147757d2","16f9127808ea83ef88187a37fbd57e3a400de4b60972f2009a4ec20d6c49a928","cafc89df369faae9db4b327da33a3c745c611a5549a6e8c0d00e08e938247c93","6ae56fee92ce63638c8664185d277ccfdd9b6fa2620b1efe1a5df95c6930458f","5f86ccf7205f2ab586211c1694096e50f7e73c0cc2057ce5e7722e4d6d448c52","499c6dc6d8e1be65954ed3d2bb1cd7c7dbf116da630deec66205eb8d703f0754","429e0b55229cd6580439422c3e152e908b9e5905a5eec2f8df8d3e7cc49729e4","06bb6e31fafcfb0aac0e55690a708f8e03bee81b69d912be9b091e4b5e8dfacd","e006aaf4054103e05ca66e1aa693f17d859ef737f3eaec3f533434c7bc133dca","41029ced819770fc1a02865d695dc3e5177aeea547e7f90b2a370b5677c8ddab","c5916563ba585d0f02b8ace2c8ce35493789e78d06960adfc60a7dbb7fb62297","d414fddeb3b668465f80c2d4a149c85c608525bcbcc62098cd50a226cb1cfd91","4ccfb79c1fbc5235414ea870c4110af1b382d0c9f33275a2fa9944d972fac172"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3960,3983],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3960"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11 with release cause ′RRC Resume failure′.","paragraph_zero_based":3984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE may apply above failure handling also in case the RRCResume message causes a protocol error for which the generic error handling as defined in 10 specifies that the UE shall ignore the message.","paragraph_zero_based":3985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:If the UE is unable to comply with part of the configuration, it does not apply any part of the configuration, i.e. there is no partial success/failure.","paragraph_zero_based":3986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.13.12Inter RAT cell reselection","paragraph_zero_based":3987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reselecting to an inter-RAT cell, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>perform the actions upon going to RRC_IDLE as specified in 5.3.11, with release cause 'other'.","paragraph_zero_based":3989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.14Unified Access Control","paragraph_zero_based":3990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.14.1General","paragraph_zero_based":3991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to perform access barring check for an access attempt associated with a given Access Category and one or more Access Identities upon request from upper layers according to TS 24.501 [23] or the RRC layer. This procedure does not apply to IAB-MT. This procedure does not apply to L2 U2N Relay UE initiating RRC connection establishment or RRC connection resume upon reception of any message from a L2 U2N remote UE via SL-RLC0 or SL-RLC1 in accordance to 5.3.3.1a or 5.3.13.1a.","paragraph_zero_based":3992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"After a PCell change in RRC_CONNECTED the UE shall defer access barring checks until it has obtained SIB1 (as specified in 5.2.2.2) from the target cell.","paragraph_zero_based":3993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.14.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":3994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if timer T390 is running for the Access Category:","paragraph_zero_based":3996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the access attempt as barred;","paragraph_zero_based":3997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if timer T302 is running and the Access Category is neither '2' nor '0':","paragraph_zero_based":3998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the access attempt as barred;","paragraph_zero_based":3999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the Access Category is '0':","paragraph_zero_based":4001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":4002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SIB1 includes uac-BarringPerPLMN-List that contains a UAC-BarringPerPLMN for the selected PLMN or SNPN:","paragraph_zero_based":4004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the procedure in 5.2.2.4.2 for a selected PLMN resulted in use of information in npn-IdentityInfoList and UAC-BarringPerPLMN has an entry with the plmn-IdentityIndex corresponding to used information in this list:","paragraph_zero_based":4005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the UAC-BarringPerPLMN entry with the plmn-IdentityIndex corresponding to used information in the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":4006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4007}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bde0805282175ce21646511680f099c3e09a01a375781019a3c313b617189042","07b6a99dbebd6320785810586b077090f5065a72aba5c43edfceba55f145fc12","4b7a3981ffe81d1700e7f353f1dc6d5f6ce4916c3087a3e827e771f9afe4e9c3","8c187cb245243f5a919b6deaa9ca47ccb7cdac4b18ba6b2e4557caca77fa107e","ea942ea06d7daf1ed092349ee23d42a4fa8cb8a8af7fda323fb571eee2755d12","1e60f5beb7cd6f39f2215aeae21800d2fab33657413bda4c0e1987b18d25a48b","ba3302324c903672d815b490bc33b7bbc4854d5a3248f615537d0976f5016e8e","a53412a89e10df21b8ad9dabfae6531ce57f43295d2cb6c76212f4e69da08a9a","05fc11765a433ee102cf98663ba3b0fa34982bee744a68016738259e46f7f318","60f019ce2edb6bbd3f37d720ea280b804d1f0ed0b7686f914ee3502dd8bd0c9b","e5da5a8ac49e3c0bb499aab1f18278655b0a12952c2c2367790c7f0de03250dc","37de7d1c997a15ef7ef4376258582b3065f83212b69cc00b43e6ba36e9b97b57","2374e32d15fefbea98c2d611e2eb453fcfaa81a5af3cc4ada714d789d5ad889a","22061e06330156f9b316eca87ea5590adce09057029612bbc6f67ed9eca868c9","0606b655a9173d4b418e553769b478bc06d866f8100d247689f8216963cbc1f3","e1944429c62623a78ca6e06fd7c862a61ff84afa5d26dcac02b5879775f1ff65","8accc3b5437f7c52036e62152aaa276315bd50ac06751d5b5533d8fb93e36289","b584dc890871689c5a963b08975620fe91e41df5b9342dc3d9e27480e3ff7b60","b8e904a89eb728f345665c1f47a615e38a9c8015fd8439ac4b2ae9bf635a303f","8f74d2fa3919f3f7d6654c9544782564964fb2215383b84ffb1dd77d9a0845b7","890033d7a94aa6e237f42b1915500ec326541133d8359cdafcc2fdfd95d5e6ee","5fe1f74f7996e06e2ad8493578e786d7ca92dee9adcc55fb37d20ca90a3b59f1","401ac53107165f8e0dc13d3ef5f00d5cc8933e2da7754908e66e3da3f190e262","3059ec9a11f22fd6b677a252e0be4f3752f42c6f0c615c36c67765d3dcb327f0"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[3984,4007],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p3984"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the UAC-BarringPerPLMN entry with the plmn-IdentityIndex corresponding to the selected PLMN and the PLMN-IdentityInfo, if any, or the selected SNPN and the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":4008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if any UAC-BarringPerPLMN entry is selected:","paragraph_zero_based":4009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>in the remainder of this procedure, use the selected UAC-BarringPerPLMN entry (i.e. presence or absence of access barring parameters in this entry) irrespective of the uac-BarringForCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if SIB1 includes uac-BarringForCommon:","paragraph_zero_based":4011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>in the remainder of this procedure use the uac-BarringForCommon (i.e. presence or absence of these parameters) included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":4012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":4014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if uac-BarringForCommon is applicable or the uac-ACBarringListType indicates that uac-ExplicitACBarringList is used:","paragraph_zero_based":4015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the corresponding UAC-BarringPerCatList contains a UAC-BarringPerCat entry corresponding to the Access Category:","paragraph_zero_based":4016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the UAC-BarringPerCat entry;","paragraph_zero_based":4017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the uac-BarringInfoSetList contains a UAC-BarringInfoSet entry corresponding to the selected uac-barringInfoSetIndex in the UAC-BarringPerCat:","paragraph_zero_based":4018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>select the UAC-BarringInfoSet entry;","paragraph_zero_based":4019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>perform access barring check for the Access Category as specified in 5.3.14.5, using the selected UAC-BarringInfoSet as \"UAC barring parameter\";","paragraph_zero_based":4020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":4022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":4024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the uac-ACBarringListType indicates that uac-ImplicitACBarringList is used:","paragraph_zero_based":4025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select the uac-BarringInfoSetIndex corresponding to the Access Category in the uac-ImplicitACBarringList;","paragraph_zero_based":4026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the uac-BarringInfoSetList contains the UAC-BarringInfoSet entry corresponding to the selected uac-BarringInfoSetIndex:","paragraph_zero_based":4027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the UAC-BarringInfoSet entry;","paragraph_zero_based":4028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>perform access barring check for the Access Category as specified in 5.3.14.5, using the selected UAC-BarringInfoSet as \"UAC barring parameter\";","paragraph_zero_based":4029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the access attempt as allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":4031}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ba04b489dd21a1bdfd4