{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reportType is set to rxTxPeriodical and if a (first) measurement result is available:","paragraph_zero_based":4896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":4897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":4898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":4899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon expiry of the periodical reporting timer for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":4900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":4901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the corresponding reportConfig includes a reportType is set to reportSFTD:","paragraph_zero_based":4902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the corresponding measObject concerns NR:","paragraph_zero_based":4903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the drx-SFTD-NeighMeas is included:","paragraph_zero_based":4904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the quantity to be reported becomes available for each requested pair of PCell and NR cell:","paragraph_zero_based":4905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>stop timer T322;","paragraph_zero_based":4906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":4907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else","paragraph_zero_based":4908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for each requested pair of PCell and NR cell or the maximal measurement reporting delay as specified in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":4909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding measObject concerns E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":4910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the pair of PCell and E-UTRA PSCell or the maximal measurement reporting delay as specified in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":4911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reportType is set to reportCGI:","paragraph_zero_based":4912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE acquired the SIB1 or SystemInformationBlockType1 for the requested cell; or","paragraph_zero_based":4913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE detects that the requested NR cell is not transmitting SIB1 (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 13):","paragraph_zero_based":4914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop timer T321;","paragraph_zero_based":4915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":4916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":4917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":4918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon the expiry of T321 for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":4919}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9707b7c14750342c6f87554cbbc36968da962ef518c4b402440ed256dc7873bb","6680b686cf386a12e56682e4facd1c543476d7fc518ce5c9f162a7cbedb6b879","fbdbc2ea6896d73a4f0cded06192d8148b6e168b26670870004960ae04f95dd6","87e686d18ca1dda1f50d9718a794a4d8e08252458c5d86ecb1539b5cda414735","3709ff1018a17abf3a1058a14acf2eaeb41d67de5cddbaccd5b84abf8fb02480","81bd90f08ad4ac2b26dcaf76b3597dd6c3388b5ca632961b624d14d9cc4c34fb","eeedbb82c6c97b5e56ac51372baa7d8b9b7c4926e4901c6623f619c39a820923","ae973136a3ab1b6c399ed0719b5c1cfed6ef87e76eddf360c0f301fc7db946f7","8c7f4249827565a9eb0fe49616402994125ac723971b88e79e0df45c4f62ea7c","be483358bb77f8c6e8b59563cbbbbb6d005bd7e519fb647b3ca163e9110ec6ad","c7b401c967b1b326343beae35cf5ecc1f94a1891a4ac5afe4d0f2b68a1fc6732","46014dc26b580b3ef366908fe48844a932438f901833ab8e75f9f8c0a50ea68b","231578fa5ae28dbf3f4b2ff4fa848abb743a1b9172514a9ea057b16cb19ca0b7","72eb8f7cdb402dbeaae1f093bc87bbb72766dee3bdbb3a2ef14f296a42a8ffe4","d33571a4a572ad79f51c18c2c1753e9cb941f1c0f0aa3b1ecba9cf31e0f96f38","a5867355a15ec90dd2d0f92193a14d4cca3decec743f89f47b22d5028b554c23","30817daa7f3db1afbf40d927a3fb645a7ef0dcb0e02323a027cbf770fc1b9249","5aac425a6b05872e930bfb5eb53aa4323851c0ff4e1f02059a9b7c59856024b9","c5aee4e4b888dc9a0ea6c7c41e8755ad217e749cb576a9c532854bb2be71f302","d5c5825cd4401dd441cf2fc2190e722c88616ded920c6bb093abda086877c389","84e7586f017d1ff04d21b7b550567d78249a95e37bab40b6f067ffd92253be4b","4bdb7a6cdb7bd4897236f309016782628772615a2c6fb2bda3bce6efeac5742c","f1341157b9acba3dbb0398da4f822d717e3ae1f51e8763680a2854aee609655b","50f62a52b42a439bc069e61b21126338d91b420e2af5b2f95d3a298416d2ace5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[4896,4919],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p4896"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":4920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":4921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":4922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>upon the expiry of T322 for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":4923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5.","paragraph_zero_based":4924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.2Event A1 (Serving becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":4925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the NR serving cell corresponding to the associated measObjectNR associated with this event.","paragraph_zero_based":4929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":4935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":4938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":4939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":4940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.3Event A2 (Serving becomes worse than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":4941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4943}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["013b645bc13bf9f57341b5625a740a9f98407f4923fb23ca36c83f8a5d44014b","3f322639655a675d4d6a07c5a2a05a80d09afd447f6b4722786e7e58581a59fe","3eac71bc73193231a25eb2132195e687c320658271f857570b14653d852306ae","3e3d729c8ff80bbd85c822d541bbaef836a5efdcdb9c078ce4661018ca6eb6b7","7f9995f2db43812d51dfdf7224f21fd739535db09cc76cd87926430056b6174c","32630935322