{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the serving cell indicated by the measObjectNR associated to this event.","paragraph_zero_based":4945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":4951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a2-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":4954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":4955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":4956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.4Event A3 (Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell)","paragraph_zero_based":4957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A3-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A3-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the SpCell for Mp, Ofp and Ocp.","paragraph_zero_based":4961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The cell(s) that triggers the event has reference signals indicated in the measObjectNR associated to this event which may be different from the NR SpCell measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":4962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":4964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":4966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e2456f643594451eb88dc4a5312ccb440806fb7982857af0ae9b6af0f17d34fc","7c755a17e7d14ed7e2e1aa3f8eb4929a1866fa9a86eb9817654993902a36de36","0dfe20164619773965454f95964a657d89a76ab1952d6ede0a4271afc03e5974","019f667bc6360194f40ebaf02bac0ee76dd84a808e9934578d75fdea40560b76","53981410d606648604b36edde3576f2831b231bbcd041cb1badf0abb95ed0836","3ea4da2f0adba842a8173b729b8