{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":4968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the reference signal of the neighbour cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell).","paragraph_zero_based":4969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":4970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is the measurement result of the SpCell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":4971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofp is the measurement object specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell).","paragraph_zero_based":4972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocp is the cell specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell), and is set to zero if not configured for the SpCell.","paragraph_zero_based":4973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Off is the offset parameter for this event (i.e. a3-Offset as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Mp are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":4976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Ofp, Ocp, Hys, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":4977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The definition of Event A3 also applies to CondEvent A3.","paragraph_zero_based":4978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.5Event A4 (Neighbour becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":4979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A4-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A4-2, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":4982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":4986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":4987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":4988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell).","paragraph_zero_based":4989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the measurement object specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":4990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":4991}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5c192263d23253d1cc9c82cee15bad9de95d7e36117f2993192a9d9904260bcb","73bc5e1981704c3579c620648b8ca204b5e0cad79c8d1678446a7565550cbb3c","31a3fc1c3d232fb3ca2f4924e194a44219cb8f9e0efc96cf11fb6bcd700df4c3","59bbc86398a31a6544a2b6f559d51235cc64e3b3deb84a0505df12ed8d2ff1b7","32fd579fb95c18a619b08a066ca334cee3597702312c46ffa810602271864f13","d9a30d010b7afa74ce56c26eeef43c51eef0da6817505adf8c72e68375278dae","c6284568d8ba0e1379d70973487e6d6088a46c0fcc57bada969ac15c76f5dc4e","f5b33f63a804194164b8b7afcdaded4d86e9f2b521549f70f361d6838f55c93c","49bbff523f1cfdd69faef8f878e6b1a295816a27a1d82670329bec75fd262d2b","cba78dc9b5a9177dac5bbdc8f4afb3cf72b473641460c79692860dce08abec26","a8e8b752539dc9de6363ab4fb08774269f14b2a145944d64dfd7d036c5493497","84a1ad5f0128290bf011712721ffe5231e5624136fefc7ababdc38db5cd38eeb","c2464f8df83794bb6f94f00a73c12d21f7507468fae2af2d9c2ebc32ed219db2","ffbd3868c2b9d6c9b65aa8a98a0741a0b724eea738ef4fc02f3d18fcc5f53400","9e002787bbd73a96e6feaa3634528c0d6e86c959d18b10d81318375e73ecc937","03e032794a0d7293e7683745acd8e29bc0d6fa8fd4b47ec4d679c43a43e4ee18","50792847e0ee6b7df479d3ba10d6460522b55ae7b646e4ef1ab706659c87177f","4959e037890a7fbbf073ff264edcc1026abb4fb3f3c49f13117c7cab0a881e4b","0c90ab2acae4f36388956e49a5562ab582c10fe3fbaa7f4e32161cebb145f784","0ee785b43eec4e17331818f9a182aceb6bd9177ac558319bbe0cb6a2d5158141","4e4ad7d4fb30ad7bb1d2bcbab9e8141e138fa75c10ef8d8a03f3f21a0ef87bda","33041a9e09d94266ba4f1421a60a8835ce3549930bcbfdea8d331631a8ca8873","0fa1358a45384ac8ba730ba4ea3955fbca672aa21cf2a0291a59b55730b34737","f1982faa882a37a5e303b7