{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a5-Threshold1 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a5-Threshold2 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Mp are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1is expressed in the same unit as Mp.","paragraph_zero_based":5021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:The definition of Event A5 also applies to CondEvent A5.","paragraph_zero_based":5023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.7Event A6 (Neighbour becomes offset better than SCell)","paragraph_zero_based":5024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A6-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A6-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the (secondary) cell corresponding to the measObjectNR associated to this event to be the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The reference signal(s) of the neighbour(s) and the reference signal(s) of the SCell are both indicated in the associated measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":5029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A6-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ocn – Hys > Ms + Ocs + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A6-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ocn + Hys < Ms + Ocs + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the associated measObjectNR), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocs is the cell specific offset of the serving cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the associated measObjectNR), and is set to zero if not configured for the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5039}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1aa0f7f6a76600c1f8bb596b667018e0ed2b1f1701728c7da531bded3b0e99d6","44eda2cfdd1592a3c23f475d0dedf25c5e98905b6cbe41cab75ee7531edf7574","5101a6d12edfe3179fedbc850297f99a368a556c0ec823fc0adef20d8a4d3987","b6752a9fbf72a8b8711bfe42ac4d09d1785464786d9cc895c9c66afcce52bfa3","5d114aca3d786bba340cbf5904dcbcfa06f8891f3782704aba0d6c637afb827d","b9f163314981c61b6df14391618f3d388100dea1aa3244f32a7557d32e4597e5","f4b618bda49d6301e202e84d9a1fce11863385a8f7414baf1bfa90b05a82ee0f","a79a08fb39ffbd77a883fcc29bd18f89dcb09f6f464f1e0b912a985ec9c5aaf2","07771f59f67114bcf7dfaeaeb1db1c9cd9ffe085b03d7e38f875cda15a7e763b","01e71738d5163fcea14cc10d083c82da3223fb64bef953b83760b369e0f9ac95","c7515228e83df34e25766b41229df86ca66e449d094b675f9e1608c23d4d247b","771b2c8fb87586f12a336bb1913ee50dbdf5bbfdce151d46a9e5baf8777d96de","1a8abc031fe9e4f9b226cd59829de80daf345952aa1421ba715ce2b7de3f11cb","38164df26c27324afb35066bd9c59bba79a8988056e79eeb173b8cccec4d9679","5ace8a2d4e9f2913773f89cf9f73f1414e494f3bb49e1810144b8816bac9b8bd","e333242315cce120081f168d10efb4bd0901d5082966c56e42edc6b7e705d339","f960892b15b6141d8d3edf1baafea4c1256858fed5ee1f694f47e260e1cfd428","54f7d28cd367c99421b29eed9adc4d85284e1bbdcf91d83acb094091ac55522d","6942343b9d19d53ae37e76000d12bc391faa7443057c73105214572795eff979","8726ea009d1113596d2fdb863fd08e13838efedc13482892e602bc0777a2b4fb","8442fd8fb53b06dea91c3a7db37b464d6aeb34e1145d72cbd9b88c811db81756","0144d25e61300679dac16a8077413ca8860cb54ddf831de3330bbefd5b64ce4d","69238196d41c2935217cfcea6bf8730c65f33cc11a0b2e49f9baba83ea03128e","6878f3648c13eb3a6c08df7e9cdc5501100629fe85dc65644287d08da5e43940"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5016,5039],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p5016"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Off is the offset parameter for this event (i.e. a6-Offset as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Ms are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn, Ocs, Hys, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.8Event B1 (Inter RAT neighbour becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":5046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the inter-RAT neighbour cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the frequency of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. eutra-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour inter-RAT cell, utra-FDD-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectUTRA-FDD corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour inter-RAT cell).","paragraph_zero_based":5053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the neighbour inter-RAT cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. b1-ThresholdEUTRA as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event, b1-ThresholdUTRA-FDD as defined for UTRA-FDD within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm or in dB, depending on the measurement quantity of the inter-RAT neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.9Event B2 (PCell becomes worse than threshold1 and inter RAT neighbour becomes better than threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":5060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition B2-1 and condition B2-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B2-3 or condition B2-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c911bdeb364da63d4904bb7fa73c9d4715801d1d8f9a3af81af7ccb8ed8ed0f7","3d179117944882aabf08c563e5cf9a7cd6c84e8ee7c09f19f2c80e06d34a3322","8d65e34f20155561a4f062b746d8b7bdf0c884ba7d56838bc7d87555dd8863a3","424134e61c509926943d4452dff238a346aa8116a5c877cd03390aa50ec13c60","94cecf3c439c36e41bb28f63a8e18abda5a3a977c91ea2815c036116e18e8405","5edc3a1f056753eb90ecb56b7652119e7afda1c15f3f5d9d472774008b908344","203e811c1334ae3b17977af8cebf1c8f90bcb2af8b317eb0bdcc1e0d4afb41f7","476a1dd85c4928e58b035ac3ed064c915689121f8f4e24ef3998726cd1649a89","619a842eb225a0aa44e6e256ff94c4a671718dcdab903e316c1d0c1456203fae","19679dfd7d325546bad0e6d9af3087e7c9307f67507c9664708c7811cad477a7","87b51f09730321ebce5a49e685379c3763135ed82f6a0404cb6262fad70f9c6b","44d7a12d8d520c38ad633a865dcc19fb914c5563c0dac70bfa1c079071785821","3079f2e8555164930ebe01532449b5b6fc64dff33bb0e60bc73de269e8da9e75","7e73139f07783d1cbc64f8937f5e5a8576abc7b6d4fdce856d4691d9f38d1ea3","364000f4a67787c428ba2f637bca8aa4d0e5a9ab26345d4e6069cfa8575c0185","691c91933d09413911e2dbbc3af79af2cf2c9e7c3c614d72228e17d150facc05","476f59710c084a908f0fb44e865715d6d710ea4e5ecfbe82e14973f9f6f32df0","c9b492d41cecc2a7519ae53a1da21275497d77eaaf9809a1cbe93d6a7e1f96a0","6938356abe3f238b070a16692ff094d450c16eae3cc3400ded93b11a625ecf92","7e1d7ccb1b4bf7293709bbda9a2e74152227825bc332de26c3f2f9e82eafd90f","266ab27a319750bab0abbfe69dd79f7729ca7984f90586fcbf7123a3b26f4977","5e88146c0d8cf30c6bbbe493ece910c9fbc4495fb3e2411cbe909b94426d5a03","9799cfde5eb5dffeb3c32b0a899d1995a9e3c5e3541bb567c7169d58f90e7b96","d39341590a602f13ea46aaca71080c88711a0ed676aa16fc26eb1c5cf8b65903"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5040,5063],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p5040"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp + Hys < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp – Hys > Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is the measurement result of the PCell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the inter-RAT neighbour cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the frequency of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. eutra-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the frequency of the inter-RAT neighbour cell, utra-FDD-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectUTRA-FDD corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour inter-RAT cell).","paragraph_zero_based":5075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the neighbour inter-RAT cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. b2-Threshold1 as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. b2-Threshold2EUTRA as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event, b2-Threshold2UTRA-FDD as defined for UTRA-FDD within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm or dB, depending on the measurement quantity of the inter-RAT neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mp.","paragraph_zero_based":5083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.10Event I1 (Interference becomes higher than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition I1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5087}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e598