{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition I1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":5088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality I1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mi – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality I1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mi+ Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mi is the measurement result of the interference, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. i1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mi, Thresh are expressed in dBm.","paragraph_zero_based":5097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.11Event C1 (The NR sidelink channel busy ratio is above a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition C1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition C1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality C1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality C1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of channel busy ratio of the transmission resource pool, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR-SL for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. c1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR-SL for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in decimal from 0 to 1 in steps of 0.01.","paragraph_zero_based":5111}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ee4b081e4e253c6ec464751581b556861f5118df020748efb3ff313a684a6b10","6b115e471edc8dd7671a1d4739a5f12dba04a4a6a41087fb2e7e8409c9adf3e0","36319a73acc5cf5648d53001b1df8e5fb2d591b8d35c893ce5d28079cad48eea","6eac2bc0cd83b623957d8f1136c559a6f81ab8ea52652a22c14a2bd326fdeb15","096f271b9ec4b90eb5f14456ef8843b93bc7e5e6e6a96c9eda043b331bcc91de","278d56afdc4104b3727f9067a37ec3b2639767c29d7dac26326433c63fcefb4c","d20bec5043bfceb81e471df55