{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed is in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":5112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":5113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.12Event C2 (The NR sidelink channel busy ratio is below a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition C2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition C2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality C2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality C2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of channel busy ratio of the transmission resource pool, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR-SL for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. c2-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR-SL for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is expressed in decimal from 0 to 1 in steps of 0.01.","paragraph_zero_based":5126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed is in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":5127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Ms.","paragraph_zero_based":5128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.13Void","paragraph_zero_based":5129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.14Void","paragraph_zero_based":5130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.15Event D1 (Distance between UE and referenceLocation1 is above threshold1 and distance between UE and referenceLocation2 is below threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":5131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition D1-1 and condition D1-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition D1-3 or condition D1-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D1-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5135}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3ba80d4fb042eb7f8e44e28c2df4be8fb3928c906af11d58c0d68f17b7b65523","0a9ebf37d59a0fc8f9fdc41d694ec7d60c1be44e18f3ee63a64eb57d01d1ed8a","c51ef6f604510eae8d09aaf4cc43492622e0e719a22afe2f63f14f840b331f03","07c3abe90e9e2d36b2586f79d2d9f9b523106b2bc9f5466da869cd4a61ccc6dc","c87af332251f8646572613ca74c4282a165259027326831f304ca3dfa6552889","b4b2d468dae02912a41f785b8e2d353