{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1-Hys>Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D1-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2+Hys<Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D1-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1+Hys<Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality D1-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2-Hys>Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1 is the distance between UE and a reference location for this event (i.e. referenceLocation1 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event), not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2 is the distance between UE and a reference location for this event (i.e. referenceLocation2 as defined within reportConfigNR for this event), not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresisLocation as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold for this event defined as a distance, configured with parameter distanceThreshFromReference1, from a reference location configured with parameter referenceLocation1 within reportConfigNR for this event.","paragraph_zero_based":5147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold for this event defined as a distance, configured with parameter distanceThreshFromReference2, from a reference location configured with parameter referenceLocation2 within reportConfigNR for this event.","paragraph_zero_based":5148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml1 is expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ml2 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":5150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":5151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":5152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Ml1.","paragraph_zero_based":5153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The definition of Event D1 also applies to CondEvent D1.","paragraph_zero_based":5154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.16CondEvent T1 (Time measured at UE is within a duration from threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition T1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition T1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality T1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5159}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fd0ac67c77c35205f29108687ed706d3339f1f6d8f9b1d5e0dbef403454a2c38","684e49c50908e7aee347e2ccae0466b56cb0eb4fcfbccfa07a4941faae450522","a7bb48767cc9