{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the Aerial UE altitude relative to the sea level.","paragraph_zero_based":5258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys, Thresh are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.bEvent H2 (The Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition H2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition H2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality H2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality H2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the Aerial UE altitude relative to the sea level.","paragraph_zero_based":5271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h2-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h2-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys, Thresh are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.cEvent A3H1 (Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition A3H1-1 and condition A3H1-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A3H1-3 or condition A3H1-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>use the SpCell for Mp, Ofp and Ocp.","paragraph_zero_based":5279}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["330fb909b6eded591d5a601f6ad87b7fcdf22c0d81119ebf8d10cff9ac4f20cc","30e3c7888d1b51ff8323fc4ff229f331b36ef4f51a77221c793ec72d75458658","f554377205e5f00000e63fa64dcd4389ef50198341c4bc509c6a1d824ce6ce46","744023cdd1793e1f61f81b70f16b3c08bf81447c3011809bd6606d5151080d42","d495c063cc0c7c3b3214180b9ee40443663e3739912b5402e173697ae59ce45a","31555de543a670b3a765b7ccd73ae06e77bc73465712cf38b320769fb8c0bd4e","8780a5c02beaded64d69f22ac4522e046e6772ac4a8a36f814bdbf736019ed4d","3f80d1fb7ae5fb8e0dd4cbe1dbe26dec80af778575d96d8f4c2baf497961ae2d","12505195030f47a131a5e67ea471dbeaa2ab984af0c170a1c8785ac8b740fea9","a05ec0ea51342464f2f7c8283069b5ea2002baf7ad21b9ae23609ec363c24876","065a906245019d6a32338145bf7c967dbc560aa1e5d98f460e87c2483358cf54","8a5237a88c489294626963bea875363d65a99891899aa3419153bdeb78712052","927bcd22428a2ee2451500480ebb53fc5c2e6f40ab0183a17e17a47c1fec19b9","c4adf0703166a2ee62039663df13c74d20228baf1e2bd9eb21187e1264e7ac31","2ef337bdfc3895e5818b1709755918ace2447c4159baab500c79bc821a866846","e32e9bee7dcb34d3f7aec7b01eba4fc0739f0e90ee43cef0b41533efda2f0130","848faa4ef7b40c2bdc91cc0b3d4029f5f9a459265063d9c41edfeb94355121fd","64da347d687cb4b2e343251ededb665952c50694bec2ea0b84e8711eecd55001","4fa324b5bf271f7f9b040c3714100829ab98fd6507840556148124752648abae","7ad799da74ea316196b7dd6b305b2606cd1c0bf253ec2bae53465b206914b9c9","7e0566577c473840064ce67c09b6b8b14aa89692ea982681f496ab0a4b78ef1a","7f5aa632de6f123625ab29ef33c8ea7b8880d4891a79b983ce11e0277a8aea0e","ea9fcdcddc989b3cf784a98224d404c17fbad6f9a88b8b3934bb7ebff7196680","110f7e2348ffc0892ea3af2932c74c87b3334195644edcf0ef4285056ea8ed9b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5256,5279],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p5256"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The cell(s) that triggers the event has reference signals indicated in the measObjectNR associated to this event which may be different from the NR SpCell measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":5280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H1-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys1 > Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H1-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys2 > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H1-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys1 < Mp + Ofp + Ocp + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A3H1-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys2 < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the reference signal of the neighbour cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell).","paragraph_zero_based":5291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp is the measurement result of the SpCell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofp is the measurement object specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell).","paragraph_zero_based":5294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocp is the cell specific offset of the SpCell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the SpCell), and is set to zero if not configured for the SpCell.","paragraph_zero_based":5295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys1 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. a3-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Off is the offset parameter for this event (i.e. a3-Offset as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the Aerial UE altitude relative to the sea level.","paragraph_zero_based":5298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys2 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Mp are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys1, Ofp, Ocp, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys2, Thresh are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5303}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b51