{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys2 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. h1-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms, Hys2, Thresh2 are expressed in meters.","paragraph_zero_based":5357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.fEvent A4H2 (Neighbour becomes better than threshold1 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":5358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5359},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition A4H2-1 and condition A4H2-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A4H2-3 or condition A4H2-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":5361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H2-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys1 > Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H2-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms + Hys2 < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H2-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys1 < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A4H2-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms – Hys2 > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. offsetMO as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell).","paragraph_zero_based":5372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the measurement object specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within measObjectNR corresponding to the neighbour cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys1 is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. a4-Hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. a4-Threshold as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5375}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["231515e7ae8efa16a10c66862bed30b7216c2e4b23e