{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the field timeSpent of the entry as the time without PSCell according to the following:","paragraph_zero_based":6936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE experienced a PSCell release since entering the current PCell in RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":6937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the time spent with no PSCell since last PSCell release after entering the current PCell in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":6938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the time spent with no PSCell since entering the current PCell in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":6940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon entering 'camped normally' state in NR (in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE) or E-UTRA (in RRC_IDLE) while previously in 'any cell selection' state or 'camped on any cell' state in NR or LTE:","paragraph_zero_based":6941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include an entry in variable VarMobilityHistoryReport possibly after removing the oldest entry, if necessary, according to following:","paragraph_zero_based":6942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the field timeSpent of the entry as the time spent in 'any cell selection' state and/or 'camped on any cell' state in NR or LTE.","paragraph_zero_based":6943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10UE Information","paragraph_zero_based":6944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.1General","paragraph_zero_based":6945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.10.1-1: UE information procedure","paragraph_zero_based":6947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE information procedure is used by the network to request the UE to report information.","paragraph_zero_based":6948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":6949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The network initiates the procedure by sending the UEInformationRequest message. The network should initiate this procedure only after successful security activation.","paragraph_zero_based":6950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.3Reception of the UEInformationRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":6951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the UEInformationRequest message, the UE shall, only after successful security activation:","paragraph_zero_based":6952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the idleModeMeasurementReq is included in the UEInformationRequest and the UE has stored VarMeasIdleReport that contains measurement information concerning cells other than the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":6953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultIdleEUTRA in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of measReportIdleEUTRA in the VarMeasIdleReport, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":6954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultIdleNR in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of measReportIdleNR in the VarMeasIdleReport, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":6955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the VarMeasIdleReport upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":6956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the logMeasReportReq is present and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarLogMeasReport:","paragraph_zero_based":6957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if VarLogMeasReport includes one or more logged measurement entries, set the contents of the logMeasReport in the UEInformationResponse message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the absoluteTimeStamp and set it to the value of absoluteTimeInfo in the VarLogMeasReport;","paragraph_zero_based":6959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["647625a444d05fe94d0238d701559e551e048d62ff119368ce02ecd1e62085d5","1b9b27085b8e82390ecfb2ccfbd3f92ddf2898256fd3f2cbe3781c293d801016","93a316ab6c0da3ab905c5e4cf2228ba4a4c417902515e85f3d4a14e0fea769a5","71a69c6c490324b0fb3b1d62ce856fdd77339d05ee0ae40e04ce611a94f723d7","a6f03d31d1ac6bbe1f3c344c6e0aeba79e4a15b38b8e010a68da3f91ed1665ec","eb0212b488c4608d85264d04e606317782d2eedb37a7c1e425cfaac267dccbae","6e7745c8ef0b854c8ca5c9d069fb2c5197f0989e742ba1d2b84e2744545331f3","b0204b0496b27cdc7c54de3334bfbd95e1ee55e7c68bb04f9d5032dad09c7741","fa14c09567cb4b3ceb0848bbaeec7ee593577c113656bf37f46eb21af187e372","ae3172e420934b2c520870cae2cebc9b0ac691ffcfb304713da2aa66b8e27197","26ea80affc22f14d853ce0099cfadc8fed1c34d67497464c43d4e96336cfe5fe","b0809f898810662c7fc0f9a30953bd44ce028faf43c5acb3d50cb5c6abc2d16e","808f0c0db20405b1b09757b7c9f9853ff2652c21e19d324f8bd449f3a9c7e1d8","c3245ff8d3b8fd03fa7c195d3675209038c90ec6aa9c3c358133ae3d3f5ea57a","972c35c088bc86ed68534b3bf4f9f5fb3b9cee4d64ba392319ae2430ecff4833","e823fff153fb5fac6c81713ee48f5a5c8b6fb564a0523ec505ffbe2aad3a7ce8","18b18a597f2b61839bb78ec9c66f1da5bb1b97cefe05e3cf663d930a83842f0e","ea579ffea703a72b3f254608282a2b50d8212fddf6e4711d424116f57e00f4b3","5fb8eef827820d4b54bb4a5dfc4fe9dfd5b5e3c694f8983d7c256b3b9e0d81e1","ab5630dbf5c35232b9dfade7242e9d833a8747b27e7ff3ca40400faa10dc8815","9f4976d668186355fd74cae46ed99beb5e5770442751017b573baad3167bcd04","dd933a002b0c78dd1b4028e200daba6ffb36c1e9c5a10b197e002cc1eac450a5","b7e770876b12a4e9bdd93941e03c9074423974b5d58acc9fe16345b4b9d3c203","d491cf6628a4a13c195fa5b88d40f576f64676bdfd62fc3d10af8c4066cb71cb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6936,6959],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p6936"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the traceReference and set it to the value of traceReference in the VarLogMeasReport;","paragraph_zero_based":6960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the traceRecordingSessionRef and set it to the value of traceRecordingSessionRef in the VarLogMeasReport;","paragraph_zero_based":6961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the tce-Id and set it to the value of tce-Id in the VarLogMeasReport;","paragraph_zero_based":6962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the logMeasInfoList and set it to include one or more entries from the VarLogMeasReport starting from the entries logged first, and for each entry of the logMeasInfoList that is included, include all information stored in the corresponding logMeasInfoList entry in VarLogMeasReport;","paragraph_zero_based":6963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the VarLogMeasReport includes one or more additional logged measurement entries that are not included in the logMeasInfoList within the UEInformationResponse message:","paragraph_zero_based":6964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the logMeasAvailable;","paragraph_zero_based":6965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if bt-LocationInfo is included in locationInfo of one or more of the additional logged measurement entries in VarLogMeasReport that are not included in the logMeasInfoList within the UEInformationResponse message:","paragraph_zero_based":6966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableBT;","paragraph_zero_based":6967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if wlan-LocationInfo is included in locationInfo of one or more of the additional logged measurement entries in VarLogMeasReport that are not included in the logMeasInfoList within the UEInformationResponse message:","paragraph_zero_based":6968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the logMeasAvailableWLAN;","paragraph_zero_based":6969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ra-ReportReq is set to true and the UE has random access related information available in VarRA-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":6970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the ra-ReportList in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of ra-ReportList in VarRA-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":6971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the ra-ReportList from VarRA-Report upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":6972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if rlf-ReportReq is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":6973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has radio link failure information or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":6974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set timeSinceFailure in VarRLF-Report to the time that elapsed since the last radio link failure or handover failure in NR;","paragraph_zero_based":6975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the rlf-Report in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of rlf-Report in VarRLF-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":6976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard the rlf-Report from VarRLF-Report upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":6977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the UE is capable of cross-RAT RLF reporting as defined in TS 38.306 [26] and has radio link failure information or handover failure information available in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] and if the RPLMN is included in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10]:","paragraph_zero_based":6978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set timeSinceFailure in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] to the time that elapsed since the last radio link failure or handover failure in EUTRA;","paragraph_zero_based":6979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set failedPCellId-EUTRA in the rlf-Report in the UEInformationResponse message to indicate the PCell in which RLF was detected or the source PCell of the failed handover in the VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10];","paragraph_zero_based":6980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResult-RLF-Report-EUTRA in the rlf-Report in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of rlf-Report in VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10];","paragraph_zero_based":6981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard the rlf-Report from VarRLF-Report of TS 36.331 [10] upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":6982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if connEstFailReportReq is set to true and the UE has connection establishment failure or connection resume failure information in VarConnEstFailReport or VarConnEstFailReportList and if the RPLMN is equal to plmn-Identity stored in VarConnEstFailReport or in at least one of the entries of VarConnEstFailReportList:","paragraph_zero_based":6983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7982a7b8bc5af6e14afcca08aec795e1562b5ac00ce2b23d814afdc221cc3b39","97bdd5fe6c65bb08879d3ab66d075f1a1b6d56135843cb562dcfc71380343a53","fe7a292013d68baae7b9a87617c73533e047c370f3e91c50c1a6c762d2ce2842","12c1cfb5d3fa9c3a6dc80fb4608b77f378ca7266877b32118c44d19adb4abf73","d94d54e8e88cfa5d6f8cae658739ecc4eedeb7570351808515b830944ae47eb1","9719e077be3b45564464f5eb3007388ca5ab9615c3b43dbe