{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mbs-NeighbourCellList-r17             MBS-NeighbourCellList-r17                                            OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":9456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-ConfigPTM-List-r17                SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofDRX-ConfigPTM-r17)) OF DRX-ConfigPTM-r17   OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":9457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pdsch-ConfigMTCH-r17                  PDSCH-ConfigBroadcast-r17                                            OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":9458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    mtch-SSB-MappingWindowList-r17        MTCH-SSB-MappingWindowList-r17                                       OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":9459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    lateNonCriticalExtension              OCTET STRING                                                         OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":9460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension                  SEQUENCE {}                                                          OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":9461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":9462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MBSBROADCASTCONFIGURATION-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":9464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":9465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MBSBroadcastConfiguration field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":9467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdsch-ConfigMTCH","paragraph_zero_based":9468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Provides parameters for acquiring the PDSCH for MTCH. When this field is absent, the UE shall use parameters in pdsch-ConfigMCCH to acquire the PDSCH for MTCH.","paragraph_zero_based":9469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mbs-SessionInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":9470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Provides the configuration of each MBS session provided by MBS broadcast in the current cell.","paragraph_zero_based":9471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mbs-NeighbourCellList","paragraph_zero_based":9472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of neighbour cells providing one or more MBS broadcast services via broadcast MRB that are provided by the current cell. This field is used by the UE together with mtch-NeighbourCell field signalled for each MBS session in the corresponding MBS-SessionInfo. When an empty mbs-NeighbourCellList list is signalled, the UE shall assume that MBS broadcast services signalled in mbs-SessionInfoList in the MBSBroadcastConfiguration message are not provided in any neighbour cell. When a non-empty mbs-NeighbourCellList is signalled, the current serving cell does not provide information about MBS broadcast services of a neighbour cell that is not included in mbs-NeighbourCellList, i.e., the UE cannot determine the presence or absence of an MBS service of a neighbour cell that is absent. When the field mbs-NeighbourCellList is absent, the current serving cell does not provide information about MBS broadcast services in the neighbouring cells, i.e. the UE cannot determine the presence or absence of an MBS service in neighbouring cells based on the absence of this field.","paragraph_zero_based":9473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MBSInterestIndication","paragraph_zero_based":9475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MBSInterestIndication message is used to inform network that the UE is receiving/ interested to receive or no longer receiving/ interested to receive MBS broadcast service(s) via a broadcast MRB.","paragraph_zero_based":9476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SRB1","paragraph_zero_based":9477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: AM","paragraph_zero_based":9478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: DCCH","paragraph_zero_based":9479}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f4bd846289b50eb502641751d9e7d796c55024fe41350138a702ced67f7ffc36","d934a55ddfe5660a2491774b35134de39bba86b04079859abf086617079c4fe7","48b3de17156c0066ce92e6bbf73ab100c8a21c4117d3af1dc40c3ab325c740d1","c2d9bf130d6082ea119cef16bf63558032a731fc6bb9445d1837bdddabba73f9","9cff859f4d9eaeb458f7c125c2b6ea2e5a37f238091c544eccb400310f0f7ae5","bb08fc7531a65cf1057f0ddc43ae569c82e3b28f6768cb91a2378dc885c1501c","b10368e58e8c4e7c2931b4e7dd59f3f82ed46c9f06922a382ab45992c600347f","0629a4efa72de7ea4c9754c72bfa05fbd3800a9bd00f51c545452b055e7587e7","162bb78c71bea2b5ad3671976603cc7230c07204b78835124fa23ce2e3bc0eb2","e5e9a2f646c100d885dd4c9b2f17e2719152c52557acfd6e015125442377f6ce","5de23ddf0bdbab11ccf61aeeb655d1694b809991384feb28805e6d0a3cf36bc5","3a1565ef42cfb65817de6153d27336e0b40e7156f875f06f505644c31780256d","80a66051c12d8360017fd9237d2d73dd16b83117a392575a6cfaf9a8bbb6232a","d58881d4574c6d953fd5447d60a7c3912ea1da6bf068be04c36548d209b70733","56a273b4b094f28b75fff1623effd3c327215b7b136b94a3403e7abc06b1c10a","c332f4771badd263daadefce5245425edf6f28ccaa883d9dec82f7e5c7123415","6bf70e8166a2d171046fc473fb7461b88d656d9952cd4b9e295a31595b79ac26","fde63b5b0d46d5edf3d3bd4f6fd7851f855e91ce4a407dff4165750bb5f0b192","fda11147c1fe3e3482b154f99e0882487e71828214d28d25b7e8992b39b6a9a2","dc33b3a6c24d41e813560d74ad9830390640ce2c28d4339e686167ca1b1b9316","25dd72b1bbe311da9035d89b4135ad5e6d2da91069f2e7af11186ae120f509f0",