{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nas-SecurityParamFromNR             OCTET STRING                                                OPTIONAL,   -- Cond HO-ToEPCUTRAN","paragraph_zero_based":9720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    lateNonCriticalExtension            OCTET STRING                                                OPTIONAL,","paragraph_zero_based":9721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension                MobilityFromNRCommand-v1610-IEs                             OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":9722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":9723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MobilityFromNRCommand-v1610-IEs ::=     SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":9725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    voiceFallbackIndication-r16             ENUMERATED {true}                                       OPTIONAL,   -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":9726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension                    SEQUENCE {}                                             OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":9727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":9728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MOBILITYFROMNRCOMMAND-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":9730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":9731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MobilityFromNRCommand-IEs field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":9733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nas-SecurityParamFromNR","paragraph_zero_based":9734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If targetRAT-Type is eutra, this field is used to deliver the key synchronisation and Key freshness for the NR to LTE/EPC handovers and a part of the downlink NAS COUNT as specified in TS 33.501 [11] and the content of the parameter is defined in TS 24.501 [23]. If targetRAT-Type is utra-fdd, this field is used to deliver the key synchronisation and Key freshness for the NR to FDD UTRAN handover and a part of the downlink NAS COUNT as specified in TS 33.501 [11] and the content of the parameter is defined in TS 24.501 [23].","paragraph_zero_based":9735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"targetRAT-MessageContainer","paragraph_zero_based":9736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field contains a message specified in another standard, as indicated by the targetRAT-Type, and carries information about the target cell identifier(s) and radio parameters relevant for the target radio access technology. A complete message is included, as specified in the other standard. See NOTE 1","paragraph_zero_based":9737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"targetRAT-Type","paragraph_zero_based":9738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the target RAT type.","paragraph_zero_based":9739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"voiceFallbackIndication","paragraph_zero_based":9740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the handover is triggered by EPS fallback for IMS voice as specified in TS 23.502 [43].","paragraph_zero_based":9741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The correspondence between the value of the targetRAT-Type, the standard to apply, and the message contained within the targetRAT-MessageContainer is shown in the table below:","paragraph_zero_based":9743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_