wn cause value being used by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":9929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ue-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":9930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UE identity included to retrieve UE context and to facilitate contention resolution by lower layers.","paragraph_zero_based":9931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–RRCReconfiguration","paragraph_zero_based":9933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The RRCReconfiguration message is the command to modify an RRC connection. It may convey information for measurement configuration, mobility control, radio resource configuration (including RBs, MAC main configuration and physical channel configuration) and AS security configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":9934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SRB1 or SRB3","paragraph_zero_based":9935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c05d4dfafa8253508a6f5e5cdfd4f468efc4b28fd2d03b6a40ec186514367002","b5374c374e027645298da9a81a7898ca72c7374ee8e16b86c32ae727f4274eed","bd2f3448e9f5e89ca1b2d49690bf71512f67da36162b2b2b3bee4148e53451f0","37efa90a598182ee46b1f5251af9e9c24da15d0fadb50dcd46b46573344c99d4","a2e8df370c735ddef970f176d103d68722678119e63fb43cfd09012570bd530d","e6331aba4184f25da25918d61e61c353044775eb9e2172390ec5276208b89396","c9f6c69f2a860be21eee6b6cff1428b371e92089a79e5d70277186f608629023","73f4a1a0e2d388c614fcb4a4a20d963390ff6e66c67c65a8d48e2650cb3f7deb","c4fd54876f14009b3ca3e68c919c1367b91455037249c16bd79115b4daf9010b","ae7589845da616c8e9af9379c84cd6b38d90a8d574edd4d53a3411cda60ae748","6d263ef6288b1af7b5e788b5b0d720bb0fd22316af77a9d36a6f9ce8e5d2b12b","8afe751