{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    spare                               BIT STRING (SIZE (12))","paragraph_zero_based":11112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":11113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRC-PosSystemInfoRequest-r16-IEs ::=  SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":11115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    requestedPosSI-List                   BIT STRING (SIZE (maxSI-Message)),  --32bits","paragraph_zero_based":11116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    spare                                 BIT STRING (SIZE (11))","paragraph_zero_based":11117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":11118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-RRCSYSTEMINFOREQUEST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":11120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":11121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":11122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RRCSystemInfoRequest-IEs field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":11123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requested-SI-List","paragraph_zero_based":11124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of requested SI messages which are configured by schedulingInfoList in si-SchedulingInfo and schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 (if present) in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":11125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is not present:","paragraph_zero_based":11126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of SI messages configured by schedulingInfoList in si-SchedulingInfo in SIB1, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":11127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is present:","paragraph_zero_based":11128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE generates a list of concatenated SI messages by appending the SI messages containing type1 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 to the SI messages configured by schedulingInfoList in si-SchedulingInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":11129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of concatenated SI messages, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":11130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedPosSI-List","paragraph_zero_based":11131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of requested SI messages which are configured by posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo and schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 (if present) in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":11132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is not present:","paragraph_zero_based":11133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of SI messages configured by posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo in SIB1, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":11134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is present:","paragraph_zero_based":11135}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["dc2b3e5d522fbf0ed2d65019bf18479ce51ace951c62ef881365d16fb71b0ff9","92a74e582cfc