{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-RxLevMinOffsetCell","paragraph_zero_based":13344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"Qrxlevminoffsetcell\" in TS 38.304 [20]. Actual value Qrxlevminoffsetcell = field value * 2 [dB].","paragraph_zero_based":13345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-RxLevMinOffsetCellSUL","paragraph_zero_based":13346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"QrxlevminoffsetcellSUL\" in TS 38.304 [20]. Actual value QrxlevminoffsetcellSUL = field value * 2 [dB].","paragraph_zero_based":13347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-PositionQCL","paragraph_zero_based":13348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the QCL relation between SS/PBCH blocks for a specific intra-frequency neighbor cell as specified in TS 38.213 [13], clause 4.1. If provided, the cell specific value overwrites the value signalled by ssb-PositionQCL-Common in SIB2 for the indicated cell.","paragraph_zero_based":13349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":13351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":13352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SharedSpectrum2","paragraph_zero_based":13353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optional present, Need R, if this intra-frequency or neighbor cell operates with shared spectrum channel access. Otherwise, it is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":13354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SIB4","paragraph_zero_based":13356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB4 contains information relevant for inter-frequency cell re-selection (i.e. information about other NR frequencies and inter-frequency neighbouring cells relevant for cell re-selection), 