{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    q-QualMinOffsetCell                 INTEGER (1..8)                              OPTIONAL        -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":13656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":13657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SIB5-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":13659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":13660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":13661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB5 field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":13662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"carrierFreqListEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":13663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of carrier frequencies of E-UTRA. If the carrierFreqListEUTRA-v1610/ carrierFreqListEUTRA-v1700 is present, it shall contain the same number of entries, listed in the same order as in the carrierFreqListEUTRA (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":13664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dummy","paragraph_zero_based":13665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is not used in the specification. If received it shall be ignored by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":13666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-ExcludedCellList","paragraph_zero_based":13667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of exclude-listed E-UTRA neighbouring cells.","paragraph_zero_based":13668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-FreqNeighHSDN-CellList","paragraph_zero_based":13669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of neighbouring EUTRA HSDN cells as specified in TS 36.304 [27].","paragraph_zero_based":13670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"eutra-multiBandInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":13671},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of frequency bands in addition to the band represented by carrierFreq for which cell reselection parameters are common, and a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission values, as defined in TS 36.101 [22], table 6.2.4-1, for the frequency bands in eutra-multiBandInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":13672},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"highSpeedEUTRACarrier","paragraph_zero_based":13673},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If the field is present, the UE shall apply the enhanced NR-EUTRA inter-RAT measurement requirements to support high speed up to 500 km/h as specified in TS 38.133 [14] to the E-UTRA carrier.","paragraph_zero_based":13674},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"idleModeMeasVoiceFallback","paragraph_zero_based":13675},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether E-UTRA idle/inactive measurements and reporting for EPS fallback can be used.","paragraph_zero_based":13676},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"p-MaxEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":13677},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The maximum allowed transmission power in dBm on the (uplink) carrier frequency, see TS 36.304 [27].","paragraph_zero_based":13678},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"q-QualMin","paragraph_zero_based":13679}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2fab6ef0786efb3ae81bba724d32739a38b652213e004eb6bf32fcb465d85be2","03c5a8ae262807ffd27cf154188e295b3dbf2f9a9a5d8eaaf01b71959e6b13c0","98fa183a848990b7d678eb7dc943a71760a79b25a3cf416f0d3f9aa37e96bf5e","dbc13c7d82b8ecac20cab2b567e073aa639896c2b9a289758a88fce1f917ba84","9df59160d0299688c9da7a026c111942917a7baa21f98d6740ea86ee5da905a3","1bdc9e1f18fd05b54977b6d7dd6f3d7b5e5463a9fa7163df826b0a8cd0a65751","53fe386122fbe26dd5c32bd190a804d7a3131ada4a582c76c6731a356f3e