{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NTN-NeighCellConfig-r17 ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":14208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ntn-Config-r17                           NTN-Config-r17                                  OPTIONAL,       -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":14209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    carrierFreq-r17                          ARFCN-ValueNR                                   OPTIONAL,       -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":14210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    physCellId-r17                           PhysCellId                                      OPTIONAL        -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":14211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":14212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SIB19-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14215},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB19 field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":14217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"distanceThresh","paragraph_zero_based":14218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Distance from the serving cell reference location and is used in location-based measurement initiation in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE, as defined in TS 38.304 [20]. Each step represents 50m.","paragraph_zero_based":14219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ntn-Config","paragraph_zero_based":14220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Provides parameters needed for the UE to access NR via NTN access such as Ephemeris data, common TA parameters, k_offset, validity duration for UL sync information and epoch.","paragraph_zero_based":14221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ntn-NeighCellConfigList, ntn-NeighCellConfigListExt","paragraph_zero_based":14222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Provides a list of NTN neighbour cells including their ntn-Config, carrier frequency and PhysCellId. This set includes all elements of ntn-NeighCellConfigList and all elements of ntn-NeighCellConfigListExt. If ntn-Config is absent for an entry in ntn-NeighCellConfigListExt, the ntn-Config provided in the entry at the same position in ntn-NeighCellConfigList applies. Network provides ntn-Config for the first entry of ntn-NeighCellConfigList. If the ntn-Config is absent for any other entry in ntn-NeighCellConfigList, the ntn-Config provided in the previous entry in ntn-NeighCellConfigList applies.","paragraph_zero_based":14223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"referenceLocation","paragraph_zero_based":14224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference location of the serving cell provided via NTN quasi-Earth fixed system and is used in location-based measurement initiation in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE, as defined in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":14225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-Service","paragraph_zero_based":14226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the time information on when a cell provided via NTN quasi-Earth fixed system is going to stop serving the area it is currently covering. The field indicates a time in multiples of 10 ms after 00:00:00 on Gregorian calendar date 1 January, 1900 (midnight between Sunday, December 31, 1899 and Monday, January 1, 1900). The exact stop time is between the time indicated by the value of this field minus 1 and the time indicated by the value of this field.","paragraph_zero_based":14227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SIB20","paragraph_zero_based":14229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB20 contains the information required to acquire the MCCH/MTCH configuration for MBS broadcast.","paragraph_zero_based":14230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SIB20 information element","paragraph_zero_based":14231}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3a1c56a86821539470170986802006f673db19f4c46198adfeafbae0f1876f5e","1767e18849b4544f17ab6c6086aad642dc753f493be862dfaa2563c72409aff8","9b4d45cb8319c3ef0a5559033265cd0e27e55023fd582fd09a8e7a364ad28598","465603dfa9cecf42741fc86a852aa8c81931015ad26a9a34b1d1651ae5dae66d","9a5f76493d93f513a4e7a888d77e5f93dfc7d16048b7650f0a5c6c204c9ed295","68da9b670e19ffd0906dabe0c3371c2f16ba40055d43143b15689ba56b2538c6","a16aef60096c7959ac64e3a0e9de997f140d7d53b54a661deba461561ba6064e","ca853f6d7b290bc746b59d588138bde9d975acb57770592768a7b1df6510db1f","16a044c8bc05586d8960603f32d5aab3bcd7da1f5294c5734cd4967cf9e13a81","af299bb6d32957cca0719b41d17ea921e083dbc62eb2342613167a8b2440aa16","672ff0c9284afa2fb75469b6929ebc9507ebbb80b896ccf45fbe6d8aba92fac5","843f9489c5613c5ae9f4f560fcd4c7372f2daf341b01efee9aa159e4f0442501","82dcd73b8be72a6e541b0c7c4e6a8f9a96d54b310b20915959929ec2c55e61e2","d03f64e42ac184eae16742d230cac5521f95258755eb194f3bb822d0698429d8","2c119829fee967c1a89ad1bf08edaaf1af466fe21d9b5970e03b62861553ecdf","eeeda3a14472e7abcf83a251db7fb602acb0293c65ef3f77aa28089baf12b480","eee2a0d77b8b20a378fa91411527309ae425db93295f829c13d978ec2c569a96","de8e928958eb45beb7a9fb0483e240c353dfe3a5aded90f5ba139abb3623c410","7f25ada26d776416418d34543cc539e6718c540c7996eec66d61081751496f69","a8d18109e70a718b37af825742e37bbbfb1adfbe9656a01c04941e4387e462da","0b9f1e70c9fb00454523ded8f4680e34f0a53b1d637fcf200b1fd3e9d6244553","01d0dc64d20150621cedc32fd4d3d2f892648d3b0494df25f6c1a3b8c593b351","801c43ed5eb1f1bde7011bfc84d8ffde9297d678bff8490e21c8acffcad3ff81","bd55662cf8326462de9e9a4355b8404b415b5d5f9e0c19ce0215dd5fd4f2be2e"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[14208,14231],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p14208"}
