{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BeamFailureRecoveryRSConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":14786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateBeamRS-List","paragraph_zero_based":14787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of reference signals (CSI-RS and/or SSB) identifying the candidate beams for recovery. The network always configures this parameter in every instance of this IE.","paragraph_zero_based":14788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateBeamRS-List2","paragraph_zero_based":14789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of reference signals (CSI-RS and/or SSB) identifying the candidate beams for recovery.","paragraph_zero_based":14790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rsrp-ThresholdBFR","paragraph_zero_based":14791},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L1-RSRP threshold used for determining whether a candidate beam may be included by the UE in MAC CE for BFR (see TS 38.321 [3] and TS 38.213 [13], clause 6). The network always configures this parameter in every instance of this IE.","paragraph_zero_based":14792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BetaOffsets","paragraph_zero_based":14794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BetaOffsets is used to configure beta-offset values, see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3.","paragraph_zero_based":14795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BetaOffsets information element","paragraph_zero_based":14796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":14797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BETAOFFSETS-START","paragraph_zero_based":14798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14799},{"lit