{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":14808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BETAOFFSETS-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":14811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BetaOffsets field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":14813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetACK-Index1","paragraph_zero_based":14814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 2 bits HARQ-ACK (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 11.","paragraph_zero_based":14815},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetACK-Index2","paragraph_zero_based":14816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 11 bits HARQ-ACK (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 11.","paragraph_zero_based":14817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetACK-Index3","paragraph_zero_based":14818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Above 11 bits HARQ-ACK (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 11.","paragraph_zero_based":14819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part1-Index1","paragraph_zero_based":14820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 11 bits of CSI part 1 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":14821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part1-Index2","paragraph_zero_based":14822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Above 11 bits of CSI part 1 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":14823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part2-Index1","paragraph_zero_based":14824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Up to 11 bits of CSI part 2 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":14825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"betaOffsetCSI-Part2-Index2","paragraph_zero_based":14826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Above 11 bits of CSI part 2 bits (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.3). When the field is absent the UE applies the value 13.","paragraph_zero_based":14827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":14828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BetaOffsetsCrossPri","paragraph_zero_based":14829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BetaOffsetsCrossPri is used to configure beta-offset values for cross-priority HARQ-ACK multiplexing on PUSCH.","paragraph_zero_based":14830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BetaOffsetsCrossPri information element","paragraph_zero_based":14831}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f82b6d7e0d7b88cd7508f14e1d947ba0d52af0cf79a2faab230e1b46fb34e268","54419a2af2ae962aca8b75f1ce80b69eb2896225c5ee7545e4e5c042b99f952b","b3db6c1cb80a7e6db9c188967d8bbf8f7f26422bd53256bd249d39705e2542b7","738b6c9ff51353f2a7dfd9152051d62c200cb30909cf24aad8a5ecbad3f18654","2d73f9b94dc3cef1ef8055e64b87707770f2e71d1182ddfc7119506285fc4485","f93316371d9f1605795f9e65308b4b3aa4bc99390cb361999a8ec6a2ca29e058","3471746a0fcabaa2a3dbf6986cb0ec6bb56ef6010412a5acf72ef77c7124765d","2b68654141bb2af1e5e2def4788003ca8be6798d931209d3502d6fad931871a7","e2b96d8f9577c5097cf61b479bcc861fdbb2cc83dfa4d1a2312123672424383b","dc59faa1e972c1097954737710c323a35a7bea2ab84279d1fd0cff5efe1fd510","b0f837e16e53f54e541b5d2d0