{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dlCarrier","paragraph_zero_based":15648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates DL carrier activation state for this carrier and the related active BWP Index, if activated.","paragraph_zero_based":15649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ulCarrier","paragraph_zero_based":15650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates UL carrier activation state for this carrier and the related active BWP Index, if activated.","paragraph_zero_based":15651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":15652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CellGroupConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":15653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bap-Address","paragraph_zero_based":15654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BAP address of the parent node in cell group.","paragraph_zero_based":15655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bh-RLC-ChannelToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":15656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of the backhaul RLC entities and the corresponding MAC Logical Channels to be added and modified.","paragraph_zero_based":15657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bh-RLC-ChannelToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":15658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of the backhaul RLC entities and the corresponding MAC Logical Channels to be released.","paragraph_zero_based":15659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"f1c-TransferPath","paragraph_zero_based":15660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The F1-C transfer path that an EN-DC IAB-MT should use for transferring F1-C packets to the IAB-donor-CU. If IAB-MT is configured with lte, IAB-MT can only use LTE leg for F1-C transfer. If IAB-MT is configured with nr, IAB-MT can only use NR leg for F1-C transfer. If IAB-MT is configured with both, it is up to IAB-MT to select an LTE leg or a NR leg for F1-C transfer. If the field is not configured, the IAB node uses the NR leg as the default one.","paragraph_zero_based":15661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"f1c-TransferPathNRDC","paragraph_zero_based":15662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The F1-C transfer path that an NR-DC IAB-MT should use for transferring F1-C packets to the IAB-donor-CU. If IAB-MT is configured with mcg, IAB-MT can only use the MCG for F1-C transfer. If IAB-MT is configured with scg, IAB-MT can only use the SCG for F1-C transfer. If IAB-MT is configured with both, it is up to IAB-MT to select the MCG or the SCG for F1-C transfer.","paragraph_zero_based":15663},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"mac-CellGroupConfig","paragraph_zero_based":15664},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MAC parameters applicable for the entire cell group.","paragraph_zero_based":15665},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"npn-IdentityInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":15666},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to transfer npn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1 of the SCell. The UE uses this field to translate the plmn-Index in MCCH of SCell to SNPN Identity. If this field and plmn-IdentityInfoList are both absent, the UE uses the npn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1 of the PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":15667},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"plmn-IdentityInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":15668},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is used to transfer plmn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1 of the SCell. The UE uses this field to translate the plmn-Index in MCCH of SCell to PLMN Identity. If this field and npn-IdentityInfoList are both absent, the UE uses the plmn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1 of the PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":15669},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"prioSCellPRACH-OverSP-PeriodicSRS","paragraph_zero_based":15670},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When configured, the UE applies UL power control prioritization by prioritizing PRACH transmission on SCell over semi-persistent and/or periodic SRS transmission as defined in subclause 7.5 of TS 38.213 [13].","paragraph_zero_based":15671}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["855fda5a54bc72055c537a31607cafcd8c146e7a706920642ed2bd15f7f9fc65","5d94cc0de1e4465e2d547d6ae6f6c58fd4ec3f45e99ed23c87f08ca8eb190d4a","8acd85c65c2a31b28aeca4b822b814065f5e2c491c4e5070628c5a80ea5ec360","7178200f7a09df3a37998572ea53861c64947505e88e0f60396bc43f62c2a123","97daa0a203920d4c6e7ac80b9ab863844d4ff4c0976c0afe33d49e80dde528da","4e3ccde824bafa9aa62c927a60161ced609d7a0f8c8dd3ff2cb78cc0e464bd8b","2796624098602d2ca06fa5dd202d2f172f71b09defc2644c27f1cbe997e58f84","2020d6e8de53a4c7986899e52c980b43f4a35716bb485a7ec1a05d5ada4386ef","548af10a2bd2dd651e29b93efb5d60db217df06bcdd77a565756b081a856ee9d","decc054fb3b5c3bc742bcee246c7fa90f7ae8a9263000f3dde2e021edd8e9211","82acc9756df49b1b0f88fd7b46c720afdf3b22e830c48d1bdee51eeb03e63f27","0650fc3a9bc03bcf1681be856ee3b21312dda5a552f4fdd029434051f3eada7a","c036ef6be061ea91c20d7e92827c670b4c676bd7f8319b9a780045032e733d17","382c8fafea9f2f8c06985956b614e1a833ab85947a991a42ea40277fc09cd12a","14a21febc21151936eb106902790dbce2121cd6f3d1662b1645b4888e7869b58","5fa4eb04be8f348dbf1d38f32faddf438c794e81666c3480ba7b62b5da605bce","057daeda22b30d93993039d79345ecb6d44c5d86deaee9f12798bd75c6f8011f","6addad6b2f7dd0042c589fdbe1d472df86c616d4e955adaab532fe0e4eb80486","79f27d2ae9a5716fafe0ec3e47fe873c498660ab4601d8e9e348b557745e42ea","f285ccf7ac0f9a1d60b576a6ed95b5dda9ecf200553393a5a314b156e64774d6","873a2cd8eaf1426ce396246f5dd8491d7d828963e39842b9d10d495ad7947564","ea517af17e1e88f1864439a650d20f1cfaef520447486839100fbde682e18109","113ef1be9b21fdf89d12c0f5bdbd91bf53fb9c572f73b5e5b91e49837dbc9715","d9e1f301ef78bc36d9a63b0e20f9733348ba6b2