{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Frequency-occupancy of CSI-IM (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.4)","paragraph_zero_based":17040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicityAndOffset","paragraph_zero_based":17041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodicity and slot offset for periodic/semi-persistent CSI-IM. Network always configures the UE with a value for this field for periodic and semi-persistent CSI-IM-Resources (as indicated in CSI-ResourceConfig). A change of configuration between periodic or semi-persistent and aperiodic for a CSI-IM-Resource is not supported without a release and add.","paragraph_zero_based":17042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierLocation-p0","paragraph_zero_based":17043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM subcarrier occupancy of the CSI-IM resource for Pattern0 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.4)","paragraph_zero_based":17044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierLocation-p1","paragraph_zero_based":17045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM subcarrier occupancy of the CSI-IM resource for Pattern1 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.4)","paragraph_zero_based":17046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"symbolLocation-p0","paragraph_zero_based":17047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM symbol location of the CSI-IM resource for Pattern0 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.4)","paragraph_zero_based":17048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"symbolLocation-p1","paragraph_zero_based":17049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM symbol location of the CSI-IM resource for Pattern1 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.4)","paragraph_zero_based":17050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":17052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":17053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PeriodicOrSemiPersistent","paragraph_zero_based":17054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need M, for periodic and semi-persistent CSI-IM-Resources (as indicated in CSI-ResourceConfig). The field is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":17055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-IM-ResourceId","paragraph_zero_based":17057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-IM-ResourceId is used to identify one CSI-IM-Resource.","paragraph_zero_based":17058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-IM-ResourceId information element","paragraph_zero_based":17059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-IM-RESOURCEID-START","paragraph_zero_based":17061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-IM-ResourceId ::=               INTEGER (0..maxNrofCSI-IM-Resources-1)","paragraph_zero_based":17063}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ab367346fb0c57b41c1661aa7bc0dc9dad044277a653cea8d9670c4e5311f14b","d2ef6c1e282baf853418add29d8bbd40eb1a74356130707f37c8000d480e4dc8","76f66ab82d9af07e3249aeb3772886e85b5943734275f3e31002c2b549f2e430","ff73f5637346ceeade19cec7aea6053d560e60b289a9948c700aac2d576dcf81","56890962bed7ac24306da964ca35fddffc25e34eb41a1ba52179eb527122431d","e7b03f698dccb225fb0bb4b95c44122e2e323e734b3e73c997f93dc3c6196d78","99e6bbb22ff47accbd36dbd179ec5e69cf6d3a0c4134a35f21078f7d668775f4","d8edf44eaf271e6d8f1740e7a143f1ef8041c46a533abbe99deb6d933035973d","d673d769b3e91187f51a418c