{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-ReportConfigId is used to identify one CSI-ReportConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":17424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ReportConfigId information element","paragraph_zero_based":17425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-REPORTCONFIGID-START","paragraph_zero_based":17427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ReportConfigId ::=              INTEGER (0..maxNrofCSI-ReportConfigurations-1)","paragraph_zero_based":17429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-REPORTCONFIGID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-ResourceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":17434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-ResourceConfig defines a group of one or more NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSet, CSI-IM-ResourceSet and/or CSI-SSB-ResourceSet.","paragraph_zero_based":17435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ResourceConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":17436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-RESOURCECONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":17438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ResourceConfig ::=      SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":17440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-ResourceConfigId        CSI-ResourceConfigId,","paragraph_zero_based":17441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-RS-ResourceSetList      CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":17442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        nzp-CSI-RS-SSB              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":17443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"            nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetList  SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofNZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSetsPerConfig)) OF NZP-CSI-RS-ResourceSetId","paragraph_zero_based":17444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                                                                                            OPTIONAL, -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"            csi-SSB-ResourceSetList     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourceSetsPerConfig)) OF CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId  OPTIONAL  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        },","paragraph_zero_based":17447}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["55b1a6f5d8e14c760569a8c2a9c770227293a74a318afe5daec051cbf1a6c034","22cc3663285148252f13ad13770f4d527932942770019d1fe664948a7b00f438","ba9b731777def4fe3cfd8b5a66e48f10738efa6729f2f5b421f9cf4b3de1913b","6867e5b2f094f1dde387f35038e56304f0ce0b25910e34404cd0b85e546069f4","c0071c83165b832c8a9ce2a068d94b3c259a0b8a951e0bc59c9da6c0a7b7a62b","2c41bdd012528c6e8ffa743c07c676e0842dee17cc1bc699c1290e9bdd6aa540","8035773cc7618d2221bbb3d23aab71c6774eaff687dfd105a51ff49245e64431","dcc96fdea6534b799601ad781dec8ec305a6fefef6c167f2385e0dc3710a7609","5dbaf94be9630628d734d00e0f579cf50dc739db79e830955373cb1f4ba34656","01bcf05bbe1154e1854367698c2b02ab9596d083f764d1ebe04166cd3c523e82","f359984cb04f3c5a21d3377126c89e56091b9c5264ab2e0bb938fa1c9697cbfe","1c00449003f849dfdddbdbeaafc4f2fcbd07b95680e0154aeb28455f444e75e6","10420d3d418ac1b24a5b925ce4e2892da0c0514b8b5b242a0010c486d17eaf0f","67893f4d1f6a7fedf04348778f7500bae26e07c757d85c588081acbcc02b104c","b5930577b430a5004e9f71f63eadc7c4c2760a09837ae088e26c553f1c47e31d","29fe3c987be533fc307ba6f8b3916658fdee3ea6a470a78d59251dec92821b47","13b74858bcd78756a00cfa966373e70ffabda3d89b17be33154318d25a622427","9542438fed52b80a4e918a5867a4e6fb657003d674a26f8ce4d73943c3a717fc","ca8a937164ac4c46a4326b01a62c2a90a53130ee10d2d2f010954f8746f638c2","ace5e135fc1a8f079a100e6d300a250838c994f9cefafa445ff9499a8038166e","7a2c39cdffbff41d31718bfa6abaccb8a39191366b000fa0eeb70c732aaa59df","259ad55c5c7a20d77b13d054355b7f0649d61624285e98c19d472652cb23b221","e39f60bc8afc696eda45bf77c151e801aa6a4cbef99487bfdeb0db8de73e45f3","5677eb47d4b494c4b7057899635704fdbc42542416c53f91be9676e5d921e448"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[17424,17447],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p17424"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        csi-IM-ResourceSetList      SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofCSI-IM-ResourceSetsPerConfig)) OF CSI-IM-ResourceSetId","paragraph_zero_based":17448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    },","paragraph_zero_based":17449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    bwp-Id                      BWP-Id,","paragraph_zero_based":17451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    resourceType                ENUMERATED { aperiodic, semiPersistent, periodic },","paragraph_zero_based":17452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":17453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":17454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-SSB-ResourceSetListExt-r17      CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId                                                  OPTIONAL  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17455},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":17456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-RESOURCECONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-ResourceConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bwp-Id","paragraph_zero_based":17463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The DL BWP which the CSI-RS associated with this CSI-ResourceConfig are located in (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.2.","paragraph_zero_based":17464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-IM-ResourceSetList","paragraph_zero_based":17465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of references to CSI-IM resources used for CSI measurement and reporting in a CSI-RS resource set. Contains up to maxNrofCSI-IM-ResourceSetsPerConfig resource sets if resourceType is 'aperiodic' and 1 otherwise (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.2).","paragraph_zero_based":17466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-ResourceConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":17467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Used in CSI-ReportConfig to refer to an instance of CSI-ResourceConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":17468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"csi-SSB-ResourceSetList, csi-SSB-ResourceSetListExt","paragraph_zero_based":17469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of references to SSB resources used for CSI measurement and reporting in a CSI-RS resource set (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.2). The csi-SSB-ResourceSetListExt provides additional references and can only be configured if csi-SSB-ResourceSetList is configured and groupBasedBeamReporting-v1710 is configured in the CSI-ReportConfig that indicates this CSI-ResourceConfig as resourcesForChannelMeasurement. If groupBasedBeamReporting-v1710 is configured in the IE CSI-ReportConfig that indicates this CSI-ResourceConfig as resourceForChannelMeasurement, the network configures 2 resource sets, which may be two CSI SSB resource sets (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.1.2 and 5.2.1.4.2). In this case, in TS 38.212 [17] Table 6.3.1.1.2-8B, the first resource set is indicated by a resource set indicator set to 0 and the second resource set by a resource set indicator set to 1.","paragraph_zero_based":17470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nzp-CSI-RS-ResourceSetList","paragraph_zero_based":17471}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_