{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17640},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17641},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-RS-RESOURCEMAPPING-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17642},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17643},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17644},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-RS-ResourceMapping field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17645},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cdm-Type","paragraph_zero_based":17646},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CDM type (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":17647},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"density","paragraph_zero_based":17648},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Density of CSI-RS resource measured in RE/port/PRB (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.5.3).","paragraph_zero_based":17649},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Values 0.5 (dot5), 1 (one) and 3 (three) are allowed for X=1, values 0.5 (dot5) and 1 (one) are allowed for X=2, 16, 24 and 32, value 1 (one) is allowed for X=4, 8, 12.","paragraph_zero_based":17650},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For density = 1/2, includes 1-bit indication for RB level comb offset indicating whether odd or even RBs are occupied by CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":17651},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"firstOFDMSymbolInTimeDomain2","paragraph_zero_based":17652},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Time domain allocation within a physical resource block. See TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.5.3.","paragraph_zero_based":17653},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"firstOFDMSymbolInTimeDomain","paragraph_zero_based":17654},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Time domain allocation within a physical resource block. The field indicates the first OFDM symbol in the PRB used for CSI-RS. See TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.5.3.","paragraph_zero_based":17655},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"freqBand","paragraph_zero_based":17656},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Wideband or partial band CSI-RS, (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":17657},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyDomainAllocation","paragraph_zero_based":17658},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Frequency domain allocation within a physical resource block in accordance with TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.5.3. The applicable row number in table 7.4.1.5.3-1 is determined by the frequencyDomainAllocation for rows 1, 2 and 4, and for other rows by matching the values in the column Ports, Density and CDMtype in table 7.4.1.5.3-1 with the values of nrofPorts, cdm-Type and density below and, when more than one row has the 3 values matching, by selecting the row where the column (k bar, l bar) in table 7.4.1.5.3-1 has indexes for k ranging from 0 to 2*n-1 where n is the number of bits set to 1 in frequencyDomainAllocation.","paragraph_zero_based":17659},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"nrofPorts","paragraph_zero_based":17660},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of ports (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":17661},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17662},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-SemiPersistentOnPUSCH-TriggerStateList","paragraph_zero_based":17663}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["46698b9b8435204f433c58e7fb59929ebcc2cef98e02c90cd5a5f8c5645380d2","dec41035cc72541b90cbbf73eaeaf105574d9e83cf6d7b7efd2b3612c885d3ee","853a16128a89c8c29c6486530542fdf3d775ed3728a23df1a4bd40e66ecf99f5","fd5f1dc57b1a00019e