{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet information element","paragraph_zero_based":17688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESET-START","paragraph_zero_based":17690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet ::=             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":17692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-SSB-ResourceSetId               CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId,","paragraph_zero_based":17693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    csi-SSB-ResourceList                SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourcePerSet)) OF SSB-Index,","paragraph_zero_based":17694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":17695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":17696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    servingAdditionalPCIList-r17        SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourcePerSet)) OF ServingAdditionalPCIIndex-r17  OPTIONAL  -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":17698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ServingAdditionalPCIIndex-r17  ::=  INTEGER(0..maxNrofAdditionalPCI-r17)","paragraph_zero_based":17701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESET-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSet field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servingAdditionalPCIList","paragraph_zero_based":17707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the physical cell IDs (PCI) of the SSBs in the csi-SSB-ResourceList. If present, the list has the same number of entries as csi-SSB-ResourceList. The first entry of the list indicates the value of the PCI for the first entry of csi-SSB-ResourceList, the second entry of this list indicates the value of the PCI for the second entry of csi-SSB-ResourceList, and so on. For each entry, the following applies:","paragraph_zero_based":17708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- If the value is zero, the PCI is the PCI of the serving cell in which this CSI-SSB-ResourceSet is defined;","paragraph_zero_based":17709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- otherwise, the value is additionalPCIIndex-r17 of an SSB-MTC-AdditionalPCI-r17 configured using the additionalPCI-ToAddModList-r17 in ServingCellConfig, and the PCI is the additionalPCI-r17 in this SSB-MTC-AdditionalPCI-r17.","paragraph_zero_based":17710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17711}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["64c6a1ae7cd7230a8624241c8f48964a69376b87eed4dc87b91421e2951f9f8b","f2687817fc54c3fd94eac0e844995c9acb51afddc51b8599d19b3f94143a4b8d","004f9a5a6fa1c068a23f31c0696688df7115d2eafa85a161adc0ba7277c680b7","8214003bc84f19bb3d18a9846d498dc2c076c5c74ed72e103ecf718031404963","a717b1763b64cba644c68e63711ba273e74cff55de6f6c37b101884d05306872","f62cb7490a7730eded2de731431bc509026fbb7e7fa988d077d581bdec2c18b8","ba152745a7b5d4535f0da528e9da54af8a4d38ac77395b0b297f3e2ce22f4754","cdbdb027ba99777918fd8b56fcb44adc1fd2abaf08cb93300ca0477d