{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId","paragraph_zero_based":17712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId is used to identify one SS/PBCH block resource set.","paragraph_zero_based":17713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceId information element","paragraph_zero_based":17714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESETID-START","paragraph_zero_based":17716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CSI-SSB-ResourceSetId ::=           INTEGER (0..maxNrofCSI-SSB-ResourceSets-1)","paragraph_zero_based":17718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CSI-SSB-RESOURCESETID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DedicatedNAS-Message","paragraph_zero_based":17723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DedicatedNAS-Message is used to transfer UE specific NAS layer information between the 5GC CN and the UE. The RRC layer is transparent for this information.","paragraph_zero_based":17724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DedicatedNAS-Message information element","paragraph_zero_based":17725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":17726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DEDICATED-NAS-MESSAGE-START","paragraph_zero_based":17727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DedicatedNAS-Message ::=        OCTET STRING","paragraph_zero_based":17729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DEDICATED-NAS-MESSAGE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DL-PPW-PreConfig","paragraph_zero_based":17734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DL-PPW-PreConfig provides configuration for a measurement window where a UE is expected to measure the DL PRS, if it is inside the active DL BWP and with the same numerology as the active DL BWP. Based upon the indication received in the configuration, the UE identifies whether the DL PRS priority is higher than that of the other DL signals or channels and accordingly determines, for example, the UE is expected to measure the DL PRS and is not expected to receive other DL signals and channels.","paragraph_zero_based":17735}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3115ea5b09dcc1e8ad5c2c35e2d17412e4b91c9b9b9ea15780647906c6036741","225d0a976da5756ea807aefd92c3ff41847d2bd02903f49cb8c2587c34147610","66efff8b398159e228209900f078d35d9a79d174df43d6fcf7c38f2b8e602a82","e22f0ad243e2e90e3e1987e5948bb6a704336261dc0f7f3dfe9b68137454533d","be23e57025cae105b779b9439bf11964a930f265dab370046a103e3aeb458fa3","f701c0046bd284860a55ff9795802ce49786a9b2c78d3e223e021d34d6b52e65","01b810487574ee4deca3f9e958eb2e2f3ea739fd7a41d2835f9f7531d3fc5e8b","03f117af87a465f0525fb30ad59ad9f8667671a699f9d0a81d90ef34c09b9259","a2fa73b893678454a2500cb7167f4be2e8f24d52836f745d06dc12684278cbf7","62dc07928df1c5c6139d40df4c00232078236eca26bb9eefa92529f75e67361f","856eabce2259228788286cf02cc423e10e8bcb2f90a9ad56477