{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dmrs-Downlink-r16               ENUMERATED {enabled}                                                        OPTIONAL    -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":17928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":17929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":17931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DMRS-DOWNLINKCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":17934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DMRS-DownlinkConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":17936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dmrs-AdditionalPosition","paragraph_zero_based":17937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Position for additional DM-RS in DL, see Tables 7.4.1.1.2-3 and 7.4.1.1.2-4 in TS 38.211 [16]. If the field is absent, the UE applies the value pos2. See also clause 7.4.1.1.2 for additional constraints on how the network may set this field depending on the setting of other fields.","paragraph_zero_based":17938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dmrs-Downlink","paragraph_zero_based":17939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether low PAPR DMRS is used, as specified in TS38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.1.1.","paragraph_zero_based":17940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"dmrs-Type","paragraph_zero_based":17941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Selection of the DMRS type to be used for DL (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.1.1). If the field is absent, the UE uses DMRS type 1.","paragraph_zero_based":17942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxLength","paragraph_zero_based":17943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The maximum number of OFDM symbols for DL front loaded DMRS. len1 corresponds to value 1. len2 corresponds to value 2. If the field is absent, the UE applies value len1. If set to len2, the UE determines the actual number of DM-RS symbols by the associated DCI. (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.1.2).","paragraph_zero_based":17944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"phaseTrackingRS","paragraph_zero_based":17945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configures downlink PTRS. If the field is not configured, the UE assumes that downlink PTRS are absent. See TS 38.214 [19] clause 5.1.6.3.","paragraph_zero_based":17946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scramblingID0","paragraph_zero_based":17947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL DMRS scrambling initialization (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.1.1). When the field is absent the UE applies the value physCellId configured for this serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":17948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scramblingID1","paragraph_zero_based":17949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DL DMRS scrambling initialization (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 7.4.1.1.1). When the field is absent the UE applies the value physCellId configured for this serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":17950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":17951}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ccc6c0d860bca5f0d26277072b688eeb3550b1b81299f233ef7bcd2d34cdf7db","23d2a159a9fb600eb2ac673aab4fd6aad2c9bd88f8d011a7d2ff257fa099328e","ad2a76c68a8e6d342c2af170d61f3d6943572d57cdc028033150ea398d813c19","15b3d27dbcba45c316ce405aacb157ba16368789bc6670aeef18f6f5825c9970","5082b8428a75f7f9128b245a29ec5529cb21