{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SubgroupConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18192},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subgroupsNumPerPO","paragraph_zero_based":18193},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Total number of subgroups per Paging Occasion (PO) for UE to read subgroups indication from physical-layer signaling. The field represents the sum of CN-assigned and UEID-based subgroups supported by the network. When PEI-Config is configured, there is always at least one subgroup (UEID-based subgroup or CN-assigned subgroup) configured.","paragraph_zero_based":18194},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subgroupsNumForUEID","paragraph_zero_based":18195},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of subgroups per Paging Occasion (PO) for UE to read subgroups indication from physical-layer signaling, for UEID-based subgrouping method. When present, the field is set to an integer smaller than or equal to subgroupsNumPerPO. subgroupsNumPerPO equals to subgroupsNumForUEID when the network does not configure CN-assigned subgrouping. When pei-Config is configured, the field is absent when the network only configures CN-assigned subgrouping. Both this field and subgroupsNumPerPO are equal to 1 when the network does not configure subgrouping. When pei-Config is configured, if the field is absent, the UE uses subgrouping according to TS 38.304 [20], clause 7.3.0.","paragraph_zero_based":18196},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18197},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":18198},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":18199},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SharedSpectrum2","paragraph_zero_based":18200},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optional present, Need R, if this cell operates with shared spectrum channel access. Otherwise, it is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":18201},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18202},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DownlinkPreemption","paragraph_zero_based":18203},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DownlinkPreemption is used to configure the UE to monitor PDCCH for the INT-RNTI (interruption).","paragraph_zero_based":18204},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DownlinkPreemption information element","paragraph_zero_based":18205},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":18206},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DOWNLINKPREEMPTION-START","paragraph_zero_based":18207},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18208},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DownlinkPreemption ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18209},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    int-RNTI                            RNTI-Value,","paragraph_zero_based":18210},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    timeFrequencySet                    ENUMERATED {set0, set1},","paragraph_zero_based":18211},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    dci-PayloadSize                     INTEGER (0..maxINT-DCI-PayloadSize),","paragraph_zero_based":18212},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    int-ConfigurationPerServingCell     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofServingCells)) OF INT-ConfigurationPerServingCell,","paragraph_zero_based":18213},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":18214},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18215}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e4451f2eea952c283514838be9d693261c1be9bf4269f24eb8181206c447a1f2","b0afd6a03ac930bb9