{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL-r17                INTEGER (0..448)","paragraph_zero_based":18312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL","paragraph_zero_based":18319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of symbols of the BWP where the transport block was received. drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL-r17 is only applicable for SCS 480 kHz and 960 kHz. If configured, the UE shall ignore drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerDL (without suffix) for SCS 480 kHz and 960 kHz.","paragraph_zero_based":18320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL","paragraph_zero_based":18321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of symbols of the BWP where the transport block was transmitted. drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL-r17 is only applicable for SCS 480 kHz and 960 kHz. If configured, the UE shall ignore drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerUL (without suffix) for SCS 480 kHz and 960 kHz.","paragraph_zero_based":18322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms. ms0 corresponds to 0, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-LongCycleStartOffset","paragraph_zero_based":18325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-LongCycle in ms and drx-StartOffset in multiples of 1 ms. If drx-ShortCycle is configured, the value of drx-LongCycle shall be a multiple of the drx-ShortCycle value.","paragraph_zero_based":18326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-onDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSecond). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-RetransmissionTimerDL","paragraph_zero_based":18329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was received. value sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-RetransmissionTimerUL","paragraph_zero_based":18331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in number of slot lengths of the BWP where the transport block was transmitted. sl0 corresponds to 0 slots, sl1 corresponds to 1 slot, sl2 corresponds to 2 slots, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-ShortCycleTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of drx-ShortCycle. A value of 1 corresponds to drx-ShortCycle, a value of 2 corresponds to 2 * drx-ShortCycle and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":18334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-ShortCycle","paragraph_zero_based":18335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["739bccb57d7538aa382115f8f99bd03a6460e1f81f646633dd189f261ef234d2","3b938d1397391d3cf9fa76231a341c970796005ad30754ece009fd018324c086","2c66d4cf02f6