{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSECONDARYGROUP-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSecondaryGroup field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-InactivityTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiple integers of 1 ms. ms0 corresponds to 0 ms, ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. The network configures a drx-InactivityTimer value for the second DRX group that is smaller than the drx-InactivityTimer configured for the default DRX group in IE DRX-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":18365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-onDurationTimer","paragraph_zero_based":18366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in multiples of 1/32 ms (subMilliSeconds) or in ms (milliSeconds). For the latter, value ms1 corresponds to 1 ms, value ms2 corresponds to 2 ms, and so on, as specified in TS 38.321 [3]. The network configures a drx-onDurationTimer value for the second DRX group that is smaller than the drx-onDurationTimer configured for the default DRX group in IE DRX-Config.","paragraph_zero_based":18367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–DRX-ConfigSL","paragraph_zero_based":18369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE DRX-ConfigSL is used to configure additional DRX parameters for the UE performing sidelink operation with resource allocation mode 1, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":18370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSL information element","paragraph_zero_based":18371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":18372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSL-START","paragraph_zero_based":18373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DRX-ConfigSL-r17 ::=            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-HARQ-RTT-TimerSL-r17        INTEGER (0..56),","paragraph_zero_based":18376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    drx-RetransmissionTimerSL-r17   ENUMERATED {sl0, sl1, sl2, sl4, sl6, sl8, sl16, sl24, sl33, sl40, sl64, sl80, sl96, sl112, sl128,","paragraph_zero_based":18377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                sl160, sl320, spare15, spare14, spare13, spare12, spare11, spare10, spare9, spare8,","paragraph_zero_based":18378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"                                                spare7, spare6, spare5, spare4, spare3, spare2, spare1}","paragraph_zero_based":18379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-DRX-CONFIGSL-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18383}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ab8e301221d31e63db48d87adba6cb44fb1c363d4967ec88d4d8b56895ba9bc4","dc0733b0103df9a9da38ef7d2f8dbb91c126e8a4f641f292a13cb48c8dc98e39","b35c73d5ca04ed5620224a3752aa0f654da9672e9f234224c2e5a8bd43dd1c76","5ca40e40566cb6dea51c2be511b52b6f54c6e200d1d4f6a4a8c4ab30d0fac2ca","3d24c52af2ad3c686bb5503d26499dae7d78ea661a203e87153ee81c2a9068b3","