},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQUENCYINFOUL-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoUL field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteFrequencyPointA","paragraph_zero_based":18739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Absolute frequency of the reference resource block (Common RB 0). Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A. Note that the lower edge of the actual carrier is not defined by this field but rather in the scs-SpecificCarrierList (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.4.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":18740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"additionalSpectrumEmission","paragraph_zero_based":18741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The additional spectrum emission requirements to be applied by the UE on this uplink. If both additionalSpectrumEmission (without suffix) and additionalSpectrumEmission-v1760 are absent, the UE uses value 0 for the additionalSpectrumEmission (see TS 38.101-1 [15], tables 6.2.3.1-1A, 6.2A.3.1.1-2 and 6.2A.3.1.2-2, TS 38.101-2 [39], tables 6.2.3.1-2 and 6.2A.3.1-2, and TS 38.101-5 [75], table 6.2.3.1-1A). Network configures the same value in additionalSpectrumEmission for all uplink carrier(s) of the same band with UL configured and if signalled, the same vaue in additionalSpectrumEmission-v1760 for all uplink carrier(s) of the same band with UL configured, except for additionalSpectrumEmission value corresponding to NS_55/NS_57. If NS_55/NS_57 (see TS 38.101-1 [15], table 6.2.3.1-1) is applicable for at least one uplink carrier, the network may configure either NS_55/NS_57 or NS_01 for these uplink carriers, and NS_01 for the remaining uplink carrier(s) of band n77. The additionalSpectrumEmission is applicable for all uplink carriers of the same band with UL configured.","paragraph_zero_based":18742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"additionalSpectrumEmissionAerial","paragraph_zero_based":18743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["264f4f019cc950cda4bccffe848102513ed0ce585b41ec05c1c4305e12830a58","cd8bca513b6b3c63a41afec76021a0f68dc100a0960f0a40b3428d3281e6ba8c","c108ca26ef2ab9c847e7eb20781e3296a306d37a345df7fad7d111d2df32b062","bb3ee27fad9b61ab8aa9ba3105db131fd2c1bf20b0530773e3c842420f90c22a","0cfb880480ee94f99b91096817b0f3d53be40e33524ce05b4273723942f9ac30","51078c5a625ac96dc81d0d3346cb9f31b9e7301deea15a7de1d7ad44937682af","8a818b18ed6c9e307070d340113f242aaccabedaa79f941dab5dd3cca7dd3161","60cbdd1eff95dcb4c98910202cec247b51e61c775752739d147990ca288ce60b","3dd8309e34b415b32ebd04395cc3c594f2a0155be438615553b4e038a2cb233a","033c3b728b8d508927e39ec9bce4eff745ef86b5d673fd8ab9f2c446b15802fd","bc0332b76079c7a93dcd34bd8de73952540735d63df38a833b6dd9281914e1ad","5fbb3a93118d0a23a61a000fbb62d12bb60a368393b6f7b440faa8cac167c20c","4e8ce81d0132feec5d5d980de9ecd23330bf4fb38484badc6ddcadb704f60fc1","3394fd0fb221c09e51172cbdc3e72c7eb3391319dc56c0606a1f692bfb2d687f","844a7c46fe2e22c038088bfe6d65939678671ccc1fbbbbbce0e13d7f2d6a8a72","c0ed87747b9a765363fd39a9165ad0f62bc92f2ce525fe0e6399ddce0f77b278","b66888bcf65c3395b3e30b594f30564a20ce740ba1334942ee9a5935744c085c","be7b5df195b502c8d1ec2a418b83392665109e81cd3f5ea4778ea99655008f3f","cab063251969685c29beaab9518085b8ad78c5a4ab2576f27ce22385b057f485","174213444c81dbedaa82f871d1a511fb215324bbd69966d465663d881a3e25ac","475e3dc3252d5e9cc473cd0a5c4d3e63a1e9f438b44510d2858334f59ee56c1b","c1e2a8ca6b06757afe67f6f33ac89d29e61d4160833175a07cc825a88bc25435","7da1769b61f02eb5ddbbbadaf21a7d4ac69bfb0e292e230bbb578e675dc2bf2a","f55cdd3b3e5cdc768347420048ff12fd6a01dd85adc2ecc8b5959560026a38dd"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[18720,18743],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx:p18720"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The additional spectrum emission requirements to be applied by the aerial UE on this uplink (see TS 38.101-1 [15], tables TBD, TS 38.101-2 [39], tables TBD, and TS 38.101-5 [75], table TBD). If the field is absent, the aerial UE uses value indicated by the field additionalSpectrumEmission/ additionalSpectrumEmission-v1760.","paragraph_zero_based":18744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyBandList","paragraph_zero_based":18745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List containing only one frequency band to which this carrier(s) belongs. Multiple values are not supported.","paragraph_zero_based":18746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyShift7p5khz","paragraph_zero_based":18747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Enable the NR UL transmission with a 7.5 kHz shift to the LTE raster. If the field is absent, the frequency shift is disabled.","paragraph_zero_based":18748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"p-Max","paragraph_zero_based":18749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Maximum transmit power allowed in this serving cell. The maximum transmit power that the UE may use on this serving cell may be additionally limited by p-NR-FR1 (configured for the cell group) and by p-UE-FR1 (configured total for all serving cells operating on FR1). If absent, the UE applies the maximum power according to TS 38.101-1 [15] in case of an FR1 cell, TS 38.101-2 [39] in case of an FR2 cell or TS 38.101-5 [75] in case of an NTN cell. In this release of the specification, if p-Max is present on a carrier frequency in FR2, the UE shall ignore the field and applies the maximum power according to TS 38.101-2 [39]. Value in dBm. This field is ignored by IAB-MT, the IAB-MT applies output power and emissions requirements, as specified in TS 38.174 [63].","paragraph_zero_based":18750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scs-SpecificCarrierList","paragraph_zero_based":18751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of carriers for different subcarrier spacings (numerologies). Defined in relation to Point A. The network configures a scs-SpecificCarrier at least for each numerology (SCS) that is used e.g. in a BWP (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 5.3).","paragraph_zero_based":18752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":18754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":18755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FDD-OrSUL","paragraph_zero_based":18756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present if this FrequencyInfoUL is for the paired UL for a DL (defined in a FrequencyInfoDL) or if this FrequencyInfoUL is for a supplementary uplink (SUL). It is absent, Need R, otherwise (if this FrequencyInfoUL is for an unpaired UL (TDD).","paragraph_zero_based":18757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FDD-TDD-OrSUL-Optional","paragraph_zero_based":18758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need R, if this FrequencyInfoUL is for the paired UL for a DL (defined in a FrequencyInfoDL), or if this FrequencyInfoUL is for an unpaired UL (TDD) in certain bands (as defined in clause 5.4.2.1 of TS 38.101-1 and in clause 5.4.2.1 of TS 38.104 [12]), or if this FrequencyInfoUL is for a supplementary uplink (SUL). It is absent, Need R, otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":18759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FrequencyInfoUL-SIB","paragraph_zero_based":18761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FrequencyInfoUL-SIB provides basic parameters of an uplink carrier and transmission thereon.","paragraph_zero_based":18762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoUL-SIB information element","paragraph_zero_based":18763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":18764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQUENCYINFOUL-SIB-START","paragraph_zero_based":18765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoUL-SIB ::=             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1280d70c9a0a828ed70d2473602b2dfbd785b5f1ff49ffae2d5792a0aac9b337","ac78040edc0ce24e22297be2db8ed47977c539e3c2208c9b01499996f20d11b7","d059da04ff850cdf45140d3131c3243fb2c1af4603b4932f9c50ae41b1309078","c4b192f01a0f91ef0d799387de51b1be7618d1337086b99c24188f1bd68298bb","6cd28c4e56a836d2a886344f8e098ed2c6eab3aa6880897f0a0cced3ab3dd3cb","12d5f851d597a59dce85429cd369cae229ec986e138892fe291762f98b303558","46ab8fb0a73c05e8d7e8800385f5325f54242f3961c1b6e4c6f79d6bbd66b5d5","4f5e9ce72b333d9bbe8434a134298366028320d71a8ba1c6edaa5b780b3ec949","60bb9bf3fefe7a0eb03d8db5276e9125ec59755484861902492e2d653b2cebe6","5fd630e4035cf6256ba27cdfb7dd955f4172a4e6213fcf599204a76628ea2382","0d2b9e706ba67e705046ce0eef430ffe58522d50da7faaefd39cfc371df50a4c","626f8639bf46b4e587abe9ef2829ee31b77e12e268bcd7cc4ef449b985858f2c","bb77fc02656c4302e104edc5e054dad8537d04e5f26545120a4837ed0c8476a0","5c3115983f8e3a9e9a862cf7679a3878afbea9b52ab2cc4351e3c22d6119937c","1e03a78eba8472d3713379d79686940e139268f1b0f1d19259ed3d2d904c0931","88cdd2b7cc002157ab0d9b6d3915af6fdcccf1f946d822116ae16d353ca9c63c","92b40f8ebf9187fef0919f8bdd1c3ecebd894837fcb357e2c01b2f47897be18c","ae82e7bffb678c719a50205384ca6e320597eeb6d41b5418dbbda7c753fb7ff4","b047d3ed7633ab9a56f844abaed8b093c140eeb115c4d9d9ea717245bfd24881","4892071c48a2322f3b26d8d1519188a23986a41b3c4a879a