{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyBandList                   MultiFrequencyBandListNR-SIB                            OPTIONAL,   -- Cond FDD-OrSUL","paragraph_zero_based":18768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    absoluteFrequencyPointA             ARFCN-ValueNR                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Cond FDD-OrSUL","paragraph_zero_based":18769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    scs-SpecificCarrierList             SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSCSs)) OF SCS-SpecificCarrier,","paragraph_zero_based":18770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    p-Max                               P-Max                                                   OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":18771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyShift7p5khz                ENUMERATED {true}                                       OPTIONAL,   -- Cond FDD-TDD-OrSUL-Optional","paragraph_zero_based":18772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":18773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":18774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyBandListAerial-r18         MultiFrequencyBandListNR-Aerial-SIB-r18                 OPTIONAL    -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":18775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ]]","paragraph_zero_based":18776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoUL-SIB-v1760 ::=       SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":18779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    frequencyBandList-v1760             MultiFrequencyBandListNR-SIB-v1760","paragraph_zero_based":18780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":18781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQUENCYINFOUL-SIB-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":18784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":18785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FrequencyInfoUL-SIB field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":18786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"absoluteFrequencyPointA","paragraph_zero_based":18787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Absolute frequency of the reference resource block (Common RB 0). Its lowest subcarrier is also known as Point A. Note that the lower edge of the actual carrier is not defined by this field but rather in the scs-SpecificCarrierList (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.4.4.2).","paragraph_zero_based":18788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyBandList","paragraph_zero_based":18789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Provides the frequency band indicator and a list of additionalPmax and additionalSpectrumEmission values as defined in TS 38.101-1 [15], table 6.2.3.1-1, TS 38.101-2 [39], table 6.2.3.1-2, and TS 38.101-5 [75], table 6.2.3.1-1. The UE shall apply the first listed band which it supports in the frequencyBandList field. If frequencyBandList-v1760 is present, it shall contain the same number of entries, listed in the same order as in frequencyBandList (without suffix).","paragraph_zero_based":18790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyBandListAerial","paragraph_zero_based":18791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["85e713d53e90fcf4eb1d7a73f20a353ae40f60d5f7cde60b03a0e407bc37a157","c578d8505be6c43bdd03a3e133feb111a696ce485685f3709fdba143c0431796","cc797d27815da1ac217a9f3007e31f05197bfa