{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ssb-ToMeasure","paragraph_zero_based":19704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The set of SS blocks to be measured within the SMTC measurement duration (see TS 38.215 [9]). When the field is absent in VarMeasIdleConfig, the UE measures on all SS-blocks.","paragraph_zero_based":19705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ss-RSSI-Measurement","paragraph_zero_based":19706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the SSB-based RSSI measurement configuration. If the field is absent in VarMeasIdleConfig, the UE behaviour is defined in TS 38.215 [89], clause 5.1.3.","paragraph_zero_based":19707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"validityAreaList","paragraph_zero_based":19708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the list of frequencies and optionally, for each frequency, a list of cells within which the UE is required to perform measurements while in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE. ","paragraph_zero_based":19709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MeasIdToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":19711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MeasIdToAddModList concerns a list of measurement identities to add or modify, with for each entry the measId, the associated measObjectId and the associated reportConfigId.","paragraph_zero_based":19712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasIdToAddModList information element","paragraph_zero_based":19713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":19714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASIDTOADDMODLIST-START","paragraph_zero_based":19715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasIdToAddModList ::=              SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofMeasId)) OF MeasIdToAddMod","paragraph_zero_based":19717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasIdToAddMod ::=                  SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":19719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    measId                              MeasId,","paragraph_zero_based":19720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    measObjectId                        MeasObjectId,","paragraph_zero_based":19721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    reportConfigId                      ReportConfigId","paragraph_zero_based":19722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":19723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASIDTOADDMODLIST-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":19725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":19726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":19727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["cc55aea3903950b522f293376d2202e525894c9336e484210d937da721839a2b","270a60fcf24d398d4da451c322c5f8b7b615b10eb58da7b0c701e840b0f614aa","5466505c67d16fa5552f758b1df155d6eae68e53eb7899250cd0eb8c8998d813","c47b1745368245fe16b893769e1d5a88fe5694b455aaf4fd8e934f92ac7f83e9","65f2ca2fbf082b5ed3bdb61a9edab8649dd600d96c2aeddbfb9cf26cafd1e2d5","71937383477abc805c436502ebb800c2cfbd05c1422be3b4a72aa0e6873724af","c0b4912595da75e841c1d6fd501c7a56698c76f07dbb3a9b8d23ec27b6f55958","0e4c460d9294cf0b795eefd96ba7d36fbd5657ff70aed129a1678dc9efc4dd14","615a63c642c359d467016eec1286ad2c9a71cd54acfda290d0b828bffd9b9538","2dbf7909ef60577e24465080a4da2e280ab310ecb04176765868e7fdd49e8bb4","3d6f5c52ff4a23d1a81b1378ed49693690a325c1074ec88f7aa2066f8ba1780f","b