{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MobilityStateParameters field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"n-CellChangeHigh","paragraph_zero_based":20883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The number of cell changes to enter high mobility state. Corresponds to NCR_H in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":20884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"n-CellChangeMedium","paragraph_zero_based":20885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The number of cell changes to enter medium mobility state. Corresponds to NCR_M in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":20886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-Evaluation","paragraph_zero_based":20887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The duration for evaluating criteria to enter mobility states. Corresponds to TCRmax in TS 38.304 [20]. Value in seconds, s30 corresponds to 30 s and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":20888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-HystNormal","paragraph_zero_based":20889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The additional duration for evaluating criteria to enter normal mobility state. Corresponds to TCRmaxHyst in TS 38.304 [20]. Value in seconds, value s30 corresponds to 30 seconds and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":20890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MRB-Identity","paragraph_zero_based":20892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MRB-Identity is used to identify a multicast MRB used by a UE.","paragraph_zero_based":20893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MRB-Identity information element","paragraph_zero_based":20894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":20895},{"liter