{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MsgA-ConfigCommon is used to configure the PRACH and PUSCH resource for transmission of MsgA in 2-step random access type procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":20904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":20905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MSGACONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":20906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MsgA-ConfigCommon-r16 ::=           SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":20908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    rach-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA-r16      RACH-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA-r16,","paragraph_zero_based":20909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    msgA-PUSCH-Config-r16               MsgA-PUSCH-Config-r16                                      OPTIONAL --Cond InitialBWPConfig","paragraph_zero_based":20910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":20911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MSGACONFIGCOMMON-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":20914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MsgA-ConfigCommon field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":20916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"msgA-PUSCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":20917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of cell-specific MsgA PUSCH parameters which the UE uses for contention-based MsgA PUSCH transmission of this BWP. If the field is not configured for the selected UL BWP, the UE shall use the MsgA PUSCH configuration of initial UL BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":20918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rach-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA","paragraph_zero_based":20919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of cell specific random access parameters which the UE uses for contention based and contention free 2-step random access type procedure as well as for 2-step RA type contention based beam failure recovery in this BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":20920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":20922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":20923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"InitialBWPConfig","paragraph_zero_based":20924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present when MsgA-ConfigCommon is configured for the initial uplink BWP, or when MsgA-ConfigCommon is configured for a non-initial uplink BWP and MsgA-ConfigCommon is not configured for the initial uplink BWP, otherwise the field is optionally present, Need S.","paragraph_zero_based":20925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":20926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MsgA-PUSCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":20927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["518c51b78afdf2abd6ef98cef27adf7af908d33174197b6db849be2e34519411","0eefd0e6d9f2e9c816ca4e8472332ca68de57769cd34a911bd5393e2bbffcfbd","1b715a48e4d3fe76ccd843b1202d0bae76650739cb4ed097394b9d3f0bfcbada","b152ff3220f0ec6c086d6dee8924705d595f2d488928b370c65fb044dd4091c6","996e868393846b71a4f9f34b82eeace87ae2d518ba3d72727aa8685cc3436cc2","cb1352fe6c4d2580f723eddaf3de3fc96ad985f3676f58d533f254357a469d41","8741f228c8f81c81d429a5163ebe4705517fa18f0968841c56c66c2aacda313d","65dc60169f5747b66bca20cbe6f1849ef6ca36faa01c486047247c14b318a84c