{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    musim-GapId-r17                        MUSIM-GapId-r17,","paragraph_zero_based":21120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    musim-GapInfo-r17                      MUSIM-GapInfo-r17","paragraph_zero_based":21121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":21123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MUSIM-GAPCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MUSIM-GapConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-AperiodicGap","paragraph_zero_based":21129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the MUSIM aperiodic gap as specified in TS 38.133 [14] clause 9.1.10. If UE indicates the musim-Starting-SFN-AndSubframe when requesting aperiodic gap the network can only configure the aperiodic gap with the same start point or no aperiodic gap. If the field musim-Starting-SFN-AndSubframe is absent for aperiodic gap, network can configure any timing as the starting point for aperiodic gap or configure no aperiodic gap.","paragraph_zero_based":21130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-GapInfo","paragraph_zero_based":21131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the values for musim-GapLength and musim-GapRepetitionAndOffset. When network provides periodic gap, network always signals the musim-GapLength and musim-GapRepetitionAndOffset as indicated by the UE's preferred MUSIM gap configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":21132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-GapToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":21133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of MUSIM periodic gap patterns to add or modify.","paragraph_zero_based":21134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"musim-GapToReleaseList","paragraph_zero_based":21135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"List of MUSIM periodic gap patterns to release.","paragraph_zero_based":21136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MUSIM-GapId","paragraph_zero_based":21138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE MUSIM-GapId is used to identify UE periodic MUSIM gap(s) to add, modify or release.","paragraph_zero_based":21139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MUSIM-GapId information element","paragraph_zero_based":21140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":21141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MUSIM-GAPID-START","paragraph_zero_based":21142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d5dda4f9660ccc7097dd95a61c927c4f14cca12b2f0057550a48b48bf9a2c8e4","344736c23e7aad1bdcc09fa804d4c77054b25296581c89014660ec7b98a5cae0","8330896cd2af207071c0dd7512890d0a34d5d50aa7e4cc58fcc3f64106bcca1d","3631c7bfab63888fd72e369f61310e022cc0fd71b90cf24a0ff7cfa0e70214bd","3220b4f601296d0eac11b8604ff6901db7df9354afd6b43b3c76f7614a2036d9","8d018f056d098d8b824d32f21671219963dd94c2ae3dd6ecb3729055b2d1b3cc","66fa12491601eb5b55b1d2566fec66de979fae029ff7e95bbd1f40de353124b0","e0fb68fbaf548c93478bc330c7529831793e15aaaa516dcceb95e5e53388bfd1","9fe7103d2c1b977a8752234b2b4330b4a0c40e9b15e576abbf8e7c499f3aad36","e61d2813b900ac3e8715a057a6e17bff72f90f4f392657ddcfa6bc0a9929d3ca","fb88b9ba964c1f9ad81b60fad