{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    gapIndication-r16                            ENUMERATED {gap, no-gap}","paragraph_zero_based":21240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":21241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NeedForGapsInfoNR-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsInfoNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"intraFreq-needForGap","paragraph_zero_based":21247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap requirement information for NR intra-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":21248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"interFreq-needForGap","paragraph_zero_based":21249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the measurement gap requirement information for NR inter-frequency measurement.","paragraph_zero_based":21250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsIntraFreq field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servCellId","paragraph_zero_based":21253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell which contains the target SSB (associated with the initial DL BWP) to be measured. ","paragraph_zero_based":21254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndicationIntra","paragraph_zero_based":21255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap is required for the UE to perform intra-frequency SSB based measurements on the concerned serving cell. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed if any of the UE configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB) do not contain the frequency domain resources of the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB). Value no-gap indicates a measurement gap is not needed to measure the SSB associated to the initial DL BWP (CD-SSB) for all configured BWPs (except the BWP(s) configured with servingCellMO associated with NCD-SSB), no matter the SSB is within the configured BWP or not. ","paragraph_zero_based":21256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NeedForGapsNR field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"bandNR","paragraph_zero_based":21259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the NR target band to be measured.","paragraph_zero_based":21260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gapIndication","paragraph_zero_based":21261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether measurement gap is required for the UE to perform SSB based measurements on the concerned NR target band while NR-DC or NE-DC is not configured. The UE determines this information based on the resultant configuration of the RRCReconfiguration or RRCResume message that triggers this response. Value gap indicates that a measurement gap is needed, value no-gap indicates a measurement gap is not needed. ","paragraph_zero_based":21262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4d8646774defe2877fa08009497ca2fd61b5de7f8d158c69a03e25ef5994175a","66e16a098250640301594ec43e8f14c22b3c4045c90124323e878721714fd962","d1ca908afcb927981ae061980795c7971c4b4396d872b3