{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-IdentityInfoList field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"iab-Support","paragraph_zero_based":21483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field combines both the support of IAB and the cell status for IAB. If the field is present, the cell supports IAB and the cell is also considered as a candidate for cell (re)selection for IAB-nodes; if the field is absent, the cell does not support IAB and/or the cell is barred for IAB-node.","paragraph_zero_based":21484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"gNB-ID-Length","paragraph_zero_based":21485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the length of the gNB ID out of the 36-bit long cellIdentity.","paragraph_zero_based":21486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NPN-IdentityInfo","paragraph_zero_based":21487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The NPN-IdentityInfo contains one or more NPN identities and additional information associated with those NPNs. Only the same type of NPNs (either SNPNs or PNI-NPNs) can be listed in a NPN-IdentityInfo element.","paragraph_zero_based":21488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"npn-IdentityList","paragraph_zero_based":21489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The npn-IdentityList contains one or more NPN Identity elements.","paragraph_zero_based":21490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"trackingAreaCode","paragraph_zero_based":21491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the Tracking Area Code to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity field belongs. ","paragraph_zero_based":21492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ranac","paragraph_zero_based":21493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the RAN Area Code to which the cell indicated by cellIdentity field belongs. ","paragraph_zero_based":21494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellReservedForOperatorUse","paragraph_zero_based":21495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether the cell is reserved for operator use (for the NPN(s) identified in the npn-IdentityList) as defined in TS 38.304 [20]. This field is ignored by NPN capable IAB-MT.","paragraph_zero_based":21496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–NR-DL-PRS-PDC-Info","paragraph_zero_based":21498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE NR-DL-PRS-PDC-Info defines downlink PRS configuration for PDC.","paragraph_zero_based":21499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR-DL-PRS-PDC-Info information element","paragraph_zero_based":21500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":21501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NR-DL-PRS-PDC-INFO-START","paragraph_zero_based":21502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["54dfc345fb49863ccb4099747494ae3acfe3cbbabbea70c8709eaa68284b0dfa","a0e65ca2f9a210366982d4bd85b9c0f674557de2ef1e9eb0a35e3257574ac602","586f57216bb1d08ddaccb840e99528a9c56891d3cdae3d2bcc6b1449dd7472eb","5c389161c99e540e050fbc4a7190cf53c65156aa3850647ef246dce1a141601d","9b35d0974c275678a7f0db020e042f1f3c2830397616ff81bd056a920e038792","fe45be9fd5a7add49d74740d3d3634ce9a1f0188c3effbf2b43ceb174b15106c","fd2b629e3ce9f0137dbe7f51cc9cca0afd35740531d1d4aebf7974899ef0e335","c66cf8389c0a81e12019a939c3f236f5b3c033903ce649f2cd2b74555d21b906","b2715186155b1191c1d6e4fc825d6e70da9a4dd6deec3cc