{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    powerControlOffset                  INTEGER (-8..15),","paragraph_zero_based":21792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    powerControlOffsetSS                ENUMERATED{db-3, db0, db3, db6}                 OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":21793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    scramblingID                        ScramblingId,","paragraph_zero_based":21794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    periodicityAndOffset                CSI-ResourcePeriodicityAndOffset                OPTIONAL,   -- Cond PeriodicOrSemiPersistent","paragraph_zero_based":21795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    qcl-InfoPeriodicCSI-RS              TCI-StateId                                     OPTIONAL,   -- Cond Periodic","paragraph_zero_based":21796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":21797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":21798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-NZP-CSI-RS-RESOURCE-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":21801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":21802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NZP-CSI-RS-Resource field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":21803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicityAndOffset","paragraph_zero_based":21804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Periodicity and slot offset sl1 corresponds to a periodicity of 1 slot, sl2 to a periodicity of two slots, and so on. The corresponding offset is also given in number of slots (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1). Network always configures the UE with a value for this field for periodic and semi-persistent NZP-CSI-RS-Resource (as indicated in CSI-ResourceConfig).","paragraph_zero_based":21805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"powerControlOffset","paragraph_zero_based":21806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Power offset of PDSCH RE to NZP CSI-RS RE. Value in dB (see TS 38.214 [19], clauses 5.2.2.3.1 and 4.1).","paragraph_zero_based":21807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"powerControlOffsetSS","paragraph_zero_based":21808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Power offset of NZP CSI-RS RE to SSS RE. Value in dB (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":21809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"qcl-InfoPeriodicCSI-RS","paragraph_zero_based":21810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For a target periodic CSI-RS, contains a reference to one TCI-State in TCI-States for providing the QCL source and QCL type. For periodic CSI-RS, the source can be SSB or another periodic-CSI-RS. Refers to the TCI-State or dl-OrJoint-TCI-State which has this value for tci-StateId and is defined in tci-StatesToAddModList or in dl-OrJointTCI-StateList in the PDSCH-Config included in the BWP-Downlink corresponding to the serving cell and to the DL BWP to which the resource belongs to (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":21811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceMapping","paragraph_zero_based":21812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"OFDM symbol location(s) in a slot and subcarrier occupancy in a PRB of the CSI-RS resource.","paragraph_zero_based":21813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scramblingID","paragraph_zero_based":21814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Scrambling ID (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.2.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":21815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a21aa64e8af1e5be