{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellGroupsForSwitchList","paragraph_zero_based":22128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The list of serving cells which are bundled for the search space group switching purpose (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 10.4). A serving cell can belong to only one CellGroupForSwitch. The network configures the same list for all BWPs of serving cells in the same CellGroupForSwitch.","paragraph_zero_based":22129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"searchSpaceSwitchDelay","paragraph_zero_based":22130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the value to be applied by a UE for Search Space Set Group switching; corresponds to the P value in TS 38.213 [13], clause 10.4. The network configures the same value for all BWPs of serving cells in the same CellGroupForSwitch. For 120/480/960 kHz SCS, only values 40,41, ... 52 are valid and the actual value = field value  * SCS/120 kHz i.e. field value 40 corresponds to 40 with 120 kHz SCS, 160 with 480 kHz SCS and 320 with 960 kHz SCS, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":22131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"searchSpaceSwitchTimer","paragraph_zero_based":22132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Timer (in unit of slots) to control the UE behavior to switch from search space group X back to search space group 0, as specified in clause 10 of TS 38.213 [13]. For the 15kHz SCS, only the first 26 values are valid and correspond to {1, 2, 3, …, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 80, 100}. For the 30kHz SCS, only the first 46 values are valid and correspond to {1, 2, 3, …, 40, 60, 80, 100, 120, 160, 200}. For the 60kHz SCS, only the first 86 values are valid and correspond to {1, 2, 3, …, 80, 120, 160, 200, 240, 320, 400}. For the 120kHz SCS, the 166 values correspond to {1, 2, 3, …, 160, 240, 320, 400, 480, 640, 800}. For the 480kHz SCS, the 166 values correspond to {4, 8, 12, …, 640, 960, 1280, 1600, 1920, 2560, 3200}. For the 960kHz SCS, the 166 values correspond to {8, 16, 24, …, 1280, 1920, 2560, 3200, 3840, 5120, 6400}.","paragraph_zero_based":22133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PDCCH-ConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":22135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PDCCH-ConfigCommon is used to configure cell specific PDCCH parameters provided in SIB as well as in dedicated signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":22136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDCCH-ConfigCommon information element","paragraph_zero_based":22137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":22138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-PDCCH-CONFIGCOMMON-START","paragraph_zero_based":22139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":22140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PDCCH-ConfigCommon ::=              SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":22141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    controlResourceSetZero              ControlResourceSetZero                                  OPTIONAL,   -- Cond InitialBWP-Only","paragraph_zero_based":22142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    commonControlResourceSet            ControlResourceSet                                      OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":22143},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    searchSpaceZero                     SearchSpaceZero                                         OPTIONAL,   -- Cond InitialBWP-Only","paragraph_zero_based":22144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    commonSearchSpaceList               SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..4)) OF SearchSpace                    OPTIONAL,   -- Need R","paragraph_zero_based":22145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    searchSpaceSIB1                     SearchSpaceId                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":22146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation   SearchSpaceId                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":22147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    pagingSearchSpace                   SearchSpaceId                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":22148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ra-SearchSpace                      SearchSpaceId                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":22149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...,","paragraph_zero_based":22150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    [[","paragraph_zero_based":22151}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["49612f69a07261ea64f52b828d7ae788f3da0d4e6f2d7239caf0de6cce3325c2","7eb327417cb8c609af4f415164d68e294847bf3e94d9af8ad094406bc9cd7ed8","61d724891e322af26e3d95f7cab5b90a1e5820b2ef63e28999be5b21fa37e4dd","963704475d99b82bd4ea5ef8714c87273c06530ff2b7b67fcc55ff649bf2c8e9","5b1d487ce0cfe46233deaf7f345082456a0428d1bfba40e9fc48ae10f2c6b11c","64e4a560e591b7864542bad9def766900655f95a4c23e614d8cfae09879636b5","1b61224ba4c0ce8c124f21e6a4a1a9e1cfe6377801f633d0e57921a632b36595","0a3b22595d2c2bdb4a8d9ad20a826711493011e9c6da981630b7ee3da458b08d","5e0264d46ff9d6ae0bfa90e305501ab44b239b735ba842953d14c4d2b298c139","6a31f2d218d602367a951d165c003ad85acc040b07461a501b0eeb2b7575f554","b5ded38472934d7785a1571444407b414c235de71e14d356ae68cee7944c3338","2b97620a2ee8f65c2981c722c4fb4ee253179d8af5d1c87b311447af36286cc4","f98eb4aeb657bedc2041946767bd47d74fb0c97e11b640bb16eacb25c97c01be","a7f43814597c40821926d1de533b33394a1e7e30b59e6fc38992d6a5de85faea","e181b925d5367a87e8f829a2e35f7271f5edae570992dbd4351e66604ca49243","c77dea9753327df9e