{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PTRS-UplinkConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":23424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"frequencyDensity","paragraph_zero_based":23425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Presence and frequency density of UL PT-RS for CP-OFDM waveform as a function of scheduled BW If the field is absent, the UE uses K_PT-RS = 2 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1).","paragraph_zero_based":23426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxNrofPorts","paragraph_zero_based":23427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The maximum number of UL PTRS ports for CP-OFDM (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.2.3.1).","paragraph_zero_based":23428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ptrs-Power","paragraph_zero_based":23429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UL PTRS power boosting factor per PTRS port (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1, table 6.2.3.1.3).","paragraph_zero_based":23430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"resourceElementOffset","paragraph_zero_based":23431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the subcarrier offset for UL PTRS for CP-OFDM. If the field is absent, the UE applies the value offset00 (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 6.4.1.2.2).","paragraph_zero_based":23432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sampleDensity","paragraph_zero_based":23433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sample density of PT-RS for DFT-s-OFDM, pre-DFT, indicating a set of thresholds T={NRBn, n=0,1,2,3,4}, that indicates dependency between presence of PT-RS and scheduled BW and the values of X and K the UE should use depending on the scheduled BW, see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1, table 6.2.3.2-1.","paragraph_zero_based":23434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeDensity","paragraph_zero_based":23435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Presence and time density of UL PT-RS for CP-OFDM waveform as a function of MCS If the field is absent, the UE uses L_PT-RS = 1 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1).","paragraph_zero_based":23436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"timeDensityTransformPrecoding","paragraph_zero_based":23437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Time density (OFDM symbol level) of PT-RS for DFT-s-OFDM. If the field is absent, the UE applies value d1 (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.1).","paragraph_zero_based":23438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"transformPrecoderDisabled","paragraph_zero_based":23439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of UL PTRS without transform precoder (with CP-OFDM).","paragraph_zero_based":23440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"transformPrecoderEnabled","paragraph_zero_based":23441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of UL PTRS with transform precoder (DFT-S-OFDM).","paragraph_zero_based":23442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":23443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–PUCCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":23444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE PUCCH-Config is used to configure UE specific PUCCH parameters (per BWP).","paragraph_zero_based":23445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PUCCH-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":23446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":23447}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["ee94a4f6706ef77e8bc8506113fdaa02d8b9d495f5aefcccbc647c6cd856538a","9b59e67912eb1ef61a179a28d55eba4f289d5870d39557f810153af026176fe6","23f7269e21775b3b06c2dc62e3c16928a88b3ea76625f02ae562ff43a6da0a8b","8d839e9f4abfaf6abd3eedbe57d67de530b3cb1e8dd950a58d56fec5f45398e9","b5c86cbea5043ac640d9f6c1812044fe7594a9ac220a243a69d1056baafbcaa2","f143343b