{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigInterRAT specifies criteria for triggering of an inter-RAT measurement reporting event, or an L2 U2N relay measurement reporting event. The inter-RAT measurement reporting events for E-UTRA and UTRA-FDD are labelled BN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on. The measurement reporting events for L2 U2N relay UE are labelled YN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":25752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event B1:Neighbour becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event B2:PCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event Y1: PCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event Y2: Candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigInterRAT information element","paragraph_zero_based":25757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":25758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-REPORTCONFIGINTERRAT-START","paragraph_zero_based":25759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigInterRAT ::=                    SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":25761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    reportType                                  CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":25762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        periodical                                  PeriodicalReportConfigInterRAT,","paragraph_zero_based":25763},{"literal_tex