{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UTRA-FDD threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (RSCP, EcN0) to be used in inter RAT measurement report triggering condition for event number bN.","paragraph_zero_based":25920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"utra-FDD-RSCP corresponds to CPICH_RSCP in TS 25.133 [46] for FDD. utra-FDD-EcN0 corresponds to CPICH_Ec/No in TS 25.133 [46] for FDD.","paragraph_zero_based":25921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For utra-FDD-RSCP: The actual value is field value – 115 dBm.","paragraph_zero_based":25922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For utra-FDD-EcN0: The actual value is (field value – 49)/2 dB.","paragraph_zero_based":25923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"y1-Threshold1","paragraph_zero_based":25924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR threshold to be used in measurement report triggering condition for event Y1.","paragraph_zero_based":25925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"yN-Threshold2-Relay","paragraph_zero_based":25926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"L2 U2N Relay threshold value associated with the selected trigger quantity (i.e. RSRP) to be used in measurement report triggering condition for event number YN.","paragraph_zero_based":25927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PeriodicalReportConfigInterRAT field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":25929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"maxReportCells","paragraph_zero_based":25930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Max number of non-serving cells/candidate L2 U2N Relay UEs to include in the measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":25931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportAmount","paragraph_zero_based":25932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Number of measurement reports applicable for eventTriggered as well as for periodical report types","paragraph_zero_based":25933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportQuantity, reportQuantityUTRA-FDD","paragraph_zero_based":25934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The cell measurement quantities to be included in the measurement report. If the field reportQuantityUTRA-FDD is present, the UE shall ignore the value(s) provided in reportQuantity.","paragraph_zero_based":25935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ReportConfigNR","paragraph_zero_based":25937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigNR specifies criteria for triggering of an NR measurement reporting event or of a CHO, CPA or CPC event or of an L2 U2N relay measurement reporting event. For events labelled AN with N equal to 1, 2 and so on, measurement reporting events and CHO, CPA or CPC events are based on cell measurement results, which can either be derived based on SS/PBCH block or CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":25938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A1:Serving becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A2:Serving becomes worse than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":25941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4:Neighbour becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5:PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Neighbour/SCell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25943}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b57