{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A6:Neighbour becomes amount of offset better than SCell;","paragraph_zero_based":25944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event D1:Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":25945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A3: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes amount of offset better than PCell/PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":25946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A4: Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent A5: PCell/PSCell becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND Conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent D1: Distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation1 becomes larger than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference1 and distance between UE and a reference location referenceLocation2 of conditional reconfiguration candidate becomes shorter than configured threshold distanceThreshFromReference2;","paragraph_zero_based":25949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"CondEvent T1: Time measured at UE becomes more than configured threshold t1-Threshold but is less than t1-Threshold + duration;","paragraph_zero_based":25950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event X1:Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than absolute threshold1 AND NR Cell becomes better than another absolute threshold2;","paragraph_zero_based":25951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event X2:Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than absolute threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For event I1, measurement reporting event is based on CLI measurement results, which can either be derived based on SRS-RSRP or CLI-RSSI.","paragraph_zero_based":25953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event I1:Interference becomes higher than absolute threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":25954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The reporting events concerning Aerial UE altitude are labelled HN with N equal to 1 and 2. Additionally, the reporting events concerning Aerial UE altitude and the neighboring cell measurements simultaneously are labelled AMHN with M equal to 3, 4, 5 and N equal to 1, 2.  ","paragraph_zero_based":25955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event H1:Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":25956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event H2:Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":25957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3H1: Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":25958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A3H2: Neighbour becomes offset better than SpCell and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold.","paragraph_zero_based":25959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4H1: Neighbour becomes better than threshold1 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold2.","paragraph_zero_based":25960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A4H2: Neighbour becomes better than threshold1 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold2.","paragraph_zero_based":25961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5H1: SpCell becomes worse than threshold1 and neighbour becomes better than threshold2 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes higher than a threshold3.","paragraph_zero_based":25962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event A5H2: SpCell becomes worse than threshold1 and neighbour becomes better than threshold2 and the Aerial UE altitude becomes lower than a threshold3.","paragraph_zero_based":25963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReportConfigNR information element","paragraph_zero_based":25964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":25965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-REPORTCONFIGNR-START","paragraph_zero_based":25966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":25967}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c7bf772098b022dab61489d91150046371dd539392d55c2766edebd69370ee7b","ff0e46024f0f1cae507fa68aad9b8cc58941f737265b247ada221ba35a73ebe5","5c7ed3f5f1e80096c39cb84262c54d2e0f739443c1368c86ff747fbb16e17a8f","c6f040ee4d5ae07c6fb97690a14d9d8f8e0665736a6947b4f1d51f1909af805c","f31072bfc877e74e458d02f6c50ae941e083784d63b4667b43ce3450a0e4d9e1","647155c2b09b8d7ec625b7a862168f5d4cd5b7d49f1caccbb040b75dcbd40a41","80c603af5d3a2207d1285b60cbb0d1376bc6ffc525cd8eab4093fd55572807e7","3d9153f8d3e66f0d6340857accbecfdb10227dd5ad6233fb8c2d817a91f8e042","6a46342025f803d4d93847fc714ece772af6591c2ac17dd561d2e6b856afa90c","ec6777bc37499c7d759539a12d77d25919cab1423de469185cc22b838d199bf6","aa92033bf04c3d216223484caabb78788662647fbf092b637ac5018b7ea20708","5a9d90e60d5cdb24f23026fa4f627777db1bd2f69fa7cf030a1a11fea281989f","799cc50d17827f350f46be200d907987d640734a445b47bad5eb3ecc420e63e6","b9a6c706aeefc94790923d74d2de1b0bc51908c597824a41ac7969e98cb74713","7a49a33848f93459571aa8563b24168fd4acd54bfbf878dd39daeb9aecc69e85","e85e25c8fe01cc15cd10da8298069c9d78851dfe273fd942ed3165320eaf53d7","36614e40e09986efcc95299c2580038f72a3a7f32688993aa63ebfe000b8a