{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cellForWhichToReportSFTD","paragraph_zero_based":26424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the target NR neighbour cells for SFTD measurement between PCell and NR neighbour cells.","paragraph_zero_based":26425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"drx-SFTD-NeighMeas","paragraph_zero_based":26426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that the UE shall use available idle periods (i.e. DRX off periods) for the SFTD measurement in NR standalone. The network only includes drx-SFTD-NeighMeas field when reprtSFTD-NeighMeas is set to true.","paragraph_zero_based":26427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportSFTD-Meas","paragraph_zero_based":26428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE is required to perform SFTD measurement between PCell and NR PSCell in NR-DC.","paragraph_zero_based":26429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportSFTD-NeighMeas","paragraph_zero_based":26430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE is required to perform SFTD measurement between PCell and NR neighbour cells in NR standalone. The network does not include this field if reportSFTD-Meas is set to true.","paragraph_zero_based":26431},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportRSRP","paragraph_zero_based":26432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates whether UE is required to include RSRP result of NR PSCell or NR neighbour cells in SFTD measurement result, derived based on SSB. If it is set to true, the network should ensure that ssb-ConfigMobility is included in the measurement object for NR PSCell or NR neighbour cells.","paragraph_zero_based":26433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RxTxPeriodical field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"reportAmount","paragraph_zero_based":26436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the number of UE Rx-Tx time difference measurement reports. If configured to r1, the network does not configure rxTxReportInterval and only one measurement is reported. If configured to infinity, UE periodically reports measurements according to the periodicity configured by rxTxReportInterval.","paragraph_zero_based":26437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rxTxReportInterval","paragraph_zero_based":26438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the measurement reporting periodicity of UE Rx-Tx time difference.","paragraph_zero_based":26439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"other field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":26441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasTriggerQuantity","paragraph_zero_based":26442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SINR is applicable only for CONNECTED mode events.","paragraph_zero_based":26443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":26444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–ReportConfigNR-SL","paragraph_zero_based":26445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE ReportConfigNR-SL specifies criteria for triggering of a CBR measurement reporting event for NR sidelink communication/discovery. Measurement reporting events are based on CBR measurement results on the corresponding transmission resource pools. These events are labelled CN with N equal to 1 and 2.","paragraph_zero_based":26446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Event C1:CBR of NR sidelink communication/discovery is above a threshold;","paragraph_zero_based":26447}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_