{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SchedulingRequestResourceConfigExt-v1700 ::=    SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":27024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    periodicityAndOffset-r17                        CHOICE {","paragraph_zero_based":27025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        sl1280                                          INTEGER (0..1279),","paragraph_zero_based":27026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        sl2560                                          INTEGER (0..2559),","paragraph_zero_based":27027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        sl5120                                          INTEGER (0..5119)","paragraph_zero_based":27028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    }                                                                                                       OPTIONAL   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":27029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":27030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SCHEDULINGREQUESTRESOURCECONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":27032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":27033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SchedulingRequestResourceConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":27035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"periodicityAndOffset","paragraph_zero_based":27036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SR periodicity and offset in number of symbols or slots (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 9.2.4) The following periodicities may be configured depending on the chosen subcarrier spacing:","paragraph_zero_based":27037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCS =  15 kHz: 2sym, 7sym, 1sl, 2sl, 4sl, 5sl, 8sl, 10sl, 16sl, 20sl, 40sl, 80sl","paragraph_zero_based":27038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCS =  30 kHz: 2sym, 7sym, 1sl, 2sl, 4sl, 8sl, 10sl, 16sl, 20sl, 40sl, 80sl, 160sl","paragraph_zero_based":27039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCS =  60 kHz: 2sym, 7sym/6sym, 1sl, 2sl, 4sl, 8sl, 16sl, 20sl, 40sl, 80sl, 160sl, 320sl","paragraph_zero_based":27040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCS = 120 kHz: 2sym, 7sym, 1sl, 2sl, 4sl, 8sl, 16sl, 40sl, 80sl, 160sl, 320sl, 640sl","paragraph_zero_based":27041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCS = 480 kHz: 1sl, 2sl, 4sl, 8sl, 16sl, 40sl, 80sl, 160sl, 320sl, 640sl, 1280sl, 2560sl","paragraph_zero_based":27042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCS = 960 kHz: 1sl, 2sl, 4sl, 8sl, 16sl, 40sl, 80sl, 160sl, 320sl, 640sl, 1280sl, 2560sl, 5120sl","paragraph_zero_based":27043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":27044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sym6or7 corresponds to 6 symbols if extended cyclic prefix and a SCS of 60 kHz are configured, otherwise it corresponds to 7 symbols.","paragraph_zero_based":27045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For periodicities 2sym, 7sym and sl1 the UE assumes an offset of 0 slots.","paragraph_zero_based":27046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If periodicityAndOffset-r17 is present, any previously configured periodicityAndOffset (without suffix) is released, and vice versa.","paragraph_zero_based":27047}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9ba9e353beb2ca95c8dea2d3f22f9c09eab189db10c9b7c419d77c42b43b1a09","07d565f722587b707e734c5019e7726eabe4314c3ef77cc5395b421202cbff3f","028c42d27bede586b0ad43e2292f1bded1292966587bba554db050fe987b5efe","1f357d4118535a79889e3d6b1505ca4cc32b4725902046a03867119a75eb9f01","d8f8f74d134f1