{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SlotFormatCombinationId ::=         INTEGER (0..maxNrofSlotFormatCombinationsPerSet-1)","paragraph_zero_based":28368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SLOTFORMATCOMBINATIONSPERCELL-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SlotFormatCombination field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":28373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slotFormatCombinationId","paragraph_zero_based":28374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This ID is used in the DCI payload to dynamically select this SlotFormatCombination (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1).","paragraph_zero_based":28375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slotFormats","paragraph_zero_based":28376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Slot formats that occur in consecutive slots in time domain order as listed here (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1 and TS 38.213 [13], clause 14 for IAB-MT).","paragraph_zero_based":28377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SlotFormatCombinationsPerCell field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":28379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"enableConfiguredUL","paragraph_zero_based":28380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If configured, the UE is allowed to transmit uplink signals/channels (SRS, PUCCH, CG-PUSCH) in the set of symbols of the slot when the UE does not detect a DCI format 2_0 providing a slot format for the set of symbols (see TS 38.213 [13], 11.1.1). This field is applicable only if cg-RetransmissionTimer-r16 is configured.","paragraph_zero_based":28381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"positionInDCI","paragraph_zero_based":28382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The (starting) position (bit) of the slotFormatCombinationId (SFI-Index) for this serving cell (servingCellId) within the DCI payload (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1).","paragraph_zero_based":28383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"servingCellId","paragraph_zero_based":28384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The ID of the serving cell for which the slotFormatCombinations are applicable.","paragraph_zero_based":28385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"slotFormatCombinations","paragraph_zero_based":28386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list with SlotFormatCombinations. Each SlotFormatCombination comprises of one or more SlotFormats (see TS 38.211 [16], clause 4.3.2). The total number of slotFormats in the slotFormatCombinations list does not exceed 512. ","paragraph_zero_based":28387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierSpacing2","paragraph_zero_based":28388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference subcarrier spacing for a Slot Format Combination on an FDD or SUL cell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1). For FDD, subcarrierSpacing (SFI-scs) is the reference SCS for DL BWP and subcarrierSpacing2 (SFI-scs2) is the reference SCS for UL BWP. For SUL, subcarrierSpacing (SFI-scs) is the reference SCS for non-SUL carrier and subcarrierSpacing2 (SFI-scs2) is the reference SCS for SUL carrier. The network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to any SCS of configured BWPs of the serving cell that the command applies to. And the network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to the SCS of the serving cell which the UE monitors for SFI indications.","paragraph_zero_based":28389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"subcarrierSpacing","paragraph_zero_based":28390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reference subcarrier spacing for this Slot Format Combination. The network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to any SCS of configured BWPs of the serving cell that the command applies to. And the network configures a value that is smaller than or equal to the SCS of the serving cell which the UE monitors for SFI indications (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.1.1).","paragraph_zero_based":28391}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["75f383f00762641ea44c4316adbee28d2f0589481561ac26562a74b96721e522","dcad46d537bdfded345cdb6de33e84bbc9f6e903c4c21a66f83e16aa8efab8d5","9fea1b722b437b55eca3aa06b12d617e2e468f80c22b1dd6d160706627fffaf1","9c9e468240297cab573534063b900a85a5aca62c9390e8f26f213989f249592e","c360fdc281e6a08a65fb12037c8c715691d3389e23ec2c410c76aebbf7ee628d","18ecfbdc8950f80c21028dc70874d40524a25f36197646ced3fea3840c2b3c37","699e5a086ac5752bfdfe258ee3e108d8dbc41b80cc50e1bbf9ba3feaf61d52b9","52748596b7fff6aebcb9ca8a2a8f684798656f8fc80b8f1406fcb674067fb30e","d4b8d294666bc60cffce930e5d174a2167ed7b76887e641b1def16d1ae6f1cf5","24468b2be60adc9ab40396323a39eaa30f3228a05a8bbf13f917abab15048def","21f4eaee2f0ea901a7f02bd278a9c492367718e23e288de0b410a3769a2c8704","14796174b3d1f669f130f5b7453df298763b901d58cec9754dbcf5917cf386df","2dbb8b597a9df15900c3b22723d42a5db14b3e2405da3ef7d0c87ae0fd60e6f8","deb4d75ef99dde81e5379e72ebe61a3da30e5a9d6a8427d1fda765022b66d2d6","d52ef0ca794b71152504c490482da8aa3742a3dd4469681f9170d31760c72028","4bb1f73feb31d675fcfb27eb12a0596ce4219fb5e81a34b76cc0b583c264acb7","2be28b8a6a6e25755da0614c9fae6b4646570b6460dc4971bb5103f7d8fce43d","2dd81ad151a87a03c2618d9c1c372dfc0e17a5d429b5fd108d350f6ee6eb6066","5749ee970a997fe91d40e09fae7eb2d16cf86936e70b14a75061e1f85c4494f5","51b3d9876d8f3a78bec8e8ec48a51e86f2fd828bbf6002e02c7742fbd27dbc63","2eb172f4f575b9382dbfc91dcf1f1ad8c5a42e35901dcc70aa8fb369a81a6afb","a77c64ca3