{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        typeA                               SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..32)) OF SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Config,","paragraph_zero_based":28680},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"        typeB                               SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Config","paragraph_zero_based":28681},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    }                                                                                                           OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":28682},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    monitoringCells                     SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofServingCells)) OF ServCellIndex               OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":28683},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    ...","paragraph_zero_based":28684},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":28685},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28686},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Config ::=            SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":28687},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    srs-CC-SetIndexlist                 SEQUENCE (SIZE(1..4)) OF SRS-CC-SetIndex                                OPTIONAL    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":28688},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":28689},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28690},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CC-SetIndex ::=                 SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":28691},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cc-SetIndex                         INTEGER (0..3)                                                          OPTIONAL,   -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":28692},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    cc-IndexInOneCC-Set                 INTEGER (0..7)                                                          OPTIONAL    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":28693},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":28694},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28695},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-CARRIERSWITCHING-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":28697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CC-SetIndex field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":28699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cc-IndexInOneCC-Set","paragraph_zero_based":28700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CC index in one CC set for Type A (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.4). The network always includes this field when the srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group is set to typeA.","paragraph_zero_based":28701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"cc-SetIndex","paragraph_zero_based":28702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the CC set index for Type A associated (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.4). The network always includes this field when the srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group is set to typeA. The network does not configure this field to 3 in this release of specification.","paragraph_zero_based":28703}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d9af19b464f73045bd1c5ab170e1bceb8308f1521781d7e18f184df8dd84ee07","b1cc19bd87874d98ca0c8c4c21a09d00e8240fa4b43618a9b1d1e01fe850768b","1935ca4ccb8bd1d9eccbdde1e4ab50bdfd954c753911e4dca3ee649e260bb936","5cac0f51b6cabc9a3e289674f32bdc17e1e46190c1840c41cca46e45061cf51d","0861bfae89c58e417f78115729f23a9366758fb350c5d1067960bedbb0fe85de","e545fe9dfb8b0e0e6eea5fc84780e581e8099d06f295684e4a2a5856c159c251","d8a2f0fb524327d