{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-CarrierSwitching field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":28705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"monitoringCells","paragraph_zero_based":28706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A set of serving cells for monitoring PDCCH conveying SRS DCI format with CRC scrambled by TPC-SRS-RNTI (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.3).","paragraph_zero_based":28707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-SwitchFromServCellIndex","paragraph_zero_based":28708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the serving cell whose UL transmission may be interrupted during SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell. During SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell, the UE may temporarily suspend the UL transmission on a serving cell with PUSCH in the same CG to allow the PUSCH-less SCell to transmit SRS. (see TS 38.214 [19], clause 6.2.1.3).","paragraph_zero_based":28709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-TPC-PDCCH-Group","paragraph_zero_based":28710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Network configures the UE with either typeA-SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Group or typeB-SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Group, if any.","paragraph_zero_based":28711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeA","paragraph_zero_based":28712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Type A trigger configuration for SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.4). In this release, the network configures at most one entry (the first entry) of typeA, and the first entry corresponds to the serving cell in which the SRS-CarrierSwitching field is configured. SRS carrier switching to SUL carrier is not supported in this version of the specification.","paragraph_zero_based":28713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"typeB","paragraph_zero_based":28714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Type B trigger configuration for SRS transmission on a PUSCH-less SCell (see TS 38.213 [13], clause 11.4).","paragraph_zero_based":28715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-TPC-PDCCH-Config field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":28717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-CC-SetIndexlist","paragraph_zero_based":28718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of pairs of [cc-SetIndex; cc-IndexInOneCC-Set] (see TS 38.212 [17], TS 38.213 [13], clause 7.3.1, 11.4). The network does not configure this field for typeB.","paragraph_zero_based":28719},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SRS-Config","paragraph_zero_based":28721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SRS-Config is used to configure sounding reference signal transmissions. The configuration defines a list of SRS-Resources, a list of SRS-PosResources, a list of SRS-PosResourceSets and a list of SRS-ResourceSets. Each resource set defines a set of SRS-Resources or SRS-PosResources. The network triggers the transmission of the set of SRS-Resources or SRS-PosResources using a configured aperiodicSRS-ResourceTrigger (L1 DCI). The network does not configure SRS specific power control parameters, alpha (without suffix), p0 (without suffix) or pathlossReferenceRS if unifiedTCI-StateType is configured for the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":28722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":28723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":28724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SRS-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":28725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":28726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SRS-Config ::=                          SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":28727}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3a0ed1b7f930be63a8a9f9276fbf59bafbe983aeb034c81207a270fcf7fe388b","d096219c871b0f936fce75d494c8f06d7f4c5cbc803b29f6d27df8b88770f78b","34e2aab137343f3f2c6ad6ea1663c7020654d0d5319e2fd5e1db7ab670f8fd53","c3c40b017d1a65869722f4b3ed421540ed788921ecc44a489740ce7612bed4a1","983d1392070a4ef5e119ab176a16156ebad369e7e6856986d9d381edc46328d3","412cf5f1572a980de89fbc9a53cc93dbf5af8078b3c2262a62af254cca64219e","4d048a60ce48fc5791fe787cedf7456133742c365440174f8917f530271bced0","929d1e9e2e948a860ed00890f0891e9b3a2eece5f699203a2ad05f0a805c5eb9","0df4be361f65938140fe81516d1d56542ccfc67f3893da07b6c1930c00af294c","d4c39136b7f470efb069c29040ebfa917ab5c3e9ea966dd5bcb2f63ae6bb2f87","01c28160480cc8c3c01bb94e143acfccfbfcc64f1c79ca10ccc68f3d3ba44b9f","b5dc46d2aef080f562c8cc35a397a4fa8a3155c024a69c0b3d1f458c9e94d929","8261e09b666db67c46d0c141dc1e0be6b55483b93aafe93af9340bf9841f845f","69fa6f84962fc6d94b872514e8e8e7c1a1e9efb601dfb674a9cdd0abf0ae88ea","ddae09bda8e5b6e8d39596f72c33d65b7574cb150289938d181192eb9e11677d","dac419d80e2113efee070e2f3edf112df94bd794b4b7477fa51a2b7b7ebe3d96","a2f5cc49f9cde286d9f1fe279fb059fdd65a5c2c50106e51f2262dbfebc1d04e","4c3f9b85b118bb8dbad56acd5ce3057b974217859efac0aaf968c88de13afc20","f321d5b26846e12b5f733841053748116ff9bb2254676abaca518050f0b5a383","49c5a2b2fdd4bc96a2f1216156bfbb5a2e0f4565e4ab4a722d503eadbd4c2c62","f3f3ad0297dadf8f1caf5162c7537e67fb9508a59f6a15bb7561a36919f98c2b","9426bff31478400916b60bd9f6f004e23b9d6edadd70dd13d359cd74cc4ff90e","cbc960018b1a55a632c31d487d3c5a25dae3a7b37b8c3605f25a92189a53abea","d1b0b01935cddab22133040e61e3252a2e2f39fc039d73ff4ac3c4d3166d0d9f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[28704,28727],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion ru