{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates, for a particular pair of E-UTRA bands, the RF retuning time when switching between an E-UTRA carrier corresponding to this band entry and another (PUSCH-less) E-UTRA carrier corresponding to the band entry in the order indicated below:","paragraph_zero_based":30912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For the first E-UTRA band, the UE shall include the same number of entries for E-UTRA bands as in bandList, i.e. first entry corresponds to first E-UTRA band in bandList and so on,","paragraph_zero_based":30913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For the second E-UTRA band, the UE shall include one entry less, i.e. first entry corresponds to the second E-UTRA band in bandList and so on","paragraph_zero_based":30914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":" -And so on","paragraph_zero_based":30915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"srs-TxSwitch","paragraph_zero_based":30916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates supported SRS antenna switch capability for the associated band. If the UE indicates support of SRS-SwitchingTimeNR, the UE is allowed to set this field for a band with associated FeatureSetUplinkId set to 0 for SRS carrier switching.","paragraph_zero_based":30917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"uplinkTxSwitchingBandParametersList-v1700","paragraph_zero_based":30918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates a list of per band per band combination capabilities for UL Tx switching.","paragraph_zero_based":30919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR","paragraph_zero_based":30921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR contains a list of V2X sidelink and NR sidelink band combinations.","paragraph_zero_based":30922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR information element","paragraph_zero_based":30923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":30924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-BANDCOMBINATIONLISTSIDELINKEUTRANR-START","paragraph_zero_based":30925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR-r16 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxBandComb)) OF BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-r16","paragraph_zero_based":30927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1630 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxBandComb)) OF BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1630","paragraph_zero_based":30929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationListSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1710 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxBandComb)) OF BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1710","paragraph_zero_based":30931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-r16 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSimultaneousBands)) OF BandParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-r16","paragraph_zero_based":30933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":30934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BandCombinationParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1630 ::= SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxSimultaneousBands)) OF BandParametersSidelinkEUTRA-NR-v1630","paragraph_zero_based":30935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1290c7adaf5b50c5411a987c20b3e2909eed8658296ae