{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id","paragraph_zero_based":32857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id identifies a set of features applicable to one carrier of a feature set. The FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id of a FeatureSetUplinkPerCC is the index position of the FeatureSetUplinkPerCC in the featureSetsUplinkPerCC. The first element in the list is referred to by FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id = 1, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":32858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id information element","paragraph_zero_based":32859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETUPLINKPERCC-ID-START","paragraph_zero_based":32861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FeatureSetUplinkPerCC-Id ::=            INTEGER (1..maxPerCC-FeatureSets)","paragraph_zero_based":32863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FEATURESETUPLINKPERCC-ID-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FreqBandIndicatorEUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":32868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":32869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQBANDINDICATOREUTRA-START","paragraph_zero_based":32870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FreqBandIndicatorEUTRA ::=  INTEGER (1..maxBandsEUTRA)","paragraph_zero_based":32872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-FREQBANDINDICATOREUTRA-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":32875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":32876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–FreqBandList","paragraph_zero_based":32877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE FreqBandList is used by the network to request NR CA, NR non-CA and/or MR-DC band combinations for specific NR and/or E-UTRA frequency bands and/or up to a specific number of carriers and/or up to specific aggregated bandwidth. This is also used to request feature sets (for NR) and feature set combinations (for NR and MR-DC). For NR sidelink communication, this is used by the initiating UE to request sidelink UE radio access capabilities from the peer UE.","paragraph_zero_based":32878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"FreqBandList information element","paragraph_zero_based":32879}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["317a330091f86beb3c7e6bf0f5cc25c96a422b2241e5008cf24c425f23cd85e1","c192389045883e2d421636459c713b417e4f5769d17a1b5e8f05105e9a725056","0923619d9f5abc3d174002b696d3252ce04c588a449cc9de899c74f12f0f106c","9a5a870de1f6939ea1117fb1a4ceb7fee33fa7efec92c72260b7c159160c3ba5","e9f46ccccdcd0b49a7232c229d311ee76b97863845cd034cf262d73a0deb8d3c","7ea3dc2e72b25cac38549cc306e8133cb78d46db33706a2d83cfc7d90c61ab35","d0c66ee6e57f59ba5c423259d53e57a0e155fbbcbbdee1005a2756721e379965","74e97eead283155c139084297b073172db0f9e56b5ecf64d53c1012ffe1ad8cf","168f3416397db340646fb6c9aae75a7267a97c69fb5ec28390e618eea732c8e1","6c10cc13afb733bdefd1b592de5818d4e1a21555ac5c8fd790efbf341