{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"referenceTimePreferenceReporting","paragraph_zero_based":37224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, the field indicates the UE is configured to provide reference time assistance information.","paragraph_zero_based":37225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"releasePreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report assistance information to inform the gNB about the UE's preference to leave RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":37227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report the relaxation state of RLM measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":37229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"releasePreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":37230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for release preference assistance information reporting. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s0dot5 means prohibit timer is set to 0.5 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on. Value infinity means that once a UE has reported a release preference, the UE cannot report a release preference again during the RRC connection.","paragraph_zero_based":37231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"s-SearchDeltaP-Stationary","paragraph_zero_based":37232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"SSearchDeltaP-StationaryConnected\" in 5.7.4.4. Value dB2 corresponds to 2 dB, dB3 corresponds to 3 dB and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration of the UE to indicate its preference for SCG deactivation.","paragraph_zero_based":37235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"scg -StatePreferenceProhibitTimer","paragraph_zero_based":37236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Prohibit timer for UE indication of its preference for SCG deactivation. Value in seconds. Value s0 means prohibit timer is set to 0 seconds, value s1 means prohibit timer is set to 1 second and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sensorNameList","paragraph_zero_based":37238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report measurements from specific sensors. NG-RAN configures the field if includeSensor-Meas is configured for one or more measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":37239},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-AssistanceConfigNR","paragraph_zero_based":37240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicate whether UE is configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":37241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sourceDAPS-FailureReporting","paragraph_zero_based":37242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates whether the UE shall generate the SHR upon successfully completing the DAPS handover to the target cell and if a radio link failure was experienced in the source PCell while executing the DAPS handover. This field is set in the otherConfig configured by the source cell of the DAPS handover.","paragraph_zero_based":37243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"successHO-Config","paragraph_zero_based":37244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Configuration for the UE to report the successful handover information to the network.","paragraph_zero_based":37245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"t-SearchDeltaP-Stationary","paragraph_zero_based":37246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Parameter \"TSearchDeltaP-StationaryConnected\" in 5.7.4.4. Value in seconds. Value s5 means 5 seconds, value s10 means 10 seconds and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":37247}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a4e18775219257d77a5681aba99a362010469a40b1b47578c291434a03751407","168e1df27ccdb2c059233c0905a74903fb1ced2d8d8a8f5e99921c0f66be8fff","ae242d41c538cb3339414de903874aa0de21a4c92f62351e77b5913203aec26b","278884a3b2a8fabc414071aef838a3cf44c835ba7ddb1f7a7e45703cf62cf11e","f5839252cb174d4df427652cbb8ea6ba9122f82e3d933382d2577952f5d62f0d","3a3140ab8892a61ac6cd50c54da8649bef2833270478713d9b96b233027b085a","d297270c2cb874b07ed3ea2c5b03c6326e4a3ee12975188af5eff3fb1b1f3489","f829cf67c79f6f9a22cc973b40e407cfa1d9202b6c8616df3ec7804ba2186adf","cc4aa2b62cbd081ab7bdee9168a3ecd1fd0c60d71450bba4ddd34a1083939ebd","ad0f60b9acee5da5a320be164422d5f5937c9654c01a64d3efbcbb0bdeb06e10","6ff342b11c359b328eeaad1bd843e65c7325e3a12202f420204e089604ae3164","6ededa250ae453974d17fbbce28c5a00e4a10f5ef12c5fc36a58695f803e7776","3ca2eb35748869d67ea6036f8fa79bd7f27fb91c8a87f6075b95d8909d65a3d9","4bda17a7bdc29327049a47696423d91b6f7f5a4dfdc49af6ceda7846535e0dfa","cb2709a5566094f4171decf520555bdfee55cd295ef19fa00db2c5fda0760f04","a090462cbc4804aaf83504ebd6e000bdad02ea8a3091ae3ecb8abc7af26fa39c","af005f70ea22300c6b624209b2e6c9628d598a91054c427378cf68f0f2caaa02","dd588159d6eab1ac8ac99061901ed8fe31151cb854b03965d7bafebf2bd48a6f","a705d3b8a4a17e0e35ccd74ffa2e5f1fdead14b05c8a1fb696bd07c901585827","504e0628dc71d950ef57e3f2acbeeeffaab6622926dda25e424d23afd9b9bbd6","3cbcc5cd3a9ae710450ae1c566697dabd440af370bd7e169ccaf3386e89b2a8a","eaab7b4fb791fc03442fdfd0417f14600f047d0c57561278f895781fa858938b","893d110d75b557e4dd322473dbaf605a613e986b6d22a4f1e302ffdd5fa4b1db","55c1b1c2c9c08c1538d4d3606b264eb319792e405695769aaa58ec5b950e7534"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[37224,37247],"projection":"All w:t a