nfig","paragraph_zero_based":37479},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the NR sidelink discovery dedicated resource pool configurations on the configured sidelink BWP. The total number of Rx/Tx resource pools configured for communication and discovery does not exceed the maximum number of Rx/Tx resource pool for NR sidelink communication (i.e. maxNrofRXPool-r16/maxNrofTXPool-r16).","paragraph_zero_based":37480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-Generic","paragraph_zero_based":37481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the generic parameters on the configured sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":37482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-PoolConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the resource pool configurations on the configured sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":37484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-Id","paragraph_zero_based":37485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"An identifier for this sidelink bandwidth part.","paragraph_zero_based":37486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-PoolConfigA2X","paragraph_zero_based":37487}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["df9faf2ca41d45539da1b2f848a37a739b3b076c888c831fd8c0780547076008","41f437945502d139459f037d145f0e23c9ead066c62f44c1156c2d04fdd9188c","b1a251f4c815e9143d3bba7d64d772325d4d7e530d4232f456d26df7e8331e06","83cf8bd849c440bb153362399f0401adfff9cff4ee3e6d20225bc42d5a5a8746","1c1ca50eb632c78d599da60f08ba0266347cb97e9d337400b0081099efe9fca4","919ab460ec54d3d9363202cf1a39c046e1eaa1f49970ff970d899615cc030ec4","90f146a7f9ff6e97bfec84a0b18346b0012d3021e14fdbe45a9867c3d2946127","488526c156dac70b945d9