figCommon","paragraph_zero_based":37527},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the resource pool configurations on the configured sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":37528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-PoolConfigCommonA2X","paragraph_zero_based":37529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the resource pool configurations for A2X services on the configured sidelink BWP.","paragraph_zero_based":37530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-BWP-PoolConfigCommonPS","paragraph_zero_based":37531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the resource pool configurations for power saving on the configured sidelink BWP. This field does not include sl-TxPoolExceptional.","paragraph_zero_based":37532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-BWP-DiscPoolConfig","paragraph_zero_based":37534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-BWP-DiscPoolConfig is used to configure UE specific NR sidelink discovery dedicated resource pool.","paragraph_zero_based":37535}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["72572e36a54153d3afffa4b9a7debc855f28ecbcd5a5760de21d5125f33f128f","c5d37d46cf2d2896fb340743605961f097680cd2de67f1be177245612888ba8a","2c148d922e97532d741898e1136da98868bf782bc79b882b0c79d092b634c380","b467144ffa22c1708f9c54ba5651a51f2debe3e9a9b3377174b7acdb71288573","4f0af38e64c59ea3072cfa2e5536579408abcca43d2cde03714ca93216605b9a","590b7fcbe1c71a593b7406d10d7c0deb1022f349ca0425b4b429dcc768f99d34","2436318b4688ccbab151bde9f5cff2e0d9f5d13851e7df1cada2988708472844","f3e8978603572da234a467a15bfb654783810beb540d53569ac80a73d8bc11ca","6f2f1838d8eb50e020f85a790c790