{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-BWP-DiscPoolConfig information element","paragraph_zero_based":37536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":37537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-BWP-DISCPOOLCONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":37538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-BWP-DiscPoolConfig-r17 ::=        SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":37540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-DiscRxPool-r17                    SEQUENCE (SIZE (1..maxNrofRXPool-r16)) OF SL-ResourcePool-r16        OPTIONAL,    -- Cond HO","paragraph_zero_based":37541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-DiscTxPoolSelected-r17            SL-TxPoolDedicated-r16                                               OPTIONAL,    -- Need M","paragraph_zero_based":37542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    sl-DiscTxPoolScheduling-r17          SL-TxPoolDedicated-r16                                               OPTIONAL     -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":37543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":37544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-BWP-DISCPOOLCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":37546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":37547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-BWP-DiscPoolConfig field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":37549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-DiscTxPoolScheduling","paragraph_zero_based":37550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the resources by which the UE is allowed to transmit NR sidelink discover based on network scheduling on the configured BWP. For the PSFCH related configuration, if configured, will be used for PSFCH transmission/reception.","paragraph_zero_based":37551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When this field is configured together with sl-TxPoolScheduling, the resource pool index (which is used in DCI Format 3_0 in TS 38.212 [17], clause 7.3.1.4.1) is defined as 0, 1,  …,  x-1 for the resource pools included in the sl-TxPoolScheduling, and x, x+1, …, x+y-1 for the resource pools included in sl-DiscTxPoolScheduling, where x is the number of the resource pools in sl-TxPoolScheduling, and y is the number of resource pools in sl-DiscTxPoolScheduling.","paragraph_zero_based":37552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":37554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":37555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO","paragraph_zero_based":37556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field is optionally present, need M, in an RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync; otherwise it is absent, need M.","paragraph_zero_based":37557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-BWP-DiscPoolConfigCommon","paragraph_zero_based":37559}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8b4993805e6b495c4e3fcded55c070d9a24243b5f27a0dcb1537bb5bb30739b6","4757bd2f1d9f043158f7bbc0919d5c78b2b0a5cd959bef7f1883f7e44cd3066a","f4e204e2d230b557c7f0ac40f649258e52eeda543ce87ee332b37e594193e0a0","1c28bbc37be6951bc0af35107ec01e34e58b2397654a6c685ef475d24c5f7af4","16b0959d0e92580dee9a4d02f3e618af3f70f2703e994e87faf61df6a5555640","f4ec517462dc57b8ac153b90c30be374d0087d