{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PSFCH-ToPUCCH-CG-Type1","paragraph_zero_based":37872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field, for sidelink configured grant type 1, indicates slot offset between the PSFCH associated with the last PSSCH resource of each period and the PUCCH occasion used for reporting sidelink HARQ.","paragraph_zero_based":37873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-ResourcePoolID","paragraph_zero_based":37874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the resource pool in which the sidelink configured grant type 1 is applied.","paragraph_zero_based":37875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-StartSubchannelCG-Type1","paragraph_zero_based":37876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the starting sub-channel of sidelink configured grant type 1. An index giving valid sub-channel index.","paragraph_zero_based":37877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-TimeOffsetCG-Type1","paragraph_zero_based":37878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the slot offset with respect to logical slot defined by sl-TimeReferenceSFN-Type1, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":37879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-TimeReferenceSFN-Type1","paragraph_zero_based":37880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates SFN used for determination of the offset of a resource in time domain. If it is present, the UE uses the 1st logical slot of associated resource pool after the starting time of the closest SFN with the indicated number preceding the reception of the sidelink configured grant configuration type 1 as reference logical slot, see TS 38.321 [3], clause 5.8.3. If it is not present, the reference SFN is 0.","paragraph_zero_based":37881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-TimeResourceCG-Type1","paragraph_zero_based":37882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This field indicates the time resource location of sidelink configured grant type 1. An index giving valid combinations of up to two slot positions (jointly encoded) as time resource indicator value (TRIV), as defined in TS 38.212 [17].","paragraph_zero_based":37883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-DestinationIdentity","paragraph_zero_based":37885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-DestinationIdentity is used to identify a destination of a NR sidelink communication.","paragraph_zero_based":37886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DestinationIdentity information element","paragraph_zero_based":37887},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":37888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-DESTINATIONIDENTITY-START","paragraph_zero_based":37889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-DestinationIdentity-r16 ::=           BIT STRING (SIZE (24))","paragraph_zero_based":37891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-DESTINATIONIDENTITY-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":37893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":37894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":37895}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c49698096df099dbd0f1803cef64d96625a246883a5806a2e89257fe4a85cf80","a36436a4bf002940d4fa5a20bbaf916cb5023c7e088498d042ac86505765081c","4a6beadaa6a726d0add4886c2a4da3a6750e86a10ae475ff86b96e680f9e2247","033a13b8c0ae499b62eba94d4dbdfcb250e8e66bcdf7e69c27244aad969a9cbe"