{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, indicate the maximum PUSCH duration of UL-SCH resources that this sidelink logical channel is mapped to, when checking the SR trigger condition. Corresponds to \"sl-MaxPUSCH-Duration\" in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":38352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-PrioritisedBitRate","paragraph_zero_based":38353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Value in kiloBytes/s. Value kBps0 corresponds to 0 kiloBytes/s, value kBps8 corresponds to 8 kiloBytes/s, value kBps16 corresponds to 16 kiloBytes/s, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":38354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-Priority","paragraph_zero_based":38355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Sidelink logical channel priority, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":38356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-SchedulingRequestId","paragraph_zero_based":38357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If present, it indicates the scheduling request configuration applicable for this sidelink logical channel, as specified in TS 38.321 [3].","paragraph_zero_based":38358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38359},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SL-L2RelayUE-Config","paragraph_zero_based":38360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IE SL-L2RelayUE-Config is used to configure L2 U2N relay operation related configurations used by L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":38361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-L2RelayUE-Config information element","paragraph_zero_based":38362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":38363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SL-L2RELAYUE-CONFIG-START","paragraph_zero_based":38364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":38365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SL-L2RelayUE-Config-r17 ::= 