 38.321 [3]","paragraph_zero_based":40912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LatencyBoundCSI-Report","paragraph_zero_based":40913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the latency bound of SL CSI report from the associated SL CSI triggering in terms of number of slots.","paragraph_zero_based":40914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LatencyBoundIUC-Report","paragraph_zero_based":40915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the latency bound of SL Inter-UE coordination report from the associated SL Inter-UE coordination explicit request triggering in terms of number of slots.","paragraph_zero_based":40916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-LogicalChannelIdentity","paragraph_zero_based":40917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the identity of the sidelink logical channel.","paragraph_zero_based":40918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"sl-MappedQoS-FlowsToAddList","paragraph_zero_based":40919}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["f15415f3231103c396b6ccd8c01b204cd933218c4d4711fabdd641c364f27fa2","176b4c6672227456977992cd8fae6fd28e663fd1c7337a9014f64d9be7b09df0","91c8646c2346c77ef5cdedbb6cbb3d2a6f0c9341c17f45bf3b0019cb2c72be80","2d9da262b88a78899811e0325865d12690d67b33935872a15f520c0433a95fc5","5d143f893b0bd65ca95b21b06e05d1195720da9a96e137871d7d072ac6f613ac","094b2f57d7a9b205207ea2e191798c324561805743734732b6a2be1748b06299","c2acebd4f0a1a5586fabc655ef005515558f61597a3e2cb7829751866d0653df","444cd5fba4b7339d3f6d3fa7bfa7c5133813b805fa19f8f399bca36326df428c","3d5361da1b9853020ab3b4aff6250055da60aaac44e3dbb727104db8f5911969","b60ac20c788c190da4d4b83f451707a47a69cc34b1072b771d2fc4152a8b244c","f7bf15b90bde5f6d7a2fc33e2ff7e272ab9a3ddf551cc0