{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T319a","paragraph_zero_based":41280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of RRCResumeRequest or RRCResumeRequest1 when the resume procedure is initiated for SDT.","paragraph_zero_based":41281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCResume, RRCSetup, RRCRelease, RRCReject message or upon failure to resume RRC connection for SDT as specified in 5.3.13.5 or upon cell reselection.","paragraph_zero_based":41282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.13.5.","paragraph_zero_based":41283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T320","paragraph_zero_based":41284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of t320 or upon cell (re)selection to NR from another RAT with validity time configured for dedicated priorities (in which case the remaining validity time is applied).","paragraph_zero_based":41285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon entering RRC_CONNECTED, upon reception of RRCRelease, when PLMN selection or SNPN selection is performed on request by NAS, when the UE enters RRC_IDLE from RRC_INACTIVE, or upon cell (re)selection to another RAT (in which case the timer is carried on to the other RAT).","paragraph_zero_based":41286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Discard the cell reselection priority information provided by dedicated signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":41287},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T321","paragraph_zero_based":41288},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving measConfig including a reportConfig with the reportType set to reportCGI","paragraph_zero_based":41289},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the information needed to set all fields of cgi-info, upon receiving measConfig that includes removal of the reportConfig with the reportType set to reportCGI and upon detecting that a cell is not broadcasting SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":41290},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Initiate the measurement reporting procedure, stop performing the related measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":41291},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T322","paragraph_zero_based":41292},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving measConfig including reportConfigNR with the reportType set to reportSFTD and drx-SFTD-NeighMeas is set to true.","paragraph_zero_based":41293},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the SFTD measurement results, upon receiving measConfig that includes removal of the reportConfig with the reportType set to reportSFTD.","paragraph_zero_based":41294},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Initiate the measurement reporting procedure, stop performing the related measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":41295},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T325","paragraph_zero_based":41296},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCRelease message with deprioritisationTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":41297},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":41298},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Stop deprioritisation of all frequencies or NR signalled by RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":41299},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T330","paragraph_zero_based":41300},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving LoggedMeasurementConfiguration message","paragraph_zero_based":41301},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon log volume exceeding the suitable UE memory, upon initiating the release of LoggedMeasurementConfiguration procedure","paragraph_zero_based":41302},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions specified in 5.5a.1.4","paragraph_zero_based":41303}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a