{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346j (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":41352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":41353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":41354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":41355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T346k (The UE maintains one instance of this timer per cell group)","paragraph_zero_based":41356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting UEAssistanceInformation message with bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig.","paragraph_zero_based":41357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon releasing bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig during the connection re-establishment/resume procedures, upon receiving bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig set to release, or upon performing MR-DC release.","paragraph_zero_based":41358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action.","paragraph_zero_based":41359},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T350","paragraph_zero_based":41360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmitting DedicatedSIBRequest message with requestedSIB-List and/or  requestedPosSIB-List.","paragraph_zero_based":41361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon acquiring the requested SIB(s) or posSIB(s), upon releasing onDemandSIB-Request during the connection re-establishment procedures, upon receiving onDemandSIB-Request set to release, upon reception of RRCRelease or upon successful change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED.","paragraph_zero_based":41362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No action","paragraph_zero_based":41363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T380","paragraph_zero_based":41364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of t380 in RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":41365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCResume, RRCSetup or RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":41366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.13.","paragraph_zero_based":41367},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T390","paragraph_zero_based":41368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"When access attempt is barred at access barring check for an Access Category. The UE maintains one instance of this timer per Access Category.","paragraph_zero_based":41369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon cell (re)selection, upon relay (re)selection, upon entering RRC_CONNECTED, upon reception of RRCReconfiguration including reconfigurationWithSync, upon change of PCell while in RRC_CONNECTED, upon reception of MobilityFromNRCommand, or upon reception of RRCRelease.","paragraph_zero_based":41370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4.","paragraph_zero_based":41371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"T400","paragraph_zero_based":41372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon transmission of RRCReconfigurationSidelink","paragraph_zero_based":41373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon reception of RRCReconfigurationFailureSidelink or RRCReconfigurationCompleteSidelink","paragraph_zero_based":41374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Perform the Sidelink radio link failure related actions as specified in 5.8.9.3.","paragraph_zero_based":41375}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_s