{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- Example with traditional non-critical extension (empty sequence)","paragraph_zero_based":42889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BroadcastInfoBlock1 ::=             SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":42891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    itemIdentity                        INTEGER (1..max),","paragraph_zero_based":42892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field1                              Field1,","paragraph_zero_based":42893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field2                              Field2                  OPTIONAL,           -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":42894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension                BroadcastInfoBlock1-v940-IEs    OPTIONAL","paragraph_zero_based":42895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":42896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BroadcastInfoBlock1-v940-IEs::=SEQUENCE {","paragraph_zero_based":42898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field3-r9                           Field3-r9               OPTIONAL,           -- Cond Cond1","paragraph_zero_based":42899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    field4-r9                           Field4-r9               OPTIONAL,           -- Need N","paragraph_zero_based":42900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    nonCriticalExtension                SEQUENCE {}             OPTIONAL            -- Need S","paragraph_zero_based":42901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":42902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":42904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":42905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, apply the following principles regarding the levels applicable in case of nested error handling:","paragraph_zero_based":42906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-an extension addition group is not regarded as a level on its own. E.g. in the ASN.1 extract in the previous, a error regarding the conditionality of field3 would result in the entire itemInfo entry to be ignored (rather than just the extension addition group containing field3 and field4);","paragraph_zero_based":42907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-a traditional nonCriticalExtension is not regarded as a level on its own. E.g. in the ASN.1 extract in the previous, an error regarding the conditionality of field3 would result in the entire BroadcastInfoBlock1 to be ignored (rather than just the non-critical extension containing field3 and field4).","paragraph_zero_based":42908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"10.5Not comprehended field","paragraph_zero_based":42909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, when receiving an RRC message on any logical channel:","paragraph_zero_based":42910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the message includes a field that the UE does not comprehend:","paragraph_zero_based":42911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["06d57b2de25d993d83ab38ad9eefdd3244a0672d53c875b78f6f94ee252924e5","d42b17ffbdd974c417c8c41923c2d1bf3e46a8db5280a079d122a3370a7e1718","4d16f4d0bb68ac1df8d1af46f3f1373a957e0e7385c2ccbe8591d801718c471a","ef1ec6ad36f3361caeafabcacf5724acdf5e302fcbd9b191ff46981263edfd33","6fccc49d3a2c923e0d51375386f654a9a83ccc4f205c3f1c7bbb