{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312230.zip::R2-2312230-UAV-RRC-CR-Update-v07-rapp-cl.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCellInfoList","paragraph_zero_based":43248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of the best cells on each frequency for which measurement information was available","paragraph_zero_based":43249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"candidateCellInfoListSN-EUTRA","paragraph_zero_based":43250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A list of EUTRA cells including serving cells and best neighbour cells on each serving frequency, for which measurement results were available. This field is only used in NE-DC. ","paragraph_zero_based":43251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":43253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":43254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO","paragraph_zero_based":43255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in case of handover within NR or UE context retrieval, e.g. in case of resume or re-establishment. The field is optionally present in case of handover from E-UTRA/5GC. Otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":43256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"HO2","paragraph_zero_based":43257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present in case of handover within NR; otherwise the field is absent.","paragraph_zero_based":43258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The following table indicates per source RAT whether RAT capabilities are included or not.","paragraph_zero_based":43260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":43261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Source RAT","paragraph_zero_based":43262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":43263},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"E-UTRA capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":43264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MR-DC capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":43265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"UTRA capabilities","paragraph_zero_based":43266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR","paragraph_zero_based":43267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included if UE Radio Capability ID as specified in 23.502 [43] is used for the UE. Included otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":43268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included","paragraph_zero_based":43269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included","paragraph_zero_based":43270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"May be included, ignored by gNB if received","paragraph_zero_based":43271}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["73ce3f155859a013cb1e91276d264d97d6f285b55ad9d22cf56fb2f775ccf314","388fbf1aa640df19cbfd19cc875e0002109f959065fcb0f0d1932395d5aa6fd4","994729dac271cf676e5c280e9a3e90db319277075f324aa56d9fe74b5b4f55fc","0ddefb0df6af75da9b04ad71f17984e2ff65f98b08128df589664f9b5eac1420","a35454c0d871a594d33694c0ea11f657d8de6ed89840668c72e3c392a17233d1","34e35643f030dae92c410cecda49fdbd14e35b1c769f75b49f586143d4d1a96c","d438a9403bd83855ef8ba62763c9ae301af72db333e2b77c368e5768fbbee7a2","f0faee2d00f92b162280f15237d19fe02132291bf98eb9d38f35df8ee39e4b66","894bb2f30b8e870545ff588c8169be438df68ca44160f2c1271e134584c4b4fe","c515214a27830cf388016adb0ced8d894859f6a1d4346bf9060e8be0d8c472ce","4206004a6aab5a09c7786dd6487bea4692f500e91d308a3a61aa13c0b4536b88","54c421bef5984f65f2aebb7b6accc9644976e98c427c199450e33b1b956c5ea8","f94b26447254c5a209dcc5723af7e66d28b3ee7e69fb6a5e0534234fca53d58c","ed