red grant, CA or MIMO re-configuration will be triggered by this message. Further, the UL grant for transmission of RRCResumeComplete and the data is transmitted over common search space with DCI format 0_0.","paragraph_zero_based":44421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In this scenario, the RRC procedure delay [ms] can extend beyond the reception of the UL grant, up to 7 ms.","paragraph_zero_based":44422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":44423}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"88ac48b8abb8e582293899eb6fcf429cfe666bf19f2b5195cc18f96b95e0fc00","original_member_sha256":"b9eae4c3bdf5a2993a73f949e5986a1204cf998aea465f31f717a8289e1b579d","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a5cc64b4ef6430e0d09b262cff8c6187187212ebb9bbe072d6dd6026bcf3a8da","fea85cbf4f7fb950a6e24f445141264f9c062b94f746a840902e70b7319d2109","6905e1632ee90136d564cca20d4d886b2a46ba5d1fa6298d5cc09f08c026c796","d070a2f6e2c52299333712fb6dd6dbdad8613a3e50334931dcc0ab46a306fc73","d1bf6c730a5bf7ab86d9e479ee38116ba5d668ddaed6e230d1b40c073b32c898","8919fd66264c959909e2ba4c1bee75a629cb5e393c0ca630e91214d8ca327b34","c0fda64d1fc53308e566459ffe39825b2a6fa21f48e433473e62e06d7f58f998","bf46f019f3b0c6d05a02f85ce707949f5f82dc6fbd01d99ccb8d3f0429a798c8","8d75fab3c9b5a59680b59223f3ddbab5f4a5b2b024a90294033710f03afadfe9","313d5e1606e5fce19b4d84ee74729a8d8f16f5fa9696c553818af33d8f8efdab","2278190d0c84f69c32414a9b2637e3853e77ab64f064cdf42719d705e12853cc","6ed8f993f8a5797ec747754596c9a17cbc23f6cef461459a89d40187a4fa931c","f092161fb84bc3429838242093999b6a888ae6968578a92ec9f880c305c855c8","f4cc7e93c89222e541bc79933fce114fe4b50298a432a959e4d2f4c666537075","f2f0b8324b03d50dc25068c8cd7370ee5991eee87748699cf5debefd5a081d9e","26a79b0224790957ee49720b92dea142a3b2001677c92842ba17cf2c753eb1be","03e7bb3c4d1683688dae75ce94107f4ed24e64339c229d5833cb04aca49b6c87","0a12169576b83ebcb8b2664714e0d54