{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Including ETWS notification, CMAS notification;","paragraph_zero_based":120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Including positioning assistance data.","paragraph_zero_based":121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-RRC connection control:","paragraph_zero_based":122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Paging;","paragraph_zero_based":123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Establishment/modification/suspension/resumption/release of RRC connection, including e.g. assignment/modification of UE identity (C-RNTI, fullI-RNTI, etc.), establishment/modification/suspension/resumption/release of SRBs (except for SRB0);","paragraph_zero_based":124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Access barring;","paragraph_zero_based":125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Initial AS security activation, i.e. initial configuration of AS integrity protection (SRBs, DRBs) and AS ciphering (SRBs, DRBs);","paragraph_zero_based":126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-RRC connection mobility including e.g. intra-frequency and inter-frequency handover, path switch from a PCell to a target L2 U2N Relay UE or from a L2 U2N Relay UE to a target PCell or from a source L2 U2N Relay UE to a target L2 U2N Relay UE, associated AS security handling, i.e. key/algorithm change, specification of RRC context information transferred between network nodes;","paragraph_zero_based":127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Establishment/modification/suspension/resumption/release of RBs carrying user data (DRBs/MRBs);","paragraph_zero_based":128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4Measurement report triggering","paragraph_zero_based":133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.1General","paragraph_zero_based":134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If AS security has been activated successfully, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the corresponding reportConfig includes a reportType set to eventTriggered or periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the corresponding measObject concerns NR:","paragraph_zero_based":138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the corresponding reportConfig includes measRSSI-ReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the resource indicated by the rmtc-Config on the associated frequency to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the eventA1 or eventA2 is configured in the corresponding reportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider only the serving cell to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the eventA3 or eventA5 is configured in the corresponding reportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3f53f0c4586bf8b254425277e9fb8bd7efccfd50075268b0780d8dfe6812ec6a","dd55dd5fa0ca6e11267286f5cf6a2d83721a9a27b5772151850c375478837a29","f0546148ed848e73cb96b7de97f3364013e93ee879ef31518ab71e23852c586a","2c016edb20e85bcefab27eba03f82151e604afaef6f5c90d52967c78c4b31c54","781c045c5343e0dd110d2c4b5fb4490d3e5383276b67e765ba947f90db000607","3db7ef25d496300b40a75bc7c432b995ec204e731d00afd48d0f9c56f159f0ab","55efe50c8ee1b258bd884bf206b55a3e6fdda39f8077f3b7a76d9690eadc5c00","d12b42b834cbc9f9f2a96568ad9b0be56ca4572438a4937f58aa702dac33fc80","d16bc278f990d6fce7c2c5ffaa786ece9b97f19eb49101883c961859ca0a4ae9","69921fb42ec48f3305e46b417a52ad356363ade2221e7e5411e4e6411df900cc","dad89f395aca6469afb00cacf2a36da5d370ff7e2a4f0907074a07adcf2f966d","0037ee52aec4ba451a9249ae5088c48cc92571dad66203234eba3d44d45bb7dd","a6e1a4f0d1d12d808954a28b331c69f126a1d657f1e463db4e18ff2b4085d43e","f0c157f3be6893639f2dc2d4090d56aa479de1ba379a086ec4c27444d440c9db","1c8ad37bdf0f2efc7aa11d3a3cf01f8bf88b3bb7ce19a243d4ae35e8916ff44e","21863cdc2f38fc4d4df2f606decc64b6c164e22882653d6756afc19360835322","8dd0b4bae308758f6a22c357f48a3bb3390ab93962317c42226a3b35430eb27c","a45ffc2795c8c55cd493e80b698ebde1caf09e9732a2fa02b98cd9f672c87d75","18bf5302b9da92c9e310e6f31a1ddd769a3ea15513272288441c9a898abeb9af","026db37a4d1ad395b62f13e4dcadf1bb9a7d0d33745715993deccb7ca9312444","bf0eb1cd8dce01f36e76e92e99f1434879d66bb6bdffca44f45d240bc31d237e","1951bad7b00e52e212df24f812e09d94d10056a1d6422eeb030bf64d025f5061","1f777fab5b3531041effc28f9846830e1bd0481fc786385f58454c7e4b79d08a","b860b3b0e984b237f7b88f579ae85b483efc74bdfd76d8a906e14ab0410419d1"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[120,143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx:p120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if a serving cell is associated with a measObjectNR and neighbours are associated with another measObjectNR, consider any serving cell associated with the other measObjectNR to be a neighbouring cell as well;","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the eventX2 is configured in the corresponding reportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider only the serving L2 U2N Relay UE to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if corresponding reportConfig includes reportType set to periodical; or","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for measurement events other than eventA1, eventA2, eventD1 or eventX2:","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if useAllowedCellList is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>consider any neighbouring cell detected based on parameters in the associated measObjectNR to be applicable when the concerned cell is included in the allowedCellsToAddModList defined within the VarMeasConfig for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>consider any neighbouring cell detected based on parameters in the associated measObjectNR to be applicable when the concerned cell is not included in the excludedCellsToAddModList defined within the VarMeasConfig for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding measObject concerns E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if eventB1 or eventB2 is configured in the corresponding reportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider a serving cell, if any, on the associated E-UTRA frequency as neighbour cell;","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider any neighbouring cell detected on the associated frequency to be applicable when the concerned cell is not included in the excludedCellsToAddModListEUTRAN defined within the VarMeasConfig for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding measObject concerns UTRA-FDD:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if eventB1-UTRA-FDD or eventB2-UTRA-FDD is configured in the corresponding reportConfig; or","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if corresponding reportConfig includes reportType set to periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider a neighbouring cell on the associated frequency to be applicable when the concerned cell is included in the cellsToAddModList defined within the VarMeasConfig for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding measObject concerns L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if eventY1-Relay or eventY2-Relay or eventZ1-Relay is configured in the corresponding reportConfig; or","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if corresponding reportConfig includes reportType set to periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider any L2 U2N Relay UE fulfilling upper layer criteria detected on the associated frequency to be applicable for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the corresponding reportConfig includes a reportType set to reportCGI:","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell detected on the associated measObject which has a physical cell identity matching the value of the cellForWhichToReportCGI included in the corresponding reportConfig within the VarMeasConfig to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the corresponding reportConfig includes a reportType set to reportSFTD:","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["97a2c8c716b3787a324a7d71aea3cd0fc2c2d82b3d15619a5e9478f92961cc76","0995f54b5efa0131d90f27b3a46ef7df237792fa7ff337be58dbda00b8cffb50","c58231c83d3854ca8745f98d9e90b849ad12f6d5fad945f5a2e1537f0c0e06b9","a37bf112388f7bfe2f097fc0611caae7c1ffc24e06b3138417075516e563c9fa","b11d1714fd8567412c4d61610f5cf25cce148113e9cacbf4fad5dfd5e589a586","92119d5f43c6ecf852bcee847f462b8f9cc333943625ea953a1af5f7baf1a331","d7c2fe71cfbba4bef94670d389bf10641697c5c0094ff5c1e3fed5f99958dd1b","955248561c4f4c7e0878173e734a4cdad483d7ea8f98873de538fba2980ac887","46da5039f16d4f2533281a261d83b740f0d0334fc788f49fe5b9a34458db81ce","96f6c5e4346937641cb0363322a00108ef35028530fb387b47c35faa2eebee14","a423ba203668dbab6c72379aec5e3047b8d4c6c2967d5ffd0630e20b81eb489f","5ab7f16c0c7901effb89f0af7ecb01daf09ffea8ceb92425a52b04b2202b080e","d8e6d4fb1f3c6264dce2d78eb25d0c9dceacd1f9efe68578a4812d7c5c64b775","ac3145c728c62c612eec55ac1f737d1c629b9c68cf8fe6dc861583a5492d129e","b9ecd03675b0cb533a22907fe2c1659dc452e48d7b6c66f409b9af76b97baf38","36a282c074dc3d815f38d82603c717a70596399d9c9f4edce8d64c42d045e233","b4e8dda56b0c95807c2f88b4f26f81be48f50bfe4f6075d8167fd092336fdcf7","63a809134d9eaa2da5d373635a2fff976d73ed969eff948c381f9820f656af54","966f444cc8cc7fb9dbd9a04c06342fc20acc612219d9e2bdf56709d0d662e94e","19c98aaeb1ee948d601e6263d5fe1b5227ed876a25db0f0f0cea4c11c5cc865c","5a35ef672a67c99358d5b9