{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the corresponding measObject concerns NR:","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportSFTD-Meas is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the NR PSCell to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if the reportSFTD-NeighMeas is included:","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if cellsForWhichToReportSFTD is configured in the corresponding reportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>consider any NR neighbouring cell detected on the associated measObjectNR which has a physical cell identity that is included in the cellsForWhichToReportSFTD to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>consider up to 3 strongest NR neighbouring cells detected based on parameters in the associated measObjectNR to be applicable when the concerned cells are not included in the excludedCellsToAddModList defined within the VarMeasConfig for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding measObject concerns E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportSFTD-Meas is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider the E-UTRA PSCell to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the corresponding reportConfig includes a reportType set to cli-Periodical or cli-EventTriggered:","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider all CLI measurement resources included in the corresponding measObject to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the corresponding reportConfig includes a reportType set to rxTxPeriodical:","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider all Rx-Tx time difference measurement resources included in the corresponding measObject to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the corresponding reportConfig concerns the reporting for NR sidelink communication/discovery (i.e. reportConfigNR-SL):","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the transmission resource pools indicated by the tx-PoolMeasToAddModList defined within the VarMeasConfig for this measId to be applicable;","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered and if the entry condition applicable for this event, i.e. the event corresponding with the eventId of the corresponding reportConfig within VarMeasConfig, is fulfilled for one or more applicable cells for all measurements after layer 3 filtering taken during timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarMeasConfig, while the VarMeasReportList does not include a measurement reporting entry for this measId (a first cell triggers the event):","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include the concerned cell(s) in the cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if useT312 is set to true in reportConfig for this event:","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T310 for the corresponding SpCell is running; and","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if T312 is not running for corresponding SpCell:","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["462594d7c7534df82da7aa19e3c92340596b38712b5cb75ef68e5e7c853c49e6","9bde3f3c7e006b322436b6311f2ad318949f7533272eecf996f42ce5280a80bf","020b67a072640f4b932987189b1e0a1cf2b5dec8b15e3073e3da42543f416093","c4eb83ffea8eb453c6915595146d1f8268513aabdd0ebf1622b5b64dbc53e406","f8be197233bc7ff9f43ee2931d4fdff53101724d74d16dee734ba1701d11dde7","edb7f9b20e6b2be7ac94336d67f5ce09aff5402b0b31d9ad6840e043f85218fc","9950a0962096fa646340c508057756d1a02dfa51991d9b82a2d994b79c537005","6e9ed2c2fe4edb4238a2eec859f7b9e6cd694b8ede5cb1ba80b7d5902415faa3","9269f8e2b7398cd4d0b703b8d71572ede48f9d01f627db4b61c3d5864bad016f","1717c8c1c7bfbd59a07c9363be1927d04c385d612e59fd3364c2f14322b235c8","632d3a31502dbe833ce6a3a07705510c5fd857c630e1fc4ff41723fcf2c931d0","b9ffe51bc1c0462cca2aed84524d9b7caf7142558fa1e4a3a3503f644b0c651c","51084bb0e4e0f3ce1ebe9f4a68eb7594b7c832ec233d98afef4ef5451ad78a4f","781b991bd49f9f4bd63dd131f2f6cbd86c8f501294b9b7adc09d1b6d051005c1","e389c3d93ec31269a83c2296660e6f43f25bdbf5186dcae519da8e70a178f619","73b03d8648919ad162b3fba8ce27208e6e96faef598f8ba0144b409025d2bbbc","b15b41bfc07f079cf591f4de47889ffdab6b054ebba823a2c46a2d40f9ab59eb","b72491280fff69ea8f2641980908c569cb2032d77b93abbdff86db9b7a7ff20e","3875c381b39d8fad2dea722d986a4a1f5f79203518c7daefec820af189473214","4437c121c5f1c57425e1bc308ebae003e80b6bc0455b639f363b5099dffb6424","a8260973a47112b5dc1d612476be3a1d25571b6cbaaa511d0e911dc199c6108e","9c719d27ef616ac7a24f4a91e27e499ec1c66f3e6b8798060bbefc50b96e0de0","689b43e5927c55a38