, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered and if the leaving condition applicable for this event is fulfilled for one or more applicable transmission resource pools included in the poolsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId for all measurements taken during timeToTrigger defined within the VarMeasConfig for this event:","paragraph_zero_based":234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the concerned transmission resource pool(s) in the poolsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the poolsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId is empty:","paragraph_zero_based":236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop the periodical reporting timer for this measId, if running","paragraph_zero_based":238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the reportType is set to eventTriggered and if the eventId is set to eventD1 and if the entering condition applicable for this event, i.e. the event corresponding with the eventId of the corresponding reportConfig within VarMeasConfig, is fulfilled during timeToTrigger defined for this event within the VarMeasConfig, while the VarMeasReportList does not include a measurement reporting entry for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["df87b540e14d743797d067323ef3423857bbe22e7ec398497f1be47f84934c29","1b