{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the reportType is set to eventTriggered and if the eventId is set to eventD1 and if the leaving condition applicable for this event is fulfilled for the associated VarMeasReport within the VarMeasReportList for this measId during timeToTrigger defined within the VarMeasConfig for this event:","paragraph_zero_based":243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if reportOnLeave is set to true for the corresponding reporting configuration:","paragraph_zero_based":244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5;","paragraph_zero_based":245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the periodical reporting timer for this measId, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if reportType is set to periodical and if a (first) measurement result is available:","paragraph_zero_based":249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfReportsSent defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId to 0;","paragraph_zero_based":251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the corresponding reportConfig includes measRSSI-ReportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure as specified in 5.5.5 immediately when RSSI sample values are reported by the physical layer after the first L1 measurement duration;","paragraph_zero_based":253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding reportConfig includes the ul-DelayValueConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after a first measurement result is provided from lower layers of the associated DRB identity;","paragraph_zero_based":255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the corresponding reportConfig includes the ul-ExcessDelayConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after a first measurement result is provided from lower layers of the associated DRB identity(ies) according to the configured threshold per DRB identity(ies);","paragraph_zero_based":257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if the reportAmount exceeds 1:","paragraph_zero_based":258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the NR SpCell or for the serving L2 U2N Relay UE (if the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE);","paragraph_zero_based":259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e. the reportAmount is equal to 1):","paragraph_zero_based":260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the NR SpCell and for the strongest cell among the applicable cells, or for the NR SpCell and for the strongest L2 U2N Relay UEs among the applicable L2 U2N Relay UEs; or initiate the measurement reporting procedure, as specified in 5.5.5, immediately after the quantity to be reported becomes available for the serving L2 U2N Relay UE and for the strongest cell among the applicable cells (if the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE);","paragraph_zero_based":261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, in case the corresponding reportConfig concerns the reporting for NR sidelink communication/discovery, reportType is set to periodical and if a (first) measurement result is available:","paragraph_zero_based":262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include a measurement reporting entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a7f76f7899706563e68d70c44a2419f21c74e9e0b9771dc32a87f0ed750225b8","4bf6352931e08f4ae7639b768264d1589b26da7bedd1822566973895d35525b0","2b118d719ba42aafcc469b5675b4f0f06828e1b6db6712aae00db04970aa7365","f208f455f863d7dd7008d47763d361f4097171f1cd4062b79f831781887fb6b5","9308a40fb87d7f1bc81fe83df0aa0c8501b5fecdb394ac9f9a25894ae9bbfe75","3d94e0b75fa00f6515bf1268be608833c1f6da6794a756621c60f1b637955e9d","a9ed7db8e041fbbe80904f7351c9dd32222ff51d31cacd3eb457f0e4e78d1879","b2df28f16a2afc0803171a4346f5a5c60ea1690fc28acfdddbc451f3bb68f72c","33659e56586989800e1a32a11cadc4afd358e1906fd9f6db03264a7b22a3ab61","3708620fb05a6f434f9d05618ba498da3973215377c7ff805ffbeb3aeccee55b","de41465ff04c471ad8a9b85dcac6f006c77fc172bed784a254589d85c511e824","5e8ef1fdc66cc6dc3ba90dde172e984264fab8854efe80a47debc52a644c4607","be1eba5475e626ab32693690d5a2f030372091f9ff8eca1b494061827c355585",