{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultServFreqListNR-SCG to include for each NR SCG serving cell that is configured with servingCellMO, if any, the following:","paragraph_zero_based":384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportConfig associated with the measId that triggered the measurement reporting includes rsType:","paragraph_zero_based":385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the serving cell measurements based on the rsType included in the reportConfig that triggered the measurement report are available according to the measurement configuration associated with the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultServingCell within measResultServFreqListNR-SCG to include RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR of the serving cell, derived based on the rsType included in the reportConfig that triggered the measurement report;","paragraph_zero_based":387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if SSB based serving cell measurements are available according to the measurement configuration associated with the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultServingCell within measResultServFreqListNR-SCG to include RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR of the serving cell, derived based on SSB;","paragraph_zero_based":390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else if CSI-RS based serving cell measurements are available according to the measurement configuration associated with the SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultServingCell within measResultServFreqListNR-SCG to include RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR of the serving cell, derived based on CSI-RS;","paragraph_zero_based":392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if results for the serving cell derived based on SSB are included:","paragraph_zero_based":393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the ssbFrequency to the value indicated by ssbFrequency as included in the MeasObjectNR of the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if results for the serving cell derived based on CSI-RS are included:","paragraph_zero_based":395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the refFreqCSI-RS to the value indicated by refFreqCSI-RS as included in the MeasObjectNR of the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportConfig associated with the measId that triggered the measurement reporting includes reportQuantityRS-Indexes and maxNrofRS-IndexesToReport:","paragraph_zero_based":397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each serving cell configured with servingCellMO, include beam measurement information according to the associated reportConfig as described in 5.5.5.2, where availability is considered according to the measurement configuration associated with the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if reportConfig associated with the measId that triggered the measurement reporting includes reportAddNeighMeas:","paragraph_zero_based":399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the measObjectNR indicated by the servingCellMO includes the RS resource configuration corresponding to the rsType indicated in the reportConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultNeighCellListNR within measResultServFreqListNR-SCG to include one entry with the physCellId and the available measurement quantities based on the reportQuantityCell and rsType indicated in reportConfig of the non-serving cell corresponding to the concerned measObjectNR with the highest measured RSRP if RSRP measurement results are available for cells corresponding to this measObjectNR, otherwise with the highest measured RSRQ if RSRQ measurement results are available for cells corresponding to this measObjectNR, otherwise with the highest measured SINR, where availability is considered according to the measurement configuration associated with the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the reportConfig associated with the measId that triggered the measurement reporting includes reportQuantityRS-Indexes and maxNrofRS-IndexesToReport:","paragraph_zero_based":402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>for each best non-serving cell included in the measurement report:","paragraph_zero_based":403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9>include beam measurement information according to the associated reportConfig as described in 5.5.5.2, where availability is considered according to the measurement configuration associated with the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the measRSSI-ReportConfig is configured within the corresponding reportConfig for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the rssi-Result to the linear average of sample value(s) provided by lower layers in the reportInterval;","paragraph_zero_based":406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the channelOccupancy to the rounded percentage of sample values which are beyond the channelOccupancyThreshold within all the sample values in the reportInterval;","paragraph_zero_based":407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2c73b3016736cb6502e10f3a18bec86157110d92f04e28bb8145d474e8d373d4","d7f2e33910396a6159a13c18399a88562272eef5680dbcfadd1be7e0f934058b","74d505ac4bd604b37f56616