{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the sl-MeasResultServingRelay in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the cellIdentity to include the cellAccessRelatedInfo contained in the discovery message received from the serving L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the sl-RelayUE-Identity to include the Source L2 ID of the serving L2 U2N Relay;","paragraph_zero_based":411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> if the measurement of serving L2 U2N Relay UE is based on SL-RSRP:","paragraph_zero_based":412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   4> set the sl-MeasResult to include the SL-RSRP of the serving L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   4> set the sl-MeasQuantity to SL-RSRP;","paragraph_zero_based":414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> else:","paragraph_zero_based":415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   4> set the sl-MeasResult to include the SD-RSRP of the serving L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"   4> set the sl-MeasQuantity to SD-RSRP;","paragraph_zero_based":417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:In case of no data transmission from L2 U2N Relay UE to L2 U2N Remote UE, it is left to UE implementation whether to use SL-RSRP or SD-RSRP when setting the sl-MeasResultServingRelay of the serving L2 U2N Relay UE.","paragraph_zero_based":418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if there is at least one applicable neighbouring cell or candidate L2 U2N Relay UE to report:","paragraph_zero_based":419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered or periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measurement report concerns the candidate L2 U2N Relay UE:","paragraph_zero_based":421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-MeasResultsCandRelay in measResultNeighCells to include the best candidate L2 U2N Relay UEs up to maxNrofRelayMeas in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered:","paragraph_zero_based":423},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the L2 U2N Relay UEs included in the relaysTriggeredList as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":424},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":425},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the applicable L2 U2N Relay UEs for which the new measurement results became available since the last periodical reporting or since the measurement was initiated or reset;","paragraph_zero_based":426},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each L2 U2N Relay UE that is included in the sl-MeasResultsCandRelay:","paragraph_zero_based":427},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the cellIdentity to include the cellAccessRelatedInfo contained in the discovery message received from the concerned L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":428},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the sl-RelayUE-Identity to include the Source L2 ID of the concerned L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":429},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the sl-MeasResult to include the SD-RSRP of the concerned L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":430},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each included L2 U2N Relay UE, include the layer 3 filtered measured results in accordance with the reportConfig for this measId, ordered as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":431}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5373df20386dd8c2f89a3a0b0365cfd86b04b046cbbadee0a1a6f06f985a1d1f","ac8f4f8d7e344fcff722fadb7bb5b2247bed5e621309f6ce88e92411654c2ea4","3a0a8a40cf31c1a9d6ba16369a9e649f28503b011994aec171f870b3dde44de6","b512588524464064b8499c5a0e9f3b4e5b699902373bd46b7acd66ed4094ff0e","42842575c375dd976b33f3831251aba9a652b2218120a45eb68c34c94fe52468","9124831308d322157f9b93ddb943dc0756cc705396b33749ea1140b057ed13b0","c1106fc58110f2eafb8ecc39d2b13a12d8d5f4a12b67260d2e9912958d428e34","9ee1169fb8f47eef43e17d5ec872d7797ca6441ce4080ae3f3064091a37dc548","f2c1ea00755b7e5f69362bc6c3a0b7212a34b6b1c1ac1913c52510dadaf291f4","49d479d51fd2b3b87861e070175717938b76c59742c4df37b1a22974136eb762","94f60ba4e528eebe8091b1816b6bc71c206be49dfd084c8ae454209f589bd5c1","2da68f2bf8a9e8458530b72e8280bf14c6c71239f6f3bc2eb7e306ff16bbc5d8","2cda9ea3fbf5ca82cecbf30d177f199ff671ee4dd29eebc5613222bce1319066","f223fc377aab7942078a5dca748dc94d6221006812d053773ee32cf2c4a4aa65","d1105281e433c6cb72fd49a71761ef832a352be077cad1c052aba9f0adb42118","7f560ce9ae7f1678516841fbf48e53fafa505521ccbc56914e51806a48ac0c90","8c25c6371e6174591a442fc4f98f987a8660ef7a1d861979eb895237d7475cbd","2ec32f3d497d372e2c3857367e85bcd2c496fa0721c756ce589e90dfdd0ad442","64c405fc856d28f96a6442eb63f330603e749e5dcf0b76203289550605aa0445","74f640994c82839ff3d314413cfd5e2a3e58a6cc9c513174ad12e5d5f380fa5e","82e13a0f061968002eec7a2fbbc90e7b7411df826a9fdf5616444067a9491277","efcf11e5f8eec18a6be8d0cb869331a06b43dad86edafcf23366b44752328f71","77bf30b69cc5dbf24e856a9a8b37448432c0e00db6bb042e33229dc1d08a515b","dd395c4d56528211bfb2e0e2ef1baefc1dad6ee86470ce66321a1cb6873f9389"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[408,431],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx:p408"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the sl-MeasResult to include the quantity(ies) indicated in the reportQuantityRelay within the concerned reportConfigRelay in decreasing order of the sorting quantity, determined as specified in 5.5.5.3, i.e. the best L2 U2N Relay UE is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":432},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":433},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the measResultNeighCells to include the best neighbouring cells up to maxReportCells in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":434},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered and eventId is not set to eventD1:","paragraph_zero_based":435},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the cells included in the cellsTriggeredList as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":436},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":437},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the applicable cells for which the new measurement results became available since the last periodical reporting or since the measurement was initiated or reset;","paragraph_zero_based":438},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each cell that is included in the measResultNeighCells, include the physCellId;","paragraph_zero_based":439},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered or periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":440},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for each included cell, include the layer 3 filtered measured results in accordance with the reportConfig for this measId, ordered as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":441},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the measObject associated with this measId concerns NR:","paragraph_zero_based":442},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>if rsType in the associated reportConfig is set to ssb:","paragraph_zero_based":443},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9>set resultsSSB-Cell within the measResult to include the SS/PBCH block based quantity(ies) indicated in the reportQuantityCell within the concerned reportConfig, in decreasing order of the sorting quantity, determined as specified in 5.5.5.3, i.e. the best cell is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":444},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9>if reportQuantityRS-Indexes and maxNrofRS-IndexesToReport are configured, include beam measurement information as described in 5.5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":445},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>else if rsType in the associated reportConfig is set to csi-rs:","paragraph_zero_based":446},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9>set resultsCSI-RS-Cell within the measResult to include the CSI-RS based quantity(ies) indicated in the reportQuantityCell within the concerned reportConfig, in decreasing order of the sorting quantity, determined as specified in 5.5.5.3, i.e. the best cell is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":447},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"9>if reportQuantityRS-Indexes and maxNrofRS-IndexesToReport are configured, include beam measurement information as described in 5.5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":448},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the measObject associated with this measId concerns E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":449},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>set the measResult to include the quantity(ies) indicated in the reportQuantity within the concerned reportConfigInterRAT in decreasing order of the sorting quantity, determined as specified in 5.5.5.3, i.e. the best cell is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":450},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>if the measObject associated with this measId concerns UTRA-FDD and if ReportConfigInterRAT includes the reportQuantityUTRA-FDD:","paragraph_zero_based":451},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"8>set the measResult to include the quantity(ies) indicated in the reportQuantityUTRA-FDD within the concerned reportConfigInterRAT in decreasing order of the sorting quantity, determined as specified in 5.5.5.3, i.e. the best cell is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":452},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":453},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cell indicated by cellForWhichToReportCGI is an NR cell:","paragraph_zero_based":454},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if plmn-IdentityInfoList of the cgi-Info for the concerned cell has been obtained:","paragraph_zero_based":455}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5018db0eda77a763dedbc1373d0b3db450387a2b21fcccc762c58c6c18e48d7a","8ec17ca633e6c19bda248c968c99b0af00e3a71644d757d36f1f1bbc6adc5647","d22b353f05a27b0fa75420ecfa127bb796784a8463aa81188c7b88fe64834c4a","65901c6dd97b1d40f3c40b5a7741f211a46f62ce913cca886c510bb74161a590","f308f2368b7ba69275bdc00f762f2db892a286a3199faf777c7e444c0ec027c0","59c9ed9eebe6872d7e50eea4d3e6a16fe2a06f7b488da5de20f111c1e33b739c","00a7f48fb51939f7a3bd0a097d33d0ea61a7f6e1ced8b494d501c50ff27e10c5","930d38591c81bd1012370eb1cb8741363dbb9f8a42f71278bad184db46be1349","87c0390195c2558fa81dcc9e8a7b5e08b2ee56d4e578cc5b92ef3e7cf83d3384","80e7a565384929b3da4a558b27713cdb5c98a6ac19143f8726a2131f865013a2","0c20dbe93e9f966ce7b6b9f64d9a93dec63a9890eaba2164f7dd854a8e8afbd0","3f927d46f5e2c204b6b192ea81296c2fba10c983a93ba23d5d06e1a364c53536","5c749d30c4af787dc47dca51feda9e92520a7bdb84581762eed451a0c8042e80","dc60a9bc52df2bc4cf048939197829d53e579f0a8d06dd87060d43ca7e74420d","6ba451e1d215a5f572fa33e349cb190ac0edb45ff3c351506885365a6160cef0","cbbb18f6aae81f320d11e6539031db106be4190c2cfd009d440a3debdbc69f68","64919967c3f58042d7714b9db1abb9eb4c9aaa5b97e4b27e855a7e877accd999","19e7beee502ff3221ce9445087c3e15478a9bc16476e02c50c481ff72478ba19","29ea858f4d9591bc8947d2dfe71e8e0565096116c032c2150edfc6ca4a785d49","5d121f5d97ab142d5cf4118d24c569f8cf89a1c3cd657802e1767d657d26f6e9","d09ac3f3fc65f4813858aaa76609c84ed8025e791e20f23f9f3dd2680a189004","d1db32cc09fd7a0645584fc0071000049857b21007c3315be34f2204053e1b12","e1de3f9e0e362d977823bca8e163facd66a67067c8774a06d03941f1b6775bf9","0e3fe32592af5298c84a362a39641b103ff2001959767818e81722a900f4f913"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[432,455],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx:p432"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the plmn-IdentityInfoList including plmn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode (if available), trackingAreaList (if available), ranac (if available), cellIdentity and cellReservedForOperatorUse for each entry of the plmn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":456},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include frequencyBandList if available;","paragraph_zero_based":457},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each PLMN-IdentityInfo in plmn-IdentityInfoList:","paragraph_zero_based":458},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the gNB-ID-Length is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":459},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include gNB-ID-Length;","paragraph_zero_based":460},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if nr-CGI-Reporting-NPN is supported by the UE and npn-IdentityInfoList of the cgi-Info for the concerned cell has been obtained:","paragraph_zero_based":461},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the npn-IdentityInfoList including npn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, ranac (if available), cellIdentity and cellReservedForOperatorUse for each entry of the npn-IdentityInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":462},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each NPN-IdentityInfo in NPN-IdentityInfoList:","paragraph_zero_based":463},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the gNB-ID-Length is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":464},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>include gNB-ID-Length;","paragraph_zero_based":465},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include cellReservedForOtherUse if available;","paragraph_zero_based":466},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else if MIB indicates the SIB1 is not broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":467},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the noSIB1 including the ssb-SubcarrierOffset and pdcch-ConfigSIB1 obtained from MIB of the concerned cell;","paragraph_zero_based":468},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cell indicated by cellForWhichToReportCGI is an E-UTRA cell:","paragraph_zero_based":469},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if all mandatory fields of the cgi-Info-EPC for the concerned cell have been obtained:","paragraph_zero_based":470},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include in the cgi-Info-EPC the fields broadcasted in E-UTRA SystemInformationBlockType1 associated to EPC;","paragraph_zero_based":471},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is E-UTRA/5GC capable and all mandatory fields of the cgi-Info-5GC for the concerned cell have been obtained:","paragraph_zero_based":472},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include in the cgi-Info-5GC the fields broadcasted in E-UTRA SystemInformationBlockType1 associated to 5GC;","paragraph_zero_based":473},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the mandatory present fields of the cgi-Info for the cell indicated by the cellForWhichToReportCGI in the associated measObject have been obtained:","paragraph_zero_based":474},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the freqBandIndicator;","paragraph_zero_based":475},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the cell broadcasts the multiBandInfoList, include the multiBandInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":476},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the cell broadcasts the freqBandIndicatorPriority, include the freqBandIndicatorPriority;","paragraph_zero_based":477},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the corresponding measObject concerns NR:","paragraph_zero_based":478},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportSFTD-Meas is set to true within the corresponding reportConfigNR for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":479}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b7