{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultSFTD-NR in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":480},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sfn-OffsetResult and frameBoundaryOffsetResult to the measurement results provided by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":481},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportRSRP is set to true;","paragraph_zero_based":482},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set rsrp-Result to the RSRP of the NR PSCell derived based on SSB;","paragraph_zero_based":483},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the reportSFTD-NeighMeas is included within the corresponding reportConfigNR for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":484},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each applicable cell which measurement results are available, include an entry in the measResultCellListSFTD-NR and set the contents as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":485},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set physCellId to the physical cell identity of the concerned NR neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":486},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sfn-OffsetResult and frameBoundaryOffsetResult to the measurement results provided by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":487},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportRSRP is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":488},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set rsrp-Result to the RSRP of the concerned cell derived based on SSB;","paragraph_zero_based":489},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the corresponding measObject concerns E-UTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":490},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportSFTD-Meas is set to true within the corresponding reportConfigInterRAT for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":491},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultSFTD-EUTRA in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":492},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sfn-OffsetResult and frameBoundaryOffsetResult to the measurement results provided by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":493},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportRSRP is set to true;","paragraph_zero_based":494},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set rsrpResult-EUTRA to the RSRP of the EUTRA PSCell;","paragraph_zero_based":495},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if average uplink PDCP delay values are available:","paragraph_zero_based":496},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the ul-PDCP-DelayValueResultList to include the corresponding average uplink PDCP delay values;","paragraph_zero_based":497},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if PDCP excess delay measurements are available:","paragraph_zero_based":498},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the ul-PDCP-ExcessDelayResultList to include the corresponding PDCP excess delay measurements;","paragraph_zero_based":499},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the includeCommonLocationInfo is configured in the corresponding reportConfig for this measId and detailed location information that has not been reported is available, set the content of commonLocationInfo of the locationInfo as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":500},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the locationTimestamp;","paragraph_zero_based":501},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the locationCoordinate, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":502},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the velocityEstimate, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":503}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9ae31df5b10c0c5dc7f816d08a8f1df1e97a599f06