{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the locationError, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":504},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the locationSource, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":505},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if available, include the gnss-TOD-msec,","paragraph_zero_based":506},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the coarseLocationRequest is set to true in the corresponding reportConfig for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":507},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include coarseLocationInfo, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":508},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the includeWLAN-Meas is configured in the corresponding reportConfig for this measId, set the wlan-LocationInfo of the locationInfo in the measResults as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":509},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if available, include the LogMeasResultWLAN, in order of decreasing RSSI for WLAN APs;","paragraph_zero_based":510},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the includeBT-Meas is configured in the corresponding reportConfig for this measId, set the BT-LocationInfo of the locationInfo in the measResults as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":511},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if available, include the LogMeasResultBT, in order of decreasing RSSI for Bluetooth beacons;","paragraph_zero_based":512},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the includeSensor-Meas is configured in the corresponding reportConfig for this measId, set the sensor-LocationInfo of the locationInfo in the measResults as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":513},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if available, include the sensor-MeasurementInformation;","paragraph_zero_based":514},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if available, include the sensor-MotionInformation;","paragraph_zero_based":515},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if there is at least one applicable transmission resource pool for NR sidelink communication/discovery (for measResultsSL):","paragraph_zero_based":516},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultsListSL to include the CBR measurement results in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":517},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered:","paragraph_zero_based":518},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the transmission resource pools included in the poolsTriggeredList as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":519},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":520},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the applicable transmission resource pools for which the new measurement results became available since the last periodical reporting or since the measurement was initiated or reset;","paragraph_zero_based":521},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the corresponding measObject concerns NR sidelink communication/discovery, then for each transmission resource pool to be reported:","paragraph_zero_based":522},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-poolReportIdentity to the identity of this transmission resource pool;","paragraph_zero_based":523},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-CBR-ResultsNR to the CBR measurement results on PSSCH and PSCCH of this transmission resource pool provided by lower layers, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":524},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":525},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if there is at least one applicable CLI measurement resource to report:","paragraph_zero_based":526},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportType is set to cli-EventTriggered or cli-Periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":527}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_ce