{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultCLI to include the most interfering SRS resources or most interfering CLI-RSSI resources up to maxReportCLI in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":528},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportType is set to cli-EventTriggered:","paragraph_zero_based":529},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if trigger quantity is set to srs-RSRP i.e. i1-Threshold is set to srs-RSRP:","paragraph_zero_based":530},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the SRS resource included in the cli-TriggeredList as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":531},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if trigger quantity is set to cli-RSSI i.e. i1-Threshold is set to cli-RSSI:","paragraph_zero_based":532},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the CLI-RSSI resource included in the cli-TriggeredList as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":533},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":534},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if reportQuantityCLI is set to srs-rsrp:","paragraph_zero_based":535},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the applicable SRS resources for which the new measurement results became available since the last periodical reporting or since the measurement was initiated or reset;","paragraph_zero_based":536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the applicable CLI-RSSI resources for which the new measurement results became available since the last periodical reporting or since the measurement was initiated or reset;","paragraph_zero_based":538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each SRS resource that is included in the measResultCLI:","paragraph_zero_based":539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the srs-ResourceId;","paragraph_zero_based":540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set srs-RSRP-Result to include the layer 3 filtered measured results in decreasing order, i.e. the most interfering SRS resource is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each CLI-RSSI resource that is included in the measResultCLI:","paragraph_zero_based":542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the rssi-ResourceId;","paragraph_zero_based":543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set cli-RSSI-Result to include the layer 3 filtered measured results in decreasing order, i.e. the most interfering CLI-RSSI resource is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if there is at least one applicable UE Rx-Tx time difference measurement to report:","paragraph_zero_based":545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set measResultRxTxTimeDiff to the latest measurement result;","paragraph_zero_based":546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>increment the numberOfReportsSent as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId by 1;","paragraph_zero_based":547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the periodical reporting timer, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the numberOfReportsSent as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId is less than the reportAmount as defined within the corresponding reportConfig for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start the periodical reporting timer with the value of reportInterval as defined within the corresponding reportConfig for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":551}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b