{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":583},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":584},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":585},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":586},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":587},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":588},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":589},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NEXT CHANGE","paragraph_zero_based":590},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.5.3Sorting of cell measurement results","paragraph_zero_based":591},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall determine the sorting quantity according to parameters of the reportConfig associated with the measId that triggered the reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":592},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered:","paragraph_zero_based":593},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for an NR cell, consider the quantity used in the aN-Threshold (for eventA1, eventA2 and eventA4) or in the a5-Threshold2 (for eventA5) or in the aN-Offset (for eventA3 and eventA6) or in the x1-Threshold2 (for eventX1) as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":594},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for an E-UTRA cell, consider the quantity used in the bN-ThresholdEUTRA as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":595},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for an UTRA-FDD cell, consider the quantity used in the bN-ThresholdUTRA-FDD as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":596},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for a candidate L2 U2N Relay UE, consider the y1-Threshold2-Relay (for eventY1-Relay) or y2-Threshold-Relay (for eventY2-Relay) or z1-Threshold2-Relay (for eventZ1) as the sorting quantity;","paragraph_zero_based":597},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":598},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":599}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c6d8b7ff4aba3883b1878ba051f3dab0f23fb0fdaf363fee78c857312e2e045e","16fcc665168ae8b65e53a0e265371516ddd9ed329dee383b5fa518b2fb9681a7","de097375c1700ecfc9ead0fe4d11bb1be1108286a7d9b5d124f71f1f6e23b8ac","05fcdad6d08207fcab403433189d09270e3ddeb25d3094daf4fdb65cde5b450b","e49544f65ca59fc7512888f62b919036aad599e282de39862f7354c94afe1b5a","fb6447b053cf76f44e911f7a2e4aa5e9290d1b2a28641fa478828812b1245782","59c798b7ada3ba19704843a381c4a584e4f2dfeaa9979a25d3eda5dda39b256f","eb74906678a9811d2a18deeb0333b8f0d2aa68397e09689ec12382575ba7002e","55d6328d45d3ff0f3bc6178c042c68f2b24d9ede03f219c17eaa382a6231b5b7","6bd227d429bdcffaef85ff38f075c6bba84427ca98c20d96ef1de7dbe73f555b","f7bef5c2a2180a0a298206016ed5f2302412ce5bdc2aa5fe701ccb183f7811c6","eadaa9001809c8995b0e927485797ef7b12098cc21349460523b471cf041f191","93389773531a4bab492eb2bdb8fa53cffac860f80d7ded1efcb7a05eceb585fc","0a519f2653dfdb3d4619f1ed77a17fb4ade53f127777a861614d1a25f3fd4452","0c269d3385fe3562b65e5b82cb0e1eb7abe9b1b4ef4516ec029f4c471ce4ca95","68e27c81c3dec9f7621df78de95001dcd6a3133767e5b5f6192fc98868e8