{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312499.zip::R2-2312499_38.331_Rel-18_SL_relay_service_continuity.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    deActivated-r17                     NULL,","paragraph_zero_based":768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"    activeBWP-r17                       INTEGER (0..maxNrofBWPs)","paragraph_zero_based":769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"}","paragraph_zero_based":770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-CELLGROUPCONFIG-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Conditional Presence","paragraph_zero_based":775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Explanation","paragraph_zero_based":776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2Tx","paragraph_zero_based":777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need R, if uplinkTxSwitching is configured; otherwise it is absent, Need R.","paragraph_zero_based":778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"BWP-Reconfig","paragraph_zero_based":779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need N, if the BWPs are reconfigured or if serving cells are added or removed. Otherwise it is absent. ","paragraph_zero_based":780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"DirectToIndirect-PathSwitch","paragraph_zero_based":781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present for the L2 U2N remote UE at path switch to the target L2 U2N Relay UE (including direct to indirect path switch and indirect to indirect path switch). It is absent otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Note: the target L2 U2N Relay UE should not be the same as serving L2 U2N Relay UE for inter-gNB indirect to indirect path switch.","paragraph_zero_based":783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"PreConfigMG","paragraph_zero_based":784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is optionally present, Need R, if there is at least one per UE gap configured with preConfigInd or there is at least one per FR gap of the same FR which the SCell belongs to and configured with preConfigInd. It is absent, Need R, otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ReconfWithSync","paragraph_zero_based":786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field is mandatory present in the RRCReconfiguration message:","paragraph_zero_based":787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-in each configured CellGroupConfig for which the SpCell changes,","paragraph_zero_based":788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-in the masterCellGroup:","paragraph_zero_based":789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-at change of AS security key derived from KgNB,","paragraph_zero_based":790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-in an RRCReconfiguration message contained in a DLInformationTransferMRDC message,","paragraph_zero_based":791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"78722f96da2c1b0794be02771e6d00815867826bc913cd2dc90778e7cf20a03c","original_member_sha256":"01249659941507b71cdd3a9a4350d5330966e5252dc21fbfc70854bb5a08b2f1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["526d4161aad237d774760d19aab81432905e565b3674b185a8f481310b047037","c2a5680af0a849ec15ad876074a01b3a15f2cea8eb787a0a90a148a42ce12bde","a4e94adf40df1e1df233605e703f06ae5472127b38eab88c0008e8720a05bc66","6d92c81054d366d83e6d6fd0f081585884bed6f8c1061998a5064bf8f425e955","dbec9b632f20401c587cc104586ecc0acfab898169361fe94e18843af61055d1","330f0b005d027f28e542a6d1a720dd30c386a8dd6031d7734aea459bc5c4e20d","8b235c4e224d4246b4d38c4d8e6fca7dc243e2cdf715f16b43b15c494c40b6d3","b573bf82c98a0d7cd756130e5f386de393bfd55045c9e1c6cb9b028d4722c58f","9f36c00ddab93f98ed920d04921f5ed0c60fe0cc0b9996e46