{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312597.zip::R2-2312597 TEI18 SDT_ReleaseEnh 38331 CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T331 with the value set to measIdleDuration;","paragraph_zero_based":144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListNR in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListEUTRA in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains validityAreaList:","paragraph_zero_based":149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received validityAreaList in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease includes suspendConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC and release the default MAC Cell Group configuration, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the received suspendConfig except the received nextHopChainingCount;","paragraph_zero_based":153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sdt-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the DRB in the sdt-DRB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the DRB to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-SRB2-Indication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the SRB2 to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each RLC bearer (except those associated with broadcast MRBs) that is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for SRB2 (if it is resumed) and for SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the PCell with the configured grant resources for SDT and instruct the MAC entity to start the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the configuration and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1b:The Network should provide full configuration to UE for SRS for Positioning in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"605f5556d4559c377af37734d128f90e6b23a50bfa171827ed70fbcc25e634bc","original_member_sha256":"c2bda6ec6791c373934daad8eb9bc8cda1172d062407a896f6ea0f18f8edff12","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["8a4b27dd59d0e328896fab2d93201dd319d985901512ed0530db531d0fcdb991","2ff4f3a1cffff0349d3d79c965a31f2139587fba09c0a1c8c0897c80697d556b","782996608d4ea07a55e90ef9011fe62f7249810c3fd552a7a457e778af7347f8","1cd7ce24fa8a51bd3160739137160d4fd9536f46efbf99385cbffabe87f4ee41","0db5c81d4be5bd962cbfa2492a1420af6c627e6f1097ce9297938630dc6632f2","9053687baad99c6fc49ae6a8f95ad7c285d1062018fa54ec693bb29d496abf3b","4f4fd3d95c64d20a4360469ea3bb24d16258030269c0da9903046bae5012cab4","9a12303487918585a1e26c563d1c4a0ba5b018da8616bd37b27f6d9b2565d923","06e95f269da83d152b8096d454e961f65093172507097ea3c5e24d05472a0efd","fbfd9940f723e098a1579bc1401d6eb39aeb108fcba3949886e77c0eb0d47d83","f5fcf8d3a019deaed6a7d4d0fcb500a0f08018fcdc9ab4f9d1cd22c985c77d9e","5e51e9a2769ed9c0bdf12fd45344f767e3211d5b3d26beff5001732892c9b250","c586165d5d80a51a7252df3754bf18b951b37167f25802197556277c4e668cea","91c07aa45a3d1d54babafeebefd4c85046a09466784bd1b360e118308adf3895","a0f489132d05b443c112df6ff5771992cb7ec413487e9ee6afb11da968a4f2fe","77684081574c437032f4d2da03f82aa16522f3cf382463ca6288ccc6ad2a46c7","51e7002188ffaaf2f1a5ab2ad744dc8c20ad4c2bccb56f76b5d93a2b78c86bce","f60a0d41033b3d6d739e579b401443d241d579161ed580201a5b5f4ddc29f1fd","dbcb7f9ff845bca39177b08adb2795e52d34a351251d170a39e9ccd4228a32a5","eff9389d204db017aeed638e4a4395f916646d70a00b25587d629dfb0a36159a","d427f041dfd1cf5526f968a2ec359ded7381cb9c540b15bd9de728a122d71ed3","44d1d8c2178a25d8a20d026e73a4694b3d200aaefb0217ad44902eade5e5fa09","b8f4cf443f46d69e7c4260763e6da97815b238ba32422c725d368aca3c08172a","5102ca31e712d45b7125363739e9ac7d15abaec8f5678c67c0a3cea8687403b4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[144,167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312597.zip::R2-2312597 TEI18 SDT_ReleaseEnh 38331 CR.docx:p144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312597.zip::R2-2312597 TEI18 SDT_ReleaseEnh 38331 CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId of the MCG measConfig and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish or re-establish (e.g. via release and add) SL RLC entity for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish RLC entities for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCRelease message with suspendConfig was received in response to an RRCResumeRequest or an RRCResumeRequest1:","paragraph_zero_based":182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T319 if running;","paragraph_zero_based":183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>in the stored UE Inactive AS context:","paragraph_zero_based":184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the KgNB and KRRCint keys with the current KgNB and KRRCint keys;","paragraph_zero_based":185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the nextHopChainingCount with the value of nextHopChainingCount received in the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the cellIdentity with the cellIdentity of the cell the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the suspendConfig contains the sl-UEIdentityRemote (i.e. the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE):","paragraph_zero_based":188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the C-RNTI with the value of the sl-UEIdentityRemote;","paragraph_zero_based":189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the physical cell identity with the value of the sl-PhysCellId in sl-ServingCellInfo contained in the discovery message received from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> else:","paragraph_zero_based":191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"605f5556d4559c377af37734d128f90e6b23a50bfa171827ed70fbcc25e634bc","original_member_sha256":"c2bda6ec6791c373934daad8eb9bc8cda1172d062407a896f6ea0f18f8edff12","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["78bfd781ebcdf52e886e38e079b95f37c9bd95aad547974aee057644b5ed72d2","dbd6cc230ba0573797aec76d3529b258