{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312597.zip::R2-2312597 TEI18 SDT_ReleaseEnh 38331 CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release propDelayDiffReportConfig from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":312},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":313},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig from the UE Inactive AS context, if stored;","paragraph_zero_based":314},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":315},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the specified configuration of SL-RLC0 used for the delivery of RRC message over SRB0 as specified in 9.1.1.4;","paragraph_zero_based":316},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the SDAP configuration and PDCP configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2 for SRB0;","paragraph_zero_based":317},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":318},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":319},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":320},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":321},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is different to the PCell in which the UE received the stored sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":322},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the stored sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config;","paragraph_zero_based":323},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":324},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":325},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the resume procedure is initiated in a cell that is different to the PCell in which the UE received the stored ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":326},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the stored ncd-SSB-RedCapInitialBWP-SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":327},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if conditions for initiating SDT in accordance with 5.3.13.1b are fulfilled:","paragraph_zero_based":328},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the resume procedure is initiated for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":329},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T319a when the lower layers first transmit the CCCH message;","paragraph_zero_based":330},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider SDT procedure is ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":331},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":332},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T319;","paragraph_zero_based":333},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>instruct the MAC entity to stop the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer, if it is running;","paragraph_zero_based":334},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ta-Report is configured with value enabled and the UE supports TA reporting:","paragraph_zero_based":335}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"605f5556d4559c377af37734d128f90e6b23a50bfa171827ed70fbcc25e634bc","original_member_sha256":"c2bda6ec6791c373934daad8eb9bc8cda1172d062407a896f6ea0f18f8edff12","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["949f3c68933837056e22c3da41ba3a85a96affbaca1d3aa901a4050cd11f2a64","c9fb6a2a864104136f6029ce764cfc6dcb2568071e0b2c0116fd0bacfaa92cc5","1772cc7faa84f0616713e28a35d460aa4a9bca26fb61686211a5df21187b37f2","21262f13cb3c379615345a91cbbe35043d5b0d979a0f464d347f8fc63416f8ed","1886d8105f5ccf9638b4f6ff6ef3cc56b1ddda414a4c387d7bf219588a4a8b6f","759287fe60f5b15062b4d79095d0da36ba0d083e6da819c601cc137837f1946