850.zip::R2-2312850 SDT CR for TEI18.docx:p24"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312850.zip::R2-2312850 SDT CR for TEI18.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":48},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Category:","paragraph_zero_based":49},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"B","paragraph_zero_based":50},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":51},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Release:","paragraph_zero_based":52},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Rel-18","paragraph_zero_based":53},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":54},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following categories:F  (correction)A  (mirror corresponding to a change in an earlier release)B  (addition of feature), C  (functional modification of feature)D  (editorial modification)","paragraph_zero_based":55},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Detailed explanations of the above categories canbe found in 3GPP TR 21.900.","paragraph_zero_based":56},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Use one of the following releases:Rel-8(Release 8)Rel-9(Release 9)Rel-10(Release 10)Rel-11(Release 11)…Rel-16(Release 16)Rel-17(Release 17)Rel-18(Release 18)Rel-19(Release 19)","paragraph_zero_based":57},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":58},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":59},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Reason for change:","paragraph_zero_based":60},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If there is a beam failure during ongoing RA-SDT, the transmission and reception at the UE will not succeed, and the UE will wait until SDT failure detection timer expires, and then the UE goes to IDLE state. ","paragraph_zero_based":61},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"This CR introduces changes to the 38.321 specification where during ongoing RA-SDT procedure for MO-SDT or MT-SDT (performed over RACH) if the RSRP value of the current SSB (i.e., SSB selected in the last random access procedure during the ongoing SDT procedure) is less than a pre-configured threshold, a UE triggers RACH procedure similar to CG-SDT procedure in Rel-17 SDT. Hence, if recovered, the UE does not go to IDLE state.","paragraph_zero_based":62},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":63},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":64},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Summary of change:","paragraph_zero_based":65},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Added normative text in 5.27.1 for MO-SDT or MT-SDT, a UE to chek if the RSRP value of the current SSB is less than rsrp-ThresholdSSB, and if so, initiate a Random Access procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":66},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Added in 5.1.4a and 5.5 “if the Random Access procedure was initiated by the MAC sublayer itself during the ongoing RA-SDT procedure (as specified in clause 5.27.1) and the PDCCH transmission is addressed to the C-RNTI:”.","paragraph_zero_based":67},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":68},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impact Analysis","paragraph_zero_based":69},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted 5G architecture options: NR SA ","paragraph_zero_based":70},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":71}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"0ed20e35f80ae6dbd920dbfb65a5ffcc912cf1eceeb6f721c9d4744c57b8a97e","original_member_sha256":"410a03e8639120f55092631249de3d039280236418ef38d73948186067c759a1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["931b08b02977c80973c145a601d2d326184e279339952f91eb0aad603da4c3ce","820c335ab6d5f13f7a6bb018ace1d7f80f3b189b5e7f23907580ca4b51a127f1","947a788ff4db3deddba047f2f5cd4444401528060c96bb4133f538c8e0a3eb15","208ace56a9d124040177afc7606ac488509be357e1b17fcf6d1f69e9a35bbd30","0742eb074e8d359350695efed802459903e3d927b3546dc0b92a39ed53d9fdb9","f94fad12e10ebe4e7ba052a6045190e9cf9d0d9e95e3576060b752df8f7022b7","ab595cdb95b1c1aa43d43ed3ff13fa2d02507607623d47c399beb6e18188e796","e6a0748c8bf91c867f22d6ad02d394d64bf788ce69a9051e467f844a45f992da","2df3574a31f789d190a1e32fba01a8744d02fb5bf2fcfff5f8d3458e9952d141","063fe96c99303f7b1c0c07a4c6c5f0362b91933568065820b140d69772427f81","728227fccd518b31180a6300063f3ce1e2629b785489d8ddd5a25d164c15187f","29e209765da8f939e572b5a50b11e5ae10d6b321e21bd5aac2bdf2fb5c0a2223","c7ef408e1274d84f3e9e3b89f6502d8e4e9e920fcd8e3d37ce1f70fb1704d377","19ed517d9993ba37261d2353a43d188f7c149547c9bdf2c4119a99a4493e173c","66a161c50cb887ce7baae05121b5d809fd1c4fb8bf2d4f356f961d8294c05750","ba1899c9ff84790fde6ada9f77ba0ed34c462cd3fab824833f67e4e1d3dda70a","32e1ef2f4f9c7c907820855a16594722a413b66044a80a86ff7ace72df2b36a9","17328a9c3d5b2b5312712cc7cbedbb2e38ebba95234eb93e1e39ad18857dbc37","d5f1ef82b2e6b3ac57c2831d8aca30b1669b068bac2e10208d8fcbe394132b47","63e05bc14086fd173a3459ee6744893ca09a4335da6e50e6e20643cd297a486f","dca08b8087ac774b1b24096b5a444d424f2d331de943c7cf1c3c675bfa291db5","b1c97461d9e4170853771ad190949fefb7391af3b0efcd5cd636c9153e68a715","8722fb7bbe31b51a9ffcc37513a7f52a20d0d6243c7b73c15869de5560b72354","5739ec725f492dc2bd5bf6de7e51664d94750901773d49b93b36f559f141764d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[48,71],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312850.zip::R2-2312850 SDT CR for TEI18.docx:p48"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312850.zip::R2-2312850 SDT CR for TEI18.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Impacted functionality:","paragraph_zero_based":72},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RA-SDT for MT-SDT and MO-SDT.","paragraph_zero_based":73},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":74},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inter-operability:","paragraph_zero_based":75},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1. If the network is implemented according to the CR and the UE is not, no interoperability exists.","paragraph_zero_based":76},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":77},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2. If the UE is implemented according to the CR and the network is not, no interoperability exists.","paragraph_zero_based":78},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":79},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":80},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":81},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Consequences if not approved:","paragraph_zero_based":82},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SDT transmission and reception at the UE will not succeed, and the UE will wait until SDT failure detection timer expires, and then the UE goes to IDLE state. ","paragraph_zero_based":83},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":84},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":85},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Clauses affected:","paragraph_zero_based":86},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.27.1","paragraph_zero_based":87},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":88},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":89},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":90},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Y","paragraph_zero_based":91},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"N","paragraph_zero_based":92},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":93},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":94},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Other specs","paragraph_zero_based":95}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"0ed20e35f80ae6dbd920dbfb65a5ffcc912cf1eceeb6f721c9d4744c57b8a97e","original_member_sha256":"410a03e8639120f55092631249de3d039280236418ef38d73948186067c759a1","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["60d3ae333376e3958de09488f9b33a1809b0ba8d7e62867f0538d0db55ff0d18","1b804e8e688bc7d1bec7e5bf8fc6889d5f8b44e2ba45f4d6920f8e8854e43715","0cb8341f35211f99ad726497bc35a3adf3784990a9391bb29d4a1f6dd362e5e3","2aeb1a4adfa8a3b1e62a1a16baf5ff1c430b85b850b89036e6f0182ff47d0103","3fce79c656207708ea5fc23706c26ac5b6d3c631ff1816f7cb25fdf85b257ae4","e011cc97b954253cd7513072409ab423f1a7886874310075a1b3cc906da3d80c","03e6e63a5869227aba703aef8158fed1be9c6bef97c01fdf68c207772bfe413c","99d364ec71c8e1563f0084ffde9c7ecb00f42a81dc891d467b2a7bd54eb5257a","93bd68debb8d52287b7550152e7bf0b7431a9703c9d2c6379bd34ece5d896149","53dc6ced6f072d9b07bccbb01c025bf6b7d9936c383620ec278e91583be2cd60","8ad4f888c4155fc13a1ee9b880717c7b53676905eccb2a0752e008ab3748fd70","d0635be8ab40eaa9f425f0ed58c5d94ae2d55339b89f7a90c9fadae1b151dfbe","62095ac49fc07b8ca64107217a14ec2d6176c925692420e830d5196bcbf059ae","1197ec1bbda5deec72d6a1c5a87b26e67ddd2a277a4a2ece0a1944af853b38b5","fccb80b7aedd853fb65a10d1dec508bf9307dd9276aa30a8d4b480cc34a09f7f","c7975301758f21be8ce916dc95903fe683fad1db933ac5ada02fdfbad6f2d942","334264055ccc84aa6bc1d9feb9c19f162aeb96c67aa3afed23e6f6245368ba99","6414370efcee60943ce6ecc1fc2c8ebf1097fa45d45621f4126dd0904a66e31b","5b022c4eaacf377415458a9415444cac375b848cd038689a4b989efb123a4e24","d7cea1577ad89b2e5f67093c0799ee0e913887660d59469e7c1040a8d8efca32","7508e106b27851127461a2f24810bc148132d1833af27995266c95a170beae12","f810b259af31122e91a5e630508c6b0f968c9532cbbee177cd55bf9277a98267","d53d74bb0249f84286cc243848a5