protocol is also used to configure the radio interface between an IAB-node and its parent node [2].","paragraph_zero_based":114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2References","paragraph_zero_based":115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The following documents contain provisions which, through reference in this text, constitute provisions of the present document.","paragraph_zero_based":116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-References are either specific (identified by date of publication, edition number, version number, etc.) or nonspecific.","paragraph_zero_based":117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For a specific reference, subsequent revisions do not apply.","paragraph_zero_based":118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-For a non-specific reference, the latest version applies. In the case of a reference to a 3GPP document (including a GSM document), a non-specific reference implicitly refers to the latest version of that document in the same Release as the present document.","paragraph_zero_based":119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d8815830d19f65c2ae4d56dcb9a9f6ce9f1a6be77959b7b90e75215375c88fe2","e4eba76c050ae3e574915091271f6a460af6ce8015fbc8e81895832032948e9b","bf60c5bac750d245b520fe839ad7c01c7c6db985dfb8f812241ab24ff6451fe6","2653aee6ac586bdecc2f791a6411c4a256cde360ad0d1bfd4606322092f0ae6b","1d07faf526e382f930d8f0d72345b80b2691b78d600b3221cd6b6156fb32f5ee","42cee5bb7253dbfd51a8be88a209d09ba91549f929ce76c4f67398cfbf078fac","9c1e40fc99a9d14be2b2622ae26651eeb93458bf22476a9e048e5ceab1f00f4e","3cb6eb4230a3b61e4b9d5b8b25f76e2e087c7a3efa1819eefc1a4c54557180c8","f4bf4ed2666b8f2987275cb132c34fdd11e52e42e68f089606350176b8ed854a","81c52eb1e53600dcfa6