{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, while SDT procedure is not ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":696},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing si-RequestConfigSUL and criteria to select supplementary uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":697},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on supplementary uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in si-RequestConfigSUL corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":698},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":699},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":700},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is a RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing si-RequestConfigRedCap and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":701},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in si-RequestConfigRedcap corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":702},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":703},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":704},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":705},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is not a RedCap UE and if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing si-RequestConfig and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met; or","paragraph_zero_based":706},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is a RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is not configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes si-SchedulingInfo containing si-RequestConfig and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":707},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in si-RequestConfig corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":708},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":709},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":710},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":711},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default L1 parameter values as specified in corresponding physical layer specifications except for the parameters for which values are provided in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":712},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":713},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":714},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":715},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest in accordance with 5.2.2.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":716},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":717},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":718},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while waiting for the acknowledgment for SI request from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":719}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["abba84d850d81cc81311ea22ae4e01af162b6c7985e787ceefa0e9a136fc62ad","1bdad3161b911725224224d8740c0aaf54e91099b730fc0887bb399e24451032","7b8e1e0f9de5f6ac471100bc032aa01ceb5cd1a8ce8f723e2ca667343b5d79c5","30ce7d79be735539306b0f41287b4bc81c10a92207e32a6efc5c371cef114054","9c983254a3098d0e1324629afa1e6d6083600d40fbfbeb07275078e478ce5390","0ab044d30bcc5e7cce5ec76bd53236591ec4d07e86a3d5c10baa183b74e8de3c","4dbc06e493dcd2bc27655cc8d400b8c0891a6a3490b3aba1a413870c69d6416a","89194731d39c47f1f8a41c184db702aa03b1529d70345d6bfefc3662727b9561","5f261693673a6c58aa04fec9c5c632d1fef9378838fc3e8c25540186d85aea42","e359f8e177bd4889ee8ba2605cc4c088f211f1189fde2c375245b5d17b1ae8ca","2e173da8073bb49ac41dae2b57e61c7f860883ee78a4f5895e64c2cff41b4b90","488112f14832f8ff5a49cf1540b8076ea41cbaee1e6f5f7b2062b3e31b48484e","41153d7980bfc8c7951c374020ed7ecb1362b17b