{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":720},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SI request is based on RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcSystemInfoRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":721},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release RLC entity for SRB0.","paragraph_zero_based":722},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:After RACH failure for SI request it is up to UE implementation when to retry the SI request.","paragraph_zero_based":723},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.3aRequest for on demand positioning system information","paragraph_zero_based":724},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall, while SDT procedure is not ongoing:","paragraph_zero_based":725},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SIB1 includes posSI-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigSUL and criteria to select supplementary uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":726},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on supplementary uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in posSI-RequestConfigSUL corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations, and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":727},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":728},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":729},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is a RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes posSI-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfigRedCap and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":730},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in posSI-RequestConfigRedCap corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations, and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":731},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":732},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":733},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":734},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is not a RedCap UE and if SIB1 includes posSI-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfig and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met; or","paragraph_zero_based":735},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is a RedCap UE and if initialUplinkBWP-RedCap is not configured in UplinkConfigCommonSIB and if SIB1 includes posSI-SchedulingInfo containing posSI-RequestConfig and criteria to select normal uplink as defined in TS 38.321[3], clause 5.1.1 is met:","paragraph_zero_based":736},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>trigger the lower layer to initiate the Random Access procedure on normal uplink in accordance with TS 38.321 [3] using the PRACH preamble(s) and PRACH resource(s) in posSI-RequestConfig corresponding to the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations , and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":737},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for SI request is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":738},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":739},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":740},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default L1 parameter values as specified in corresponding physical layer specifications except for the parameters for which values are provided in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":741},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the default MAC Cell Group configuration as specified in 9.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":742},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the timeAlignmentTimerCommon included in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":743}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e3b369d84dd3366d9fd0e05d6b85795c9e554f7f913fe387ef41da28efa4902a","7e99595cd44257abf98066e18718f1ad05c1676bf2b4e0de13fd17c37dac7e8f","e4ee937e05c6f78484c11097a90a348d9f6170a675bff61e5e14c3624b16e2d7","bc50f609cbc158417f44c772cb834814aa7dfba61865b01afc120000a2dc573b","398aaf89c438e0ffc91ebd1571672443a178c3db67c4b37c87e81148fc2da68f","d8b58ae6a6910fb65344356aa861cf453658966229efada538691970a67342ba","c836f72e3c7ea289b42b3c72c84ba1706e874f7ca94a9c27a184d87f61791f46","4a156b7966c2a33e7ed9eb10c0b079640c46265a784429123a5dddbf720a7816","5ff2b102dbb56cabab102781d4cb2c446c22e0282c0524f16fcacc6231924230","3fa4ede60f6873229f965c934c03605dfab6cef8bd078ccea42e06fa4f332d34","ebe162745d7781cb80212556098c244e0effa75f22913aa8169b310f6ecb8ca9","368bc0609b157af38d690bdb23388b2d34bdee30fb567121897b6b2821c35463","efddaad09901dca2d8f8ce9d89d6978abddcd88b8c909477f0ddb978b41190c6","671d4a0415f573ab3035ad4767fcb0c3aba4202a50f57fc520287ebfce39d35d","9a6a94218395de642a5674b08a90675d4f45f3c6a627a62f14fb614c8051623d","caa50c7d74c5c03289318c07d3d6657bbb14992b85c8472a92a1d0c54f7125fe","7266a6da449297f81098d72bfca0f5e2f96390fccbc6b3e32acc966968e36477","914b219378c5adb5a8dbd1dcaba7a51e9e0ed7f39ece89be24c98908b2130e5a","94b3307c09a11fc34377f5e61b41cb6306875d7feda8c02b46ff0a40ed2baadb","d0082a086a17e6238c0cb1b89d7dcebae17e7694e8da42b0bda9e7f08415a735","4f7e9ffdab688c0141c240cc4b6a04842d549767b606380f8a931d7de54a9097","a2e3f6227e5fe9901e8b3c8b0e13adad2e8ac09946424808d5f6ebb2f78e9cde","04f8a114f1f403a3f0e3b5ae1b947fc600cf3dabd7a5ca12e508fd212e6a542b","5a91a86020a357bec0d1f5954bf0948c0d8dd0db1b16f9f8ecf71cac8d77c613"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[720,743],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p720"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the CCCH configuration as specified in 9.1.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":744},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest in accordance with 5.2.2.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":745},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if acknowledgement for RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest is received from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":746},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2, immediately;","paragraph_zero_based":747},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if cell reselection occurs while waiting for the acknowledgment for SI request from lower layers:","paragraph_zero_based":748},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":749},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SI request is based on RRCSystemInfoRequest message with rrcPosSystemInfoRequest:","paragraph_zero_based":750},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release RLC entity for SRB0.","paragraph_zero_based":751},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:After RACH failure for SI request it is up to UE implementation when to retry the SI request.","paragraph_zero_based":752},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.4Actions related to transmission of RRCSystemInfoRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":753},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of RRCSystemInfoRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":754},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required SI message(s) other than positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":755},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the requested-SI-List to indicate the SI message(s) that the UE requires to operate within the cell, and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting;","paragraph_zero_based":756},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the procedure is triggered to request the required SI message(s) for positioning:","paragraph_zero_based":757},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the requestedPosSI-List to indicate the SI message(s) that the UE upper layers require for positioning operations, and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting.","paragraph_zero_based":758},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the RRCSystemInfoRequest message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":759},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.5Acquisition of SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED","paragraph_zero_based":760},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":761},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED with an active BWP not configured with common search space with the field searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1, or","paragraph_zero_based":762},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED and acting as a L2 U2N Remote UE and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":763},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo or posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB or requested posSIB:","paragraph_zero_based":764},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":765},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":766},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":767}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fc6bd5eca92fd6ec1e9da5b69b01fcb3912b2188dca43b18bee383453525364b","bfc5ca754a76f5c255212113479e5ebc336bbaedfc72efbd8d4ab2d2753560da","dcf8ff857ad28d3b1628d480db0c51082237de4b286feb13f6c2a1f2c018d96c","5751c22b9636a225efcd8dfab9f461a7c5314e2b64afc5643faf2969e57da951","f20a52a6ef1e3cc3780548a92bf3107cd8a16ee3b332370afbcd5741bf6633fd","5583071087707263e53978e0507d2b34839b9e49d8a75acb5282a12af8f2a604","39c6d49c7a28fe4cbde373b45a77e1fe995f99026943a4e315d2a3e41ab8323d","349a439711a148e270b2fb3f8c52764d66db8c9c127296b989ed5b6484bd7ed2","205dedcb2211cc41e335ba7871cad70a1c3e42d2b0903b896a0d76b3758b8775","051a425686d53a3d73b86e2bd2cb85794a755a90247680ba97d10c7e3a7e93fe","eead34eca1faab3874c0134cb1ee4f9ea802e3aa9c2e5eb160e47aed970738bc","a52038314f6809b8a0a734245cf010d802bd283ce7bbefb5163ae2aad390ef6f","36c6eab686b3a32abfedda64ec3ccebfbc8e528f9904668f6450f7a45a584284","b3a12ded8ad983d12946c381d45ee172298e2d15fc213505676f2a6cad88e720","c15a17af6fb19fc15606698a184dba49478dd243fa38029b55c5d46d9b7f950b","a1285bff7f9645bed0e6f3f2ef894bef4f3f54a6beb5061e7e02eea3fc50b0cf","3a8e3288c90393939b4e74b7c097f10e49b44b1a4bc4b74a7c2a4139533c7bbb","860256c632c305aa37ec408f185973827e2a8ca794fd71a31d116f6754add490","7daf0b6190ee25f5e0e747df524f4b9fcfc6238e49f5694e2566132714adec00","52541ac3654eed9f392ec2ca2c60b9f54a7972444e04d7b18aadbc0eaa388397","101f2065aecf547e998ab6982de6c4f740e1c4c1d2d4d577d7bd6a5e87f53ccf","215a3cf4b11089a2754b3fc50c5e8570ebde29a04c756b9550b13f429e08cb4c","81fee572f1bde39f818928f636aa36dd940e7299e585535dc0f71c88fffc3abd","adcef6de0935fcc1f17496bab4328a5af3a51fc3e0f5bc1c0d35b68e2cfd4c93"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[744,767],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p744"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED with an active BWP configured with common search space with the field searchSpaceOtherSystemInformation and the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested SIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo in the stored SIB1, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if onDemandSIB-Request is configured and timer T350 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the DedicatedSIBRequest message in accordance with 5.2.2.3.6;","paragraph_zero_based":780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>start timer T350 with the timer value set to the onDemandSIB-RequestProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the requested SI message(s) corresponding to the requested posSIB(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2.","paragraph_zero_based":782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:UE may include on demand request for SIB and/or posSIB(s) in the same DedicatedSIBRequest message.","paragraph_zero_based":783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.3.6Actions related to transmission of DedicatedSIBRequest message","paragraph_zero_based":784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of DedicatedSIBRequest message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required SIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested SIB(s);","paragraph_zero_based":787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is triggered to request the required posSIB(s):","paragraph_zero_based":788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include requestedPosSIB-List in the onDemandSIB-RequestList to indicate the requested posSIB(s).","paragraph_zero_based":789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the DedicatedSIBRequest message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4Actions upon receipt of System Information","paragraph_zero_based":791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6f1f7543ad295111bd7b1c479b4e70bbba6de7dc9c2a3dcc16f9a64c318cfd9c","458a2b48ea8b4aa65e819fc31d73621f59d89fd3e03f2c98adad526339c54b88","df4ff3658197d4b29120c68500b5c6eb759754517e9d0e325ab1a911709b4761","e7b2783e09c5375fe854243f3b9e7dd2d7ec8dd67b30c75ffda1f965cb05292c","4b9ea122b9272939eead309d95f578bf42f4f02724b3556bdca017747f65863f","390cb797f72181e684271dc469044f81568b5e329c579f168a91a51ebfe8900f","0576082e44bdc9d41330ad7fb0933c3ba0c1a6e813d24882bc8a13b9c3ec49df","8fb94da5e9d43cf6448a934767825daa8e23f70392023380d77e368628cea1c0","0d33920a43643ffcae5cf0d209104c98ef63ca028ba7754e16de017a515d9335","05098ae56e9a9bbacd681039961b116938105d0f4bea6da6f3148548f1dbedc2","e13a6ee82dbbc3eb3ec88d0eaed1fa30860e6926b84f72aa7339f34b01d14bb8","2b9fc14a2d800d2d3f9cb586ade316c26a9c63575e56b3a81ef676e2de072fb5","abdf338f4d0ac7dfdf3900b5885ec39ec922cfe170e238324db95c02ac57db2b","55ea70c090df86d02b7cac2507aab46c9497437c46914704e8101f5215a369c9","45b9a5d66cee92c5b1facf73d24b19a9212754051ec720df194a554ae17bf123","478dd332d78382e8b63e051ec153cab67f8db5afcd9c297472f3429d2df0b47c","86b659378039b8e88b3aa6ff1cf66ba4d3e693ec954fca325c9ff33991748116","c763184d5cacfa39fae7d4089db29fbfe0988fd74b7436dfc1586fe234cd9c16","ef6f0c80c306d49dbccaef51041936459d75dbcc75f6ac5308fef31cd3a26356","595f84fc1a7463a14db91aa567cefdbec3bcc9555062c8803c2bdb2502e1d9a7","c714ad4dc8926984d5052bb2b40b7b4feeb1d05507114de668a4501932277e97","24635385795d7808b8068d1320909050a808ae5131f1afb0fb01f8be51ae3c1b","62e7d7ec023f0cd7bbb6f232a58770de3a4633b0cca5a5c79027d5846c8f9c7f","1671fcef24348576956da176dda130e3140a86a2c622794358c83973750c9eb4"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[768,791],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p768"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.1Actions upon reception of the MIB","paragraph_zero_based":792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the MIB the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the acquired MIB;","paragraph_zero_based":794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the access is not for NTN or the UE is not capable of NTN or the UE is not capable of NES; and","paragraph_zero_based":796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the cellBarred in the acquired MIB is set to barred:","paragraph_zero_based":797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a RedCap UE and ssb-SubcarrierOffset indicates SIB1 is transmitted in the cell (TS 38.213 [13]):","paragraph_zero_based":798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>acquire the SIB1, which is scheduled as specified in TS 38.213 [13];","paragraph_zero_based":799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the received systemFrameNumber, pdcch-ConfigSIB1, subCarrierSpacingCommon, ssb-SubcarrierOffset and dmrs-TypeA-Position.","paragraph_zero_based":803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:A UE capable of NTN access should acquire SIB1 to determine whether the cell is an NTN cell.","paragraph_zero_based":804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:A UE capable of NES should acquire SIB1 to determine the cell barring status when the cellBarred in MIB is set to barred.","paragraph_zero_based":805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Editor’s note: A NES-capable UE in the cell barring context is at least UE supporting cell DTX/DRX. FFS if other NES features will need to be included only if legacy impact is found. FFS how we capture it in the CR in terms of wording. A reference to a specific UE capability to be added.","paragraph_zero_based":806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.2Actions upon reception of the SIB1","paragraph_zero_based":808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving the SIB1 the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>store the acquired SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the access is for NTN, and the cellBarredNTN in the acquired SIB1 is set to barred or the cellBarredNTN is not included in the acquired SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is a RedCap UE and it is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the RedCap UE is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if intraFreqReselectionRedCap is not present in SIB1:","paragraph_zero_based":815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bde365f8449c7ec9696c929c62a92ef34716e0e3a32ebe19c256f5c798b91dd8","728261c57303ce756665af9429c3a38700ee89b814eff416a70b8c8bc131b13f","39ef1d81d477db70168062306c02837230bd2cd1f3dd1f22e17b4eeee49e4634","dc8bba2bfde0dc056bd96c02943288d7c1723fde9612893e8697d8c2f1cfacc6","3f1186883a3c14b4f6b44cb20673f9e9cc20336925b35516074b6bf3ac89816e","8910df760bb755d672eed50fb4a77ed9b0271ac45ac059f6041d2923fd7bb64e","802fcf60357c28919142bd1999f87f397a75fa3cff451ec8b3e4fb6cbfd5225c","3f80e9abd5e04792faaed9142ec39febf26c53d195a5df18d73bb7bd7c675358","cb34227e9c63e75351e29aca5153302e3f4114ffc4e419f5596e56a88a8dc65f","c10a07c1c7aee8f2e43760583ba8b06efb7bb7548dc331023261b2d5211b1764","712e518a954889e1c6c8df63c6c4d5f62e812a4b3f63e3dfbbff2d475adf2334","d5e42d6541e9460790caa0f654cab70ee602cca5b1ce58ed9bc589c948005012","334e67803391c3e6e97e92d022c4624ea37640cb61a808f5c982b37c018f034d","351edea1369b45b8f63da0917077453770a492f8d697f57c17a7baeace19d8c7","0f9eda4c4cced4f4939126d32aa5004c1bffb3f324c7cb9d46e28844447c94e9","d88f17561a03930308671a54cf1f45501e6ca9b55587957fa2d9fb3f09b9af61","d45cc8bf752f4841edd2a017cb21e6acfb46ab8d93d5400626d5a10af0892216","6e0c09c47dbdd21c982ade727c9946803f38d7434ffc155f3f386d548843357d","e206f6f7782362d63acbbaee6dcab8ddbd664387f3ca12d547f7da2b33bea766","e9a6c377098eef1ef3e0f72d47cb6cfd1bc08dcb07c9704fa13eebe3c700e876","9baf7f38284abf1f5cc2b47e1e0a7e9c990f0c7aaf1e3e6712ed698ad801cd8f","d134b9e17bd3c9907ddc0ec9751f03f1768adfc954952d353bb3ae17df32d3fd","d357bc476aa426ad6ad2720df3e74dcbca921c05a8c8374815d17728236dc6d7","4135c2c12195eb1c629b27acc9969e3d96d909593aceaf0dada4ced4b6639d15"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[792,815],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p792"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform barring as if intraFreqReselectionRedCap is set to allowed;","paragraph_zero_based":817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else:","paragraph_zero_based":818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarredRedCap1Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE is equipped with 1 Rx branch; or","paragraph_zero_based":819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the cellBarredRedCap2Rx is present in the acquired SIB1 and is set to barred and the UE is equipped with 2 Rx branches; or","paragraph_zero_based":820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the halfDuplexRedCapAllowed is not present in the acquired SIB1 and the UE supports only half-duplex FDD operation:","paragraph_zero_based":821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform barring based on intraFreqReselectionRedCap as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE supports NES and it is in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE, or if the UE supporting NES is in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if cellBarredNES is absent in the acquired SIB1 and the cellBarred in the acquired MIB is set to barred:","paragraph_zero_based":825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the cellAccessRelatedInfo contains an entry of a selected SNPN or PLMN and in case of PLMN the UE is either allowed or instructed to access the PLMN via a cell for which at least one CAG ID is broadcast:","paragraph_zero_based":828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>in the remainder of the procedures use npn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, and cellIdentity for the cell as received in the corresponding entry of npn-IdentityInfoList containing the selected PLMN or SNPN;","paragraph_zero_based":829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the cellAccessRelatedInfo contains an entry with the PLMN-Identity of the selected PLMN:","paragraph_zero_based":830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>in the remainder of the procedures use plmn-IdentityList, trackingAreaCode, trackingAreaList, and cellIdentity for the cell as received in the corresponding PLMN-IdentityInfo containing the selected PLMN;","paragraph_zero_based":831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE in RRC_INACTIVE is configured for feature(s) that it does not support in current serving cell:","paragraph_zero_based":832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>the corresponding configuration is not used in current serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>disregard the frequencyBandList, if received, while in RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the cellIdentity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the trackingAreaCode to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the trackingAreaList to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>forward the received posSIB-MappingInfo to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1292593b427c04c8d7cd291ef06c7d062bcf108c16992e1bfc541328d73e95eb","bf47ed77289ab03e7a0bd97fa1beb37f715654465edbb98c6e70bda4fc86f25d","fc8813e3a7933f2259bce803c92f49b936daaecba91eb07b06e6c15e2644f5c6","328c9fdadeb2425fda9af376799e4c02bb96cb0c9e00172c533abe743df63abc","2c40920fa4287c0f04ac93e5229506298e694684e43bc32f2a2e672f847a9d25","f5d16be7d41570df795e2eb2635d225bb7f4f52638ef0acd27f3f7dd0c61b11b","f77bf8df7cff8538e26d40537d73557d57141e378f12faea6fdc765ff5c02d9b","47f5907065475d099421a817db55ce35733586ae14fa084cef2e1dbbd3795035","5e485aea45fe40658482dd6c6126b11e2d55f6a68d3395439711b6610731b3a1","f3dd95b8b2ba0088b23fe52eb05a599b157755e94efd2b434b4e82631a873899","4448a5f96d3013a77a913f58425b3f581ca20ed82f00f587729f371cd5e745c5","6e4a07c3ff9e7ae9d0ae90423817759bbc7b416d4529025e3ecc25c31ca5baa2","0f3d0b9a5d07c735095b2c833fd9bcd84045cff45f2dbe60ea1dbb5b26b6b3bd","48768d7e58e0d1475a31efaac816c30bbb6c7bee45b967229ac72bdb0374230f","08e398824cac389144278f771e8a72cd3910417f23d15d91315b795f6acc3818","cc86ed59593b6306d69a1c4fafe21ccd37204c5f525fd5c6451e6741b68910c0","f5502c7b17a6e65e5751c70926c959b0d0b35508e343a646ce56f91ec5db4f04","74907761ce6f45b46a6c48ed0bc38b90d1bca5e66e3d26bd26046a60dc723050","5356aff8ac1cf9d69c8b4e3872b62bbaf7b05169bd99b7b1aa678b4d39a79fce","00a5b7dc11487ea1c6654114704484ef9d609040936b0ddf9fe2321792850bd0","5adb7892babde26d98c935a6a4a4b7ecff6105790b5ad731b8231c088b353f38","23da3abdd94e0a3abc208e1dfc014b52a755f3eba66b8aa0ad01accd5366c799","ef792a1007e7a76d523c05810157151caf44ed502467f8e40d1a3836c5ca8c96","e3bfc53e5b6e53ef37b4e0e7cffdd06771aa65471aad6ffeded3d0c96a88e45a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[816,839],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p816"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a stored valid version of a SIB or posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, that the UE requires to operate within the cell in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>use the stored version of the required SIB or posSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>acquire the required SIB or posSIB requested by upper layer as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList for downlink for TDD, or one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList for uplink for FDD, and they are not downlink only bands, and","paragraph_zero_based":847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is IAB-MT or supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList for a supported band in the downlink for TDD, or a supported band in uplink for FDD, and","paragraph_zero_based":848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports an uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15], TS 38.101-2 [39], and TS 38.101-5 [75]) which","paragraph_zero_based":849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in uplinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP or, for RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured), and which","paragraph_zero_based":850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial uplink BWP or, for RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured, and","paragraph_zero_based":851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports a downlink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15], TS 38.101-2 [39], and TS 38.101-5 [75]) which","paragraph_zero_based":852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in downlinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial downlink BWP or, for RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured), and which","paragraph_zero_based":853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial downlink BWP or, for RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured, and","paragraph_zero_based":854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if frequencyShift7p5khz is present and the UE supports corresponding 7.5kHz frequency shift on this band; or frequencyShift7p5khz is not present:","paragraph_zero_based":855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if neither trackingAreaCode nor trackingAreaList is provided for the selected PLMN nor the registered PLMN nor PLMN of the equivalent PLMN list:","paragraph_zero_based":856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform cell re-selection to other cells on the same frequency as the barred cell as specified in TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if UE is IAB-MT and if iab-Support is not provided for the selected PLMN nor the registered PLMN nor PLMN of the equivalent PLMN list nor the selected SNPN nor the registered SNPN:","paragraph_zero_based":859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20];","paragraph_zero_based":860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply a supported uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is contained within the carrierBandwidth indicated in uplinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP or, for RedCap UEs, RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP, if configured, and which","paragraph_zero_based":863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["77113672e795dc21b35e3fe389981858d90718001fc3fde72ab90f7728df579f","467f94316b4f9fd648d7f1335b13e6fcb19006ca8372e4e803fd0b930ab7f116","1af4fef8bc6fdca296d537f1c8cb83cae4c64b6544f4228af913a9635badecac","51869f83a4e8e55e5e508d3245b5f0f8aa3fa376573813a84be380fabf25340c","70f40a9b967adf781a716ad9350e5796a3f7bc39f2ea659e2b724dcc2e771c13","0fe8da53319fd6e4fdddddf32006ff1bf5bc5a47f56d740bad5fa96566c020ef","5b2d0188f54e2521fab7c6ff270dbcf43fa76c4d66bd6a1308c9dcecd4c220be","2ae768996b4c8c3b67d67014b2dd2c7e058e49a436c2e71dd19a3343ca6c5e09","57cbabe140013bec5c61e1a9c33ee17f116d1f56541edb9c462d40832d561415","3f73c68a2112ee8b0b51b542aa6ebe452c42e6a0ef0a5a6326df9b4ec57c6801","72d56b2e3da88383f81aa177fc617ba1742f0c9ab82b41d5932753bcba3ef9e6","9214a6f96acc0a78ae75503399e5f7a2d9619a9527adcaeab4d7fb5b225bf516","c9888e28cd430ac1cec154fc0d25c9bda9bb1f9123213cd87657d79eac389bae","4826625780f452b6f6917eeac8d2ab5ada7ba6a68e5ee9f9b7c6d9cb1e62d13f","42c9d54a657897f0865eef5bcab0f326134e55f30dc2621ded632a18e93434c8","adb6b1f3aa22f34028dd0fa9dd8128d2e76d198242599684c1b89d5a9b5a2720","375aabb9a0eff9879f89a7c5dc6359464cce653d96c87a9a2465a43782b4c42c","4d90d3120f0d6805ca76f5876357fd194010e78597f26f3e42fc55c82e8b88b6","3cc1439625113a7c953f2112cfb25f92001228567de121147ebb09f5d5488b9a","280757a35b41bb9a60aea34b8de4b90e242ef7dc5ceca29739a2a39b8d35ce2a","d454f8c60ec8ce7e728c5b4a03aabfebb442af732e72229880e49acc9d6805df","44968221ee86c925e29f0e011d13e2240f5af0bc055fcf0a928fc068e91b575d","4fa9ec5020bb0deb5afd49e0ad483e98bbadc2579200bd4fe003c68999b3b141","f9caf41d08cbc2c7056fa6f9321c8aa76ef6b5179a4be0748fa2765be3b1b6a2"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[840,863],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p840"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP for the uplink or, for a RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial uplink BWP if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply a supported downlink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- is contained within the carrierBandwidth indicated in downlinkConfigCommon for the SCS of the initial downlink BWP or, for RedCap UEs, RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP, if configured, and which","paragraph_zero_based":866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"- is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP for the downlink or, for a RedCap UE, of the RedCap-specific initial downlink BWP if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList, for FDD from frequencyBandList for uplink, or for TDD from frequencyBandList for downlink, which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxList, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the cellIdentity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the trackingAreaCode to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the trackingAreaList to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the received posSIB-MappingInfo to upper layers, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the PLMN identity or SNPN identity or PNI-NPN identity to upper layers;","paragraph_zero_based":873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if in RRC_INACTIVE and the forwarded information does not trigger message transmission by upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the serving cell does not belong to the configured ran-NotificationAreaInfo:","paragraph_zero_based":875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>initiate an RNA update as specified in 5.3.13.8;","paragraph_zero_based":876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the ims-EmergencySupport to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the eCallOverIMS-Support to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>forward the UAC-AccessCategory1-SelectionAssistanceInfo or UAC-AC1-SelectAssistInfo for the selected PLMN/SNPN to upper layers, if present and set to a, b or c;","paragraph_zero_based":879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is in SNPN access mode:","paragraph_zero_based":880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>forward the imsEmergencySupportForSNPN indicators with the corresponding SNPN identities to upper layers, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the specified PCCH configuration defined in 9.1.1.3;","paragraph_zero_based":883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a stored valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, that the UE requires to operate within the cell in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the stored version of the required SIB;","paragraph_zero_based":885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has not stored a valid version of a SIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required SIB(s), in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":887}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0feda159a9f67cae4e9c725879e8ace0c4a34ff7228f65bd2e14296d765cc0f0","b943ef6eda444b32f016e899f495e59b509146a9b841ba2a4167ed6a22925e59","fa850eaa91c7f8ffc20d1b9b03a1ab8e5f925d5efd7fc4bbaa69b40836a412bf","bbb378bd5b28dd6a0a23a1793c622e4e60c2464bf784983379887dcd878bd791","a9dce3cfefaa371cc8bc4150b532a0e36de53a3ffebc6fe0dea57d8c12b6d78f","2645297fdbf422cf2c8defb8d20892ac3f763ed39baedc33a1279a20c5dcdc70","ca34f5d633cf8d0641d18d23ed35aee9f959e5fa329265c97adb5fdd4617cd17","152733a2ab4e7cab32d385ad929462c6c2d2f121fea516bae6cf21958a08c859","f1c8a00007e7e2725ded89ea7cb9437c18952c7627bf457e97ebb2c97b28675e","7293b96d5b1aaa9fbf13c4428edea0fd3717f6cd3cc99dc37580072224fdeb04","074bd0e0b1124d694b42dcd4f1c9386646a78f3ec1c1ae7306cc3ec3f50e7c26","cc0075ff42cd203d1495b70324082686d8dcd8a6d8c7ebe9fcadbf3062870fd1","4f37b919da23b084e97b4e94b339efc9f2c94f9bd022445a5d3ba40436d44a40","aeaa19e69bf614e1219f8a04ee9eda4ff7ae5f4d75439a25d24d6a41b232227f","a57f1febe7f4cae529f35256dd4caf22837e444ec03d55481eb219714b0ddf47","751410dc9cd2180055da5eaf14460e6c7e7ba567637f480166b6be8b7cacf58b","f40ecc1a20fd8f8d611a0549eb7292b0148066f199c0e7eddfb682f1825d5af6","66f938135c02a50e405aa87f34d3c23f32687c77905047105cb2d7a3ab91963f","c71821738de514ef03dc36fe7000b560fe5653ac56690082cf6b7c1ef1922051","8b57ef7deb8a90af2a824232132332607a5c154d5e0008a1eab55f6248b6bdcd","409a992a8cd30cae0942a329054805aa817114b9b6a7f56912cb6704620f876f","b188054a25db64f565bb1a4e4759f2f30076f