{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the si-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one required SIB and for which si-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>trigger a request to acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE has a stored valid version of a posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several required posSIB(s), in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>use the stored version of the required posSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> if the UE has not stored a valid version of a posSIB, in accordance with clause 5.2.2.2.1, of one or several posSIB(s) in accordance with clause 5.2.2.1:","paragraph_zero_based":893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one requested posSIB and for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to broadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.2;","paragraph_zero_based":895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for the SI message(s) that, according to the posSI-SchedulingInfo, contain at least one requested posSIB for which posSI-BroadcastStatus is set to notBroadcasting:","paragraph_zero_based":896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>trigger a request to acquire the SI message(s) as defined in clause 5.2.2.3.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList in uplinkConfigCommon for FDD or in downlinkConfigCommon for TDD;","paragraph_zero_based":898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList:","paragraph_zero_based":899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the additionalPmax for UL;","paragraph_zero_based":900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the p-Max in uplinkConfigCommon for UL;","paragraph_zero_based":902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if supplementaryUplink is present in servingCellConfigCommon; and","paragraph_zero_based":903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports one or more of the frequency bands indicated in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink; and","paragraph_zero_based":904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList for a supported supplementary uplink band; and","paragraph_zero_based":905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports an uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth configuration (see TS 38.101-1 [15] and TS 38.101-2 [39]) which","paragraph_zero_based":906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is smaller than or equal to the carrierBandwidth (indicated in supplementaryUplink for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP), and which","paragraph_zero_based":907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial uplink BWP of the SUL:","paragraph_zero_based":908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>consider supplementary uplink as configured in the serving cell;","paragraph_zero_based":909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in nr-NS-PmaxList, if present;","paragraph_zero_based":910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply a supported supplementary uplink channel bandwidth with a maximum transmission bandwidth which","paragraph_zero_based":911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c3a7cfa0edb2dbed761b04993d8d872d06e58ab199c92a540c5c5ebb287e5077","658f46899cf0b30be5fd1f3763fff3cac584180f0a599bde26d8e1896f73d196","2e026c3db259372e5d67467d909b589551151e9f7edaff12920d86cd940441ad","6592b386dffabd1973c4f1cbd77558c1f84f7f935950a711997c318b820b4e50","34389ca687b6ddafb8cd513b46c6e2ab7ca2bb2d6951f5810f40fd0613935e17","43e3169e308b23590e255daa6f129452363e2f1279badc87cad01b1d61abcfd4","e4fee7f5bdf323aec3a00c796d0cf023d7ed7e5a29081455eda9e5025ba7305d","b2efebe48f98280adc2b49b69f39545b412a0793720bab8a29db8ee8ffadfbac","67316bbf5bd784b0c806e57cbd1bcc142c0368f3087f7f758b578ae12788593e","3d5ac7580404f08f5e8a5c476b8e359540a4ca849363f1de004fc981d43c5309","f2e60e5c36288f98d6d9cbba80770a3a8ebc58ede95676be779ae495ea555b47","a977042611b0abf4f31866e952bb4b10bdd60c05a7483ee632beb4a140aa7acd","0a8ba0ded6d52e79ced56b1a3aa53e41d2ac847922bd561e07b3b0207cc1a11f","78237d9ba86468f559e94ce9abf7319c58278c73cde4ad48115d4af81f9f2196","50234296ad629bec7815d2cab36f3a011856cffd2a5a25cd1b0864212f4d8844","04eaf03e09fce730c94287014634495b87f912fefd8193d14911efd83c61cc7f","27595da39b5d98bed21c51669fea0b8517c55b6f75c94777804f5ea1608b28b9","bf2a471780a2c471aad39ad771f0c8f336c6227a36a2856700622e0bf0d41638","c9c52b7d341df7959fba01daea332101d205468fb093bc50d6a1600f075b03a7","8237aa05f8ffb442b9865846f75cc3b32ebe9fa16e7d6b78a102cc77e6c6c692","e5627608