{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is contained within the carrierBandwidth (indicated in supplementaryUplink for the SCS of the initial uplink BWP), and which","paragraph_zero_based":912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is wider than or equal to the bandwidth of the initial BWP of the SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList for the supplementaryUplink;","paragraph_zero_based":914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList for the supplementaryUplink:","paragraph_zero_based":915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the additionalPmax in supplementaryUplink for SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max in supplementaryUplink for SUL;","paragraph_zero_based":918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For an out of coverage L2 U2N Remote UE in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE receiving SIB1 from its connected L2 U2N Relay UE, it is up to Remote UE implementation whether to consider and apply the following parameters: frequencyBandList, carrierBandwidth, frequencyShift7p5khz, frequency band, channel bandwidth, the configuration included in the servingCellConfigCommon, the specified PCCH configuration, additionalSpectrumEmission, additionalPmax, and p-Max.","paragraph_zero_based":919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the cell as barred in accordance with TS 38.304 [20]; and","paragraph_zero_based":921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform barring as if intraFreqReselection, or intraFreqReselectionRedCap for RedCap UEs, is set to notAllowed;","paragraph_zero_based":922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.3Actions upon reception of SIB2","paragraph_zero_based":923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB2, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE or in RRC_INACTIVE or in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if, for the entry in frequencyBandList with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandList:","paragraph_zero_based":926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList;","paragraph_zero_based":927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList:","paragraph_zero_based":928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE selects a frequency band (from the procedure in clause 5.2.2.4.2) for the supplementary uplink:","paragraph_zero_based":932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if, for the entry in frequencyBandListSUL with the same index as the frequency band selected in clause 5.2.2.4.2, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandListSUL:","paragraph_zero_based":933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandListSUL;","paragraph_zero_based":934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList:","paragraph_zero_based":935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1dfbd5cc9523f3323e99cce73efd94a7f594ae38798dd61603dfba3eeb30009d","16cd1df6457c993a40aa53732414e1b1e0a78947284d5d3af66030b04dccab76","133b834686f00182f2236492773aa32065a292516e80869551a5f87c8eb41705","3a9c9b99c91249f11f2cefd756ba557ff9c817e537e55f1534d7df0b3fb903ea","a15a0701f8bdcdcefcd75cbdd589f2dd08132438a717cd26a4487e69819b83d7","c5bca96ce6043ee2c6d6b3bcb531e83defd1279687c9929687a9cffec923980a","120fe26e0b76a1031e57c74dcd37a9ce516cfccc18ddb6846c5facee2c8287db","1716bffc5207fea3902cf3c276266397c3e46f734d1992b9dd77fedfc3a12749","a4fab44556d92b6116fd51ee29d6276786fc4c59a05985cb46e63ecfa1c89789","23fbbc283f79db11b6f36f5e675fb060dc88fce340f5ae81fbaf1d1f5ee45599","f66d86a84a77218724ff00bdb9ee27346f6b6f1fb88485543066c4a8bb176d8f","0ec506cb427127a78b5ca77422aad89412a878a1cb640cbd1805ea7061c43d59","37f2da0f22317566947b3a2aa1f647d0b61346be81070ad879f529452ccdaf2c","051b196bbfeeb69cbf4e9d5cdf0ce95927f78aa1fd11392b106ef797c1ca68da","5e97bafbd0a9a690ca27b1130ecc57d87ee4cb0e287a29d9cf4b890a4367e311","81dd23591f704e54dc734b498fbd3ef2d7cb2c06974530dd8b83dcf6e1a45ade","a1fc5b28c9a4f11fb69703d7bbf5ded8820e384ff906268bb8eb6a807eecb6fe","55fcf2860498acf03713fe54196717a61ccc9e104d78b3bf5a05a1a9ffef75bc","bb2b727d17fb1c4e47dc683591e22b69c76ecc6cb0c7a4a17aaf469e11153333","a6380abfaceb803b51da57da177b3686dfff0c594269bb5c436a42bf1734f915","b2bcffc2d5e386eb4dd3b25a75522a572cf5247ea3590d121931f0da43c16c87","df2473ea2c22f259eb8e529fb9eabca61ab8201001ae8506f799d764ff62273e","7440dc67e6b250fe4c94c7710ad43cae8b94e9eef3ab03c39c4549ccaa4d01df","3cdbf90038aa2c3745d6d144fd9ebf96b3afc2e84f95f59b59e380d4910871cb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[912,935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>apply the p-Max.","paragraph_zero_based":940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.4Actions upon reception of SIB3","paragraph_zero_based":943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"No UE requirements related to the contents of this SIB3 apply other than those specified elsewhere e.g. within procedures using the concerned system information, and/ or within the corresponding field descriptions.","paragraph_zero_based":944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.2.2.4.5Actions upon reception of SIB4","paragraph_zero_based":945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon receiving SIB4 the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if in RRC_IDLE, or in RRC_INACTIVE or in RRC_CONNECTED while T311 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each entry in the interFreqCarrierFreqList:","paragraph_zero_based":948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is not a RedCap UE; or","paragraph_zero_based":949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a RedCap UE and the interFreqCarrierFreqList-v1700 is absent; or","paragraph_zero_based":950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE is a RedCap UE and redCapAccessAllowed is present in interFreqCarrierFreqList-v1700:","paragraph_zero_based":951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>select the first frequency band in the frequencyBandList, and frequencyBandListSUL, if present, which the UE supports and for which the UE supports at least one of the additionalSpectrumEmission values in NR-NS-PmaxList, if present:","paragraph_zero_based":952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if, the frequency band selected by the UE in frequencyBandList to represent a non-serving NR carrier frequency is not a downlink only band:","paragraph_zero_based":953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if, for the selected frequency band, the UE supports at least one additionalSpectrumEmission in the NR-NS-PmaxList within the frequencyBandList:","paragraph_zero_based":954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>apply the first listed additionalSpectrumEmission which it supports among the values included in NR-NS-PmaxList within frequencyBandList;","paragraph_zero_based":955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the additionalPmax is present in the same entry of the selected additionalSpectrumEmission within NR-NS-PmaxList:","paragraph_zero_based":956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>apply the additionalPmax;","paragraph_zero_based":957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>else:","paragraph_zero_based":958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"7>apply the p-Max;","paragraph_zero_based":959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4bbef4ad7436dc48b557e45250a674690f5ba40e18043499443cf9b1cfe2b318","cd867185c7f24a746e5cbdeff7f429c7ff757fa2a5a51e1c528c3bc88f80f490","c24ff515d26b9d60660fb34b4a8d3726b2564692a991603b79997fd960e6d39a","e65f2acf6044df5cdabff81eda59cd0ba22da308c28929404424df59a89f6c54","9444c0d161e375b161bb44da28dd268bef7b63d6d0254751946ce2aa14808963","086f520666229b60653de2142a597b609a