{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1536},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the otherConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1537},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the other configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.9;","paragraph_zero_based":1538},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the bap-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1539},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the BAP configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.12;","paragraph_zero_based":1540},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the iab-IP-AddressConfigurationList:","paragraph_zero_based":1541},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if iab-IP-AddressToReleaseList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":1542},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform release of IP address as specified in 5.3.5.12a.1.1;","paragraph_zero_based":1543},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if iab-IP-AddressToAddModList is included:","paragraph_zero_based":1544},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform IAB IP address addition/update as specified in 5.3.5.12a.1.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1545},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the conditionalReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":1546},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform conditional reconfiguration as specified in 5.3.5.13;","paragraph_zero_based":1547},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapsConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1548},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapsConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1549},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1550},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1551},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1552},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1553},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigNR is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1554},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1555},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1556},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of NR target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1557},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":1558},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if needForGapNCSG-ConfigEUTRA is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1559}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["26fddfe801dfdc7d9a1bf6ab9639fde63ddbb95faf1741f34921a861f76a3593","86c574ee10e721977befa357cafa3b3addfbbd06fa7c5ee4b53dd9ab4ce5c8aa","6117e9807688e428483b93014c0862c4a63814710d0ad6612a0604c739c5e1ba","61e0462876120b230bd8eb7c5815451d7cb88de6779264c0464fa042ae6de52c","b1ff6ba18c4b4d5ba66a7016b9d85491e1117cf503ffa0ebea347b799cac279c","345de4a1e367df118b9cbe7bbeabc160627e4588a995b9c2