{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1560},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1561},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide the measurement gap and NCSG requirement information of EUTRA target bands;","paragraph_zero_based":1562},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the onDemandSIB-Request:","paragraph_zero_based":1563},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if onDemandSIB-Request is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":1564},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1565},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":1566},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to request SIB(s) or posSIB(s) in RRC_CONNECTED in accordance with clause 5.2.2.3.5;","paragraph_zero_based":1567},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":1568},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR:","paragraph_zero_based":1569},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the sidelink dedicated configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.14;","paragraph_zero_based":1570},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 0a:If the sl-ConfigDedicatedNR was received embedded within an E-UTRA RRCConnectionReconfiguration message, the UE does not build an NR RRCReconfigurationComplete message for the received sl-ConfigDedicatedNR.","paragraph_zero_based":1571},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RelayUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1572},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N Relay UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.15;","paragraph_zero_based":1573},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-L2RemoteUE-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1574},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the L2 U2N Remote UE configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.16;","paragraph_zero_based":1575},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the dedicatedPagingDelivery:","paragraph_zero_based":1576},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the Paging message reception procedure as specified in 5.3.2.3;","paragraph_zero_based":1577},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the sl-ConfigDedicatedEUTRA-Info:","paragraph_zero_based":1578},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform related procedures for V2X sidelink communication in accordance with TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.3.10 and clause 5.5.2;","paragraph_zero_based":1579},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the ul-GapFR2-Config:","paragraph_zero_based":1580},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the FR2 UL gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.13c;","paragraph_zero_based":1581},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCReconfiguration message includes the musim-GapConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":1582},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the MUSIM gap configuration procedure as specified in 5.3.5.9a;","paragraph_zero_based":1583}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["2c5b