{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the release is triggered by reception of the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":1992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToReleaseList:","paragraph_zero_based":1993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the current UE configuration includes an SCell with value sCellIndex:","paragraph_zero_based":1994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>release the SCell.","paragraph_zero_based":1995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.5.5.9SCell Addition/Modification","paragraph_zero_based":1996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":1997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is not part of the current UE configuration (SCell addition):","paragraph_zero_based":1998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>add the SCell, corresponding to the sCellIndex, in accordance with the sCellConfigCommon and sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":1999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId included in the measIdList within VarMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if SCells are not applicable for the associated measurement; and","paragraph_zero_based":2005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the concerned SCell is included in cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":2006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the concerned SCell from cellsTriggeredList defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":2007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the SCellConfig contains the goodServingCellEvaluationBFD:","paragraph_zero_based":2008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the UE may perform the evaluation of the good serving cell quality criterion for this serving cell as specified in 5.7.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":2009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each sCellIndex value included in the sCellToAddModList that is part of the current UE configuration (SCell modification):","paragraph_zero_based":2010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>modify the SCell configuration in accordance with the sCellConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":2011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sCellState is included:","paragraph_zero_based":2012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in activated state;","paragraph_zero_based":2013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>configure lower layers to consider the SCell to be in deactivated state.","paragraph_zero_based":2015}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d027fcbcbbf1ea77bb47eebcb13abf2fe45c7da2617d28fc2eb4a140341aa2a2","8bd211b3d332a1baefef39212df58ccc06232ee0abced260da09d2e4bfdae663","b1135ccf901fdec03a292a79bbdb837e12c277cdc008ca03630501fbdfcb92c4","302b903fc7e50908620829a5c5faf1e761de3b5ce617d4e17bd75aa461583f6d","b3826c9ac1fd118d24d3278e6121c15cb59131