{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide overheating assistance information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide overheating assistance information and stop timer T345, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the idc-AssistanceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if idc-AssistanceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide IDC assistance information in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":2383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the received otherConfig includes the drx-PreferenceConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":2384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if drx-PreferenceConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":2385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself to be configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters for power saving for the cell group in accordance with 5.7.4;","paragraph_zero_based":2386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":2387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider itself not to be configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters for power saving for the cell group and stop timer T346a associated with the cell group, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the r