{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release musim-GapAssistanceConfig, if configured and stop timer T346h, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release musim-LeaveAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig, if configured, and stop timer T346i, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":2979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release propDelayDiffReportConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release maxBW-PreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successHO-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if any DAPS bearer is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":2986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset the source MAC and release the source MAC configuration;","paragraph_zero_based":2987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each DAPS bearer:","paragraph_zero_based":2988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity or entities as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the PDCP entity to release DAPS as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":2990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":2991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the PDCP entity for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4], clause 5.1.3, and the associated logical channel for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the physical channel configuration for the source SpCell;","paragraph_zero_based":2994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the keys used in the source SpCell (the KgNB key, the KRRCenc key, the KRRCint key, the KUPint key and the KUPenc key), if any;","paragraph_zero_based":2995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release sl-L2RemoteUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release the SRAP entity, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":2998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":2999}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["85d5296e0f2fbe7aa654ef7a308449ee6bfeac73c797de15cc994d7362cecc0c","7d4ff99d6f8c526389c6da4536d7f2f8a34967328b5652f7fa720ffcf9d27788","9daf39f458028f4294597ff1847323b75851c7661cf51ffb90b2ecf567b09cd6","d09b0de4a49b48f8524737ae8c887487475d9a9d5187bf99a974e95fd750ab4b","992b50c027d2f5115cd3904d3dd651fdb0b413064ce6eac452e7baeec1c372ac","f2bf110834ab91228fc8970a6c863706ec192810941d189a6dfee575e4773b68","ef6796a40fd0d28b839298