{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":3000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":3001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":3002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":3003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>consider the connected L2 U2N Relay UE as suitable and perform actions as specified in clause 5.3.7.3a;","paragraph_zero_based":3004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is up to Remote UE implementation whether to release or keep the current PC5 unicast link.","paragraph_zero_based":3005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> else:","paragraph_zero_based":3006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is capable of L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":3007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform either cell selection as specified in TS 38.304 [20], or relay selection as specified in clause 5.8.15.3, or both;","paragraph_zero_based":3008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform cell selection in accordance with the cell selection process as specified in TS 38.304 [20].","paragraph_zero_based":3010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For L2 U2N Remote UE, if both a suitable cell and a suitable relay are available, the UE can select either one based on its implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":3011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.3.7.3Actions following cell selection while T311 is running","paragraph_zero_based":3012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon selecting a suitable NR cell, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":3013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>ensure having valid and up to date essential system information as specified in clause 5.2.2.2;","paragraph_zero_based":3014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T311;","paragraph_zero_based":3015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T390 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>stop timer T390 for all access categories;","paragraph_zero_based":3017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>perform the actions as specified in 5.3.14.4;","paragraph_zero_based":3018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the relay (re)selection procedure, if ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":3019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the cell selection is triggered by detecting radio link failure of the MCG or re-configuration with sync failure of the MCG or mobility from NR failure, and","paragraph_zero_based":3020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if attemptCondReconfig is configured; and","paragraph_zero_based":3021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected cell is not configured with CondEventT1, or the selected cell is configured with CondEventT1 and leaving condition has not been fulfilled; and","paragraph_zero_based":3022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the selected cell is one of the candidate cells for which the reconfigurationWithSync is included in the masterCellGroup in the MCG VarConditionalReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["fd1be99d5eea7a6fa3a41a4c3dc0d3a8c3d