{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE supports RLF-Report for conditional handover, set the choCellId in the VarRLF-Report to the global cell identity, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the selected cell;","paragraph_zero_based":3024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the stored condRRCReconfig associated to the selected cell and perform actions as specified in 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:It is left to network implementation to how to avoid keystream reuse in case of CHO based recovery after a failed handover without key change.","paragraph_zero_based":3026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if UE is configured with attemptCondReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reset MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":3029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release spCellConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release the MCG SCell(s), if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release delayBudgetReportingConfig, if configured and stop timer T342, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release overheatingAssistanceConfig , if configured and stop timer T345, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if MR-DC is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>perform MR-DC release, as specified in clause 5.3.5.10;","paragraph_zero_based":3035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release idc-AssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release btNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release wlanNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release sensorNameList, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release drx-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346a associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxBW-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346b associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxCC-PreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346c associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346d associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346e associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release rlm-RelaxationReportingConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346j associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release bfd-RelaxationReportingConfig for the MCG, if configured and stop timer T346k associated with the MCG, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release releasePreferenceConfig, if configured and stop timer T346f, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3047}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragr