{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release onDemandSIB-Request if configured, and stop timer T350, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release referenceTimePreferenceReporting, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release sl-AssistanceConfigNR, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release obtainCommonLocation, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release scg-DeactivationPreferenceConfig, if configured, and stop timer T346i, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release musim-GapAssistanceConfig, if configured and stop timer T346h, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release musim-LeaveAssistanceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release propDelayDiffReportConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release ul-GapFR2-PreferenceConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release rrm-MeasRelaxationReportingConfig, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxBW-PreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceConfigFR2-2, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>release minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceConfigExt, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>suspend all RBs, and BH RLC channels for the IAB-MT, except SRB0 and broadcast MRBs;","paragraph_zero_based":3061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":3064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>release the PC5 RLC entity for SL-RLC0, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start timer T301;","paragraph_zero_based":3070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the default L1 parameter values as specified in corresponding physical layer specifications except for the parameters for which values are provided in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3071}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["d122a0dbc4a0005fa401fae76d12610d1be76b02da893ec5fdf2db75c881de04","e019f8bc748a318a0713b7153bacfb65b0c51619da5a51ca8e4f207cecbd309b","a5658940450a3489821239db38a11578cee1ce6478d40320c0c0444c029a578f","a1f8d8e340320cdf88525ba