{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T320, with the timer value set according to the value of t320;","paragraph_zero_based":3216},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3217},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the cell reselection priority information broadcast in the system information;","paragraph_zero_based":3218},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if deprioritisationReq is included and the UE supports RRC connection release with deprioritisation:","paragraph_zero_based":3219},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start or restart timer T325 with the timer value set to the deprioritisationTimer signalled;","paragraph_zero_based":3220},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the deprioritisationReq until T325 expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":3221},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1a:The UE stores the deprioritisation request irrespective of any cell reselection absolute priority assignments (by dedicated or common signalling) and regardless of RRC connections in NR or other RATs unless specified otherwise.","paragraph_zero_based":3222},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease includes the measIdleConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3223},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if T331 is running:","paragraph_zero_based":3224},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3> stop timer T331;","paragraph_zero_based":3225},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>perform the actions as specified in 5.7.8.3;","paragraph_zero_based":3226},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the measIdleConfig is set to setup:","paragraph_zero_based":3227},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store the received measIdleDuration in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3228},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T331 with the value set to measIdleDuration;","paragraph_zero_based":3229},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListNR:","paragraph_zero_based":3230},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListNR in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3231},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains measIdleCarrierListEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":3232},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received measIdleCarrierListEUTRA in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3233},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the measIdleConfig contains validityAreaList:","paragraph_zero_based":3234},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>store the received validityAreaList in VarMeasIdleConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3235},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RRCRelease includes suspendConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3236},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>reset MAC and release the default MAC Cell Group configuration, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3237},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>apply the received suspendConfig except the received nextHopChainingCount;","paragraph_zero_based":3238},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the sdt-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3239}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4c370ca9080381536c66f46f4a51242961c9eb4778347468251b5b6a2b3e79f8","a068ce58f3bb0593d985e6516011fdccaa100dc4b6476f3633320f6321a1e75f","aacab69fe2f530ec8d02fdee96d6291a8caa7b55e1d831726fa30b8e74de52c4","0ffadd91431d65d6d26fcdefdf63247200d101e3afbd15ea08818660e9c605ce","ede47d57f50db1f28aca7d311aec3b24695a7a6aa9edca8e36714041c69e440c","3355c8fcf8b95f1c3be07c6472a3c4b2f142dba0070d4e6e9c9058015a263e00","f0c8d6ad8f1433c2a