{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the DRB in the sdt-DRB-List:","paragraph_zero_based":3240},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the DRB to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":3241},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-SRB2-Indication is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3242},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>consider the SRB2 to be configured for SDT;","paragraph_zero_based":3243},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each RLC bearer (except those associated with broadcast MRBs) that is not suspended:","paragraph_zero_based":3244},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>re-establish the RLC entity as specified in TS 38.322 [4];","paragraph_zero_based":3245},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for SRB2 (if it is resumed) and for SRB1:","paragraph_zero_based":3246},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>trigger the PDCP entity to perform SDU discard as specified in TS 38.323 [5];","paragraph_zero_based":3247},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sdt-MAC-PHY-CG-Config is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3248},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>configure the PCell with the configured grant resources for SDT and instruct the MAC entity to start the cg-SDT-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":3249},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if srs-PosRRC-Inactive is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":3250},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>apply the configuration and instruct MAC to start the inactivePosSRS-TimeAlignmentTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":3251},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1b:The Network should provide full configuration to UE for SRS for Positioning in RRC_INACTIVE.","paragraph_zero_based":3252},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>remove all the entries within the MCG and the SCG VarConditionalReconfig, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":3253},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for each measId of the MCG measConfig and for each measId of the SCG measConfig, if configured, if the associated reportConfig has a reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3254},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the associated reportConfigId:","paragraph_zero_based":3255},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching reportConfigId from the reportConfigList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3256},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the associated measObjectId is only associated to a reportConfig with reportType set to condTriggerConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":3257},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the entry with the matching measObjectId from the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3258},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry with the matching measId from the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":3259},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is acting as L2 U2N Remote UE:","paragraph_zero_based":3260},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the PC5-RRC connection with the U2N Relay UE is determined to be released:","paragraph_zero_based":3261},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>indicate upper layers to trigger PC5 unicast link release;","paragraph_zero_based":3262},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else (i.e., maintain the PC5 RRC connection):","paragraph_zero_based":3263}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5e51e9a2769ed9c0bdf12fd45344f767e3211d5b3d26beff5001732892c9b250","c586165d5d80a51a7252df3754bf18b951b37167f25802197556277c4e668cea","91c07aa45a3d1d54babafeebefd4c85046a09466