{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>establish or re-establish (e.g. via release and add) SL RLC entity for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>re-establish RLC entities for SRB1;","paragraph_zero_based":3266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRCRelease message with suspendConfig was received in response to an RRCResumeRequest or an RRCResumeRequest1:","paragraph_zero_based":3267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T319 if running;","paragraph_zero_based":3268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>in the stored UE Inactive AS context:","paragraph_zero_based":3269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the KgNB and KRRCint keys with the current KgNB and KRRCint keys;","paragraph_zero_based":3270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the nextHopChainingCount with the value of nextHopChainingCount received in the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":3271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>replace the cellIdentity with the cellIdentity of the cell the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":3272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the suspendConfig contains the sl-UEIdentityRemote (i.e. the UE is a L2 U2N Remote UE):","paragraph_zero_based":3273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the C-RNTI with the value of the sl-UEIdentityRemote;","paragraph_zero_based":3274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the physical cell identity with the value of the sl-PhysCellId in sl-ServingCellInfo contained in the discovery message received from the connected L2 U2N Relay UE;","paragraph_zero_based":3275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4> else:","paragraph_zero_based":3276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the C-RNTI with the C-RNTI used in the cell (see TS 38.321 [3]) the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":3277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>replace the physical cell identity with the physical cell identity of the cell the UE has received the RRCRelease message;","paragraph_zero_based":3278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>replace the nextHopChainingCount with the value associated with the current KgNB;","paragraph_zero_based":3279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the timer T319a if running and consider SDT procedure is not ongoing;","paragraph_zero_based":3280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":3281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>store in the UE Inactive AS Context the nextHopChainingCount received in the RRCRelease message, the current KgNB and KRRCint keys, the ROHC state, the EHC context(s), the UDC state, the stored QoS flow to DRB mapping rules, the application layer measurement configuration, the C-RNTI used in the source PCell, the cellIdentity and the physical cell identity of the source PCell, the spCellConfigCommon within ReconfigurationWithSync of the NR PSCell (if configured) and all other parameters configured except for:","paragraph_zero_based":3282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within ReconfigurationWithSync of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":3283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within ReconfigurationWithSync of the NR PSCell, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-parameters within MobilityControlInfoSCG of the E-UTRA PSCell, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-servingCellConfigCommonSIB;","paragraph_zero_based":3286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-sl-L2RelayUE-Config, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":3287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da9