{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the measurement reporting entry for this measId from the VarMeasReportList, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":4344},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>stop the periodical reporting timer or timer T321 or timer T322, whichever is running, and reset the associated information (e.g. timeToTrigger) for this measId.","paragraph_zero_based":4345},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The UE does not consider the message as erroneous if the measObjectToRemoveList includes any measObjectId value that is not part of the current UE configuration.","paragraph_zero_based":4346},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.2.5Measurement object addition/modification","paragraph_zero_based":4347},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4348},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each measObjectId included in the received measObjectToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4349},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if an entry with the matching measObjectId exists in the measObjectList within the VarMeasConfig, for this entry:","paragraph_zero_based":4350},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>reconfigure the entry with the value received for this measObject, except for the fields cellsToAddModList, excludedCellsToAddModList, allowedCellsToAddModList, cellsToRemoveList, excludedCellsToRemoveList, allowedCellsToRemoveList, tx-PoolMeasToRemoveList, tx-PoolMeasToAddModList, ssb-PositionQCL-CellsToRemoveList, ssb-PositionQCL-CellsToAddModList, cca-CellsToRemoveList, and cca-CellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4351},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the cellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4352},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each physCellId included in the cellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4353},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching physCellId from the cellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4354},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4355},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each physCellId value included in the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4356},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching physCellId exists in the cellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4357},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this physCellId;","paragraph_zero_based":4358},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4359},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>add a new entry for the received physCellId to the cellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4360},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the excludedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4361},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the excludedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4362},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex from the excludedCellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4363},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For each pci-RangeIndex included in the excludedCellsToRemoveList that concerns overlapping ranges of cells, a cell is removed from the exclude-list of cells only if all PCI ranges containing it are removed.","paragraph_zero_based":4364},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the excludedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4365},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the excludedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4366},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex is included in the excludedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4367}],"source":"Whole auth