{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this pci-RangeIndex;","paragraph_zero_based":4368},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4369},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>add a new entry for the received pci-RangeIndex to the excludedCellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4370},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the allowedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4371},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the allowedCellsToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4372},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex from the allowedCellsToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4373},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE2:For each pci-RangeIndex included in the allowedCellsToRemoveList that concerns overlapping ranges of cells, a cell is removed from the allow-list of cells only if all PCI ranges containing it are removed.","paragraph_zero_based":4374},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the allowedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4375},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each pci-RangeIndex included in the allowedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching pci-RangeIndex is included in the allowedCellsToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this pci-RangeIndex;","paragraph_zero_based":4378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>add a new entry for the received pci-RangeIndex to the allowedCellsToAddModList","paragraph_zero_based":4380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each measId associated with this measObjectId in the measIdList within the VarMeasConfig, if any:","paragraph_zero_based":4381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>remove the measurement reporting entry for this measId from the VarMeasReportList, if included;","paragraph_zero_based":4382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>stop the periodical reporting timer or timer T321 or timer T322, whichever one is running, and reset the associated information (e.g. timeToTrigger) for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":4383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the tx-PoolMeasToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each transmission resource pool indicated in tx-PoolMeasToRemoveList:","paragraph_zero_based":4385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>remove the entry with the matching identity of the transmission resource pool from the tx-PoolMeasToAddModList;","paragraph_zero_based":4386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the received measObject includes the tx-PoolMeasToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each transmission resource pool indicated in tx-PoolMeasToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if an entry with the matching identity of the transmission resource pool exists in the tx-PoolMeasToAddModList:","paragraph_zero_based":4389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>replace the entry with the value received for this transmission resource pool;","paragraph_zero_based":4390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":4391}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["12453f01