{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":4992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A6-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition A6-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":4994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for this measurement, consider the (secondary) cell corresponding to the measObjectNR associated to this event to be the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":4995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The reference signal(s) of the neighbour(s) and the reference signal(s) of the SCell are both indicated in the associated measObjectNR.","paragraph_zero_based":4996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A6-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ocn – Hys > Ms + Ocs + Off","paragraph_zero_based":4998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality A6-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":4999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ocn + Hys < Ms + Ocs + Off","paragraph_zero_based":5000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the neighbouring cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the associated measObjectNR), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ms is the measurement result of the serving cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocs is the cell specific offset of the serving cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the associated measObjectNR), and is set to zero if not configured for the serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Off is the offset parameter for this event (i.e. a6-Offset as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn, Ms are expressed in dBm in case of RSRP, or in dB in case of RSRQ and RS-SINR.","paragraph_zero_based":5008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn, Ocs, Hys, Off are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.8Event B1 (Inter RAT neighbour becomes better than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B1-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B1-2, as specified below, is fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":5013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B1-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5015}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c