{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B1-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is the measurement result of the inter-RAT neighbour cell, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn is the measurement object specific offset of the frequency of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. eutra-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour inter-RAT cell, utra-FDD-Q-OffsetRange as defined within the measObjectUTRA-FDD corresponding to the frequency of the neighbour inter-RAT cell).","paragraph_zero_based":5020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ocn is the cell specific offset of the inter-RAT neighbour cell (i.e. cellIndividualOffset as defined within the measObjectEUTRA corresponding to the neighbour inter-RAT cell), and set to zero if not configured for the neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event (i.e. hysteresis as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. b1-ThresholdEUTRA as defined within reportConfigInterRAT for this event, b1-ThresholdUTRA-FDD as defined for UTRA-FDD within reportConfigInterRAT for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn is expressed in dBm or in dB, depending on the measurement quantity of the inter-RAT neighbour cell.","paragraph_zero_based":5024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Ofn, Ocn, Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.9Event B2 (PCell becomes worse than threshold1 and inter RAT neighbour becomes better than threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":5027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition B2-1 and condition B2-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition B2-3 or condition B2-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp + Hys < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn – Hys > Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-3 (Leaving condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp – Hys > Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality B2-4 (Leaving condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mn + Ofn + Ocn + Hys < Thresh2","paragraph_zero_based":5038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5039}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98b