{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh1 is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":5160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh2 is expressed in the same unit as Mn.","paragraph_zero_based":5161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.18Event X2 (Serving L2 U2N Relay UE becomes worse than threshold)","paragraph_zero_based":5162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when condition X2-1, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition X2-2, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X2-1 (Entering condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr + Hys < Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5167},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality X2-2 (Leaving condition)","paragraph_zero_based":5168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr – Hys > Thresh","paragraph_zero_based":5169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The variables in the formula are defined as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is the measurement result of the serving L2 U2N Relay UE, not taking into account any offsets.","paragraph_zero_based":5171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys is the hysteresis parameter for this event.","paragraph_zero_based":5172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is the threshold parameter for this event (i.e. x2-Threshold-Relay as defined within reportConfigNR for this event).","paragraph_zero_based":5173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mr is expressed in dBm.","paragraph_zero_based":5174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Hys are expressed in dB.","paragraph_zero_based":5175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Thresh is expressed in the same unit as Mr.","paragraph_zero_based":5176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.5.4.19Event Y1 (PCell becomes worse than threshold1 and candidate L2 U2N Relay UE becomes better than threshold2)","paragraph_zero_based":5177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the entering condition for this event to be satisfied when both condition Y1-1 and condition Y1-2, as specified below, are fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>consider the leaving condition for this event to be satisfied when condition Y1-3 or condition Y1-4, i.e. at least one of the two, as specified below, is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":5180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Y1-1 (Entering condition 1)","paragraph_zero_based":5181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Mp + Hys < Thresh1","paragraph_zero_based":5182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Inequality Y1-2 (Entering condition 2)","paragraph_zero_based":5183}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4298642790eac366ad0ac6852d9224081d6abdaccb00202859aaf66eff7d6f27","0240a13e8f1134f249404032d745f509886065d789ef6dc8a36f445003230349","7d8bb458a30be8e92989afd9c70ee9daadf4d8920fa43c003d4ea051f5e8c165","91773f7cc365117da6208b215e0ce4e2172156574a671c3009b19ffa076523a7","94890f85929b2018954dad0f1aefa61b977b6278109073dd11d70521a21fde08","9ef7df61622b3c6b32af2fb9b56113ee8929cdec078d5808d18693776babd63a","f05e28b7940733ea774871accfa03ea37b78a0749624ee0dda99a1b157661ff7","128ee67d9500a79