{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if available, include the sensor-MotionInformation;","paragraph_zero_based":5376},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if there is at least one applicable transmission resource pool for NR sidelink communication/discovery (for measResultsSL):","paragraph_zero_based":5377},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultsListSL to include the CBR measurement results in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":5378},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the reportType is set to eventTriggered:","paragraph_zero_based":5379},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the transmission resource pools included in the poolsTriggeredList as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5380},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5381},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the applicable transmission resource pools for which the new measurement results became available since the last periodical reporting or since the measurement was initiated or reset;","paragraph_zero_based":5382},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the corresponding measObject concerns NR sidelink communication/discovery, then for each transmission resource pool to be reported:","paragraph_zero_based":5383},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-poolReportIdentity to the identity of this transmission resource pool;","paragraph_zero_based":5384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sl-CBR-ResultsNR to the CBR measurement results on PSSCH and PSCCH of this transmission resource pool provided by lower layers, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":5385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":5386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if there is at least one applicable CLI measurement resource to report:","paragraph_zero_based":5387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportType is set to cli-EventTriggered or cli-Periodical:","paragraph_zero_based":5388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measResultCLI to include the most interfering SRS resources or most interfering CLI-RSSI resources up to maxReportCLI in accordance with the following:","paragraph_zero_based":5389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the reportType is set to cli-EventTriggered:","paragraph_zero_based":5390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if trigger quantity is set to srs-RSRP i.e. i1-Threshold is set to srs-RSRP:","paragraph_zero_based":5391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the SRS resource included in the cli-TriggeredList as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if trigger quantity is set to cli-RSSI i.e. i1-Threshold is set to cli-RSSI:","paragraph_zero_based":5393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the CLI-RSSI resource included in the cli-TriggeredList as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if reportQuantityCLI is set to srs-rsrp:","paragraph_zero_based":5396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the applicable SRS resources for which the new measurement results became available since the last periodical reporting or since the measurement was initiated or reset;","paragraph_zero_based":5397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include the applicable CLI-RSSI resources for which the new measurement results became available since the last periodical reporting or since the measurement was initiated or reset;","paragraph_zero_based":5399}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3f2206e1c0cc59d6f8404f0e0bfcbecae317e259390b3fb9c6c97de4f2f46e84","c7a5a11b0ad9eb980fb59fbd3a26a4a8ec7688cc8fcc52a86e04e28af4398808","4f39e49f92fa41ae4381f2c3e90429d1701828b67ad6e2d12cb88bd5c953935b","960d05a023db49cdd93970c51cab4a0867b5935d835ff890a45771fa0cb1863d","2b870cf4add246ee9299017e785d2603eb9ca1f2a075ee131c7ea37084b06cba","b8499bd7de91df67ceae7a582a5a554ce1ab1ac6f35b4f63945cb06ea72c4478","9ce45b14dca75209a54c7543b41964de2b4e8e8a620ab1ef6a5f0fcd55f41345","6d58f214721125d1f347a2d6bcabd1e4b05ac4520ddf889811394c8915c0825c","299a9c9ae43cf379231e209cf307bea48bd57afa23d4992cfbf92fd94591fa82","c326fc768adff9dfe613548931b7b82d4e5439e20cecfb72b8628984a8adee0f","48dcfc260a82e3a3cbd69be92f41d8475417f5b946ac456398422800deb54b27","3fe084bd13764d8375dc095a3193dafa748f5df4ed2334aa193e8c172376f426","b6b066438d79ee5e9c45ea78659e1fa554d2dfd823735c2ce982b59d7fc1aa5b","2fbf378e4aa0da52df985cd8d5b7103f7a1cbdffd68d2292646365712718c128","a0c319d77666868981589a6eff896ca8a0f7647c8e3d422833bac740d5135b20","b7d1a8de11596ca94b94cafa9091e2ecc596c9601cf5a32db04f882c14f9da50","cab3a88935a979c67a2903d2c4946ff74804f2572aa416bfba6e3fb91bf9dd44","e82d4e1548fa89628e61a3685e335648aad21acbbd26af2e0f533046de82c0a4","b45515ea0d17e53affb2ee362aeca9cff203c4a48b7d414471f97a0b323b4112","6fe3673f2d411780522fa2e35212802a07af58a1a909dcfbb514a389597617f9","14c90465c6eb8a896f088fb8ab9653c6e783b8dd0809a0b402124b57bafe8a2f","da9333a35705ee4cc332a26ac1c1cbe8ba48b6a6bd22c15fceb94bbd29b123ba","24a9432fc73308705ad779e33fc860266e146f30ca6974f1b693380f748673a8","342d934f4e5be68e9cac95c64b91534b371f2ebae7b5654f63422df16e4db8ab"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5376,5399],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p5376"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each SRS resource that is included in the measResultCLI:","paragraph_zero_based":5400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the srs-ResourceId;","paragraph_zero_based":5401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set srs-RSRP-Result to include the layer 3 filtered measured results in decreasing order, i.e. the most interfering SRS resource is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":5402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>for each CLI-RSSI resource that is included in the measResultCLI:","paragraph_zero_based":5403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include the rssi-ResourceId;","paragraph_zero_based":5404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set cli-RSSI-Result to include the layer 3 filtered measured results in decreasing order, i.e. the most interfering CLI-RSSI resource is included first;","paragraph_zero_based":5405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if there is at least one applicable UE Rx-Tx time difference measurement to report:","paragraph_zero_based":5406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set measResultRxTxTimeDiff to the latest measurement result;","paragraph_zero_based":5407},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>increment the numberOfReportsSent as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId by 1;","paragraph_zero_based":5408},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop the periodical reporting timer, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":5409},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the numberOfReportsSent as defined within the VarMeasReportList for this measId is less than the reportAmount as defined within the corresponding reportConfig for this measId:","paragraph_zero_based":5410},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>start the periodical reporting timer with the value of reportInterval as defined within the corresponding reportConfig for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5411},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5412},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the reportType is set to periodical or cli-Periodical or rxTxPeriodical:","paragraph_zero_based":5413},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove the entry within the VarMeasReportList for this measId;","paragraph_zero_based":5414},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>remove this measId from the measIdList within VarMeasConfig;","paragraph_zero_based":5415},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the measurement reporting was configured by a sl-ConfigDedicatedNR received within the RRCConnectionReconfiguration:","paragraph_zero_based":5416},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the MeasurementReport message to lower layers for transmission via SRB1, embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferIRAT as specified TS 36.331 [10], clause 5.6.28;","paragraph_zero_based":5417},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in (NG)EN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":5418},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB3 is configured and the SCG is not deactivated:","paragraph_zero_based":5419},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the MeasurementReport message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission, upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":5420},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5421},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the MeasurementReport message via E-UTRA embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10].","paragraph_zero_based":5422},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":5423}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590