{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set refFreqCSI-RS to the value indicated by refFreqCSI-RS as included in the associated measurement object;","paragraph_zero_based":5856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a serving cell is associated with the MeasObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":5857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set measResultServingCell to include the available quantities of the concerned cell and in accordance with the performance requirements in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":5858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultNeighCellList to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first, and based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and set its fields as follows;","paragraph_zero_based":5859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>ordering the cells with sorting as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>based on SS/PBCH block if SS/PBCH block measurement results are available and otherwise based on CSI-RS;","paragraph_zero_based":5861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>using RSRP if RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise using RSRQ if RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise using SINR;","paragraph_zero_based":5862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each neighbour cell included:","paragraph_zero_based":5863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the optional fields that are available.","paragraph_zero_based":5864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The measured quantities are filtered by the L3 filter as configured in the mobility measurement configuration. The measurements are based on the time domain measurement resource restriction, if configured. Exclude-listed cells are not required to be reported.","paragraph_zero_based":5865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7 according to the otherConfig associated with the NR SCG.","paragraph_zero_based":5866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3.5Actions related to transmission of SCGFailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":5867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the SCGFailureInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message due to T310 expiry:","paragraph_zero_based":5869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as t310-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":5870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message due to T312 expiry:","paragraph_zero_based":5871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as other and set the failureType-v1610 as t312-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":5872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message to provide reconfiguration with sync failure information for an SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":5873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as synchReconfigFailureSCG;","paragraph_zero_based":5874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the SCGFailureInformation message to provide random access problem indication from SCG MAC:","paragraph_zero_based":5875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the random access procedure was initiated for beam failure recovery:","paragraph_zero_based":5876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failureType as other and set the failureType-v1610 as beamFailureRecoveryFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":5877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failureType as randomAccessProblem;","paragraph_zero_based":5879}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6b82d71efa5c084b759a70f271030d93416e3f5bf3cf44be6a9052c39fb25ced","2fac59e468821a3b91f110b5823867c0c1df36124e81848b20f4f555a5a2e28f","c7df40dcdcbebea76920acef1d7dae820636ebbf10dc7020a0a66cb43973c2d2","37c997ea640d4bffd2defe1e922c25b8ba78f5294823b034c1a5264021a752ef","a0afcaab0c6a79284cd8bd6f939ba04ee7b80615432de6416b7f46b4c6f10fea","d6464252b2d7e84f5a40c4a07b692a4892b5ce34608b5d9d0fae693c69576e28","2236129b3b300734334cf4c87dba3a024b61a5a4cd7e542489e119a8ffb3623c","8a3a7cd4b2a4026bcb8cbba37f3ffba23692cb602e9f3b43d2b60177404c95a6","ccb8c64038f76c54529065ba8021be0faebd0576d5253c432e46cb0bc265f030","1a7569c52ca117dfdfd323716d9dff5166fb0f0032bd3229e7f262b7fe7871ec","8fe9c6e856f96e8ff00cb1215defb4d576ca23d90ad7294354bc5fb0e9440df3","566161d3c629df39516cee5d10fa39a5be5ebb77460e34893c98e8d6c27541b0","f7fed253c18c6d93da64ca7ee672e836192fbff1df7ba6316d933827f3486085","e35f4f8037d344106ff2a18368152295e289325669afb1d5cbcd7b3071458991","47f39368235bba19cc8bce5a10fe79ed201db040f3c6c0c511898270416c90cf","fd33c0949d63ee64e6a1dca8dd698147c74a3077b1530c98998069688fc15f01","22848c94cef57f626ca83b238ee8c6650ac7fc2cf5b5217285e9e750b5fd82ba","d9b8a5bff3518ccb3046c9f68a68d21e365e89625a5ab58c316ab459b0a3dafa","7179aa7f5c38a533a29706dc75c5c14e95d408ec71f7e9e1f4e0cc5f23a23662","227f470ca679005630a2cffb57c433b49c67f72dfdbe1dc923905b93100fdf1e","dd17bb8de0e56a3420dfbd26a24fc79ca5f20db31e95b95035393437b6ff48c8","9cb59df434f2d10eb61369bd3af5be63c3808ebdc8fed9a2d9e95aff898615ae","e56a8850a3474dfed0b4f70a9a206b7a5be82974b2111b9a534f030aeeceb87d","6ac60b36cb22b2aae3a1540c9384704cb55499396ab1e823c803fe4a061c1a89"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5856,5879