and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as other and set failureType-v1610 as beamFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":5891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1> include and set MeasResultSCG-Failure in accordance with 5.7.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":5892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each MeasObjectNR configured by a MeasConfig associated with the MCG, and for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":5893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include an entry in measResultFreqList;","paragraph_zero_based":5894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is a measId configured with the MeasObjectNR and a reportConfig which has rsType set to ssb:","paragraph_zero_based":5895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set ssbFrequency in measResultFreqList to the value indicated by ssbFrequency as included in the MeasObjectNR;","paragraph_zero_based":5896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is a measId configured with the MeasObjectNR and a reportConfig which has rsType set to csi-rs:","paragraph_zero_based":5897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set refFreqCSI-RS in measResultFreqList to the value indicated by refFreqCSI-RS as included in the associated measurement object;","paragraph_zero_based":5898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a serving cell is associated with the MeasObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":5899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set measResultServingCell in measResultFreqList to include the available quantities of the concerned cell and in accordance with the performance requirements in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":5900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultNeighCellList in measResultFreqList to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first, and based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and set its fields as follows;","paragraph_zero_based":5901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>ordering the cells with sorting as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>based on SS/PBCH block if SS/PBCH block measurement results are available and otherwise based on CSI-RS;","paragraph_zero_based":5903}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["664b1a76fc15878d51efe416a4977982c82ffc84d36e91dc269148593682ded0","423ff54e37116863408a5561066ecafcd2ec7ccfb4819aa256979f80d7512236","c2a029de550570b2527bc2e3c45e70d6048c3bad57701e6bfac9bcb77fed5ceb","5f06ecaffefd91e21c315ec2a58a5efe9500a621c67cf3c8927e4d2963a1f88d","95889c160039a29747ef70d8605e4c3857c622a06f7297e9825cab468ef812b7","fcc3b4ba21d2e4fd93b2598345a1eb8120cbfed4d28f7d937b06c1d1b495fba1","a657a4bd46b4ec53f80e98873b61a94c930033fa9f9d51536c05408129d84f11","5bd00b2154b48d80a68e57040ddc5ca1954500418bae9a5b9ce9bf57cc4184c6","a7dafe214a32c029ea9acc132c7588fed0c8234482a35847d92c8762da2506d9","55f74a8f203979a4e87c80a1339bcd19aa52fa45162085b2a379c46d3d519007","a8388c3795cf61c4f4de4469a37fb3b2f74abd5141b12e01088320d0ef0d5549","7c34eaa0df55727fba61d7879171696c5effbaa47aa1ce9e102ad9c3c4f5213a","56cf1258147cee565bf596f6e233238c0875ba25abbc6249724cc977c04fa808","9ed9ff9a27f981bec7bd8fa088c541ae391c7ec1e1ca07b89d7f4aab3b21a13b","440f78e21e8ff80b4033782cb9c9a2c0cb7ae1d60b7072b299e13e2e51d00c0f","da25944e9f31038797acc04db6f3a388faf0bbf6132bdd48b014ea3015e14ec2","ca9a724030f06a4a9507a9675cae722f32ff2186aee67e65be9fe52815f3455a","e213174aa2bcf45fe30eb5a2e6a0112a4dd29ff5d849b0fcf5898f28aba07b06","d14a571489b7613d48ec91bddf4d9e4b0b47ccd79cfef8784f7eac68e255bc5c","9cb67dd9f8f8b53024306755da3e83f9aa07ec9457f74022ce32db6ab84d0c41","9d696fa87c4e8316ff104ccab923bcfd5ccc777756f70686f4614381910a2231","42fd2689c3183ce1b4badb767b46e568b6e0671df36be9ad2d379f41acf734ce","3c37f6160189f39c3bb6653618e0f32cec6dbe00a6c413ac0bb611182e14e914","3128d17bb76ff0601533c3d94ca3a60b24a9706cd383727bbdef010859e7c153"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5880,5903],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p5880"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>using RSRP if RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise using RSRQ if RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise using SINR;","paragraph_zero_based":5904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each neighbour cell included:","paragraph_zero_based":5905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the optional fields that are available.","paragraph_zero_based":5906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The measured quantities are filtered by the L3 filter as configured in the mobility measurement configuration. The measurements are based on the time domain measurement resource restriction, if configured. Exclude-listed cells are not required to be reported.","paragraph_zero_based":5907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Field measResultSCG-Failure is used to report available results for NR frequencies the UE is configured to measure by SCG RRC signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":5908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7 according to the otherConfig associated with the NR MCG.","paragraph_zero_based":5909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE supports SCG failure for mobility robustness optimization:","paragraph_zero_based":5910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the failureType is set to synchReconfigFailureSCG; or","paragraph_zero_based":5911},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the failureType is set to randomAccessProblem and the SCG failure was declared while T304 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":5912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set perRAInfoList to indicate the performed random access procedure related information as specified in 5.7.10.5.","paragraph_zero_based":5913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failedPSCellId to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the target PSCell of the failed PSCell change;","paragraph_zero_based":5914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the previousPSCellId to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the source PSCell associated to the last received RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":5915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the timeSCGFailure to the elapsed time since the last execution of RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG until declaring the SCG failure;","paragraph_zero_based":5916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failedPSCellId to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the PSCell in which the SCG failure was declared;","paragraph_zero_based":5918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG was received to enter the PSCell in which the SCG failure was declared:","paragraph_zero_based":5919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the timeSCGFailure to the elapsed time since the last execution of RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG until declaring the SCG failure;","paragraph_zero_based":5920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the previousPSCellId to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the source PSCell associated to the last received RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync for the SCG;","paragraph_zero_based":5921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the SCGFailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":5922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3aEUTRA SCG failure information","paragraph_zero_based":5923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3a.1General","paragraph_zero_based":5924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.3a.1-1: EUTRA SCG failure information","paragraph_zero_based":5926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to inform NR MN about an SCG failure on E-UTRA SN the UE has experienced (e.g. SCG radio link failure, SCG change failure), as specified in TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":5927}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["68594a2c64b4dd83f0a33e55b9253dbaacb40cd419b8c72450ba71b0b0d22676","1e7a01849535daa50ad2bdef6bcd5007d2adfcec20e3983eaa40784be42baa77","e4bd5aeb348cdfc42423f8804360bd5167036848574a7608a3142d885f18ed8e","30e997c6b3031d5b18d758fe99cf6918009695b72cc24de9061c7bf6d7950cee","993e7848589079325686cabeb5bac3ed0c026e8fe7954dcea0fa5e95f8e31ed2","870d14bf83484a7cac72b3dfa06f342e3629339478c20d348583eab62ca55c2e","35ff1263e4ede10ec5a848ca591758134e6f4f303189ec5c228b32756cbd3ad1","f735dd9cc25c2d7d679c135dd09b3a2911a913c8abae1aa4e59df5aab918ad56","28ad55341c78053ebf3e58e2ff34b010462bfd741365259c067df7fac4a4e9ee","82d4d1e4b0567c14d097b3ee5e2726672d020dc239b0d61ea5e24f3cf9b64939","2a684b89930db53e8a6123f85654f6a581d37be135a66b251665820c90050a36","c605e74ad45fa18234f4e5489964ea5a561226005825a190a0d0bb91f4089e9d","d04e9cca49226d211460248046d2968f1884f82461dd0e77e0ea79677ab196a6","e3ed38608500b292a8a4e34bcedca96d1ad00c8addde6778be21422b4cb95184","ebe7e0c4a216bead4216c726f56fe70ab3fd19beec788816d1ac8dd4681adfc7","a52681a231467c9735cd37662ad8c448f83d60bbf207ca5552a95ff3d924b746","011867ff3edaa7832c0853e8ff0c81bb60ec4d67e174e74a69c884f8a8fd47b9","e902f11ebb2300d555ab896ddd3d927765f4b2130b61e7e602cfd73ceaf4bf43","e1a8ca132f403c9ebf9df65038dbbff7356bc5c2f0c2b0b03d60f0117c60936f","68896d62fe46b0eb50d2b9c0e1def581561ebb3eda2db15901301ae50fce4caa","245c644bc72f42aaacd979f0808e66f0b798fba47287b6be4f3186100e84dadd","8064d67fac752e829eae58b3af51d5d14305cd20bc2c1638b83fe8b5011c5144","4a64fa063ae2fb060794626647a570d7459d5e1797067cadffff2895a9918750","e670b60f02e94a24e77df93eb1550dac71eba12ea92f290caa5478873c7bb29a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5904,5927],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p5904"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3a.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":5928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE initiates the procedure to report EUTRA SCG failures when neither NR MCG nor EUTRA SCG transmission is suspended and in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.2. Actions the UE shall perform upon initiating the procedure, other than related to the transmission of the SCGFailureInformationEUTRA message are specified in TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.2.","paragraph_zero_based":5929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3a.3Actions related to transmission of SCGFailureInformationEUTRA message","paragraph_zero_based":5930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the SCGFailureInformationEUTRA message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include failureType within failureReportSCG-EUTRA and set it to indicate the SCG failure in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.4;","paragraph_zero_based":5932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include and set measResultSCG-FailureMRDC in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each EUTRA frequency the UE is configured to measure by measConfig for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":5934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultFreqListMRDC to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first using RSRP to order if RSRP measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using RSRQ to order if RSRQ measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using SINR to order, and based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and for each cell that is included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":5935},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:Field measResultSCG-FailureMRDC is used to report available results for E-UTRAN frequencies the UE is configured to measure by E-UTRA RRC signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":5936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7.:","paragraph_zero_based":5937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the SCGFailureInformationEUTRA message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":5938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3bMCG failure information","paragraph_zero_based":5939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.1General","paragraph_zero_based":5940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.3b.1-1: MCG failure information","paragraph_zero_based":5942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to inform the network about an MCG failure the UE has experienced i.e. MCG radio link failure. A UE in RRC_CONNECTED, for which AS security has been activated with SRB2 and at least one DRB or multicast MRB setup or, for IAB, SRB2, may initiate the fast MCG link recovery procedure in order to continue the RRC connection without re-establishment.","paragraph_zero_based":5943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":5944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE configured with split SRB1 or SRB3 initiates the procedure to report MCG failures when neither MCG nor SCG transmission is suspended, the SCG is not deactivated, t316 is configured, and when the following condition is met:","paragraph_zero_based":5945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>upon detecting radio link failure of the MCG, in accordance with 5.3.10.3, while T316 is not running.","paragraph_zero_based":5946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":5947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T310 for the PCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":5948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop timer T312 for the PCell, if running;","paragraph_zero_based":5949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>suspend MCG transmission for all SRBs, DRBs, multicast MRBs, except SRB0, and, if any, BH RLC channels;","paragraph_zero_based":5950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>reset MCG MAC;","paragraph_zero_based":5951}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["4e7884798d53917465cdbad1ea8ce0378772e0c5e967d9028404e4db6bfda540","7bae63cef2d6f604153dc4e7e34239e36d09e27ed1da04d49d7e90c7055dd173","f7b60a7e0872b36ab23305002ef1c3f2d5e80705f593cd7819ace0b302e4d8d9","6339030a14709c18f06687fbcfcd81ca1e628c7ac7756a6d54c2227606b71669","9cc8fa669dcd68dab7d72f5f875fbe309969a1535326f7ffdc6b9f138608d82e","a435bd8c2240eda1c04d8878768dfee036dd9312518f730254b33d6f5aa67590","df9a3a71128f21b69ad9d22445af2c737eb0a030fa694f20f1d28aef04cfac9c","f7d72e00a40d52ebf1166ae0edcd6ca548f0f2722d6bcefe92babe35e440b910","f701ae24351a4d2add5344ac1276bae31a1ab4957078a9a0901743c1b30d1eab","2b2a1a4479149f5687cd4d9015a8f3cc641b7c8c74bb4b805c5f0b55027e139f","827f1769c3a6d2551dc81258344e861e92ef460fdbaa74a91ceb4e7d2526af9b","358448d2f1bc596c21593b03a29f4bc416e90f3c5558958f3f21aea907f5d715","1f54dc2049c6fd7f886652a119569115a6a2fbbf14348c642a9c57199aef41eb","b3e9637722cfb46eec4c1233aad63269c6a06a9a83686901c704e4cfcd54c75b","b5b5ae8690d5f4635ac0f8aae000494e8784300b3058e2e4f36a9b4ecfabe1d2","fa30619f6ab9967b0a2322d1033e06366869d6b32e4dfee8ae0c80fe57f636e7","b168561e216697202894d3c8022367513136430a258bff20f61d5ea035b9d30b","1a345a9b1dbcb5a2b7bf7da28f8495f5e893adf236a9d6500de5e9586502e553","79b9a546bb3e5582c799132f149abfcfa7448e85cc0805e9061225a3beedf2c4","688fd4fda7ed44ffa9e7830e6683710f3271366b2fcca3e5cd7ef165a5efd7f6","e35918c67b4d40ec27795ca27bc86791c2dc6f8971f8144dc3ab90ac1c471592","ae9eef66806b64d94cf1f578a038683f0f62a1346ced86c147ffb106a4184faa","47bd1ad1cd983298520e4725663aea4f67fcdd728b65a743717d00739f630a0c","843c2695308dbd221f46504e7ddb7e2274af3043c355c76241d73438900235e5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5928,5951],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p5928"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop conditional reconfiguration evaluation for CHO, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":5952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>stop conditional reconfiguration evaluation for CPC, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":5953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message in accordance with 5.7.3b.4.","paragraph_zero_based":5954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE:The handling of any outstanding UL RRC messages during the initiation of the fast MCG link recovery is left to UE implementation.","paragraph_zero_based":5955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.3Failure type determination","paragraph_zero_based":5956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the MCG failure type as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message due to T310 expiry:","paragraph_zero_based":5958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as t310-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":5959},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message due to T312 expiry:","paragraph_zero_based":5960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as t312-Expiry;","paragraph_zero_based":5961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message to provide random access problem indication from MCG MAC:","paragraph_zero_based":5962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the random access procedure was initiated for beam failure recovery:","paragraph_zero_based":5963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failureType as beamFailureRecoveryFailure;","paragraph_zero_based":5964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":5965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the failureType as randomAccessProblem;","paragraph_zero_based":5966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message to provide indication from MCG RLC that the maximum number of retransmissions has been reached:","paragraph_zero_based":5967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as rlc-MaxNumRetx:","paragraph_zero_based":5968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if the UE initiates transmission of the MCGFailureInformation message due to consistent uplink LBT failures on the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":5969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as lbt-Failure;","paragraph_zero_based":5970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if connected as an IAB-node and the MCGFailureInformation message is initiated due to the reception of a BH RLF indication on BAP entity from the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":5971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the failureType as bh-RLF.","paragraph_zero_based":5972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.4Actions related to transmission of MCGFailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":5973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the MCGFailureInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>include and set failureType in accordance with 5.7.3b.3;","paragraph_zero_based":5975}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["0279bfd5cb7e8af1d28caffee71785fb7372d48002d361406ae89cea097e893f","a278cf0d933d507d4e8fe34d27903a6226ddc7404f499b015b35799f711512d0","5b62ddc43329a8f56454ce289c44bd0be7a723ccd900b243b934406ac22fb1cc","e4752f69c7e690df1f149aec39aac9712ff1f4337a11240235777e6da7dabd87","d29844e51f0d8fd3d23c1cc95a1460e6be44ee6992d3a673c527434283b192f4","7cea4b911ab9ab53567b7c2fed01da0c4eb4df7e6295cfd5d5db6f429e805700","d7a6ba0180faa7afc230d190a74b2e19b20e95623e1d001fb3592bb1ae511d20","5e1922ab23eb0d75c14169a4d02185e6a40ffda41717a0729177f1d23fb5292e","c60556236aca8cc2d92f25d0c639fe7d5dfec62f7b1bd8fd9f883a5b093b4eef","55fabc2ea8b867b5a9f38bfefca2737c40e319ba23b5b0e787f34b84b3fe8b44","a39192aa4f625f7d9b3a63ffda7de9de3113f6be208b40081f68d64b8379b0e3","d38b00cfff7d500472d489602b880d3fc78a4dbe691369d6b0ce73f1a89786bd","239650cd4287ead16b7d732690c37d7a442758ca1864cc46b61b31ad9ba6451b","6a07186b32e8ece9ac0386098b8a67a993aebaf5c0ce8f1c3a1b952366a0ae91","6c99a70e8981ca488bca0e5369672a461a71b7dd88fa8a79db0f5c95627d0085","2149bcc3a65e442653f97537e99fa2081c68168e6c2bd30cd8340cb4eee48dd3","369e6ac8b9b2c308d66398ace57896fcf1c8be14804ea5fb7fcfc1821646f01f","07c604c10fc693b947cf2a4e6ac260c658c74e0649deab761035b17e972a7987","2dfa20ef69618342cdf239a9123bcaa21439729903ab52bdd99628affcdbdd92","5a403ab1beea943cf19cf39f857ca296140848e51fc7b7a38799b42a3f869285","d632dd5ae94d5254b1229daf2fce632c73ebe3f4df444195f9488868077930fd","4210c32fffc5514ef6e45d6470fe48cc2bf44849c2fe6e0f50ce0495e0dc6413","fe2105420f4ed9136f08cc3494e0c2e9f1e74ede846ef7fcdbcea219c0ef3522","cfe89e49a404d4247560ebf0604941dc5aaf01b54951f8f671ab4aa3ce623cbe"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5952,5975],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p5952"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each MeasObjectNR configured by a measConfig associated with the MCG, and for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":5976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include an entry in measResultFreqList;","paragraph_zero_based":5977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is a measId configured with the MeasObjectNR and a reportConfig which has rsType set to ssb:","paragraph_zero_based":5978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set ssbFrequency in measResultFreqList to the value indicated by ssbFrequency as included in the MeasObjectNR;","paragraph_zero_based":5979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if there is a measId configured with the MeasObjectNR and a reportConfig which has rsType set to csi-rs:","paragraph_zero_based":5980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set refFreqCSI-RS in measResultFreqList to the value indicated by refFreqCSI-RS as included in the associated measurement object;","paragraph_zero_based":5981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if a serving cell is associated with the MeasObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":5982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set measResultServingCell in measResultFreqList to include the available quantities of the concerned cell and in accordance with the performance requirements in TS 38.133 [14];","paragraph_zero_based":5983},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultNeighCellList in measResultFreqList to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first, and based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and set its fields as follows;","paragraph_zero_based":5984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>ordering the cells with sorting as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":5985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>based on SS/PBCH block if SS/PBCH block measurement results are available and otherwise based on CSI-RS;","paragraph_zero_based":5986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>using RSRP if RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise using RSRQ if RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise using SINR;","paragraph_zero_based":5987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each neighbour cell included:","paragraph_zero_based":5988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include the optional fields that are available.","paragraph_zero_based":5989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each EUTRA frequency the UE is configured to measure by measConfig for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":5990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultFreqListEUTRA to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first using RSRP to order the cells if RSRP measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using RSRQ to order the cells if RSRQ measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using SINR to order the cells, based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and for each cell that is included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":5991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each UTRA-FDD frequency the UE is configured to measure by measConfig for which measurement results are available:","paragraph_zero_based":5992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measResultFreqListUTRA-FDD to include the best measured cells, ordered such that the best cell is listed first using RSCP to order the cells if RSCP measurement results are available for cells on this frequency, otherwise using EcN0 to order the cells, based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE detected the failure, and for each cell that is included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":5993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":5994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in NR-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":5995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include and set measResultSCG in accordance with 5.7.3.4;","paragraph_zero_based":5996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE is in NE-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":5997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include and set measResultSCG-EUTRA in accordance with TS 36.331 [10] clause 5.6.13.5;","paragraph_zero_based":5998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The measured quantities are filtered by the L3 filter as configured in the mobility measurement configuration. The measurements are based on the time domain measurement resource restriction, if configured. Exclude-listed cells are not required to be reported.","paragraph_zero_based":5999}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["66d74da8ba3cf349e0dcc19f99df5c85f1590cd08c3cabddc59b27bbbfcc056b","9324d1e08f12786d68f7693bd9842bffc9e17c6c1ca765547843bd3125aefb5b","f8103434720ae5ff12e07b4243d58f7447c7f421d1343453de9842b2d76fc482","6bc38e729e99d2490df6d44ccd765316c3dc742f1961763f28be9b39dcc8430d","2ef34164480c714fa74afb071999ab1a45c74710adf5b3853d85d6b9c908b93a","09ede0724428d4b8d8ebfeec5321d53a28499958e4707d680ad5d47282e6d1c9","24d6b124243834366ead5a7cd606080e48291a588f0cae16abd26b6109b81801","2cedbbcff50ea38d8568e144ef988f60468c8499288bc19a55bf7041fc6f0426","28c4c1618c8f576a8db5691485fd934ead273740fef675c2fca4ff281b3c2fa5","9e6269487c0fc4041c5427516b2b580eb58103bb5b3da80755d322fcc1170a31","e25b214a356b1fb56f5559c4de2d543180666afd06a42773a9453db3ccf4d95e","d8b26bcf0d76cbf7931d84e2fea3d620a442b59773600ef50020c0cf420f7aa3","1accf7410b1114d0876d824e58b287c123484460502211889500d380769699c0","38d1f6f6aa994a3f9f91edb9f3a42bc10814f8b87f38876770568c3adf3dfbfa","59a957a214c509a7a1d51d8e91863d23724ea6209e5143c2682851fab3032486","826cc6efab460b270ac97ffa573793e51de006b315becff7596e7afd121e8791","3d84861e2e8af78a2b067589d1eecb6891bb4197282efa504168ed8494b25d0d","2a4c4f4773012b67fd79104015e25313d8582940af64ce8c5d0526c89ad54cc3","c0496970cf1d9e7ddd8ea37fa8a7884cbbf1b364c25156e1bc01cdf4b6a46912","cb479e69c3343478b925dc57bdbb56d1d0055e4ffdbb9a5e50d31e85034b2dc9","12297c4489b2693d876a23a4cfa1ca7495e7ea3b39adda82e85f6e7e0c8184d6","283f5e455e2862bc826a66cdb8c4aceaaaad22670f87ebc5f2e05d6060fbffbd","c71c743825e339d30d331a0dd8ba5cc23952be3e39261ac54c50fe878d9d9830","0181243d8db3cfb5eaba73093dd7bc62254bde7a858ad6a05dc7e61ed0bad220"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[5976,5999],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p5976"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:Field measResultSCG-Failure is used to report available results for NR frequencies the UE is configured to measure by SCG RRC signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":6000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:Field measResultSCG-EUTRA is used to report available results for E-UTRAN frequencies the UE is configured to measure by E-UTRA RRC signalling.","paragraph_zero_based":6001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SRB1 is configured as split SRB and pdcp-Duplication is not configured:","paragraph_zero_based":6002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the primaryPath for the PDCP entity of SRB1 refers to the MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":6003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the primaryPath to refer to the SCG.","paragraph_zero_based":6004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>start timer T316;","paragraph_zero_based":6006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SRB1 is configured as split SRB:","paragraph_zero_based":6007},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the MCGFailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission via SRB1, upon which the procedure ends;","paragraph_zero_based":6008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else (i.e. SRB3 configured):","paragraph_zero_based":6009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the MCGFailureInformation message to lower layers for transmission embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC via SRB3 as specified in 5.7.2a.3.","paragraph_zero_based":6010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.3b.5T316 expiry","paragraph_zero_based":6011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if T316 expires:","paragraph_zero_based":6013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate the connection re-establishment procedure as specified in 5.3.7.","paragraph_zero_based":6014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4UE Assistance Information","paragraph_zero_based":6015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.1General","paragraph_zero_based":6016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.4.1-1: UE Assistance Information","paragraph_zero_based":6018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is for the UE to inform the network of:","paragraph_zero_based":6019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its delay budget report carrying desired increment/decrement in the connected mode DRX cycle length, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its overheating assistance information, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its IDC assistance information, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on DRX parameters for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6023}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5de93792a69335199ec353789c46e98e916379541abb783971707b6cffc8612c","4a2a03d9e4b0b7ad5147c3829f15f310f02f57c81961dbc57c8c61c8bad16cdd","234ae3fcff581aeb3c29f8a6c73f73d3d8b7d6bb0da3832ad4d302622f431d96","29ed9d962f5de91acece7f2a21d462acbde7d560b51dce1a597ff0ded4a846c0","8fcefa82d2c4df3c52d5baf8de7e4d93d68ccb683b1f78f2f712a207c0657326","f4320924924c6918b4c85d21d91906848c7b9c63cfc663f7b8b0f61948da9226","359fb8227f059fd696488b9981142cef5808b91c7136d21262035b28f1c02143","15c1ed1bc0e9c0e9f9ee2d2ab76b898be3a39f0f6a007f684db3aa9263fa92ed","0588f5b46eec4ef4b43c602f0236d18c72db0543c56de6543a7b76db20aa6261","185f10f9e9d49f3d74071cf1425ea8592b5331c8c827abd042bb1741c319dd59","c63c07cc4df4b073d2c658c456e40b807cf8f8ca2a40f865d9e3bc9fb8f5dcdb","633eff2857a331905d83eab04e8bfa054ba5e89afd77f77cd1442e53bebdd0b3","664a292e6ca791fdf58557d636c5805ff015546bffeef49a6481937066889d92","ef21b7052444a38b7c1d4718febaa0147382e1a27f64e3f759521bc55bdbd2ee","071cf3b9cfcd5f6e79c7903d05eef7c71a039b3718884381d54ae6c631e14696","594796ade2705ddc271ce91ef8f23338a6d13608b00201d92aa39efc2a83cb15","e7ecf88ac69b9f2635ccffd66dc87c73f01402ee20c58de495d594bd6685aa42","dd2faed7af35fab9527c8c360156ba55ef2bbdabcae8f3e4b643dffc4e8f0306","102788d721769b2eb34186830fb840279e8022162302ca9be97c6891693c6f91","cf55fe3cf58560ceee1cbbfea4dbb48aaa77b511820f06c1b7f0e4eba16dd229","312a5e97c5335d8ecd26efc860712010c2142ac15f771fc01343417229a0d54a","b60bc830f74943b42346d1b1cbe9aa555ecefe7394f239309c3d097bacaf8b6b","45f018866456e97bc0608ca1c6ec9574167bc41601bcf939608ea5b9d952366f","933d46bba3c6289a15ba6c605fb47caba72f621b27e96342b2b7d6eee233ceae"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6000,6023],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6000"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for power saving, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the RRC state, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference in being provisioned with reference time information, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference for FR2 UL gap, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6031},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state for MUSIM operation, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference on the MUSIM gaps, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its relaxation state for RLM measurements, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its relaxation state for BFD measurements, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-availability of data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers which are not configured for SDT, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-its preference for the SCG to be deactivated, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-availability of uplink data to transmit for a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer while the SCG is deactivated, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-change of its fulfilment status for RRM measurement relaxation criterion, or;","paragraph_zero_based":6039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-service link (specified in TS 38.300 [2]) propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s).","paragraph_zero_based":6040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":6041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing delay budget report in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, including upon being configured to provide delay budget report and upon change of delay budget preference.","paragraph_zero_based":6042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing overheating assistance information in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting internal overheating, or upon detecting that it is no longer experiencing an overheating condition.","paragraph_zero_based":6043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing IDC assistance information in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting IDC problem if the UE did not transmit an IDC assistance information since it was configured to provide IDC indications, or upon change of IDC problem information.","paragraph_zero_based":6044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on DRX parameters of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a preference on DRX parameters and upon change of its preference on DRX parameters.","paragraph_zero_based":6045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum aggregated bandwidth preference and upon change of its maximum aggregated bandwidth preference.","paragraph_zero_based":6046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum number of secondary component carriers preference and upon change of its maximum number of secondary component carriers preference.","paragraph_zero_based":6047}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e8f509208550b9a8da8f602c054ee2103493302ea602d95dd0a54b296b3ef1ae","886e1e48e8b091d7ed986dcfd84714c10a16f6d9085493ec992c0787177063fc","b641bf99aaaad3c5faaa1585bb018bdf1fc8718d39f5ed1dbd3478f2fe9c9055","9fc86bb7726ea92e4a8959950f78a5dfc39f724d50aa959d8edcc7a692ef0854","1832cb512df69ad57ea24e15811501386b6403b3fc1de491e020c9c81cbe3c83","3923343c3a35f5734f48a01251020dfdd0bf83ea1ec056c9d1ce97f2ad0840f1","40c3ea1fcd2a896f9e292e6280ea411f4dde784dc247c2014fddca49e0ca0401","d89883a0bfac8bf7fbc55c434a7f114c56a8c5295f803f790ff5369522c24b0d","9081d1c29d70cdd8e11b4cb4804d6c4f55b8149d9c2490355ee6871d57f5c5eb","07d0149e1e6481a3e3ac34f62c5ce5cd5e1fe16e86bf0f9172c6298f5acbb291","70e4f020de35d754bfd8abccb4e17e65a490b1a20d281f0a98f92de1fddb3e4e","b8e9f5f16d67d7db05d18a5183eeae1cfda71e59900213bea42a01c51badb38b","9e32c3d4444c29fb1bd985f5f21087716f325e7f782ce9311e11932e08af3757","943ae74158053a473163478a43b925cc4c6fbca396723295f316d46ee1191c8a","7aa34deb075079a9a65508b5b1f3611df820f680c1afedb8bbc7ecfaa8e83c70","8d6ea65fdcc03e7cb266d7b648942a60ee57b22c9de6562ad18ee72e256ad520","ab933a388b3df5297ec444a9bcbfb988bc28646e6a9512318296462644448103","e7c9c09e697063ff1c3af559abd12aec68e6c0ffe55a1385337b9390715b0a20","0cbb7e25563222a8548cc107bdd2197d7f4b3543350310a3a76682956a8d1cb6","b4d6e3f44d2662156527bc1ce347ca0d0fcac176b09927ba72410790d122c8d3","623541f9b875b436c4b83f134627e82e31e2566658c3bab74167e2c98f874c9c","8306a9eab6573bddbd11f2d58ee8cd655db7a34942e76e912259cf0dc7cb3336","40ecd3b8bff1ce4a12a41759aa581acc2a9c64d62e7a9366e689d5bbbae94140","d8d9f0f63db13c6ff4f8a54eed10b58ced70cbd45f75a05d6bcc8461717ddeac"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6024,6047],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6024"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a maximum number of MIMO layers preference and upon change of its maximum number of MIMO layers preference.","paragraph_zero_based":6048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of a cell group for power saving in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, if it was configured to do so, including upon having a minimum scheduling offset preference and upon change of its minimum scheduling offset preference.","paragraph_zero_based":6049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing assistance information to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining that it prefers to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state, or upon change of its preferred RRC state.","paragraph_zero_based":6050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure in several cases, including upon being configured to provide traffic pattern information and upon change of traffic patterns.","paragraph_zero_based":6051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of its preference in being provisioned with reference time information may initiate the procedure upon being configured to provide this indication, or if it was configured to provide this indication and upon change of its preference.","paragraph_zero_based":6052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of its preference in FR2 UL gap may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon detecting the need of FR2 UL gap activation/deactivation.","paragraph_zero_based":6053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing MUSIM assistance information for gap preference may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining it needs the gaps, or upon change of the gap preference information.","paragraph_zero_based":6054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing MUSIM assistance information for leave indication may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so upon determining that it needs to leave RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":6055},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of relaxing its RLM measurements of a cell group in RRC_CONNECTED state shall initiate the procedure for providing an indication of its relaxation state for RLM measurements upon being configured to do so, and upon change of its relaxation state for RLM measurements in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":6056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of relaxing its BFD measurements in serving cells of a cell group in RRC_CONNECTED shall initiate the procedure for providing an indication of its relaxation state for BFD measurements upon being configured to do so, and upon change of its relaxation state for BFD measurements in RRC_CONNECTED state.","paragraph_zero_based":6057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of SDT initiates this procedure when data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers that are not configured for SDT becomes available during SDT (i.e. while SDT procedure is ongoing).","paragraph_zero_based":6058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing its preference for SCG deactivation may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon determining that it prefers or does no more prefer the SCG to be deactivated.","paragraph_zero_based":6059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE that has uplink data to transmit for a DRB for which there is no MCG RLC bearer while the SCG is deactivated shall initiate the procedure.","paragraph_zero_based":6060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing an indication of fulfilment of the RRM measurement relaxation criterion in connected mode may initiate the procedure if it was configured to do so, upon change of its fulfilment status for RRM measurement relaxation criterion for connected mode.","paragraph_zero_based":6061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s) shall initiate the procedure upon being configured to do so, and upon determining that service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and a neighbour cell has changed more than threshPropDelayDiff compared with the last reported value.","paragraph_zero_based":6062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide delay budget report:","paragraph_zero_based":6064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with delayBudgetReport since it was configured to provide delay budget report; or","paragraph_zero_based":6065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current delay budget is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including delayBudgetReport and timer T342 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart timer T342 with the timer value set to the delayBudgetReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":6067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide a delay budget report;","paragraph_zero_based":6068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide overheating assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":6069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the overheating condition has been detected and T345 is not running; or","paragraph_zero_based":6070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current overheating assistance information is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including overheatingAssistance and timer T345 is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6071}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["60fce623a7a6241d34c3102dc793f6de4283667cb69ae1ca62e3d068a2dda0a2","1f7c9cd37d8533314bc0da447351410aa29d34c9b17ce6c904d6140b351aea2f","e913c6f35e5d086f81ac014258e6f48625751e8821237fe4b26609f72af32145","fbe7468c39a6ccf0ca6d9d760d855f871b1c67eed4105ee70b3db8524b429384","63dd53c3a1504a8ee2386f674665e21a9ea1f260b7149bf4cb182ceae3a5beed","68fb5f213bc8457887049dfee921ce46d7f8484dc8c962da2064813c0ec9d07b","f85bc1a1ae4d62161232a04acfc8aff62d998d1d42596f13a3868dd472e39ef3","1bce7eede253e968bb11ba7d321cff18d302e8db248d31caa77470ca900bfb8d","28f2446a200f8ff866c7ef8341bee5b9ce5cbc15be382c38f1995c7aa64ca73e","cb25051efd70182ebcacabc99d71709c5d31501adf2354afe3943f0ddbee2ec3","59c14f1a7269836cccef503bd2d1d9b29808b14d701ba4b15f8374cd899288de","e18284d82de05559c60eb1b6ca029701d8d4a471f82cda81c56666c9267d565e","355f2d94ad6c88ef50541131fd1f4e2e7c504d3b37f97b8e3875aa75168cb0ba","960bdf128a76b2d51d3ef9e08e450f0ed563562d45cfdb00b389abc2a163a94c","61161c2b68847759caf85efaf6156e3937609d27b5bc3685f56101c7ce888948","2150963d696810a5d355dc6e25f22ef54ed8fce75524d44e06a82f2c4269b0bc","179d4799aa5603a3cd2bc95b37e81b31d9411142a3baf0f6490d22f49b7d7466","aeccf17ed4797e318e68a4ca873e774e34a2d88363bf59e3048ad1a4523a0924","c5b38fa6242364f9b4a965e9e48fe9f3b4fbba7f493f7844662d5bb6d130589a","5200801f0a634efeb2b55d950e6d9256b114b9888b4212182a854cf64d5cc64f","f4db631da1ca143238eb8a6437d31de6ec2b8ccb013ef1bbd88b57b7d6623267","f7f1fdeb3e2d4d2061b8a8f754fb11c50c153b9b7b7852ee0db46f74591aa012","ff49030ae2f304e470b286544b7b13ac5dfb5d0670b4fa140def109be3bc74b1","bd90c6b98a349ef19f17c4daa37df8abe6e8f5d9bfb2274830653b9abfd680b6"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6048,6071],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6048"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T345 with the timer value set to the overheatingIndicationProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":6072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide overheating assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":6073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide IDC assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":6074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with idc-Assistance since it was configured to provide IDC assistance information:","paragraph_zero_based":6075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more frequencies included in candidateServingFreqListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself; or","paragraph_zero_based":6076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if on one or more supported UL CA combination comprising of carrier frequencies included in candidateServingFreqListNR, the UE is experiencing IDC problems that it cannot solve by itself:","paragraph_zero_based":6077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":6078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the current IDC assistance information is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":6079},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide IDC assistance information;","paragraph_zero_based":6080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The term \"IDC problems\" refers to interference issues applicable across several subframes/slots where not necessarily all the subframes/slots are affected.","paragraph_zero_based":6081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For the frequencies on which a serving cell or serving cells is configured that is activated, IDC problems consist of interference issues that the UE cannot solve by itself, during either active data exchange or upcoming data activity which is expected in up to a few hundred milliseconds.For frequencies on which a SCell or SCells is configured that is deactivated, reporting IDC problems indicates an anticipation that the activation of the SCell or SCells would result in interference issues that the UE would not be able to solve by itself.For a non-serving frequency, reporting IDC problems indicates an anticipation that if the non-serving frequency or frequencies became a serving frequency or serving frequencies then this would result in interference issues that the UE would not be able to solve by itself.","paragraph_zero_based":6082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":6083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on DRX parameters of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with drx-Preference for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on DRX parameters of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":6084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current drx-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including drx-Preference for the cell group and timer T346a associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346a with the timer value set to the drx-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current drx-Preference;","paragraph_zero_based":6087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":6088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum aggregated bandwidth of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":6089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxBW-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2for the cell group and timer T346b associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346b with the timer value set to the maxBW-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxBW-Preference and/or maxBW-PreferenceFR2-2;","paragraph_zero_based":6092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":6093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxCC-Preference for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of secondary component carriers of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":6094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxCC-Preference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxCC-Preference for the cell group and timer T346c associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6095}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["3962fc8140f74f7740e01e7136be48985147ed3bc0e1f6f30d72b36f940e9813","cc412c493ae616bc5ca0d47662e15f05b272a75be1c4338b96876043ac6906b7","048bda5cfdbeafee22e6791d89bbcea3849daec8e2dd5f5db3c3d8e4bb1fdeb4","aab2daaea077962cd45016e6229594edd0dee8e88378a3080390a15aff2b86a1","aec1f428a475ad1ae33f1837d9a12064e91dde557db811ddc75c174cf514f074","894e0c44237608843d5e9ff797627187790cc84d5ea5e9b93e65f2f58ac6fa0e","56f2880bd18ead8925b95c87fb8711c481957726b7544ba96082d71fa21d2813","c165cd5bf5d9ed56309021aeb31412e2e7210b0f56b32983b007b86c89b108de","734d2e32a9734b10c35d592f7c21f59e9bd415f497d5d90a86b4210c7761a9ac","1cfbc0241f1051edfc073ca401bea769f2a1833afa0e2b43158d04c24b510af4","293a2a815064922cda4fdefcb1059fdeaf2caf0f2d9d2c95b0718e80d44bdf1f","b737797987741a549ef02b14442a3284fd50e6301234009d7f34cb0a03778b11","12db5ecd8e721ff5ffa3ff3d3786be1206b918a2b60902d1353dcca974e2352d","3394d0feda85e5cd1978a3d9287cf7bbf62f3b6b980ecc1a4452c19350285fe6","c624ff9daa7f8c183fac9967c1f4583e81b10cdbb7a1ed212af3751ed5eacb1f","5cfdd2918122de58028e62e9323ac75c780ca20aa9801f4ef460695e2532472e","83cf2ef7f61bdcd347f1f6daa11f85f7d463a858cca334d4e5591d9611383941","953760b49a4749b14ba4f238ef9de49da134921b3de9b1059545662f3dfd1826","2398d1b360f88e9f60037f21951a2748739fe6057351a93ff5071430c5ac1c10","65663c314e43ecee01e21e9410d619a55747eeefa072b9716fb4f8841f70fdc0","2e5bafbb5398e4ee96c8af10e9301320d830d1b30137588cd411a15ea695dc9b","f8e0fc0d63bd826d76d834b26d8c0c7ad16e01854de951e8c35b423fca1e3097","95b6cd328d44be57d8954f6aefd60366c3a8999946ed7101e31003f0baa08d5b","50e1b4eb4099b1e9fe8dd9a2c9c4052d42c04b689e346f5cb5965ddf6704f7bf"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6072,6095],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6072"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346c with the timer value set to the maxCC-PreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxCC-Preference;","paragraph_zero_based":6097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":6098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":6099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current maxMIMO-LayerPreference information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 for the cell group and timer T346d associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346d with the timer value set to the maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current maxMIMO-LayerPreference and/or maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2;","paragraph_zero_based":6102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of a cell group for power saving:","paragraph_zero_based":6103},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of the cell group and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt for the cell group since it was configured to provide its preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling of the cell group for power saving; or","paragraph_zero_based":6104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt information for the cell group is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt for the cell group and timer T346e associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346e with the timer value set to the minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceProhibitTimer of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current minSchedulingOffsetPreference and/or minSchedulingOffsetPreferenceExt;","paragraph_zero_based":6107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its release preference and timer T346f is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE determines that it would prefer to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":6109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE is configured with connectedReporting and the UE determines that it would prefer to revert an earlier indication to transition out of RRC_CONNECTED state:","paragraph_zero_based":6110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346f with the timer value set to the releasePreferenceProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":6111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the release preference;","paragraph_zero_based":6112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication:","paragraph_zero_based":6113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide configured grant assistance information for NR sidelink communication;","paragraph_zero_based":6114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide preference in being provisioned with reference time information:","paragraph_zero_based":6115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with referenceTimeInfoPreference since it was configured to provide preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":6116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE's preference changed from the last time UE initiated transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including referenceTimeInfoPreference:","paragraph_zero_based":6117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide preference in being provisioned with reference time information.","paragraph_zero_based":6118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference on FR2 UL gap:","paragraph_zero_based":6119}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["9aa3640d1d8cfe2811c054ab45c9409d9354f77cf88a8d99d0986dbd1f04d22c","b94ac184aed352b6292ea5531f5e53afa8a93e6a4df4a2c349572937253dff0b","d83c7e60f82584987497cf8b86e4800a0f7e92cfcc88127938615a7de19df907","b8d694ab464370ba5a67c46f8694045b97eebf7f45ba035674fa084b230f1b02","9e52df195a1ed8dc816ee4b901b6c9a585cd4dd4f6360e6307f616742d53d099","d0a9401a1e2897ec786e23df6c97492bfc255e44c984f50cb79854413d90146b","55c94fda4454be2d0150a6b222388ee5566ca9400c087d50c19b231f0136e1f3","bef5204c6b19be2f195c7276b8795d0116fc2d7e5466e918631228032bb8c865","9db79cc49874382d5113874a1a4ca1529c974d08730701b58add3a6cecda5cd8","23b43cdb334eb7bbf6fd68e590ae9889a04e6cbfa444b0a607ad0f6bedd4f2e6","0739303c4285b4d7baa76226d7f0a7ee6154905e5a6eec073ed1890933e48213","2a45ba66d3b666dfd1b61bacd8966d7cac8f140d700ba82233d6e584d2d7987b","36807297346c1bd9173fcdf6d560ad3ec3a9e74b553713235f974c1331e44b73","aa77df1c8269eea50afdb7c21695810cb359e5d4bc62cfc57c54ac7abfe6e3b3","38c9305101fdcad18e8d0466b79f700415e546ab4583a47f52b9315eb88781af","dc96c2f331c25863f5dbf3a795c0c3cf31c3f32604b56ff8088778f1d80f784d","ef48e59baef26e675be731a2225ce7ee27c1b8c9a677942e12cd3e4626e58cf2","ece7f243517dea88564931a8996b7e4112c24b08d4a095659e38bf52e5f8dab1","22887c2e6882edea4bbddea3ad5e1e174b0784ecba2de72ef889ffcc0bbeacdf","611a5745cf875344aac4b53e632bc5513c4ca3be93bfee2849779d146dff39e6","056841913579c9f50f907e64fcd89c41a48e0ee9bbb1524f3cd20dc4456c073f","01a7e93956c54a2dff2fa261991a3a089580977f761c2a208f0597a82f42a28b","4bed38a5472fc1d7fec314279a208628acafc7da471b528e3927c160a994c01e","22e776421d0e1ffa56ab97f1fee824ac8ad3c7881c99fa041758972168e2a451"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6096,6119],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6096"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with ul-GapFR2-Preference since it was configured to provide its preference on FR2 UL gap information:","paragraph_zero_based":6120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference on FR2 UL gap activation/deactivation:","paragraph_zero_based":6121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide FR2 UL gap preference;","paragraph_zero_based":6122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the current FR2 UL gap preference is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message:","paragraph_zero_based":6123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide FR2 UL gap preference.","paragraph_zero_based":6124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for leaving RRC_CONNECTED:","paragraph_zero_based":6125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE needs to leave RRC_CONNECTED state and the timer T346g is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide MUSIM assistance information for leaving RRC_CONNECTED;","paragraph_zero_based":6127},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start the timer T346g with the timer value set to the musim-LeaveWithoutResponseTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":6128},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap preference:","paragraph_zero_based":6129},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the MUSIM gap(s) and the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with musim-GapPreferenceList since it was configured to provide MUSIM assistance information for gap preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":6130},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the current musim-GapPreferenceList is different from the one indicated in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-GapPreferenceList and the timer T346h is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6131},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the current musim-GapPreferenceList;","paragraph_zero_based":6132},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start or restart the timer T346h with the timer value set to the musim-GapProhibitTimer.","paragraph_zero_based":6133},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:The UE does not need to initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message if the difference between the current musim-GapPreferenceList and the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including musim-GapPreferenceList is only due to removal of an ended aperiodic gap.","paragraph_zero_based":6134},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements of a cell group and RLM measurement of the cell group is not stopped:","paragraph_zero_based":6135},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with rlm-MeasRelaxationState since it was configured to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements for the cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":6136},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the relaxation state of RLM measurements for the cell group is currently different from the relaxation state reported in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including rlm-MeasRelaxationState of the cell group and timer T346j associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6137},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346j with the timer value set to the rlm-RelaxtionReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":6138},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the relaxation state of RLM measurements of the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6139},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements of serving cells of a cell group and BFD measurement of the cell group is not stopped:","paragraph_zero_based":6140},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with bfd-MeasRelaxationState since it was configured to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements for the cell group; or","paragraph_zero_based":6141},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the relaxation state of BFD measurements in any serving cell of the cell group is currently different from the relaxation state reported in the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including bfd-MeasRelaxationState of the cell group and timer T346k associated with the cell group is not running:","paragraph_zero_based":6142},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346k with the timer value set to the bfd-RelaxtionReportingProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":6143}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["39f905da15899c6c12cf593ddfb3857836fb9e368a0174157078d408be6d3b80","8f436d1c76b345fb623efb03b618cdd5a1592fc36178732c98a55a8211a9f83c","7a039a0058de8808df84729d2da1e07ff18123f46ff948872c3ffdf67a553a74","60e6b178c30060925279a78d3f55659206f888fa6e4cdc10a17708be08b7fa69","64d615ecbbd7debcfa50a5af715d558b108044414be97836cee2215df48f4206","f81ac95568e5d9a86c8373e69eee59a9900575fae037eaa7b08a35181d3cd63f","b5286121cc93fb5fd296d40684e4309df12b2a23179acd5fccba96cae729e56d","6628a29ec8ee26275d89e68b8ad6a171b55ea644fb9211fbc9a5a5be8ceeb082","e47f42fc9479f046fc8fc3738d04faa60ba51f00018d03f1dc9a2a40523e2171","a0e8c0c74a7fe5db80545f74213cefa03c9a76a214bacedb9ad021a892d5e2a7","7d1fb8ed9913ff008b45b70476bb609ac25fac8e0765e7248f22c85e332a841e","73d267cbccaece7abe9678a0a78de5633bf96cd9989e7aa3634bb86bc817fd1a","7e21ba44bcc56c178199062a701ccfa0300c5301ab2c2aa981f0b571b4c3de00","efe9ad5074bc500548131b8235ba7b56f1517e5b815bccf70797a3190a856081","fd22a38b83f0f6db3e41c32881dab46bee6d6ef704de0f2d99dc3b0213be179b","aff02e5b7fe73c20bf8543bf31c1326ed0f4c4d90faff8b09add5e57fb1b39e8","2aefc1c402e36f079a71e396196dadfe72c0c5946ef925092cce845ca8946150","47110e5dcd157601fc2331ac9032dd69cf6c5f2346e7cfd6d125f9e5bcb02560","51adb0bb643c8823deec8c9841fc10e5b3df83b3821adff1fdaebe448f4d5e40","5f93bc4611290a5203d694113b37428fce2bdc72e7a146c9bca0b958860a7783","349be5c7d1f1615682fce5d76b9bd86bb155dba373708c58187cae84dc0d2f8f","a79563a501caab2229eb8cde032c05fd1370bea8797ff818b29d99f4a89de15f","baec9be39bde640eb844fac0ac770b1e170dbed545611e7e64d995736a0ec68c","daef27498d717a258a7ab29dc4e101788275015e02883de3b445e90ce22b4d9d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6120,6143],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6120"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the relaxation state of BFD measurements of serving cells of the cell group.","paragraph_zero_based":6144},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if data and/or signalling mapped to radio bearers not configured for SDT becomes available during SDT (i.e. while SDT procedure is ongoing):","paragraph_zero_based":6145},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with nonSDT-DataIndication since the initiation of the current resume procedure for SDT:","paragraph_zero_based":6146},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide nonSDT-DataIndication.","paragraph_zero_based":6147},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide its preference for SCG deactivation and timer T346i is not running;","paragraph_zero_based":6148},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE prefers the SCG to be deactivated and did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with scg-DeactivationPreference since it was configured to provide its SCG deactivation preference; or","paragraph_zero_based":6149},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE preference for SCG deactivation is different from the last indicated scg-DeactivationPreference:","paragraph_zero_based":6150},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>start timer T346i with the timer value set to the scg-DeactivationPreferenceProhibitTimer;","paragraph_zero_based":6151},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide the UE preference for SCG deactivation;","paragraph_zero_based":6152},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the SCG is deactivated, and,","paragraph_zero_based":6153},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>the UE has uplink data to send for an SCG RLC entity while the UE previously did not have any uplink data to send for any SCG RLC entity:","paragraph_zero_based":6154},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the UE has uplink data to send for a DRB whose DRB-Identity is not included in any RLC-BearerConfig in the CellGroupConfig associated with the MCG.","paragraph_zero_based":6155},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to send indications of RRM measurement relaxation criterion fulfilment:","paragraph_zero_based":6156},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the criterion in 5.7.4.4 is met for a period of TSearchDeltaP-StationaryConnected:","paragraph_zero_based":6157},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as true since it was configured to provide indications of RRM measurement relaxation criterion fulfilment; or","paragraph_zero_based":6158},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>the last UEAssistanceInformation message indicated the criterion in 5.7.4.4 is not fulfilled with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as false:","paragraph_zero_based":6159},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the criterion for RRM measurement relaxation for connected mode is fulfilled;","paragraph_zero_based":6160},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6161},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last UEAssistanceInformation message indicated fulfilment of the criterion in 5.7.4.4 with rrm-MeasRelaxationFulfilment as true:","paragraph_zero_based":6162},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to indicate that the criterion for RRM measurement relaxation for connected mode is not fulfilled.","paragraph_zero_based":6163},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s);","paragraph_zero_based":6164},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE did not transmit a UEAssistanceInformation message with propagationDelayDifference since it was configured to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and neighbour cell(s); or","paragraph_zero_based":6165},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for any neighbour cell in neighCellInfoList, if the service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and the neighbour cell has changed more than threshPropDelayDiff since the last transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message including propagationDelayDifference:","paragraph_zero_based":6166},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message in accordance with 5.7.4.3 to provide service link propagation delay difference between serving cell and each neighbour cell included in the neighCellInfoList;","paragraph_zero_based":6167}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["aa1b458dc496ec5588b52241b81706e674a1778490017837330c23a5f10742d5","225d112401fd1e4bc53e38a8965325c7392bcc7bfe1d9d5afd3ea0742e6fbafb","47f5bfc3e4fa5278f69bb60b19017d7659c9446625bfdc15cf09e0dd137f010f","ef4c4c9432f448dabce36faf85b63e9b6e6f9e5002b5a8fcf32b90838a97e464","b77d658d3158a91ff50ae4e47a969e1d5b4f2b99cfca802109dc5e5c045274f7","79db3976c95711ddf5abefd96e314d421ef7fc3492cb03ffbfc780257af201df","09f0a377ad1624808e72397e666499f7313d5830e4056cc6e55264350883f785","02399439c47b96d3fd69b2174472986438cbcdd094adeb1072019a51b1c2258c","4e5e9a74a2f4b5a64132641c124fd786ff917c5bbae6244486c04d07ed9b57de","35d3fc4f54a7e3bad849fe96748089bba53c5eea07a825fdb5b543ce93affd02","e0fdf64b73c1b2e3383edb6d0d0df0809c3a49b4b93f6de19f0856763d457923","7ab5424847295256e61d6df10bccf009615e7c38763804b8e80be633c07a859b","244bed9e33a0b6c25f1bb8324ff6bacf43984ee855cb0bd4736ff8172783af80","1b6e558ec0a0f5f1871c74170ead6a9bc84c03e66e44e817152cd4355bd3bc6e","c43155a05c96c541c40faccfcd1b1b50ce564dbeca0dc142c97152da761a12d2","42e487187688bb735e53387a8742eac2df2409e6181acf8528ae8ae71b1de452","902a6cf2f33c75b61722a43e9e9c965623f23db4df7bf4fea98cd8707d932786","493517044c6d04e5c65bbde750ebd086e44d7cf1c5a1e58cc91473616f922f57","0d1836c08d1f9671afe96d164f39e1f3afca25aaac88b028fa5af8b1e3d10ca4","d6bb6c1ae0f6c84f1ef97c35f51f25d063657bb491cea1c8d18f12868d7d3ef5","ceeb70f2ab58086b02f9b4ec10c6413feaf644460510610a71aca7f9e8e15a5c","5b71e22df3e8a0f4759f58f75dd0e8695881293698d1efe39cf591e3b3328dbb","38c7468e2dd957a348dc9617ece9dd9347436d5f507051de322bb35c795530cd","82b408276cd6855cdae160acec973997c2dd3e381df91b69a54c7e4f80cfc418"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6144,6167],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6144"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.4.3Actions related to transmission of UEAssistanceInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":6168},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the UEAssistanceInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6169},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide a delay budget report according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":6170},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set delayBudgetReport to type1 according to a desired value;","paragraph_zero_based":6171},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide overheating assistance information according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3;","paragraph_zero_based":6172},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE experiences internal overheating:","paragraph_zero_based":6173},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce the number of maximum secondary component carriers:","paragraph_zero_based":6174},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxCCs in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6175},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedCCsDL to the number of maximum SCells the UE prefers to be temporarily configured in downlink;","paragraph_zero_based":6176},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedCCsUL to the number of maximum SCells the UE prefers to be temporarily configured in uplink;","paragraph_zero_based":6177},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce maximum aggregated bandwidth of FR1:","paragraph_zero_based":6178},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxBW-FR1 in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6179},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedBW-DL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all downlink carriers of FR1;","paragraph_zero_based":6180},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedBW-UL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all uplink carriers of FR1;","paragraph_zero_based":6181},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce maximum aggregated bandwidth of FR2-1:","paragraph_zero_based":6182},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxBW-FR2 in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6183},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedBW-DL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all downlink carriers of FR2-1;","paragraph_zero_based":6184},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedBW-UL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all uplink carriers of FR2-1;","paragraph_zero_based":6185},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce maximum aggregated bandwidth of FR2-2:","paragraph_zero_based":6186},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxBW-FR2-2 in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6187},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedBW-FR2-2-DL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all downlink carriers of FR2-2;","paragraph_zero_based":6188},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedBW-FR2-2-UL to the maximum aggregated bandwidth the UE prefers to be temporarily configured across all uplink carriers of FR2-2;","paragraph_zero_based":6189},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to temporarily reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR1:","paragraph_zero_based":6190},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR1 in the OverheatingAssistance IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6191}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["44b6767cfb8173667d5ce5bebf4733ca670f2904db801127cc7f450b9554771b","a9ebb9cd2d3f509fcbdd15ebb87282f8a4c3f2b3c9edb8f0787c25290fc4b7d2","7f7e5fc9e9cce49ecd4a6a9f3328b4d3a4748ef70372104774e9bb6aff636d90","ae0a6f4cd99b84a1b3940fad09aa3be53281c181dead439348d07aa6c7a092d3","08e042a1f5fb61114519dddc1ab8ce5848b0bc8060f57cb5672dfec310fb526b","f6ff94cdcd2d621a0b79515d96bf22507d68d26704015f12e85d310ea6d532b8","c6f10334b85f6df678e8b8194370907fde5acc12544131233800082c57eebbcd","c704a7cd614c4cf6f4a17ee22cb2b708bb06781a08058edbc8f392597e4914ad","6ede9c7dcdbd723e3a84905cab32ab28e145ecf7258176166958cf98afa17ba1","cfbccb3f5676af0860fd4707bdad1944cf50e34f42613928ea4b35595389788d","5f603e1ae6baf41641ede25dd4049831976bfbaf8e9e80ecaa02047e7e3795b1","f7936e90d9e90ab6ba6b4eec80af30c94be61400a9ce9465588fda7ce5123ff2","bbaa2b6d4c986022c69eaabc36fef69a87ff6e80d03616cbf44d0d16908739bf","11d495be93d7d840120fbdf54afe11ca57c1759d27971951e74a3b54a0124c37","1e1befbce8f8ca540cc4f5f052a1b78b077b3399eef163395edf176e1bc4cdf8","3719b12733702f5182315c53d35f1ee2d890dc7c7f66f194e1b87b35a6c029e1","1d222b7ba711475bc41b4245e3fd892acae526335bd40b6bdcb0dd7f814f7052","aa5c97765e164550f2652e28c475aa30a84ded2dd0090a70f2cc417fd38036e2","f3ba4f94eac8cce8bf6478d20452d7a4f06339ea9642f89a140b6622cd4744b2","cc50bf00c2373f70fc46295dc6ebcbd57e376857ce0c0423290b4942617c2c8d","27952a97d71b070774c7ae2da01bf8f38c0e78f51002a3f89e00ae02006d7d0c","35d9ca7afa48762c12fd23194606dfebe19794f3fc65a5d2bbac2f844024b35b","7cf2c5bd032b98df568c65e2e3e44611cd8b5588ae37230b8bb591e5f16b96df","30cb013d21aab3cadc0db9416e7243f0ed1933995d0509547b90787956135de0"],"para