{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR1-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6264},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR1-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6265},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2-1:","paragraph_zero_based":6266},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6267},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR2-1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6268},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR2-1 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6269},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":6270},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR1 and reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreference IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6271},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide maxMIMO LayerPreferenceFR2 2 of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":6272},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include maxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":6273},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group for FR2-2:","paragraph_zero_based":6274},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE prefers to reduce the number of maximum MIMO layers of each serving cell operating on FR2 2:","paragraph_zero_based":6275},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2-2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2 2 IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6276},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-2-DL to the preferred maximum number of downlink MIMO layers of each BWP of each FR2-2 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6277},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set reducedMIMO-LayersFR2-2-UL to the preferred maximum number of uplink MIMO layers of each FR2-2 serving cell that the UE operates on in the cell group;","paragraph_zero_based":6278},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else (if the UE has no preference on the maximum number of MIMO layers for the cell group):","paragraph_zero_based":6279},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>do not include reducedMaxMIMO-LayersFR2-2 in the MaxMIMO-LayerPreferenceFR2-2 IE;","paragraph_zero_based":6280},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if transmission of the UEAssistanceInformation message is initiated to provide minSchedulingOffsetPreference of a cell group for power saving according to 5.7.4.2 or 5.3.5.3:","paragraph_zero_based":6281},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include minSchedulingOffsetPreference in the UEAssistanceInformation message;","paragraph_zero_based":6282},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE has a preference on the minimum scheduling offset for cross-slot scheduling for the cell group:","paragraph_zero_based":6283},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 (TS 38.214 [19], clause 5.1.2.1) for cross-slot scheduling with 15 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":6284},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-15kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":6285},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE has a preference for the value of K0 for cross-slot scheduling with 30 kHz SCS:","paragraph_zero_based":6286},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include preferredK0-SCS-30kHz in the MinSchedulingOffsetPreference IE and set it to the desired value of K0;","paragraph_zero_based":6287}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7d6cbf616f47e454a5b892df6cee8eaa301d3d112a5d57a1dea34822fbffff1a","0a1ee32225fef639d4067e9a622353501060e7006a8d7429dfc54a42a0f08a66","32ee7776432e3f83a48c5bea2673514214580c1806f6d9627eedfe8c1c452da2","48919c7b8534d122f5a9cac1cd9dd44e299f7d1a1d0c5328a88cc647a482da72","8df4a5e22f962eed9c82f075e02c660347c1800541a10fbcba0eff3330bc3b33","27c2874d68ef36e7de5743144874d5561ee29a364fd0859c5426808c8040fbbf","a2ef9fdabdb79a6872cc0cc7cf7777a94f7c341b005e592803b016624ad3438f","f9500a824227a005c9a7daedff913b75b503373626152494bf7913984278c55b","c86460967f332434d65821cb1506c4517089017a8b47598482461ddb12b26c4d","15384db2d80d6efb5354fc69d1f1a53ddc888c947bb2d1c262a84f5e2c36d499","a3bfe1bd5d1d6f6f390f2a41190086745b9b2725c9fa05bc9c4144c9c5cc0c33","9a61a5be7a1cd628b90dadb43ee612a30c01b17a5193f9ebda7bd2a57cb8c0a5","3fdd15f81b5790f9ef8d163cf59d4dbf81e659465f4fb3e3fda6d452f5d15bb7","9269d21e716bce4d3fa7e24abdf6f8375da9db8013ac4c7e63db54f2791fe19c","864c6b0d3da3e9c6764d26896b5a03bc3ee6cc4cddf5a438dad9e0ebe2386fa8","d9ead940eb66c3d1e0e8a1fca6f5d0f46309430e648ce0af7e59259140f67647","38129b0ea4a23c20b6550011a8e7e