{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the successHO-Report in the UEInformationResponse message to the value of successHO-Report in the VarSuccessHO-Report, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":6768},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the VarSuccessHO-Report upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":6769},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the coarseLocationRequest is set to true:","paragraph_zero_based":6770},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include coarseLocationInfo, if available;","paragraph_zero_based":6771},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the logMeasReport is included in the UEInformationResponse:","paragraph_zero_based":6772},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEInformationResponse message to lower layers for transmission via SRB2;","paragraph_zero_based":6773},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>discard the logged measurement entries included in the logMeasInfoList from VarLogMeasReport upon successful delivery of the UEInformationResponse message confirmed by lower layers;","paragraph_zero_based":6774},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6775},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the UEInformationResponse message to lower layers for transmission via SRB1.","paragraph_zero_based":6776},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.4Actions upon successful completion of a random-access procedure or on completion of a request of on-demand system information","paragraph_zero_based":6777},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon successfully performing random-access procedure initialized with 4-step or 2-step RA type, or upon failed or successfully completed on-demand system information acquisition procedure in RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE state, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6778},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the RPLMN or the PLMN selected by upper layers (see TS24.501 [23]) from the PLMN(s) included in the plmn-IdentityList in SIB1 is not included in plmn-IdentityList stored in a non-empty VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":6779},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>clear the information included in VarRA-Report;","paragraph_zero_based":6780},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the number of RA-Report entries stored in the ra-ReportList in VarRA-Report is less than maxRAReport:","paragraph_zero_based":6781},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the number of PLMN entries in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRA-Report is less than maxPLMN; or","paragraph_zero_based":6782},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the number of PLMN entries in plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRA-Report is equal to maxPLMN and the list of EPLMNs is subset of or equal to the plmn-IdentityList stored in VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":6783},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>append the following contents associated to the successfully completed random-access procedure or the failed or successfully completed on-demand system information acquisition procedure as a new entry in the VarRA-Report:","paragraph_zero_based":6784},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the list of EPLMNs has been stored by the UE:","paragraph_zero_based":6785},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the plmn-IdentityList to include the list of EPLMNs stored by the UE (i.e. includes the RPLMN) without exceeding the limit of maxPLMN;","paragraph_zero_based":6786},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6787},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the plmn-Identity, in plmn-IdentityList, to the PLMN selected by upper layers (see TS 24.501 [23]) from the PLMN(s) included in the plmn-IdentityInfoList in SIB1;","paragraph_zero_based":6788},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the cellId to the global cell identity and the tracking area code, if available, otherwise to the physical cell identity and carrier frequency of the cell in which the corresponding random-access preamble was transmitted;","paragraph_zero_based":6789},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE supports spCell ID indication:","paragraph_zero_based":6790},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on an SCell of MCG:","paragraph_zero_based":6791}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["bc1dfb3eaccfc47dff32402145c0e0a59110373a8124fe4b877631033bf1fc16","79291fd2ebda96dd6deba7c8df976916bd059fd1f0ffee1704b3f56d1d977344","17cd092b6442b2c1040d3ab9ba6d34489bdc28e71a00dd8a715a3fe79064e898","fed93e9003a2ab249cd4b2435252a76a9c5c6762d0d15ca95ead053ebf8c6762","0a2fe3ec8e69784ae3469872055242f4ebde8e342ed34d3d76327af7f17fbd2e","d6df442d6fa3019591f719d9f41df663445d6a4146ff387764ed4ef3cce1762c","97787ea8feec9ed611c9c82537368e49f0f5cfbf51147efa8220842a3243b7dc","369c3d2605e105cc94b8dac0b7f1e18295b0e4314f0f514852fe12095bb428b6","fa6e1c635168ba6bb589ff2024d333f789a3a30a768722664c2968d7985decd9","40407a5e10b9cdb31dbb83b8fadc8e8e442d2307992736e9b49f30a668baa07b","2d00e5a2d113381cd4637574babd38f73625e984b1fac269616400801e9d443c","b0a5946f0711253a1425cbd46d9fa3613a42b9ca21c98996402d43b4b63b595b","a00ab1c8c35df44e2b0086091bca2816322a7fca0bd58bc1c27199c7ac084b38","c5997ff9e89fe1bbe0935f674ebb618e5889f30ebc1603483c9f7d7382cd7ee9","65208fb68345d53917910edba1475397d721c483ae540b66f5bc5c1c3434d004","c9178c7ec810f6ff8cd20c0ed3032d8e4207eae6ca6022440200164c0ab0e2d0","8a2f2c8f4a368c7164459541acc182c6e2e23ecd99b1291700ea2e9634ccbb99","0f2d496dfb2bd0f6b7f3c008d36ca150e6430d6632c8eafe20cdeb263f816ff4","2b3d4014ea3a5827501bf59399155676fb5e3eeadd3b0f11ed7ff0d50039c16b","67a32a34cff8937e7b1d8510679f3f4ec8fa814e7048debde7f9dd4c5b7d46f0","1188bf1729448e3270844d8607ddf3e026112de986f8b02f8b28b12af17a2c0d","a08a6cc9f5ebb1c2e6dbbba2910cfd448823e47ed7b084dbefd827ed0bdbe7c5","02a676c5dc21a8ad5e7ad3a347876d8cbd7168fb9cefe44524aad2b8feacd1e0","ac7b3516c2aee36cec35dbbf3a5c550871b3006c4d17be8accf123e2283a1e02"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6768,6791],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6768"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":6792},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on an SCell of SCG:","paragraph_zero_based":6793},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PSCell, if available, otherwise, set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":6794},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the corresponding random-access procedure was performed on PSCell:","paragraph_zero_based":6795},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>if the cellId is not set to the global cell identity of the PSCell, set the spCellId to the global cell identity of the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":6796},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the raPurpose to include the purpose of triggering the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6797},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the ra-InformationCommon as specified in clause 5.7.10.5.","paragraph_zero_based":6798},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may discard the random access report information, i.e. release the UE variable VarRA-Report, 48 hours after the last successful random access procedure or the failed or successfully completed on-demand system information acquisition procedure related information is added to the VarRA-Report.","paragraph_zero_based":6799},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:The UE does not log the RA information in the RA report if the triggering event of the random access is consistent UL LBT on SpCell as specified in TS 38.321 [6].","paragraph_zero_based":6800},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.5RA information determination","paragraph_zero_based":6801},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the content in ra-InformationCommon as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6802},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the absoluteFrequencyPointA to indicate the absolute frequency of the reference resource block associated to the random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6803},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the locationAndBandwidth and subcarrierSpacing associated to the UL BWP of the random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6804},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if contention based random-access resources are used in the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":6805},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msgA_RO-FrequencyStart and msgA-RO-FDM and msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random- access resources if used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6806},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure is available:","paragraph_zero_based":6807},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6808},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if only 2 step random-access resources are available in the UL BWP used in the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":6809},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msgA-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndex to the subcarrier spacing as derived from the msgA-PRACH-ConfigurationIndex used in the 2-step random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6810},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6811},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6812},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msg1-FrequencyStart associated to the 4 step random-access resources if used in the random-access procedure, and if its value is different from the value of msgA-RO-FrequencyStart if it is included in the ra-InformationCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":6813},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msg1-FDM associated to the 4 step random-access resources if used in the random-access procedure, and if its value is different from the value of msgA-RO-FDMCFRA if it is included in the ra-InformationCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":6814},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure is available, and if its value is different from the value of msgA-SubcarrierSpacing if it is included in the ra-InformationCommon:","paragraph_zero_based":6815}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["a955e9ea2c219406dab0703a3f61e40845b7603fe97f4f2176c8ce60b014059e","64dc36bd53bc7d16e6bce0da4b1eb3a076d94b65ae6a3a248428001f3ac136e2","91360ecc263e3a5837ed5795683c4e2f1b77bbfbe66dd1b07c6706f859c35209","675a3227e5604db03b034badb902d74f63e8c9a05dfa0d044cb64d508bfdd3a9","bb92a7b30be536e091fd9d30a4ec73f2b9dc12eed0b15f2ec011fb9e7e5874a1","ea4d9512067ca3f6dc6bd1033fd55a5301bce2e4697fd82eb44d80183388a57b","3edb515b8c880bbadf703539ad2f06af89b40d4ec42423977d4737bfbffae0df","74be81d2f97bdd3d7b08f6924290b73b6eaa636f6fab8a2896c5c05a30814da1","4ffd0f95fbc77ecf7d8dbe44da6855097d471d3152892fe8b8311c338286b411","b743cc4cec529326fd2ff9b1e006a46ccdac54802edbdf7b9e5f240660f40f46","e31f13ce0b945af9a4c10a847ff64fe33701420d3a8d011c1721b754abd71856","ab2a2e405051e9bc1a083a7ee80a66d2ff0da841d6f39d7ab7392e031f67b6cf","24b6d65b1abe1b7