{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6816},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else:","paragraph_zero_based":6817},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndex to the subcarrier spacing as derived from the prach-ConfigurationIndex used in the 4-step random-access procedure, and if its value is different from the value of msgA-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndex if it is included in the ra-InformationCommon;","paragraph_zero_based":6818},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if contention free random-access resources are used in the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":6819},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msg1-FrequencyStartCFRA and msg1-FDMCFRA associated to the 4 step random-access resources if used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6820},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> if msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure is available:","paragraph_zero_based":6821},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SubcarrierSpacingCFRA associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6822},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2> else:","paragraph_zero_based":6823},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndexCFRA to the subcarrier spacing as derived from the prach-ConfigurationIndex used in the 4 step random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6824},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msgA-RO-FrequencyStartCFRA and msgA-RO-FDMCFRA associated to the 2 step contention free random access resources if used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6825},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msgA-MCS, the nrofPRBs-PerMsgA-PO, the msgA-PUSCH-TimeDomainAllocation, the frequencyStartMsgA-PUSCH, the nrofMsgA-PO-FDM associated to the 2 step random-access resources if used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6826},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure is available:","paragraph_zero_based":6827},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msgA-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 2 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6828},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if only 2 step random-access resources are available in the UL BWP used in the random-access procedure:","paragraph_zero_based":6829},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msgA-SCS-From-prach-ConfigurationIndex to the subcarrier spacing as derived from the msgA-PRACH-ConfigurationIndex used in the 2-step random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6830},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6831},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the msg1-SubcarrierSpacing associated to the 4 step random-access resources used in the random-access procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6832},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the random access procedure is initialized with RA_TYPE set to 2-stepRA as described in TS 38.321 [3]:","paragraph_zero_based":6833},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the dlPathlossRSRP to the measeured RSRP of the DL pathloss reference obtained at the time of RA_Type selection stage of the initialization of the RA procedure as captured in TS 38.321 [3];","paragraph_zero_based":6834},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the configuration for the random access msgA-TransMax was configured in RACH-ConfigDedicated for this random access procedure, and raPurpose is set to reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":6835},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set msgA-TransMax to the value of msgA-TransMax in RACH-ConfigDedicated;","paragraph_zero_based":6836},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if msgA-TransMax was configured in RACH-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA:","paragraph_zero_based":6837},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set msgA-TransMax to the value of msgA-TransMax in RACH-ConfigCommonTwoStepRA;","paragraph_zero_based":6838},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the msgA-PUSCH-PayloadSize to the size of the overall payload available in the UE buffer at the time of initiating the 2 step RA procedure;","paragraph_zero_based":6839}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["c7e010435b7448c31e4bc4edc8ae25c3d6e1401fad79fad75cc69eaf78feca63","f03173f4e7ac7b17925cf38c1eb679789e689a15e252a81bb0adbd8a0469bca7","3fc64a683a6690810c87d84f22b5f769fb609851cb75526221f490b5c389526c","aeeec34ada372ccce1a211521f8af26ca16a0d82dbc8e7337e69f23542d2cd59","ddedbf314e2543aca1146396698eb7a5512fa1e2c16561545e64502ec91c2763","0558742a4466c95b9833d28cb543241d4d85e49b2b250e3e9fcaf2eed25f8a16","5ee8562376de5a5f5509b7dfe6c29b71229ff516ad78270776ecc33b0b1a4432","87f46948017af52857ef45f0e88136792a2c2040cbb0d1eaf37c689388b681c5","dc070e8529987f55fdb81df941f4bef194209de4a4c11cc61a4a28802b0025ba","8e2a4aa9a2a570b7a2a2a87dfd163cce8ab228df1e70d57bac1c07d3c92ec5bf","a6fdebc8943a24d5a8e6dd2e61fcf3875f01d90e3ac1ff2d1f470223bb6272a0","0e38ff0aee9d0f7b6cac25a037142eb20de26855a81f7aa17eaec275ed70c082","96f86aeead8c137713f241835d313e1edb59a35ba4c5b66680886c6fa1f042f3","700756d44f5cba7765a6b36b04f149c3b83cbd135b78ed84d3316839668fb99c","ab188412ffeede5638cfbb024943df09756618dd29cfece15c1d068c659fe729","63ff670f3ee403f3b289c96af7591c262948dc5ed4aeceb12a8a7e1da9e17443","c0c485589a840b9d26f49f70a1ed1b0527b3d158bd10894d1535be0ba739b449","728e06505eecfc6241620e8ccff09e738bee446a952650ebadc4e31e0a8a0f57","e39dc39df0bdcd1539ba07ab458e9473d041de4a6a3f94ec6197244576ac0314","128611a590e52c52c5a51cf88ede8f8f4c24caba23f39cbf70976fb5d6dd9552","22cfdf847882d8a965735e65948a14b04070f1e0e2d38e1205f2df577aa91ef4","fbc5adb53fb2f1de22d7199f9f6e58934c5b54b8018c8ed2f6b6cd792fe25c41","f6c4b7b09e19dc0319d49c5009a4d5316bc9042d59bf67ba65f7037abbd54d30","354a9d2f4192dc7f488fa5ff04a8a66e31a1ced4b0bb91ef9b33b9fd4736bf82"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6816,6839],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6816"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the purpose of the random access procedure is to request on-demand system information (i.e., if the raPurpose is set to requestForOtherSI or msg3RequestForOtherSI):","paragraph_zero_based":6840},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the intendedSIBs to indicate the SIB(s) the UE wanted to receive as a result of the SI request;","paragraph_zero_based":6841},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the ssbsForSI-Acquisition to indicate the SSB(s) used to receive the SI message;","paragraph_zero_based":6842},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the on-demand system information acquisition was successful:","paragraph_zero_based":6843},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the onDemandSISuccess to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6844},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>set the parameters associated to individual random-access attempt in the chronological order of attempts in the perRAInfoList as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6845},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the random-access resource used is associated to a SS/PBCH block, set the associated random-access parameters for the successive random-access attempts associated to the same SS/PBCH block for one or more random-access attempts as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6846},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the ssb-Index to include the SS/PBCH block index associated to the used random-access resource;","paragraph_zero_based":6847},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfPreamblesSentOnSSB to indicate the number of successive random-access attempts associated to the SS/PBCH block;","paragraph_zero_based":6848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each random-access attempt performed on the random-access resource, include the following parameters in the chronological order of the random-access attempt:","paragraph_zero_based":6849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the random-access attempt is performed on the contention based random-access resource and if raPurpose is not equal to 'requestForOtherSI', include contentionDetected as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if contention resolution was not successful as specified in TS 38.321 [6] for the transmitted preamble:","paragraph_zero_based":6851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the contentionDetected to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the contentionDetected to false;","paragraph_zero_based":6854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the random access attempt is a 2-step random access attempt:","paragraph_zero_based":6855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if fallback from 2-step random access to 4-step random access occurred during the random access attempt:","paragraph_zero_based":6856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set fallbackToFourStepRA to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the random-access attempt is performed on the contention based random-access resource; or","paragraph_zero_based":6858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the random-access attempt is performed on the contention free random-access resource and if the random-access procedure was initiated due to the PDCCH ordering:","paragraph_zero_based":6859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the random access attempt is a 4-step random access attempt and the SS/PBCH block RSRP of the SS/PBCH block corresponding to the random-access resource used in the random-access attempt is above rsrp-ThresholdSSB; or","paragraph_zero_based":6860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the random access attempt is a 2-step random access attempt and the SS/PBCH block RSRP of the SS/PBCH block corresponding to the random-access resource used in the random-access attempt is above msgA-RSRP-ThresholdSSB:","paragraph_zero_based":6861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the dlRSRPAboveThreshold to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6863}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["82d31147878726e943ab9a42915e0d6399011f18538b3e7743fd1592ba852836","e0c2ed9abdad5a820b6a3968da7deaeef3883db6796afe2f081bf15b7642690b","ca392dc8c4f86d39b29e26164dff4beef4bfc4d3a660cfa62100d9e379f4a23e","21c5010eb971a496ca8cae150eb5a0929399c17be6fb45e38c8aac3a98ea7e1e","a6e3fcfaefebd73a2d7b5b94a64331bd33952df4816878d6f6b9a8ade0fd675d","d3cab534a4b89c7a9256c2750418da57c7f4425ccded4ce9230de929e2116d2e","df57bda784539696817d6e9acfd1cff663b1799ead431c891f3baa8cb1b7b8db","74c1b5ae0454717afabe702469d55c94193b9e6f84c9bac5d7d917bb35462fa6","7d3c5dfc1c159a2aaa85ef23a795a85c1ef2cbeebf5cbc5ca99abac8bea3b8ef","35cb3d88572e5f6e686a53fac47c99f17ecb96112511c8ed13323a1644816d92","88ba393ce6607f2700895ab8c1abaded9313b7e27861d936776342f457495438","b19777fec77c9534d16cb14f2852c33acbe3d274f3ca174f381196351aecc97b","a62674e78801c7d3153f48060fd6c60d5a218f48656c508edd6bbb581ec1e892","ffdeb06a5604af576d220027189803a3baa1b57968363d6c67d2142f2a632b6d","6484cb4452e24914488ab0044811a281ac48530bd61ad8bdd7d5df38f9aff6a4","977b721f131db331ee6210db81b026f1da39fc763e864c1a7928ffe1de917d1e","6628eeaad32b69be03cf8f4b4a4f9365a38c2dcd3cb4a61928b131e14eff1ae4","5baf401ecbb2fc5705d87cc3742b25598efa7cd675de3ae30ddab96892479150","9bb85ba2e82e7eb8a4b552b53abfe5de98434c2bf603718427d0dacfa1762c57","38052da25b567a2ef8113a5bd6630a2cf297c40eb77c04c5c23d885e7b626b51","65a6f5dfd624d3e0a3acdc08bd1ff50f730c03252b5f9b6769e8467999ecd963","0cf896cf041421bf7c5f1a251b50a92e2481d79f4550f28a1b9886d030958ca0","1f5c6580e3dd4433c3c75eb373e065f1ee579ab4f7e8092bf2dd0a8b3f96e1ca","fd5c3f15a98e072cae8d59ea12f6dfdd00fe573848f99d82c33d09fa3beaf369"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6840,6863],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6840"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the dlRSRPAboveThreshold to false;","paragraph_zero_based":6864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the random-access resource used is associated to a CSI-RS, set the associated random-access parameters for the successive random-access attempts associated to the same CSI-RS for one or more random-access attempts as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the csi-RS-Index to include the CSI-RS index associated to the used random-access resource;","paragraph_zero_based":6866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the numberOfPreamblesSentOnCSI-RS to indicate the number of successive random-access attempts associated to the CSI-RS.","paragraph_zero_based":6867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:Void.","paragraph_zero_based":6868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.10.6Actions for the successful handover report determination","paragraph_zero_based":6869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall for the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":6870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T304 and the configured value of the timer T304, included in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT304 if included in the successHO-Config received before executing the last reconfiguration with sync; or","paragraph_zero_based":6871},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T310 and the configured value of the timer T310, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT310 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync; or","paragraph_zero_based":6872},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the T312 associated to the measurement identity of the target cell was running at the time of initiating the execution of the reconfiguration with sync procedure and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T312 and the configured value of the timer T312, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT312 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync; or","paragraph_zero_based":6873},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if sourceDAPS-FailureReporting is included in the successHO-Config before executing the last reconfiguration with sync and is set to true and if the last executed handover was a DAPS handover and if an RLF occurred at the source PCell during the DAPS handover while T304 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":6874},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>store the successful handover information in VarSuccessHO-Report and determine the content in VarSuccessHO-Report as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6875},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>clear the information included in VarSuccessHO-Report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":6876},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the plmn-IdentityList to include the list of EPLMNs stored by the UE (i.e., includes the RPLMN);","paragraph_zero_based":6877},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the c-RNTI to the C-RNTI assigned by the target PCell of the handover;","paragraph_zero_based":6878},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the source PCell in which the last RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":6879},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sourcePCellID in sourceCellInfo to the global cell identity and tracking area code, if available, of the source PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":6880},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the sourceCellMeas in sourceCellInfo to include the cell level RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR, of the source PCell based on the available SSB and CSI-RS measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":6881},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the rsIndexResults in sourceCellMeas to include all the available SSB and CSI-RS measurement quantities of the source PCell collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":6882},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last executed handover was a DAPS handover and if an RLF occurred at the source PCell during the DAPS handover while T304 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":6883},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the rlf-InSourceDAPS in sourceCellInfo to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6884},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for the target PCell indicated in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync:","paragraph_zero_based":6885},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the targetPCellID in targetCellInfo to the global cell identity and tracking area code, if available, of the target PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":6886},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the targetCellMeas in targetCellInfo to include the cell level RSRP, RSRQ and the available SINR, of the target PCell based on the available SSB and CSI-RS measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":6887}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5cff5875b746b0d1935437b3cefbc7dfbe4676672646f186ec815cb45d1850c6","79e02cc393e0bb939db9f5e076221358484d05589a6ed425406bf7559b34be48","6568dbeddec18e707184ce322c1c2da87fb6d897726599151fca8a725caca43e","7f84df78f27d8803f565fede4b3cd2d9470a6d1f5f7fcf485b990ec171f4e1e9","82b54971e4c9dd3d080fea80e7b899781638112cfcd54eab4cb6b061a4a16480","51c94262a5f171870a06793778f1631991578548e313ecf639b6b50931b3823b","0218dff2e4c9dd5c3624b82a597047e707070aa5f5e8c88080b2e3f01d7a7438","2f31c07fe033457f7bef59d2ca99947e1b39c18b38edd6bc78fdfafee2083ec8","bb609cf15f7c98387d416539b5ac241ead8e2386bf0a3e50dcca6ef1b19e26e2","ad9af10c28c4f1de58fa6acbbf8b43382dd49b94d18ddc6efb6213fd6beed444","0337f97a91141b67c61176386d93565c632443ad891699340fb30bbd5347dfc8","5d5b6e8134fde927e453f23f81fc19bd015840d5ee6caa829281d60bec23ad86","08ad3090c08bd18aba7ec557d86618f2013e3869319b04e490201ebc0d4d8ef4","c884f881639213154dce1d661aa335ef83e949e757b89434630f38bc378a2888","897105cc24c7a5e998fc3c2c3020c52dcc30bcea6c00e19bfa37c02607b1cbc4","3bee30cdd33155394f01d9672d49f537158b7cfedf3c5ae9e336fba3464ee667","21993497ee9af92b71624384f4ca69ca735357167ea3d5355f9d527a0f3fd480","25f5a3a627b49d3ac15f5c7b4628b7073c39f70b7f5d10e1b7cf9bbea7856299","ab3c24184dfe5acca99543421b4feac27441c3ce143bea44956370d279a42021","5d4a2a5d0fe2eda75a98939e90af7ba7b4140b875d2c19e80b5eec3b88c04ec3","3d8ba61bac9154c85540e05fdb3d3b9a57d0b019c6339d0aff4737c29fb3e32b","dfe3822ee4e2bff81feb2ee3ee978ec4919f1b6f1711ebc3b5d655ea499c15e0","f49ceae8dcaaa337ece4c4b6a13cfd691374cef1e8ac112cfc5ab602da2c6d2d","56b5fdf24c768b9c2f0e0cc2b1f6459a3d1d96181f3212dd5f74bb6507f4ba2f"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6864,6887],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6864"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the rsIndexResults in targetCellMeas to include all the available SSB and CSI-RS measurement quantities of the target PCell collected up to the moment the UE sends RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":6888},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the last applied RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was included in the stored condRRCReconfig:","paragraph_zero_based":6889},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the timeSinceCHO-Reconfig to the time elapsed between the initiation of the execution of conditional reconfiguration for the target PCell and the reception of the last conditionalReconfiguration including the condRRCReconfig of the target PCell in the source PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":6890},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T304 and the configured value of the T304 timer, included in the last applied RRCReconfiguration message including the reconfigurationWithSync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT304 if included in the successHO-Config received before executing the last reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":6891},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t304-cause in shr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6892},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the ra-InformationCommon to include the random-access related information associated to the random access procedure in the target PCell, as specified in clause 5.7.10.5;","paragraph_zero_based":6893},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T310 and the configured value of the T310 timer, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT310 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":6894},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t310-cause in shr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6895},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the T312 associated to the measurement identity of the target cell was running at the time of initiating the execution of the reconfiguration with sync procedure and if the ratio between the value of the elapsed time of the timer T312 and the configured value of the T312 timer, configured while the UE was connected to the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync, is greater than thresholdPercentageT312 included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync:","paragraph_zero_based":6896},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set t312-cause in shr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6897},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if sourceDAPS-FailureReporting included in the successHO-Config if configured by the source PCell before executing the last reconfiguration with sync is set to true, and if the last executed handover was a DAPS handover and if an RLF occurred at the source PCell during the DAPS handover while T304 was running:","paragraph_zero_based":6898},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set sourceDAPS-Failure in shr-Cause to true;","paragraph_zero_based":6899},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the measObjectNR, configured by the source PCell, in which the last RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":6900},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if measurements are available for the measObjectNR:","paragraph_zero_based":6901},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the SS/PBCH block-based measurement quantities are available:","paragraph_zero_based":6902},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells to include all the available measurement quantities of the best measured cells, other than the source PCell or target PCell, ordered such that the cell with highest SS/PBCH block RSRP is listed first if SS/PBCH block RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest SS/PBCH block RSRQ is listed first if SS/PBCH block RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest SS/PBCH block SINR is listed first, based on the available SS/PBCH block based measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":6903},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":6904},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:For the neighboring cells set included in measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells ordered based on the SS/PBCH block measurement quantities, the UE includes also the CSI-RS based measurement quantities, if available.","paragraph_zero_based":6905},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if the CSI-RS measurement quantities are available:","paragraph_zero_based":6906},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>set the measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells to include all the available measurement quantities of the best measured cells, other than the source PCell and target PCell, ordered such that the cell with highest CSI-RS RSRP is listed first if CSI-RS RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest CSI-RS RSRQ is listed first if CSI-RS RSRQ measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest CSI-RS SINR is listed first, based on the available CSI-RS based measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":6907},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":6908},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:For the neighboring cells set ordered based on the CSI-RS measurement quantities, the UE includes measurements only for the cells not yet included in measResultListNR in measResultNeighCells to avoid overriding SS/PBCH block-based ordered measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":6909},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the measObjectEUTRA, configured by the source PCell in which the last RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":6910},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if measurements are available for the measObjectEUTRA:","paragraph_zero_based":6911}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["37a6bbf47f0b497c74c92a15af6bf8dfbc3ee2e0cfe5fe77802e35f96c47c4a9","23076a5943a793370a63f0f541289b263c6a8c53aec88ff285250e8f3f0990ff","65e4f15eabca3ec03952fbb05e21b22a6f44d2d07b7261763c1fe094bb3f0c68","758e00ff73fd1e769f3913c30cdf511a0ae55737f9cd0e68b385477ac5adbe0f","c0f8f39f36e73dfb006c0e12269392c75fd41d71e71d0d20ed4911258c9cba5f","eecb96d59baf8d461ce2fce7ce779eec3bbf3d0d5c6945b645a8acaf1a8d7a98","5f8a1d3801da284bb633aba9a7a5f01643d25d9f396cf1a77d76aa163f6ef3a5","629e49ba3aee3c5a09aa940b21ab3affcb9c5c7a307870dbf7868efdb07db135","d7b8c25a856ddf86645bba54b3f85f8fe5b12dab521bb9a3d40f02d9efc95eac","7eb94e093c0d964b8863c0a10046ae5d645222f94d503feabc957ccb4f8c7e72","2cee35ca4a91605b3fea78a9cadea0e4c525a208aa404ab5d27f4bbc7dfd3326","c616d5e7db067aee1177ab23e633d3f4338b486127f38f4633bcdb3b8f8fa4ca","1b0424ebe9aa6fb4a82fa8bf531099d768070d80069a653f3f3c187475662971","a1cece331ddbccacf9f4cc32db18edd3f75f17d976f543f769b4de17df2bad06","623edee58da71e9a0571a583d974885172f93628c5673d01c7f496d355efccdb","2374bdf396e6119fa9c2b439be31ab7c49e493b5bdad95d1cc650b49682c6495","7a1e0fe240fdcf936ce14224bd6131901bee41ec773ca93a42113a0b9a5816c7","e8d68cce49fbf3b2803670cb436f48827e8511ccff22c3ffa5610cac0ea79575","76a0d161b2acc0b509e25f139699ad1653bb6bd7c2c9ee84f45cb913560462a0","a3fa1bf98e28bf6c099385d6656148fc4e545417a5f9584e1787adcf2f96c6bd","42135df2a820c80fd758471c986c1d2cbd7ad50c3a698ffc0ca3d9046fa4646e","aac544fddef2cb2039e0c3835d3831517b9b0ad8ab33290c7651eeb65cd6df7d","01bec0f355bad5697b05c2b60fb975ecd609491ee4a0c2381a5adc34b5fa2203","ff0fafe1aacca6588487eb6c19e45a8f2c4f7abfd89c8144abcbced6d029c36a"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6888,6911],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6888"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the measResultListEUTRA in measResultNeighCells to include the best measured cells ordered such that the cell with highest RSRP is listed first if RSRP measurement results are available, otherwise the cell with highest RSRQ is listed first, based on measurements collected up to the moment the UE sends the RRCReconfigurationComplete message;","paragraph_zero_based":6912},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>for each neighbour cell included, include the optional fields that are available;","paragraph_zero_based":6913},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each of the neighbour cells included in measResultNeighCells:","paragraph_zero_based":6914},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the cell was a candidate target cell included in the condRRCReconfig within the conditionalReconfiguration configured by the source PCell, in which the last RRCReconfiguration message including reconfigurationWithSync was applied:","paragraph_zero_based":6915},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>set the choCandidate to true in measResultNR;","paragraph_zero_based":6916},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if available, set the locationInfo as in 5.3.3.7;","paragraph_zero_based":6917},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>release successHO-Config configured by the source PCell and thresholdPercentageT304 if configured by the target PCell.","paragraph_zero_based":6918},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE may discard the successful handover information, i.e., release the UE variable VarSuccessHO-Report, 48 hours after the last successful handover information is added to the VarSuccessHO-Report.","paragraph_zero_based":6919},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.11Void","paragraph_zero_based":6920},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.12IAB Other Information","paragraph_zero_based":6921},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.12.1General","paragraph_zero_based":6922},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":6923},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.12.1-1: IAB Other Information procedure","paragraph_zero_based":6924},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB Other Information procedure is used by IAB-MT to request the IAB-donor-CU to allocate IP address or inform the IAB-donor-CU of the IP address for the collocated IAB-DU.","paragraph_zero_based":6925},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.12.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":6926},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the IAB-MT shall:","paragraph_zero_based":6927},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the IABOtherInformation message in accordance with 5.7.12.3;","paragraph_zero_based":6928},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.12.3Actions related to transmission of IABOtherInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":6929},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The IAB-MT shall set the contents of IABOtherInformation message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6930},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is used to request IP addresses:","paragraph_zero_based":6931},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if IPv4 addresses are requested:","paragraph_zero_based":6932},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the iab-IPv4-AddressNumReq to the number of IPv4 addresses requested per specific usage;","paragraph_zero_based":6933},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if IPv6 addresses or IPv6 address prefixes are requested:","paragraph_zero_based":6934},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if IPv6 addresses are requested:","paragraph_zero_based":6935}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["52ec7e007e49658ad257a6025098da8c856f41bb38ef23712ad0262156b25d7a","740d995f0751f180fb4cda7e7b329187b7e1419a73bb4a4365fda5e380afea00","86dcb6498f60127475021aee36d76b8c729ca43a0e885b202a998f304a5b2161","5bcc484e7e795f5af22040b2b1f4241acce32346c699cc533d6fcc8fcc04f186","9fe21b6b71470c294351ed80aadfbe8313b357c9497d1f0db0a7d0b93239befd","c5f266025cd4f925534cfac261d729a762ec3f7612b122683d9bb62cde5bc8c3","6bd1dfa80e26430ef9c82f810a41589322b5217d39953af39f1508301261a389","a31b5fd7ce243ba76e38198ab17cac378c74c0d59119dfd3a69487197370261c","1fb7cd5fa9ec3d345b032e708ce2d0f5252da08c6c25c9346f40bdb62b4001da","0ca4e680be07b2b13dfd285cd4933d1b448b2cdd459006b9a37f5cdfa60d4747","fc680776a95497547878371ed048a318fc241467c8b1963dba26a86dc65c2067","6a5ce482de6a2b10656fd9b4167f70ddfe55f05a5a3e8d8878759a70659b1ad1","783ae234f061e0d52ef83b026ac8aba06ee65e95d424e8611722ba6dc0a46c9c","37f51f9d2d39132da5811cbd614caeea440c51bc5718c408a3f17313e751fabb","9e30f23e39228fbd1a7c2c57c6ad234717bafa58e726fa8a6e864f75300644b5","cd4e0654ae60378b63b80358b0e2a564c9f2d1a3f1e75ca0768132909418a302","fb3e4237c55019a04a153d362b152fc1909242398f40a3dc143452254567c8b4","52727d6f7bf252d9e38101a0b836fc2042ca4e71eede9392b96f877aa2cfccc3","be84608ec3eb1cd2f903f346eef8e8d314c15efd725fc9f3ac51e355c4f41264","9727fe913af272868bc61ceb2d93081590bdc6f0173eefc446425caf09ffbbf0","0eae3a887e2b6a953f49456fbe4fa9ea0074518bedeb6a988ba6a6d1f5f83165","cba06edda8afc66a3b78fd1259586c11db2d2911ad0f9190bfbee9da7b156498","70cbe2935e9f5d08d616afba75632c974d2ab8e5f6353369fbaff803b32d8a77","3beea958d5ce993a3080429f82b83746bf5131c494d8a9f5c98f23bbb594e28d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6912,6935],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6912"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the iab-IPv6-AddressNumReq to the number of IPv6 addresses requested per specific usage;","paragraph_zero_based":6936},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if IPv6 address prefixes are requested:","paragraph_zero_based":6937},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the iab-IPv6-AddressPrefixReq to true per specific usage;","paragraph_zero_based":6938},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the procedure is used to report IP addresses:","paragraph_zero_based":6939},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if IPv4 addresses are reported:","paragraph_zero_based":6940},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>include iPv4-Address in iab-IPv4-AddressReport, and for each IP address included:","paragraph_zero_based":6941},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if IPv4 addresses are used for F1-C traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6942},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include these addresses in f1-C-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6943},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if IPv4 addresses are used for F1-U traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6944},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include these addresses in f1-U-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6945},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if IPv4 address are used for non-F1 traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6946},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include these addresses in non-f1-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6947},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if IPv4 addresses are used for all traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6948},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>include these addresses in all-Traffic-IAB-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6949},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if IPv6 addresses or IPv6 address prefixes are reported:","paragraph_zero_based":6950},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if IPv6 addresses are reported:","paragraph_zero_based":6951},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include iPv6-Address in iab-IPv6-AddressReport, and for each IP address included;","paragraph_zero_based":6952},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if IPv6 addresses are used for F1-C traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6953},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include these addresses in f1-C-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6954},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if IPv6 addresses are used for F1-U traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6955},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include these addresses in f1-U-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6956},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if IPv6 addresses are used for non-F1 traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6957},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include these addresses in non-f1-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6958},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if IPv6 addresses are used for all traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6959}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["7038390ebb58af6471910bc0d78f00e07153ac989d873ce0dfc862ca69ed8dfe","2232a956315ac2227303e5e0cdab65973e4e6a9408061df49356dc6c10138877","1e9811ec3ef2c724862a4faf31fbe890db417b5e6c7780b54914a01b65b5f5a0","a1b733cc4be79699d56bcfe4c2185ec514270a6d30ac4a5cf70e13c26862f8e9","232dffc056705c7bfa91454e0246dc512209811d75b9d9057fd4a79daea0c0ba","c17da93865242cc8b045a86fab51986f4993cdf5c8e2455b51f5596f3f0518f9","a3bd31b6be43bde3e40b723fd87e6090901784516fa5c212009793364d740e71","512a3044ad855ee254431d00f9c8157884ae9de734e5d8084a6b24710b89aa8c","c452bb2824c9cf4b1b8cd82b820a17d5f91122ff892d022a7ac896817140c6f7","dfdd8df09b02e458efabe7ac20c020b3f717e537956cd5657c86a0f89572ce57","3b13a8284b27166b780d599ef68722a2174460eefb07f82fd172def633e0ed40","9cd97e1b74ae932f5a50a5bb7afd7726948e69584d9a43bd5a897eee1383a375","f41564054c4d4761a4aceecb1ffa6b32d2332de3f207fe0ef60e99e5c0eaa180","99a4ddc50b30e5e5d9e22971e63339a797f585cd2cb330430575488bbf9a8050","8315a4a7547c70edf24b4c4ec47efe0b858b112c1390b2434e8001c885c85dd7","780e29632995307bad13ad48abf16645c267c092c1c047df8c37bdcbaafd2a50","3df8a825b0d46bf3555c5366d25e80dc844200e71117f1a9ede97b7c6c96260b","fd1cee7ff1a0682297b38f70c2f4787e3ee0234e754106184783b74229fab1cb","c948b03604f93c421c3eb54b1bd184ec14942ec1b351fa05a5d08d380605fcb7","51a12cc5bfeb7a5798e32a829edf423d9beab6b1c61f07d5e7377f72c2cbac67","05701f3d4cd56b6113b2d7653ca91be313f69079eb26d90853028246e32b2b00","43e42c620bb120585021725d30cd014903e8b7c3a91f27cbb663778f830269be","1d93074aa611c9b597efa496652f89b0e520331c360a31e9f44ca2d12e643696","a96230056038c22db6765aebb9d230b2cb5e56da37fcc2eedd314f86f3603cc5"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6936,6959],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6936"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include these addresses in all-Traffic-IAB-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6960},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>else if IPv6 address prefixes are reported:","paragraph_zero_based":6961},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>include these iPv6-Prefix in iab-IPv6-PrefixReport, and for each IP address prefix included;","paragraph_zero_based":6962},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if this IPv6 address prefix is used for F1-C traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6963},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include this prefix in f1-C-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6964},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if this IPv6 address prefix is used for F1-U traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6965},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include this prefix in f1-U-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6966},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if this IPv6 address prefix is used for non-F1 traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6967},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include this prefix in non-f1-Traffic-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6968},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5>if this IPv6 address prefix is used for all traffic:","paragraph_zero_based":6969},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"6>include this prefix in all-Traffic-IAB-IP-Address.","paragraph_zero_based":6970},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the IAB-MT is in (NG)EN-DC, or","paragraph_zero_based":6971},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the IAB-MT is in NR-DC and the IAB Other Information procedure is towards the IAB-donor-CU in the SN:","paragraph_zero_based":6972},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if SRB3 is configured:","paragraph_zero_based":6973},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the IABOtherInformation message via SRB3 to lower layers for transmission;","paragraph_zero_based":6974},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else if the IAB-MT is in (NG)EN-DC:","paragraph_zero_based":6975},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the IABOtherInformation message via the E-UTRA MCG embedded in E-UTRA RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in TS 36.331 [10];","paragraph_zero_based":6976},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6977},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>submit the IABOtherInformation message via the NR MCG embedded in NR RRC message ULInformationTransferMRDC as specified in clause 5.7.2a.3;","paragraph_zero_based":6978},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":6979},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the IABOtherInformation message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":6980},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.13RLM/BFD relaxation","paragraph_zero_based":6981},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case both low mobility criterion and good serving cell criterion are configured for RLM/BFD relaxation, the UE is allowed to perform RLM and/or BFD relaxation according to requirements specified in TS 38.133 [14] when both relaxed measurement criterion for low mobility and relaxed measurement criterion for good serving cell quality are met.","paragraph_zero_based":6982},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"In case only the good serving cell quality criterion is configured for RLM/BFD relaxation, the UE is allowed to perform RLM and/or BFD relaxation according to requirements specified in TS 38.133 [14] when the relaxed measurement criterion for good serving cell quality is met.","paragraph_zero_based":6983}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["72673e70a5b942c9b79b530e88b516fed511e8244bb1926e7e3c1fa2108ce4b3","8423f4945d1bde88d5d872da58e9810839af93cf2138cba6c19f0183f8c98d80","119dd346380466c88eea63d4e5a5b0cd31b42c05b62cf5fc7381dbf9ef774ca9","513bb3d68c84520c7be1cf4b7c157969733332c124220d564548c1e3b01c3aed","505790608671348518384ca53705e40005612a71a1803f75a4bae20b3989bdb7","a1a77cb9b249874f06cf50c327f00efa29a8440f5e40c57bf87501f0e0d6804b","91ce62d528378ae48178769ad781f6dd655ea81547c09a21673926aa91d6b696","c3e2b8fa46c9acde007dfa3661b4952937891410e03971cec7f364c1bf80080c","c2a53d56fe0862c8930e313275e53594995ab3fe4b196dd24636efeeca5d00c3","4881f1ca3de0418cf769fb450ec5dea99e5e0300c49755342fd2484696182f2c","83b1f1b9c6447d633384846c67d4a9b2b38dfbf926c04ab5659e7362397559a1","b2e834b3cc13876c889d76f2ed79ce1dd284a9a34a5f6781728adb31a7259725","7e834f9d9232ef659e7e51179216e4007ca536b0ddcc061a646d95bb76f5ca54","a74a27d5ccb0dd896eb659b04c0beae66f192ae5dca6077a3785ea5bd5ce3a0a","34111b15ef161ecf622019533a11ab04efd8f94019e56732d62195379e4b8747","2c59279a0c6dbdaa21adad327381b37ec17cd3a65365cdc59b6ecee812a96234","70cfe8e805a630128d508c7ad2739bf30fa32354edb2b0038b5034f4e6c85c21","48a17fc84508ec27ab64df618fe742bf9ed3e1d5b18fb28ad84f844f092dcf58","c7bb8b702470f90cec10b33df1b93a0496b4b2b98b1f2babfc9057776a68f189","0e2f805054fb3f2391fdf15cfc981b7648825001be1f207675a1a3b83af1568a","80f305465de4d2a51967e36eb5c52b18987e5b1fcbfa9704cee751e14cea5f79","c29b663f93cce676610bbd617cdecc0176f7d2cc83500b60354f61b1300f5964","38c7293d2a087c20122d6ebaba3b254490e4fdcaa65fb7b4aca010bf0ca99a2f","4ad1270ecd13e53986b37723298dbb709a15f21725252eeef275dd4c015ba963"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6960,6983],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6960"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.13.1Relaxed measurement criterion for low mobility","paragraph_zero_based":6984},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The relaxed measurement criterion for UE with low mobility in RRC_CONNECTED is fulfilled when:","paragraph_zero_based":6985},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-(SS-RSRPRef – SS-RSRP) < SSearchDeltaP-Connected,","paragraph_zero_based":6986},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Where:","paragraph_zero_based":6987},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-SS-RSRP = current L3 RSRP measurement of the SpCell based on SSB (dB).","paragraph_zero_based":6988},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-SS-RSRPRef = reference L3 RSRP measurement of the SpCell based on SSB (dB), set as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":6989},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-After receiving low mobility criterion configuration, or","paragraph_zero_based":6990},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-After MAC of the CG successfully completes a Random Access procedure after applying a reconfigurationWithSync in spCellConfig of the CG while low mobility criterion is configured, or","paragraph_zero_based":6991},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If (SS-RSRP - SS-RSRPRef) > 0, or","paragraph_zero_based":6992},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-If the relaxed measurement criterion has not been met for TSearchDeltaP-Connected:","paragraph_zero_based":6993},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE shall set the value of SS-RSRPRef to the current SS-RSRP value of the SpCell.","paragraph_zero_based":6994},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.13.2Relaxed measurement criterion for good serving cell quality","paragraph_zero_based":6995},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The relaxed measurement criterion of good serving cell quality for RLM is fulfilled when the downlink radio link quality on the configured RLM-RS resource is evaluated to be better than the threshold Qin+XdB, wherein","paragraph_zero_based":6996},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Qin is specified in clause 8.1 of TS 38.133 [14].","paragraph_zero_based":6997},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-X is the parameter offset in goodServingCellEvaluationRLM for the evaluated serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":6998},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The relaxed measurement criterion of good serving cell quality for BFD is fulfilled when the downlink radio link quality on the configured BFD-RS resource is evaluated to be better than the threshold Qin+XdB, wherein","paragraph_zero_based":6999},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-Q in is specified in clause 8.1 of TS 38.133 [14].","paragraph_zero_based":7000},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-X is the parameter offset in goodServingCellEvaluationBFD for the evaluated serving cell.","paragraph_zero_based":7001},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.14UE Positioning Assistance Information","paragraph_zero_based":7002},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.14.1General","paragraph_zero_based":7003},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":7004},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.14.1-1: UE Positioning Assistance Information procedure","paragraph_zero_based":7005},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE Positioning Assistance Information procedure is used by UE to report the UE Positioning Assistance Information. The UE reports the association between SRS resources for positioning and the UE Tx TEG ID as defined in TS 38.305 [73].","paragraph_zero_based":7006},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.14.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":7007}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["e139160f017cd2e276caca160cea45033700549ad88e9de415bcf418a8e52f4b","209743cd08e2f6b2373e4fb74fe1757a4fb8b73d26af096d5eedfb48144bb2ef","b2ae05e2045440daf7e18cd9592967bad87318ce2330453fab5c55b2aff969fb","4ab8a98af8b00448f39daf7dd20023e2ca16cddd6ab5b6356ee2754e33cb92a0","5ec1461df06576df37c464b201a5bf0eb9f65ba5739e0c99032232fab0260b7e","baa0d917184e6dc1ee1dc3d24b5c46c8492fc3eb64c9ae8983bf93fa03744c83","6c08f40c29c4dd9fa60a57f38e72fa7676b92f11c28e1e618db403aca405e8e0","76137ba677299a96fa4d1992736d2c0bffc0563d4c901dba6076a721920c4595","8667973f0777a5ece6326d856509d3cba0c7e2fd7006bb38edc2145cc15d035c","780200c16380d9d1606b724d4c86a19081febf6b0c52f710bfdfc166d75eac92","48cd39cc65296055a34961a4572e5b94f93f531c7abe458dd694193fc0a7b27c","a54d1c2febc280826c4d1ac97a1d926310941b21af237ba6d6460eeab8b1a59c","207b3f9fbdb72f868808a5ec62486d164fb2d37d45f3c25bc978e7fc8036895a","2623d876ec2250901d2b6a4b87deb018ea4f4a05489aeb810a97b9a829fa29df","6ff5aeabe943091979265b5355887475c90110c0ed5b977e2c64a6f1c1db2868","7cd525c2dfc034976897b4c52e8d8fba8d7267808a8f7681f292a1eb0ff1431a","1a488f10bedfb19ffaf6b49614da263af2c21f03622b2561854be2ec78a53422","4f88d491085a895795fd1aeaeb55c41c0e4d01fc87c7ac3a6901e7e4699dd4e6","f3176e0817b71d57b497f580b7da6816a5227754f7bc29a5e5f87d76b07dc8f4","65e05f2641ca209e403d7582c288970f262fe64858d6153c31289ad20d6f9035","43ff8c2edd2ec3d0151fff05acfa282b97e83eac69203130b3f95b26e0bf4564","8db499c2f1bcca0bb806e3fb2f62f5846b658b27517446ca38d5c8f15cde6807","6027c40c39210f2a300a9a0a8b96a34837fa03e69f6f8400cf9169a9ba8c9f82","4888e5f9b02155d9ad17a3a9d88d00cc09bc214b15373e45958829276f13896d"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[6984,7007],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p6984"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of providing the association between SRS resource for positioning and UE Tx TEG ID in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure upon being configured to provide this association information.","paragraph_zero_based":7008},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7009},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>initiate transmission of the UEPositioningAssistanceInfo message in accordance with 5.7.14.3 to provide the association.","paragraph_zero_based":7010},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.14.3Actions related to transmission of UEPositioningAssistanceInfo message","paragraph_zero_based":7011},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall set the contents of the UEPositioningAssistanceInfo message as follows:","paragraph_zero_based":7012},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config in RRCReconfiguration message is configured with periodicReporting:","paragraph_zero_based":7013},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>for all the association changes store ue-TxTEG-Association corresponding to each ue-TxTEG-ID with nr-TimeStamp;","paragraph_zero_based":7014},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the results in ue-TxTEG-AssociationList in the UEPositioningAssistanceInfo message on expiry of each configured period;","paragraph_zero_based":7015},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>optionally include one ue-TxTEG-TimingErrorMarginValue for each UEPositioningAssistanceInfo message;","paragraph_zero_based":7016},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else if ue-TxTEG-RequestUL-TDOA-Config in RRCReconfiguration message is configured with oneShot:","paragraph_zero_based":7017},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>identify the ue-TxTEG-Association corresponding to each ue-TxTEG-ID with nr-TimeStamp;","paragraph_zero_based":7018},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>include the results in ue-TxTEG-AssociationList in the UEPositioningAssistanceInfo message only one time;","paragraph_zero_based":7019},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>optionally include one ue-TxTEG-TimingErrorMarginValue for each UEPositioningAssistanceInfo message.","paragraph_zero_based":7020},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall submit the UEPositioningAssistanceInfo message to lower layers for transmission.","paragraph_zero_based":7021},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.15Void","paragraph_zero_based":7022},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.16Application layer measurement reporting","paragraph_zero_based":7023},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.16.1General","paragraph_zero_based":7024},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":7025},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.7.16.1-1: Application layer measurement reporting","paragraph_zero_based":7026},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to send application layer measurement reports to the network.","paragraph_zero_based":7027},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.16.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":7028},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of application layer measurement reporting in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure when configured with application layer measurement, i.e. when appLayerMeasConfig and SRB4 have been configured by the network.","paragraph_zero_based":7029},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating the procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7030},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>for each measConfigAppLayerId received from upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":7031}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["38f21a1bff2f1c12a32ed44c4fb60bfa6bbc1bb1845010fce5a9dddabe2d66e8","f11a32164dc98f2cb1c6da5c225b1abd84b148f9fba7cdd80aff6affd80e0736","9b088c9f1409bf454f8c403876c8b1d5d341bf708f92393017f2f374ccc7b85f","137b109248e1d83c6947e158659f2564f5766869096e1cd9e0c83ef1af9d4431","00c92025e0224e628951439e8a2108e9f1e1031b77d7aab0457dd010d95e7bbf","a39c9d68cd2f3c894694249557fced76735854bb875c00f565bc11a53e438f59","c4c748dfc54984e96597161839094b314f163fb668fed22caddf3966586544f7","8769bf250e30d7bb593bc525d69c49a0bce1dc0207458ba41ee4ce4844117add","fb0f6a5684857392b233e514d18e70e345433341235d45485549647a006a783b","a1897e62a622bdf21b8b8b4dfe30cb1cd7438718d27288a4e41f21288161f3ca","c96d16d8606ddb665437fbe0926a3798cb999415396b09f861d44e4b73780225","f6dd1f0bb8fd8c9d397a7a3188390906b0e932d3e2738c03b226028f68814480","a2fbe5ba9178e6f2e4895bcdd490b602381a45bfb58a934101a6aedc02411011","2ac7861a1485fea6d05e76d5cbbc0a6ba67eeed403112b0806c4dd9695e1ca75","b2b5140b11659ba74a4faebbf35d4ea85a95b6a8020ddaa9335e0c427bd11964","f779fca957b1eef607dbe44f3977929bc5e362c341bbcf42558b20ccc278fe7a","261348789aed182872e57e044855b4cefb2633dce550d0b286f25bcdd3e351f2","e946e27e2c2d30410a64989611a59747fe924d783a4f6a40d35958de4ee653b5","485bfb4802b086050d18c3494a1d4c7ff8245035fdae4767faac3f733f66d6b1","a83ed8a2eeeaf8f309b4f4c7350d366121e59fe5516d5841de2850966929363e","04e175d1b7c56b9247bc425a55ba4ae69d35cfd7db9e110a27230f1f72ed5640","212f967e33e63612ef47d1dad637de54b77be710dc62ed242ee0080cc069f198","9b82de9469eb565bed97c979d2a8c09cb798e828d49ac814f441f6b5d62c0f46","663441396443c991124eb3cb286d1e2e269498940bb00909d11173af69b8aba7"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7008,7031],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p7008"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the UE AS has received application layer measurement report container from upper layers which has not been transmitted; and","paragraph_zero_based":7032},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the application layer measurement reporting has not been suspended for the measConfigAppLayerId associated with the application layer measurement report container according to clause 5.3.5.13d:","paragraph_zero_based":7033},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the measReportAppLayerContainer in the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to the received value in the application layer measurement report container;","paragraph_zero_based":7034},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>set the measConfigAppLayerId in the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to the value of the measConfigAppLayerId received together with application layer measurement report information;","paragraph_zero_based":7035},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if session start or stop information has been received from upper layers for the measConfigAppLayerId:","paragraph_zero_based":7036},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the appLayerSessionStatus in the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to the received value of session start or stop information;","paragraph_zero_based":7037},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if RAN visible application layer measurement report has been received from upper layers:","paragraph_zero_based":7038},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each appLayerBufferLevel value in the received RAN visible application layer measurement report:","paragraph_zero_based":7039},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the appLayerBufferLevel values in the appLayerBufferLevelList in the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to the buffer level values received from the upper layer in the order with the first appLayerBufferLevel value set to the newest received buffer level value, the second appLayerBufferLevel value set to the second newest received buffer level value, and so on until all the buffer level values received from the upper layer have been assigned or the maximum number of values have been set according to appLayerBufferLevel, if configured;","paragraph_zero_based":7040},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>set the playoutDelayForMediaStartup in the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to the received value of playout delay for media startup in the RAN visible application layer measurement report, if any;","paragraph_zero_based":7041},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>for each PDU session ID value indicated in the received RAN visible application layer measurement report, if any:","paragraph_zero_based":7042},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>set the PDU-SessionID field in the pdu-SessionIdList in the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to the indicated PDU session ID value;","paragraph_zero_based":7043},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the encoded RRC message is larger than the maximum supported size of one PDCP SDU specified in TS 38.323 [5]:","paragraph_zero_based":7044},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if the RRC message segmentation is enabled based on the field rrc-SegAllowed received in appLayerMeasConfig:","paragraph_zero_based":7045},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>initiate the UL message segment transfer procedure as specified in clause 5.7.7;","paragraph_zero_based":7046},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7047},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>discard the RRC message;","paragraph_zero_based":7048},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7049},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>submit the MeasurementReportAppLayer message to lower layers for transmission upon which the procedure ends.","paragraph_zero_based":7050},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.7.17Derivation of pathloss reference for TA validation of SRS for Positioning transmission and CG-SDT in RRC_INACTIVE","paragraph_zero_based":7051},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon request from lower layer for pathloss reference derivation for TA validation for SRS for Positioning transmission or CG-SDT in RRC_INACTIVE, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7052},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>acquire SIB2, if stored version is invalid;","paragraph_zero_based":7053},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if nrofSS-BlocksToAverage or absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation is not present or if absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation is present and the highest beam measurement quantity value is below or equal to absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation:","paragraph_zero_based":7054},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive the downlink pathloss reference RSRP for TA validation as the highest beam measurement quantity value, where each beam measurement quantity is described in TS 38.215 [24];","paragraph_zero_based":7055}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["6ff0861831e30dc4c478f4e596dd1af3b094d1ec8f680603c5291ae210eea570","eebec29ccec91df9d16166d810813bb87a386077f6f896aead321f7b0b3474bb","0ec85889e90c675407e594da7f30f96460bb3c5d596cdacff10816f0eaea855e","8514596388a773af7f482d061ca5717426eb22e8570eb7bb10c09fd9f5f444c7","c1cd4f3e4d8a7b2726f342485a72ce9da80e75e7ddb4f2e981a4362651f7b3f7","84a4e6701e7d88b671425bb601829c2e7b97294bce16bb48271bee2cb3d4fcc7","92d4e845b8be2bc18aeb4665333e37016dea2b12d2c9117a8dadf23b43c4e956","0675e46801620ab41997067ce0056611a6d38dfda325935ca4ceb1ac6b269117","54a1c397046f11c45ccdf6d2d35209bf7a975bd1703502336bdc6148e045cf1c","fd409d7dee69492860adc102c93dc74f1c0dccba8a4433707034db041687ba28","ed92e115f983b37a06ed6b268dd1375836c15fbc48bb67b21438f1ade3455bea","9535ecf0363b2c04e2edd2b6e624706ba718a5445d89d584e2e4c716eb6b35ca","3f20917b124ed7b6d2cd31e9041ec06de9c78bcee2661800a54aecd33a494b20","9400bd0d8d187f105489fa97e80de7679ec63cc284ad63fd56fbf0ae69d26057","40a3f8862476f36afe3037b3eff4894b3335af6f60616ec2eff33bf55613b8ab","093d4b82827763b84ec86b3fa060ef055a79050d5135e3dc7cee0050d630d1f9","08d5606580fa7d4543912351ef23c8dceaf39b2c279df069e7fa4a4fca718401","3a3593692f3c96d72175046ec6859e9ebfb6e8f61a4adc32f3f1780e96fef691","a5219d083738db2e201a8d7999d01168ffde7a5b4521448f69594cc3b0cefa6e","d03b2abf7de543b54ef32b1e03323889a29f81a2c6de3ee98b06dc11b4a9895e","bc68061ab701da8af8d42380a6b43a34044d407308116fabec1ec13d414d19b7","e19bf0378de4555ca12381b4d764f34145e6cd46f0b5cc0d03b64cad2d11474a","769fb5f963284652dcdf3c357e7d0bc9c29db4a464334381c5924ae4069266e5","f2c4f5254675ba78d01e48c3738b0bd08352c834b579576f30020b5b34ab138b"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7032,7055],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p7032"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7056},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>derive the downlink pathloss reference RSRP for TA validation as the linear average of the power values of up to nrofSS-BlocksToAverage of the highest beam measurement quantity values above absThreshSS-BlocksConsolidation, where each beam measurement quantity is described in TS 38.215 [24].","paragraph_zero_based":7057},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8Sidelink","paragraph_zero_based":7058},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.1General","paragraph_zero_based":7059},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NR sidelink communication consists of unicast, groupcast and broadcast. For unicast, the PC5-RRC connection is a logical connection between a pair of a Source Layer-2 ID and a Destination Layer-2 ID in the AS. The PC5-RRC signalling, as specified in clause 5.8.9, can be initiated after its corresponding PC5 unicast link establishment (TS 23.287 [55]). The PC5-RRC connection and the corresponding sidelink SRBs and sidelink DRB(s) are released when the PC5 unicast link is released as indicated by upper layers.","paragraph_zero_based":7060},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For each PC5-RRC connection of unicast, one sidelink SRB (i.e. SL-SRB0) is used to transmit the PC5-S message(s) before the PC5-S security has been established. One sidelink SRB (i.e. SL-SRB1) is used to transmit the PC5-S messages to establish the PC5-S security. One sidelink SRB (i.e. SL-SRB2) is used to transmit the PC5-S messages after the PC5-S security has been established, which is protected. One sidelink SRB (i.e. SL-SRB3) is used to transmit the PC5-RRC signalling, which is protected and only sent after the PC5-S security has been established. One sidelink SRB (i.e. SL-SRB4) is used to transmit/receive the NR sidelink discovery messages.","paragraph_zero_based":7061},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For unicast of NR sidelink communication, AS security comprises of integrity protection of PC5 signalling (SL-SRB1, SL-SRB2 and SL-SRB3) and user data (SL-DRBs), and it further comprises of ciphering of PC5 signaling (SL-SRB1 only for the Direct Link Security Mode Complete message as specified in TS 24.587 [57] for V2X service or TS 24.554 [72] for Proximity-services, SL-SRB2 and SL-SRB3) and user data (SL-DRBs). The ciphering and integrity protection algorithms and parameters for a PC5 unicast link are exchanged by PC5-S messages in the upper layers as specified in TS 33.536 [60], and applied to the corresponding PC5-RRC connection in the AS. Once AS security is activated for a PC5 unicast link in the upper layers as specified in TS 33.536 [60], all messages on SL-SRB2 and SL-SRB3 and/or user data on SL-DRBs of the corresponding PC5-RRC connection are integrity protected and/or ciphered by the PDCP.","paragraph_zero_based":7062},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"For unicast of NR sidelink communication, if the change of the key is indicated by the upper layers as specified in TS 24.587 [57] or TS 24.554 [72], UE re-establishes the PDCP entity of the SL-SRB1, SL-SRB2, SL-SRB3 and SL-DRBs on the corresponding PC5-RRC connection.","paragraph_zero_based":7063},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 1:In case the configurations for NR sidelink communication are acquired via the E-UTRA, the configurations for NR sidelink communication in SIB12 and sl-ConfigDedicatedNR within RRCReconfiguration used in clause 5.8 are provided by the configurations in SystemInformationBlockType28 and sl-ConfigDedicatedForNR within RRCConnectionReconfiguration as specified in TS 36.331 [10], respectively.","paragraph_zero_based":7064},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 2:In this release, there is one-to-one correspondence between the PC5-RRC connection and the PC5 unicast link as specified in TS 38.300[2].","paragraph_zero_based":7065},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 3:All SL-DRBs related to the same PC5-RRC connection have the same activation/deactivation setting for ciphering and the same activation/deactivation setting for integrity protection as specified in TS 33.536 [60].","paragraph_zero_based":7066},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 4:When integrity check failure concerning SL-SRB1 for a specific destination is detected, the UE sends an indication to the upper layers [57].","paragraph_zero_based":7067},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"NOTE 5:The selection of NULL algorithms means that the PC5 messages are considered protected for the purposes of being allowed to be sent or received.","paragraph_zero_based":7068},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.2Conditions for NR sidelink communication/discovery operation","paragraph_zero_based":7069},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The UE shall perform NR sidelink communication operation only if the conditions defined in this clause are met:","paragraph_zero_based":7070},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE's serving cell is suitable (RRC_IDLE or RRC_INACTIVE or RRC_CONNECTED); and if either the selected cell on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery operation belongs to the registered or equivalent PLMN as specified in TS 24.587 [57] or TS 24.554 [72] or the UE is out of coverage on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery operation as defined in TS 38.304 [20] and TS 36.304 [27]; or","paragraph_zero_based":7071},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE's serving cell (RRC_IDLE or RRC_CONNECTED) fulfils the conditions to support NR sidelink communication/discovery in limited service state as specified in TS 23.287 [55]; and if either the serving cell is on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery operation or the UE is out of coverage on the frequency used for NR sidelink communication/discovery operation as defined in TS 38.304 [20] and TS 36.304 [27]; or","paragraph_zero_based":7072},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if the UE has no serving cell (RRC_IDLE).","paragraph_zero_based":7073},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.3Sidelink UE information for NR sidelink communication/discovery","paragraph_zero_based":7074},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.3.1General","paragraph_zero_based":7075},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":7076},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Figure 5.8.3.1-1: Sidelink UE information for NR sidelink communication/discovery","paragraph_zero_based":7077},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The purpose of this procedure is to inform the network that the UE:","paragraph_zero_based":7078},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is interested or no longer interested to receive or transmit NR sidelink communication/discovery,","paragraph_zero_based":7079}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["5019cd1c39283395214df146c820d338432ccc2b18e424ccb6300bce5c9a554b","7b1ccfe4e2f2a9a4c585a90af300c6b293779eb712229cd5cab4ef9195b9ec87","d1ffd56b6a4080ac5b9c81a07f6b1a75b221a92cdbc801ec540ecfacd1c97fb3","60098fc8bf24e70e57497b7d0014d694ff97ce4e16b4662d3c818f8affc699ec","d38445d213f305bd7a7f9164200c117302f0496411690fb0d0910506cadc5ee4","8bff225f388bb312d38c9a2a6ba0b24ee821637395072a0ed72d906006ac7ae8","4ef709cadab4d6b643cd7d3f1474ed7fc2b0be95b5a1f3127d938ea712915306","55aa89a53f206e9628eb73c31db888a3532ac7e61f39c47291fdd8117b1a79ee","9063d168627c3384792a1faba5ba26846d8b255c3721f6a5218cbf5c12be6e5a","7989ec63dcfe0b12d65c61f5f8179291765dc0005d4a799c5b055c238adaa64d","48d72041343a69b8b0b7922fbce50478a79c79ce899d2c3ec33d4da91b858119","a1003fc0c4155cd4edee321279e2b65b471dfb4e2d72a57300321a9e5993d17b","e085fe8705849894fdf4e369bf737faab739cc64e6523d31b7980626a838beb0","22c20a50aede6bd6c937bb7acb3c0ccbff328589ecd87fb4ed9385df842f3d79","b7540cd5eb49ddde4639fb29fcd3fb056690db3c429a5e20142d5a25e9fc12eb","45a767000366dd047314f5b8f341f4073f44e71a724b9b6ef137c5870efc431c","0585b496877e605aa6a5493cde98fd58af82c0466e6abbabfd6f8d82290d130a","b1134f6e978d257992a08ccf2e65d4c72d5ff4d1e5bf7becf45c8bbce1dbcb54","50bd65bda9c59e23fb22480264fef66afcff1c94e1b295a0551b136c7942d712","779e6de707db23d144424d2ffaacdb259d5c800095b945166d505f449d6d30ca","d0b4a12fb60a9ef6f7efc08f52040733bce9b38a0aec3af58b698cc8d4642777","7d4341d8e81bdbf4e3d99dd95553a1ebb0d7c9a59fe61aff2071b1abd041bdb8","043b35d7e0692c7edcae2299ca035f89052eb4e05410695ea3526b6816b9d7f6","947e45c710f6ab89781e40c96cca5c7408a51a616a6b9a06a53d38bb99ee4756"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7056,7079],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p7056"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is requesting assignment or release of transmission resource for NR sidelink communication/discovery,","paragraph_zero_based":7080},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting QoS parameters and QoS profile(s) related to NR sidelink communication,","paragraph_zero_based":7081},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting that a sidelink radio link failure or sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure has been detected,","paragraph_zero_based":7082},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting the sidelink UE capability information of the associated peer UE for unicast communication,","paragraph_zero_based":7083},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting the RLC mode information of the sidelink data radio bearer(s) received from the associated peer UE for unicast communication,","paragraph_zero_based":7084},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting the accepted sidelink DRX configuration received from the associated peer UE for NR sidelink unicast reception,","paragraph_zero_based":7085},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting the sidelink DRX assistance information received from the associated peer UE for NR sidelink unicast transmission, when the UE is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig,","paragraph_zero_based":7086},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting, for NR sidelink groupcast transmission, the sidelink DRX on/off indication for the associated Destination Layer-2 ID, when the UE is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig,","paragraph_zero_based":7087},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting, for NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception, the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile(s) associated with its interested services to which sidelink DRX is applied,","paragraph_zero_based":7088},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting DRX configuration reject information from its associated peer UE for NR sidelink unicast transmission, when the UE is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig,","paragraph_zero_based":7089},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-is reporting parameters related to U2N relay operation.","paragraph_zero_based":7090},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"5.8.3.2Initiation","paragraph_zero_based":7091},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink communication or NR sidelink discovery or NR sidelink U2N relay operation that is in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure to indicate it is (interested in) receiving or transmitting NR sidelink communication or NR sidelink discovery or NR sidelink U2N relay operation in several cases including upon successful connection establishment or resuming, upon change of interest, upon changing QoS profile(s), upon receiving UECapabilityInformationSidelink from the associated peer UE, upon RLC mode information updated from the associated peer UE or upon change to a PCell providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR. A UE capable of NR sidelink communication may initiate the procedure to request assignment of dedicated sidelink DRB configuration and transmission resources for NR sidelink communication transmission. A UE capable of NR sidelink communication may initiate the procedure to report to the network that a sidelink radio link failure or sidelink RRC reconfiguration failure has been declared. A UE capable of NR sidelink discovery may initiate the procedure to request assignment of dedicated resources for NR sidelink discovery transmission or NR sidelink discovery reception. A UE capable of U2N relay operation may initiate the procedure to report/update parameters for acting as U2N Relay UE or U2N Remote UE (including L2 Remote UE's source L2 ID).","paragraph_zero_based":7092},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink operation that is in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure to report the sidelink DRX configuration received from the associated peer UE for NR sidelink unicast reception, upon accepting the sidelink DRX configuration from the associated peer UE. A UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig and is performing sidelink unicast transmission may initiate the procedure to report the sidelink DRX assistance information or the sidelink DRX configuration reject information received from the associated peer UE, upon receiving either of them from the associated peer UE. A UE capable of NR sidelink communication that is configured with sl-ScheduledConfig and is performing sidelink groupcast transmission may initiate the procedure to report the sidelink DRX on/off indication for the associated Destination Layer-2 ID.","paragraph_zero_based":7093},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"A UE capable of NR sidelink operation that is in RRC_CONNECTED may initiate the procedure to report the Destination Layer-2 ID and QoS profile(s) associated with its interested service(s) that sidelink DRX is applied, for NR sidelink groupcast or broadcast reception.","paragraph_zero_based":7094},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Upon initiating this procedure, the UE shall:","paragraph_zero_based":7095},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"1>if SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR is provided by the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":7096},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>ensure having a valid version of SIB12 for the PCell;","paragraph_zero_based":7097},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":7098},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7099},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":7100},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxInterestedFreqList; or if the frequency configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink communication on has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":7101},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink communication reception frequency of interest in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7102},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7103}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["1ecc3dfc40de705cd8e5144e474d11d4aea56e1456ba383c88953616bc095e68","e06343b542ffbca8a7d6557d2121b67da7a69d6b532a5dab12ec00ffe0bf4f2d","4a875622daf99b936aebb4b0f7c97460e5d8bfd6dcd85e2a2447a0e3eef722a4","8a9baa01c3277935dc5e06f3706d62d0aff4ad49f42a25934c1823eb2ec9d1cc","8e7cdf97f00c9da1f729722ecb4548d3ee143c51cb5510924e1c48cc45af7606","c43fd5c22c1d58f76899cf414937e52470568054052c958d2ee1df7b44aa324a","43627a8c9084837c99c7df891b23694110f9342364ca2d25a02fab0f96f3cdbf","d609cb34add3c2bc3cc72a838e5f54bd9839de016be3e9d98a47e345b7a62385","2187a47fea07fc94fb0ac1455abbc106355f2dc516f067977d2941fa24f0679f","edb4cc7a795c728e74cdb0b5ba69dd833baa429eb770611b4c740a49010c2108","7e7951a8439c4e1d5eba5aa45c05d94d2fbbc2a9feef1bfe46e34ad088880776","e00610364a964c275c3690564ec01969eaffeff25f14db594613c12948c72eab","ad7557646105e691679f9aaa17771846607db121ee43f48d3123f21b7bd537fc","8f655ac76d148774c7089c1ff430b55bd294db1115eeb71dcddb42f52f72e666","a37f5209e3d3bb69ac69fad0dd03dc88684226e83ee3b7cc96bb3d9a2ad78166","696d23fefee3b1aa4adfb92f703e879695cea31900876323537bee430e555de7","eef14d95f85ebe1668f2a3ee358ba3926821f52fe552bac668f6497208df45d6","8e6aae1c75e4d8bfb9b09452083018fcab312e0d87dcf9f4deb4d2c740876b17","07cdc92d68ce6c564a7b41e862a1c6a7fc903263320ee2452e1727b987e4b767","9685f0f8aedce6e771711692648e65e619c45b074cf3dd66f967683ebd430eca","2c193fbe3844e633bea35b7c6e0e44e4f61fd83c0605db51b4d10f8ec51968e8","97f8f0a4a2af763e1f9b207cfbc5af2d38c520fc43aff18738df3360f3d4b875","8f5ce2bdc449fb24a461350c33e626960d3ff2d7b33bb163bda4a62f874b1180","d549ad0b229d8f672bfbb488741cf41b85c43940878e9df9ee3f8ef68e0b6abb"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[7080,7103],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p7080"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxInterestedFreqList:","paragraph_zero_based":7104},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it is no longer interested in NR sidelink communication reception in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7105},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layers to transmit non-relay NR sidelink communication on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell:","paragraph_zero_based":7106},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7107},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or","paragraph_zero_based":7108},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-TxResourceReqList; or if the information carried by the sl-TxResourceReqList has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":7109},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink communication transmission resources required by the UE in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7110},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7111},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-TxResourceReqList:","paragraph_zero_based":7112},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it no longer requires NR sidelink communication transmission resources in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7113},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to receive NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-NonRelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":7114},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7115},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-NonRelayDiscovery; or","paragraph_zero_based":7116},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxInterestedFreqListDisc; or if the frequency configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages on has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":7117},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate the NR sidelink discovery reception frequency of interest in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7118},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>else:","paragraph_zero_based":7119},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message included sl-RxInterestedFreqListDisc:","paragraph_zero_based":7120},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>initiate transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message to indicate it is no longer interested in NR sidelink non-relay discovery messages reception in accordance with 5.8.3.3;","paragraph_zero_based":7121},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"2>if configured by upper layer to receive NR sidelink L2 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L2U2N-Relay; or if configured by upper layer to receive NR sidelink L3 U2N relay discovery messages on the frequency included in sl-FreqInfoList in SIB12 of the PCell including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery:","paragraph_zero_based":7122},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the UE did not transmit a SidelinkUEInformationNR message since last entering RRC_CONNECTED state; or","paragraph_zero_based":7123},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if since the last time the UE transmitted a SidelinkUEInformationNR message the UE connected to a PCell not providing SIB12 including sl-ConfigCommonNR; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L2U2N-Relay in case of L2 U2N relay operation; or connected to a PCell providing SIB12 but not including sl-L3U2N-RelayDiscovery in case of L3 U2N relay operation; or","paragraph_zero_based":7124},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"3>if the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message did not include sl-RxInterestedFreqListDisc; or if the frequency configured by upper layers to receive NR sidelink discovery messages on has changed since the last transmission of the SidelinkUEInformationNR message:","paragraph_zero_based":7125},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is capable of U2N Relay UE, and if SIB12 includes sl-RelayUE-ConfigCommon; or","paragraph_zero_based":7126},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"4>if the UE is selecting a U2N Relay UE / has a selected U2N Relay UE / configured with measurement object associated to L2 U2N Relay UEs, and if SIB12 includes sl-RemoteUE-ConfigCommon:","paragraph_zero_based":7127}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":