{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"AppLayerBufferLevel-r17 ::= INTEGER (0..30000)","paragraph_zero_based":9384},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9385},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-MEASUREMENTREPORTAPPLAYER-STOP","paragraph_zero_based":9386},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1STOP","paragraph_zero_based":9387},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9388},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"MeasReportAppLayer field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":9389},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"appLayerSessionStatus","paragraph_zero_based":9390},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates that an application layer measurement session in the application layer starts or ends.","paragraph_zero_based":9391},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"measReportAppLayerContainer","paragraph_zero_based":9392},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field contains the application layer measurement report container, see Annex L (normative) in TS 26.247 [68], clause 16.5 in TS 26.114 [69] and TS 26.118 [70].","paragraph_zero_based":9393},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"ran-VisibleMeasurements","paragraph_zero_based":9394},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field contains the RAN visible application layer measurement report.","paragraph_zero_based":9395},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9396},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RAN-VisibleMeasurements field descriptions","paragraph_zero_based":9397},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"appLayerBufferLevelList","paragraph_zero_based":9398},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The field indicates a list of application layer buffer levels, and each AppLayerBufferLevel indicates the application layer buffer level in ms. Value 0 corresponds to 0ms, value 1 corresponds to 10ms, value 2 corresponds to 20 ms and so on. If the buffer level is larger than the maximum value of 30000 (5 minutes), the UE reports 30000.","paragraph_zero_based":9399},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"playoutDelayForMediaStartup","paragraph_zero_based":9400},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Indicates the application layer playout delay for media start-up in ms. Value 0 corresponds to 0ms, value 1 corresponds to 1ms, value 2 corresponds to 2 ms and so on. If the playout delay for media start-up is larger than the maximum value of 30000ms, the UE reports 30000.","paragraph_zero_based":9401},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"pdu-SessionIdList","paragraph_zero_based":9402},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains the identity of the PDU session, or the identities of the PDU sessions, used for application data flows subject to the RAN visible application layer measurements.","paragraph_zero_based":9403},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":9404},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–MIB","paragraph_zero_based":9405},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The MIB includes the system information transmitted on BCH.","paragraph_zero_based":9406},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: N/A","paragraph_zero_based":9407}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all unfiltered body and nested table paragraphs"},"source_cell_coordinates":{"document_XML_sha256":"e6da965682bd316cba86572597901ea384f59f1fc16f9cae6cc2322c6ca66446","original_member_sha256":"98ba9f2b5573fe46d64ecaac42249cc03885c5438afddaea698dae3590b59c3c","paragraph_ElementTree_utf8_XML_sha256":["223644239dfd3a8466768496ee078295438b0c173b0eea80168bf1ce41e2c55f","458c6b5bfbd49f13b9f38454928d3fcacc22616265f14d71ef6e22aa5fcafb8e","ee42c97d22eb857c1ea2e8455ef954e3c02b010a3f315319b1a0b7719b88501f","9dbc694c866bcf92c586dc39365ca2522d0b5c4b123f523d66ec225da886863b","e01a9b7aa9832b8fd2609650ebdb793e07ffc8c271cee4c5a9c73192e12e258d","8c57ca3d3bebe4b825b1177c44f5ccf706f8c47b4c38fe580573ed62feca2d6c","ecbdf5968ccdddce6387db5