"ac572b4431337b0be8ae8a721688696f19e888fb76e4c210eaf650151a1a1c8d","91ee6cacd28593e3996305e40022f34f53bf12edbc8f3db926d12473501e9723","17714d5f14832b8c182a07e2057897bc12907270bde96a8e7c76524485145ed3","84c94920fd2c8ffeabbf58bb64b64adb51d98584f5f575aaf5d1c96fe01f0716","71672c8d9680a8f5a4fcb5f6d87d457b4a20b5496f71c05f852c70362c1dcce1","d27a4d16dc0a35cc68259d40e6809f0070ee7d9101dfb5bd48601a1faa32cdd8","2e20b8efaf5c240992a2fcdff8d2be69f137ad176dc6a801b4b9ec1ae36b2952","bfced043e0a84461e8f1fc973987b40b1efd2e7ebc32675bec87b0a4027f2f89"],"paragraph_range_zero_based":[10824,10847],"projection":"All w:t and m:t including tracked insertion/deletion runs; not a final-edit-state interpretation or answer annotation."},"source_row":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx:p10824"}
{"fields":{"filename":"R2-2312910.zip::R2-2312910 38331-h60 NES merged CR.docx","origin":"original_author_document_complete_unfiltered_paragraph_projection","paragraphs":[{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requested-SI-List","paragraph_zero_based":10848},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of requested SI messages which are configured by schedulingInfoList in si-SchedulingInfo and schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 (if present) in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":10849},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is not present:","paragraph_zero_based":10850},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of SI messages configured by schedulingInfoList in si-SchedulingInfo in SIB1, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":10851},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is present:","paragraph_zero_based":10852},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE generates a list of concatenated SI messages by appending the SI messages containing type1 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 to the SI messages configured by schedulingInfoList in si-SchedulingInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":10853},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of concatenated SI messages, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":10854},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"requestedPosSI-List","paragraph_zero_based":10855},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Contains a list of requested SI messages which are configured by posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo and schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 (if present) in SIB1.","paragraph_zero_based":10856},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is not present:","paragraph_zero_based":10857},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of SI messages configured by posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo in SIB1, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":10858},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"If si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 is present:","paragraph_zero_based":10859},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-The UE creates a list of concatenated SI messages by appending the SI messages containing type2 SIB configured by schedulingInfoList2 in si-SchedulingInfo-v1700 to the SI messages configured by posSchedulingInfoList in posSI-SchedulingInfo.","paragraph_zero_based":10860},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-According to the order of entry in the list of concatenated SI messages, first bit corresponds to first/leftmost listed SI message, second bit corresponds to second listed SI message, and so on.","paragraph_zero_based":10861},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"","paragraph_zero_based":10862},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"–SCGFailureInformation","paragraph_zero_based":10863},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"The SCGFailureInformation message is used to provide information regarding NR SCG failures detected by the UE.","paragraph_zero_based":10864},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Signalling radio bearer: SRB1","paragraph_zero_based":10865},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"RLC-SAP: AM","paragraph_zero_based":10866},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Logical channel: DCCH","paragraph_zero_based":10867},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"Direction: UE to Network","paragraph_zero_based":10868},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"SCGFailureInformation message","paragraph_zero_based":10869},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- ASN1START","paragraph_zero_based":10870},{"literal_text_all_w_t_and_m_t":"-- TAG-SCGFAILUREINFORMATION-START","paragraph_zero_based":10871}],"source":"Whole authentic original CR source member; all u